values
  ('701797439374068400', 'Death Rides a Horse', 1967, 'Western', 'Giulio Petroni, Carlo Carlini, Enrico Bergier', 'Luciano Vincenzoni', 'Lee Van Cleef, John Phillip Law, Mario Brega, Luigi Pistilli, José Torres, Anthony Dawson, Franco Balducci, Guglielmo Spoletini', 'R', 'Bill Meceita, a boy whose family was murdered in front of him by a gang, sets out 15 years later to exact revenge. On his journey, he finds himself continually sparring and occasionally cooperating with Ryan, a gunfighter on his own quest for vengeance, who knows more than he says about Bill''s tragedy.', 'Bill Meceita, a boy whose family was murdered in front of him by a gang, sets out 15 years later to exact revenge. On his journey, he finds himself continually sparring and occasionally cooperating with Ryan, a gunfighter on his own quest for vengeance, who knows more than he says about Bill''s tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjvb8IYBaqizU1GG1qmGtMJpkBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49397'),
  ('176371808096375141', 'Death Ring', 1992, 'Action', 'R.J. Kizer', 'George T. LeBrun, Mike Norris', 'Mike Norris, Billy Drago, Chad McQueen, Don Swayze, Elizabeth Sung, Isabel Glasser, Branscombe Richmond, Kelly Bennett', null, 'Ex-Green Beret Matt Collins is kidnapped along with his fiancée, Lauren Sadler, by crazed hunter extraordinaire Danton Vachs. Every year he holds a contest where people can purchase the right to hunt down and kill a human being. This time, Collins is to be the hunted. Vachs uses Lauren as motivation for Collins to really fight to survive and thus provide the buyers with a truly exceptional hunt. Collins is turned loose on an uncharted island and four killers set out to find and kill him.', 'Ex-Green Beret Matt Collins is kidnapped along with his fiancée, Lauren Sadler, by crazed hunter extraordinaire Danton Vachs. Every year he holds a contest where people can purchase the right to hunt down and kill a human being. This time, Collins is to be the hunted. Vachs uses Lauren as motivation for Collins to really fight to survive and thus provide the buyers with a truly exceptional hunt. Collins is turned loose on an uncharted island and four killers set out to find and kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z71a7fBFk5AxjTKzYFpCgsCCXtO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281094'),
  ('411882288373736696', 'Death Row Girls', 2004, 'Action, Thriller', 'Sadaaki Haginiwa', 'Bun Kitazawa, Keita Oki', 'Aki Hoshino, Ren Suzuki, Ami Natsui, David Ito, Ryu Kano, Emi Kitagawa, Junko Maru', null, 'In a nightmarish world of secret graveyards and machine gun executions, inmates must die... or kill to survive. Escape is no option, and is punished with... death, or a fate worse than death.', 'In a nightmarish world of secret graveyards and machine gun executions, inmates must die... or kill to survive. Escape is no option, and is punished with... death, or a fate worse than death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzeXGNwVYitHFKCZQZoFEKXk95R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40126'),
  ('167316795352410744', 'Death Saved My Life', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Seth Jarrett, Hans Charles, Anthony DIDomenico', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Meagan Good, Chiké Okonkwo, La''Myia Good, Sa''Raya Paris Johnson, Darren Goldstein, Robert Eli, Glenn Morizio, Philip Hernandez', 'PG-13', 'On the surface it seems Jade has it all, including a successful marketing career, a heart surgeon husband who is admired and respected in the community, and a young daughter they both dote on. However, behind closed doors, her life is far from perfect.', 'On the surface it seems Jade has it all, including a successful marketing career, a heart surgeon husband who is admired and respected in the community, and a young daughter they both dote on. However, behind closed doors, her life is far from perfect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2S4AMsZG7PZmSLgDhPCKk5VakT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796989'),
  ('600942313368232653', 'Death Screams', 1982, 'Horror', 'David Nelson', 'Paul C. Elliott', 'Susan Kiger, Martin Tucker, William T. Hicks, Jennifer Chase, Jody Kay, Andrea Savio, Helene Tryon, Hanns Manship', null, 'Late one night, a young couple are brutally murdered at a make-out spot by an unseen assailant, their bodies tossed into the nearby river. As the lifeless lovers drift slowly downstream, the residents of the town excitedly prepare themselves for their annual carnival, unaware that a machete-wielding maniac with a twisted grudge is lurking in their midst. When a group of teen revellers plan a late-night after party down in the local cemetery, they unwittingly set the stage for a bloodbath.', 'Late one night, a young couple are brutally murdered at a make-out spot by an unseen assailant, their bodies tossed into the nearby river. As the lifeless lovers drift slowly downstream, the residents of the town excitedly prepare themselves for their annual carnival, unaware that a machete-wielding maniac with a twisted grudge is lurking in their midst. When a group of teen revellers plan a late-night after party down in the local cemetery, they unwittingly set the stage for a bloodbath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdIMJz1mpNo8qKvWRjKJN4s5ue9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85199'),
  ('84078970181337312', 'Death Sentence', 1968, 'Western', 'Antonio Secchi, Mario Lanfranchi', 'Mario Lanfranchi', 'Richard Conte, Enrico Maria Salerno, Tomas Milian, Robin Clarke, Adolfo Celi, Eleonora Brown, Luciano Rossi, Lilli Lembo', null, 'Four men killed Django''s brother a long time ago. A withdrawn rancher, a notorious card player, a despotic priest and a crazy albino with an obsession for gold. The relentless Django seeks for revenge and hunts them down without mercy.', 'Four men killed Django''s brother a long time ago. A withdrawn rancher, a notorious card player, a despotic priest and a crazy albino with an obsession for gold. The relentless Django seeks for revenge and hunts them down without mercy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Cx0wSoSyJSgAm7EiFXGPYUkHOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100546'),
  ('287906596242114475', 'Death Sentence', 1974, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Wilbur D''Arcy, Tim Southcott, E.W. Swackhamer', 'John Neufeld', 'Cloris Leachman, Laurence Luckinbill, Nick Nolte, Alan Oppenheimer, William Schallert, Yvonne Wilder, Herb Voland, Hope Summers', null, 'A juror on a murder trial begins to believe that the man charged with the crime is innocent — and that the real killer is her own husband.', 'A juror on a murder trial begins to believe that the man charged with the crime is innocent — and that the real killer is her own husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3aK8Zsy0cauyS4h7v7FxypRMbU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45377'),
  ('365810727552612405', 'Death Sentence', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John R. Leonetti, James Wan, Albert Cho', 'Ian Mackenzie Jeffers', 'Kevin Bacon, Garrett Hedlund, Kelly Preston, Jordan Garrett, John Goodman, Aisha Tyler, Stuart Lafferty, Matt O''Leary', 'R', 'Nick Hume is a mild-mannered executive with a perfect life, until one gruesome night he witnesses something that changes him forever. Transformed by grief, Hume eventually comes to the disturbing conclusion that no length is too great when protecting his family.', 'Nick Hume is a mild-mannered executive with a perfect life, until one gruesome night he witnesses something that changes him forever. Transformed by grief, Hume eventually comes to the disturbing conclusion that no length is too great when protecting his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rdEAMh4a3pc7GO6fSkJwpt7BWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11835'),
  ('713815958326474638', 'Death Shadows', 1986, 'Action', 'Hideo Gosha, Fujio Morita', 'Motomu Furuta', 'Mariko Ishihara, Masanori Sera, Mari Natsuki, Tsunehiko Watase, Takuzō Kawatani, Takeo Chii, Shinnosuke Ikehata, Naoto Takenaka', null, 'Three men sentenced to death are spared and changed into “shadows executioners”, a group of ruthless ninja working for mysterious high ranking officials. During their investigation on some illegal business, one of them, called “Yazuke the Viper”, finds his abandoned daughter, Ocho, who has now become a mistress of Denzo, a smuggler. After Yazuke’s death, Ocho is also recruited as a “shadows executioner”, with the task of completing her father’s mission.', 'Three men sentenced to death are spared and changed into “shadows executioners”, a group of ruthless ninja working for mysterious high ranking officials. During their investigation on some illegal business, one of them, called “Yazuke the Viper”, finds his abandoned daughter, Ocho, who has now become a mistress of Denzo, a smuggler. After Yazuke’s death, Ocho is also recruited as a “shadows executioner”, with the task of completing her father’s mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4kFebh8KHQ8olITDCji2F8SHuV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58284'),
  ('1111650765310855543', 'Death Ship', 1980, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alvin Rakoff, René Verzier, Charles Braive', 'John Robins', 'George Kennedy, Richard Crenna, Nick Mancuso, Sally Ann Howes, Kate Reid, Victoria Burgoyne, Jennifer McKinney, Danny Higham', 'R', 'Survivors of a tragic shipping collision are rescued by a mysterious black ship which appears out of the fog. Little do they realise that the ship is actually a Nazi torture ship which has sailed the seas for years, luring unsuspecting sailors aboard and killing them off one by one.', 'Survivors of a tragic shipping collision are rescued by a mysterious black ship which appears out of the fog. Little do they realise that the ship is actually a Nazi torture ship which has sailed the seas for years, luring unsuspecting sailors aboard and killing them off one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5FDs2a7MLuwDJPQWbVbYrL2NJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31703'),
  ('584815713483371110', 'Death Smiles on a Murderer', 1973, 'Horror', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato, Romano Scandariato', 'Claudio Bernabei, Romano Scandariato', 'Ewa Aulin, Klaus Kinski, Luciano Rossi, Attilio Dottesio, Carla Mancini, Angela Bo, Sergio Doria, Marco Mariani', null, 'Greta is a beautiful young woman abused by her brother Franz and left to die in childbirth by her illicit lover, the aristocrat Dr. von Ravensbrück. Bereft with grief, Franz reanimates his dead sister using a formula engraved on an ancient Incan medallion. Greta then returns as an undead avenging angel, reaping revenge on the Ravensbrück family and her manically possessive brother.', 'Greta is a beautiful young woman abused by her brother Franz and left to die in childbirth by her illicit lover, the aristocrat Dr. von Ravensbrück. Bereft with grief, Franz reanimates his dead sister using a formula engraved on an ancient Incan medallion. Greta then returns as an undead avenging angel, reaping revenge on the Ravensbrück family and her manically possessive brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMXaIDsW89wvDDswdZNqOvEQxHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5434'),
  ('988783113174613417', 'Death Spa', 1988, 'Horror', 'Michael Fischa, Arledge Armenaki, Gary Wagner', 'Mitch Paradise, James Bartruff', 'William Bumiller, Brenda Bakke, Shari Shattuck, Ken Foree, Merritt Butrick, Robert Lipton, Alexa Hamilton, Rosalind Cash', null, 'Michael''s health club is beseiged with a series of terrible murders involving killer saunas and other grisly devices. Michael''s wife killed herself a while before and her brother holds Michael responsible. Michael needs to stop the bloodshed before he loses all of his clients.', 'Michael''s health club is beseiged with a series of terrible murders involving killer saunas and other grisly devices. Michael''s wife killed herself a while before and her brother holds Michael responsible. Michael needs to stop the bloodshed before he loses all of his clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MgYDkLLOLf3y03s2lyxpjIGXe2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28389'),
  ('76490881062954065', 'Death Steps in the Dark', 1977, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Maurizio Pradeaux, Aldo Ricci', 'Maurizio Pradeaux, Arpad De Riso', 'Leonard Mann, Robert Webber, Vera Krouska, Antonio Maimone, Barbara Seidel, Susy Jennings, Nikos Verlekis, Anestis Vlahos', null, 'An Italian reporter is travelling on the Instabul-Athens train. A woman is murdered with the reporter''s letter-opener so that makes him the main suspect. With the help of his Swedish girlfriend he starts investigating in order to prove his innocence.', 'An Italian reporter is travelling on the Instabul-Athens train. A woman is murdered with the reporter''s letter-opener so that makes him the main suspect. With the help of his Swedish girlfriend he starts investigating in order to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62i4VZVb2Let0urTa9k4txBJlTq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105398'),
  ('813528059802014638', 'Death Strokes', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Miguel Núñez, Evan Phan', null, 'Daniel Galo, Sofía Félix, Felipe Tútuti, Roberto Medina, María Luz Macías, Heriberto Norzagaray, Rubí Molina', null, 'Through the film, Ivan makes a couple of odd decisions in order to overcome his detachment. First, he goes along with the wild desires of his girlfriend, Rosa. Later he gets tricked into adopting a pig. At a time when Ivan''s life turns absurd, he must find himself; beyond death and unbearable heat. The film is also an allegory about the desire to overcome the current hard times in México.', 'Through the film, Ivan makes a couple of odd decisions in order to overcome his detachment. First, he goes along with the wild desires of his girlfriend, Rosa. Later he gets tricked into adopting a pig. At a time when Ivan''s life turns absurd, he must find himself; beyond death and unbearable heat. The film is also an allegory about the desire to overcome the current hard times in México.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c38bXmKH8BSRZoiaMqSp0g3rGry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259477'),
  ('605308728526341386', 'Death Takes a Holiday', 1934, 'Fantasy, Romance, Drama', 'Mitchell Leisen, Charles Lang', 'Maxwell Anderson, Gladys Lehman', 'Fredric March, Evelyn Venable, Guy Standing, Kent Taylor, Katharine Alexander, Gail Patrick, Helen Westley, Kathleen Howard', 'NR', 'After years of questioning why people fear him, Death takes on human form so he can mingle among the mortals and find an answer. However, events soon spiral out of control as he falls in love with the beautiful young Grazia, the only woman not afraid of him. As he falls in love with her, her father sees him for what he is and begs him to return to his duties. Death must decide whether or not to seek his own happiness or sacrifice it so that Grazia may live.', 'After years of questioning why people fear him, Death takes on human form so he can mingle among the mortals and find an answer. However, events soon spiral out of control as he falls in love with the beautiful young Grazia, the only woman not afraid of him. As he falls in love with her, her father sees him for what he is and begs him to return to his duties. Death must decide whether or not to seek his own happiness or sacrifice it so that Grazia may live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/becYmbZXZalAvxNC4JVpQSjvqtk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37215'),
  ('656216520617808221', 'Death to 2020', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Al Campbell, Alice Mathias, Jamie Cairney', 'Charlie Brooker, Tom Baker, Kemah Bob', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Hugh Grant, Lisa Kudrow, Kumail Nanjiani, Tracey Ullman, Samson Kayo, Leslie Jones, Diane Morgan', 'NR', '2020: A year so [insert adjective of choice here], even the creators of Black Mirror couldn''t make it up… but that doesn''t mean they don''t have a little something to add. This comedy event that tells the story of the dreadful year that was — and perhaps still is? The documentary-style special weaves together some of the world''s most (fictitious) renowned voices with real-life archival footage.', '2020: A year so [insert adjective of choice here], even the creators of Black Mirror couldn''t make it up… but that doesn''t mean they don''t have a little something to add. This comedy event that tells the story of the dreadful year that was — and perhaps still is? The documentary-style special weaves together some of the world''s most (fictitious) renowned voices with real-life archival footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9FPFsPkeiBDn6WwDHFgniWdVJm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773655'),
  ('565783096437843540', 'Death to 2021', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Josh Ruben, Jack Clough, Markus Mentzer', 'Ben Caudell, Angelo Irving, Alan Connor', 'Hugh Grant, Joe Keery, William Jackson Harper, Lucy Liu, Tracey Ullman, Samson Kayo, Stockard Channing, Cristin Milioti', 'NR', 'This comedic retrospective mixes archival footage and scripted sketches as it revisits all the dread — and occasional delight — that 2021 had to offer.', 'This comedic retrospective mixes archival footage and scripted sketches as it revisits all the dread — and occasional delight — that 2021 had to offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGt48Z1j4TuzPti8ZNWqqypa6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911068'),
  ('706466181853404768', 'Death to Smoochy', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'David Webb, Michael Risoli, Bruno Bryniarski', 'Adam Resnick', 'Robin Williams, Edward Norton, Catherine Keener, Danny DeVito, Jon Stewart, Pam Ferris, Danny Woodburn, Michael Rispoli', 'R', 'Tells the story of Rainbow Randolph, the corrupt, costumed star of a popular children''s TV show, who is fired over a bribery scandal and replaced by squeaky-clean Smoochy, a puffy fuchsia rhinoceros. As Smoochy catapults to fame - scoring hit ratings and the affections of a network executive - Randolph makes the unsuspecting rhino the target of his numerous outrageous attempts to exact revenge and reclaim his status as America''s sweetheart.', 'Tells the story of Rainbow Randolph, the corrupt, costumed star of a popular children''s TV show, who is fired over a bribery scandal and replaced by squeaky-clean Smoochy, a puffy fuchsia rhinoceros. As Smoochy catapults to fame - scoring hit ratings and the affections of a network executive - Randolph makes the unsuspecting rhino the target of his numerous outrageous attempts to exact revenge and reclaim his status as America''s sweetheart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrwwuNLITsA5N5cVnA3ftvHFqHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9275'),
  ('829486814877730440', 'Death to the Supermodels', 2005, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Joel Silverman, William MacCollum', 'Joel Silverman', 'Jaime Pressly, Brooke Burns, Maria Arcé, Marcelle Larice, Sung-Hi Lee, Eva Derrek, Jason ''Wee Man'' Acuña, Taylor Negron', 'R', 'This sexy comedy finds the world''s greatest, most eccentric supermodels gathered on a deserted island for the swimsuit photo shoot from hell', 'This sexy comedy finds the world''s greatest, most eccentric supermodels gathered on a deserted island for the swimsuit photo shoot from hell', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZirECiJtR38jGeITCfAiPPlS8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15851'),
  ('171422830244557406', 'Death Train', 1993, 'TV Movie, Action, Thriller', 'David Jackson, Timothy Eaton', 'David Jackson', 'Pierce Brosnan, Patrick Stewart, Alexandra Paul, Ted Levine, Christopher Lee, John Abineri, Nic D''Avirro, Clarke Peters', 'R', 'When a renegade Russian general sends a nuclear bomb hurtling toward the Middle East aboard a hijacked train, special agents are dispatched to disarm the deadly device. Ten tons of steel and one ounce of hot plutonium are now riding roughshod through Europe. With time running out, the agents launch a desperate, bullet-packed assault on a deadly moving target piloted by a cold-blooded mercenary.', 'When a renegade Russian general sends a nuclear bomb hurtling toward the Middle East aboard a hijacked train, special agents are dispatched to disarm the deadly device. Ten tons of steel and one ounce of hot plutonium are now riding roughshod through Europe. With time running out, the agents launch a desperate, bullet-packed assault on a deadly moving target piloted by a cold-blooded mercenary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zC0MftjGSMUuHFFzZnHnaYWC4gf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20435'),
  ('120533699526667329', 'Death Trance', 2005, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Yuji Shimomura, Shinichi Fujita', 'Shinichi Fujita, Seiji Chiba, Junya Kato', 'Tak Sakaguchi, Takamasa Suga, Kentaro Seagal, Yûki Takeuchi, Ben Hiura, Honoka Asada, Yoko Fujita, Osamu Takahashi', null, 'In an unknown place and unknown time, a lone Samurai known only as Grave thirsts for the ultimate battle.', 'In an unknown place and unknown time, a lone Samurai known only as Grave thirsts for the ultimate battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibzV90cPb1omUslgkOntpjWVSC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19504'),
  ('1114767985558608786', 'Death Tube 2', 2012, 'Horror', 'Yôhei Fukuda, Yôhei Fukuda', 'Yôhei Fukuda', 'Naomi Inoue, Satoshi Sakurai, Motono Takuya, Fuka Nishihara, Kazushige Sakaguchi, Hiroaki Kawatsure, Ao Akiyama, Norizuke Matsukawa', null, 'The sequel to the exciting terror film! ''Death Tube,'' the website where murders are streamed live in real time, is back online with a new generation of challengers / victims! Who will escape and what will be left of them? The real killer is about to be revealed! A new crop of contestants turn up to participate in a vicious game of life or death, broadcast live over the internet for all the world to see.', 'The sequel to the exciting terror film! ''Death Tube,'' the website where murders are streamed live in real time, is back online with a new generation of challengers / victims! Who will escape and what will be left of them? The real killer is about to be revealed! A new crop of contestants turn up to participate in a vicious game of life or death, broadcast live over the internet for all the world to see.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVhpkoaPFUf6r6YLupwUpptNWAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138577'),
  ('657448501593343184', 'Death Tube: Broadcast Murder Show', 2010, 'Horror', 'Yôhei Fukuda', 'Mari Asato, Michitaka Okada', 'Shoichi Matsuda, Wataru Kaoru, Ishino Atsushi, Tsukamoto Sanae, Namikawa Hajime, Kensuke Ashihara, Hoshina Yôhei, Motono Takuya', null, 'Tragedy begins with curiosity. The on-line killer website broadcasts scenes of death in real time. Viewers are drawn to the website through curiosity, and then are shocked by what they see. Against their will, random viewers are selected to enter the killing game. It is literally a life and death situation to survive in this cruelest of spectator sports.', 'Tragedy begins with curiosity. The on-line killer website broadcasts scenes of death in real time. Viewers are drawn to the website through curiosity, and then are shocked by what they see. Against their will, random viewers are selected to enter the killing game. It is literally a life and death situation to survive in this cruelest of spectator sports.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyVNOTE9PRYGVTDGHzrHWnSAP4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178725'),
  ('314194941304419458', 'Death Tunnel', 2005, 'Horror', 'Philip Adrian Booth, Marcel Cabrera, Philip Adrian Booth', 'Christopher Saint Booth, Philip Adrian Booth', 'Steffany Huckaby, Melanie Lewis, Yolanda Pecoraro, Kristin Novak, Annie Burgstede, Jason Lasater, Gary Wolf, Robyn Corum', null, 'For an initiation stunt, five college women are locked in a Kentucky hospital built in 1910 where 63,000 people died from a disease known as the "white plague". Deep under the hospital is the "Death Tunnel" which once were used to secretly remove the dead from the grounds.', 'For an initiation stunt, five college women are locked in a Kentucky hospital built in 1910 where 63,000 people died from a disease known as the "white plague". Deep under the hospital is the "Death Tunnel" which once were used to secretly remove the dead from the grounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xElzRRGuSSLyUxole8UY3i80PFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9814'),
  ('868503559388297687', 'Death Valley', 1982, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Dick Richards, Frank Beetson, Stephen H. Burum', 'Richard Rothstein', 'Paul Le Mat, Catherine Hicks, Stephen McHattie, Wilford Brimley, Peter Billingsley, Edward Herrmann, Jack O''Leary, Mary Steelsmith', 'R', 'A divorced mother, her young son and her new boyfriend set out on a road trip through Death Valley and run afoul of a local serial killer.', 'A divorced mother, her young son and her new boyfriend set out on a road trip through Death Valley and run afoul of a local serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XHuvwszXiK1lc2B79PLQUSCnBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72574'),
  ('74006428262075108', 'Death Valley', 2021, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Matthew Ninaber, Brent Tremain', 'Matthew Ninaber', 'Jeremy Ninaber, Ethan Mitchell, Kristen Kaster, Matthew Ninaber, Matthew Daciw, Jacqueline Ninaber, Jonah Fortin, Melissa Joy Boerger', 'NR', 'Mercenaries with nothing to lose are hired to rescue a bioengineer imprisoned in a cold war bunker. Upon entering the ominous facility, they find themselves in a fight for their lives when they come under attack from an unknown and deadly creature.', 'Mercenaries with nothing to lose are hired to rescue a bioengineer imprisoned in a cold war bunker. Upon entering the ominous facility, they find themselves in a fight for their lives when they come under attack from an unknown and deadly creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVVBypE10jInpy2lYurWT8lyOXs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892113'),
  ('941516544604646819', 'Death Walks at Midnight', 1972, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Luciano Ercoli, Fernando Arribas', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Mahnahén Velasco', 'Nieves Navarro, Simón Andreu, Pietro Martellanza, Carlo Gentili, Ivano Staccioli, Claudio Pellegrini, Fabrizio Moresco, Alessandro Perrella', null, 'Valentina, a beautiful fashion model, takes an experimental drug as part of a scientific experiment. While influenced by the drug, Valentina has a vision of a young woman being brutally murdered with a viciously spiked glove. It turns out that a woman was killed in exactly the same way not long ago and soon Valentina finds herself stalked by the same killer.', 'Valentina, a beautiful fashion model, takes an experimental drug as part of a scientific experiment. While influenced by the drug, Valentina has a vision of a young woman being brutally murdered with a viciously spiked glove. It turns out that a woman was killed in exactly the same way not long ago and soon Valentina finds herself stalked by the same killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTOW46oizijZCY6EpS2JQuo5hlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91255'),
  ('619381740426299804', 'Death Walks on High Heels', 1971, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Alessandro D''Eva, Luciano Ercoli, Fernando Arribas', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Mahnahén Velasco', 'Frank Wolff, Nieves Navarro, Simón Andreu, Carlo Gentili, George Rigaud, José Manuel Martín, Fabrizio Moresco, Luciano Rossi', null, 'Exotic dancer Nicole finds herself terrorized by a black-clad assailant determined on procuring her murdered father''s stolen gems. Fleeing Paris in hopes of evading her knife-wielding pursuer, Nicole arrives in England only to discover that death stalks her at every corner.', 'Exotic dancer Nicole finds herself terrorized by a black-clad assailant determined on procuring her murdered father''s stolen gems. Fleeing Paris in hopes of evading her knife-wielding pursuer, Nicole arrives in England only to discover that death stalks her at every corner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/OgnXQqhORlSIXGHfM3TpgDph4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77029'),
