  ('907676155338019392', 'Death Wish 3', 1985, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Winner, John Stanier, Alan Hopkins', 'Don Jakoby', 'Charles Bronson, Deborah Raffin, Ed Lauter, Martin Balsam, Gavan O''Herlihy, Kirk Taylor, Alex Winter, Tony Spiridakis', 'R', 'Architect/vigilante Paul Kersey arrives back in New York City and is forcibly recruited by a crooked police chief to fight street crime caused by a large gang terrorizing the neighborhoods.', 'Architect/vigilante Paul Kersey arrives back in New York City and is forcibly recruited by a crooked police chief to fight street crime caused by a large gang terrorizing the neighborhoods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc33TytXxkC9cSKyztDJzwF3lbn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24873'),
