  ('968826336423173447', 'Death''s Roulette', 2023, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Luis Enrique Carrión, Manolo Cardona', 'Gavo Amiel, Julieta Steinberg', 'Manolo Cardona, Maribel Verdú, Carla Adell, Juan Carlos Remolina, Adriana Paz, Dagoberto Gama, Fernando Becerril, Tiago Correa', 'R', 'Seven strangers wake up in a mansion in the middle of nowhere to discover they are part of a twisted game. They will have 60 minutes to choose one person to die; otherwise, all of them will be murdered. As the clock ticks down, the most lurid secrets will come to light, and they’ll discover they are all connected by a dark past.', 'Seven strangers wake up in a mansion in the middle of nowhere to discover they are part of a twisted game. They will have 60 minutes to choose one person to die; otherwise, all of them will be murdered. As the clock ticks down, the most lurid secrets will come to light, and they’ll discover they are all connected by a dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMeKoe3ui4Pad8FUOJwCby3SOWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114905'),
  ('562529131313195835', 'Deathcember', 2019, 'Horror', 'Steve De Roover, Isaac Ezban, Trent Haaga', 'Steve De Roover, Jasper Vrancken, Isaac Ezban', 'Barbara Crampton, Tiffany Shepis, AJ Bowen, Jeffrey Reddick, Haydée Lysander, Marie Nasemann, Barkley Harper, Kue Lawrence', 'NR', 'Advent – a time of joyful anticipation. You will surely remember the feeling you had as a child, waking up on the first December morning. Rising early, ready to open a new door for 24 consecutive days.', 'Advent – a time of joyful anticipation. You will surely remember the feeling you had as a child, waking up on the first December morning. Rising early, ready to open a new door for 24 consecutive days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEmsHJvFigUPMmhl5CjaLjw5jNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597785'),
