  ('305743190900590316', 'Deathmask', 1984, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Richard Friedman, Yuri Denysenko', 'Jeffrey Goldenberg, Richard Friedman', 'Farley Granger, Lee Bryant, John McCurry, Arch Johnson, Barbara Bingham, Ruth Warrick, Danny Aiello, Veronica Hart', null, 'Haunted by the drowning death of his own daughter, a police investigator embarks on an obsessive 10-year hunt for the identity of a dead boy, to the detriment of his family life.', 'Haunted by the drowning death of his own daughter, a police investigator embarks on an obsessive 10-year hunt for the identity of a dead boy, to the detriment of his family life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTxa7h8jTTX2IaiDyEjaPXUwvYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78180'),
  ('875509857892211787', 'Deathrow Gameshow', 1987, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Mark Pirro, Craig Bassuk, Tom Milo', 'Mark Pirro', 'John McCafferty, Robyn Blythe, Beano, Mark Lasky, Darwyn Carson, Kent Butler, Paul Farbman, Bill Whitehead', 'R', 'Chuck Toedan hosts the most controversial show on TV: Live or Die, where deathrow inmates compete against each other for a chance to beat the executioner. However, when he accidentally kills a mob boss of the most feared mafia in the city, a hit man tries to put an end to him and his show once and for all. As a battle of wits and survival ensues, Chuck is forced to engage in the very tactics he uses on his contestants, or die trying.', 'Chuck Toedan hosts the most controversial show on TV: Live or Die, where deathrow inmates compete against each other for a chance to beat the executioner. However, when he accidentally kills a mob boss of the most feared mafia in the city, a hit man tries to put an end to him and his show once and for all. As a battle of wits and survival ensues, Chuck is forced to engage in the very tactics he uses on his contestants, or die trying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7944iQqgowLOGKAVgEtnSiHoOH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73146'),
  ('9217160249799326', 'Deathsport', 1978, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Allan Arkush, Nicholas Niciphor, Gary Graver', 'Nicholas Niciphor, Donald E. Stewart', 'David Carradine, Claudia Jennings, Richard Lynch, William Smithers, Will Walker, David McLean, Jesse Vint, H.B. Haggerty', 'R', '1000 years into the future, after the Great Neutron Wars, the world is divided into desert wastelands and isolated city-states. Notorious "Desert Ranger" Kaz is forced to fight in the DeathSport, dueling on futuristic motorcycle "Death Machines". With the help of renegade vixen Deneer, Kaz must face his past and fight to save himself and his people.', '1000 years into the future, after the Great Neutron Wars, the world is divided into desert wastelands and isolated city-states. Notorious "Desert Ranger" Kaz is forced to fight in the DeathSport, dueling on futuristic motorcycle "Death Machines". With the help of renegade vixen Deneer, Kaz must face his past and fight to save himself and his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UzEUTGfVftDWMqOnpepujv3VRn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28735'),
  ('1081548807041510248', 'Deathstalker', 1983, 'Action, Fantasy', 'James Sbardellati, Leonardo Rodríguez Solís, Américo Ortiz de Zárate', 'Howard R. Cohen', 'Rick Hill, Barbi Benton, Richard Brooker, Lana Clarkson, Víctor Bó, Bernard Erhard, Augusto Larreta, Verónica Llinás', 'R', 'The warrior Deathstalker is tasked by an old witch lady to obtain and unite the three powers of creation - a chalice, an amulet, and a sword - lest the evil magician Munkar get them and use them for nefarious purposes. After obtaining the sword, Deathstalker joins with other travelers going to the Big Tournament to determine the strongest warrior. The false king holds the true princess in captivity, and plots to have Deathstalker killed, and Deathstalker must fight to free the princess.', 'The warrior Deathstalker is tasked by an old witch lady to obtain and unite the three powers of creation - a chalice, an amulet, and a sword - lest the evil magician Munkar get them and use them for nefarious purposes. After obtaining the sword, Deathstalker joins with other travelers going to the Big Tournament to determine the strongest warrior. The false king holds the true princess in captivity, and plots to have Deathstalker killed, and Deathstalker must fight to free the princess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuX0IwRF03lcNXuhRNIVbBEByqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15895'),
  ('399973285790666298', 'Deathstalker', 2025, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Steven Kostanski, Andrew Appelle, Martin M. Smith', 'Steven Kostanski', 'Daniel Bernhardt, Christina Orjalo, Paul Lazenby, Nicholas Rice, Patton Oswalt, Nina Bergman, John Clifford Talbot, Jon Ambrose', 'R', 'A powerful swordsman known as Deathstalker recovers a cursed amulet from a corpse-strewn battlefield. Marked by dark magic and hunted by monstrous assassins, he must face the rising evil and break the curse.', 'A powerful swordsman known as Deathstalker recovers a cursed amulet from a corpse-strewn battlefield. Marked by dark magic and hunted by monstrous assassins, he must face the rising evil and break the curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEI3DnzQC1afAjJOAizx6UX27pL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1253000'),
  ('1013476536324853665', 'Deathstalker II: Duel of the Titans', 1987, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jim Wynorski, Leonardo Rodríguez Solís, Bob Sheridan', 'Neil Ruttenberg', 'John Terlesky, Monique Gabrielle, John Lazar, Toni Naples, María Socas, Marcos Woinsky, Dee Booher, Jacques Arndt', 'R', 'Deathstalker helps Reena the Seer out of a few jams, and she solicits his help for a bigger task. She reveals that she is actually Princess Evie, but the evil sorcerer had her abducted and cloned in order to seize control of the kingdom. Together they travel to the evil sorcerer''s stronghold to restore the princess to her rightful position, encountering challenges along the way both from the sorcerer''s goons and the fierce Amazon women.', 'Deathstalker helps Reena the Seer out of a few jams, and she solicits his help for a bigger task. She reveals that she is actually Princess Evie, but the evil sorcerer had her abducted and cloned in order to seize control of the kingdom. Together they travel to the evil sorcerer''s stronghold to restore the princess to her rightful position, encountering challenges along the way both from the sorcerer''s goons and the fierce Amazon women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWWGVspUqMezWpXcaaB3yglWp8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28218'),
  ('744659079085015507', 'Deathstalker III: The Warriors from Hell', 1988, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Alfonso Corona, Xavier Cruz', 'Howard R. Cohen', 'John Allen Nelson, Carla Herd, Terri Treas, Thom Christopher, Aarón Hernán, Roger Cudney, Claudia Inchaurregui, Erika Carlsson', 'R', 'Deathstalker’s back—and this time he’s facing off against Troxartes, an evil wizard with a zombie army and two magical jewels that hold the key to the lost city of Erendor. Teaming up with Princess Carissa, Deathstalker must protect the third gem, storm a heavily guarded fortress, and ride a bolt of lightning straight into battle.', 'Deathstalker’s back—and this time he’s facing off against Troxartes, an evil wizard with a zombie army and two magical jewels that hold the key to the lost city of Erendor. Teaming up with Princess Carissa, Deathstalker must protect the third gem, storm a heavily guarded fortress, and ride a bolt of lightning straight into battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v02COOci4mePyLwn2447PdbnCxz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47360'),
  ('409006408050229222', 'Deathstalker IV: Match of Titans', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Howard R. Cohen, Emil Vagenstein', 'Howard R. Cohen', 'Rick Hill, Maria Ford, Brett Baxter Clark, Michelle Moffett, Djoko Rosic, Anya Pencheva, Kosta Karageorgiev, Jenny Philipova', 'R', 'What begins as a grand tournament soon turns sinister when fighters start disappearing without a trace. Drawn into the mystery, Deathstalker uncovers a wicked queen’s plot and her army of unstoppable stone warriors. Now, with his fellow champions in danger and a new love to protect, Deathstalker must fight his greatest battle yet—or become just another casualty in her twisted game.', 'What begins as a grand tournament soon turns sinister when fighters start disappearing without a trace. Drawn into the mystery, Deathstalker uncovers a wicked queen’s plot and her army of unstoppable stone warriors. Now, with his fellow champions in danger and a new love to protect, Deathstalker must fight his greatest battle yet—or become just another casualty in her twisted game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbFVPFuikx4RFOOrMn7qr0gea0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47363'),
  ('998960153065287714', 'Deathstroke: Knights & Dragons - The Movie', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Sung Jin Ahn, Matthew Girardi', 'J. M. DeMatteis', 'Michael Chiklis, Sasha Alexander, Chris Jai Alex, Faye Mata, Griffin Puatu, Asher Bishop, Imari Williams, Colin Salmon', 'R', 'The assassin Deathstroke tries to save his family from the wrath of H.I.V.E. and the murderous Jackal.', 'The assassin Deathstroke tries to save his family from the wrath of H.I.V.E. and the murderous Jackal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFIHbiy55smzi50RmF8LQjmpGcx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:703771'),
  ('299104797790417548', 'Deathtrap', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Sidney Lumet, Andrzej Bartkowiak, Burtt Harris', 'Jay Presson Allen', 'Michael Caine, Christopher Reeve, Dyan Cannon, Irene Worth, Henry Jones, Joe Silver, Tony DiBenedetto, Al LeBreton', 'PG', 'A Broadway playwright puts murder in his plan to take credit for a student''s script.', 'A Broadway playwright puts murder in his plan to take credit for a student''s script.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwrqCTcu5rAkU2dL2YqG6jjrLPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17590'),
  ('754498144060913859', 'Deathwatch', 2002, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, War', 'MJ Bassett, Hendrik Holler, Hubert Taczanowski', 'MJ Bassett', 'Jamie Bell, Rúaidhrí Conroy, Mike Downey, Laurence Fox, Roman Horák, Dean Lennox Kelly, Torben Liebrecht, Kris Marshall', 'R', 'In the brutal trench fighting of the First World War, a British Infantry Company is separated from their regiment after a fierce battle. Attempting to return to their lines, the British soldiers discover what appears to be a bombed out German trench, abandoned except for a few dazed German soldiers. After killing most of the Germans, and taking one prisoner, the British company fortifies to hold the trench until reinforcements can arrive. Soon, however, strange things being to happen as a sense of evil descends on the trench and the British begin turn on each other.', 'In the brutal trench fighting of the First World War, a British Infantry Company is separated from their regiment after a fierce battle. Attempting to return to their lines, the British soldiers discover what appears to be a bombed out German trench, abandoned except for a few dazed German soldiers. After killing most of the Germans, and taking one prisoner, the British company fortifies to hold the trench until reinforcements can arrive. Soon, however, strange things being to happen as a sense of evil descends on the trench and the British begin turn on each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/R8qod2CvMi5iH2gfr043dMSM1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12576'),
  ('402806930607197518', 'Deb Is Boss', 2026, 'Drama', 'Trey Haley', 'Carl Weber, Deb Antney', 'Lil Mama, LisaRaye McCoy, Clifton Powell, Dan Lauria, Redaric Williams', null, 'Follows the life of managing star Deb Antney, from growing up in Queens to her success as a career-changing manager, accredited for breaking the careers of high-profile artists as Gucci Mane, French Montana and Nicki Minaj.', 'Follows the life of managing star Deb Antney, from growing up in Queens to her success as a career-changing manager, accredited for breaking the careers of high-profile artists as Gucci Mane, French Montana and Nicki Minaj.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4d8GlYRvwX3tZGZasIHu5l6GhLX.jpg', 'plex:movie:deb-is-boss'),
