  ('317186670481355331', 'Debbie Macomber''s Dashing Through The Snow', 2015, 'TV Movie, Family, Mystery, Romance', 'Neil Cervin, Kristoffer Tabori', 'Maria Nation', 'Meghan Ory, Andrew W. Walker, Rukiya Bernard, Aaron Craven, Colleen Winton, Kadence Kendall Roach, Rohan Campbell', null, 'Stranded at an airport at Christmastime, Ashley Harrison accepts a ride from Dash Sutherland, who has just rented the last car in town. As the pair heads north, their adventures include car trouble, adopting a puppy and being secretly tailed by federal agents, who believe Ashley is up to no good. With a hint of romance gradually filling the air will these two fall in love or will their journey bring about an unexpected road bump to romance?', 'Stranded at an airport at Christmastime, Ashley Harrison accepts a ride from Dash Sutherland, who has just rented the last car in town. As the pair heads north, their adventures include car trouble, adopting a puppy and being secretly tailed by federal agents, who believe Ashley is up to no good. With a hint of romance gradually filling the air will these two fall in love or will their journey bring about an unexpected road bump to romance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odsvdvoDLb1sIWHtzWojxZXQni2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369052'),
  ('525457179719924054', 'Debt', 2018, 'Drama', 'Vuslat Saraçoğlu, Meryem Yavuz', 'Vuslat Saraçoğlu', 'Serdar Orçin, İpek Türktan, Rüçhan Çalışkur, Ozan Çelik, Beyti Engin, Feridun Koç, Ülkü Aybala Sunat, Öykü Sevinç', null, 'Tufan who works at a small print shop lives in Eskişehir with his wife Mukaddes and daughter Simge. Huriye, their lonely neighbour next door falls ill one night. A doctor recommends that she shouldn’t stay on her own. Tufan takes pity on Huriye, who has no family to turn to, and decides to host her at his house.', 'Tufan who works at a small print shop lives in Eskişehir with his wife Mukaddes and daughter Simge. Huriye, their lonely neighbour next door falls ill one night. A doctor recommends that she shouldn’t stay on her own. Tufan takes pity on Huriye, who has no family to turn to, and decides to host her at his house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFQAi1oChh99WHmtsfY9GXRXWUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518835'),
  ('721688244983951553', 'Debt Collectors', 2020, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Jonathan Hall, Jesse V. Johnson', 'Jesse V. Johnson, Stu Small', 'Scott Adkins, Louis Mandylor, Mayling Ng, Vladimir Kulich, Mariano Mendoza, Ski Carr, Josef Cannon, Mike Maolucci', 'R', 'A pair of debt collectors are thrust into an explosively dangerous situation, chasing down various lowlifes while also evading a vengeful kingpin.', 'A pair of debt collectors are thrust into an explosively dangerous situation, chasing down various lowlifes while also evading a vengeful kingpin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8FWpw3WHUo9EvU1xMWZRjdRlN3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647785'),
