  ('1062118047564862967', 'Debtor’s Wife', 2024, null, null, null, 'Yoon Yool, Min Do-yoon, So Ra', null, 'Soo-yeong and Hae-soo are college friends stuck in a love tangle: Soo-yeong likes Che-moo, but Che-moo likes Hae-soo. Meanwhile, Hae-soo likes Dae-in, but Dae-in likes Soo-yeong. Despite the mixed-up feelings, they end up in mismatched marriages. Later, Hae-soo wants to have a baby and tries to get closer to her husband, Dae-in. But Dae-in knows he can’t have children, so he secretly makes a surprising proposal to Soo-yeong’s husband, Che-moo.', 'Soo-yeong and Hae-soo are college friends stuck in a love tangle: Soo-yeong likes Che-moo, but Che-moo likes Hae-soo. Meanwhile, Hae-soo likes Dae-in, but Dae-in likes Soo-yeong. Despite the mixed-up feelings, they end up in mismatched marriages. Later, Hae-soo wants to have a baby and tries to get closer to her husband, Dae-in. But Dae-in knows he can’t have children, so he secretly makes a surprising proposal to Soo-yeong’s husband, Che-moo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouXTrnJBimHIhWIUlHARDJH47no.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1525963'),
  ('374499070685247359', 'Debug', 2014, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Gavin Smith, Jason McQuarrie, David Hewlett', 'David Hewlett', 'Jeananne Goossen, Adrian Holmes, Adam Butcher, Jason Momoa, Kyle Mac, Jadyn Wong, Sidney Leeder, Nathaniel Bacon', 'PG-13', 'Six young computer hackers sent to work on a derelict space freighter, are forced to match wits with a vengeful artificial intelligence that would kill to be human.', 'Six young computer hackers sent to work on a derelict space freighter, are forced to match wits with a vengeful artificial intelligence that would kill to be human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnsqg7ukZe9S0uoPQ7633sWtMno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299939'),
  ('998030394536685931', 'Decadencia', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Joaquin Rodriguez', 'Joaquin Rodriguez', 'Alejandro Estrada, Nataly Umaña, Juan Pablo Castañeda, Samantha Godoy, Roberto Palazuelos', null, 'Anabel Bolio is a beautiful and young workingwoman; Oskar Pratz is a brilliant and handsome entrepreneur. A spark of mutual attraction is inevitable and a torrid romance ensues. But what seams to be the prefect love story quickly decay and spiral downward into dangerous sexual games that lead to tragedy.', 'Anabel Bolio is a beautiful and young workingwoman; Oskar Pratz is a brilliant and handsome entrepreneur. A spark of mutual attraction is inevitable and a torrid romance ensues. But what seams to be the prefect love story quickly decay and spiral downward into dangerous sexual games that lead to tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68aiHQF3wl8XdqnCcYXM3h25pKz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360028'),
  ('981899546894846923', 'Decalogue I', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Dariusz Jabłoński, Teresa Violetta Buhl', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Henryk Baranowski, Wojciech Klata, Maja Komorowska, Artur Barciś, Agnieszka Brustman, Maciej Borniński, Magdalena Mikołajczak, Maria Gładkowska', null, 'Krzysztof, a semantics professor and computer hobbyist, is raising his young son, Paweł, to look to science for answers, while Irena, Paweł’s aunt, lives a life rooted in faith. Over the course of one day, both adults are forced to question their belief systems.', 'Krzysztof, a semantics professor and computer hobbyist, is raising his young son, Paweł, to look to science for answers, while Irena, Paweł’s aunt, lives a life rooted in faith. Over the course of one day, both adults are forced to question their belief systems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3kJ2UXkZSUzfQAAjcRwl6qNIpc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118662'),
  ('966744523332102853', 'Decalogue II', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Teresa Violetta Buhl, Dariusz Jabłoński', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Krystyna Janda, Aleksander Bardini, Olgierd Łukaszewicz, Artur Barciś, Stanisław Gawlik, Krzysztof Kumor, Maciej Szary, Krystyna Bigelmajer', null, 'Dorota Geller, a married woman, faces a dilemma involving her sick husband''s prognosis. Her husband''s doctor, who believes in God, sweared about it in vain.', 'Dorota Geller, a married woman, faces a dilemma involving her sick husband''s prognosis. Her husband''s doctor, who believes in God, sweared about it in vain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jil1lzNPa6fQWh2JG7Khc7MLjKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51108'),
  ('190002453555685176', 'Decalogue III', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Piotr Sobociński, Teresa Violetta Buhl', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Daniel Olbrychski, Maria Pakulnis, Joanna Szczepkowska, Artur Barciś, Krystyna Drochocka, Krzysztof Kumor, Dorota Stalińska, Zygmunt Fok', null, 'It’s Christmas Eve, and Ewa has plotted to pass the hours until morning with her former lover Janusz, a family man, by making him believe her husband has gone missing. During this night of recklessness and lies, the pair grapple with choices made when their affair was discovered three years ago, and with the value of their present lives.', 'It’s Christmas Eve, and Ewa has plotted to pass the hours until morning with her former lover Janusz, a family man, by making him believe her husband has gone missing. During this night of recklessness and lies, the pair grapple with choices made when their affair was discovered three years ago, and with the value of their present lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9V2nTq15i9cmfbieglzaCW4IJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118663'),
  ('216025187279263771', 'Decalogue IV', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Dariusz Przychoda, Dariusz Jabłoński', 'Krzysztof Piesiewicz, Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Adrianna Biedrzyńska, Janusz Gajos, Artur Barciś, Aleksander Bardini, Adam Hanuszkiewicz, Jan Tesarz, Igor Śmiałowski, Andrzej Blumenfeld', null, 'A father and daughter, Michał and Anka, have a unique intimacy, which the college-aged Anka is beginning to feel conflicted about. When she finds an unopened letter from her deceased mother, it seems to justify her attraction to Michał, who may not in fact be her father.', 'A father and daughter, Michał and Anka, have a unique intimacy, which the college-aged Anka is beginning to feel conflicted about. When she finds an unopened letter from her deceased mother, it seems to justify her attraction to Michał, who may not in fact be her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0OHhueacQS9mT6HnrF3ivdxnxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51110'),
  ('1082600547792699177', 'Decalogue IX', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Piotr Sobociński, Paweł Rzepkowski', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Ewa Błaszczyk, Piotr Machalica, Artur Barciś, Jan Jankowski, Jolanta Piętek-Górecka, Katarzyna Piwowarczyk, Jerzy Trela, Małgorzata Boratyńska', null, 'Roman and Hanka have a loving marriage, but his impotence has led to her having an affair. The unbearable situation drives Roman to extreme measures both physically and mentally, testing their love and his own will to live.', 'Roman and Hanka have a loving marriage, but his impotence has led to her having an affair. The unbearable situation drives Roman to extreme measures both physically and mentally, testing their love and his own will to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9walZQzHStoe38bEJv4AJbcV56K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118669'),
  ('932820331408910584', 'Decalogue V', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie, Crime', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Sławomir Idziak, Teresa Violetta Buhl', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Mirosław Baka, Krzysztof Globisz, Jan Tesarz, Artur Barciś, Krystyna Janda, Olgierd Łukaszewicz, Maciej Szary, Zbigniew Zapasiewicz', null, 'Jacek, an angry drifter, murders a taxi driver, brutally and without motive. His case is assigned to Piotr, an idealistic young lawyer who is morally opposed to the death penalty, and their interactions take on an emotional honesty that throws into stark relief for Piotr the injustice of killing of any kind.', 'Jacek, an angry drifter, murders a taxi driver, brutally and without motive. His case is assigned to Piotr, an idealistic young lawyer who is morally opposed to the death penalty, and their interactions take on an emotional honesty that throws into stark relief for Piotr the injustice of killing of any kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZktBR66C8WIJHJkqMlj6MgowDK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118665'),
  ('596683976576646181', 'Decalogue VI', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Witold Adamek, Teresa Violetta Buhl', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Olaf Lubaszenko, Grażyna Szapołowska, Stefania Iwińska, Artur Barciś, Stanisław Gawlik, Piotr Machalica, Rafal Imbro, Jan Piechociński', null, 'A teenage postal worker, Tomek, routinely spies on his older neighbor Magda, a sexually liberated artist who lives in the apartment across the courtyard from his. As their private worlds merge, fascination turns to obsession, and the line between love and curiosity becomes violently blurred.', 'A teenage postal worker, Tomek, routinely spies on his older neighbor Magda, a sexually liberated artist who lives in the apartment across the courtyard from his. As their private worlds merge, fascination turns to obsession, and the line between love and curiosity becomes violently blurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFrFFA3hdQrx0JaumP0mMkuM13X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118667'),
  ('45227322672676793', 'Decalogue VII', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Dariusz Kuc, Teresa Violetta Buhl', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Anna Polony, Maja Barełkowska, Władysław Kowalski, Bogusław Linda, Bożena Dykiel, Katarzyna Piwowarczyk, Stefania Błońska, Dariusz Jabłoński', null, 'As a high school student, Majka bore a child, Ania, whom Majka’s mother, Ewa, has been raising as her own. Now that Majka is ready for motherhood, Ewa refuses to let go, leading Majka to kidnap her own daughter, with unexpected emotional consequences.', 'As a high school student, Majka bore a child, Ania, whom Majka’s mother, Ewa, has been raising as her own. Now that Majka is ready for motherhood, Ewa refuses to let go, leading Majka to kidnap her own daughter, with unexpected emotional consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itblkmFBfKhZxUbJjYgyEgjDlgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118668'),
  ('714140834622166778', 'Decalogue VIII', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Andrzej J. Jaroszewicz, Teresa Violetta Buhl', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Piesiewicz', 'Maria Kościałkowska, Teresa Marczewska, Artur Barciś, Tadeusz Łomnicki, Marian Opania, Bronisław Pawlik, Wojciech Asiński, Marek Kępiński', null, 'Zofia, a professor of ethics, is visited by Elżbieta, an American researching the fate of Jews who survived World War II. A daytime classroom conversation turns into a night of confrontation, and Zofia is forced to answer for a decision she made decades ago that directly affected the course of Elżbieta’s life.', 'Zofia, a professor of ethics, is visited by Elżbieta, an American researching the fate of Jews who survived World War II. A daytime classroom conversation turns into a night of confrontation, and Zofia is forced to answer for a decision she made decades ago that directly affected the course of Elżbieta’s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJ60dOPRq3M0Dkbpnp5jrl2UfVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51111'),
  ('829455671215829582', 'Decalogue X', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Olaf Lubaszenko, Dariusz Przychoda', 'Krzysztof Piesiewicz, Krzysztof Kieślowski', 'Jerzy Stuhr, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Henryk Bista, Olaf Lubaszenko, Maciej Stuhr, Jerzy Turek, Anna Gornostaj, Henryk Majcherek', null, 'Jerzy and Artur’s father dies, leaving behind a valuable stamp collection, which, they discover, is coveted by dealers of varying degrees of shadiness. The more involved the brothers get in their father’s world, the more dire and comical their situation becomes.', 'Jerzy and Artur’s father dies, leaving behind a valuable stamp collection, which, they discover, is coveted by dealers of varying degrees of shadiness. The more involved the brothers get in their father’s world, the more dire and comical their situation becomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zvQpJDfpXlCe9FvBdO86hIgavN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118670'),
  ('800791235113046443', 'Decampitated', 1998, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Matt Cunningham, Carolyn C. Miller', 'Matt Cunningham', 'Amy Gordon, Mike Hart, Steve Ladden, Wayne Larsen, Bethany La Voo, Ryan Lowery, Thomas Martwick, Cristina Patterson', null, 'Seven friends are going camping at the infamous DeCamp acres for a weekend. But they crash their car and are put in the woods guarded by a psychopath killer who tries to kill them one by one.', 'Seven friends are going camping at the infamous DeCamp acres for a weekend. But they crash their car and are put in the woods guarded by a psychopath killer who tries to kill them one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OJdyQUy2JnKyWR8fx0CbdNYjT8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19604'),
  ('145433771836732530', 'Decasia: The State of Decay', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Bill Morrison', 'Bill Morrison', null, null, 'A meditation on the human quest to transcend physicality, constructed from decaying archival footage and set to an original symphonic score.', 'A meditation on the human quest to transcend physicality, constructed from decaying archival footage and set to an original symphonic score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8szza0KS8jJb2IlKZgeZ8vRsP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25621'),
  ('485688730161753590', 'Deceitful Appearances', 1983, 'Drama', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo, Alejandro Pelayo, Juan Antonio de la Riva', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo', 'Gonzalo Vega, Isela Vega, Manuel Ojeda, Margarita Isabel, Ignacio Retes, Roberto Cobo, Tina Romero, Emma Roldán', null, 'The sexual misunderstandings caused by the real identity of a rich woman serve Hermosillo to satirize the moral and social hypocrisy of the provincial that every Mexican carries inside.', 'The sexual misunderstandings caused by the real identity of a rich woman serve Hermosillo to satirize the moral and social hypocrisy of the provincial that every Mexican carries inside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SI0MSAFnBQDgX5OMbVXWfkMv5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273583'),
  ('168982323328897104', 'Deceived', 1991, 'Thriller', 'Damian Harris, Deborah Aquila, Walter Gasparovic', 'Mary Agnes Donoghue, Bruce Joel Rubin', 'Goldie Hawn, John Heard, Ashley Peldon, Robin Bartlett, Tom Irwin, Amy Wright, Kate Reid, Jan Rubeš', 'PG-13', 'The murder of a museum curator places art dealer Jack Saunders under suspicion for selling forged treasures to museums. When Jack suddenly dies in a car crash, his wife Adrienne tries to discover what he did on her own. She finds that she knew little about the man she was married to. The more she learns about her husband''s possible illegal activities and double life, the more she places her daughter, and herself, in grave danger.', 'The murder of a museum curator places art dealer Jack Saunders under suspicion for selling forged treasures to museums. When Jack suddenly dies in a car crash, his wife Adrienne tries to discover what he did on her own. She finds that she knew little about the man she was married to. The more she learns about her husband''s possible illegal activities and double life, the more she places her daughter, and herself, in grave danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j18E6rNmvPf6ALnWHrvn9IBvI7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28455'),
  ('425963693859924342', 'Deceiver', 1997, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jonas Pate, Josh Pate, Bill Butler', 'Josh Pate, Jonas Pate', 'Tim Roth, Michael Rooker, Renée Zellweger, Chris Penn, Rosanna Arquette, Karina Logue, Ellen Burstyn, Tamara Mercer', 'R', 'The gruesome death of a prostitute brings suspicion on one of her clients, James Wayland, a brilliant, self-destructive and epileptic heir to a textile fortune. So detectives Braxton and Kennesaw take Wayland in for questioning, thinking they can break the man. But despite his troubles, Wayland is a master of manipulation, and during the interrogation, he begins to turn the tables on the investigators, forcing them to reveal their own sinister sides.', 'The gruesome death of a prostitute brings suspicion on one of her clients, James Wayland, a brilliant, self-destructive and epileptic heir to a textile fortune. So detectives Braxton and Kennesaw take Wayland in for questioning, thinking they can break the man. But despite his troubles, Wayland is a master of manipulation, and during the interrogation, he begins to turn the tables on the investigators, forcing them to reveal their own sinister sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bxBZV0KsUolu7MddTXZ0Prac3Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14583'),
  ('535921363968205418', 'December', 2008, 'Drama', 'Selton Mello, Tatiana Maciel, Juliana Alves', 'Marcelo Vindicato, Selton Mello', 'Leonardo Medeiros, Darlene Glória, Paulo Guarnieri, Graziella Moretto, Lúcio Mauro, Fabrício Reis, Thelmo Fernandes, Cláudio Mendes', null, 'Caio is 40 years old and lives in the Rio de Janeiro''s countryside, where he owns a scrap-metal yard. On Christmas'' Eve, he goes to the capital to visit his family and friends. Finally he will be able to meet a man he has not seen for a long time: himself.', 'Caio is 40 years old and lives in the Rio de Janeiro''s countryside, where he owns a scrap-metal yard. On Christmas'' Eve, he goes to the capital to visit his family and friends. Finally he will be able to meet a man he has not seen for a long time: himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzp3uFH4EK4fITH141VYS1SEhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72705'),
  ('474382509953778643', 'December 7th', 1943, 'History, War, Action, Documentary', 'John Ford, Gregg Toland, Gregg Toland', 'Budd Schulberg', 'Walter Huston, Harry Davenport, Dana Andrews, Paul Hurst, George O''Brien, James Kevin McGuinness, Philip Ahn, Addie Allen', null, '"Docudrama" about the bombing of Pearl Harbor on December 7th, 1941 and its results, the recovering of the ships, the improving of defense in Hawaii and the US efforts to beat back the Japanese reinforcements.', '"Docudrama" about the bombing of Pearl Harbor on December 7th, 1941 and its results, the recovering of the ships, the improving of defense in Hawaii and the US efforts to beat back the Japanese reinforcements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrfkeXuHyogHMTUIZ4srU3680is.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100605'),
  ('523790054097053017', 'December Boys', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Connell, Rod Hardy, Sophie Stawaruk', 'Marc Rosenberg', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Lee Cormie, Christian Byers, James Fraser, Jack Thompson, Teresa Palmer, Sullivan Stapleton, Victoria Hill', 'PG-13', 'For many years, four teenage orphans at an Australian outback convent have watched their younger comrades find new parents, and realize that they may never be adopted. The Reverend Mother sends the four boys away on a seaside vacation, where they meet Teresa and Fearless, a couple who would make perfect parents. The youths compete with one another to be the one Teresa and Fearless decide to adopt.', 'For many years, four teenage orphans at an Australian outback convent have watched their younger comrades find new parents, and realize that they may never be adopted. The Reverend Mother sends the four boys away on a seaside vacation, where they meet Teresa and Fearless, a couple who would make perfect parents. The youths compete with one another to be the one Teresa and Fearless decide to adopt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28Q3BZgCI8imvbC8qQWDAL0nqjR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4629'),
  ('1020221646904264105', 'Deception', 1946, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Irving Rapper, Ernest Haller, Jesse Hibbs', 'Joseph Than, John Collier', 'Bette Davis, Paul Henreid, Claude Rains, John Abbott, Benson Fong, John Alban, Russell Arms, Lois Austin', null, 'After marrying her long lost love, a pianist finds the relationship threatened by a wealthy composer who is besotted with her.', 'After marrying her long lost love, a pianist finds the relationship threatened by a wealthy composer who is besotted with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLJ837hwFn6x89i3YODO8D5POvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25502'),
  ('717863708281388547', 'Deception', 2008, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Marcel Langenegger, Dante Spinotti', 'Mark Bomback', 'Ewan McGregor, Hugh Jackman, Michelle Williams, Natasha Henstridge, Charlotte Rampling, Bruce Altman, Andrew Ginsburg, Stephanie Roth Haberle', 'R', 'As a corporate auditor who works in a number of different offices, Jonathan McQuarry wanders without an anchor among New York''s power brokers. A chance meeting with charismatic lawyer Wyatt Bose leads to Jonathan''s introduction to The List, an underground sex club. Jonathan begins an affair with a woman known only as S, who introduces Jonathan to a world of treachery and murder.', 'As a corporate auditor who works in a number of different offices, Jonathan McQuarry wanders without an anchor among New York''s power brokers. A chance meeting with charismatic lawyer Wyatt Bose leads to Jonathan''s introduction to The List, an underground sex club. Jonathan begins an affair with a woman known only as S, who introduces Jonathan to a world of treachery and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfkdTvfmaqlGiHymJl6EAdIaN1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13018'),
  ('477275006374553459', 'Deception', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julia Benazet, Gabriele Roux, Nathalie Nouaili', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Julie Peyr', 'Denis Podalydès, Léa Seydoux, Emmanuelle Devos, Anouk Grinberg, Mădălina Constantin, Miglen Mirtchev, Rebecca Marder, Saadia Bentaïeb', null, 'An American writer living in exile in London, Philip listens to women. His English mistress, who visits him regularly in the studio that serves as their refuge. A student he loved in another life. A former lover confined to a hospital in New York.', 'An American writer living in exile in London, Philip listens to women. His English mistress, who visits him regularly in the studio that serves as their refuge. A student he loved in another life. A former lover confined to a hospital in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xT261ctrOccm8fXDAYQPm3Zbyh6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774343'),
  ('714201387039540197', 'Deceptions', 1990, 'Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ruben Preuss, Dan Bradley, Zoran Hochstätter', 'Richard Taylor', 'Nicollette Sheridan, Harry Hamlin, Robert Davi, Marshall Colt, Kevin King, Ben Mittleman, John Levinson, Audri Phillips', 'R', 'When a wealthy socialite kills her husband, she claims self-defense. The cop assigned to the case is suspicious but becomes obsessed with the sensual young woman.', 'When a wealthy socialite kills her husband, she claims self-defense. The cop assigned to the case is suspicious but becomes obsessed with the sensual young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHmLkeaj6KP5obCWKEN4EHzA9N6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224526'),
  ('46103409603309487', 'Déchaînées', 2009, 'Drama', 'Raymond Vouillamoz, Denis Jutzeler', 'Stéphane Mitchell', 'Adèle Haenel, Irène Jacob, Paolina Biguine, Yvette Théraulaz, Jacques Michel, Pierre Maulini, Gaël Kamilindi, Simon Guélat', null, 'Lucy, a 19-year old law student and intern at a Swiss television network in Geneva, comes across her double in archival footage about the woman’s liberation movement in the 70’s. Her family’s resistance to talk about this time convinces Lucy that a secret lurks behind this mysterious woman, named Geneviève.', 'Lucy, a 19-year old law student and intern at a Swiss television network in Geneva, comes across her double in archival footage about the woman’s liberation movement in the 70’s. Her family’s resistance to talk about this time convinces Lucy that a secret lurks behind this mysterious woman, named Geneviève.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTWacEAINGbfXd8Nkw6hUELIoo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61790'),
  ('542620997658980670', 'Decision at Sundown', 1957, 'Western', 'Budd Boetticher, Sam Nelson, Burnett Guffey', 'Charles Lang', 'Randolph Scott, John Carroll, Karen Steele, Valerie French, Noah Beery Jr., John Archer, Andrew Duggan, James Westerfield', null, 'A man and his partner arrive at a small Western town to kill its most powerful man because the former blames him for his wife''s death.', 'A man and his partner arrive at a small Western town to kill its most powerful man because the former blames him for his wife''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR7L1RIgN8zHE83E4Z2MU6jYF8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39557'),
  ('1101390809477793895', 'Decision Before Dawn', 1951, 'War, Action, Thriller', 'Anatole Litvak, Franz Planer', 'Peter Viertel', 'Richard Basehart, Gary Merrill, Oskar Werner, Hildegard Knef, Dominique Blanchar, O.E. Hasse, Wilfried Seyferth, Hans Christian Blech', 'NR', 'WWII is entering its last phase: Germany is in ruins, but does not yield. The US army lacks crucial knowledge about the German units operating on the opposite side of the Rhine, and decides to send two German prisoners to gather information. The scheme is risky: the Gestapo retains a terribly efficient network to identify and capture spies and deserters. Moreover, it is not clear that "Tiger", who does not mind any dirty work as long as the price is right, and war-weary "Happy", who might be easily betrayed by his feelings, are dependable agents. After Tiger and another American agent are successfully infiltrated, Happy is parachuted in Bavaria. His duty: find out the whereabouts of a powerful German armored unit moving towards the western front.', 'WWII is entering its last phase: Germany is in ruins, but does not yield. The US army lacks crucial knowledge about the German units operating on the opposite side of the Rhine, and decides to send two German prisoners to gather information. The scheme is risky: the Gestapo retains a terribly efficient network to identify and capture spies and deserters. Moreover, it is not clear that "Tiger", who does not mind any dirty work as long as the price is right, and war-weary "Happy", who might be easily betrayed by his feelings, are dependable agents. After Tiger and another American agent are successfully infiltrated, Happy is parachuted in Bavaria. His duty: find out the whereabouts of a powerful German armored unit moving towards the western front.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOrzwxmEvPIiD9VDSuN1utgMAxX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4461'),
  ('144281529221670456', 'Decision to Leave', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Kim Seong-sik, Park Chan-wook, Kim Ji-yong', 'Park Chan-wook, Chung Seo-kyung', 'Tang Wei, Park Hae-il, Lee Jung-hyun, Go Kyung-pyo, Park Yong-woo, Kim Shin-young, Yoo Seung-mok, Jung Yi-seo', 'NR', 'From a mountain peak in South Korea, a man plummets to his death. Did he jump, or was he pushed? When detective Hae-joon arrives on the scene, he begins to suspect the dead man’s wife Seo-rae. But as he digs deeper into the investigation, he finds himself trapped in a web of deception and desire.', 'From a mountain peak in South Korea, a man plummets to his death. Did he jump, or was he pushed? When detective Hae-joon arrives on the scene, he begins to suspect the dead man’s wife Seo-rae. But as he digs deeper into the investigation, he finds himself trapped in a web of deception and desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zI8KZ4EdLUymWKX1YEkpZ0gtPUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:705996'),
  ('161256397606874834', 'Decisions, Decisions', 2008, null, null, null, 'Todd Friel', 'G', '"Dear God. What is your will for my life? I want to be in alignment with your will, so please show me what I should do for a living." This has been the earnest prayer of countless Christians. Does God answer this prayer, or does He reveal what you are supposed to do in other ways? Todd Friel, host of Wretched Radio, will provide you the tools to make small and big decisions so you will KNOW that you are in God''s will. No more regrets over bad decisions. No more wondering if you are reading signs from God right. Just simple, Biblical principles that will help you make a decision and sleep like a baby at night regardless of how well it turns out.', '"Dear God. What is your will for my life? I want to be in alignment with your will, so please show me what I should do for a living." This has been the earnest prayer of countless Christians. Does God answer this prayer, or does He reveal what you are supposed to do in other ways? Todd Friel, host of Wretched Radio, will provide you the tools to make small and big decisions so you will KNOW that you are in God''s will. No more regrets over bad decisions. No more wondering if you are reading signs from God right. Just simple, Biblical principles that will help you make a decision and sleep like a baby at night regardless of how well it turns out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/394DwKBQspEdZGUnKcjsclCI5GD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626050'),
  ('166636517707336647', 'Decisive Engagement: The Liaoxi Shenyang Campaign', 1991, 'War, History', 'Jian Chen, Li Jun, Yang Guangyuan', 'Wang Jun, Shi Chao, Li Pingfen', 'Gu Yue, Su Lin, Zhao Hengduo, Liu Huaizheng, Guo Fazeng, Lu Xi, Lu Qi, Shaoxin Ma', null, 'First part of the Decisive Engagement trilogy. Directed by Pingfen Li et al.', 'First part of the Decisive Engagement trilogy. Directed by Pingfen Li et al.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3L4zHEd6XKJrx6cVYgnlWRdO6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283033'),
  ('711684785685551586', 'Deck the Halls', 2006, 'Comedy, Family', 'Mark Irwin, John Whitesell, Charles Croughwell', 'Don Rhymer, Chris Ord, Matt Corman', 'Danny DeVito, Matthew Broderick, Kristin Davis, Kristin Chenoweth, Alia Shawkat, Fred Armisen, Jorge Garcia, Dylan Blue', 'PG', 'Determined to unseat Steve Finch''s reign as the town''s holiday season king, Buddy Hall plasters his house with so many decorative lights that it''ll be visible from space! When their wives bond, and their kids follow suit, the two men only escalate their rivalry - and their decorating.', 'Determined to unseat Steve Finch''s reign as the town''s holiday season king, Buddy Hall plasters his house with so many decorative lights that it''ll be visible from space! When their wives bond, and their kids follow suit, the two men only escalate their rivalry - and their decorating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smJDzhYGhl6j9OrucsB7IkMNy82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9969'),
  ('368628527948357342', 'Declaration of War', 2011, 'Drama', 'Valérie Donzelli, Sébastien Buchmann', 'Jérémie Elkaïm, Valérie Donzelli', 'Valérie Donzelli, Jérémie Elkaïm, Gabriel Elkaïm, Brigitte Sy, César Desseix, Elina Löwensohn, Philippe Laudenbach, Bastien Bouillon', null, 'Roméo and Juliette are two young actors. They fall in love at first sight, move in together and make a baby. A love story and the founding of a home like millions of others. Except that their little boy, Adam, behaves abnormally. The young parents try hard to persuade themselves that everything is okay but, with the passing of time, they cannot delude themselves anymore: their son has a problem. From now on, war is declared. A war against illness. A war against Death. A war against despair.', 'Roméo and Juliette are two young actors. They fall in love at first sight, move in together and make a baby. A love story and the founding of a home like millions of others. Except that their little boy, Adam, behaves abnormally. The young parents try hard to persuade themselves that everything is okay but, with the passing of time, they cannot delude themselves anymore: their son has a problem. From now on, war is declared. A war against illness. A war against Death. A war against despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVqIROaHxwwsxCSTEaEMqWyINmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73562'),
  ('596945462828019378', 'Decoded', 2024, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Chen Sicheng, Cao Yu', 'Chen Sicheng, Christopher MacBride', 'Liu Haoran, John Cusack, Chen Daoming, Daniel Wu, Yu Feihong, Chen Sicheng, Ren Luyao, Chen Yusi', null, 'In the 1940s, the world was in turmoil, and it was crucial to decipher the enemy''s communication codes in a timely and accurate manner. Rong Jinzhen has shown amazing mathematical talent since her childhood, and because she solved the problems assigned by her math teacher, she was noticed by more people, and even walked into the door of code-breaking by mistake.', 'In the 1940s, the world was in turmoil, and it was crucial to decipher the enemy''s communication codes in a timely and accurate manner. Rong Jinzhen has shown amazing mathematical talent since her childhood, and because she solved the problems assigned by her math teacher, she was noticed by more people, and even walked into the door of code-breaking by mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVbQ7CdjNbInS6ZIY0dS6KBZROi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241486'),
  ('229218114983600205', 'Decoder', 1984, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Muscha, Johanna Heer', 'Volker Schäfer, Trini Trimpop, Muscha', 'FM Einheit, William Rice, Christiane Felscherinow, William S. Burroughs, Genesis P-Orridge, Ralf Richter, Matthias Fuchs, Alexander Hacke', null, 'F.M. discovers that different sonic frequencies induce different patterns of behaviour in listeners, first in his own studio but later in the local "H-Burger" restaurant where the passive muzak appears to be wiping people''s emotions.', 'F.M. discovers that different sonic frequencies induce different patterns of behaviour in listeners, first in his own studio but later in the local "H-Burger" restaurant where the passive muzak appears to be wiping people''s emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHxPGSwDTgyuw8sivGl81vn3e1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90652'),
