  ('1059863154939591930', 'Deconstructing Harry', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Woody Allen, Carlo Di Palma, Richard Patrick', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Judy Davis, Kirstie Alley, Elisabeth Shue, Billy Crystal, Bob Balaban, Hazelle Goodman, Eric Lloyd', 'R', 'Writer Harry Block draws inspiration from people he knows, and from events that happened to him, sometimes causing these people to become alienated from him as a result.', 'Writer Harry Block draws inspiration from people he knows, and from events that happened to him, sometimes causing these people to become alienated from him as a result.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7Z5DdznqANJUjqWISEFu9bw6J7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2639'),
  ('579191049925539102', 'Decoy', 1946, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jack Bernhard, L. William O''Connell, William A. Calihan Jr.', 'Nedrick Young', 'Jean Gillie, Edward Norris, Robert Armstrong, Herbert Rudley, Sheldon Leonard, Marjorie Woodworth, Philip Van Zandt, Carole Donne', 'NR', 'A fatally shot female gangleader recounts her sordid life of crime to a police officer just before she dies.', 'A fatally shot female gangleader recounts her sordid life of crime to a police officer just before she dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnuBJ5efPrKqYywLkJmxsFqcH95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20028'),
  ('886082204001649510', 'Decoys', 2004, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Matthew Hastings, Daniel Villeneuve, Pierre Jodoin', 'Matthew Hastings, Tom Berry', 'Kim Poirier, Stefanie von Pfetten, Corey Sevier, Elias Toufexis, Meghan Ory, Ennis Esmer, Krista Morin, Marc Trottier', 'R', 'Luke and Roger are just another couple of college guys trying to lose their virginity. But when Luke sees something unusual, he begins to suspect that the girls on campus aren''t exactly...human.', 'Luke and Roger are just another couple of college guys trying to lose their virginity. But when Luke sees something unusual, he begins to suspect that the girls on campus aren''t exactly...human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nieqSpywIW3J25cFC8mEUXF2FTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18442'),
  ('909775814024626015', 'Decoys 2: Alien Seduction', 2007, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jeffery Scott Lando, John Spooner', 'Miguel Tejada-Flores', 'Kim Poirier, Corey Sevier, Tobin Bell, Tyler Johnston, Dina Meyer, Lindsay Maxwell, Reamonn Joshee, Sam Easton', null, 'Sam, a college student in a small Northwestern town, reluctantly joins his roommates in a contest to see who can hook up with the most gorgeous co-eds by the end of the semester. But when men slowly start disappearing around town, he and his friends learn that when it comes to beautiful women, it''s what''s inside that really matters.', 'Sam, a college student in a small Northwestern town, reluctantly joins his roommates in a contest to see who can hook up with the most gorgeous co-eds by the end of the semester. But when men slowly start disappearing around town, he and his friends learn that when it comes to beautiful women, it''s what''s inside that really matters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29ntxtmUwcA8RPVdEHStsaqrLGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18443'),
  ('436801834902551234', 'Dedalus', 2025, 'Thriller', 'Gianluca Manzetti, Andrea Arnone', 'Vincenzo Alfieri, Nicola Barnaba, Roberto Cipullo', 'Luka Zunic, Matilde Gioli, Francesco Russo, Giulio Beranek, Giulia Elettra Gorietti, Stella Pecollo, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Carolina Rey', null, 'Michele, Tiziana, Nino, Antonella, Filippo and Linda are the six aspiring content creators selected to participate in Dedalus, a new social game that promises to make the winner rich and famous. Locked up in an isolated arena, the contestants participate in trials that prove increasingly dangerous. What seemed like a simple game slowly turns into something completely different and the contestants, find themselves both executioners and victims of an elaborate revenge.', 'Michele, Tiziana, Nino, Antonella, Filippo and Linda are the six aspiring content creators selected to participate in Dedalus, a new social game that promises to make the winner rich and famous. Locked up in an isolated arena, the contestants participate in trials that prove increasingly dangerous. What seemed like a simple game slowly turns into something completely different and the contestants, find themselves both executioners and victims of an elaborate revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAyH3CZ9Tmeo2P7P6b1ltSXQ3g4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1231163'),
  ('693327458007186730', 'Dede Korkut Hikayeleri Salur Kazan: Zoraki Kahraman', 2017, 'History, Comedy', 'Serdar Özdemir, Burak Aksak', 'Burak Aksak', 'Mahir İpek, Devrim Yakut, Onur Atilla, Erdal Tosun, Korhan Herduran, Öznur Serçeler, Burak Çimen, Fatih Dokgöz', null, 'Will Salur be able to rescue his loved ones who have been taken captive by the bad guys? Will the captive tribe be able to defeat the bad guys? In Salur Kazan: The Reluctant Hero, the fairy tales we all know are presented to us again in a humorous and modern language.', 'Will Salur be able to rescue his loved ones who have been taken captive by the bad guys? Will the captive tribe be able to defeat the bad guys? In Salur Kazan: The Reluctant Hero, the fairy tales we all know are presented to us again in a humorous and modern language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YTxsBOKiw7ZsS028UXpsYDVCY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467853'),
  ('540850091580558426', 'Dedee', 1948, 'Drama', 'Yves Allégret, Jean Bourgoin', null, 'Bernard Blier, Simone Signoret, Marcello Pagliero, Jane Marken, Marcel Dieudonné, Marcelle Arnold, Denise Clair, Gabriel Gobin', 'NR', 'Dedee is a prostitute, working in Monsieur Rene''s night club on Antwerp''s harbour. The porter is Marco, her pimp. Dedee is not happy, until she meets Francesco, an italian sailorman. They fall in love and Dedee begins to dream about an escape of her daily dullness.', 'Dedee is a prostitute, working in Monsieur Rene''s night club on Antwerp''s harbour. The porter is Marco, her pimp. Dedee is not happy, until she meets Francesco, an italian sailorman. They fall in love and Dedee begins to dream about an escape of her daily dullness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6SpWR30bDVgJpbUfUsS3iBgLbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79376'),
  ('986474118441518489', 'Dedh Ishqiya', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Abhishek Chaubey, Satyajit Pande, Chandradeep Singh Rathore', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Abhishek Chaubey', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Madhuri Dixit, Arshad Warsi, Huma Qureshi, Vijay Raaz, Manoj Pahwa, Salman Shahid', null, 'A team of con men fall for a Begum and her female confidante. Does their love fructify?', 'A team of con men fall for a Begum and her female confidante. Does their love fructify?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6KLehJgkGUBFBS1geBOZIlPozm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248698'),
  ('654239893223115679', 'Dedication', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Justin Theroux, Stephen Kazmierski', 'David Bromberg', 'Billy Crudup, Mandy Moore, Tom Wilkinson, Dianne Wiest, Martin Freeman, Bob Balaban, Christine Taylor, Bobby Cannavale', 'R', 'A modern love story in which a misanthropic, emotionally complex author of a hit children''s book is forced to team with a beautiful illustrator after his best friend and collaborator passes away. As Henry struggles with letting go of the ghosts of love and life, he discovers that sometimes you have to take a gamble at life to find love.', 'A modern love story in which a misanthropic, emotionally complex author of a hit children''s book is forced to team with a beautiful illustrator after his best friend and collaborator passes away. As Henry struggles with letting go of the ghosts of love and life, he discovers that sometimes you have to take a gamble at life to find love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0kzH6zMTOtvEDY9LVYAQxwZx7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14118'),
  ('102494730878769164', 'Deduce, You Say', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery', 'Chuck Jones, Milt Franklyn', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', 'NR', 'Daffy Duck is a detective who is hunting for the Shropshire Slasher.', 'Daffy Duck is a detective who is hunting for the Shropshire Slasher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yz7bH8VgezjUrxkAtWckbrklfLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139723'),
  ('520301037755772740', 'DEEMO Memorial Keys', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Romance, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Hisashi Ezura, Shuhei Matsushita, Jin Aketagawa', 'Bun-O Fujisawa, Junichi Fujisaku', 'Ayana Taketatsu, Akari Nibu, Akari Kito, Ayane Sakura, Gaku Hamada, Naomi Watanabe, Issey Ogata, Kouhei Matsushita', null, 'Deemo is a lonely individual who lives in solitude, playing the piano in a castle. One day, a girl who has lost her memory falls from the sky. Wanting to help her recover her memories and return to her world, Deemo discovers that a tree kept atop the piano will grow whenever the piano is played.', 'Deemo is a lonely individual who lives in solitude, playing the piano in a castle. One day, a girl who has lost her memory falls from the sky. Wanting to help her recover her memories and return to her world, Deemo discovers that a tree kept atop the piano will grow whenever the piano is played.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myQiAsoHWmVcoHkpYqb8jI0fhGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648457'),
  ('992656171914232242', 'Deep', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Julio Soto Gurpide', 'Jose Tatay, Salvador Rubio, Julio Soto Gurpide', 'Justin Felbinger, Jess Harnell, Phil LaMarr, Dwight Schultz, Elisabeth Gray, Anna Vocino, Lindsey Alena, Beth Rollan', 'PG', 'In 2100, when humanity has abandoned the earth, a colony of extravagant creatures still thrives in the deepest abyss of the ocean.', 'In 2100, when humanity has abandoned the earth, a colony of extravagant creatures still thrives in the deepest abyss of the ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mShTMzDNfHgTgA3N81TEefL0EMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430474'),
  ('662269807852309142', 'Deep', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Sita Likitvanichkul, Apirak Samudkitpaisan, Thanabodee Uawithya', 'Wisit Sasanatieng, Sita Likitvanichkul, Apirak Samudkitpaisan', 'Panisara Rikulsurakan, Kay Lertsittichai, Supanaree Sutavijitvong, Krit Jeerapattananuwong, Warisara Jitpreedasakul, Wongsakorn Rassamitat, Dujdao Vadhanapakorn, Bhumibhat Thavornsiri', null, 'Four insomniac med school students are lured into a neuroscience experiment that spirals out of control and must find a way out before it’s too late.', 'Four insomniac med school students are lured into a neuroscience experiment that spirals out of control and must find a way out before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhbJCqSUmhFJJYo27DP44kdN6Fb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842171'),
  ('670749080778196357', 'Deep Blood', 1990, 'Horror', 'Raffaele Donato, Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato', 'George Nelson Ott', 'Frank Baroni, Allen Cort, Keith Kelsch, James Camp, Tody Bernard, John K. Brune, Margareth Hanks, Van Jensens', null, 'Several young men have to stop an ancient native American evil in the form of a killer shark which is attacking a small beach community.', 'Several young men have to stop an ancient native American evil in the form of a killer shark which is attacking a small beach community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdgws8nCfwsRrkhdQf9q6XY2lQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171993'),
  ('724410821517206824', 'Deep Blue', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Andy Byatt, Alastair Fothergill, Peter Scoones', 'David Attenborough', 'Michael Gambon, David Attenborough, Pierce Brosnan, Frank Glaubrecht, Jacques Perrin, Dalik Wollinitz', null, 'Deep Blue is a major documentary feature film shot by the BBC Natural History Unit. An epic cinematic rollercoaster ride for all ages, Deep Blue uses amazing footage to tell us the story of our oceans and the life they support.', 'Deep Blue is a major documentary feature film shot by the BBC Natural History Unit. An epic cinematic rollercoaster ride for all ages, Deep Blue uses amazing footage to tell us the story of our oceans and the life they support.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzKirFeKspU0PktaX5BfdhSofcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11019'),
  ('777194722699196081', 'Deep Blue Sea', 1999, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Renny Harlin, Stephen F. Windon, Pete Romano', 'Wayne Powers', 'Saffron Burrows, Thomas Jane, LL Cool J, Samuel L. Jackson, Jacqueline McKenzie, Michael Rapaport, Stellan Skarsgård, Aida Turturro', 'R', 'Researchers on the undersea lab Aquatica have genetically altered the brains of captive sharks to develop a cure for Alzheimer''s disease. But there''s an unexpected side effect: the sharks got smarter, faster, and more dangerous. After a big storm damages their remote research facility, they must fight for their lives.', 'Researchers on the undersea lab Aquatica have genetically altered the brains of captive sharks to develop a cure for Alzheimer''s disease. But there''s an unexpected side effect: the sharks got smarter, faster, and more dangerous. After a big storm damages their remote research facility, they must fight for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyn0zyCI4kIlbDoHH0Hzv09hDC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8914'),
  ('771846950990028126', 'Deep Blue Sea 2', 2018, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Darin Scott, Thomas L. Callaway, Andre Weavind', null, 'Danielle Savre, Rob Mayes, Michael Beach, Nathan Lynn, Kim Syster, Jeremy Jess Boado, Adrian Collins, Cameron Robertson', 'R', 'When shark conservationist Dr. Misty Calhoun is invited to consult on a top-secret project run by pharmaceutical billionaire Carl Durant, she is shocked to learn that the company is using unpredictable and highly aggressive bull sharks as its test subjects, which soon break loose and cause havoc.', 'When shark conservationist Dr. Misty Calhoun is invited to consult on a top-secret project run by pharmaceutical billionaire Carl Durant, she is shocked to learn that the company is using unpredictable and highly aggressive bull sharks as its test subjects, which soon break loose and cause havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqjAHXMJLORx9vVsCTJ6ZPJcr3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492336'),
  ('1104339143540950201', 'Deep Blue Sea 3', 2020, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bianca Vandewalle, Tony McLeod, John Pogue', 'Dirk Blackman', 'Tania Raymonde, Nathaniel Buzolic, Emerson Brooks, Bren Foster, Reina Aoi, Alexander Bhat, Siya Mayola, Avumile Qongqo', 'R', 'Dr. Emma Collins and her team are spending their third summer on the island of Little Happy studying the effect of climate change on the great white sharks who come to the nearby nursery every year to give birth. Along with the last two inhabitants of this former fishing village, their peaceful life is disrupted when a "scientific" team led by her ex-boyfriend and marine biologist Richard show up looking for three bull sharks who we soon learn aren''t just any bull sharks.', 'Dr. Emma Collins and her team are spending their third summer on the island of Little Happy studying the effect of climate change on the great white sharks who come to the nearby nursery every year to give birth. Along with the last two inhabitants of this former fishing village, their peaceful life is disrupted when a "scientific" team led by her ex-boyfriend and marine biologist Richard show up looking for three bull sharks who we soon learn aren''t just any bull sharks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKthjUmxjHjvJK8FktFfQdmwP12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:703745'),
  ('1020756908316079671', 'Deep Breath', 2001, 'Drama', 'Damien Odoul, Pascale Granel', 'Damien Odoul', 'Pierre-Louis Bonnetblanc, Dominique Chevalier, Maxime Dalbrut, Jean-Claude Lecante, Jean Milord, Stéphane Terpereau, Thierry Benoiton, Pierre Lasvaud', null, 'David is a troubled city boy, being looked after by his uncle on a farm. He is initiated into the drunken partying of the village and stumbles off drunk to find his friend Matthieu and cell-playing girlfriend in the forest. There he finds a brutal and horrifying outlet that will change his life forever...', 'David is a troubled city boy, being looked after by his uncle on a farm. He is initiated into the drunken partying of the village and stumbles off drunk to find his friend Matthieu and cell-playing girlfriend in the forest. There he finds a brutal and horrifying outlet that will change his life forever...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVxQdbRMHKpWrO8v0lAe08JSTPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27142'),
  ('1007083510448040037', 'Deep Cover', 1992, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Bill Duke, Warren R. Turner, Willie E. Simmons, Jr.', 'Henry Bean, Michael Tolkin', 'Laurence Fishburne, Jeff Goldblum, Victoria Dillard, Gregory Sierra, Clarence Williams III, René Assa, Alex Colon, Roger Guenveur Smith', 'R', 'Black police officer Russell Stevens applies for a special anti-drug squad which targets the highest boss of cocaine delivery to LA—the Colombian foreign minister''s nephew. Russell works his way up from the bottom undercover, until he reaches the boss.', 'Black police officer Russell Stevens applies for a special anti-drug squad which targets the highest boss of cocaine delivery to LA—the Colombian foreign minister''s nephew. Russell works his way up from the bottom undercover, until he reaches the boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVLNUxxT2BHeBsNKET0tfnUUmwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20676'),
  ('464123503021126096', 'Deep Cover', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Tom Kingsley, Will Hanke, Richard Selway', 'Alexander Owen, Ben Ashenden, Derek Connolly', 'Bryce Dallas Howard, Orlando Bloom, Nick Mohammed, Paddy Considine, Sonoya Mizuno, Ian McShane, Sean Bean, Freya Parker', 'R', 'Kat is an improv comedy teacher beginning to question if she’s missed her shot at success. When an undercover cop offers her the role of a lifetime, she recruits two of her students to infiltrate London’s gangland by impersonating dangerous criminals.', 'Kat is an improv comedy teacher beginning to question if she’s missed her shot at success. When an undercover cop offers her the role of a lifetime, she recruits two of her students to infiltrate London’s gangland by impersonating dangerous criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYfaChljpg6eo9ZlFyTmI81PMZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1239193'),
  ('524381562275650974', 'Deep Crimson', 1996, 'Crime, Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein, Guillermo Granillo, Ivan Avila', 'Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Regina Orozco, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Marisa Paredes, Julieta Egurrola, Sherlyn, Giovani Florido, Fernando Palavicini, Alexandra Vicencio', null, 'Driven by desire and desperate for self-love, Coral and Nicolás will abandon their past lives in a journey surrounded by murder.', 'Driven by desire and desperate for self-love, Coral and Nicolás will abandon their past lives in a journey surrounded by murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxfwz8uObOEUyd5ECMAGl9aFYUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47007'),
