  ('812276345285558296', 'Deep End', 1971, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Wolfgang Glattes, Charly Steinberger', 'Bolesław Sulik, Jerzy Skolimowski, Jerzy Gruza', 'Jane Asher, John Moulder-Brown, Karl Michael Vogler, Christopher Sandford, Diana Dors, Louise Martini, Erica Beer, Anita Lochner', 'R', 'London, England. Mike, a fifteen-year-old boy, gets a job in a bathhouse, where he meets Susan, an attractive young woman who works there as an attendant.', 'London, England. Mike, a fifteen-year-old boy, gets a job in a bathhouse, where he meets Susan, an attractive young woman who works there as an attendant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pZxUJTgjerjxuifSU13B8pXAJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59408'),
  ('809475118468571935', 'Deep Evil', 2004, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Pat Williams, David Pelletier', 'Kevin Gendreau, Keith Shaw', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Ona Grauer, Adam J. Harrington, Jim Thorburn, Will Sanderson, Rachel Hayward, Heather Feeney, Leah Cairns', null, 'An alien microbe lands in remote Siberia in the 1950''s. In the year 2004, US scientist working at a top secret underground lab in Alaska clone the microbe. A garbled distress signal is heard from the lab just before a complete lock down of the facility. This is the last word sent out from the scientists. A team of scientists and military personnel are in charge of finding out what went wrong.', 'An alien microbe lands in remote Siberia in the 1950''s. In the year 2004, US scientist working at a top secret underground lab in Alaska clone the microbe. A garbled distress signal is heard from the lab just before a complete lock down of the facility. This is the last word sent out from the scientists. A team of scientists and military personnel are in charge of finding out what went wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDH1nMECHW2OAHHRvriy6jzdNb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19010'),
  ('382703672094372105', 'Deep Fear', 2022, 'Horror', 'Grégory Beghin', 'Nicolas Tackian', 'Sofia Lesaffre, Victor Meutelet, Joseph Olivennes, Kassim Meesters, Philippe Résimont, Olivier Bony, Blaise Afonso, Léone François-Janssens', null, 'Three students celebrate their graduation with a visit of the Paris catacombs. When they discover a bunker, little do they know it''s not the only thing that Nazi have left behind...', 'Three students celebrate their graduation with a visit of the Paris catacombs. When they discover a bunker, little do they know it''s not the only thing that Nazi have left behind...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSTVDy2Pt5dtQrWC9BcaZZKWV0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933415'),
  ('651608297908494134', 'Deep Fear', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Action, Mystery', 'Marcus Adams', 'Sophia Eptamenitis, Robert Capelli Jr.', 'Mădălina Ghenea, Ed Westwick, Macarena Gómez, Stany Coppet, Ibrahima Gueye, David Leguesse, Mariana Garradas, Marco Canadea', null, 'A solo trip aboard a yacht takes a terrifying turn when a woman encounters three drug traffickers clinging to the shattered remains of a boat. They soon force her to dive into shark-infested waters to retrieve kilos of cocaine from the sunken wreck.', 'A solo trip aboard a yacht takes a terrifying turn when a woman encounters three drug traffickers clinging to the shattered remains of a boat. They soon force her to dive into shark-infested waters to retrieve kilos of cocaine from the sunken wreck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ms1omYCnhnO3eDOI88tfiy6SaoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899445'),
  ('1053593686672625721', 'Deep Impact', 1998, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Dietrich Lohmann, Mimi Leder, Lisa M. Rowe', 'Bruce Joel Rubin, Michael Tolkin', 'Robert Duvall, Téa Leoni, Elijah Wood, Vanessa Redgrave, Morgan Freeman, Maximilian Schell, James Cromwell, Ron Eldard', 'PG-13', 'A seven-mile-wide space rock is hurtling toward Earth, threatening to obliterate the planet. Now, it''s up to the president of the United States to save the world. He appoints a tough-as-nails veteran astronaut to lead a joint American-Russian crew into space to destroy the comet before impact. Meanwhile, an enterprising reporter uses her smarts to uncover the scoop of the century.', 'A seven-mile-wide space rock is hurtling toward Earth, threatening to obliterate the planet. Now, it''s up to the president of the United States to save the world. He appoints a tough-as-nails veteran astronaut to lead a joint American-Russian crew into space to destroy the comet before impact. Meanwhile, an enterprising reporter uses her smarts to uncover the scoop of the century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3vQS7JKqlOb3MdVJHuTCP9s7Mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8656'),
  ('802373559761787883', 'Deep in My Heart', 1954, 'Music, Comedy', 'Stanley Donen, Robert Vreeland, George J. Folsey', 'Leonard Spigelgass', 'José Ferrer, Merle Oberon, Helen Traubel, Doe Avedon, Walter Pidgeon, Paul Henreid, Tamara Toumanova, Paul Stewart', 'NR', 'Biographic movie about the American composer Sigmund Romberg.', 'Biographic movie about the American composer Sigmund Romberg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5f8JcfqnDkeCCrRVz7LlrUuNOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43196'),
  ('1101282644022783287', 'Deep in the Darkness', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adrian Peng Correia, Claudio Rietti, Colin Theys', 'John Doolan', 'Dean Stockwell, Sean Patrick Thomas, Dina Cataldi, Kristen Bush, Marty Gargle', 'NR', 'Dr. Michael Cayle thought leaving the chaotic lifestyle of New York City behind for the quiet, small town of Ashborough would bring his family closer together. Soon after arriving, however, he discovers the town''s deepest secret: a terrifying and controlling race of creatures that live amongst the darkness in the woods behind his home.', 'Dr. Michael Cayle thought leaving the chaotic lifestyle of New York City behind for the quiet, small town of Ashborough would bring his family closer together. Soon after arriving, however, he discovers the town''s deepest secret: a terrifying and controlling race of creatures that live amongst the darkness in the woods behind his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igJo6txL8k83Y203mJZGkIOD1PU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271665'),
  ('971271505176458803', 'Deep in the Heart', 2015, 'Drama', 'He Shan, Xin Yukun', 'Xin Yukun', 'Huo Weimin, Wang Xiaotian, Luo Yun, Yang Yuzen, Sun Li, Jin Zi', null, 'An unrecognizable, charred corpse discovered in a remote mountain village in China connects three local stories.', 'An unrecognizable, charred corpse discovered in a remote mountain village in China connects three local stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7Eb5korUAji3X4eiN6ybE1r9yn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292362'),
  ('814552437645790906', 'Deep in the Valley', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Christian Forte, Alex Vendler, Kimberly Stuckwisch', 'Christian Forte', 'Chris Pratt, Brendan Hines, Scott Caan, Rachel Specter, Denise Richards, Kate Albrecht, Christopher McDonald, Blanca Soto', 'R', 'Best friends, Carl and Lester, find themselves magically transported into an alternate universe straight out of a real-life adult movie. Hilarity ensues as they embark upon a journey of adult-themed mayhem while Carl ultimately finds true love in the most unlikely of places.', 'Best friends, Carl and Lester, find themselves magically transported into an alternate universe straight out of a real-life adult movie. Hilarity ensues as they embark upon a journey of adult-themed mayhem while Carl ultimately finds true love in the most unlikely of places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obMNcO8izVF6Zv7crsmwvsDeyK9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21862'),
  ('274409162516462520', 'Deep In The Wood', 2015, 'Thriller', 'Stefano Lodovichi, Benjamin Maier, Alessandro Tonda', 'Isabella Aguilar, Stefano Lodovichi, Davide Orsini', 'Camilla Filippi, Filippo Nigro, Giovanni Vettorazzo, Maria Vittoria Barrella, Teo Achille Caprio, Stefano Detassis, Roberto Gudese, Luca Filippi', null, 'When young Tommi goes missing during a festival in the Dolomites in 2010, his parents are devastated. Five years later, a boy is found with no name or records; DNA tests prove it is Tommi. But while Tommi''s father Manuel welcomes him back with open arms, his mother Linda is not convinced that it is her son. Suspicion and superstition permeate the pores of this eerie mystery thriller.', 'When young Tommi goes missing during a festival in the Dolomites in 2010, his parents are devastated. Five years later, a boy is found with no name or records; DNA tests prove it is Tommi. But while Tommi''s father Manuel welcomes him back with open arms, his mother Linda is not convinced that it is her son. Suspicion and superstition permeate the pores of this eerie mystery thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bDcMSOgKm69KOGOPASf2rfTEmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369233'),
  ('60604345405269404', 'Deep in the Woods', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Denis Rouden, Lionel Delplanque', 'Annabelle Perrichon', 'François Berléand, Denis Lavant, Clotilde Courau, Clément Sibony, Vincent Lecœur, Marie Trintignant, Maud Buquet, Alexia Stresi', 'R', 'A group of artists, composed of the young actors Wilfried and Matthieu and the actresses Sophie, Mathilde and the dumb Jeanne, is hired by a millionaire, Axel de Fersen, to present a performance of Little Red Riding Hood in his isolated castle to celebrate the birthday of his grandson. Meanwhile, the police advises that a serial killer is raping and killing young women in the woods around that area. During the night, the group feels trapped and threatened in the castle, guessing who is and where might be the killer.', 'A group of artists, composed of the young actors Wilfried and Matthieu and the actresses Sophie, Mathilde and the dumb Jeanne, is hired by a millionaire, Axel de Fersen, to present a performance of Little Red Riding Hood in his isolated castle to celebrate the birthday of his grandson. Meanwhile, the police advises that a serial killer is raping and killing young women in the woods around that area. During the night, the group feels trapped and threatened in the castle, guessing who is and where might be the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iF03JebY67u0RPz8J5zMXUboew5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11303'),
  ('472181184637447160', 'Deep in the Woods', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Benoît Jacquot, Julien Hirsch', 'Benoît Jacquot, Julien Boivent', 'Isild Le Besco, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Jérôme Kircher, Bernard Rouquette, Mathieu Simonet, Jean-Pierre Gos, Luc Palun, Jean-Claude Bolle-Reddat', null, 'A wanderer named Timothee arrives in a French village in 1865 pretending to be deaf and mute. He uses tricks to hypnotize a beautiful young woman named Josephine and takes advantage of her until he is arrested and tried for his crimes.', 'A wanderer named Timothee arrives in a French village in 1865 pretending to be deaf and mute. He uses tricks to hypnotize a beautiful young woman named Josephine and takes advantage of her until he is arrested and tried for his crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aH8sQUoIX1Pt3A9vLw0tCuFdppo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72355'),
  ('1044911397872942943', 'Deep Red', 1994, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Craig R. Baxley, João Fernandes, Kristi Tyminski', 'D. Brent Mote', 'Michael Biehn, Joanna Pacula, John de Lancie, Steven Williams, Tobin Bell, Lisa Collins, Michael Des Barres, Lindsey Haun', null, 'After a young girl is accidently infected with an alien substance known as "Deep Red", the astonishing results attract the attention of the illustrious scientist Dr. Newmeyer. Disillusioned security expert Joe Keyes must team up with his estranged wife to protect the girl and her mother from the obsessed scientist who will stop at nothing to get what he wants.', 'After a young girl is accidently infected with an alien substance known as "Deep Red", the astonishing results attract the attention of the illustrious scientist Dr. Newmeyer. Disillusioned security expert Joe Keyes must team up with his estranged wife to protect the girl and her mother from the obsessed scientist who will stop at nothing to get what he wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Dvq3IdLpYvv4yNkQTc2qJ02kHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58815'),
  ('676259277695471235', 'Deep Rising', 1998, 'Adventure, Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Stephen Sommers, Howard Atherton, Henry M. Lebo', 'Stephen Sommers', 'Treat Williams, Famke Janssen, Anthony Heald, Kevin J. O''Connor, Wes Studi, Derrick O''Connor, Jason Flemyng, Cliff Curtis', 'R', 'A group of heavily armed hijackers board a luxury ocean liner in the South Pacific Ocean to loot it, only to do battle with a series of large-sized, tentacled, man-eating sea creatures who have taken over the ship first.', 'A group of heavily armed hijackers board a luxury ocean liner in the South Pacific Ocean to loot it, only to do battle with a series of large-sized, tentacled, man-eating sea creatures who have taken over the ship first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1nOnrAlG3EbOvzgZt2ya11OmjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9457'),
  ('59008539787604194', 'Deep Sea', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Cheng Mazhiyuan, Tian Xiaopeng', 'Tian Xiaopeng', 'Wang Tingwen, Su Xin, Kuixing Teng, Yang Ting, Jing Ji, Guo Haoran, Tian Xiaopeng, Fang Taochen', 'PG-13', 'Shenxiu has felt a deep sadness since her mother left. A storm plunges her into a dreamlike world of swirling colour. Led by the Hyjinx, and joined by inventive underwater chef Nanhe, she embarks on a quest to find solace in the Eye of the Deep Sea.', 'Shenxiu has felt a deep sadness since her mother left. A storm plunges her into a dreamlike world of swirling colour. Led by the Hyjinx, and joined by inventive underwater chef Nanhe, she embarks on a quest to find solace in the Eye of the Deep Sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znSKKjTpwnFmlieJtnlLoI6McKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667717'),
  ('1095926368132027664', 'Deep Sea 3D', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Howard Hall, Howard Hall', null, 'Kate Winslet, Johnny Depp', 'G', 'Sea life in a whole new way. Deep Sea 3D, an underwater adventure from the filmmakers behind the successful IMAX® 3D film Into the Deep, transports audiences deep below the ocean surface. Through the magic of IMAX®; and IMAX 3D, moviegoers will swim with some of the planets most unique, dangerous and colorful creatures, and understand this inspiring underworld.', 'Sea life in a whole new way. Deep Sea 3D, an underwater adventure from the filmmakers behind the successful IMAX® 3D film Into the Deep, transports audiences deep below the ocean surface. Through the magic of IMAX®; and IMAX 3D, moviegoers will swim with some of the planets most unique, dangerous and colorful creatures, and understand this inspiring underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oFxUTFKWQTkZhO7CgABu5p1Wgy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17700'),
  ('821096831426458174', 'Deep Sea Monster Raiga', 2009, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Shinpei Hayashiya', 'Shinpei Hayashiya', 'Yukijiro Hotaru, Miyu Oriyama, Mao Urata, Manami Enosawa, Hanji Yanagiya, Tokimatsu Sanyutei, Makoto Inamiya, Mizuho Yoshida', null, 'When the Earth''s ecosystem is disrupted due to global warming, a plethora of prehistoric sea monsters wage war on Japan. Led by the powerful Raiga, the monsters ravage the city of Asakusa.', 'When the Earth''s ecosystem is disrupted due to global warming, a plethora of prehistoric sea monsters wage war on Japan. Led by the powerful Raiga, the monsters ravage the city of Asakusa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsRUZmfDEb6V40K3tnMUREjJIFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488412'),
  ('486450619241192046', 'Deep Sea Mutant Snake', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Thriller, Horror', 'Wu Yang', 'Wu Yang', 'Zhao Yixin, Jacinda Li, Qiu Shijian, Jiang Yanxi, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Lopsang', null, 'After his fiancé sudden death, Qin Yu is convinced Cass Corporation is somehow involved and is determined to find the truth. Booking passage on the same cruise ship as former Cass employee, Jason, Qin Yu follows him. Qin Yu hopes to secure the information he needs on Cass to be able to testify against them in court. But Qin Yu isn’t the only person on board hoping to gain intel on Cass. Desperate for a story, reporter Feng Li tails both Qin Yu and Jason, booking passage on the same cruise. Unfortunately, no one has much of a chance to gain information as the ship is suddenly attacked by giant mutant snakes. Escaping the attack, the survivors find themselves on the very island Cass Corporation has been conducting their illegal experiments. Hunted by monsters of all sorts, will any of the survivors find a way to bring Cass down and make it off the island alive?', 'After his fiancé sudden death, Qin Yu is convinced Cass Corporation is somehow involved and is determined to find the truth. Booking passage on the same cruise ship as former Cass employee, Jason, Qin Yu follows him. Qin Yu hopes to secure the information he needs on Cass to be able to testify against them in court. But Qin Yu isn’t the only person on board hoping to gain intel on Cass. Desperate for a story, reporter Feng Li tails both Qin Yu and Jason, booking passage on the same cruise. Unfortunately, no one has much of a chance to gain information as the ship is suddenly attacked by giant mutant snakes. Escaping the attack, the survivors find themselves on the very island Cass Corporation has been conducting their illegal experiments. Hunted by monsters of all sorts, will any of the survivors find a way to bring Cass down and make it off the island alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pc5cPGTCi37DsC2y5wqM2t8vu10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017794'),
  ('284011380805295897', 'Deep Sea Python', 2023, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Wang Qing, Li Zhi', 'Zhang Lin', 'Wang Zhao, Wang Yabin, Ma Qianqian, Fang Ziyi, Zhou Qinlin, Li Peize, Jiang Junnan, Xu Jinzhou', null, 'Fisherman Chen Yue is hired to sail a group of people, including photographer Zhong Ming, to a party on an ocean island. Upon arrival, the island is attacked by a massive deep-sea python, killing anyone it finds. Chen Yue and Zhong Ming must work together to lead the survivors out of danger in a fight for survival.', 'Fisherman Chen Yue is hired to sail a group of people, including photographer Zhong Ming, to a party on an ocean island. Upon arrival, the island is attacked by a massive deep-sea python, killing anyone it finds. Chen Yue and Zhong Ming must work together to lead the survivors out of danger in a fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9deAmNHD1MwAJ8IXvqr2Y3B21Di.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081713'),
  ('298181464776388273', 'Deep Shock', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Phillip J. Roth, Todd Barron, Todor Chapkanov', 'Phillip J. Roth, Jeff Rank', 'David Keith, Simmone Mackinnon, Mark Sheppard, Sean Whalen, Robert Zachar, Richard Gnolfo, Todd Kimsey, Tyrone Pinkham', null, 'When an unknown underwater object disables an American nuclear-powered submarine and attacks a submerged Arctic research complex, a scientific expedition flies to the North Pole to investigate these incidents as well as the sudden, inexplicable rise in temperature that threatens to melt the ice cap and flood the surface of the world.', 'When an unknown underwater object disables an American nuclear-powered submarine and attacks a submerged Arctic research complex, a scientific expedition flies to the North Pole to investigate these incidents as well as the sudden, inexplicable rise in temperature that threatens to melt the ice cap and flood the surface of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oY3jCsYul7eLO07RmLiweXqzK3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58816'),
  ('1069129504561685562', 'Deep Space', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Fred Olen Ray, Gary Graver, Steve Patino', 'T.L. Lankford, Fred Olen Ray', 'Charles Napier, Ann Turkel, Bo Svenson, Ron Glass, Julie Newmar, James Booth, Norman Burton, Jesse Dabson', null, 'Secretly engineered and blasted into space by government scientists, a vile monster crash-lands back on Earth and begins killing everyone it encounters. As the death toll rises, veteran cop McLemore bravely steps forward to crush the scary creature.', 'Secretly engineered and blasted into space by government scientists, a vile monster crash-lands back on Earth and begins killing everyone it encounters. As the death toll rises, veteran cop McLemore bravely steps forward to crush the scary creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2dqszB02pXb83zAp35FNXblgKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27662'),
  ('356472380567468638', 'Deep Throat in Tokyo', 1975, 'Drama, Horror', 'Kan Mukai, Shizuo Hanazawa, Hideki Fukamachi', 'Tatsuhiko Kamoi, Yutaka Kohira', 'Kumi Taguchi, Akiko Mori, Yuriko Azuma, Mariko Shikô, Yûko Akane, Yasuko Matsui, Tatsuya Nanjo, Hirohisa Nakata', null, 'Kumi Taguchi is a model who leaves her boxer boyfriend after he sustains an injury. She meets and quickly marries Hideo, the heir to a corporate empire. Hideo''s father, Takehiko, lusts after Kumi. Takehiko sends his son away, ostensibly on a business trip, but actually so that he can be murdered by Takehiko''s henchmen. Takehiko seduces Kumi, but is frustrated when she refuses to perform oral sex on him. Angered, Takehiko forces Kumi to undergo surgery in which her clitoris is transferred to her throat, thereby requiring that she engage in oral sex in order to have an orgasm. Hideo, the supposedly murdered son, returns having paid off his assassins. Hideo shoots and kills his father, but Kumi grabs the gun and kills Hideo so that she can inherit the family''s fortune', 'Kumi Taguchi is a model who leaves her boxer boyfriend after he sustains an injury. She meets and quickly marries Hideo, the heir to a corporate empire. Hideo''s father, Takehiko, lusts after Kumi. Takehiko sends his son away, ostensibly on a business trip, but actually so that he can be murdered by Takehiko''s henchmen. Takehiko seduces Kumi, but is frustrated when she refuses to perform oral sex on him. Angered, Takehiko forces Kumi to undergo surgery in which her clitoris is transferred to her throat, thereby requiring that she engage in oral sex in order to have an orgasm. Hideo, the supposedly murdered son, returns having paid off his assassins. Hideo shoots and kills his father, but Kumi grabs the gun and kills Hideo so that she can inherit the family''s fortune', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYoA2HT3LvFxANCQCCtDenQW7sJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143477'),
  ('638738944409687890', 'Deep Trap', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Horror', 'Kwon Hyung-jin, Shin Tae-seob, Ha Gyeong-ho', 'Han Soo-Bong, Kwon Hyung-jin', 'Don Lee, Kim Min-kyung, Jo Han-sun, Ji an', null, 'A man invites a young couple to vacation on a remote island to help reignite their faltering relationship. He initially seems to be a good host but the couple starts to suspect that his true intentions are much more sinister.', 'A man invites a young couple to vacation on a remote island to help reignite their faltering relationship. He initially seems to be a good host but the couple starts to suspect that his true intentions are much more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kmLrAWu0qgBRoNviC52DKEkHcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361539'),
  ('401093517181843192', 'Deep Valley', 1947, 'Drama, Romance, Crime, Thriller', 'Ted D. McCord, Jean Negulesco, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Stephen Morehouse Avery, Salka Viertel', 'Ida Lupino, Dane Clark, Wayne Morris, Fay Bainter, Henry Hull, Willard Robertson, John Alvin, Leonard Bremen', 'NR', 'A shy California farm girl falls head-over-heels in love with Barry Burnett, a fugitive from a chain gang building a road through the wilderness.', 'A shy California farm girl falls head-over-heels in love with Barry Burnett, a fugitive from a chain gang building a road through the wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFEPpg7Q69Wtogjlr96Qdw49ay3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64319'),
  ('11247671004602464', 'Deep Water', 1981, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Michel Deville, Valérie Othnin-Girard, Rosalinde Deville', 'Michel Deville, Florence Delay, Christopher Frank', 'Isabelle Huppert, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Christian Benedetti, Bertrand Bonvoisin, Philippe Clévenot, Martine Costes, Evelyne Didi, Jean-Michel Dupuis', null, 'On the island of Jersey, off the French coast, Mélanie, a beautiful woman gifted with a captivating personality, enjoys having unimportant love affairs that her husband Victor, a perfumer older than her, seems to endure with total indifference.', 'On the island of Jersey, off the French coast, Mélanie, a beautiful woman gifted with a captivating personality, enjoys having unimportant love affairs that her husband Victor, a perfumer older than her, seems to endure with total indifference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDGmUshiPrQw7VyQobLVeQjdsO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77146'),
  ('304146288696359333', 'Deep Water', 2006, 'Documentary, Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Louise Osmond, Jerry Rothwell, Nina Kellgren', null, 'Tilda Swinton, Simon Russell Beale, Jean Badin, Donald Crowhurst, Clare Crowhurst, Simon Crowhurst, Santiago Franchessie, Ted Hynds', null, 'DEEP WATER is the stunning true story of the fateful voyage of Donald Crowhurst, an amateur yachtsman who enters the most daring nautical challenge ever – the very first solo, non-stop, round-the-world boat race.', 'DEEP WATER is the stunning true story of the fateful voyage of Donald Crowhurst, an amateur yachtsman who enters the most daring nautical challenge ever – the very first solo, non-stop, round-the-world boat race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcHJ3R1gasJh927n0bRKFwBDHRo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15030'),
  ('376458946604095803', 'Deep Water', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Eigil Bryld, Dan Bradley, Adrian Lyne', 'Sam Levinson, Zach Helm', 'Ben Affleck, Ana de Armas, Tracy Letts, Lil Rel Howery, Dash Mihok, Finn Wittrock, Kristen Connolly, Jacob Elordi', 'R', 'A well-to-do husband who allows his wife to have affairs in order to avoid a divorce becomes a prime suspect in the disappearance of her lovers.', 'A well-to-do husband who allows his wife to have affairs in order to avoid a divorce becomes a prime suspect in the disappearance of her lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yRMyWwjuhKg6IU66uiZIGhaSc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619979'),
  ('483168353830597671', 'Deep Web', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Alex Winter, Joe DeSalvo', 'Alex Winter', 'Keanu Reeves, Ross Ulbricht, Cody Wilson, Lyn Ulbricht, Kirk Ulbricht, Andy Greenberg, Nicolas Christin, Christopher Soghoian', 'NR', 'Deep Web gives the inside story of one of the most important and riveting digital crime sagas of the century -- the arrest of Ross William Ulbricht, the 30-year-old entrepreneur convicted of being ''Dread Pirate Roberts,'' creator and operator of online black market Silk Road. As the only film with exclusive access to the Ulbricht family, Deep Web explores how the brightest minds and thought leaders behind the Deep Web and Bitcoin are now caught in the crosshairs of the battle for control of a future inextricably linked to technology, with our digital rights hanging in the balance.', 'Deep Web gives the inside story of one of the most important and riveting digital crime sagas of the century -- the arrest of Ross William Ulbricht, the 30-year-old entrepreneur convicted of being ''Dread Pirate Roberts,'' creator and operator of online black market Silk Road. As the only film with exclusive access to the Ulbricht family, Deep Web explores how the brightest minds and thought leaders behind the Deep Web and Bitcoin are now caught in the crosshairs of the battle for control of a future inextricably linked to technology, with our digital rights hanging in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sk6KzLhpWizGBrEt04qyzUqmSkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321769'),
  ('901565217036102034', 'Deepfaking Sam Altman', 2026, 'Documentary, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Adam Bhala Lough', 'Elizabeth Weil, Steven Leckart', 'Rainn Wilson, Kara Swisher, Michael Ian Black, Divyendra Singh Jadoun, Christian Vasquez', null, 'Director Adam Bhala Lough sets out to better understand the technology and people at the center of the AI boom. His quest sends him on a path towards the father of AI, OpenAI CEO, Sam Altman. When he isn’t able to sit down with Altman himself, Adam travels to India to create an AI version of him to interview instead.', 'Director Adam Bhala Lough sets out to better understand the technology and people at the center of the AI boom. His quest sends him on a path towards the father of AI, OpenAI CEO, Sam Altman. When he isn’t able to sit down with Altman himself, Adam travels to India to create an AI version of him to interview instead.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Ff%2Fgracenote%2Ff36143392e888116c42393e946c59c70.jpg', 'plex:movie:deepfaking-sam-altman-2026'),
  ('98184783975676029', 'Deeply', 2000, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Sheri Elwood, Sebastian Edschmid', 'Sheri Elwood', 'Kirsten Dunst, Lynn Redgrave, Julia Brendler, Trent Ford, Brent Carver, Alberta Watson, Daniel Brühl, Peter Donaldson', null, 'On Ironbound Island, native Fiona McKay arrives from Europe with her teenage daughter Clair, hoping that the peace of the island will help the girl get over the death of her boyfriend. The girl finds comfort in the company of a visiting American girl and more so in the stories of Celia, a crazy old local who weaves enchanting tales which cleverly combine her own experiences on the island with mystifying legends.', 'On Ironbound Island, native Fiona McKay arrives from Europe with her teenage daughter Clair, hoping that the peace of the island will help the girl get over the death of her boyfriend. The girl finds comfort in the company of a visiting American girl and more so in the stories of Celia, a crazy old local who weaves enchanting tales which cleverly combine her own experiences on the island with mystifying legends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zOT6T6Gqm3IcTLkblw06cABCu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41185'),
  ('739931394280685163', 'Deepsea Challenge 3D', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Andrew Wight, Raymond Quint, John Bruno', 'John Garvin, Andrew Wight', 'James Cameron, Suzy Amis, Frank Lotito, Lachlan Woods, Paul Henri', 'PG', 'Described as being a film about determination, danger and the ocean’s greatest depths, James Cameron''s "Deepsea Challenge 3D" tells the story of Cameron’s journey to fulfill his boyhood dream of becoming an explorer. The movie offers a unique insight into Cameron''s world as he makes that dream reality – and makes history – by becoming the first person to travel solo to the deepest point on the planet.', 'Described as being a film about determination, danger and the ocean’s greatest depths, James Cameron''s "Deepsea Challenge 3D" tells the story of Cameron’s journey to fulfill his boyhood dream of becoming an explorer. The movie offers a unique insight into Cameron''s world as he makes that dream reality – and makes history – by becoming the first person to travel solo to the deepest point on the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uX0mbL2qtZ6b04s8leGjealE9fS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276909'),
  ('296847021981799532', 'DeepStar Six', 1989, 'Action, Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Sean S. Cunningham, Mac Ahlberg, Chris Walas', 'Lewis Abernathy, Geof Miller', 'Taurean Blacque, Nancy Everhard, Greg Evigan, Miguel Ferrer, Nia Peeples, Matt McCoy, Cindy Pickett, Marius Weyers', 'R', 'The crew of an experimental underwater nuclear base are forced to struggle for their lives when their explorations disturb a creature who threatens to destroy their base.', 'The crew of an experimental underwater nuclear base are forced to struggle for their lives when their explorations disturb a creature who threatens to destroy their base.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueQQx7fyPjN643EwKIMHNF8A1Cw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11607'),
  ('538911437258785747', 'Deepwater', 2005, 'Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Scott Kevan, David S. Marfield', null, 'Lucas Black, Peter Coyote, Mía Maestro, Lesley Ann Warren, Xander Berkeley, Michael Ironside, Kristen Bell, Jason Cerbone', null, 'A drifter comes to the town of Deepwater and is seduced into a twisted game of deceit and murder.', 'A drifter comes to the town of Deepwater and is seduced into a twisted game of deceit and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVBVqC9pzgeQw6VBDwENivv77bn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9915'),
  ('1140288640752924378', 'Deepwater Horizon', 2016, 'Drama, Action', 'Peter Berg, Marc Fisichella, Enrique Chediak', 'J.C. Chandor', 'Mark Wahlberg, Kurt Russell, John Malkovich, Gina Rodriguez, Dylan O''Brien, Kate Hudson, J.D. Evermore, Ethan Suplee', 'PG-13', 'A story set on the offshore drilling rig Deepwater Horizon, which exploded during April 2010 and created the worst oil spill in U.S. history.', 'A story set on the offshore drilling rig Deepwater Horizon, which exploded during April 2010 and created the worst oil spill in U.S. history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgBIYCZACe3iaS9TL2XzVGkO5p5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296524'),
  ('211683502836505187', 'Deerskin', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Quentin Dupieux, Quentin Dupieux', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Jean Dujardin, Adèle Haenel, Albert Delpy, Coralie Russier, Pierre Gommé, Laurent Nicolas, Caroline Piette, Stéphane Jobert', null, 'A man''s obsession with owning the designer deerskin jacket of his dreams leads him to turn his back on his humdrum life in the suburbs, blow his life savings, and even turn him to crime.', 'A man''s obsession with owning the designer deerskin jacket of his dreams leads him to turn his back on his humdrum life in the suburbs, blow his life savings, and even turn him to crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUWuZxJWmjHyZFm0YLOdAIV4d3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582883'),
  ('1130556936766211436', 'Deewaar', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Yash Chopra, Ramesh Talwar, Deepak Sareen', 'Salim Khan, Javed Akhtar', 'Shashi Kapoor, Amitabh Bachchan, Nirupa Roy, Parveen Babi, Neetu Singh, Madan Puri, Manmohan Krishna, Jagdish Raj', null, 'Haunted by the past, Vijay turns to crime, while Ravi, his brother, becomes an honest police officer. Fate pits them against each other when Ravi is sent to nab Vijay.', 'Haunted by the past, Vijay turns to crime, while Ravi, his brother, becomes an honest police officer. Fate pits them against each other when Ravi is sent to nab Vijay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alVHFaerbSgnuKhzSddJRNiCs8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22460'),
  ('1026232307812569992', 'Deewaar: Let''s Bring Our Heroes Home', 2004, 'Drama, Action', 'Milan Luthria, Nirmal Jani', 'Shridhar Raghavan', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Sanjay Dutt, Akshaye Khanna, Amrita Rao, Kay Kay Menon, Tanuja Samarth, Rajendra Gupta, Ashraf Ul Haq', null, 'Major Ranvir Kaul (Amitabh Bachchan) is a POW who was captured along with over 50 soldiers by Pakistani soldiers in 1971 during the war between India and Pakistan. 33 years later Ranvir''s son Gaurav (Akshaye Khanna) decides to go on a rescue mission to Pakistan and bring back his father who he has not seen since he was a child. Helping him on his mission is Khan (Sanjay Dutt) who had successfully escaped from the same prison. They steal, kill, and plan to get the prisoners out. This movie is inspired by the film The Great Escape.', 'Major Ranvir Kaul (Amitabh Bachchan) is a POW who was captured along with over 50 soldiers by Pakistani soldiers in 1971 during the war between India and Pakistan. 33 years later Ranvir''s son Gaurav (Akshaye Khanna) decides to go on a rescue mission to Pakistan and bring back his father who he has not seen since he was a child. Helping him on his mission is Khan (Sanjay Dutt) who had successfully escaped from the same prison. They steal, kill, and plan to get the prisoners out. This movie is inspired by the film The Great Escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/An2v1gqXvtR4EAEhiGHhQ7lKwec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127531'),
