  ('171996480359619661', 'Def by Temptation', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller, Romance', 'Ernest R. Dickerson, James Bond III', 'James Bond III', 'James Bond III, Kadeem Hardison, Bill Nunn, Samuel L. Jackson, Minnie Gentry, Rony Clanton, Stephen Van Cleef, John Canada Terrell', 'R', 'An evil succubus is preying on libidinous black men in New York, and all that stands in her way is a minister-in-training, an aspiring actor, and a cop that specializes in cases involving the supernatural.', 'An evil succubus is preying on libidinous black men in New York, and all that stands in her way is a minister-in-training, an aspiring actor, and a cop that specializes in cases involving the supernatural.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cC96OjOeYXmBF6RuePlxA709tkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71853'),
  ('903370431395620557', 'Default', 2018, 'Drama, History', 'You Seok-moon, Moon Dae-young, Choi Kook-hee', 'Um Sung-min', 'Kim Hye-soo, Yoo Ah-in, Huh Joon-ho, Jo Woo-jin, Vincent Cassel, Kim Hong-pa, Uhm Hyo-seop, Kwon Hae-hyo', null, 'Only one week left until South Korea will go under sovereign default. Han Shi-hyun is a leader of the monetary policy team at the Bank of Korea. and is assigned to a crisis team.', 'Only one week left until South Korea will go under sovereign default. Han Shi-hyun is a leader of the monetary policy team at the Bank of Korea. and is assigned to a crisis team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDNLJUIHJEQQ3zMYWbN92R4Fqc5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554137'),
  ('98848349807891058', 'DEFCON-4', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Action', 'Paul Donovan, Digby Cook, Douglas Connell', 'Paul Donovan', 'Lenore Zann, Maury Chaykin, Kate Lynch, Kevin King, John Walsch, Tim Choate, Jeff Pustil, Donna King', 'R', 'Two men and a woman circle the globe in a satellite armed with a nuclear device. The third world war breaks out, and a few months later the satellite crashes. They survive the crash but one man gets killed by survivors and the other man gets caught. The woman stays by the remains of the the satellite but is soon caught by evil punks who have taken power.', 'Two men and a woman circle the globe in a satellite armed with a nuclear device. The third world war breaks out, and a few months later the satellite crashes. They survive the crash but one man gets killed by survivors and the other man gets caught. The woman stays by the remains of the the satellite but is soon caught by evil punks who have taken power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPQ8gUy228PrCkIFQlUVMppaD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42033'),
  ('345384467514431730', 'Defence Counsel Sedov', 1988, 'Drama', 'Evgeny Tsymbal, Vladimir Shevtsik', 'Mariya Zvereva, Ilya Zverev', 'Vladimir Ilin, Albina Matveyeva, Tamara Chernova, Татьяна Рогозина, Vatslav Dvorzhetsky, Vsevolod Larionov, Garik Sukachyov, Natalya Shchukina', null, 'Late one evening in Moscow in 1937, Defence Counsel Sedov hears a knock at the door. Three women whose agronomist husbands have been sentenced to death for alleged sabotage beg him to take on the seemingly hopeless task of saving them. Sedov embarks upon a succession of encounters with increasingly powerful officials, gradually persuading them to look at the case anew. But the highest authorities are not so easily outmanoeuvered, and Sedov becomes canonised as a Stalinist zealot, with the film building inexorably to its chilling triple climax.', 'Late one evening in Moscow in 1937, Defence Counsel Sedov hears a knock at the door. Three women whose agronomist husbands have been sentenced to death for alleged sabotage beg him to take on the seemingly hopeless task of saving them. Sedov embarks upon a succession of encounters with increasingly powerful officials, gradually persuading them to look at the case anew. But the highest authorities are not so easily outmanoeuvered, and Sedov becomes canonised as a Stalinist zealot, with the film building inexorably to its chilling triple climax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Xj5RJ9Ov9e4iL4aLwDnkhDRSu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283040'),
  ('2323145670471075', 'Defence of the Realm', 1986, 'Action, Thriller', 'David Drury, Roger Deakins', 'Martin Stellman', 'Gabriel Byrne, Greta Scacchi, Denholm Elliott, Ian Bannen, Fulton Mackay, Bill Paterson, David Calder, Frederick Treves', 'PG', 'A reporter named Mullen ''stumbles'' onto a story linking a prominent Member of Parliament to a KGB agent and a near-nuclear disaster involving a teenage runaway and a U.S. Air Force base. Has there been a Government cover-up? Mullen teams up with Vernon Bayliss, an old hack, and Nina Beckam, the MP''s assistant, to find out the truth.', 'A reporter named Mullen ''stumbles'' onto a story linking a prominent Member of Parliament to a KGB agent and a near-nuclear disaster involving a teenage runaway and a U.S. Air Force base. Has there been a Government cover-up? Mullen teams up with Vernon Bayliss, an old hack, and Nina Beckam, the MP''s assistant, to find out the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoUzgwdOk4J3ooomwxB1qwhzSbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29627'),
  ('341157477909524937', 'Defend Your Name', 2023, 'Drama', 'Aurélien Marra, Vincent Duquesne', 'Vincent Duquesne', 'Nicolas Fustier, Pablo Pauly, Julia Piaton, Patrick Rocca, Catherine Davenier', null, 'Fabrice grew up fascinated by his father. His only way to get his admiration: follow in his footsteps, become the local boss and stick up for their land at all costs. But now, his wife Laetitia is urging him to move on, to break free from his father''s grip. Torn by the conflict between his desire for freedom and the fear of losing his father''s love, he will fall into a spiral of violence.', 'Fabrice grew up fascinated by his father. His only way to get his admiration: follow in his footsteps, become the local boss and stick up for their land at all costs. But now, his wife Laetitia is urging him to move on, to break free from his father''s grip. Torn by the conflict between his desire for freedom and the fear of losing his father''s love, he will fall into a spiral of violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1zoBnDc7gDr2jnNyaob7RkyGZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:953521'),
  ('231466984170222010', 'Defending Your Life', 1991, 'Romance, Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Albert Brooks, Allen Daviau, Michael Grillo', 'Albert Brooks', 'Albert Brooks, Meryl Streep, Rip Torn, Lee Grant, Michael Durrell, James Eckhouse, Gary Beach, Julie Cobb', 'PG', 'Is there love after death? After he dies suddenly, the hapless advertising executive Daniel Miller finds himself in Judgment City, a gleaming way station where the newly deceased must prove they lived a life of sufficient courage to advance in their journey through the universe. As the self-doubting Daniel struggles to make his case, a budding relationship with the uninhibited Julia offers him a chance to finally feel alive.', 'Is there love after death? After he dies suddenly, the hapless advertising executive Daniel Miller finds himself in Judgment City, a gleaming way station where the newly deceased must prove they lived a life of sufficient courage to advance in their journey through the universe. As the self-doubting Daniel struggles to make his case, a budding relationship with the uninhibited Julia offers him a chance to finally feel alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flXJ4AnKYq8DH1f1TmQ4QrqSwsB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12186'),
  ('492554822225071327', 'Defendor', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Peter Stebbings, David Greene, Andrew Shea', 'Peter Stebbings', 'Woody Harrelson, Kat Dennings, Elias Koteas, Kristin Booth, Clark Johnson, Michael Kelly, Lisa Ray, Sandra Oh', 'R', 'A crooked cop, a mob boss and the young girl they abuse are the denizens of a city''s criminal underworld. It''s a world that ordinary Arthur Poppington doesn''t understand and doesn''t belong in, but is committed to fighting when he changes into a vigilante super-hero of his own making, Defendor. With no power other than courage Defendor takes to the streets to protect the city''s innocents.', 'A crooked cop, a mob boss and the young girl they abuse are the denizens of a city''s criminal underworld. It''s a world that ordinary Arthur Poppington doesn''t understand and doesn''t belong in, but is committed to fighting when he changes into a vigilante super-hero of his own making, Defendor. With no power other than courage Defendor takes to the streets to protect the city''s innocents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1ce5xYYkwSCqIHh0nGKnh7Zs7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34769'),
