  ('348044950547952024', 'Deli Deli Küpeli', 1986, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Ali Akdeniz, Meral Bayer', 'Osman F. Seden', 'Kemal Sunal, Melike Zobu, Yavuzer Çetinkaya, İhsan Yüce, Reha Yurdakul, Yaman Okay, Renan Fosforoğlu, Sırrı Elitaş', null, 'Two schizophrenic patients escape from a mental asylum supposing they were mistakenly quarantined. When they arrive at a country village, the villagers assume one is a sheriff and the other is a local magistrate.', 'Two schizophrenic patients escape from a mental asylum supposing they were mistakenly quarantined. When they arrive at a country village, the villagers assume one is a sheriff and the other is a local magistrate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRR6xrLGvlhi6M7n8pmMNSc4eRd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436055'),
  ('932387197032145161', 'Delibal', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ali Bilgin', 'Yıldırım Türker', 'Çağatay Ulusoy, Leyla Lydia Tuğutlu, Hüseyin Avni Danyal, Nazan Kesal, Mustafa Avkıran, Laçin Ceylan, Toprak Sağlam, Barış Aytaç', null, 'A love story following two young people battling with their emotions and dreams, the pressures of career, family and not knowing what the future holds. Füsun is a brilliant student, destined for a successful career but can''t help from falling for Baris, a musician who struggles with a psychological disorder. As the two grow closer they start to adopt each other''s traits, but becoming increasingly dependent on one another proves damaging for their relationship.', 'A love story following two young people battling with their emotions and dreams, the pressures of career, family and not knowing what the future holds. Füsun is a brilliant student, destined for a successful career but can''t help from falling for Baris, a musician who struggles with a psychological disorder. As the two grow closer they start to adopt each other''s traits, but becoming increasingly dependent on one another proves damaging for their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFf23vQM8K2mo0JNcMH6lv1yJ24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375784'),
  ('835710813280318292', 'Delicacies of Molten Horror Synapse', 1991, 'Documentary', 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Four superimposed rolls of hand-painted and bi-packed television negative imagery are edited so as to approximate the hypnagogic process whereby the optic nerves resist grotesque infusions of luminescent light.', 'Four superimposed rolls of hand-painted and bi-packed television negative imagery are edited so as to approximate the hypnagogic process whereby the optic nerves resist grotesque infusions of luminescent light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bT1H936sZ645rxJWWlnOv8JfH3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57657'),
