  ('158089048224547262', 'Delicate Crime', 2005, 'Drama', 'Beto Brant, Walter Carvalho, André Montenegro', 'Beto Brant, Marçal Aquino', 'Marco Ricca, Lilian Taublib, Felipe Ehrenberg, Maria Manoella, Matheus Nachtergaele, Zécarlos Machado, Marcélia Cartaxo, Lourdes Hernández-Fuentes', null, 'Antônio Martins, respected theatrical critic, is a very rational man. But a chance meeting with young Inês, a nude painting model, is going to rock him. Inês keeps a relationship with painter José Torres Campana, an older man with a deep influence over her. Antônio gets jealous, and the three become characters of a drama saturated with desire and danger.', 'Antônio Martins, respected theatrical critic, is a very rational man. But a chance meeting with young Inês, a nude painting model, is going to rock him. Inês keeps a relationship with painter José Torres Campana, an older man with a deep influence over her. Antônio gets jealous, and the three become characters of a drama saturated with desire and danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gz0175b134Ow6bmU4CFgECHPnul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86175'),
  ('270790928204009490', 'Delicatessen', 1991, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Darius Khondji, Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Marc Caro', 'Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Gilles Adrien, Marc Caro', 'Dominique Pinon, Marie-Laure Dougnac, Jean-Claude Dreyfus, Karin Viard, Ticky Holgado, Pascal Benezech, Edith Ker, Rufus', 'R', 'In a post-apocalyptic world, the residents of an apartment above the butcher shop receive an occasional delicacy of meat, something that is in low supply. A young man new in town falls in love with the butcher''s daughter, which causes conflicts in her family, who need the young man for other business-related purposes.', 'In a post-apocalyptic world, the residents of an apartment above the butcher shop receive an occasional delicacy of meat, something that is in low supply. A young man new in town falls in love with the butcher''s daughter, which causes conflicts in her family, who need the young man for other business-related purposes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNtOgQHxE5B8e08zuNRAdDpmK5Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892'),
