  ('824072316538254470', 'Delicious', 2021, 'History, Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Marie Dreujou, Éric Besnard', 'Éric Besnard, Nicolas Boukhrief', 'Isabelle Carré, Grégory Gadebois, Benjamin Lavernhe, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Christian Bouillette, Lorenzo Lefèbvre, Marie-Julie Baup, Laurent Bateau', null, 'France, 1789 - just before the Revolution. When talented chef Manceron is dismissed from his prestigious position by the Duke of Chamfort, he loses the taste for cooking. But when he meets the mysterious Louise, together they decide to create the very first restaurant in France.', 'France, 1789 - just before the Revolution. When talented chef Manceron is dismissed from his prestigious position by the Duke of Chamfort, he loses the taste for cooking. But when he meets the mysterious Louise, together they decide to create the very first restaurant in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pEYQgkcGsNZe6X76ZStGb62v1ad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745611'),
  ('316414470273107914', 'Delicious', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Nele Mueller-Stöfen, Frank Griebe, Inken Janssen', 'Nele Mueller-Stöfen', 'Valerie Pachner, Fahri Yardım, Carla Díaz, Naila Schuberth, Caspar Hoffmann, Julien de Saint Jean, Sina Martens, Johann von Bülow', 'R', 'During their vacation in the French countryside, a wealthy German family becomes entangled with a young hotel worker harboring sinister intentions.', 'During their vacation in the French countryside, a wealthy German family becomes entangled with a young hotel worker harboring sinister intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1ZIvviAEuIHcH9x6sv112mSvTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1418522'),
  ('935767410055546272', 'Delicious Delivery', 2015, 'Romance', 'Gi Dae-ho', null, 'Song Gi-joon, Son Ga-ram, Jeon Eun-jin, Ban Hee, Jeon Ye-eun, Lee Ye-eun, Bae Geon-sik, Jeon Ji-hak', null, 'A delivery boy gives it his all while delivering packages! Will he be able to find real love in his erotic delivery life? Im Hyeok is a handsome boy who gets dumped by his girlfriend and takes a break from school after his father goes bankrupt. He starts working as a delivery boy and his life changes completely. He provides other services to women who have nothing else to look forward to in their lives besides wait for their package to arrive. The women in an apartment complex become a group and share Im Hyeok with each other. They include his sexy ex-girlfriend Hee-seon and innocent girl Tae-hee. The 5 sensual life between the five women and Im Hyeok starts now.Delicious Delivery', 'A delivery boy gives it his all while delivering packages! Will he be able to find real love in his erotic delivery life? Im Hyeok is a handsome boy who gets dumped by his girlfriend and takes a break from school after his father goes bankrupt. He starts working as a delivery boy and his life changes completely. He provides other services to women who have nothing else to look forward to in their lives besides wait for their package to arrive. The women in an apartment complex become a group and share Im Hyeok with each other. They include his sexy ex-girlfriend Hee-seon and innocent girl Tae-hee. The 5 sensual life between the five women and Im Hyeok starts now.Delicious Delivery', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbU2UBygdGERFZkGLRXXYlj4aVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335117'),
  ('426855961747039020', 'Delicious Sisters', 2018, 'Romance', 'Kang Baek-ho', 'Kam Ja', 'Yoo Sul-young, Tae Bong, Sang Woo, Kang Jae-joong, Ahn So-hee, Kang Jae-yi', null, 'Hyun-ji and Jin-hee are university friends. One day, Jin-hee gets a call from her aunt in the suburbs saying that her son and Jin-hee’s cousin Seug-taek is going to stay with Jin-hee while he attends academy. When they and their friends see each other, they are drawn together.', 'Hyun-ji and Jin-hee are university friends. One day, Jin-hee gets a call from her aunt in the suburbs saying that her son and Jin-hee’s cousin Seug-taek is going to stay with Jin-hee while he attends academy. When they and their friends see each other, they are drawn together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giPRJA8EnvCW9xMrHPWbfvxNnri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698354'),
  ('847681504027071485', 'Delicious Tutor', 2020, 'Romance', 'Lee Ga-on', null, 'Jin Si-ah, Shin Yeon-woo, Jin Yi', null, 'Bong-soo receives a love tutor from Hope to escape from Moto-solo. Just a friend, Jeongyeon, starts to look like a woman. Bongsu confesses his anxiety to hope.', 'Bong-soo receives a love tutor from Hope to escape from Moto-solo. Just a friend, Jeongyeon, starts to look like a woman. Bongsu confesses his anxiety to hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqRAWy3EwIeDOoWU2gL1LU5VQw7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689160'),
  ('186806086871740266', 'Deliha', 2014, 'Family, Comedy, Romance', 'Duygu Akbayir, Duygu Kutlay, Firat Uçan', 'Gupse Özay', 'Gupse Özay, Derya Alabora, Esin Eden, Cihan Ercan, Barış Arduç, Korhan Herduran, Zeynep Çamcı, Hülya Duyar', null, 'A woman desperately seeking for a man to love. When he finally arrives, she overlooks him.', 'A woman desperately seeking for a man to love. When he finally arrives, she overlooks him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQqpC4qYqQqFTt9DZYjsz3s1yHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309853'),
  ('410075612093986432', 'Deliha 2', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Muzaffer Cansevdi, Övünç Angun, Sinan Duran', 'Gupse Özay', 'Gupse Özay, Eda Ece, Aksel Bonfil, Derya Alabora, Esin Eden, Hülya Duyar, Ali Çelik, Mert Öner', null, 'Zeliha is back: Crazy and candid as ever, and she still gets herself into all sorts of trouble. Seeking love in the first film, Zeliha is now after a career in the sequel, as she dreams of becoming a cook and starts working in a luxury restaurant. Will Zeliha''s dreams finally come true, or will the real world break her heart and leave her in disappointment? With heartwarming characters and an entertaining story by Gupse Özay, writer of the films Deliha and Görümce, Deliha 2 will once again leave audiences in laughter. The film also marks Özay''s directorial debut.', 'Zeliha is back: Crazy and candid as ever, and she still gets herself into all sorts of trouble. Seeking love in the first film, Zeliha is now after a career in the sequel, as she dreams of becoming a cook and starts working in a luxury restaurant. Will Zeliha''s dreams finally come true, or will the real world break her heart and leave her in disappointment? With heartwarming characters and an entertaining story by Gupse Özay, writer of the films Deliha and Görümce, Deliha 2 will once again leave audiences in laughter. The film also marks Özay''s directorial debut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulVSho2mdZplxuWWBq578p7xePZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496748'),
  ('956237530338916768', 'Delinquent Girl Boss: Worthless to Confess', 1971, 'Action, Crime', 'Kazuhiko Yamaguchi, Hanjirō Nakazawa', 'Norio Miyashita, Kazuhiko Yamaguchi', 'Reiko Oshida, Junzaburō Ban, Nobuo Kaneko, Yumiko Katayama, Yukie Kagawa, Ichirō Nakatani, Tonpei Hidari, Yōko Ichiji', null, 'Reiko Oshida stars as a young wannabe gangster tough girl, just released from reform school. She tracks down one of her classmates fathers, who runs an auto repair shop that the local Yakuza are trying to force out of business and take over, and starts working for him. At the same time a recently released from prison, and now ill Yakuza is trying to make a new life for himself and his girl, a friend of Reiko''s, who also just graduated from reform school. A fateful car crash brings the two on a collision course with each other and the brutal Yakuza clan, which can only end bloody vengeance.', 'Reiko Oshida stars as a young wannabe gangster tough girl, just released from reform school. She tracks down one of her classmates fathers, who runs an auto repair shop that the local Yakuza are trying to force out of business and take over, and starts working for him. At the same time a recently released from prison, and now ill Yakuza is trying to make a new life for himself and his girl, a friend of Reiko''s, who also just graduated from reform school. A fateful car crash brings the two on a collision course with each other and the brutal Yakuza clan, which can only end bloody vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRGYg8KYZrpfzLTrIenWSPusof7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55782'),
  ('618555766273687859', 'Delinquent in Drag', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy, Action', 'Yusaku Saotome, Masahide Okino, Noriyoshi Matsuura', 'Go Nagai', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Hideyuki Tanaka, Reiko Oimori, Yumi Touma, Eiko Yamada, Kenyu Horiuchi, Hiroko Emori, Michie Tomizawa', null, 'Does being the only guy in an all girl school sound like paradise? It might be, if the girls knew you were a guy, but to stay in school teenage pervert Banji can''t let can''t let anyone find out his chromosomes don''t match. Banji''s status conscious parents want him to go to a good school, but not enough to spend the money on a good co-ed school. Now, in addition to studying math and science, Banji has to learn how to put on a bra and makeup. His life has become a living hell. Not only is he at the bottom of the social pecking order, he must also got to conceal his inner-masculinity from the pretty classmate girl who''s stolen his heart while avoiding the female bullies who threaten to expose his less-than-feminine charms in the locker room.', 'Does being the only guy in an all girl school sound like paradise? It might be, if the girls knew you were a guy, but to stay in school teenage pervert Banji can''t let can''t let anyone find out his chromosomes don''t match. Banji''s status conscious parents want him to go to a good school, but not enough to spend the money on a good co-ed school. Now, in addition to studying math and science, Banji has to learn how to put on a bra and makeup. His life has become a living hell. Not only is he at the bottom of the social pecking order, he must also got to conceal his inner-masculinity from the pretty classmate girl who''s stolen his heart while avoiding the female bullies who threaten to expose his less-than-feminine charms in the locker room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWEykM1thLhYee6mK25fGLXyO14.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324568'),
  ('632217000517451895', 'Delinquent Schoolgirls', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Greg Corarito, Victoria Percival', 'John Lamb, Greg Corarito, Maurice Smith', 'Michael Pataki, Bob Minor, Stephen Stucker, Colleen Brennan, Roberta Pedon, George Buck Flower, Brenda Miller, Jane Steele', 'R', 'Three mental patients--a bad impersonator, a baseball player, and a gay fashion designer--escape their asylum and sexually assault their way into a girls'' private school. The girls'' education includes wrestling and karate, so the three madmen will find stern opposition they never expected.', 'Three mental patients--a bad impersonator, a baseball player, and a gay fashion designer--escape their asylum and sexually assault their way into a girls'' private school. The girls'' education includes wrestling and karate, so the three madmen will find stern opposition they never expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SKNaVGz0s9Txnyj7OctrlFRXXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39917'),
