  ('18664246812599385', 'Delirium', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Kaimakamian Carrau, Jorge Crespo', 'Carlos Kaimakamian Carrau', 'Ricardo Darín, Ramiro Archain, Emiliano Carrazzone, Florencia Miller, Miguel Di Lemme', null, 'A group of friends is looking for a change in their lives. Believing that a film will bring them fame and wealth, they embark on the project without many cinematic knowledge, but with a famous actor in mind to star: Ricardo Darín.', 'A group of friends is looking for a change in their lives. Believing that a film will bring them fame and wealth, they embark on the project without many cinematic knowledge, but with a famous actor in mind to star: Ricardo Darín.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqN8PCuLbpV2TpKxzgZa7ga0LV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357155'),
  ('683672633214574465', 'Delirium', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dennis Iliadis, Mihai Malaimare Jr.', 'Adam Alleca', 'Topher Grace, Kelli Barksdale, Patricia Clarkson, Marty Eli Schwartz, Cody Sullivan, Callan Mulvey, Robin Thomas, Braden Fitzgerald', 'R', 'A man recently released from a mental institute inherits a mansion after his parents die. After a series of disturbing events, he comes to believe it is haunted.', 'A man recently released from a mental institute inherits a mansion after his parents die. After a series of disturbing events, he comes to believe it is haunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2jIkjrASnjtwCmCNDwh9LDWvq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340601'),
  ('745632183052015407', 'Delirium', 2019, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Lars R. Liebold, Till Endemann', 'Rebekka Reuber, Marie-Therese Thill', 'Julia Koschitz, Justus von Dohnányi, Aaron Friesz, Marie-Christine Friedrich, Johannes Zeiler, Michou Friesz, Johannes Silberschneider, Patricia Hirschbichler', null, 'A psychiatrist should assess the guilt of a woman abuser.', 'A psychiatrist should assess the guilt of a woman abuser.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNM9AT4ChX7yfL5qtwg1F1qa6Mo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635920'),
  ('682266115773801992', 'Delirium in a Studio', 1907, null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Manuel, Georges Méliès', null, 'The opening title card explains that a painter has just finished his work when his assistant comes in and accidentally drinks varnish. The film then picks up as the painter goes haywire and sends the assistant into the painting.', 'The opening title card explains that a painter has just finished his work when his assistant comes in and accidentally drinks varnish. The film then picks up as the painter goes haywire and sends the assistant into the painting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcZApVihJnXDY9dFbhfWiBHp3mT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196490'),
  ('852319806606729664', 'Delirium: Photo of Gioia', 1987, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lamberto Bava, Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Roy Bava', 'Gianfranco Clerici, Daniele Stroppa', 'Serena Grandi, Vanni Corbellini, George Eastman, David Brandon, Sabrina Salerno, Karl Zinny, Capucine, Trine Michelsen', null, 'Gioia is a buxom centerfold working for Pussycat magazine. In such a profession, having an admirer or two is expected, but Gioia''s admirer is a vicious killer! He murders her fellow magazine models one at a time, using a variety of twisted implements of death. Gioia is the lucky recipient of a collection of photos, each with murdered bodies arranged around posters of her.', 'Gioia is a buxom centerfold working for Pussycat magazine. In such a profession, having an admirer or two is expected, but Gioia''s admirer is a vicious killer! He murders her fellow magazine models one at a time, using a variety of twisted implements of death. Gioia is the lucky recipient of a collection of photos, each with murdered bodies arranged around posters of her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLlnOkp9othRluCi2WGIkynVozX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28327'),
  ('512135856273477922', 'Delisin', 1975, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ergin Orbey', 'Ergin Orbey', 'Tarık Akan, Necla Nazır, Adile Naşit, Hulusi Kentmen, Ali Şen, Ayşen Gruda, Selim Acar, Nubar Terziyan', null, 'A shy introvert falls for the photographer who took her pictures during high school. Confused and worried, she doubts that love will elapse and can never open up to her lover. Yet she cannot runaway from love.', 'A shy introvert falls for the photographer who took her pictures during high school. Confused and worried, she doubts that love will elapse and can never open up to her lover. Yet she cannot runaway from love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZWbKvZFpH8uKQZ6xyjXbgM96w4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447091'),
  ('63126379862401586', 'Deliver by Christmas', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Terry Ingram, William McKnight', null, 'Alvina August, Eion Bailey, Kesler Talbot, Nadeen Lightbody, Julie Lynn-Mortensen, Jim Thorburn, Nakai Takawira, Fiona Vroom', null, 'Bakery owner Molly meets Josh, a widower who recently moved to town with his young son, but she is also charmed by a mysterious client whom she’s never met in person and she doesn’t realize that they’re the same man.', 'Bakery owner Molly meets Josh, a widower who recently moved to town with his young son, but she is also charmed by a mysterious client whom she’s never met in person and she doesn’t realize that they’re the same man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFCTa0dj4xJu2RotzrXTTXSkhkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737777'),
  ('309027958454764144', 'Deliver Me', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Federica di Giacomo', 'Andrea Osvaldo Sanguigni, Federica di Giacomo', null, null, 'A film on the come back of exorcism in the contemporary world. Each year a growing number of people call their sense of unease “possession.” The Church answers to this spiritual emergency nominating an increasing number of exorcist priests and organizing training courses. Father Cataldo is one of the most sought-after exorcists in Sicily and elsewhere; he is famous for his tireless fighting spirit. Every Tuesday Gloria, Enrico, Anna, and Giulia, along with many others, attend Father Cataldo’s mass for deliverance, trying to find a cure for a sense of discomfort that has no answer nor a name. Whether believers or not, how far are we prepared to go to get recognition for our own disease? What are we prepared to do to be delivered from it, here and now?', 'A film on the come back of exorcism in the contemporary world. Each year a growing number of people call their sense of unease “possession.” The Church answers to this spiritual emergency nominating an increasing number of exorcist priests and organizing training courses. Father Cataldo is one of the most sought-after exorcists in Sicily and elsewhere; he is famous for his tireless fighting spirit. Every Tuesday Gloria, Enrico, Anna, and Giulia, along with many others, attend Father Cataldo’s mass for deliverance, trying to find a cure for a sense of discomfort that has no answer nor a name. Whether believers or not, how far are we prepared to go to get recognition for our own disease? What are we prepared to do to be delivered from it, here and now?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNwcOaX0IBFddCOzWm6m8TEz7QE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412698'),
  ('838049006596680385', 'Deliver Us', 2023, 'Horror', 'Heiko Sikka, Lee Roy Kunz, Isaac Bauman', 'Kane Kunz, Lee Roy Kunz', 'Lee Roy Kunz, Maria Vera Ratti, Alexander Siddig, Jaune Kimmel, Thomas Kretschmann, Jelena Rajapu, Anil Kapur, Kätlin Hallik', 'NR', 'When a nun in a remote convent claims immaculate conception, the Vatican sends a team of priests to investigate, concerned about an ancient prophecy that a woman will give birth to twin boys: one the Messiah, the other the Antichrist.', 'When a nun in a remote convent claims immaculate conception, the Vatican sends a team of priests to investigate, concerned about an ancient prophecy that a woman will give birth to twin boys: one the Messiah, the other the Antichrist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOWZJgeEvH9ETqCFqxc6803l00H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1097150'),
  ('428839224239454739', 'Deliver Us from Eva', 2003, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Gary Hardwick, Alexander Gruszynski', 'James Iver Mattson, B.E. Brauner, Gary Hardwick', 'LL Cool J, Gabrielle Union, Essence Atkins, Robinne Lee, Meagan Good, Duane Martin, Mel Jackson, Dartanyan Edmonds', 'R', 'Eva Dandridge has been in charge of her younger sisters ever since their parents died many years ago. She is a very uptight young woman who constantly meddles in the affairs of her sisters and their significant others. Her brothers-in-law, who are tired of Eva interfering in their lives, decide to set her up with someone so she can leave them alone. They end up paying Ray, the local "playboy," $5,000 to date her. The plan goes by smoothly, but trouble comes when Ray actually falls in love with Eva.', 'Eva Dandridge has been in charge of her younger sisters ever since their parents died many years ago. She is a very uptight young woman who constantly meddles in the affairs of her sisters and their significant others. Her brothers-in-law, who are tired of Eva interfering in their lives, decide to set her up with someone so she can leave them alone. They end up paying Ray, the local "playboy," $5,000 to date her. The plan goes by smoothly, but trouble comes when Ray actually falls in love with Eva.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkCC7wOJ0C1gfEt44ca25x8xTdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26454'),
  ('1144756260968155514', 'Deliver Us from Evil', 2006, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Amy J. Berg', 'Amy J. Berg', 'Oliver O''Grady, Thomas P. Doyle, Benedict XVI, Adam, Monsignor Cain, Jane Degroot, Ann Marie Jyono', 'NR', 'Documentary filmmaker Amy Berg investigates the life of 30-year pedophile Father Oliver O''Grady and exposes the corruption inside the Catholic Church that allowed him to abuse countless children. Victims'' stories and a disturbing interview with O''Grady offer a view into the troubled mind of the spiritual leader who moved from parish to parish gaining trust ... all the while betraying so many.', 'Documentary filmmaker Amy Berg investigates the life of 30-year pedophile Father Oliver O''Grady and exposes the corruption inside the Catholic Church that allowed him to abuse countless children. Victims'' stories and a disturbing interview with O''Grady offer a view into the troubled mind of the spiritual leader who moved from parish to parish gaining trust ... all the while betraying so many.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FSBT712p6OwawSqLCkloNSqMaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13364'),
  ('42743408089064719', 'Deliver Us from Evil', 2009, 'Thriller', 'Ole Bornedal, Dan Laustsen', 'Ole Bornedal', 'Pernille Vallentin, Lene Nystrøm, Lasse Rimmer, Fanny Leander Bornedal, Jacob Ottensten, Lone Lindorff, Jens Andersen, Bojan Navojec', null, 'In search of a new lifestyle, Johannes and his wife Pernille leave the city and move with their two children to Johannes’ childhood town in the country. When Johannes’ drunken brother Lars accidently runs over Anna, a local, and plants false evidence pointing at the emigrant Alain, Johannes stands up to defend Alain. But it comes with a price.', 'In search of a new lifestyle, Johannes and his wife Pernille leave the city and move with their two children to Johannes’ childhood town in the country. When Johannes’ drunken brother Lars accidently runs over Anna, a local, and plants false evidence pointing at the emigrant Alain, Johannes stands up to defend Alain. But it comes with a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5F0FBTs2OA7glSUuvpwzYPCMAnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16639'),
  ('567468772372072409', 'Deliver Us from Evil', 2014, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Scott Derrickson, G.A. Aguilar, Katya Blumenberg', 'Paul Harris Boardman, Scott Derrickson', 'Eric Bana, Olivia Munn, Edgar Ramírez, Joel McHale, Sean Harris, Chris Coy, Dorian Missick, Mike Houston', 'R', 'When a frightening wave of violence sweeps through New York City, troubled cop Sarchie fails to find a rational explanation for the bizarre crimes. However, his eyes are opened to a frightening alternate reality when renegade Jesuit priest Mendoza convinces him that demonic possession may be to blame for the gruesome murders. Together, they wage a valiant supernatural struggle to rid the city of an otherworldly evil.', 'When a frightening wave of violence sweeps through New York City, troubled cop Sarchie fails to find a rational explanation for the bizarre crimes. However, his eyes are opened to a frightening alternate reality when renegade Jesuit priest Mendoza convinces him that demonic possession may be to blame for the gruesome murders. Together, they wage a valiant supernatural struggle to rid the city of an otherworldly evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Uz32ERsyCmGwV8Eg2wmT2ooWpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184346'),
  ('1150137171370237373', 'Deliver Us from Evil', 2020, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Hong Won-chan, Hong Kyung-pyo, Bae Il-hyuck', 'Hong Won-chan', 'Hwang Jung-min, Lee Jung-jae, Park Jeong-min, Moon Choi, Oh Dae-hwan, Park Myung-hoon, Song Young-chang, Lee Seo-hwan', null, 'A retired contract killer goes on a bloody rampage when a young girl finds herself at the mercy of gangland human traffickers and only one man can come to her rescue, with an arsenal of weapons and years of experience in the art of killing.', 'A retired contract killer goes on a bloody rampage when a young girl finds herself at the mercy of gangland human traffickers and only one man can come to her rescue, with an arsenal of weapons and years of experience in the art of killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hngKHgBHRD5nbTx92zatBC6eMSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581526'),
  ('543297511069974589', 'Deliverance', 1972, 'Drama, Adventure, Thriller', 'John Boorman, Vilmos Zsigmond, Al Jennings', 'James Dickey', 'Jon Voight, Burt Reynolds, Ned Beatty, Ronny Cox, Ed Ramey, Billy Redden, Seamon Glass, Randall Deal', 'R', 'Intent on seeing the Cahulawassee River before it''s turned into one huge lake, outdoor fanatic Lewis Medlock takes his friends on a river-rafting trip they''ll never forget into the dangerous American back-country.', 'Intent on seeing the Cahulawassee River before it''s turned into one huge lake, outdoor fanatic Lewis Medlock takes his friends on a river-rafting trip they''ll never forget into the dangerous American back-country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TrAzNJlHyNYYSkQf6asg3rs2Xr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10669'),
  ('812739941717846056', 'Delivered', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Emma Tammi, Lyn Moncrief', 'Dirk Blackman', 'Natalie Paul, Tina Majorino, Micah Joe Parker, Michael Cassidy, Rosslyn Luke, Vito D''Ambrosio, Joel Dupont, Stacie Greenwell', 'NR', 'A pregnant woman’s life is upended when she realizes someone close to her has darker plans for her and the baby.', 'A pregnant woman’s life is upended when she realizes someone close to her has darker plans for her and the baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idyJnDXMiETp8fyiyakv388C1WS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:701510'),
  ('1006502220862591558', 'Delivering Milo', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Nick Castle, Willy Kurant', 'Diana Wagman', 'Anton Yelchin, Albert Finney, Bridget Fonda, Campbell Scott, Hank Harris, Alison Lohman, Lesley Ann Warren, Gary Farmer', 'PG', 'A guardian angel has 24 hours to convince a soul that life on Earth is worth the effort.', 'A guardian angel has 24 hours to convince a soul that life on Earth is worth the effort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0XvS2GVf522bcOV5kFG2JC2DVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24811'),
  ('1146297739989735625', 'Delivery by Christmas', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Aleksandra Kułakowska, Maciej Prykowski, Bartosz Piotrowski', 'Aleksandra Kułakowska, Maria Pułaska, Maciej Prykowski', 'Monika Frajczyk, Piotr Pacek, Franciszek Krupowicz, Dorota Kolak, Mirosław Baka, Barbara Jonak, Łukasz Simlat, Łukasz Gawroński', null, 'When a spiteful coworker sabotages her deliveries, a courier and a helpful customer must race to return Christmas presents to their intended recipients.', 'When a spiteful coworker sabotages her deliveries, a courier and a helpful customer must race to return Christmas presents to their intended recipients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49KcmgKAtgC02xQFpDly2svEOxW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053080'),
  ('262607354865618886', 'Delivery Man', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Eric Alan Edwards, Ken Scott, Patrick McDonald', 'Ken Scott', 'Vince Vaughn, Cobie Smulders, Chris Pratt, Britt Robertson, Jack Reynor, Bobby Moynihan, Andrzej Blumenfeld, Simon Delaney', 'PG-13', 'An affable underachiever finds out he''s fathered 533 children through anonymous donations to a fertility clinic 20 years ago. Now he must decide whether or not to come forward when 142 of them file a lawsuit to reveal his identity.', 'An affable underachiever finds out he''s fathered 533 children through anonymous donations to a fertility clinic 20 years ago. Now he must decide whether or not to come forward when 142 of them file a lawsuit to reveal his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huXHYDclKT4RM1OvS3O7SXYRAU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146239'),
  ('271368189489225756', 'Delivery Run', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Joey Palmroos, Gillian Hawser', 'Joey Palmroos, Anders Holmes', 'Alexander Arnold, Liam James Collins, Arthur Sylense, Nadine Higgin, Jussi Lampi, Joey Palmroos, Darren McStay, Thom Chacon', 'R', 'A food delivery driver gets caught in a deadly chase in the icy Minnesota wilderness, pursued by a crazed snowplow driver for unknown reasons, facing life-threatening situations and forced to outsmart his relentless pursuer alone.', 'A food delivery driver gets caught in a deadly chase in the icy Minnesota wilderness, pursued by a crazed snowplow driver for unknown reasons, facing life-threatening situations and forced to outsmart his relentless pursuer alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCA5maHDlZtXNTtiLXenwnEw7tc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1336189'),
  ('149513576164014334', 'Delphine : 1, Yvan : 0', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Dominique Farrugia, Pascal Gennesseaux, Catherine Georges', 'Michel Hazanavicius, Dominique Farrugia', 'Julie Gayet, Alain Chabat, Dominique Farrugia, Lionel Abelanski, Amélie Pick, Thierry Roland, Jean-Michel Larqué, Daniel Russo', null, 'C''est une histoire d''amour banale présentée comme un match de foot ordinaire. Ce sont donc Thierry Roland et Jean-Michel Larqué qui commentent, avec leurs mots (d''amour) et leurs noms (d''oiseaux), la première année de vie en couple de Delphine et Yvan, filmés pas à pas, dans leurs ébats et leurs éclats.', 'C''est une histoire d''amour banale présentée comme un match de foot ordinaire. Ce sont donc Thierry Roland et Jean-Michel Larqué qui commentent, avec leurs mots (d''amour) et leurs noms (d''oiseaux), la première année de vie en couple de Delphine et Yvan, filmés pas à pas, dans leurs ébats et leurs éclats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejby4mbGkNQ5mvSlbI5X2KdxrCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45221'),
  ('339893556061708349', 'Delphine and Carole', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Callisto McNulty', 'Alexandra Roussopoulos, Callisto McNulty, Géronimo Roussopoulos', 'Delphine Seyrig, Carole Roussopoulos, Alexandra Roussopoulos, Chantal Akerman, Marguerite Duras, Liliane de Kermadec, Nadja Ringart, Ioana Wieder', null, 'In the 70s, actress Delphine Seyrig and director Carole Roussopoulos, both militant feminists, were the pioneers of video activism in France. They documented the demonstrations of French feminists and used the new technologies to counter the poor representation of women in the public media.', 'In the 70s, actress Delphine Seyrig and director Carole Roussopoulos, both militant feminists, were the pioneers of video activism in France. They documented the demonstrations of French feminists and used the new technologies to counter the poor representation of women in the public media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtT2UlBVXcE8RzPwu4YmJVCs3mb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580073'),
  ('83522585487749688', 'Delta', 2023, 'Drama', 'Michele Vannucci, Matteo Vieille, Matteo Damiani', 'Michele Vannucci, Massimo Gaudioso, Fabio Natale', 'Alessandro Borghi, Luigi Lo Cascio, Emilia Scarpati Fanetti, Greta Esposito, Denis Fasolo, Marius Bizău, Sergio Romano', null, 'A clash between fishermen and poachers is surging on the Po river Delta. A local group of volunteers lead by Osso wants to save the river from overfishing and defend it from the Florians, a family on the run from the Danube region. They have with them Elia, who once was part of the local community and now is on the opposite side of the conflict. Overtaken by blind violence and thirst for vengeance, Elia and Osso will confront each other in the Delta fogs, discovering their real nature in a fight that has no heroes.', 'A clash between fishermen and poachers is surging on the Po river Delta. A local group of volunteers lead by Osso wants to save the river from overfishing and defend it from the Florians, a family on the run from the Danube region. They have with them Elia, who once was part of the local community and now is on the opposite side of the conflict. Overtaken by blind violence and thirst for vengeance, Elia and Osso will confront each other in the Delta fogs, discovering their real nature in a fight that has no heroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gr2YG3hbasg5IKWncVJbjXoYscr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784375'),
  ('45623795465905738', 'Delta Farce', 2007, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'C.B. Harding', 'Bear Aderhold, Tom Sullivan', 'Larry the Cable Guy, Bill Engvall, DJ Qualls, Christina Moore, Danny Trejo, Keith David, Jeff Dunham, Ed O''Ross', 'PG-13', 'Three bumbling Army reservists are hustled onto a plane headed for combat in Iraq -- but the fact that the plane drops them in Mexico doesn''t stop them from "liberating" what they believe to be the Middle East.', 'Three bumbling Army reservists are hustled onto a plane headed for combat in Iraq -- but the fact that the plane drops them in Mexico doesn''t stop them from "liberating" what they believe to be the Middle East.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OkLfZGETr199O1hBV2iC95UBuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14547'),
  ('417791274486668804', 'Delta Force 2: The Colombian Connection', 1990, 'Action', 'Aaron Norris, Ricardo de Guzman, Leo Zisman', 'Lee Reynolds', 'Chuck Norris, Billy Drago, John P. Ryan, Richard Jaeckel, Begonya Plaza, Paul Perri, Héctor Mercado, Mark Margolis', 'R', 'When DEA agents are taken captive by a ruthless South American kingpin, the Delta Force is reunited to rescue them in this sequel to the 1986 film.', 'When DEA agents are taken captive by a ruthless South American kingpin, the Delta Force is reunited to rescue them in this sequel to the 1986 film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rBVHD1gYSx5bOwCgqSdljUXKY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19086'),
  ('6579205708746028', 'Delta Force 3: The Killing Game', 1991, 'Action, Adventure', 'Sam Firstenberg, Avraham Karpick', 'Andrew Deutsch, Greg Latter, Boaz Davidson', 'Nick Cassavetes, Eric Douglas, Mike Norris, Mark Ivanir, Matthew Penn, John Saint Ryan, John Phillips, Hanna Azoulay Hasfari', null, 'A terrorist places an atom bomb somewhere in an American metropolis. The president of the U.S. has no other choice; he has to call Delta Force.', 'A terrorist places an atom bomb somewhere in an American metropolis. The president of the U.S. has no other choice; he has to call Delta Force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2B9GjM8nwKu5wBG1wJRpxQ4Ez0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26340'),
  ('111584703990256298', 'Delta Pi', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Paul Lohmann, Stanley Foster, David Kelley', 'Kevin Brodie', 'Ruth Gordon, Laura Branigan, Joanna Dierck, Eddie Deezen, Estrellita, Kristi Somers, Candace Pandolfo, Rebecca Forstadt', 'R', 'A sorority house mother enters her girls in a mud-wrestling contest.', 'A sorority house mother enters her girls in a mud-wrestling contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRRyUKot9e0VK8p0u79AP0Msva.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251406'),
  ('836581639905681084', 'Delta Space Mission', 1985, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Călin Cazan, Mircea Toia', 'Mircea Toia', 'Mirela Gorea, Marcel Iureș, Dan Condurache, Ion Chelaru', null, 'An advanced spaceship called Delta is created to establish dialogue between intergalactic civilizations. Soon after an alien journalist boards the ship, she and the captain realize the AI that controls the ship can act on its own.', 'An advanced spaceship called Delta is created to establish dialogue between intergalactic civilizations. Soon after an alien journalist boards the ship, she and the captain realize the AI that controls the ship can act on its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBu8nXyhCDisVGt5DC2f4kw8BN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345715'),
  ('1034117208820016373', 'Deluge', 1933, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Felix E. Feist, Norbert Brodine', 'John F. Goodrich, Warren Duff', 'Lois Wilson, Sidney Blackmer, Peggy Shannon, Matt Moore, Fred Kohler, Edward Van Sloan, Samuel S. Hinds, Fred ''Snowflake'' Toones', null, 'A massive earthquake strikes the United States, which destroys the West Coast and unleashes a massive flood that threatens to destroy the East Coast as well.', 'A massive earthquake strikes the United States, which destroys the West Coast and unleashes a massive flood that threatens to destroy the East Coast as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TL1Qxgl2D4RtvnuWteVknqod1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163293'),
  ('307442765783618002', 'Delusion', 1981, 'Horror', 'Alan Beattie, David Blocker, Stephen L. Posey', 'Jack Viertel', 'Patricia Pearcy, Joseph Cotten, David Hayward, John Dukakis, Leon Charles, Alice Nunn, Patrick Pankhurst, Louis Basile', 'R', 'Meredith Stone, a home care nurse, has been assigned the duty of looking after a wealthy invalid named Ivar Langrock. Cooped up in Langrock''s stately country mansion, Meredith quickly suspects that someone sinister is lurking in the manor''s dark halls only to discover that Ivar''s demented and violent son has been locked away in a hidden room. Shortly thereafter, Ivar''s grandson Gabriel also moves into the house and with his arrival a mysterious killer soon begins murdering members of the Langrock family along with their live-in staff.', 'Meredith Stone, a home care nurse, has been assigned the duty of looking after a wealthy invalid named Ivar Langrock. Cooped up in Langrock''s stately country mansion, Meredith quickly suspects that someone sinister is lurking in the manor''s dark halls only to discover that Ivar''s demented and violent son has been locked away in a hidden room. Shortly thereafter, Ivar''s grandson Gabriel also moves into the house and with his arrival a mysterious killer soon begins murdering members of the Langrock family along with their live-in staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xGjPFsvFtjohGoOGJVQD79pTfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213208'),
  ('795123313954526166', 'Delusion', 1991, 'Crime', 'Carl Colpaert, Geza Sinkovics, Rod Smith', 'Carl Colpaert, Kurt Voss', 'Jim Metzler, Jennifer Rubin, Kyle Secor, Jerry Orbach, Robert Costanzo, Tracey Walter, Barbara Alyn Woods, Amanda Horan Kennedy', null, 'A computer expert embezzles half a million dollars and races off to Reno to start anew. Unfortunately, en route, he picks up a pair of hitchers and ends up entangled with a crazed couple who commandeer his car and leave him alone in the desert to die. As soon as he can, he hits the road to get revenge and to find his money before they do.', 'A computer expert embezzles half a million dollars and races off to Reno to start anew. Unfortunately, en route, he picks up a pair of hitchers and ends up entangled with a crazed couple who commandeer his car and leave him alone in the desert to die. As soon as he can, he hits the road to get revenge and to find his money before they do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6oyVAKQXh9Ci5WFwGF3HaByvVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36337'),
  ('221991601148518266', 'Delusions of Grandeur', 1971, 'Comedy, History', 'Gérard Oury, Henri Decaë', 'Danièle Thompson, Gérard Oury, Marcel Jullian', 'Louis de Funès, Yves Montand, Alice Sapritch, Karin Schubert, Alberto de Mendoza, Jaime de Mora y Aragón, Eduardo Fajardo, Antonio Pica', 'PG', 'Don Sallust is the minister of the King of Spain. Being disingenuous, hypocritical, greedy and collecting the taxes for himself, he is hated by the people he oppresses. Accused by The Queen, a beautiful princess Bavarian, of having an illegitimate child to one of her maids of honor, he was stripped of his duties and ordered to retire to a monastery.', 'Don Sallust is the minister of the King of Spain. Being disingenuous, hypocritical, greedy and collecting the taxes for himself, he is hated by the people he oppresses. Accused by The Queen, a beautiful princess Bavarian, of having an illegitimate child to one of her maids of honor, he was stripped of his duties and ordered to retire to a monastery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJtEs9WRqyEREvdkS470n593z03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14257'),
