  ('664962907121263423', 'Demented', 1980, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Arthur Jeffreys', 'Alex Rebar', 'Sallee Young, Harry Reems, Deborah Alter, Kathryn Clayton, Bryan Charles, Edward Talbot ''Chip'' Matthews, Stephen Blood', 'R', 'A woman is gang-raped in a horse''s stable, and even though the rapists are caught and imprisoned, she is harassed many moons later by ghastly visions of her tormentors, while her husband philanders and every little thing frightens her out of her wits.', 'A woman is gang-raped in a horse''s stable, and even though the rapists are caught and imprisoned, she is harassed many moons later by ghastly visions of her tormentors, while her husband philanders and every little thing frightens her out of her wits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tA0N5GDiQvUtUrKH9EPCdXTUWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85186'),
  ('816893597308491997', 'Demented', 2006, 'Drama', 'Laurent Achard, Philippe Van Leeuw, Georges Diane', 'Laurent Achard, Nathalie Najem', 'Julien Cochelin, Annie Cordy, Pascal Cervo, Dominique Reymond, Jean-Yves Chatelais, Thomas Laroppe, Nicolas Leclère, Florence Giorgetti', null, 'It’s summer and the beginning of the long vacation period for eleven-year-old Martin, who lives on a farm, and, at a loss, observes his family’s disintegration : his mother lives locked-up in her room ; his older brother, who he adores, drowns himself in drink ; and his father, dominated by Martin’s grandmother, is a helpless onlooker to the family’s collapse. Although Mistigri, his cat, and Malika, the Moroccan maid, afford him some comfort, Martin is determined to put an end to this confusion.', 'It’s summer and the beginning of the long vacation period for eleven-year-old Martin, who lives on a farm, and, at a loss, observes his family’s disintegration : his mother lives locked-up in her room ; his older brother, who he adores, drowns himself in drink ; and his father, dominated by Martin’s grandmother, is a helpless onlooker to the family’s collapse. Although Mistigri, his cat, and Malika, the Moroccan maid, afford him some comfort, Martin is determined to put an end to this confusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnPbsTEYVEVhR6oGCVPWxWDqdsx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108887'),
  ('110412056020011651', 'Demented Death Farm Massacre', 1972, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'Donn Davison, Fred Olen Ray', null, 'Ashley Brooks, John Carradine, George Ellis, Trudy Moore, Michael Battlesmith, Jim Peck, Pepper Thurston, Valerie Lipsey', 'R', 'A gang of four thieves, having stolen over a million dollars worth of gems, are driving through the remote hill roads of the Carolinas when their jeep runs out of gas. A local moonshiner and his wife offer the strangers a place to stay until they can get help, but the thieves soon take advantage of their hosts. Both the moonshiner''s young wife and his supposed hidden fortune prove to be irresistable temptations for the fugitives, but will their greed and jealousy prove to be their downfall?', 'A gang of four thieves, having stolen over a million dollars worth of gems, are driving through the remote hill roads of the Carolinas when their jeep runs out of gas. A local moonshiner and his wife offer the strangers a place to stay until they can get help, but the thieves soon take advantage of their hosts. Both the moonshiner''s young wife and his supposed hidden fortune prove to be irresistable temptations for the fugitives, but will their greed and jealousy prove to be their downfall?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exxtwBZbsRbo2e2Qo5ljqK2sR21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94282'),
  ('431680436171090258', 'Dementia', 1955, 'Horror', 'John Parker, William C. Thompson', 'Bruno VeSota', 'Adrienne Barrett, Bruno VeSota, Ben Roseman, Richard Barron, Ed Hinkle, Lucille Rowland, Jebbie VeSota, Faith Parker', null, 'In a shadowy world stitched from nightmares, a young woman''s harrowing journey in a seedy hotel unveils her traumatic past. Haunted by violence and stalked through desolate streets, her psyche unravels as she confronts an abusive husband and unsettling memories.', 'In a shadowy world stitched from nightmares, a young woman''s harrowing journey in a seedy hotel unveils her traumatic past. Haunted by violence and stalked through desolate streets, her psyche unravels as she confronts an abusive husband and unsettling memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0dai8tk4urRAox8rZTEXixURUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79363'),
  ('507887881411408258', 'Dementia', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mike Testin, Mike Testin', 'Meredith Berg', 'Gene Jones, Kristina Klebe, Hassie Harrison, Peter Cilella, Richard Riehle, Molly McQueen, Steve Agee, Julian Bane', 'NR', 'After being diagnosed with dementia, an elderly war veteran is forced by his estranged family to hire a live-in nurse, only to find she harbors a sinister secret.', 'After being diagnosed with dementia, an elderly war veteran is forced by his estranged family to hire a live-in nurse, only to find she harbors a sinister secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9V8mKoRfsOUMj2m3yRUTbwR437.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370234'),
  ('136692266259653287', 'Dementia 13', 1963, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Charles Hannawalt, Richard F. Dalton', 'Francis Ford Coppola', 'William Campbell, Luana Anders, Bart Patton, Mary Mitchel, Patrick Magee, Eithne Dunne, Peter Read, Karl Schanzer', 'NR', 'A scheming widow hatches a bold plan to acquire her late husband''s inheritance, unaware that she is being targeted by an ax murderer who lurks in the family''s estate.', 'A scheming widow hatches a bold plan to acquire her late husband''s inheritance, unaware that she is being targeted by an ax murderer who lurks in the family''s estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLv5491Q11zhIZbpqz7rnRZkSLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28503'),
  ('1018995985747018774', 'Demetri Martin. Person.', 2007, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jay Karas', 'Demetri Martin', 'Demetri Martin', 'NR', 'A unique talent, Demetri Martin is one of the hottest stand-up comics working today. His new special, Demetri Martin. Person. Inventive and insightful, this top-rated program brings the funny in ways you''ve never seen.', 'A unique talent, Demetri Martin is one of the hottest stand-up comics working today. His new special, Demetri Martin. Person. Inventive and insightful, this top-rated program brings the funny in ways you''ve never seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaG1cisIvh6CHLkYCWncF7wJDLs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108177'),
  ('398539214208895349', 'Demetrius and the Gladiators', 1954, 'Adventure, History, Drama', 'Milton Krasner, Delmer Daves', 'Philip Dunne', 'Victor Mature, Susan Hayward, Michael Rennie, Debra Paget, Anne Bancroft, Jay Robinson, Ernest Borgnine, Richard Egan', 'NR', 'The story picks up at the point where "The Robe" ends, following the martyrdom of Diana and Marcellus. Christ''s robe is conveyed to Peter for safe-keeping, but the emperor Caligula wants it back to benefit from its powers. Marcellus'' former slave Demetrius seeks to prevent this, and catches the eye of Messalina, wife to Caligula''s uncle Claudius. Messalina tempts Demetrius, he winds up fighting in the arena, and wavers in his faith.', 'The story picks up at the point where "The Robe" ends, following the martyrdom of Diana and Marcellus. Christ''s robe is conveyed to Peter for safe-keeping, but the emperor Caligula wants it back to benefit from its powers. Marcellus'' former slave Demetrius seeks to prevent this, and catches the eye of Messalina, wife to Caligula''s uncle Claudius. Messalina tempts Demetrius, he winds up fighting in the arena, and wavers in his faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZHr0738TLaQWC9CXCQGpw85XUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43332'),
  ('77270755911107498', 'Demi Lovato: Simply Complicated', 2017, 'Music, Documentary', 'Carlos Verón, Hannah Lux Davis', null, 'Demi Lovato, Dallas Lovato, Madison De La Garza, Wilmer Valderrama, Nick Jonas, Joe Jonas, Billy Ray Cyrus, Sirah', 'NR', 'A personal and intimate look into Demi Lovato''s life as not only a regular 25 year old, but also one of the biggest pop stars in the world.', 'A personal and intimate look into Demi Lovato''s life as not only a regular 25 year old, but also one of the biggest pop stars in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zshRAbDYbnmMcadz7NglM8UoGzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481850'),
  ('960023421080187607', 'Demi-sœurs', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Christophe Graillot, Saphia Azzedine, François-Régis Jeanne', 'François-Régis Jeanne, Saphia Azzedine', 'Sabrina Ouazani, Alice David, Charlotte Gabris, Barbara Probst, Patrick Chesnais, Meriem Serbah, Ouidad Elma, Antoine Gouy', null, 'Lauren, a lovely 29-year-old it-girl, tries to break into the world of fashion by skimming Parisian parties. Olivia, a 28-year-old psychologist, has two obsessions: to save the confectionery of her parents, and to find her ideal husband. At the age of 26, Salma, a fiery young history teacher, still lives with her mother in the suburbs. Their roads have no reason to cross - until the day when, on the death of their biological father that they never knew, they inherit together a splendid Parisian apartment. For these three sisters who have nothing in common, cohabitation will prove to be explosive, to say the least.', 'Lauren, a lovely 29-year-old it-girl, tries to break into the world of fashion by skimming Parisian parties. Olivia, a 28-year-old psychologist, has two obsessions: to save the confectionery of her parents, and to find her ideal husband. At the age of 26, Salma, a fiery young history teacher, still lives with her mother in the suburbs. Their roads have no reason to cross - until the day when, on the death of their biological father that they never knew, they inherit together a splendid Parisian apartment. For these three sisters who have nothing in common, cohabitation will prove to be explosive, to say the least.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLWj2jXRghK6mGQmeUHI7pwWzI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521092'),
  ('521752093745286544', 'Demidovy', 1983, 'Drama, TV Movie, History', 'Yaropolk Lapshin, Anatoly Lesnikov', 'Vladimir Akimov, Eduard Volodarskiy', 'Evgeniy Evstigneev, Vadim Spiridonov, Aleksandr Lazarev, Leonid Kuravlyov, Mikhail Kozakov, Tatyana Tashkova, Lidiya Fedoseyeva-Shukshina, Valeriy Zolotukhin', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKKjJg663LzppviVqIEdDYHsOwd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376188'),
  ('820283711570287714', 'Demobbed', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Roman Kachanov, Anatoliy Susekov, Andrey Shepelev', 'Ivan Okhlobystin, Roman Kachanov', 'Pyotr Korshunkov, Mikhail Petrovsky, Stanislav Duzhnikov, Viktor Pavlov, Aleksandr Belyavskiy, Juozas Budraitis, Sergei Artsybashev, Vladimir Shainskiy', null, 'The student, Rifle, has managed to seduce his professor''s wife, Bomber, an average working guy, has bought a factory and Bullet, the casino lover, is hiding from creditors. They all share a common path and conscription. In the army they teach you that everything must be smart and in order - cockades, straps and all, otherwise you''re not fit to call yourself a person, you''re a maggot. For a real man, there''s no better place than the army.', 'The student, Rifle, has managed to seduce his professor''s wife, Bomber, an average working guy, has bought a factory and Bullet, the casino lover, is hiding from creditors. They all share a common path and conscription. In the army they teach you that everything must be smart and in order - cockades, straps and all, otherwise you''re not fit to call yourself a person, you''re a maggot. For a real man, there''s no better place than the army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxlffqupxvNatCmVPymb2ztceJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64266'),
  ('438194896213221379', 'Democracy', 2015, 'Documentary', 'David Bernet', 'David Bernet', 'Jan Philipp Albrecht, Viviane Reding, Ralf Bendrath, Katarzyna Szymielewicz, Tanguy van Overstraeten, Axel Voss, Séan Kelly, Erika Mann', null, 'Digitalization has changed society. While data is becoming the "new oil", data protection is becoming the new "pollution control". This creative documentary opens an astonishing inside view into the lawmaking milieu on EU level. A compelling story of how a group of politicians try to protect todays society against the impact of Big Data and mass surveillance.', 'Digitalization has changed society. While data is becoming the "new oil", data protection is becoming the new "pollution control". This creative documentary opens an astonishing inside view into the lawmaking milieu on EU level. A compelling story of how a group of politicians try to protect todays society against the impact of Big Data and mass surveillance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iRYVslhaJiwKQf3YsquPkx4cgg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367188'),
  ('1097741110743597228', 'Demolishing and Building Up the Star Theatre', 1901, 'Documentary', 'Frederick S. Armitage', null, null, null, 'Time-lapse photography showing the one month-long demolition of the Star Theatre in New York.', 'Time-lapse photography showing the one month-long demolition of the Star Theatre in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/youDZMI8enA8NRXvoTUM8baDgj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129863'),
  ('243226116152531659', 'Demolition', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Marc Vallée, Yves Bélanger, Urs Hirschbiegel', 'Bryan Sipe', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Naomi Watts, Chris Cooper, Judah Lewis, C.J. Wilson, Polly Draper, Malachy Cleary, Debra Monk', 'R', 'An emotionally desperate investment banker finds hope through a woman he meets.', 'An emotionally desperate investment banker finds hope through a woman he meets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4t56LZ1KbOOxgKfqMKN6truBDVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303991'),
  ('1017975840271016092', 'Demolition High', 1996, 'Action', 'Jim Wynorski, Zoran Hochstätter, Franklin A. Vallette', 'Steve Jankowski', 'Corey Haim, Alan Thicke, Dick Van Patten, Jeff Kober, Melissa Brasselle, Kimberley Roberts, Trey Alexander, Richard Styles', 'PG-13', 'When a group of terrorists (led by Luther) take over a high school making the students in it their hostages, it is up to several of the students (led by Lenny) to help prevent disaster while the authorities (Slater and General Wainwright) do their part on the other side.', 'When a group of terrorists (led by Luther) take over a high school making the students in it their hostages, it is up to several of the students (led by Lenny) to help prevent disaster while the authorities (Slater and General Wainwright) do their part on the other side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p70T94feMhymjddRBtEbQRxFy1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103602'),
  ('185963716667059282', 'Demolition Man', 1993, 'Crime, Action, Science Fiction', 'Marco Brambilla, Alex Thomson, Tom Priestley Jr.', 'Daniel Waters, Robert Reneau, Peter M. Lenkov', 'Sylvester Stallone, Wesley Snipes, Sandra Bullock, Nigel Hawthorne, Benjamin Bratt, Rob Schneider, Bob Gunton, Glenn Shadix', 'R', 'In 1996, brash L.A. detective John Spartan and maniac killer Simon Phoenix are both sentenced to decades in a cryogenic prison as punishment for a rescue mission gone wrong. When Phoenix escapes 36 years later to wreak havoc on the future, Spartan is awakened to capture his nemesis the old-fashioned way.', 'In 1996, brash L.A. detective John Spartan and maniac killer Simon Phoenix are both sentenced to decades in a cryogenic prison as punishment for a rescue mission gone wrong. When Phoenix escapes 36 years later to wreak havoc on the future, Spartan is awakened to capture his nemesis the old-fashioned way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dq6AmlVFo92PRuoLCcIyFdoRuxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9739'),
  ('614963275264176346', 'Demolition of a Wall', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, 'Auguste Lumière', null, 'Auguste Lumière directs four workers in the demolition of an old wall at the Lumière factory. One worker is pressing the wall inwards with a jackscrew, while another is pushing it with a pick. When the wall hits the ground, a cloud of white dust whirls up. Three workers continue the demolition of the wall with picks.', 'Auguste Lumière directs four workers in the demolition of an old wall at the Lumière factory. One worker is pressing the wall inwards with a jackscrew, while another is pushing it with a pick. When the wall hits the ground, a cloud of white dust whirls up. Three workers continue the demolition of the wall with picks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0L46CZ6OxsvixfEklHGtF1JOHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129865'),
  ('792852579828707047', 'Demolition University', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Brian Hennessy, Kevin Tenney, Zoran Hochstätter', 'Steve Jankowski', 'Corey Haim, Ami Dolenz, Laraine Newman, Todd Allen, Robert Forster, Erin Beaux, Khrystyne Haje, Michele Maika', 'NR', 'College students on a field trip encounter terrorists planning to poison the city''s water supply.', 'College students on a field trip encounter terrorists planning to poison the city''s water supply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJtvp5wbtLxWBY87gBNOMRH78Mq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55712'),
  ('397182909599827016', 'Demon', 2015, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Marcin Wrona, Paweł Flis, Małgorzata Suwała', 'Paweł Maślona, Marcin Wrona', 'Itay Tiran, Agnieszka Żulewska, Andrzej Grabowski, Tomasz Schuchardt, Adam Woronowicz, Włodzimierz Press, Tomasz Ziętek, Katarzyna Gniewkowska', 'R', 'A bridegroom is possessed by an unquiet spirit in the midst of his own wedding celebration, in this clever take on the Jewish legend of the dybbuk.', 'A bridegroom is possessed by an unquiet spirit in the midst of his own wedding celebration, in this clever take on the Jewish legend of the dybbuk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyGOeGI6mnzkmojSnqJvWvDqtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356191'),
  ('982410807506493826', 'Demon City', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Seiji Tanaka, Takashi Tanimoto, Koji Takado', 'Seiji Tanaka', 'Toma Ikuta, Masahiro Higashide, Miou Tanaka, Ami Touma, Taro Suruga, Mai Kiryu, Naoto Takenaka, Takuma Otoo', 'R', 'Framed for his family''s murder and left for dead, an ex-hitman will stop at nothing to exact revenge on the masked "demons" who have taken over his city.', 'Framed for his family''s murder and left for dead, an ex-hitman will stop at nothing to exact revenge on the masked "demons" who have taken over his city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQ9hzto0cUuxjfzqNAiAnNJo8O7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1405338'),
  ('534806347930043804', 'Demon City Shinjuku', 1988, 'Action, Fantasy, Animation, Horror', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri', 'Kaori Okamura', 'Hideyuki Hori, Hiromi Tsuru, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Kyoko Tongu, Yusaku Yara, Banjo Ginga, Ichiro Nagai, Osamu Saka', null, 'Ten Years ago, Genichiro Izayoi died trying to stop the sorcerer Rebi Ra, and as a result Shinjuku became a playground for demons. And now, the day approaches when Rebi Ra will complete his decade-long ritual to plunge the rest of the world into chaos! As Genichiro''s son, it falls to Kyoya to venture into the heart of Shinjuku and put an end to the sorcerer his father couldn''t beat. Can Kyoya exceed his father''s legacy, or will the demons of Shinjuku create Hell on Earth?', 'Ten Years ago, Genichiro Izayoi died trying to stop the sorcerer Rebi Ra, and as a result Shinjuku became a playground for demons. And now, the day approaches when Rebi Ra will complete his decade-long ritual to plunge the rest of the world into chaos! As Genichiro''s son, it falls to Kyoya to venture into the heart of Shinjuku and put an end to the sorcerer his father couldn''t beat. Can Kyoya exceed his father''s legacy, or will the demons of Shinjuku create Hell on Earth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9O6Mewk4JmM7pLvsHt9Eyq92fWq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44179'),
  ('807806889395088860', 'Demon Cop', 1990, 'Horror, Action', 'Rocco Karega, Hal Miles, Hal Miles', 'Rocco Karega', 'Cameron Mitchell, Rocco Karega, Theresa Fenneaux, Ray Klein, Tony Zotta, Julia Westland, J. Arthur Dickinson, Duncan Larson', null, 'A former probationary officer who is a patient at a mental asylum escapes and prowls the city, looking for victims whose blood may cure the blood disease he has that has turned him into a werewolf-type monster.', 'A former probationary officer who is a patient at a mental asylum escapes and prowls the city, looking for victims whose blood may cure the blood disease he has that has turned him into a werewolf-type monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzrrcE7MRIYgoThi4SlLlrOVQrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150794'),
  ('258176746345878120', 'Demon Hunter', 2005, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Scott Ziehl, John Nasraway', 'Mitch Gould', 'William Bassett, Sean Patrick Flanery, Billy Drago, Colleen Porch, Tania Deighton, Lea Moreno Young, Johnny Tri Nguyen, Charles Howerton', 'R', 'After resolving a situation of exorcism, the half-breed demon hunter Jake Greyman reports to Cardinal White and they realize that the demon Asmodeus is impregnating many mortals trying to raise offspring. Cardinal White calls Sister Sarah Ryan to assist Jake in his hunting for Asmodeus and his women.', 'After resolving a situation of exorcism, the half-breed demon hunter Jake Greyman reports to Cardinal White and they realize that the demon Asmodeus is impregnating many mortals trying to raise offspring. Cardinal White calls Sister Sarah Ryan to assist Jake in his hunting for Asmodeus and his women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSqKoqa3yQ3EVPOD9jgElaXYffG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18969'),
  ('727539480681211215', 'Demon in the Bottle', 1996, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Adolfo Bartoli, Randall William Cook', 'Randall William Cook, Timothy Michaels', 'Ashley Tesoro, Michael Malota, Rahi Aziz, Michael Dubrow, Franklin A. Vallette, Lucian Cojocaru, Petre Constantin, Randall William Cook', 'PG', 'Four teenagers find a lost treasure buried by a 18th century pirate on a desert island. But they accidentally release the monster who lives inside a bottle, keeping the treasure.', 'Four teenagers find a lost treasure buried by a 18th century pirate on a desert island. But they accidentally release the monster who lives inside a bottle, keeping the treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYx91OwIjb4NwGM5bWDEZjptF5Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280804'),
  ('446533542729906823', 'Demon Inside', 2013, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Alfonso Pineda Ulloa, Berenice Gil, Carlos Manzo', 'Alfonso Pineda Ulloa', 'Paz Vega, Alfonso Herrera, Maya Zapata, Camila Selser, Johanna Murillo, Gala Montes, Yolanda Corrales, María de Orduña', null, 'Marta used to be a recognized and successful psychic, but after a dramatic experience, she loses faith in her gift and develops agoraphobia. She couldn''t see the devilish side of her rapper, Mario, and now, Marta is afraid that Mario will stalk her again. As soon as she released from the asylum, she moves to Monica''s uncle apartment. There, she feels safe. But soon, she has trouble with her crazy neighbors. And if this wasn''t enough, a spectrum starts to haunt her, making her life impossible. Marta will have to fight against all these difficulties and manage to get her gift back before Mario finds her.', 'Marta used to be a recognized and successful psychic, but after a dramatic experience, she loses faith in her gift and develops agoraphobia. She couldn''t see the devilish side of her rapper, Mario, and now, Marta is afraid that Mario will stalk her again. As soon as she released from the asylum, she moves to Monica''s uncle apartment. There, she feels safe. But soon, she has trouble with her crazy neighbors. And if this wasn''t enough, a spectrum starts to haunt her, making her life impossible. Marta will have to fight against all these difficulties and manage to get her gift back before Mario finds her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DGEFIH6bJ90kh8RESinFtmRWGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232612'),
  ('252289058667535681', 'Demon Is on the Island', 1983, 'Horror', 'Francis Leroi, Jacques Assuérus', 'Francis Leroi', 'Anny Duperey, Jean-Claude Brialy, Pierre Santini, Gabriel Cattand, Janine Magnan, Caroline Silhol, Cerise, Catherine Alcover', null, 'An epidemic of appliance madness unrelated to discount sales strikes an island off the coast of France: the islanders are being murderously attacked by ovens and refrigerators acquired in the same department store. Enter the young Dr. Gabrielle Martin (Anny Duperey), who arrives here to escape her own personal tragedy and instead lands in the middle of the kitchen mania. She tracks down the cause of the rapidly spreading epidemic to another doctor on the island — quite as insane as any of the kitchen appliances (if the comparison could be made) — and finds that the villainous doctor and the appliances have a most unusual link. Graphic scenes of mutilation by an oven, as one example, leave nothing much to the imagination in this film, but the interpretations of actors Anny Duperey and Jean-Claude Brialy as the good and evil doctors are excellent.', 'An epidemic of appliance madness unrelated to discount sales strikes an island off the coast of France: the islanders are being murderously attacked by ovens and refrigerators acquired in the same department store. Enter the young Dr. Gabrielle Martin (Anny Duperey), who arrives here to escape her own personal tragedy and instead lands in the middle of the kitchen mania. She tracks down the cause of the rapidly spreading epidemic to another doctor on the island — quite as insane as any of the kitchen appliances (if the comparison could be made) — and finds that the villainous doctor and the appliances have a most unusual link. Graphic scenes of mutilation by an oven, as one example, leave nothing much to the imagination in this film, but the interpretations of actors Anny Duperey and Jean-Claude Brialy as the good and evil doctors are excellent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfweLuePgIjQLpuB9rkJjr4D8CQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11669'),
  ('114057640944534146', 'Demon Lover Diary', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Joel DeMott', null, 'Joel DeMott, Jeff Kreines, Mark Rance, Jerry Younkins, Donald G. Jackson, Carol Lasowski, Bill Baetz', null, 'The film chronicles filmmaker Joel DeMott, significant other/film partner Jeff Kreines and filmmaker Mark Rance as they head to Michigan to make a low budget horror film.', 'The film chronicles filmmaker Joel DeMott, significant other/film partner Jeff Kreines and filmmaker Mark Rance as they head to Michigan to make a low budget horror film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Tzpjh7QhbVFwj90vcv4HHBEYxG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91226'),
  ('342488159028067198', 'Demon of Paradise', 1987, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Cirio H. Santiago, Ricardo Remias', 'Cirio H. Santiago', 'Kathryn Witt, William Steis, Laura Banks, Frederick Bailey, Leslie Scarborough, Henry Strzalkowski, Nick Nicholson, Liza Baumann', 'R', 'Hunters become the hunted when illegal dynamite disturbs the ageold slumber of a carnivorous lizardman. Resort owner Angela, joins forces with Sheriff Keefer to save tourists from the beast''s path of death.', 'Hunters become the hunted when illegal dynamite disturbs the ageold slumber of a carnivorous lizardman. Resort owner Angela, joins forces with Sheriff Keefer to save tourists from the beast''s path of death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNx1hqwbmhj2Cn6z87bXXNrOaMr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30928'),
  ('394477196633521708', 'Demon of the Lute', 1983, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Tang Tak-Cheung, Wong Wai-Sum, Lo Yuen-Ming', 'Tang Tak-Cheung', 'Chin Siu-Ho, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Kei Kong-Hung, Phillip Kwok Chui, Lung Tien-hsiang, Jason Pai Piao, Kwan Fung, Richard Yuen Tak', null, 'A group of heroes is assigned a mission to find a magical flute that has the capacity to annihilate everything in a certain radius.', 'A group of heroes is assigned a mission to find a magical flute that has the capacity to annihilate everything in a certain radius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHB6SzJlYcXqhbT6Yo20DjTjl8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152251'),
  ('321811653866495164', 'Demon Pond', 1979, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Masahiro Shinoda, Noritaka Sakamoto, Masao Kosugi', 'Tsutomu Tamura, Haruhiko Mimura', 'Tamasaburō Bandō V, Gō Katō, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Kōji Nanbara, Yatsuko Tan''ami, Hisashi Igawa, Norihei Miki, Juro Kara', null, 'When a lone traveler stumbles upon a remote, drought-stricken village, he finds himself engulfed in a whirlpool of myth, mystery, and magic: in a nearby pond reside spirits who hold the fate of the town’s inhabitants, including lovers Akira and Yuri, in their hands.', 'When a lone traveler stumbles upon a remote, drought-stricken village, he finds himself engulfed in a whirlpool of myth, mystery, and magic: in a nearby pond reside spirits who hold the fate of the town’s inhabitants, including lovers Akira and Yuri, in their hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoMAhw8udztiQyolNoaXbvijHQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117215'),
  ('52296811077676552', 'Demon Seed', 1977, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Donald Cammell, Alan Brimfeld, Edward Teets', 'Roger O. Hirson, Robert Jaffe', 'Julie Christie, Fritz Weaver, Gerrit Graham, Berry Kroeger, Lisa Lu, Larry J. Blake, John O''Leary, Alfred Dennis', 'R', 'A scientist creates Proteus, an organic supercomputer with artificial intelligence which becomes obsessed with human beings, and in particular the creator''s wife.', 'A scientist creates Proteus, an organic supercomputer with artificial intelligence which becomes obsessed with human beings, and in particular the creator''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rAbL1cI5TYB1RmXsPPHnLwnDsi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18775'),
  ('362573463156920607', 'Demon Slayer -Kimetsu no Yaiba- The Movie: Mugen Train', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Haruo Sotozaki, Takuro Takahashi, Haruo Sotozaki', null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Akari Kito, Hiro Shimono, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Satoshi Hino, Takahiro Sakurai, Katsuyuki Konishi, Saori Hayami', 'R', 'Tanjiro Kamado, joined with Inosuke Hashibira, a boy raised by boars who wears a boar''s head, and Zenitsu Agatsuma, a scared boy who reveals his true power when he sleeps, boards the Infinity Train on a new mission with the Fire Hashira, Kyojuro Rengoku, to defeat a demon who has been tormenting the people and killing the demon slayers who oppose it!', 'Tanjiro Kamado, joined with Inosuke Hashibira, a boy raised by boars who wears a boar''s head, and Zenitsu Agatsuma, a scared boy who reveals his true power when he sleeps, boards the Infinity Train on a new mission with the Fire Hashira, Kyojuro Rengoku, to defeat a demon who has been tormenting the people and killing the demon slayers who oppose it!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8Rb9gBr48ODIwYUttZNYeMWeUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635302'),
