  ('821304669700377373', 'Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba - Sibling''s Bond', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Haruo Sotozaki', null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Akari Kito, Takahiro Sakurai, Hochu Otsuka, Yuki Kaji, Ai Kakuma, Daisuke Namikawa, Toshihiko Seki', 'PG-13', 'Tanjiro Kamado returns home to find his family slaughtered and the lone survivor, his sister Nezuko, turned into a Demon. To his surprise, however, Nezuko still shows signs of human emotion and thought. Thus begins Tanjiro''s journey to seek out the Demon who killed their family and turn his sister human again. A recap of Kimetsu no Yaiba episodes 1–5, with new footage and special end credits.', 'Tanjiro Kamado returns home to find his family slaughtered and the lone survivor, his sister Nezuko, turned into a Demon. To his surprise, however, Nezuko still shows signs of human emotion and thought. Thus begins Tanjiro''s journey to seek out the Demon who killed their family and turn his sister human again. A recap of Kimetsu no Yaiba episodes 1–5, with new footage and special end credits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnXeOfHXsgCRi4u75OPU2U3kZsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820232'),
  ('485292538286118427', 'Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Infinity Castle', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Haruo Sotozaki, Akira Matsushima, Yuichi Terao', 'Hikaru Kondô, Koyoharu Gotouge', 'Natsuki Hanae, Takahiro Sakurai, Akira Ishida, Hiro Shimono, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Saori Hayami, Mamoru Miyano, Reina Ueda', 'R', 'The Demon Slayer Corps are drawn into the Infinity Castle, where Tanjiro, Nezuko, and the Hashira face terrifying Upper Rank demons in a desperate fight as the final battle against Muzan Kibutsuji begins.', 'The Demon Slayer Corps are drawn into the Infinity Castle, where Tanjiro, Nezuko, and the Hashira face terrifying Upper Rank demons in a desperate fight as the final battle against Muzan Kibutsuji begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWVSwgjpT2D78VUh6X8UBd2rorW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1311031'),
  ('125319260106686562', 'Demon Squad: Tooth and Claw', 2026, 'Fantasy, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kris Skoda', 'Erin Lilley, Devon Coleman', 'Khristian Fulmer, Ginger Cressman, Rob Eubanks, Iona Yabut, Victoria Antonelli', null, 'When a string of brutal killings are linked to a werewolf, paranormal investigator Nick Moon goes on the hunt. Battling supernatural forces, he uncovers a dark conspiracy that must be stopped before the monster strikes again.', 'When a string of brutal killings are linked to a werewolf, paranormal investigator Nick Moon goes on the hunt. Battling supernatural forces, he uncovers a dark conspiracy that must be stopped before the monster strikes again.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fs4KjTRsxdQF1BBKXvYadA6OJFEc.jpg', 'plex:movie:demon-squad-tooth-and-claw'),
  ('231051284166434696', 'Demon Under Glass', 2002, 'Horror', 'Michael Dean, Jon Cunningham', 'Jon Cunningham, Deborah Warner', 'Jason Carter, Garett Maggart, Jack Donner, Denise Alessandria Hurd, Ray Proscia, Harrison Young, Jean St. James, Kira Reed Lorsch', null, 'The city of Los Angeles is being terrorized by a serial killer who preys on youthful females and bleeds them dry after abusing them. With no calling card, no tangible forensic evidence and a growing list of victims, a specialty force made up of highly skilled authorities is called in. When one of their own goes in to trap the killer, will she come out alive, or will the killer have the upper hand?', 'The city of Los Angeles is being terrorized by a serial killer who preys on youthful females and bleeds them dry after abusing them. With no calling card, no tangible forensic evidence and a growing list of victims, a specialty force made up of highly skilled authorities is called in. When one of their own goes in to trap the killer, will she come out alive, or will the killer have the upper hand?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvNA7KQOhC4AZqaUUpy6Az9w4S4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74019'),
  ('898347341823780156', 'Demon Warriors', 2007, 'Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Thanakorn Pongsuwan, Apirak Gunpairoh, Panomporn Katthachan', 'Yutnathorn Kaewthong, Thanakorn Pongsuwan', 'Nirut Sirijanya, Pongpat Wachirabunjong, Somchai Kemklad, Shahkrit Yamnarm, Putthipong Sriwat, Ray MacDonald, Athip Nana, Khemapsorn Sirisukha', null, 'A detective commits suicide in order to enter the spiritual realm between life and death, to gain supernatural powers to defeat the evil overlord Sadok. However, with each battle he must sacrifice one of his five mortal senses.', 'A detective commits suicide in order to enter the spiritual realm between life and death, to gain supernatural powers to defeat the evil overlord Sadok. However, with each battle he must sacrifice one of his five mortal senses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPDwPFhDFDqY0RhXQiAXq7cCWPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27436'),
  ('292683145396171436', 'Demon Wind', 1990, 'Horror', 'Charles Philip Moore, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Charles Philip Moore', 'Eric Larson, Francine Lapensée, Rufus Norris, Jack Forcinito, Mark David Fritsche, Stephen Quadros, Sherry Leigh, Bobby Johnston', 'R', 'The strange and brutal deaths of Cory’s grandparents has haunted him for years. Determined to discover the truth, he has returned to the desolate region where they lived, along with a group of friends, to try and uncover the mystery. Ignoring warnings from the locals that the area is cursed, Cory and his friends soon realize that the legend is true, as the Demon Wind, possesses and destroys them, one by one, turning them into monsters from hell.', 'The strange and brutal deaths of Cory’s grandparents has haunted him for years. Determined to discover the truth, he has returned to the desolate region where they lived, along with a group of friends, to try and uncover the mystery. Ignoring warnings from the locals that the area is cursed, Cory and his friends soon realize that the legend is true, as the Demon Wind, possesses and destroys them, one by one, turning them into monsters from hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2H1ilFKFcD73o1G52NOJMkO8DI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58899'),
  ('737732856972011475', 'Demon Witch Child', 1975, 'Horror', 'Amando de Ossorio, Vicente Minaya Ortega, Francisco Rodríguez', 'Amando de Ossorio', 'Julián Mateos, Marian Salgado, Fernando Sancho, Lone Fleming, Ángel del Pozo, Kali Hansa, Daniel Martín, Tota Alba', 'R', 'After an old witch desecrates a church and abducts a baby, the police take her in for questioning, leading her to attempt suicide. To exact revenge, a fellow witch curses the police commissioner''s daughter, and as the old witch dies, her spirit latches onto the young girl and causes her to wreak havoc.', 'After an old witch desecrates a church and abducts a baby, the police take her in for questioning, leading her to attempt suicide. To exact revenge, a fellow witch curses the police commissioner''s daughter, and as the old witch dies, her spirit latches onto the young girl and causes her to wreak havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EHvJ8MsAE6zD42leoX5FQFpa74.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28072'),
  ('6528509717955179', 'Demonia', 1990, 'Horror', 'Lucio Fulci, Luigi Ciccarese', 'Piero Regnoli, Lucio Fulci', 'Brett Halsey, Meg Register, Lino Salemme, Christina Engelhardt, Pascal Druant, Carla Cassola, Michael Aronin, Al Cliver', null, 'Professor Malcolm Evans leads his archaeological expedition into the Valley of Temples in southeast Sicily. His companion and former student, Liza Harris, is looking forward to her very first dig. But Liza feels a strange sympathy with the valley and her recurring nightmares seem strongly tied to the nearby ruins. She is drawn to the remains of a 16th Century convent and its grisly legend of crucifixion. The local villagers rise to protect the entombed secrets of their ancestors, as Liza''s obsession with uncovering the truth takes her deeper into the forbidden ruins and further from sanity!', 'Professor Malcolm Evans leads his archaeological expedition into the Valley of Temples in southeast Sicily. His companion and former student, Liza Harris, is looking forward to her very first dig. But Liza feels a strange sympathy with the valley and her recurring nightmares seem strongly tied to the nearby ruins. She is drawn to the remains of a 16th Century convent and its grisly legend of crucifixion. The local villagers rise to protect the entombed secrets of their ancestors, as Liza''s obsession with uncovering the truth takes her deeper into the forbidden ruins and further from sanity!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oD86JcKm8PgfWzlAjDqTqJSf2S4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28847'),
  ('344965326712850755', 'Demonic', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Will Canon, Michael Fimognari, Ken Blakey', 'Will Canon, Doug Simon, Max La Bella', 'Dustin Milligan, Scott Mechlowicz, Cody H. Carolin, Maria Bello, Frank Grillo, Megan Park, Aaron Yoo, Alex Goode', 'R', 'A police officer and a psychologist investigate the deaths of five people who were killed while trying to summon ghosts.', 'A police officer and a psychologist investigate the deaths of five people who were killed while trying to summon ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ne0wAvbmzk72svslxjuFySrXEKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234212'),
  ('1062541931639439479', 'Demonic', 2021, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Hazelden, Neill Blomkamp', 'Neill Blomkamp', 'Carly Pope, Nathalie Boltt, Chris William Martin, Michael J Rogers, Kandyse McClure, Terry Chen, Jason Tremblay, Quinton Boisclair', 'R', 'A young woman unleashes terrifying demons when supernatural forces at the root of a decades-old rift between mother and daughter are ruthlessly revealed.', 'A young woman unleashes terrifying demons when supernatural forces at the root of a decades-old rift between mother and daughter are ruthlessly revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUK9duiCK1PKqWA5rRQ4XBMHITH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774021'),
