  ('178799862214920843', 'Demons', 1985, 'Horror', 'Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Lamberto Bava, Michele Soavi', 'Lamberto Bava, Franco Ferrini, Dario Argento', 'Urbano Barberini, Natasha Hovey, Karl Zinny, Fiore Argento, Paola Cozzo, Fabiola Toledo, Nicoletta Elmi, Stelio Candelli', 'NR', 'A group of people are trapped in a West Berlin movie theater infested with ravenous demons who proceed to kill and possess the humans one-by-one, thereby multiplying their numbers.', 'A group of people are trapped in a West Berlin movie theater infested with ravenous demons who proceed to kill and possess the humans one-by-one, thereby multiplying their numbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ym0mtcSt6i45NIcAoSBQhop0wSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14029'),
  ('747303099055476409', 'Démons', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Marcial Di Fonzo Bo, Nicolas Mesdom', 'Lars Norén', 'Romain Duris, Marina Foïs, Anaïs Demoustier, Stéfan Konarshe, Lola Guichard', null, 'A married couple lives in a state of mutual loathing, contemplating divorce until they invite their younger neighbours over for a drink. In that moment, the happy young couple is dragged into the bitter resentment and psychological warfare of the older pair.', 'A married couple lives in a state of mutual loathing, contemplating divorce until they invite their younger neighbours over for a drink. In that moment, the happy young couple is dragged into the bitter resentment and psychological warfare of the older pair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wwMx5wEhson4lphOpzIdKVr5wia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362467'),
