  ('424169835349692476', 'Demons of the Mind', 1972, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Sykes, Arthur Grant, Ted Morley', 'Christopher Wicking', 'Robert Hardy, Shane Briant, Gillian Hills, Yvonne Mitchell, Paul Jones, Patrick Magee, Kenneth J. Warren, Michael Hordern', 'R', 'A physician discovers that two children are being kept virtually imprisoned in their house by their father. He investigates, and discovers a web of sex, incest and satanic possession.', 'A physician discovers that two children are being kept virtually imprisoned in their house by their father. He investigates, and discovers a web of sex, incest and satanic possession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ve0midvftE2RkBbLqaFomqqRzXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46359'),
  ('828462970057571474', 'Demons of War', 1998, 'War, Drama', 'Władysław Pasikowski, Paweł Edelman', 'Władysław Pasikowski', 'Bogusław Linda, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Tadeusz Huk, Mirosław Baka, Artur Żmijewski, Olaf Lubaszenko, Alja Nikitović, Denis Delić', null, 'A detachment of the Polish IFOR forces in Bosnia is led by Major Keller, who is being investigated for insubordination during a patrol in Srebrenica. The investigation is to be led by two arriving officers - Lieutenant Czacki and Major Kusz who will also replace Keller as CO. When the camp''s RTO receives a communication from a downed Norwegian chopper, Keller ignores his standing orders and leads a platoon to rescue the crew.', 'A detachment of the Polish IFOR forces in Bosnia is led by Major Keller, who is being investigated for insubordination during a patrol in Srebrenica. The investigation is to be led by two arriving officers - Lieutenant Czacki and Major Kusz who will also replace Keller as CO. When the camp''s RTO receives a communication from a downed Norwegian chopper, Keller ignores his standing orders and leads a platoon to rescue the crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNYUJMdRepEvaBWYv4Y7GlIEDyk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38373'),
  ('972734650644870379', 'Demonte Colony 2', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'R. Ajay Gnanamuthu, Harish Kannan', 'R. Ajay Gnanamuthu, Venky Venugopal Rajavel', 'Arulnithi, Priya Bhavani Shankar, Tsering Dorjee Bawa, Antti Jääskeläinen, C. Arun Pandian, Muthukumar, Meenakshi Govindarajan, Sarjano Khalid', null, 'Debbie attempts to contact the spirit of her deceased husband Sam, she inadvertently contacts Srinivasan, who had just died. This contact saves his life but leaves him in a coma for years. Later, Debbie unravels mystery about Lord Demonte sacrificing people and enslaves their spirits. Can Debbie break this cycle and help Srinivasan to wake up from his coma?', 'Debbie attempts to contact the spirit of her deceased husband Sam, she inadvertently contacts Srinivasan, who had just died. This contact saves his life but leaves him in a coma for years. Later, Debbie unravels mystery about Lord Demonte sacrificing people and enslaves their spirits. Can Debbie break this cycle and help Srinivasan to wake up from his coma?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZmH9hea8fstTK49fplSQS0NWUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979250'),
  ('624745347215574927', 'Demonwarp', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Emmett Alston, R. Michael Stringer', 'Bruce Akiyama, Jim Bertges', 'George Kennedy, David Michael O''Neill, Pamela Gilbert, Billy Jayne, Colleen McDermott, Michelle Bauer, Hank Stratton, Shannon Kennedy', 'R', 'A man and his daughter are attacked in the woods by what they believe is a Bigfoot-type creature. However, they soon begin to suspect that they may have stumbled onto a nest of aliens in a hidden spacecraft.', 'A man and his daughter are attacked in the woods by what they believe is a Bigfoot-type creature. However, they soon begin to suspect that they may have stumbled onto a nest of aliens in a hidden spacecraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zg4jUEjRhHmTD1iu2MlpTfWXbn1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29315'),
