  ('330109454323443881', 'Den Brother', 2010, 'Comedy, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mark L. Taylor, David A. Makin', 'Jim Krieg, Michael Horowitz', 'Hutch Dano, Genevieve Hannelius, Vicki Lewis, Kelsey Asbille, David Lambert, Kelly Gould, Taylar Hender, Kiara Muhammad', null, 'Alex Pearson has a lot to learn about teamwork. As the star of the Lemon Oaks hockey team, Alex almost always has his way on and off the ice. That is until he pulls a stunt so outrageous not even his own coach can give him a pass. His punishment? Suspension from the team, a never-ending list of chores and a job watching his little sister Emily after school.', 'Alex Pearson has a lot to learn about teamwork. As the star of the Lemon Oaks hockey team, Alex almost always has his way on and off the ice. That is until he pulls a stunt so outrageous not even his own coach can give him a pass. His punishment? Suspension from the team, a never-ending list of chores and a job watching his little sister Emily after school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5oWZJChuObK0STDK3FiPNgxzFfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46064'),
  ('959545486113864573', 'Den of Thieves', 2018, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Christian Gudegast, Terry Stacey, Gary Capo', 'Christian Gudegast', 'Gerard Butler, Pablo Schreiber, O''Shea Jackson Jr., 50 Cent, Meadow Williams, Maurice Compte, Brian Van Holt, Evan Jones', 'R', 'A gritty crime saga which follows the lives of an elite unit of the LA County Sheriff''s Dept. and the state''s most successful bank robbery crew as the outlaws plan a seemingly impossible heist on the Federal Reserve Bank.', 'A gritty crime saga which follows the lives of an elite unit of the LA County Sheriff''s Dept. and the state''s most successful bank robbery crew as the outlaws plan a seemingly impossible heist on the Federal Reserve Bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cahr8gscRMjxbOJ8PddKGjH5NB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449443'),
