  ('953704127787730867', 'Denial', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Mick Jackson, Haris Zambarloukos, Christina Moore', 'David Hare', 'Rachel Weisz, Tom Wilkinson, Timothy Spall, Andrew Scott, Jack Lowden, Caren Pistorius, Alex Jennings, Harriet Walter', 'PG-13', 'Acclaimed writer and historian Deborah E. Lipstadt must battle for historical truth to prove the Holocaust actually occurred when David Irving, a renowned denier, sues her for libel.', 'Acclaimed writer and historian Deborah E. Lipstadt must battle for historical truth to prove the Holocaust actually occurred when David Irving, a renowned denier, sues her for libel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJLbcWqV6sKwPpX5uT4xaklTgQz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402298'),
  ('471164110638685206', 'Denis', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Lionel Bailliu, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Lionel Bailliu, Laurent Roggero', 'Fabrice Eboué, Jean-Paul Rouve, Audrey Dana, Sara Giraudeau, Simon Astier, Amelle Chahbi, Charlotte Desgeorges, François Bureloup', null, 'Twice Vincent thinks he has found the woman of his life. Twice his ideal woman left him for the same man: Denis. Now Vincent is pursuing a happy love affair with Anna, but he fears that history is about to repeat itself. He tries to understand his adversary. Just what is it about him that makes him so irresistible to the opposite sex - his taste in gaudy shirts or the fact that he teaches wrestling as if it were a philosophy?', 'Twice Vincent thinks he has found the woman of his life. Twice his ideal woman left him for the same man: Denis. Now Vincent is pursuing a happy love affair with Anna, but he fears that history is about to repeat itself. He tries to understand his adversary. Just what is it about him that makes him so irresistible to the opposite sex - his taste in gaudy shirts or the fact that he teaches wrestling as if it were a philosophy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzK75i9grw1kMZNWVVMuXIk8aCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189021'),
  ('464927274608869511', 'Denis Leary: Lock ''N Load', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Ted Demme', null, 'Denis Leary', null, 'Actor/comic Denis Leary discusses family life, coffee, religion, and other topics in this stand-up special.', 'Actor/comic Denis Leary discusses family life, coffee, religion, and other topics in this stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkvxEx5Hhyz1zKXHVBthjxsS883.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32482'),
  ('80068166613447933', 'Denis Leary: No Cure for Cancer', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Ted Demme', 'Denis Leary, Bill Hicks', 'Denis Leary', 'NR', 'Ticked off comic Denis Leary talks honestly about subjects ranging from smoking, red meat, drugs, his family, rehab, and yes, cancer.', 'Ticked off comic Denis Leary talks honestly about subjects ranging from smoking, red meat, drugs, his family, rehab, and yes, cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjybZeS8uPK0nezEz1CEZpZcbpa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26797'),
  ('483014431408750982', 'Denise Calls Up', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Hal Salwen, Michael Mayers', 'Hal Salwen', 'Tim Daly, Caroleen Feeney, Dan Gunther, Dana Wheeler-Nicholson, Liev Schreiber, Aida Turturro, Alanna Ubach, Sylvia Miles', null, 'A group of friends in New York, working away at their PCs and laptops, keep in touch exclusively by phone and fax. They are all too busy to meet face to face. Gale plays matchmaker, by phone, to Jerry and Barbara who, in turn, hit it off beautifully – via phone and fax. Martin gets a telephone call from someone he''s never met. It''s Denise, with some extraordinary news. Tapping away at his computer all the while, he develops a sort of friendship with Denise – via phone. And so it goes as the friends, tap, tap, tapping away, share news, hopes, and dreams – via phone and fax. Finally Gale has an unfortunate encounter with a phone, Denise has some more news for Martin, and Frank plans a gala New Year''s Eve party, but will he answer the door?', 'A group of friends in New York, working away at their PCs and laptops, keep in touch exclusively by phone and fax. They are all too busy to meet face to face. Gale plays matchmaker, by phone, to Jerry and Barbara who, in turn, hit it off beautifully – via phone and fax. Martin gets a telephone call from someone he''s never met. It''s Denise, with some extraordinary news. Tapping away at his computer all the while, he develops a sort of friendship with Denise – via phone. And so it goes as the friends, tap, tap, tapping away, share news, hopes, and dreams – via phone and fax. Finally Gale has an unfortunate encounter with a phone, Denise has some more news for Martin, and Frank plans a gala New Year''s Eve party, but will he answer the door?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ab8iYcRfEAFwzcrkYP8tJBISX1E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47449'),
  ('32250744944381657', 'Dennis', 2007, 'Drama', 'Mads Matthiesen', 'Mads Matthiesen, Martin Zandvliet', 'Kim Kold, Elsebeth Steentoft, Lykke Sand Michelsen', null, 'When Dennis, an introvert bodybuilder, invites a local girl out on a date his mother is hurt and disappointed. Despite the pressure she puts on him to cancel the date, Dennis ventures into a night that he will never forget.', 'When Dennis, an introvert bodybuilder, invites a local girl out on a date his mother is hurt and disappointed. Despite the pressure she puts on him to cancel the date, Dennis ventures into a night that he will never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joj0WWTIMSa8kAiHeBpz3DtAWF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83284'),
  ('187459391578022847', 'Dennis the Menace', 1987, 'Family, Comedy', 'Arledge Armenaki, Doug Rogers', null, 'Russell Alexander, Gregory A. Belitz, Zachary Bostrom, Robert Clotworthy, Victor DiMattia, Patricia Estrin, John Paul Gamoke, Patsy Garrett', null, 'While digging in his front garden, Dennis finds a big bone. To prove it''s from a dinosaur, he persuades his father to invite an old buddy of him, Bowen Skyler III, who''s a famous ''dinosaur hunter''. Being desperate for publicity, Skyler informs press and television... and starts a paleontologic dig in their front garden.', 'While digging in his front garden, Dennis finds a big bone. To prove it''s from a dinosaur, he persuades his father to invite an old buddy of him, Bowen Skyler III, who''s a famous ''dinosaur hunter''. Being desperate for publicity, Skyler informs press and television... and starts a paleontologic dig in their front garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7x25op1ylIvndgGH3HtKMTJ1sEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171147'),
  ('995192729104216471', 'Dennis the Menace', 1993, 'Family, Comedy', 'Nick Castle, Thomas E. Ackerman, Jane Jenkins', 'John Hughes', 'Walter Matthau, Mason Gamble, Joan Plowright, Christopher Lloyd, Lea Thompson, Robert Stanton, Amy Sakasitz, Kellen Hathaway', 'PG', 'Mr. Wilson''s ever-present annoyance comes in the form of one mischievous kid named Dennis. But he''ll need Dennis''s tricks to uncover a collection of gold coins that go missing when a shady drifter named Switchblade Sam comes to town.', 'Mr. Wilson''s ever-present annoyance comes in the form of one mischievous kid named Dennis. But he''ll need Dennis''s tricks to uncover a collection of gold coins that go missing when a shady drifter named Switchblade Sam comes to town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t642WwGifbQ2fEuKTJRgpPzsgtX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12139'),
  ('1111170828724725239', 'Dennis the Menace Strikes Again!', 1998, 'Family, Comedy', 'Charles T. Kanganis, Christopher Faloona, Jerry Grandey', 'Robert Newmyer', 'Don Rickles, George Kennedy, Justin Cooper, Betty White, Brian Doyle-Murray, Carrot Top, Dwier Brown, Heidi Swedberg', 'G', 'Barricade the doors. Lock the windows. Because he''s baaaack. That one-boy wrecking crew, Dennis the Menace, returns for more mischief and mayhem. Based on the comic strip and TV show about a mischievous little boy with a gift for the potentially lethal prank.', 'Barricade the doors. Lock the windows. Because he''s baaaack. That one-boy wrecking crew, Dennis the Menace, returns for more mischief and mayhem. Based on the comic strip and TV show about a mischievous little boy with a gift for the potentially lethal prank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6fxRpHNdSA3yv8prMo1sNzOcgF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45242'),
  ('409821637450286586', 'Dentist on the Job', 1961, 'Comedy', 'C.M. Pennington-Richards, Stephen Dade', 'Hazel Adair, Hugh Woodhouse', 'Bob Monkhouse, Kenneth Connor, Shirley Eaton, Ronnie Stevens, Eric Barker, Reginald Beckwith, Richard Wattis, Charles Hawtrey', null, 'Colonel Proudfoot of Proudfoot Industries tries to entice a couple of newly qualified dentists to advertise "Dreem", a revolutionary type of toothpaste, but he knows that if the dentists learn that they are part of an advertising campaign, they will be struck off, and the campaign will be a disaster.', 'Colonel Proudfoot of Proudfoot Industries tries to entice a couple of newly qualified dentists to advertise "Dreem", a revolutionary type of toothpaste, but he knows that if the dentists learn that they are part of an advertising campaign, they will be struck off, and the campaign will be a disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNj9LB76lllJKAfGRxRP2An22s6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130836'),
  ('981193892913384900', 'Denver and Rio Grande', 1952, 'Western', 'Byron Haskin, Ray Rennahan', 'Frank Gruber', 'Edmond O''Brien, Sterling Hayden, Dean Jagger, Kasey Rogers, Lyle Bettger, J. Carrol Naish, Zasu Pitts, Tom Powers', 'NR', 'Jim Vesser and his team of railroading men try to build a rail line through a mountain pass, while a group of less scrupulous construction workers sabotages the entire operation in the hopes that they can get their tracks laid first and get the money from the railroad.', 'Jim Vesser and his team of railroading men try to build a rail line through a mountain pass, while a group of less scrupulous construction workers sabotages the entire operation in the hopes that they can get their tracks laid first and get the money from the railroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bla214OWr1tu8LS9WrTlrJG1aSw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119229'),
  ('46520482102040996', 'Denzel Washington: A Model American', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Sonia Dauger', null, 'Spike Lee, Steven Spielberg, Martin Scorsese, Matthew Broderick, Kenneth Branagh', null, 'In 30 years of a deeply committed career and 50 roles, Denzel Washington, double-Oscar winner, placed the figure of the Black man in all its complexity at the heart of the American paradoxes: from Black activist, rebel soldier to gangster torn between violence and charity. Voted best actor of the 21st century by the New York Times a few months ago, Denzel Washington, 65, has risen to the top of American cinema. As an Actor, director and producer, he has shaken up a "color line" as immutable as it is subtle. Often identified with his characters, he reveals himself to be disconcerting and paradoxical. As if he were holding up a mirror to America in which all of its contradictions and failings were reflected. A documentary that chronicles the extraordinary career of the world-renowned African-American actor.', 'In 30 years of a deeply committed career and 50 roles, Denzel Washington, double-Oscar winner, placed the figure of the Black man in all its complexity at the heart of the American paradoxes: from Black activist, rebel soldier to gangster torn between violence and charity. Voted best actor of the 21st century by the New York Times a few months ago, Denzel Washington, 65, has risen to the top of American cinema. As an Actor, director and producer, he has shaken up a "color line" as immutable as it is subtle. Often identified with his characters, he reveals himself to be disconcerting and paradoxical. As if he were holding up a mirror to America in which all of its contradictions and failings were reflected. A documentary that chronicles the extraordinary career of the world-renowned African-American actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4D7a1mWfnMufYoa2MeHy7BPpE1A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1033551'),
