  ('335343000279374557', 'Depression and Friends', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Éric Guichard, Arnaud Lemort', 'Arnaud Lemort', 'Fred Testot, Jonathan Lambert, Arié Elmaleh, Ary Abittan, Gyselle Soares, Charlie Bruneau, Anne Depétrini, Emmanuel Reichenbach', null, 'When Frank is diagnosed with depression, his friends try to cheer him up -- and it quickly becomes clear that they''re just as down and out as he is.', 'When Frank is diagnosed with depression, his friends try to cheer him up -- and it quickly becomes clear that they''re just as down and out as he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSbrihNBbvkx3e9y02VfX7wNINo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103344'),
  ('90269187239260394', 'Deputy Droopy', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Tex Avery, Michael Lah', null, 'Bill Thompson, Tex Avery, Daws Butler', null, 'Two outlaws are trying to steal a shipment of gold being guarded by Deputy Droopy, and have to keep quiet to avoid alerting the sheriff.', 'Two outlaws are trying to steal a shipment of gold being guarded by Deputy Droopy, and have to keep quiet to avoid alerting the sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1lGE9vu3uJu9C4tOqEFIzHkP89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84749'),
  ('293344034135473208', 'Der Baulöwe', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Georgi Kissimov, Wolfgang Braumann', 'Kurt Belicke', 'Rolf Herricht, Annekathrin Bürger, Agnes Kraus, Franziska Troegner, Herbert Köfer, Gerry Wolff, Eberhard Mellies, Hans Klering', null, 'The successful entertainment artist Ralf Keul must develop his land on the Baltic Sea or else ultimately give it up. Inexperienced yet courageous, he hurls himself into the undertaking, which spares him no unpleasantness. He battles over the transportation and procurement of materials, constantly on the verge of a nervous breakdown, while his craftsmen offer little additional assistance.', 'The successful entertainment artist Ralf Keul must develop his land on the Baltic Sea or else ultimately give it up. Inexperienced yet courageous, he hurls himself into the undertaking, which spares him no unpleasantness. He battles over the transportation and procurement of materials, constantly on the verge of a nervous breakdown, while his craftsmen offer little additional assistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgX0AWgkUOlQMuIH9XaWecCGrG4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77847'),
  ('163418344959194207', 'Der Beschützer - Wissen, das tötet', 2026, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ziska Riemann', 'Christian Kaps, Oke Stielow', 'Paula Conrad Hugenschmidt, Paula Essam, Philip Günsch, Alina Hidić, Jan Krauter', null, 'Mit einem Mord bei einem Energie-Startup beginnt ein schwieriger Auftrag für den BKA-Personenschützer Jan Schäfer: Ausländische Agenten erschießen den Gründer Julian Raabe bei dem Versuch, streng geheime Daten zu erhalten. Sein Geschäftspartner und Bruder Eduard entkommt, befindet sich nun aber in höchster Gefahr. Denn seine Forschungsergebnisse, die Wasserstoff als Energieträger profitabel machen, würden die Weltwirtschaft ebenso wie die Sicherheitspolitik verändern. Entgegen des Rates der Firmenanwältin will Eduard nicht klein beigeben. Schäfer und seine Kollegin Freuding erhalten daher den Auftrag, ihn und seine Familie zu schützen. Während sich Eduards Ehefrau Hanna mit der Abschottung abfindet, sorgt Sohn Marian für Schwierigkeiten. Um das Vertrauen des rebellischen Teenagers zu gewinnen, lässt Schäfer ihn in sein sorgsam gehütetes Privatleben blicken. Dass der Personenschützer professionelle Grundsätze lockert, bringt ungeahnte Risiken mit sich. Ausgerechnet an dem Ort seiner Verwundbarkeit muss Schäfer den Kampf aufnehmen.', 'Mit einem Mord bei einem Energie-Startup beginnt ein schwieriger Auftrag für den BKA-Personenschützer Jan Schäfer: Ausländische Agenten erschießen den Gründer Julian Raabe bei dem Versuch, streng geheime Daten zu erhalten. Sein Geschäftspartner und Bruder Eduard entkommt, befindet sich nun aber in höchster Gefahr. Denn seine Forschungsergebnisse, die Wasserstoff als Energieträger profitabel machen, würden die Weltwirtschaft ebenso wie die Sicherheitspolitik verändern. Entgegen des Rates der Firmenanwältin will Eduard nicht klein beigeben. Schäfer und seine Kollegin Freuding erhalten daher den Auftrag, ihn und seine Familie zu schützen. Während sich Eduards Ehefrau Hanna mit der Abschottung abfindet, sorgt Sohn Marian für Schwierigkeiten. Um das Vertrauen des rebellischen Teenagers zu gewinnen, lässt Schäfer ihn in sein sorgsam gehütetes Privatleben blicken. Dass der Personenschützer professionelle Grundsätze lockert, bringt ungeahnte Risiken mit sich. Ausgerechnet an dem Ort seiner Verwundbarkeit muss Schäfer den Kampf aufnehmen.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:der-beschutzer-wissen-das-totet-2026-1'),
  ('774206349786810520', 'Der Boandlkramer und die ewige Liebe', 2021, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Joseph Vilsmaier', 'Marcus H. Rosenmüller, Ulrich Limmer', 'Michael Herbig, Hape Kerkeling, Hannah Herzsprung, Sebastian Bezzel, Eisi Gulp, Götz Otto, Rick Kavanian, Nadja Auermann', null, 'Death (in Bavarian: Boandlkramer) is supposed to get little Maxl, but he falls in love with Maxl''s mother. Confused by the previously unknown feelings, he confides in the devil. The incarnate persuades him to start a business where the Boandlkramer gets the chance to compete for Gefi as a mortal. Encouraged by the advice of the recently deceased womanizer Max Gumberger, the Boandl stumbles through earthly life in search of eternal love.', 'Death (in Bavarian: Boandlkramer) is supposed to get little Maxl, but he falls in love with Maxl''s mother. Confused by the previously unknown feelings, he confides in the devil. The incarnate persuades him to start a business where the Boandlkramer gets the chance to compete for Gefi as a mortal. Encouraged by the advice of the recently deceased womanizer Max Gumberger, the Boandl stumbles through earthly life in search of eternal love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCqj2FtAmVA7ss4pe2EvKItWNSI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672221'),
  ('56159184374678949', 'Der Bockerer II - Österreich ist frei', 1996, 'Drama, History', 'Franz Antel, Helmut Pirnat', 'Carl Szokoll, Franz Antel', 'Karl Merkatz, Caroline Vasicek, Alexander Wussow, Ida Krottendorf, Heinz Petters, Michael Schottenberg, Heinz Marecek, Marianne Nentwich', null, 'Vienna, 1947. Bockerer and his wife Binerl have survived the war, though his butcher''s shop was destroyed by bombs. Karl Bockerer opens up a new establishment in the center of the city. Post-war Vienna is divided into four zones in which the Allies run things and ensure that law and order prevails. This is the story of two lovers: Gustl, just returned form a POW camp, and the Russian interpreter Elena. Bockerer becomes the patron of their love. Elena''s father was executed by Stalin, and the only way she can escape a similar fate is to marry an Austrian. Bockerer "buys" a husband for Elena and, full of tricks as ever, he succeeds in pulling the wool over the Russian occupier''s eyes.', 'Vienna, 1947. Bockerer and his wife Binerl have survived the war, though his butcher''s shop was destroyed by bombs. Karl Bockerer opens up a new establishment in the center of the city. Post-war Vienna is divided into four zones in which the Allies run things and ensure that law and order prevails. This is the story of two lovers: Gustl, just returned form a POW camp, and the Russian interpreter Elena. Bockerer becomes the patron of their love. Elena''s father was executed by Stalin, and the only way she can escape a similar fate is to marry an Austrian. Bockerer "buys" a husband for Elena and, full of tricks as ever, he succeeds in pulling the wool over the Russian occupier''s eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cI9w0q9PKwaNfTfIeRUYCyXlkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28470'),
  ('167788531682229423', 'Der brave Soldat Schwejk', 1960, 'War, Comedy', 'Richard Angst, Axel von Ambesser', 'Hans Jacoby', 'Heinz Rühmann, Franz Muxeneder, Ursula von Borsody, Ernst Stankovski, Erika von Thellmann, Senta Berger, Fritz Imhoff, Jane Tilden', null, 'When the First World War breaks out in 1914, Josef Schwejk, a naive dog dealer in Prague, joins the Imperial Army.', 'When the First World War breaks out in 1914, Josef Schwejk, a naive dog dealer in Prague, joins the Imperial Army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfdgThg63vgOTEGVN4FaFt5wVQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11877'),
  ('748753147082587998', 'Der Clown', 2005, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Sebastian Vigg, Diethard Prengel', 'Timo Berndt', 'Sven Martinek, Eva Habermann, Thomas Anzenhofer, Götz Otto, Dirk Heinrichs, Xenia Seeberg, Xaver Hutter, Andreas Schmidt-Schaller', null, 'Former secret government agent Max Hecker (Sven Martinek) disguises himself with a clown mask in order to fight international crime. He hangs up his mask when one of his supporters, journalist Claudia (Diana Frank), is murdered. Four years later, he must put it back on as Claudia''s sister Leah (Eva Habermann) is kidnapped by the same people that killed Claudia.', 'Former secret government agent Max Hecker (Sven Martinek) disguises himself with a clown mask in order to fight international crime. He hangs up his mask when one of his supporters, journalist Claudia (Diana Frank), is murdered. Four years later, he must put it back on as Claudia''s sister Leah (Eva Habermann) is kidnapped by the same people that killed Claudia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekPpYfjmlY0h5wfMHvpXcANdTzR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11142'),
  ('941213715652611758', 'Der Eisenhans', 2011, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Manuel Siebenmann', 'Rudolf Herfurtner', 'Laurence Rupp, Paula Schramm, Michael Mendl, André Hennicke, Marion Mitterhammer, Karl Fischer, Alexander Jagsch, Wolfgang S. Zechmayer', null, 'German TV adaptation of Grimm‘s fairy tale “Iron John“.', 'German TV adaptation of Grimm‘s fairy tale “Iron John“.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23hkauzOD4NZM5ydf4KbcrOEwXk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111550'),
  ('1038105473982637029', 'Der Fuehrer''s Face', 1943, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Jack Kinney', 'Dick Huemer, Joe Grant', 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'A marching band of Germans, Italians, and Japanese march through the streets of swastika-motif Nutziland, serenading "Der Fuehrer''s Face." Donald Duck, not living in the region by choice, struggles to make do with disgusting Nazi food rations and then with his day of toil at a Nazi artillery factory. After a nervous breakdown, Donald awakens to find that his experience was in fact a nightmare.', 'A marching band of Germans, Italians, and Japanese march through the streets of swastika-motif Nutziland, serenading "Der Fuehrer''s Face." Donald Duck, not living in the region by choice, struggles to make do with disgusting Nazi food rations and then with his day of toil at a Nazi artillery factory. After a nervous breakdown, Donald awakens to find that his experience was in fact a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6skZApYBhhLRfYlX4YfMJog4oa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33600'),
  ('781121331881459894', 'Der Garmisch-Krimi - Wolfsmord', 2026, 'Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Saralisa Volm, Roland Stuprich', 'Leona Stahlmann, Niklas Hoffmann', 'Lavinia Wilson, Philine Schmölzer, Sevda Polat, Harald Windisch, Johanna Bittenbinder', null, 'An Austrian detective probes a murder linked to the return of wolves in Bavaria and joins forces with a disgraced local cop protecting her activist daughter as tensions between farmers and conservationists escalate.', 'An Austrian detective probes a murder linked to the return of wolves in Bavaria and joins forces with a disgraced local cop protecting her activist daughter as tensions between farmers and conservationists escalate.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4lyGXukL0lqCutDzELMTLHzdx2W.jpg', 'plex:movie:der-garmisch-krimi-wolfsmord'),
  ('542936398666213423', 'Der Geisterzug', 1957, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Fritz Moser, Rainer Wolffhardt', 'Helmut Pigge, Rainer Wolffhardt', 'Karl-Georg Saebisch, Kurt Haars, Otto Stern, Käthe Lindenberg, Günther Neutze, Hans Walter Clasen, Isolde Bräuner, Manfred Boehm', null, 'Lashing rain, thunderstorms, fog and a godforsaken, eerie train station: the mood among the six travelers who have to wait for their connecting train here in the middle of the night is extremely tense. In keeping with the gloomy scenery, the station master also tells his involuntary guests the story of the ghost train ...', 'Lashing rain, thunderstorms, fog and a godforsaken, eerie train station: the mood among the six travelers who have to wait for their connecting train here in the middle of the night is extremely tense. In keeping with the gloomy scenery, the station master also tells his involuntary guests the story of the ghost train ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2uFMYFUyUdkM5liccHCkwK70OV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370270'),
  ('97921954096500104', 'Der gute Bulle - Friss oder stirb', 2019, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Wedigo von Schultzendorff, Lars Becker', 'Lars Becker', 'Armin Rohde, Edin Hasanović, Nele Kiper, Almila Bağrıaçık, Sascha Alexander Geršak, Murathan Muslu, Nadeshda Brennicke, Vincent Krüger', null, 'Armin Rohde experienced as a "good cop" Fredo Schulz a controversial Special Investigation operation in the drug depot Berlin-Neukölln. A covert investigator was shot and Schulz, the widowed police officer, widower and ex-alcoholic at the end of his career, is charged with the resolution of the tricky case. Together with his partner, Chief Inspector Milan Filipovic, he manages to win the young dealer Dakota as an informant. But soon the two investigators will not let go of the feeling that they have a leak in their own ranks.', 'Armin Rohde experienced as a "good cop" Fredo Schulz a controversial Special Investigation operation in the drug depot Berlin-Neukölln. A covert investigator was shot and Schulz, the widowed police officer, widower and ex-alcoholic at the end of his career, is charged with the resolution of the tricky case. Together with his partner, Chief Inspector Milan Filipovic, he manages to win the young dealer Dakota as an informant. But soon the two investigators will not let go of the feeling that they have a leak in their own ranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8foV2iydEDjLUjrJbsEcaI55d7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574380'),
  ('186426830863050565', 'Der Haustyrann', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Hans Deppe, Oskar Schnirch', 'Toni Impekoven, Hans Reimann, Werner P. Zibaso', 'Heinz Erhardt, Helga Martin, Grethe Weiser, Peter Vogel, Rudolf Platte, Stephan Schwartz, Arnulf Schröder, Ernst Waldow', null, 'Cafe owner Paul Perlacher is a real pig: not only are his daughter and sister Trude embarrassed constantly by his disgusting behavior, but his tenants are subjected to every legal trick under the Sun to get them to move out. Nevertheless, Amalie Hartning''s a stubborn woman and can take care of herself well when it comes to her tyrannical landlord. If that weren''t enough for Paul, his daughter''s gone and fallen in love with the nephew of this pain in rear! And when Paul''s ordered to jail by the courts, that really is the last straw.', 'Cafe owner Paul Perlacher is a real pig: not only are his daughter and sister Trude embarrassed constantly by his disgusting behavior, but his tenants are subjected to every legal trick under the Sun to get them to move out. Nevertheless, Amalie Hartning''s a stubborn woman and can take care of herself well when it comes to her tyrannical landlord. If that weren''t enough for Paul, his daughter''s gone and fallen in love with the nephew of this pain in rear! And when Paul''s ordered to jail by the courts, that really is the last straw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Bhj0Hz44YqzbXZqUBZQiihT8sm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6011'),
  ('283474031899024661', 'Der Herr Karl', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Henny Riffel, Erich Neuberg', 'Helmut Qualtinger, Carl Merz', 'Helmut Qualtinger', null, 'The antihero "Mr. Karl" tells a "young person", the viewer, his life story while he sits at work in the warehouse of a delicatessen. The narrator increasingly turns out to be an opportunistic follower from the petty-bourgeois milieu, who maneuvered his way through life in the changing course of Austrian history from the end of the First World War to the end of the occupation in the 1950s.', 'The antihero "Mr. Karl" tells a "young person", the viewer, his life story while he sits at work in the warehouse of a delicatessen. The narrator increasingly turns out to be an opportunistic follower from the petty-bourgeois milieu, who maneuvered his way through life in the changing course of Austrian history from the end of the First World War to the end of the occupation in the 1950s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwycJX3BZvLpS33OtoJl5kjnXLk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28469'),
  ('203441709699961548', 'Der Jongleur', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Max Skladanowsky', null, 'Sylvester Schäffer Sr.', null, 'A man performs tricks on a theatre stage with a bowler hat and a billiards ball in equilibrium on his arms and body.', 'A man performs tricks on a theatre stage with a bowler hat and a billiards ball in equilibrium on his arms and body.', null, 'tmdb:movie:194084'),
  ('1123500197965060677', 'Der Kaiser', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Tim Trageser', null, 'Klaus Steinbacher, Ferdinand Hofer, Teresa Rizos, Stefan Murr, Bettina Mittendorfer, Heinz-Josef Braun, Sina Tkotsch, Artus-Maria Matthiessen', null, 'Biopic charting the career of legendary German footballer Franz Beckenbauer who won the World Cup as a player in 1974, and then as the West German team''s coach in 1990. Taking place against the backdrop of the stunning global tournaments, the film depicts a man who railed against the rigid structures and outdated rules in football and fought to conduct his private life as he wished, outside of the moral constraints and expectations of the time.', 'Biopic charting the career of legendary German footballer Franz Beckenbauer who won the World Cup as a player in 1974, and then as the West German team''s coach in 1990. Taking place against the backdrop of the stunning global tournaments, the film depicts a man who railed against the rigid structures and outdated rules in football and fought to conduct his private life as he wished, outside of the moral constraints and expectations of the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GvUClzs5x9vHZdXbq5mcjXmWP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978148'),
  ('425132554396247169', 'Der König von Köln', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Lars Bretschneider, Christian Schäfer, Richard Huber', 'Ralf Husmann', 'Rainer Bock, Joachim Król, Jörg Hartmann, Serkan Kaya, Ernst Stötzner, Judith Engel, Ulrich Brandhoff, Eva Meckbach', null, 'A rather regular state official, who works at the building authority, becomes a puppet of a few super rich. They want to make quite a lot of profit from a planned large-scale building project. Quicker than anticipated, the father-to-be gets surprised by a couple of amenities and notices that life isn’t too bad in the sphere of these semi-legal affairs. Soon, however, he has a prosecuting attorney on his tails and has to decide himself for a side.', 'A rather regular state official, who works at the building authority, becomes a puppet of a few super rich. They want to make quite a lot of profit from a planned large-scale building project. Quicker than anticipated, the father-to-be gets surprised by a couple of amenities and notices that life isn’t too bad in the sphere of these semi-legal affairs. Soon, however, he has a prosecuting attorney on his tails and has to decide himself for a side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxur3XgpIeh3mL8OymefIrUBoIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655246'),
  ('755155948840078035', 'Der letzte Bulle', 2019, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Peter Thorwarth, Dorothea Popovic, Paul Milbers', 'Jan Berger, Stefan Holtz, Peter Thorwarth', 'Henning Baum, Maximilian Grill, Leonie Brill, Florence Kasumba, Lucas Gregorowicz, Ralph Herforth, Ralf Moeller, Christian Kahrmann', null, '25 years of coma lie behind the hard-hitting policeman Mick Brisgau, as he awakens in a world unknown to him.', '25 years of coma lie behind the hard-hitting policeman Mick Brisgau, as he awakens in a world unknown to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJtFiaWzo8nn7dz9G41xdvOfdNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634129'),
  ('300521299877780422', 'Der letzte Lude', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Stephen Manuel, Stephan Schuh', 'Matthias Dinter, Martin Ritzenhoff', 'Lotto King Karl, Tobias Schenke, Alexandra Neldel, Erdal Kacar, Axel Wedekind, Luca Maric, Torsten Voges, Isabelle Ertmann', null, 'The batty sandwich seller and wannabe pimp Andy Ommsen finally gets his chance in the red light district. A reckless underworld-boss hires him to guard the beautiful go-go-dance Anica. Unfortunately, this collides with Andy''s second job, which is to show the c-grade actor Timo how to behave as a real pimp.', 'The batty sandwich seller and wannabe pimp Andy Ommsen finally gets his chance in the red light district. A reckless underworld-boss hires him to guard the beautiful go-go-dance Anica. Unfortunately, this collides with Andy''s second job, which is to show the c-grade actor Timo how to behave as a real pimp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssiqMTIvg5ZHS3KIie4Ohg69Kqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10932'),
  ('1114058932446610011', 'Der Minister', 2013, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Uwe Janson', 'Dorothee Schön', 'Kai Schumann, Johann von Bülow, Alexandra Neldel, Thomas Heinze, Katharina Thalbach, Stefanie Stappenbeck, Walter Sittler, Susan Sideropoulos', null, 'Franz Ferdinand von und zu Donnersberg is a charismatic, well-bred and handsome young man from a very wealthy family who sees his future in politics. His childhood friend Max Drexel is quick-witted, ambitious, quick-witted, but comes from a humble background and doesn''t like to be in the foreground. But together they make an unbeatable team, as Max runs his office and writes him the tangled and grandiose speeches that Franz Ferdinand gets so much applause and recognition for. But Chancellor Angela Murkel eyes the young MP with great skepticism. Franz Ferdinand realizes that he could improve his reputation with the chancellor with a doctorate', 'Franz Ferdinand von und zu Donnersberg is a charismatic, well-bred and handsome young man from a very wealthy family who sees his future in politics. His childhood friend Max Drexel is quick-witted, ambitious, quick-witted, but comes from a humble background and doesn''t like to be in the foreground. But together they make an unbeatable team, as Max runs his office and writes him the tangled and grandiose speeches that Franz Ferdinand gets so much applause and recognition for. But Chancellor Angela Murkel eyes the young MP with great skepticism. Franz Ferdinand realizes that he could improve his reputation with the chancellor with a doctorate', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGYPZSyyPhFSEe3TVCtLXj69UJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175952'),
  ('858169720023078672', 'Der Sandmann', 1995, 'Thriller', 'Nico Hofmann, Tom Fährmann', 'Matthias Seelig', 'Götz George, Karoline Eichhorn, Barbara Rudnik, Martin Armknecht, Jürgen Hentsch, Matthias Fuchs, Michael Brandner, Rudolf Kowalski', null, 'The ambitious young Ina Littmann is an investigative journalist for the TV talk show "Eye in Eye". Her current subject is Henry Kupfer, who wrote a bestseller about a psychopathic killer after he was himself in prison for 8 years for manslaughter. As an entry for the show Ina plans to use a current series of brutal murders among prostitutes. When Ina meets Kupfer, she is despised and fascinated at the same time. Soon she''s convinced that Kupfer not only writes about murders, but commits them himself. She smells a smash hit and prepares to prove him guilty on the show.', 'The ambitious young Ina Littmann is an investigative journalist for the TV talk show "Eye in Eye". Her current subject is Henry Kupfer, who wrote a bestseller about a psychopathic killer after he was himself in prison for 8 years for manslaughter. As an entry for the show Ina plans to use a current series of brutal murders among prostitutes. When Ina meets Kupfer, she is despised and fascinated at the same time. Soon she''s convinced that Kupfer not only writes about murders, but commits them himself. She smells a smash hit and prepares to prove him guilty on the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fRMxKAJa3K5L2ZbeCFIvOgXt0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12148'),
  ('1098985932426379579', 'Der Schinderhannes', 1958, 'History, Romance, Drama', 'Helmut Käutner, Heinz Pehlke', 'George Hurdalek, Carl Zuckmayer', 'Curd Jürgens, Maria Schell, Christian Wolff, Fritz Tillmann, Siegfried Lowitz, Joseph Offenbach, Paul Esser, Bum Krüger', null, '1802: The adventurous life story of Hans Bückler, known as “Schinderhannes”, who fights against the French occupying forces and large landowners who exploit poor farmers in the Hunsrück region during the Napoleonic Wars.', '1802: The adventurous life story of Hans Bückler, known as “Schinderhannes”, who fights against the French occupying forces and large landowners who exploit poor farmers in the Hunsrück region during the Napoleonic Wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNxiThqNagd1AwLya4CMqpLyox5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132252'),
  ('672400933704920074', 'Der Schneegänger', 2020, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Josef Rusnak', 'Josef Rusnak, Elisabeth Herrmann', 'Max Riemelt, Nadja Bobyleva, Stipe Erceg, Edita Malovčić, Bernhard Schir, Emil Belton, Lui Eckhardt, Christian Goebel', null, 'After missing four years, the body of a little boy is found in the forest. An unlikely pair of police officers investigate the boy''s death.', 'After missing four years, the body of a little boy is found in the forest. An unlikely pair of police officers investigate the boy''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r29mva54MBdO2Su7EFnJuUZUISk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682618'),
  ('650612759761750369', 'Der schwarze Nazi', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lukas Drangmeister, Tilman König, Susanne Frey', 'Karl-Friedrich König, Tilman König', 'Aloysius Itoka, Judith Bareiss, Bernd-Michael Baier, Gerd Ahlemann, Martina Krompholz, Brian Völkner, Melanie Müller, Milka', null, 'The Congolese Sikumoya faces prejudice and racism on a regular basis. He''s accused of not adapting enough to the "German culture" and tries harder. A Neo-Nazi group and his mother-in-law push him to the breaking point. While in a coma, his metamorphosis completes.', 'The Congolese Sikumoya faces prejudice and racism on a regular basis. He''s accused of not adapting enough to the "German culture" and tries harder. A Neo-Nazi group and his mother-in-law push him to the breaking point. While in a coma, his metamorphosis completes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgRakyNqabqp8iMvOVnj8QHwRv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388402'),
  ('472393863628268810', 'Der Tod und das Mädchen - Van Leeuwens dritter Fall', 2017, 'Crime', 'Hans Steinbichler, Sandra Köppe, Bella Halben', 'Nicole Armbruster', 'Peter Haber, Marcel Hensema, Laura de Boer, Katharina Lorenz, Barbara Auer, Jörg Schüttauf, Bruno Cathomas, Susanne Wuest', null, 'Thanks to the latest DNA technology, Bruno van Leeuwen finally has a proof in his hands, with which the rapist of the then nine-year-old Vicky can be convicted. Piet Martens, the neighbor of the girl''s family, was the culprit. But despite the new evidence, he can not be brought to justice because the crime is now time barred. Martens leaves the police headquarters as a free man. Then Vicky falls on Martens and hits him with a bottle. The police separate the two and Martens'' lawyer reports to Vicky about dangerous assault.', 'Thanks to the latest DNA technology, Bruno van Leeuwen finally has a proof in his hands, with which the rapist of the then nine-year-old Vicky can be convicted. Piet Martens, the neighbor of the girl''s family, was the culprit. But despite the new evidence, he can not be brought to justice because the crime is now time barred. Martens leaves the police headquarters as a free man. Then Vicky falls on Martens and hits him with a bottle. The police separate the two and Martens'' lawyer reports to Vicky about dangerous assault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIaSn57071sMLe5mmfWGCwUGplk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522121'),
  ('99640081391580399', 'Der Überfall', 2000, 'Drama', 'Florian Flicker, Helmut Pirnat', 'Susanne Freund, Florian Flicker', 'Roland Düringer, Josef Hader, Joachim Bißmeier, Ulrike Beimpold, Birgit Doll, Sonja Romei, Klaus Ortner', null, 'Looking around for a suitable place to hold up, Andreas stumbles into a tailor''s shop. What was supposed to last only a few minutes ends up being a bizarre afternoon for three men: the tragicomic of the less-than-expert robber, the cranky tailor and a customer - a know-it-all who drives the other two crazy. The mood constantly shifts, and the tables keep turning among the threesome. A black comedy with a twist.', 'Looking around for a suitable place to hold up, Andreas stumbles into a tailor''s shop. What was supposed to last only a few minutes ends up being a bizarre afternoon for three men: the tragicomic of the less-than-expert robber, the cranky tailor and a customer - a know-it-all who drives the other two crazy. The mood constantly shifts, and the tables keep turning among the threesome. A black comedy with a twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krdEiKDYu85PpwHRa409He3pd22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36661'),
  ('109456353021230512', 'Der Vierer', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Iván Sáinz-Pardo, Torsten Lippstock, Daniel Atzorn', 'Iván Sáinz-Pardo, Torben Struck, Florian David Fitz', 'Florian David Fitz, Julia Koschitz, Friedrich Mücke, Lucía Barrado, Diyar Ilhan, Jens Atzorn, Christoph Rothenbuchner, Wolfgang Menardi', null, 'A long-term couple who are in an erotic slump decide to bring a breath of fresh air into their relationship by having a ‘foursome’ with two friends. But the open-minded meeting takes an unexpected turn and ends in a fiasco.', 'A long-term couple who are in an erotic slump decide to bring a breath of fresh air into their relationship by having a ‘foursome’ with two friends. But the open-minded meeting takes an unexpected turn and ends in a fiasco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1vNgSowuEcKcSAbumZsa1qUFWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1336399'),
  ('88993080424840947', 'Derailed', 2002, 'Action, Thriller', 'Bob Misiorowski, Glenn R. Wilder, Franklin A. Vallette', 'Jace Anderson, Adam Gierasch', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Tomas Arana, Laura Harring, Simona Williams, Susan Gibney, Lucy Jenner, Sandra Vidal, Jessica Bowman', null, 'NATO operative Jacques Kristoff (Jean-Claude Van Damme) is summoned into action—on his birthday, no less—to track down Galina Konstantin (Laura Harring), who has stolen an extremely valuable and dangerous top-secret container from the Slovakian Government. Finding Galina doesn''t take long, and Jacques must wrap up the mission by returning Galina and the contraband to his superiors by train. Things seem to be going smoothly as Jacques and Galina board the train posing as a couple, but soon all hell breaks loose.', 'NATO operative Jacques Kristoff (Jean-Claude Van Damme) is summoned into action—on his birthday, no less—to track down Galina Konstantin (Laura Harring), who has stolen an extremely valuable and dangerous top-secret container from the Slovakian Government. Finding Galina doesn''t take long, and Jacques must wrap up the mission by returning Galina and the contraband to his superiors by train. Things seem to be going smoothly as Jacques and Galina board the train posing as a couple, but soon all hell breaks loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ot5eFU2sWOEG9IbWydNpwggBiIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17774'),
  ('123745656560749830', 'Derailed', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mikael Håfström, James Andrew Haven, Peter Biziou', 'Stuart Beattie', 'Clive Owen, Jennifer Aniston, Vincent Cassel, Melissa George, Giancarlo Esposito, RZA, Xzibit, David Morrissey', 'R', 'When two married business executives having an affair are blackmailed by a violent criminal, they are forced to turn the tables on him to save their families.', 'When two married business executives having an affair are blackmailed by a violent criminal, they are forced to turn the tables on him to save their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcCoOkwEBHUS5Y7Rm1u1oTLUHdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8999'),
  ('1083011838925221827', 'Derailed', 2016, 'Crime, Action', 'Lee Seong-tae, Kang Seong-hoon', 'Lee Seong-tae', 'Don Lee, Minho, Kim Jae-young, Jeong Da-eun, Lee You-jin, Baek Soo-min, Kim Won-sik, Park Ho-san', null, 'When two men find their lives derailed, they meet challenges that force them to face a fierce battle to protect their loved ones.', 'When two men find their lives derailed, they meet challenges that force them to face a fierce battle to protect their loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ia3xuKuRfKGjwGT8JQzi3VVCnUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428639'),
  ('899105281714607279', 'Deranged', 1974, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Alan Ormsby, Jeff Gillen, Jack McGowan', 'Alan Ormsby', 'Roberts Blossom, Cosette Lee, Leslie Carlson, Robert Warner, Marcia Diamond, Brian Smeagle, Arlene Gillen, Robert McHeady', 'R', 'A man living in rural Wisconsin takes care of his bed-ridden mother, who is very domineering and teaches him that all women are evil. After she dies, he misses her, and a year later digs her up and takes her home. He learns about taxidermy and begins robbing graves to get materials to patch her up, and inevitably begins looking for fresher sources of materials. Based loosely on the true story of Ed Gein.', 'A man living in rural Wisconsin takes care of his bed-ridden mother, who is very domineering and teaches him that all women are evil. After she dies, he misses her, and a year later digs her up and takes her home. He learns about taxidermy and begins robbing graves to get materials to patch her up, and inevitably begins looking for fresher sources of materials. Based loosely on the true story of Ed Gein.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHcXdp4hNx1QiIQyLl2NlyvKSB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39844'),
  ('783182270761960098', 'Deranged', 1987, 'Horror', 'Chuck Vincent, Larry Revene', 'Craig Horrall', 'Veronica Hart, Jerry Butler, Jennifer Delora, Jamie Gillis, Jill Cumer, Loretta Palma, John Brett, Gary Goldman', null, 'Joyce seems to have the perfect life - she lives in a nice apartment with a wealthy husband, is soon going to give birth to a baby boy, and has all the money she''ll ever need. But while her husband is away in London on business, Joyce is attacked by a masked intruder, that unleashes within her a frightened little girl, haunted by her "special" relationship with her daddy, and a crazed madwoman who is hungry for revenge. From then on, Joyce''s wild hallucinations take over, and she begins to murder anyone and everyone who comes near her, in a violent fit of rage.', 'Joyce seems to have the perfect life - she lives in a nice apartment with a wealthy husband, is soon going to give birth to a baby boy, and has all the money she''ll ever need. But while her husband is away in London on business, Joyce is attacked by a masked intruder, that unleashes within her a frightened little girl, haunted by her "special" relationship with her daddy, and a crazed madwoman who is hungry for revenge. From then on, Joyce''s wild hallucinations take over, and she begins to murder anyone and everyone who comes near her, in a violent fit of rage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1y29UeC39jJLWNf43ixhklq6t1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27611'),
  ('206145609894260897', 'Deranged', 2012, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Park Jung-woo, Ki Se-hun, Shin Sang-yeul', 'Park Jung-woo', 'Kim Myung-min, Moon Jeong-hee, Kim Dong-wan, Lee Hanee, Uhm Ji-sung, Kang Shin-il, Jo Deok-hyeon, Jeon Kuk-hwan', null, 'People binge eat and suffer from extreme thirst, which leads them to go crazy for water. They cannot control themselves because they are brainwashed by a parasite.', 'People binge eat and suffer from extreme thirst, which leads them to go crazy for water. They cannot control themselves because they are brainwashed by a parasite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hStPBeJFt0nHH2UbZPdfI5TSRpw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121491'),
  ('1114353903391488757', 'Derek DelGaudio''s In & of Itself', 2020, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Frank Oz, Cezary Zacharewicz', 'Derek DelGaudio', 'Derek DelGaudio, Hal Schulman, Marina Abramović, Alexandra DelGaudio, David Blaine, Bill Gates, Tim Gunn, Brian Henson', 'PG-13', 'Storyteller and Conceptual Magician Derek DelGaudio attempts to understand the illusory nature of identity and answer the deceptively simple question ''Who am I?''', 'Storyteller and Conceptual Magician Derek DelGaudio attempts to understand the illusory nature of identity and answer the deceptively simple question ''Who am I?''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgnXNBdjqQmVrIthQI5B8eKDKp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681459'),
