  ('1121357998889104124', 'Derrick contre Superman', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Michel Hazanavicius, Dominique Mézerette', 'Dominique Mézerette, Michel Hazanavicius', 'Horst Tappert, Fritz Wepper, Roger Moore, Paul Michael Glaser', null, 'Derrick and his deputy, Harry Klein, back from holidays, discover that french TV channel 5 is dead. They''ll have to build a plan to create a new "new 5 channel". They''ll be helped by Starsky & Hutch, Matt Houston, Captain Kirk or french inspector Navarro, while Superman, assisted by Number 6 and Roger Moore, will try to thwart their plan.', 'Derrick and his deputy, Harry Klein, back from holidays, discover that french TV channel 5 is dead. They''ll have to build a plan to create a new "new 5 channel". They''ll be helped by Starsky & Hutch, Matt Houston, Captain Kirk or french inspector Navarro, while Superman, assisted by Number 6 and Roger Moore, will try to thwart their plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aK1RfIusGaruu8INTfNI291ayyw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135307'),
  ('21859243217026951', 'Dersimiz: Atatürk', 2010, 'History, Drama', 'Hamdi Alkan', 'Turgut Özakman', 'Halit Ergenç, Çetin Tekindor, Batuhan Karacakaya, Canan Hoşgör, Tolga Savacı, Deniz Konuk, Nilgün Kasapbaşoğlu, Gaye Gürsel', null, 'Tarihci Dede is giving information to a couple of children about Mustafa Kemal Atatürk''s success and his way to shape todays Turkey.', 'Tarihci Dede is giving information to a couple of children about Mustafa Kemal Atatürk''s success and his way to shape todays Turkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48YFA38to9LeES2WNxYqsxX1YeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52128'),
  ('729435844461220126', 'Dersu Uzala', 1961, 'Adventure', 'Agasi Babayan', 'Igor Bolgarin', 'Adolf Shestakov, Kasym Zhakibayev, Aleksandr Baranov, Nikolai Gladkov, Lev Lobov, Mikhail Medvedev, Pyotr Lyubeshkin, Nikolai Khryashchikov', null, 'Dersu Uzala (Russian: Дерсу Узала) is a 1961 Soviet film, adapted from the books of Vladimir Arsenyev, about his travels in Russian Far East with a native trapper, Dersu Uzala.', 'Dersu Uzala (Russian: Дерсу Узала) is a 1961 Soviet film, adapted from the books of Vladimir Arsenyev, about his travels in Russian Far East with a native trapper, Dersu Uzala.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efXTUG4parnF23X6CxCcA2yZyce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113606'),
  ('1111882887903287166', 'Des fleurs pour Algernon', 2006, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'David Delrieux', 'Anne Giafferi', 'Julien Boisselier, Hélène de Fougerolles, Marianne Basler, Frédéric van den Driessche, Olivier Perrier, Jean-Pierre Gos, Sibylle Blanc, Antonio Troilo', null, 'After a successful experiment on Algernon, a mouse whose level of intelligence thanks to that procedure dramatically increased, the scientists decided to go further - the next "guinea pig" is Charles, a mentally disabled young man. The experiment is again successful. But what happens after it?', 'After a successful experiment on Algernon, a mouse whose level of intelligence thanks to that procedure dramatically increased, the scientists decided to go further - the next "guinea pig" is Charles, a mentally disabled young man. The experiment is again successful. But what happens after it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6VKsUCw0j0xUvsDaUihCFYiyxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142528'),
  ('415014838973869372', 'Des Hommes', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Alice Odiot, Jean-Robert Viallet, Jean-Robert Viallet', null, null, null, 'Thirty thousand square meters and 2,000 inmates, half of them under 30 years old. The Baumettes jail tells about misery, violence, abandonment, and also hopes. It is a story with its screams and its silences. A concentrate of humanity.', 'Thirty thousand square meters and 2,000 inmates, half of them under 30 years old. The Baumettes jail tells about misery, violence, abandonment, and also hopes. It is a story with its screams and its silences. A concentrate of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTYZuOVL7udx592pgKoAh1ziEvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597683'),
  ('716639172747395531', 'Des lendemains qui chantent', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Castro, Pierre Aïm', 'Florence Levard, Nicolas Castro', 'Pio Marmaï, Laetitia Casta, Ramzy Bedia, Gaspard Proust, André Dussollier, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Anne Brochet, Hédi Tillette de Clermont-Tonnerre', null, 'Olivier and Leo, two brothers that are moved to Paris and that life has separated ... If the first sees himself as a journalist without concessions, the second is an ambitious and opportunistic communication adviser. Noémie, a charming presidential adviser, can not, over the years, choose between them. To the amusement of Sylvain, their childhood friend, who made his fortune in Pink Minitel, their destinies intersect over 20 years, are intertwined, in a funny epic, tender and nostalgic, in the 80 / 90.', 'Olivier and Leo, two brothers that are moved to Paris and that life has separated ... If the first sees himself as a journalist without concessions, the second is an ambitious and opportunistic communication adviser. Noémie, a charming presidential adviser, can not, over the years, choose between them. To the amusement of Sylvain, their childhood friend, who made his fortune in Pink Minitel, their destinies intersect over 20 years, are intertwined, in a funny epic, tender and nostalgic, in the 80 / 90.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZQAhB9JLLPqwUpcej5otZBFrD2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286101'),
  ('1082227186588774967', 'Des mains en or', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Isabelle Mergault, Jean-Marie Dreujou, Sébastien Deux', 'Isabelle Mergault, Jean-Pierre Hasson', 'Lambert Wilson, Josiane Balasko, Sylvie Testud, Nicolas Briançon, Marie Petiot, Caroline Loeb, Jean-Louis Barcelona, Béatrice Facquer', null, 'Philippe is a well-known writer, whose life was going smoothly: a surgeon wife, a circle of high-ranking friends, a Parisian mansion... And above all, an imminent entry into the Académie Française. Except that Philippe suffers from terrible back pain that plagues his life. When he meets the incredible Martha, who picks him up after a car accident on the roads of Normandy, his vision of the world changes. With her gentle madness and her healing hands, this woman who seems so free is especially concerned with treating others, even if it means forgetting herself. Between these two characters that everything opposes, a surprising friendship is woven, with the opportunity for them to finally seize the best that life can offer them.', 'Philippe is a well-known writer, whose life was going smoothly: a surgeon wife, a circle of high-ranking friends, a Parisian mansion... And above all, an imminent entry into the Académie Française. Except that Philippe suffers from terrible back pain that plagues his life. When he meets the incredible Martha, who picks him up after a car accident on the roads of Normandy, his vision of the world changes. With her gentle madness and her healing hands, this woman who seems so free is especially concerned with treating others, even if it means forgetting herself. Between these two characters that everything opposes, a surprising friendship is woven, with the opportunity for them to finally seize the best that life can offer them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksEwgJb0dPmmRCH75HOAHWoUXG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989229'),
  ('717498082142455622', 'Des Plans Sur La Comète', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Guilhem Amesland', null, 'Vincent Macaigne, Hafsia Herzi, Suzanne Clément, Philippe Rebbot, Mounir Ait Hamou, Estéban', null, 'Two small time crooks brothers fall apart when they both meet very different women', 'Two small time crooks brothers fall apart when they both meet very different women', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPmhQ2Axq7tyg2lrwlhXSmzU7oH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459070'),
  ('516025478876072209', 'Desamuduru', 2007, 'Action, Romance', 'Puri Jagannadh, Shyam K. Naidu', 'Puri Jagannadh', 'Allu Arjun, Hansika Motwani, Pradeep Ram Singh Rawat, Ali Basha, Ajay, Chandramohan, Devan, Telangana Shakuntala', null, 'After Bala, who works for a TV channel, gets into trouble with a goon, he is sent away for an out-of-town assignment. There he meets and falls in love with a girl who gets kidnapped by a gangster.', 'After Bala, who works for a TV channel, gets into trouble with a goon, he is sent away for an out-of-town assignment. There he meets and falls in love with a girl who gets kidnapped by a gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YjI8n9RXaI0NlV91TV3xAFgDLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117058'),
  ('675630993159010113', 'Descarrilados', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Fer García-Ruiz', 'David Marqués', 'Julián López, Ernesto Sevilla, Arturo Valls, Dafne Fernández, Ana Milán, Jordi Aguilar, Alicia Fernández, Areta Bolado', null, 'Three lifelong 40-year-old friends go on a huge Interrail tour to honor their recently deceased friend.', 'Three lifelong 40-year-old friends go on a huge Interrail tour to honor their recently deceased friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecbeh7LvjogNiymqDRa9cjHYFj1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:772388'),
  ('42374958234167684', 'Descendant', 2022, 'Documentary, History', 'Margaret Brown', 'Margaret Brown, Kern Jackson', 'Kamau Sadiki, Emmett Lewis, Vernetta Henson, Veda Tunstall, Joycelyn Davis, Willomina Davis, Mae Jones, Lorna Woods', 'PG', 'History exists beyond what is written. The Africatown residents in Mobile, Alabama, have shared stories about their origins for generations. Their community was founded by enslaved ancestors who were transported in 1860 aboard the last known and illegal slave ship, Clotilda. Though the ship was intentionally destroyed upon arrival, its memory and legacy weren’t. Now, the long-awaited discovery of the Clotilda’s remains offers this community a tangible link to their ancestors and validation of a history so many tried to bury.', 'History exists beyond what is written. The Africatown residents in Mobile, Alabama, have shared stories about their origins for generations. Their community was founded by enslaved ancestors who were transported in 1860 aboard the last known and illegal slave ship, Clotilda. Though the ship was intentionally destroyed upon arrival, its memory and legacy weren’t. Now, the long-awaited discovery of the Clotilda’s remains offers this community a tangible link to their ancestors and validation of a history so many tried to bury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHd1OBpWLxSN5UPSJrjwYeT4PPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913822'),
  ('716891872520043323', 'Descendants', 2015, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie, Music', 'Kenny Ortega, Thomas Burstyn, Rachel Leiterman', 'Josann McGibbon, Sara Parriott', 'Dove Cameron, Sofia Carson, Cameron Boyce, Booboo Stewart, Mitchell Hope, Sarah Jeffery, Brenna D''Amico, Jedidiah Goodacre', 'G', 'A present-day idyllic kingdom where the benevolent teenage son of King Adam and Queen Belle offers a chance of redemption for the troublemaking offspring of Disney''s classic villains: Cruella De Vil (Carlos), Maleficent (Mal), the Evil Queen (Evie) and Jafar (Jay).', 'A present-day idyllic kingdom where the benevolent teenage son of King Adam and Queen Belle offers a chance of redemption for the troublemaking offspring of Disney''s classic villains: Cruella De Vil (Carlos), Maleficent (Mal), the Evil Queen (Evie) and Jafar (Jay).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65DkgHPSLVjgr6IYkpY9Aqqqid5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277217'),
  ('201471531845901429', 'Descendants 2', 2017, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie, Adventure, Music', 'Kenny Ortega, Mark Irwin, Rosalee Yagihara', 'Sara Parriott, Josann McGibbon', 'Dove Cameron, Sofia Carson, Cameron Boyce, Booboo Stewart, China Anne McClain, Mitchell Hope, Thomas Doherty, Dylan Playfair', 'G', 'When the pressure to be royal becomes too much for Mal, she returns to the Isle of the Lost where her archenemy Uma, Ursula''s daughter, has taken her spot as self-proclaimed queen.', 'When the pressure to be royal becomes too much for Mal, she returns to the Isle of the Lost where her archenemy Uma, Ursula''s daughter, has taken her spot as self-proclaimed queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoNlGfQmFZ37Gf5fRBaCTLlOZtx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417320'),
  ('927719001834527631', 'Descendants 3', 2019, 'Family, TV Movie, Adventure, Fantasy, Music', 'Kenny Ortega, Martin Ellis, Elizabeth Scherberger', 'Josann McGibbon, Sara Parriott', 'Dove Cameron, Sofia Carson, Sarah Jeffery, Cameron Boyce, China Anne McClain, Booboo Stewart, Mitchell Hope, Brenna D''Amico', 'PG', 'The teenagers of Disney''s most infamous villains return to the Isle of the Lost to recruit a new batch of villainous offspring to join them at Auradon Prep.', 'The teenagers of Disney''s most infamous villains return to the Isle of the Lost to recruit a new batch of villainous offspring to join them at Auradon Prep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IRy0iHdaS0JI3ng4ZYlk5gLSFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506574'),
  ('779000347157494600', 'Descendants of Adultery', 2016, 'Romance', 'Lee Sang-soo', null, 'Lee Chae-dam, Seo Bo-ra, Sang Woo, Chae Ye-jin, Moon Jae-hoon', null, 'Soo-ji is a skin specialist who experiences retaliatory driving on her way to work and Captain Kwon helps her. Later, they meet at the hospital and start to feel attracted to each other. Soo-ji is tired of living a pretentious marriage life with her cheating husband and falls in love with Kwon...', 'Soo-ji is a skin specialist who experiences retaliatory driving on her way to work and Captain Kwon helps her. Later, they meet at the hospital and start to feel attracted to each other. Soo-ji is tired of living a pretentious marriage life with her cheating husband and falls in love with Kwon...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hDIHNft2A7tlNsFuTKhIJfKKdc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419329'),
  ('1109993045944159471', 'Descendants: The Rise of Red', 2024, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Jennifer Phang, Chelsea Bruland, Declan Quinn', 'Dan Frey, Russell Sommer', 'Kylie Cantrall, Malia Baker, Ruby Rose Turner, Morgan Dudley, Dara Reneé, Joshua Colley, Peder Lindell, Rita Ora', 'G', 'After the Queen of Hearts incites a coup on Auradon, her rebellious daughter Red and Cinderella''s perfectionist daughter Chloe join forces and travel back in time to try to undo the traumatic event that set Red''s mother down her villainous path.', 'After the Queen of Hearts incites a coup on Auradon, her rebellious daughter Red and Cinderella''s perfectionist daughter Chloe join forces and travel back in time to try to undo the traumatic event that set Red''s mother down her villainous path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fYluTtB3b3HKO7KQa5tzrvGaps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974262'),
  ('259751705060314166', 'Descendants: The Royal Wedding', 2021, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Salvador Simó', 'Sara Parriott, Josann McGibbon, Ricky Roxburgh', 'Dove Cameron, Sofia Carson, Booboo Stewart, Mitchell Hope, Sarah Jeffery, Melanie Paxson, China Anne McClain, Jedidiah Goodacre', 'G', 'Happily-ever-after continues for Auradon''s power couple as they prepare to say "I do" at an epic celebration with their friends and family, but Hades threatens to ruin it all.', 'Happily-ever-after continues for Auradon''s power couple as they prepare to say "I do" at an epic celebration with their friends and family, but Hades threatens to ruin it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1vCU25JMegFVlj1bsWUbxEcaG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805411'),
  ('463382847241565402', 'Descendants/Zombies Worlds Collide: Concert Special', 2026, 'Music', 'Paul Dugdale', null, 'Kylie Cantrall, Freya Skye, Malia Baker, Malachi Barton, Dara Reneé', 'G', 'Fans can experience the electrifying live concert tour that brought together beloved characters and hit songs from Disney''s "Descendants" and "ZOMBIES" franchises, captured after its successful run through 40+ North American venues.', 'Fans can experience the electrifying live concert tour that brought together beloved characters and hit songs from Disney''s "Descendants" and "ZOMBIES" franchises, captured after its successful run through 40+ North American venues.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FogWhinTSMe8UhlIPhrztPVxpOsl.jpg', 'plex:movie:descendants-zombies-worlds-collide-concert-special-2026'),
  ('180378078778822426', 'Descendent', 2025, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Peter Cilella, Alexander Chinnici', 'Peter Cilella', 'Ross Marquand, Sarah Bolger, Susan Wilder, Charlene Amoia, Dan O''Brien, Brandon Scott, Alexandra Barreto, Aisha Kabia', null, 'After a traumatic brain injury triggers terrifying visions of extraterrestrials and a newfound talent for drawing, a father-to-be begins to question his reality and becomes obsessed with the need to protect his family from an unseen threat.', 'After a traumatic brain injury triggers terrifying visions of extraterrestrials and a newfound talent for drawing, a father-to-be begins to question his reality and becomes obsessed with the need to protect his family from an unseen threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Of1UCdomAu0mJY2SNHHGjhnvx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1422052'),
  ('621612838766262530', 'Descendents', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Jorge Olguín, Francesc Morales', 'Jorge Olguín, Carolina García', 'Camille Lynch, Karina Pizarro, Cristobal Barra, Sergio Allard, Francisco Andrade, Sebastián Badilla, Javiera Toledo, Juan Pablo Bastidas', null, 'In an undefined future, the earth has been destroyed by man, and the air polluted with a mysterious virus that turns humans into zombies. Only a few children are immune to the disease and have adapted to these extreme conditions and survived. Camille, a nine year old girl wanders through these desolate wastelands, protecting herself from zombies and the armed military forces that roam the land killing anyone who might be infected. However, the little girl will find other kids like her that share a recurring dream of: they all have visions of the ocean as their destiny. Together they will try to survive the journey to the ocean in search of an escape from the military who seem to be as determined on their destruction as on the zombies. Written by David Pollison/Solos Website', 'In an undefined future, the earth has been destroyed by man, and the air polluted with a mysterious virus that turns humans into zombies. Only a few children are immune to the disease and have adapted to these extreme conditions and survived. Camille, a nine year old girl wanders through these desolate wastelands, protecting herself from zombies and the armed military forces that roam the land killing anyone who might be infected. However, the little girl will find other kids like her that share a recurring dream of: they all have visions of the ocean as their destiny. Together they will try to survive the journey to the ocean in search of an escape from the military who seem to be as determined on their destruction as on the zombies. Written by David Pollison/Solos Website', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MFFdFlu7zFLjvH4evZqYqoPi7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110372'),
  ('653720006288768134', 'Descent', 2005, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Terry Cunningham', 'Michael Konyves', 'Luke Perry, Natalie Brown, Michael Dorn, Rick Roberts, Marie Ward, Mimi Kuzyk, Michael Teigen, Mike Realba', 'PG', 'When cracks in the Earth''s crust large enough to swallow a city block appear, a team of scientists must go deep into the Earth to find a way to stop the destruction.', 'When cracks in the Earth''s crust large enough to swallow a city block appear, a team of scientists must go deep into the Earth to find a way to stop the destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ss0kjeej8rhhwDXc8kdedUS8Rnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200356'),
  ('99463928839339050', 'Descent Into Darkness', 2013, 'Horror, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Rafael Cherkaski, Simon-Pierre Boireau, Denis Larzillière', 'Simon-Pierre Boireau, Rafael Cherkaski, Quentin Boëton', 'Rafael Cherkaski, Simon-Pierre Boireau, Elodie Bouleau, Roland David, Omar Salim, Flore Bonaventura, Simon Fraud, Naomie Winograd', null, 'A journalist from an Eastern European country arrives in Paris to start a tour of European capitals. His intention is to make a documentary about the European dream. Between fascination and difficulty of adaptation, Sorgoï struggles to complete his project and his expedition drives him to a devastating state of madness.', 'A journalist from an Eastern European country arrives in Paris to start a tour of European capitals. His intention is to make a documentary about the European dream. Between fascination and difficulty of adaptation, Sorgoï struggles to complete his project and his expedition drives him to a devastating state of madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4SoZoCfWactVJfvphxGCf6vhLu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359642'),
  ('212554138003493776', 'Descent Into Hell', 1986, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Francis Girod', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie, Francis Girod', 'Claude Brasseur, Sophie Marceau, Betsy Blair, Hippolyte Girardot, Sidiki Bakaba, Umban Gomez de Kset, Baaron, Jean-Baptiste Tiémélé', null, 'The marriage of the famous writer Alan and his young wife Lola is in a crisis. On a vacation in Haiti Lola wants to decide if their relationship still has a future...', 'The marriage of the famous writer Alan and his young wife Lola is in a crisis. On a vacation in Haiti Lola wants to decide if their relationship still has a future...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Q7GFisHIyiQisUjta0L4et2VZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53357'),
  ('591398559613701620', 'Desconectados', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Diego Rougier, Daniel Santa Ana, Carlos Vásquez Contreras', 'Diego Ayala, Diego Rougier, Rodrigo Vergara Tampe', 'Javiera Contador, María Jesus Haran, Diego Rojas, Dayana Amigo, Jaime Vadell, Jorge Zabaleta, Carmen Gloria Bresky, Norma Norma Ortiz', null, 'Victoria, a mother addicted to the internet and work, is completely disconnected from her two teenage children, Clara and Julián. Just when he is about to receive that long-awaited promotion, a solar storm leaves the entire world without internet, indefinitely. With her ex-husband stranded in another country, she is faced with the reality that she has to be a mother without the help of apps or the internet.', 'Victoria, a mother addicted to the internet and work, is completely disconnected from her two teenage children, Clara and Julián. Just when he is about to receive that long-awaited promotion, a solar storm leaves the entire world without internet, indefinitely. With her ex-husband stranded in another country, she is faced with the reality that she has to be a mother without the help of apps or the internet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Wad2HeJg4Y67dFRGC6oGKqLJWO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062088'),
  ('583386895769489846', 'Description of a Struggle', 1960, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Chris Marker', 'Alan Adair, Jean Vilar, Howard Vernon, Yaakov Malkin', null, 'Chris Marker’s documentary portrays Israel twelve years after its founding, blending location and archival footage to explore its diverse communities—from kibbutzim and Arab villages to Orthodox quarters and tourist sites. The “struggle” of the title reflects the nation’s search for identity in a rapidly changing region.', 'Chris Marker’s documentary portrays Israel twelve years after its founding, blending location and archival footage to explore its diverse communities—from kibbutzim and Arab villages to Orthodox quarters and tourist sites. The “struggle” of the title reflects the nation’s search for identity in a rapidly changing region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJVXT3bAXIQUsNM2T3qxh82SXjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214834'),
  ('964655078835042292', 'Desde el más allá', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Juan Carlos Blanco', null, 'Eugenio Becker, Sofía Lama, Óscar Yoldi, Mary Paz Mata, Ignacio Guadalupe, Ramón Medína, Gabriela Roel, Carlo Guerra', null, 'A group of ambitious new filmmakers wants to sell a broadcaster a television program involving ghosts and paranormal events. They have lots of special effects, but special effects aren''t necesary when something from beyond is lurking.', 'A group of ambitious new filmmakers wants to sell a broadcaster a television program involving ghosts and paranormal events. They have lots of special effects, but special effects aren''t necesary when something from beyond is lurking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKZhG8W0XFHLG1CJq6XDx4k6Jcn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268687'),
  ('595665474544244564', 'Desde que amanece apetece', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Antonio del Real, Juan Amorós', 'Joaquín Andújar', 'Gabino Diego, Arturo Fernández, Loles León, Kira Miró, Miguel Ángel Muñoz, Juan Muñoz, Antonio Hortelano, Ángel de Andrés López', null, 'Pelayo is leaving to work for his uncle Lorenzo and to find a nice girl to settle down with. Pelayo arrives to find out that Lorenzo''s "business" is in fact a male strip show and Lorenzo''s dancers are a laughing stock. Lorenzo has all his money tied up in his wedding with ex-prostitute Palmira. With Pelayo arriving life turns upside down. Can Lorenzo keep his infidelities a secret and his crew off the streets? Can Pelayo keep from falling for a prostitute on his way to finding a wife?', 'Pelayo is leaving to work for his uncle Lorenzo and to find a nice girl to settle down with. Pelayo arrives to find out that Lorenzo''s "business" is in fact a male strip show and Lorenzo''s dancers are a laughing stock. Lorenzo has all his money tied up in his wedding with ex-prostitute Palmira. With Pelayo arriving life turns upside down. Can Lorenzo keep his infidelities a secret and his crew off the streets? Can Pelayo keep from falling for a prostitute on his way to finding a wife?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpitqzjjtmhiHoIfBniSvE4dZWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128556'),
  ('58010550098017825', 'Desenrola', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Rosane Svartman, Adriana Camara, Bruno Levinson', 'Rosane Svartman, Juliana Lins', 'Olívia Torres, Lucas Salles, Juliana Paiva, Vitor Thiré, Daniel Passi, Thaís Botelho, Kayky Brito, Claudia Ohana', null, 'Priscila thinks she is too uptight. When her mother goes on a trip she decides to use her temporary freedom to deal with her uptightness.', 'Priscila thinks she is too uptight. When her mother goes on a trip she decides to use her temporary freedom to deal with her uptightness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szxcdngIz4SgYd2tG7yoNKTF1b6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70174'),
  ('125549958460113072', 'Deseo', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Leopoldo Laborde', null, 'Jonathan Islas, Annie Salomón, Celia Huerta, Rogelio Castillo, Karla Herrera', null, 'At a bachelor party, Paulina wins the prize of spending two hours with Fran, a stripper. The attraction between the two envelops them in a romance full of passion and eroticism.', 'At a bachelor party, Paulina wins the prize of spending two hours with Fran, a stripper. The attraction between the two envelops them in a romance full of passion and eroticism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JirndwhBJ1Gz1KxvmNUa1fMSpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429060'),
  ('817722158462734374', 'Deseo', 2013, 'Drama', 'Antonio Zavala Kugler', 'Antonio Zavala Kugler', 'Edith González, Christian Bach, Paola Nuñez, Paulina Gaitán, Leonor Varela, Lila Downs, Pedro Damián, Gerardo Taracena', null, 'Eight short stories of seduction and illicit encounters between lovers, filled with humor and eroticism, which use a circular structure located in the cosmopolitan atmosphere of a colonial city of Mexico.', 'Eight short stories of seduction and illicit encounters between lovers, filled with humor and eroticism, which use a circular structure located in the cosmopolitan atmosphere of a colonial city of Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nnco1q2lZ1uc06TcHrTU4JVElu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216919'),
  ('39658424406072321', 'Deseret', 1996, 'Documentary', 'James Benning', null, 'Fred Gardner', null, 'This is multifaceted look at the landscape and history of Utah (or Deseret, as the Mormon Church prefers to call it). Benning condenses 93 news stories from the New York Times from 1852 to 1992 (read offscreen by Fred Gardner) and sets them against contemporary Utah landscapes, the shots changing with each sentence.', 'This is multifaceted look at the landscape and history of Utah (or Deseret, as the Mormon Church prefers to call it). Benning condenses 93 news stories from the New York Times from 1852 to 1992 (read offscreen by Fred Gardner) and sets them against contemporary Utah landscapes, the shots changing with each sentence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwmZxxNSKFUfmersZRfdl8kta2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97046'),
  ('78227357674941468', 'Desert', 1976, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Says Fred Camper of the film: "Invited to Riverside, California, Brakhage, under the mistaken impression that it was a desert, was planning a desert movie when he arrived to discover an unattractive suburban landscape. So he decided to make, and shoot, a desert on his motel room table".', 'Says Fred Camper of the film: "Invited to Riverside, California, Brakhage, under the mistaken impression that it was a desert, was planning a desert movie when he arrived to discover an unattractive suburban landscape. So he decided to make, and shoot, a desert on his motel room table".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2aR4Sh8eqy4siTK2b41hxs7fu5w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164590'),
  ('674544526697962496', 'Desert Bloom', 1986, 'Drama, Family', 'Eugene Corr, Reynaldo Villalobos', 'Eugene Corr', 'Annabeth Gish, Jon Voight, JoBeth Williams, Ellen Barkin, Jay Underwood, Allen Garfield, Christine Lahti, Laura Rasmussen', null, 'The story involves Rose Chismore''s youth. She flashes back and remembers her coming-of-age. Her recollections are sometimes less than sweet, particularly those of her troubled and alcoholic step-father. Her memories of Robin, her first-love, are much happier and she also recalls her colorful Aunt Starr -- who''s visit is fun but also detrimental to her family''s health. The setting of 1950s Las Vegas'' bomb testing is increasingly significant to the development of the story.', 'The story involves Rose Chismore''s youth. She flashes back and remembers her coming-of-age. Her recollections are sometimes less than sweet, particularly those of her troubled and alcoholic step-father. Her memories of Robin, her first-love, are much happier and she also recalls her colorful Aunt Starr -- who''s visit is fun but also detrimental to her family''s health. The setting of 1950s Las Vegas'' bomb testing is increasingly significant to the development of the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOBhDCSoC9F10DlBj8Bis6odG5v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123056'),
  ('173257700926981187', 'Desert Blue', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Morgan J. Freeman, Andrea Stanley, Jamin O''Brien', 'Morgan J. Freeman', 'Kate Hudson, Brendan Sexton III, John Heard, Christina Ricci, Casey Affleck, Sara Gilbert, Ethan Suplee, Peter Sarsgaard', 'R', 'An academic obsessed with roadside attractions and his tv-star daughter stop at a small desert town to see the world''s largest ice cream cone, where, because of an accident that spilled an unknown substance all over the highway, they are forced to spend a few days with the towns eccentric residents.', 'An academic obsessed with roadside attractions and his tv-star daughter stop at a small desert town to see the world''s largest ice cream cone, where, because of an accident that spilled an unknown substance all over the highway, they are forced to spend a few days with the towns eccentric residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m81tA5hmjJ4Xzp3Yxs0dcnl8B1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41730'),
  ('613799359243960884', 'Desert Command', 1946, 'Adventure, Action', 'Colbert Clark, Armand Schaefer, Ernest Miller', null, 'John Wayne, Ruth Hall, Jack Mulhall, Raymond Hatton, Francis X. Bushman Jr., Noah Beery Jr., Robert Frazer, Robert Warwick', 'NR', 'Tom Wayne rescues Clancy, Renard and Schmidt in the Arabian desert and they join him in going after El Shaitan, a bad guy who is never seen as he tries to wipe out the Foreign Legion. Feature version of the movie serial, The Three Musketeers (1934).', 'Tom Wayne rescues Clancy, Renard and Schmidt in the Arabian desert and they join him in going after El Shaitan, a bad guy who is never seen as he tries to wipe out the Foreign Legion. Feature version of the movie serial, The Three Musketeers (1934).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kH4OyqqbJq7V1Mu0N1A5vEwwwKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137235'),
  ('492139007457068584', 'Desert Dancer', 2014, 'Drama, Music', 'Bjørn Ståle Bratberg, Richard Raymond, Carlos Catalán', 'Jon Croker', 'Freida Pinto, Reece Ritchie, Tom Cullen, Nazanin Boniadi, Marama Corlett, Akin Gazi, Simon Kassianides, Makram J. Khoury', 'PG-13', 'Inspirational true story of Iranian dancer Afshin Ghaffarian, who risked his life for his dream to become a dancer despite a nationwide dancing ban.', 'Inspirational true story of Iranian dancer Afshin Ghaffarian, who risked his life for his dream to become a dancer despite a nationwide dancing ban.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uV1GYM2gdit0SnNWAweG321evbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266102'),
  ('275607611611755194', 'Desert Dawn', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Justin Nesbitt, Marty Murray', 'Johnny Martin Walters, Johnny Walters, Chad Law', 'Kellan Lutz, Cam Gigandet, Chad Michael Collins, Texas Battle, Mike Ferguson, Michael-John Wolfe, Niko Foster, Helena Haro', 'R', 'A newly appointed small-town sheriff and his begrudging deputy get tangled up in a web of lies and corruption involving shady businessmen and the cartel while investigating the murder of a mysterious woman.', 'A newly appointed small-town sheriff and his begrudging deputy get tangled up in a web of lies and corruption involving shady businessmen and the cartel while investigating the murder of a mysterious woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MpAklfzhbIqonqt54MyGciDTjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180906'),
  ('325753799470189886', 'Desert Flower', 2009, 'Drama', 'Sherry Hormann, Ken Kelsch', 'Waris Dirie, Smita Bhide, Sherry Hormann', 'Liya Kebede, Sally Hawkins, Craig Parkinson, Meera Syal, Anthony Mackie, Juliet Stevenson, Timothy Spall, Lucrezia Phantazia', null, 'The autobiography of a Somalian nomad who was sold in marriage at 13, fled from Africa a while later to become finally an American supermodel and is now at the age of 38, the UN spokeswoman against female genital mutilation.', 'The autobiography of a Somalian nomad who was sold in marriage at 13, fled from Africa a while later to become finally an American supermodel and is now at the age of 38, the UN spokeswoman against female genital mutilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpAHsUmguktSveebXx2BNxUo0rh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33997'),
  ('201074860911389150', 'Desert Fury', 1947, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lewis Allen, Edward Cronjager, Charles Lang', 'Robert Rossen', 'John Hodiak, Lizabeth Scott, Burt Lancaster, Wendell Corey, Mary Astor, Kristine Miller, William Harrigan, James Flavin', 'NR', 'The daughter of a Nevada casino owner gets involved with a racketeer, despite everyone''s efforts to separate them.', 'The daughter of a Nevada casino owner gets involved with a racketeer, despite everyone''s efforts to separate them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNZsrXGmhz1KNMxz5I6Tzu2bthc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27034'),
  ('151719266861080084', 'Desert Hearts', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Donna Deitch, Robert Elswit', 'Natalie Cooper', 'Helen Shaver, Patricia Charbonneau, Audra Lindley, Andra Akers, Gwen Welles, Dean Butler, Katie La Bourdette, James Staley', null, 'While waiting for her divorce papers, a repressed literature professor finds herself unexpectedly attracted by a carefree, spirited young woman named Cay.', 'While waiting for her divorce papers, a repressed literature professor finds herself unexpectedly attracted by a carefree, spirited young woman named Cay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klAHoWOZgL8sR74Tnl7K7z4Lziq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294'),
  ('140378001178498761', 'Desert Moon', 2001, 'Drama', 'Shinji Aoyama, Masaki Tamura', 'Shinji Aoyama', 'Hiroshi Mikami, Maho Toyota, Shuji Kashiwabara, Yukiko Ikari, Takahito Hosoyamada, Jun Kunimura, Katsuhisa Namase, Pierre Taki', null, 'A successful businessman and his alcoholic wife attempt to piece together their unhappy lives and shattered marriage. Little do Nagai and Akira know that their precarious relationship will soon be transformed by a stranger, the enigmatic Keechie.', 'A successful businessman and his alcoholic wife attempt to piece together their unhappy lives and shattered marriage. Little do Nagai and Akira know that their precarious relationship will soon be transformed by a stranger, the enigmatic Keechie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKMpmYRzZS5PoilxEc9QJKd4Y7k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182134'),
  ('1066383336485763871', 'Desert Nights', 1929, 'Adventure, Drama', 'William Nigh, James Wong Howe', 'Lenore J. Coffee', 'John Gilbert, Ernest Torrence, Mary Nolan, Claude King', 'NR', 'Jewel thieves pull a heist on a diamond mining operation in Africa and take the foreman hostage before escaping into the Kalahari Desert, but when they get lost, the foreman must take charge and save them.', 'Jewel thieves pull a heist on a diamond mining operation in Africa and take the foreman hostage before escaping into the Kalahari Desert, but when they get lost, the foreman must take charge and save them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gan6z7cRBD1GmNi6NVBOYyvhXf0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119922'),
  ('541399205801560556', 'Desert of Namibia', 2024, 'Drama', 'Yoko Yamanaka, Wataru Hiranami, Shin Yonekura', 'Yoko Yamanaka', 'Yuumi Kawai, Daichi Kaneko, Kanichiro Sato, Yuzumi Shintani, Keisuke Horibe, Makiko Watanabe, Ayumu Nakajima, Erika Karata', null, 'A young and beautiful woman from Tokyo navigates multiple love stories while being haunted by her unexpressed thoughts.', 'A young and beautiful woman from Tokyo navigates multiple love stories while being haunted by her unexpressed thoughts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GmjVMDsj4YFwVGzEcvl8XTaMaB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1275240'),
  ('193592383142240774', 'Desert Saints', 2002, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'Richard Greenberg, John Newby, Christopher Tufty', 'Richard Greenberg, Wally Nichols', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Melora Walters, Jamey Sheridan, Leslie Stefanson, Bill Sage, Keith Diamond, Shawn Woods, Christopher Bersh', 'R', 'Banks is a hit man, the best, usually working for Latin American drug cartels. He picks up solitary women, uses them briefly for a job, then kills them. He''s in the Southwest, headed toward Mexico, when he picks up Bennie, a woman leaving an abusive marriage, going to Paradise, Arizona. The film follows three tracks: Banks''s slow recruitment of Bennie, the set-up for the hit at a swank resort in Mexico, and the FBI''s close pursuit of Banks, whom they want alive in hopes he''ll rat out his bosses. Bennie may not be who she seems, and there may be a chink in Banks''s tough-guy armor. Guns, money, and a chance at Paradise.', 'Banks is a hit man, the best, usually working for Latin American drug cartels. He picks up solitary women, uses them briefly for a job, then kills them. He''s in the Southwest, headed toward Mexico, when he picks up Bennie, a woman leaving an abusive marriage, going to Paradise, Arizona. The film follows three tracks: Banks''s slow recruitment of Bennie, the set-up for the hit at a swank resort in Mexico, and the FBI''s close pursuit of Banks, whom they want alive in hopes he''ll rat out his bosses. Bennie may not be who she seems, and there may be a chink in Banks''s tough-guy armor. Guns, money, and a chance at Paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2as5ytuOjrT01xr4wmqJBhfUNlV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2095'),
  ('805333851888904787', 'Desert Victory', 1943, 'War, Documentary', 'David MacDonald, Roy Boulting', 'J.L. Hodson', 'Harold Alexander, Winston Churchill, Adolf Hitler, Bernard L. Montgomery, Erwin Rommel, Claude Auchinleck, Alan Brooke, Alan Cunningham', null, 'A featureless land fit only for war, as the narrator, J. L. Hodson stated in the early scenes: "If war was to be fought then let it begin here". In endless miles of rock-strewn scrub desert, where civilians hardly existed. Desert Victory tells the story of the Allied campaign to drive Germany and Italy from North Africa is analysed, with the major portion of the film examining the battles at El Alamein, including some re-enactment. Won "Best Documentary Feature" at the 16th Academy Awards in 1944.', 'A featureless land fit only for war, as the narrator, J. L. Hodson stated in the early scenes: "If war was to be fought then let it begin here". In endless miles of rock-strewn scrub desert, where civilians hardly existed. Desert Victory tells the story of the Allied campaign to drive Germany and Italy from North Africa is analysed, with the major portion of the film examining the battles at El Alamein, including some re-enactment. Won "Best Documentary Feature" at the 16th Academy Awards in 1944.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UgT6cLTCAGqhojwpVNxajT2sS5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93335'),
  ('545769688083871402', 'Deserter', 2002, 'Drama, War', 'Martin Huberty, Dino Parks', 'Simon Murray', 'Paul Fox, Tom Hardy, Kate Maberly, Aitor Merino, Félicité Du Jeu, Yorick van Wageningen, Christian Mulot, Dugald Bruce Lockhart', null, 'Unlikely friends in a melting pot of confusion. Simon Murray fights for the French Foreign Legion. Pascal Dupont fights for himself. War torn men question honour, hope, morality...because you can desert everything...except yourself.', 'Unlikely friends in a melting pot of confusion. Simon Murray fights for the French Foreign Legion. Pascal Dupont fights for himself. War torn men question honour, hope, morality...because you can desert everything...except yourself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nb7fYnVnWeTRYNxvKFLDbcRV87f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63971'),
  ('1052640229159366508', 'Deserter''s Gold', 1998, 'Comedy, History, War', 'Janusz Majewski', 'Janusz Majewski', 'Marek Kondrat, Bogusław Linda, Wiktor Zborowski, Katarzyna Figura, Piotr Gąsowski, Jan Englert, Piotr Machalica, Leonard Pietraszak', null, '"Deserter''s Gold", the sequel to the very popular "The Deserters", is a rich war comedy, skipping humorously around the more serious dangers of a war. Deserters Gold takes place during World War II, while the first film happened during WWI. The heroes'' mission is to rob a Nazi-run bank in Poland for gold that will buy military supplies for the Polish Underground.', '"Deserter''s Gold", the sequel to the very popular "The Deserters", is a rich war comedy, skipping humorously around the more serious dangers of a war. Deserters Gold takes place during World War II, while the first film happened during WWI. The heroes'' mission is to rob a Nazi-run bank in Poland for gold that will buy military supplies for the Polish Underground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Slaj3YMBsnzNaBbjvjWdVq5JY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36412'),
  ('239465477870931816', 'Desi Boyz', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rohit Dhawan, Mudita Vohra, Brighu Bali', 'Rohit Dhawan, Milap Zaveri', 'Akshay Kumar, John Abraham, Deepika Padukone, Chitrangada Singh, Anupam Kher, Sanjay Dutt, Omi Vaidya, Mohnish Behl', null, 'When two cash-strapped UK-based Indians become male escorts amid an economic downturn, money flows right in but everything else in their lives starts falling apart.', 'When two cash-strapped UK-based Indians become male escorts amid an economic downturn, money flows right in but everything else in their lives starts falling apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ARLxG5RbsHMxDYhUFEXq2jSSI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79990'),
  ('296432166768507173', 'Desideria', 1980, 'Drama', 'Claudio Cirillo, Gianni Barcelloni', 'Gianni Barcelloni, Günter Ebert, Enzo Ungari', 'Stefania Sandrelli, Orso Maria Guerrini, Lara Wendel, Klaus Löwitsch, Vittorio Mezzogiorno, Lory Del Santo, Rossana Marra, Francesca Giordani', null, 'All her life, an overweight girl has been ignored by her rich and attractive mother. But when the ugly duckling becomes a swan, she turns into a world-class tease, exacting her revenge by seducing her mother''s boyfriend...', 'All her life, an overweight girl has been ignored by her rich and attractive mother. But when the ugly duckling becomes a swan, she turns into a world-class tease, exacting her revenge by seducing her mother''s boyfriend...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buQOGvn2502XMG7QaJW2TvPzjEV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182188'),
  ('682087667803742778', 'Desierto', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jonás Cuarón, Damián García', 'Mateo García Elizondo', 'Gael García Bernal, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Diego Cataño, Marco Pérez, Alondra Hidalgo, Óscar Flores Guerrero, David Lorenzo, Lew Temple', 'R', 'A group of Mexican emigrants attempts to cross the Mexican-US border. What begins as a hopeful journey becomes a harrowing, bloody and primal fight for survival when a deranged, rifle-toting vigilante and his loyal Belgian Malinois dog chase the group of unarmed men and women through the treacherous borderland. In the harsh, unforgiving desert terrain, the odds are stacked firmly against them as they discover there’s nowhere to hide from the unrelenting, merciless killer.', 'A group of Mexican emigrants attempts to cross the Mexican-US border. What begins as a hopeful journey becomes a harrowing, bloody and primal fight for survival when a deranged, rifle-toting vigilante and his loyal Belgian Malinois dog chase the group of unarmed men and women through the treacherous borderland. In the harsh, unforgiving desert terrain, the odds are stacked firmly against them as they discover there’s nowhere to hide from the unrelenting, merciless killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67Ue5or6ZPScqkagC3EJSOYuzyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258363'),
  ('125480659110821982', 'Design for Leaving', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Daffy Duck is a salesman for a futuristic appliance company, who, against Elmer Fudd''s will, modernizes Fudd''s house with many screwball gadgets, none of which work in Fudd''s favor.', 'Daffy Duck is a salesman for a futuristic appliance company, who, against Elmer Fudd''s will, modernizes Fudd''s house with many screwball gadgets, none of which work in Fudd''s favor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zb1PGXsblV0CjmGPjXcbzguSOgW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204031'),
