  ('630569614018956920', 'Desire', 1936, 'Romance, Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Frank Borzage, Charles Lang', 'Edwin Justus Mayer, Waldemar Young, Samuel Hoffenstein', 'Marlene Dietrich, Gary Cooper, John Halliday, William Frawley, Ernest Cossart, Akim Tamiroff, Alan Mowbray, Zeffie Tilbury', 'NR', 'Madeleine steals a string of pearls in Paris and uses American engineer Tom, who is driving on his vacation to Spain, to get the pearls out of France. But getting the pearls back from him proves to be difficult without falling in love.', 'Madeleine steals a string of pearls in Paris and uses American engineer Tom, who is driving on his vacation to Spain, to get the pearls out of France. But getting the pearls back from him proves to be difficult without falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoYV0IyYQmmbYxhZEVUlGIwb6DT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78998'),
  ('627424643696758369', 'Desire', 1946, 'Drama', 'Marcello Pagliero, Roberto Rossellini, Rodolfo Lombardi', 'Giuseppe De Santis, Roberto Rossellini, Diego Calcagno', 'Massimo Girotti, Carlo Ninchi, Elli Parvo, Roswita Schmidt, Lia Corelli, Francesco Grandjacquet, Jucci Kellerman, Spartaco Conversi', null, 'Paola, a Milan call girl, returns home to her village in the Abruzzi mountains in an attempt to go straight. Rejected by her father, blackmailed by a former lover, and lusted after by her brother-in-law, she turns to her beloved sister for support. Denied succor, like so many of Rossellini’s isolated figures, Paola awaits the arrival of her fiancé, who has offered her a new start, but instead decides that life is untenable.', 'Paola, a Milan call girl, returns home to her village in the Abruzzi mountains in an attempt to go straight. Rejected by her father, blackmailed by a former lover, and lusted after by her brother-in-law, she turns to her beloved sister for support. Denied succor, like so many of Rossellini’s isolated figures, Paola awaits the arrival of her fiancé, who has offered her a new start, but instead decides that life is untenable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTqM556KcRQ8SFpziUXC34bRRGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199305'),
  ('29876227548934102', 'Desire', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Bernard Murat', null, 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Fanny Ardant, Béatrice Dalle, Claude Rich, Jean Yanne, Dominique Lavanant, Annie Grégorio', null, 'Désiré is a fine servant and butler who regularly seduces the ladies of the house where he works, but then he moves on. This time he is working for Odette, the mistress of the minister of Posts and he is living a new situation. He has fallen in love with with Odette.', 'Désiré is a fine servant and butler who regularly seduces the ladies of the house where he works, but then he moves on. This time he is working for Odette, the mistress of the minister of Posts and he is living a new situation. He has fallen in love with with Odette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sj0ZfQ79V6CyuINV9EaDp4cKhN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83668'),
  ('467987332379753070', 'Desire', 2002, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kim Eung-soo', null, 'Jang So-yeon, Ahn Nae-sang, Lee Dong-kyu, Lee Soo-ah, Shin Sun-hee', null, 'A couple is set in their monotonous life until the husband has a homosexual affair with a young male prostitute. Suspicious of her husband, the wife seeks the truth and eventually ends up in bed with the same young man. Their desire has a new meaning.', 'A couple is set in their monotonous life until the husband has a homosexual affair with a young male prostitute. Suspicious of her husband, the wife seeks the truth and eventually ends up in bed with the same young man. Their desire has a new meaning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGVQK8c2cnxvuazQlzxB6bELlMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321235'),
  ('500380932580676546', 'Desire', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Laurent Bouhnik, Dominique Colin', 'Laurent Bouhnik', 'Déborah Révy, Hélène Zimmer, Gowan Didi, Johnny Amaro, Johan Libéreau, Jean-François Gallotte, Brice Fournier, Christelle Benoit', 'R', 'In a social context deteriorated by a countrywide economic crisis, the life of several people will be turned upside down after they meet Cécile, a character who symbolizes desire.', 'In a social context deteriorated by a countrywide economic crisis, the life of several people will be turned upside down after they meet Cécile, a character who symbolizes desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxvvNXY3n0637cOcdeC61eyVAnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86331'),
  ('1007879738597676196', 'Desire', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Diego Kaplan, Federico Cantini', 'Erika Halvorsen', 'Mónica Antonópulos, Guilherme Winter, Juan Sorini, Andrea Frigerio, Sol Charo Martínez, Agostina Bettinelli, Carolina Ardohain, Luciana Sismondi', null, 'Lucía and Ofelia, two sisters, finally meet after 7 years of cold relationships upon Lucia ''s wedding. But when Juan, Lucia''s husband, and Ofelia meet, they feel like a disruptive fantasy have enchanted their minds and bodies...', 'Lucía and Ofelia, two sisters, finally meet after 7 years of cold relationships upon Lucia ''s wedding. But when Juan, Lucia''s husband, and Ofelia meet, they feel like a disruptive fantasy have enchanted their minds and bodies...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnTYASRVkL5QPLeM0FeojTGRbgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479957'),
  ('1143973996114908632', 'Désiré', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Sacha Guitry, Jean Bachelet', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry, Jacqueline Delubac, Jacques Baumer, Pauline Carton, Saturnin Fabre, Geneviève Vix, Arletty, Alys Delonde', null, 'Sacha Guitry exchanges his usual top hat for a uniform in Désiré, playing a cavalier valet embroiled in an awkward flirtation with his new employer (played by the actor-director''s real-life wife, Jacqueline Delubac), who is involved with a stuffy politician. A carefree class farce filled with memorable supporting characters, Désiré blurs the distinction between upstairs and downstairs.', 'Sacha Guitry exchanges his usual top hat for a uniform in Désiré, playing a cavalier valet embroiled in an awkward flirtation with his new employer (played by the actor-director''s real-life wife, Jacqueline Delubac), who is involved with a stuffy politician. A carefree class farce filled with memorable supporting characters, Désiré blurs the distinction between upstairs and downstairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikQMKc7R32GDQqI3b9auICuf4LC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76702'),
  ('132037942535137330', 'Désiré', 1993, 'Science Fiction', 'Albert Dupontel', 'Albert Dupontel, Carlo De Boutiny', 'Albert Dupontel, Lola Crespin, Cathy Duros, Éric Elmosnino, Daniel Laur, Nicolas Marié, Mariamne Merlo, Philippe Uchan', null, 'The year is 2050, in this future giving birth is nothing more than a simple formality. But the birth of Désiré will be much more painful...', 'The year is 2050, in this future giving birth is nothing more than a simple formality. But the birth of Désiré will be much more painful...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4vRmkeDUmVctHZwo3Z4jgaziV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334317'),
  ('1107315330822260912', 'Désiré Landru', 2005, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Pierre Boutron, Guy Famechon', 'Pierre Boutron, Jérôme Beaujour, Emmanuel Carrère', 'Patrick Timsit, Julie Delarme, Catherine Arditi, Danièle Lebrun, Catherine Jacob, François Caron, Damien Jouillerot, Babsie Steger', null, 'Désiré Landru - husband, lover - and murderer. Based on documented facts, this is the full story of one of the most ambiguous criminals and lovers of the 20th century, the first modern serial killer.', 'Désiré Landru - husband, lover - and murderer. Based on documented facts, this is the full story of one of the most ambiguous criminals and lovers of the 20th century, the first modern serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGTo582KOfaXu6ZzdmUR2cq47yu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215784'),
  ('790205299903829582', 'Desire Under the Elms', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Delbert Mann, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Irwin Shaw', 'Sophia Loren, Anthony Perkins, Burl Ives, Pernell Roberts, Frank Overton, Rebecca Welles, Jean Willes, Anne Seymour', null, 'Ephraim Cabot is an old man of amazing vitality who loves his New England farm with a greedy passion. Hating him, and sharing his greed, are the sons of two wives Cabot has overworked into early graves. Most bitter is Eben, whose mother had owned most of the farm, and who feels who should be sole heir. When the old man brings home a new wife, Anna, she becomes a fierce contender to inherit the farm. Two of the sons leave when Eben gives them the fare in return for their shares of the farm. Meanwhile, Anna tries to cause some sparks by rubbing up against Eben.', 'Ephraim Cabot is an old man of amazing vitality who loves his New England farm with a greedy passion. Hating him, and sharing his greed, are the sons of two wives Cabot has overworked into early graves. Most bitter is Eben, whose mother had owned most of the farm, and who feels who should be sole heir. When the old man brings home a new wife, Anna, she becomes a fierce contender to inherit the farm. Two of the sons leave when Eben gives them the fare in return for their shares of the farm. Meanwhile, Anna tries to cause some sparks by rubbing up against Eben.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvRCRiVQtDv5OtlnhB1L8sw08jj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77960'),
  ('655357747877695720', 'Désirée', 1954, 'Drama, Romance', 'Henry Koster, Milton Krasner', 'Daniel Taradash', 'Marlon Brando, Jean Simmons, Merle Oberon, Michael Rennie, Cameron Mitchell, Elizabeth Sellars, Charlotte Austin, Cathleen Nesbitt', 'NR', 'In Marseilles, France in 1794, Desiree Clary, a young millinery clerk, becomes infatuated with Napoleon Bonaparte, but winds up wedding General Jean-Baptiste Berandotte, an aid to Napoleon who later joins the forces that bring about the Emperor''s downfall. Josephine Beauharnais, a worldly courtesan marries Napoleon and becomes Empress of France, but is then cast aside by her spouse when she proves unable to produce an heir to the throne.', 'In Marseilles, France in 1794, Desiree Clary, a young millinery clerk, becomes infatuated with Napoleon Bonaparte, but winds up wedding General Jean-Baptiste Berandotte, an aid to Napoleon who later joins the forces that bring about the Emperor''s downfall. Josephine Beauharnais, a worldly courtesan marries Napoleon and becomes Empress of France, but is then cast aside by her spouse when she proves unable to produce an heir to the throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvTDhI11hpiWJDRKAheoWtBknTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43333'),
  ('444401451291602131', 'Desires', 1983, 'Drama, Fantasy, Music', 'Rafael Corkidi, Rafael Corkidi', 'Rafael Corkidi, Carlos Illescas', 'Ana Luisa Peluffo, Ernesto Gómez Cruz, Angélica Chain, Jorge Humberto Robles, Gina Morett, Martin LaSalle, Ana De Sade, Elpidia Carrillo', null, 'Snippets of a family drama involving a rebellious son coming to his depressing home village, his father, and a jaded ex-lover, mixed with various surrealist scenes and statements about sin.', 'Snippets of a family drama involving a rebellious son coming to his depressing home village, his father, and a jaded ex-lover, mixed with various surrealist scenes and statements about sin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDBRJC6Pl6BoHCyRSiBZgGDVeFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104285'),
  ('297583031187618911', 'Desiring Julia', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Maria Pia Rocco, Andrea Barzini, Mario Vulpiani', 'Domenico Matteucci, Gianfranco Clerici, Andrea Barzini', 'Serena Grandi, Johan Leysen, Valeria D''Obici, Sergio Rubini, Carlo Maestro, Carlo Colombo, Alessandra Izzo, Massimo Sarchielli', null, 'A young man falls in love with extra-liberated Giulia. Their relationship becomes very passionate, but Giulia has no limits in her sexual fantasies and games. Poor guy, will soon discover he''ll have to pay a price for Giulia. He''ll have to put up with all her strange and pervert desires, until of course he reaches his limits.', 'A young man falls in love with extra-liberated Giulia. Their relationship becomes very passionate, but Giulia has no limits in her sexual fantasies and games. Poor guy, will soon discover he''ll have to pay a price for Giulia. He''ll have to put up with all her strange and pervert desires, until of course he reaches his limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzpLMtB6lZpo83T1TnMBCrafMVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255382'),
  ('677603909694953843', 'Desistfilm', 1954, 'Drama', 'Stan Brakhage', 'Stan Brakhage', 'A. Austin, Robert Benson, Yvonne Fair, Lawrence Jordan, Walter Newcomb, James Tenney', null, 'Four young men and a young woman sit in boredom. She smokes while one strums a lute, one looks at a magazine, and two fiddle with string. The door opens and in comes a young man, cigarette between his lips, a swagger on his face. The young woman laughs. As the four young men continue disconnected activities, the other two become a couple. When the four realize something has changed, first they stare at the couple who have kissed and now are dancing slowly. The four run from the house in a kind of frenzy and return to stare. The power of sex has unnerved them.', 'Four young men and a young woman sit in boredom. She smokes while one strums a lute, one looks at a magazine, and two fiddle with string. The door opens and in comes a young man, cigarette between his lips, a swagger on his face. The young woman laughs. As the four young men continue disconnected activities, the other two become a couple. When the four realize something has changed, first they stare at the couple who have kissed and now are dancing slowly. The four run from the house in a kind of frenzy and return to stare. The power of sex has unnerved them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5SAkAdvDIQzUlJUs1C2KokdhyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126124'),
  ('1074275756805731521', 'Desk Set', 1957, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Walter Lang, Leon Shamroy', 'Henry Ephron, Phoebe Ephron', 'Spencer Tracy, Katharine Hepburn, Gig Young, Joan Blondell, Dina Merrill, Sue Randall, Neva Patterson, Harry Ellerbe', 'NR', 'A computer expert tries to prove his electronic brain can replace a television network''s research staff.', 'A computer expert tries to prove his electronic brain can replace a television network''s research staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gFerTRUGkIFn41mb3B1wb8ohtj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24203'),
  ('641932217700567981', 'Desmadre Incluido', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Miguel Martí, Miguel P. Gilaberte, Hugo Baena', 'Gerardo Boneque', 'Macarena Gómez, Cristina Brondo, Mara Guil, Arlette Torres, Manuel Tallafé, Salva Reina, Jorge Clemente, Antonia San Juan', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDerGXOxXvEYWqbDBPWeMrS6IOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1131929'),
  ('473237484908688632', 'Desmontando a Lucía', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alberto Utrera, Miguel Ángel García', 'Alberto Utrera', 'Susana Abaitua, Hugo Silva, Julián Villagrán, Rodrigo Poisón, Angelo Olivier, Eduardo Rejón, Manuel Teódulo, Emy Cazorla', null, 'Lucía is arrested while driving her boyfriend Héctor''s car at 200 km/h, dazed and bloody. She was sharing a weekend at the beach with him and Elena, her best friend. Now they are both missing and Lucía only remembers a “little” argument that ended with a bottle broken on Héctor’s head, but that’s all. This complicates Simon’s life. A private investigator? No. , thank you. Simon prefers to consider himself a simple “judicial expert”. When his partner Oliver, a lawyer with financial problems due to gambling, asks him to investigate Lucía and the disappearances, Simon does not know that he is about to take the Expertise on another level. Obsessed with Bogart''s film noir, Simón will go beyond all limits when he falls in love with Lucía, the amnesiac suspect in the murder he is investigating.', 'Lucía is arrested while driving her boyfriend Héctor''s car at 200 km/h, dazed and bloody. She was sharing a weekend at the beach with him and Elena, her best friend. Now they are both missing and Lucía only remembers a “little” argument that ended with a bottle broken on Héctor’s head, but that’s all. This complicates Simon’s life. A private investigator? No. , thank you. Simon prefers to consider himself a simple “judicial expert”. When his partner Oliver, a lawyer with financial problems due to gambling, asks him to investigate Lucía and the disappearances, Simon does not know that he is about to take the Expertise on another level. Obsessed with Bogart''s film noir, Simón will go beyond all limits when he falls in love with Lucía, the amnesiac suspect in the murder he is investigating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zWj356Tr4SyWdgnZ0qGYc6m5v7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1371610'),
  ('500127912227047976', 'Desmundo', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Pedro Farkas, Alain Fresnot', 'Alain Fresnot, Anna Muylaert, Sabina Anzuategui', 'Simone Spoladore, Osmar Prado, Caco Ciocler, Berta Zemel, Beatriz Segall, José Eduardo, Debora Olivieri, Olair Coan', null, 'The story of Orisbela, a young and religious woman who comes from Portugal to Brazil to marry Francisco de Albuquerque, a rude sugar-cane plantation owner, in 1570.', 'The story of Orisbela, a young and religious woman who comes from Portugal to Brazil to marry Francisco de Albuquerque, a rude sugar-cane plantation owner, in 1570.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wP7PFoH80bx72Hmsm810FBUirp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161244'),
  ('24986736537580823', 'Desnudos', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Enrique Gómez Vadillo', 'Mauricio Pichardo', 'Rafael Amaya, Juan Vidal, Carmen Rodríguez, Karyme Lozano, Julio Camejo, Sebastian Ligarde, David Zepeda, Jorge da Silva', null, 'A gentle artist contends with his cheating girlfriend, and an innocent girl longs to break free from an abusive relationship. When fate brings these two lovelorn people together, true love finally blossoms.', 'A gentle artist contends with his cheating girlfriend, and an innocent girl longs to break free from an abusive relationship. When fate brings these two lovelorn people together, true love finally blossoms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQxFkCD7InROJiY0NjytLvQI242.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71578'),
  ('466298720385018866', 'Despair', 1978, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Ballhaus, Harry Baer', 'Tom Stoppard', 'Dirk Bogarde, Andréa Ferréol, Klaus Löwitsch, Volker Spengler, Bernhard Wicki, Armin Meier, Peter Kern, Adrian Hoven', null, 'Berlin, 1930, during the rise of Nazism. Hermann Hermann, a Russian emigrant and chocolate manufacturer, married to the capricious Lydia, loses his temper more and more every day when dealing with his workers and other businessmen; until he meets Felix, a vagrant, who seems to be physically identical to him; a disconcerting fact that leads Hermann Hermann to plot a particular way out of a fake world he actually hates.', 'Berlin, 1930, during the rise of Nazism. Hermann Hermann, a Russian emigrant and chocolate manufacturer, married to the capricious Lydia, loses his temper more and more every day when dealing with his workers and other businessmen; until he meets Felix, a vagrant, who seems to be physically identical to him; a disconcerting fact that leads Hermann Hermann to plot a particular way out of a fake world he actually hates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Mw8gaRsctMEHPkjsYM5d1RkGOe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42203'),
  ('703636676765926660', 'Desperado', 1995, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Robert Rodriguez, Batan Silva, Ricardo M. Kaplan', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Antonio Banderas, Salma Hayek Pinault, Joaquim de Almeida, Steve Buscemi, Cheech Marin, Carlos Gómez, Quentin Tarantino, Tito Larriva', 'R', 'El Mariachi plunges headfirst into the dark border underworld when he follows a trail of blood to the last of the infamous Mexican drug lords, Bucho, for an action-packed, bullet-riddled showdown. With the help of his friend and a beautiful bookstore owner, El Mariachi tracks Bucho, takes on his army of desperados, and leaves his own trail of blood.', 'El Mariachi plunges headfirst into the dark border underworld when he follows a trail of blood to the last of the infamous Mexican drug lords, Bucho, for an action-packed, bullet-riddled showdown. With the help of his friend and a beautiful bookstore owner, El Mariachi tracks Bucho, takes on his army of desperados, and leaves his own trail of blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3gwpBeXpvGZsxUya9zNym5QXrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8068'),
  ('714377590209777277', 'Desperado Outpost', 1959, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Yuzuru Aizawa', 'Kihachi Okamoto', 'Makoto Satō, Izumi Yukimura, Yōsuke Natsuki, Misa Uehara, Tatsuyoshi Ehara, Michirō Minami, Tadao Nakamaru, Ichirō Nakatani', null, 'When Sergeant Okubo''s brother is murdered at a Japanese outpost in Northern China during the Second World War, Okubo poses as a war correspondent and seeks out his brother''s killer.', 'When Sergeant Okubo''s brother is murdered at a Japanese outpost in Northern China during the Second World War, Okubo poses as a war correspondent and seeks out his brother''s killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iPI6kUKAOCfWL0dLuq3tUp8C6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125250'),
  ('388936329742893297', 'Desperados', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'LP, Tim Orr', 'Ellen Rapoport', 'Nasim Pedrad, Anna Camp, Lamorne Morris, Sarah Burns, Robbie Amell, Heather Graham, Jessica Chaffin, Izzy Diaz', null, 'A panicked young woman and her two best friends fly to Mexico to delete a ranting email she sent to her new boyfriend. On arrival, they run into her former beau, who soon gets caught up in their frantic scheme.', 'A panicked young woman and her two best friends fly to Mexico to delete a ranting email she sent to her new boyfriend. On arrival, they run into her former beau, who soon gets caught up in their frantic scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoUzSMxGu4Bm73EvH6B3iceFwW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706510'),
  ('153909509341907351', 'Desperate', 1947, 'Thriller, Crime', 'George E. Diskant, Anthony Mann, Nate Levinson', 'Harry Essex', 'Steve Brodie, Audrey Long, Raymond Burr, Douglas Fowley, William Challee, Jason Robards Sr., Freddie Steele, Lee Frederick', 'NR', 'An innocent trucker takes it on the lam when he''s accused of robbery.', 'An innocent trucker takes it on the lam when he''s accused of robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ac91MANcG3oFkr0u9TgcwD2LJNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35955'),
  ('908670717609066143', 'Desperate Hours', 1990, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Michael Cimino, Douglas Milsome, Carl Goldstein', 'Mark Rosenthal, Lawrence Konner, Joseph Hayes', 'Mickey Rourke, Anthony Hopkins, Mimi Rogers, Lindsay Crouse, Kelly Lynch, Elias Koteas, David Morse, Shawnee Smith', 'R', 'An escaped con, on the run from the law, moves into a married couple''s house and takes over their lives.', 'An escaped con, on the run from the law, moves into a married couple''s house and takes over their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtIRVVHRRr4iWN8yJ6tQs0CqWV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31676'),
  ('213222864773420715', 'Desperate Journey', 1942, 'War, Adventure, Action', 'Raoul Walsh, Bert Glennon', 'Arthur T. Horman', 'Errol Flynn, Ronald Reagan, Nancy Coleman, Raymond Massey, Alan Hale, Arthur Kennedy, Ronald Sinclair, Albert Bassermann', 'NR', 'During WWII, when an allied bomber is shot down over Germany, the five surviving crew are captured but cleverly escape detention after learning German secret information and knocking out a Nazi major. With the angry major in hot pursuit, aided by military personnel, Gestapo agents and Hitler-loyal citizens, the five wend their way across perilous Germany, intent on reaching the UK with the secrets they have learned.', 'During WWII, when an allied bomber is shot down over Germany, the five surviving crew are captured but cleverly escape detention after learning German secret information and knocking out a Nazi major. With the angry major in hot pursuit, aided by military personnel, Gestapo agents and Hitler-loyal citizens, the five wend their way across perilous Germany, intent on reaching the UK with the secrets they have learned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oanNUFLVasmh3MOIoe7Rq1THnOj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55236'),
  ('130375154998306018', 'Desperate Love 1989', 1992, 'Animation, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Takuji Endo, Yasunori Honda', null, 'Show Hayami, Takehito Koyasu, Kappei Yamaguchi', null, 'Koji Nanjo, a young rock star, falls in love with soccer player Takuto Izumi. Koji eventually learns that Izumi''s mother killed his father out of severe and intense love. Izumi took all the guilt for his father''s murder and refuses to go pro because of fear that his past will be discovered by the media. Izumi detests Koji''s company and encouragement and severely dislikes the attention from the press, but Koji cannot stay away for he soon realizes that his love for Izumi is very similar to the love that Izumi''s mother felt for his father.', 'Koji Nanjo, a young rock star, falls in love with soccer player Takuto Izumi. Koji eventually learns that Izumi''s mother killed his father out of severe and intense love. Izumi took all the guilt for his father''s murder and refuses to go pro because of fear that his past will be discovered by the media. Izumi detests Koji''s company and encouragement and severely dislikes the attention from the press, but Koji cannot stay away for he soon realizes that his love for Izumi is very similar to the love that Izumi''s mother felt for his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/616CLW9UVVeAAYmvncLoj0mhaYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456994'),
  ('990268686693689100', 'Desperate Measures', 1998, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Luciano Tovoli, Barbet Schroeder, Geoffrey Hansen', 'David Klass', 'Michael Keaton, Andy Garcia, Brian Cox, Marcia Gay Harden, Erik King, Efrain Figueroa, Joseph Cross, Janel Moloney', 'R', 'San Francisco police officer Frank Connor is in a frantic search for a compatible bone marrow donor for his gravely ill son. There''s only one catch the potential donor is convicted multiple murderer Peter McCabe who sees a trip to the hospital as the perfect opportunity to get what he wants most: freedom. With McCabe''s escape, the entire hospital becomes a battleground and Connor must pursue and, ironically, protect the deadly fugitive who is his son''s only hope for survival.', 'San Francisco police officer Frank Connor is in a frantic search for a compatible bone marrow donor for his gravely ill son. There''s only one catch the potential donor is convicted multiple murderer Peter McCabe who sees a trip to the hospital as the perfect opportunity to get what he wants most: freedom. With McCabe''s escape, the entire hospital becomes a battleground and Connor must pursue and, ironically, protect the deadly fugitive who is his son''s only hope for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74ibzyjLp2dizmiua5nHn4llG0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9458'),
  ('528780831406214662', 'Desperate Remedies', 1993, 'Drama', 'Stewart Main, Peter Wells, Leon Narbey', 'Peter Wells, Stewart Main', 'Jennifer Ward-Lealand, Kevin Smith, Lisa Chappell, Cliff Curtis, Michael Hurst, Helen Steemson, Kiri Mills, Bridget Armstrong', null, 'In a town called Hope on the edge of Britain''s empire, desperations clash: the beautiful Dorothea Brook is desperate to free her pregnant sister Rose from the clutches of Fraser, a fortune hunter. A local politician, William Poyner, is desperate for cash and thinks marriage to Dorothea will save him. Dorothea hires Lawrence Hayes, a rough but handsome Argonaut, to bribe Fraser with jewels and to marry Rose; Hayes desperately loves Dorothea and may marry Rose to stay close to her. But Dorothea has a lover, the ravishing Anne Cooper, who encourages the match with Poyser to give the lovers cover. Are these remedies, each desperate in its turn, going to make anyone happy?', 'In a town called Hope on the edge of Britain''s empire, desperations clash: the beautiful Dorothea Brook is desperate to free her pregnant sister Rose from the clutches of Fraser, a fortune hunter. A local politician, William Poyner, is desperate for cash and thinks marriage to Dorothea will save him. Dorothea hires Lawrence Hayes, a rough but handsome Argonaut, to bribe Fraser with jewels and to marry Rose; Hayes desperately loves Dorothea and may marry Rose to stay close to her. But Dorothea has a lover, the ravishing Anne Cooper, who encourages the match with Poyser to give the lovers cover. Are these remedies, each desperate in its turn, going to make anyone happy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9ajGTvlNIgPtCzdvyCHGISzKKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125262'),
  ('170965095021643680', 'Desperate Riders', 2022, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Hank Baumert Jr., Michael Feifer', 'Lee Martin', 'Drew Waters, Trace Adkins, Tom Berenger, Vanessa Evigan, Sam Ashby, Victoria Pratt, Cowboy Troy, Rob Mayes', 'PG-13', 'After Kansas Red rescues young Billy from a card-game shootout, the boy asks Red for help protecting his family from the outlaw Thorn, who’s just kidnapped Billy’s mother, Carol. As Red and Billy ride off to rescue Carol, they run into beautiful, tough-as-nails Leslie, who’s managed to escape Thorn’s men. The three race to stop Thorn’s wedding to Carol with guns a-blazing - but does she want to be rescued?', 'After Kansas Red rescues young Billy from a card-game shootout, the boy asks Red for help protecting his family from the outlaw Thorn, who’s just kidnapped Billy’s mother, Carol. As Red and Billy ride off to rescue Carol, they run into beautiful, tough-as-nails Leslie, who’s managed to escape Thorn’s men. The three race to stop Thorn’s wedding to Carol with guns a-blazing - but does she want to be rescued?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pYYGm1dWZGkbJuhcuaHD6nE6k7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928999'),
  ('1068433785630531387', 'Desperate Teenage Lovedolls', 1984, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'David Markey', null, 'Jennifer Schwartz, Hilary Rubens, Janet Housden, Kim Pilkington, Steven Shane McDonald, Tracy Marshak-Nash, Michael F. Glass, Jeffrey McDonald', null, 'Two girls rediscover their love for playing rock, find a drummer and begin practicing. When one of their mothers intervenes, they run away from home and are forced to fend for themselves on the streets against gangs and rival bands. Soon they are discovered and taken under the wing of rock manager Johnny Tremaine (played by Steven McDonald) who uses them for sex and his own aspirations of wealth. The Love Dolls set out to get revenge on those who have wronged them, and rise to the top of the rock world.', 'Two girls rediscover their love for playing rock, find a drummer and begin practicing. When one of their mothers intervenes, they run away from home and are forced to fend for themselves on the streets against gangs and rival bands. Soon they are discovered and taken under the wing of rock manager Johnny Tremaine (played by Steven McDonald) who uses them for sex and his own aspirations of wealth. The Love Dolls set out to get revenge on those who have wronged them, and rise to the top of the rock world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/805ZA1QmVrYUYwxoRSEV5j3xnFL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138745'),
  ('892221009328877800', 'Desperately Seeking Susan', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Susan Seidelman, Joel Tuber, David Dreyfuss', 'Leora Barish', 'Rosanna Arquette, Madonna, Aidan Quinn, Mark Blum, Robert Joy, Laurie Metcalf, Anna Thomson, Will Patton', 'PG-13', 'A bored New Jersey suburban housewife''s fascination with a free-spirited woman she has read about in the personal columns leads to her being mistaken for the woman herself and into a chaotic adventure of amnesia and self-discovery.', 'A bored New Jersey suburban housewife''s fascination with a free-spirited woman she has read about in the personal columns leads to her being mistaken for the woman herself and into a chaotic adventure of amnesia and self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ighImRgzYzZ88skBHaT4B7ntJG8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8130'),
  ('213872151813370159', 'Desperation', 2006, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Mick Garris, Christian Sebaldt, Peter Merwin', null, 'Tom Skerritt, Steven Weber, Annabeth Gish, Charles Durning, Matt Frewer, Henry Thomas, Shane Haboucha, Kelly Overton', 'R', 'When a sheriff arrests a writer, a family, a couple, and a hitchiker and throws them in a jail cell in the deserted town of Desperation, they must fight for their lives.', 'When a sheriff arrests a writer, a family, a couple, and a hitchiker and throws them in a jail cell in the deserted town of Desperation, they must fight for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVVTUA9SBaGlkZcj3XIJq077dQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10004'),
  ('189459751466359323', 'Desperation Road', 2023, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Sy Turnbull, Clenét Verdi-Rose, Shepherd Ahlers', 'Michael Farris Smith', 'Willa Fitzgerald, Garrett Hedlund, Mel Gibson, Ryan Hurst, Ella Thomas, Woody McClain, Kat Foster, Michael Aaron Milligan', 'R', 'Ex-con Russell Gaines is attempting to rebuild his life with the help of his father, Mitchell. However, the arrival of Maben sends his new life into chaos, leading the pair to go on the run - as their violent pasts catch up to them, the pair must learn to trust each other if they hope to live out the rest of their days.', 'Ex-con Russell Gaines is attempting to rebuild his life with the help of his father, Mitchell. However, the arrival of Maben sends his new life into chaos, leading the pair to go on the run - as their violent pasts catch up to them, the pair must learn to trust each other if they hope to live out the rest of their days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPyj6Gii1HrnzCbJXEF7JdSFkQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039690'),
  ('24028106281154696', 'Despicable Me', 2010, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Chris Renaud, Pierre Coffin, Lionel Gallat', 'Ken Daurio, Cinco Paul', 'Steve Carell, Jason Segel, Miranda Cosgrove, Dana Gaier, Elsie Fisher, Russell Brand, Julie Andrews, Will Arnett', 'PG', 'Gru is a supervillain determined to prove he’s the greatest by stealing the Moon. To pull off his plan, he adopts three orphaned girls—Margo, Edith, and Agnes—intending to use them as part of his scheme. However, as Gru bonds with the girls, his cold, villainous exterior begins to melt.', 'Gru is a supervillain determined to prove he’s the greatest by stealing the Moon. To pull off his plan, he adopts three orphaned girls—Margo, Edith, and Agnes—intending to use them as part of his scheme. However, as Gru bonds with the girls, his cold, villainous exterior begins to melt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1BT309QWjtFUlJPLmXmrcHOWEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20352'),
  ('971373022524058594', 'Despicable Me 2', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Pierre Coffin, Chris Renaud, Etienne Pêcheux', 'Ken Daurio, Cinco Paul', 'Steve Carell, Kristen Wiig, Benjamin Bratt, Miranda Cosgrove, Dana Gaier, Elsie Fisher, Russell Brand, Ken Jeong', 'PG', 'Gru is recruited by the Anti-Villain League to help deal with a powerful new super criminal.', 'Gru is recruited by the Anti-Villain League to help deal with a powerful new super criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Fh4NdoEnCjCK9wLjdJ9DJNFl2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93456'),
  ('651801037181897049', 'Despicable Me 3', 2017, 'Action, Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Pierre Coffin, Kyle Balda, Eric Guillon', 'Ken Daurio, Cinco Paul', 'Steve Carell, Kristen Wiig, Trey Parker, Miranda Cosgrove, Dana Gaier, Nhev Scharrel, Pierre Coffin, Steve Coogan', 'PG', 'Gru and his wife Lucy must stop former ''80s child star Balthazar Bratt from achieving world domination.', 'Gru and his wife Lucy must stop former ''80s child star Balthazar Bratt from achieving world domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6t3YWl7hrr88lCEFlGVqW5yV99R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324852'),
  ('243943051970056588', 'Despicable Me 4', 2024, 'Family, Comedy, Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Chris Renaud, Patrick Delage', 'Ken Daurio, Mike White', 'Steve Carell, Kristen Wiig, Will Ferrell, Sofía Vergara, Miranda Cosgrove, Dana Gaier, Madison Polan, Pierre Coffin', 'PG', 'Gru and Lucy and their girls—Margo, Edith and Agnes—welcome a new member to the Gru family, Gru Jr., who is intent on tormenting his dad. Gru also faces a new nemesis in Maxime Le Mal and his femme fatale girlfriend Valentina, forcing the family to go on the run.', 'Gru and Lucy and their girls—Margo, Edith and Agnes—welcome a new member to the Gru family, Gru Jr., who is intent on tormenting his dad. Gru also faces a new nemesis in Maxime Le Mal and his femme fatale girlfriend Valentina, forcing the family to go on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWba3TaojhK7NdycRhoQpsG0FaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519182'),
  ('640498466750267209', 'Despite Everything', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Gabriela Tagliavini, Kiko de la Rica, María Rodrigo', 'Helena Rhee, Eugene B. Rhee', 'Blanca Suárez, Macarena García, Amaia Salamanca, Belén Cuesta, Maxi Iglesias, Juan Diego, Joaquín Climent, Carlos Bardem', null, 'Sara, Lucía, Sofía and Claudia are sisters, 4 modern women with very different personalities, who come together at their mother''s funeral, after which they discover the man they''ve all called "dad" throughout their lives is not really their father. They embark on a quest to discover who their real fathers are, discovering more about themselves, their mother, and their lives.', 'Sara, Lucía, Sofía and Claudia are sisters, 4 modern women with very different personalities, who come together at their mother''s funeral, after which they discover the man they''ve all called "dad" throughout their lives is not really their father. They embark on a quest to discover who their real fathers are, discovering more about themselves, their mother, and their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeclnbGov6lbHu8o1ugcOBCUBlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588001'),
  ('321897622387430263', 'Despite the Falling Snow', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Shamim Sarif, David Johnson', 'Shamim Sarif', 'Rebecca Ferguson, Sam Reid, Charles Dance, Antje Traue, Oliver Jackson-Cohen, Anthony Stewart Head, Thure Lindhardt, Ben Batt', 'PG-13', 'New York, 1961. Alexander Ivanov, a high-ranked Soviet bureaucrat, reluctantly defects to the West while is part of a diplomatic mission, feeling the grief of being unable to know the fate of his wife Katya, whom he has had to leave behind in Moscow. Only many years later, in 1991, he will finally find out the truth when his niece Lauren travels to Moscow to participate in a painting exhibition.', 'New York, 1961. Alexander Ivanov, a high-ranked Soviet bureaucrat, reluctantly defects to the West while is part of a diplomatic mission, feeling the grief of being unable to know the fate of his wife Katya, whom he has had to leave behind in Moscow. Only many years later, in 1991, he will finally find out the truth when his niece Lauren travels to Moscow to participate in a painting exhibition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZ3o8weY8zcwmACdhqJXgkAe5zU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366901'),
  ('181571501143063517', 'Despite the Night', 2016, 'Romance, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Philippe Grandrieux, Jessica Lee Gagné', 'Bertrand Schefer, John-Henry Butterworth, Philippe Grandrieux', 'Ariane Labed, Kristian Marr, Roxane Mesquida, Paul Hamy, Johan Leysen, Sam Louwyck, Aurélien Recoing, Jonathan Boudina', null, 'After returning to Paris, a heartbroken man searching for his missing lover finds solace, and a passionate but troubled love, with a grieving nurse. This unconventional romance unfolds against a backdrop of music and defies expectations, venturing into uncharted emotional territory.', 'After returning to Paris, a heartbroken man searching for his missing lover finds solace, and a passionate but troubled love, with a grieving nurse. This unconventional romance unfolds against a backdrop of music and defies expectations, venturing into uncharted emotional territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbFmySiUqVcIE3wWG3xAaczZ22N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330385'),
  ('562809238602008435', 'Dessau Dancers', 2014, 'Music, Comedy', 'Jan Martin Scharf, Felix Novo de Oliveira', 'Ruth Toma', 'Sonja Gerhardt, Wolfgang Stumph, Hilmar Eichhorn, Wolfgang Lippert, Rainer Bock, Gordon Kämmerer, Oliver Konietzny, Arved Birnbaum', null, 'In the summer of 1985, an American movie also ignites young people in the GDR: "Beatstreet" ensures full cinemas and subsequently a new phenomenon in the streets - breakdancing! The 18-year-old Frank is electrified and founds the "Break Beaters" with like-minded friends in Dessau. The troupe dances on the streets and soon forms the spearhead of the breakdance movement in the GDR. But sooner than they would have liked, the street dancers came to the attention of the state. And they like to keep control over the leisure activities of their youth. Because what the GDR cannot ban, it tries to control - ergo the project must become socialist! So breakdancing becomes "acrobatic show dancing" and the "Break Beaters" are built up as a showcase troupe, sent around the country and soon celebrated like rock stars. But fame comes at a price and Frank slowly realizes that the price is pretty high.', 'In the summer of 1985, an American movie also ignites young people in the GDR: "Beatstreet" ensures full cinemas and subsequently a new phenomenon in the streets - breakdancing! The 18-year-old Frank is electrified and founds the "Break Beaters" with like-minded friends in Dessau. The troupe dances on the streets and soon forms the spearhead of the breakdance movement in the GDR. But sooner than they would have liked, the street dancers came to the attention of the state. And they like to keep control over the leisure activities of their youth. Because what the GDR cannot ban, it tries to control - ergo the project must become socialist! So breakdancing becomes "acrobatic show dancing" and the "Break Beaters" are built up as a showcase troupe, sent around the country and soon celebrated like rock stars. But fame comes at a price and Frank slowly realizes that the price is pretty high.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rwm7sC64LSDioItxNlFiLowUYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313517'),
  ('748954360806642811', 'Destere', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Ahmet T. Uygun', null, 'Peker Açıkalın, Önder Açıkbaş, Ali Çatalbaş, Selin Denizli, Volkan Demirok, Ceyhun Fersoy, Devrim Atmaca, Nazif Uslu', null, 'The story of a serial killer from Thrace. The film begins with two Trakyan farmers named Hayrettin and Hayati waking up one day in the basement of a village house. A voice recording from a serial killer who tells his victims, "You don''t play the game this way, you play it that way," begins to subject our heroes to various games. Inspired by the Saw series and serving as a parody of it, the film is a blend of comedy and horror.', 'The story of a serial killer from Thrace. The film begins with two Trakyan farmers named Hayrettin and Hayati waking up one day in the basement of a village house. A voice recording from a serial killer who tells his victims, "You don''t play the game this way, you play it that way," begins to subject our heroes to various games. Inspired by the Saw series and serving as a parody of it, the film is a blend of comedy and horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiBNHic68dAMRdLBuZCFdKxP5i3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52129'),
  ('860697473943697204', 'Destination Anywhere', 1997, 'Drama', 'Bobby Bukowski, Mark Pellington, Sholto J. Roeg', 'Stuart Cohn, Tom Gorai, Mark Pellington', 'Jon Bon Jovi, Demi Moore, Annabella Sciorra, Kevin Bacon, Whoopi Goldberg, Leah Rubino, Nicky ''Pops'' Anest, Olga Barbato', null, 'This film captures the essence of Jon Bon Jovi, the lead singer of one of the prime players in the legion of pop-metal bands that took ''80s radio by storm. Most of the film is a short narrative loosely based on the songs from his 1997 solo album Destination Anywhere, and features Jon Bon Jovi and Demi Moore as a young couple struggling with alcoholism and the death of their young child.', 'This film captures the essence of Jon Bon Jovi, the lead singer of one of the prime players in the legion of pop-metal bands that took ''80s radio by storm. Most of the film is a short narrative loosely based on the songs from his 1997 solo album Destination Anywhere, and features Jon Bon Jovi and Demi Moore as a young couple struggling with alcoholism and the death of their young child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbAPN2JptaQ70tWzPzOZDRyvXqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131010'),
  ('372710355579155530', 'Destination Gobi', 1953, 'War, Adventure, Drama', 'Robert Wise, Charles G. Clarke', 'Everett Freeman', 'Richard Widmark, Don Taylor, Max Showalter, Murvyn Vye, Darryl Hickman, Martin Milner, Ross Bagdasarian, Judy Dan', 'NR', 'A group of US Navy weathermen taking measurements in the Gobi desert in World War II are forced to seek the help of Mongol nomads to regain their ship while under attack from the Japanese.', 'A group of US Navy weathermen taking measurements in the Gobi desert in World War II are forced to seek the help of Mongol nomads to regain their ship while under attack from the Japanese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTp02LeUbtInHnHrE1FAC3wrpeZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123868'),
  ('1021648651066678968', 'Destination Inner Space', 1966, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Francis D. Lyon, Brick Marquard', 'Arthur C. Pierce', 'Scott Brady, Sheree North, Gary Merrill, John Howard, Wende Wagner, Mike Road, William Thourlby, Biff Elliot', null, 'A futuristic underwater sea-lab is having problems with a UFO that''s parked between them and a nearby deep ocean trench. As they investigate, they attract the unwanted attention of a dangerous creature who puts the scientists and crew in danger.', 'A futuristic underwater sea-lab is having problems with a UFO that''s parked between them and a nearby deep ocean trench. As they investigate, they attract the unwanted attention of a dangerous creature who puts the scientists and crew in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUaBoXRxeLPcsJzQY9UeAE4ZFzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29297'),
  ('645086598547020446', 'Destination Moon', 1950, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Drama', 'Irving Pichel, Lionel Lindon', 'Alford Van Ronkel, Robert A. Heinlein, James O''Hanlon', 'John Archer, Warner Anderson, Tom Powers, Dick Wesson, Erin O''Brien-Moore, Steve Carruthers, Franklyn Farnum, Jack Gargan', null, 'A team composed of an aerospace scientist, an ex-Air Force general, and an industrialist conceives an ambitious plan to land Americans on the moon. From their base in the Mojave Desert, they construct and successfully launch a spacecraft named "Luna" that contains a cargo of four astronauts. But a critical miscalculation of needed power to escape the moon''s gravitational pull may put the astronauts'' lives in danger.', 'A team composed of an aerospace scientist, an ex-Air Force general, and an industrialist conceives an ambitious plan to land Americans on the moon. From their base in the Mojave Desert, they construct and successfully launch a spacecraft named "Luna" that contains a cargo of four astronauts. But a critical miscalculation of needed power to escape the moon''s gravitational pull may put the astronauts'' lives in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dsJUooqTX5BkOmkfnuuFlkmbB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25392'),
  ('861279318913186142', 'Destination Moon', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Bernasconi', 'Eric Rondeaux, Christophe Poujol', 'Thierry Wermuth, Christian Pelissier, Henri Labussière, Yves Barsacq, Jean-Pierre Moulin, Susan Roman', null, 'Tintin and his friends go to Syldavia and join a secret space program.', 'Tintin and his friends go to Syldavia and join a secret space program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCCMq7uqRtSJmWJI4nYMiRTsmtK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441319'),
  ('1030821658734694823', 'Destination Murder', 1950, 'Crime', 'Edward L. Cahn, Jackson Rose', 'Don Martin', 'Joyce Mackenzie, Stanley Clements, Hurd Hatfield, Albert Dekker, Myrna Dell, James Flavin, John Dehner, Richard Emory', 'NR', 'Laura Mansfield catches a glimpse of mob hit man Jackie Wales after he shoots her businessman father. At the police station, Laura identifies Jackie as the murderer, but the policeman in charge of the case, Lt. Brewster, lets him go, citing a lack of corroborating evidence. Outraged, Laura worms her way into the unsuspecting Jackie''s heart, trying to snare him and mob-connected club owner Armitage in her trap.', 'Laura Mansfield catches a glimpse of mob hit man Jackie Wales after he shoots her businessman father. At the police station, Laura identifies Jackie as the murderer, but the policeman in charge of the case, Lt. Brewster, lets him go, citing a lack of corroborating evidence. Outraged, Laura worms her way into the unsuspecting Jackie''s heart, trying to snare him and mob-connected club owner Armitage in her trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGZpBRooW38gJkpbhPXVRRYO4eb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36338'),
  ('638625064487441467', 'Destination Tokyo', 1943, 'War', 'Bert Glennon, Robert B. Lee, Delmer Daves', 'Delmer Daves, Albert Maltz', 'Cary Grant, John Garfield, Alan Hale, John Ridgely, Dane Clark, Warner Anderson, William Prince, Robert Hutton', 'NR', 'During World War II, Captain Cassidy and his crew of submariners are ordered into Tokyo Bay on a secret mission. They are to gather information in advance of the planned bombing of Tokyo. Along the way, the crew learn about each other as they face the enemy and some of them lose their lives.', 'During World War II, Captain Cassidy and his crew of submariners are ordered into Tokyo Bay on a secret mission. They are to gather information in advance of the planned bombing of Tokyo. Along the way, the crew learn about each other as they face the enemy and some of them lose their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irQLva38syoOiAFCJOrFwykq4f4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22871'),
  ('678815293428164165', 'Destination Wedding', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Victor Levin, Giorgio Scali', 'Victor Levin', 'Winona Ryder, Keanu Reeves, DJ Dallenbach, Ted Dubost, D. Rosh Wright, Greg Lucey, Curt Dubost, Donna Lynn Jones', 'R', 'Frank and Lindsay—two emotionally-broken strangers—meet on the way to a destination wedding. Over the course of the weekend and against all odds, they find themselves drawn together even though they are initially repulsed by one another.', 'Frank and Lindsay—two emotionally-broken strangers—meet on the way to a destination wedding. Over the course of the weekend and against all odds, they find themselves drawn together even though they are initially repulsed by one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUMsRBGnv3X3GaG2MfJa3xl5q1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489929'),
  ('825142990171899444', 'Destination: Infestation', 2007, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror, TV Movie', 'Michael Balfry, George Mendeluk, Tashanna Ducharme', 'Mary Weinstein', 'Jessalyn Gilsig, Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Serge Houde, Karen Holness, Matt Bellefleur, Matthew Harrison, Emily Tennant, Craig Veroni', 'PG-13', 'While on a flight home from Colombia, the plane that Dr. Carrie Ross and her daughter are on is attacked by bullet ants whose sting is the most painful and deadliest on the planet. Joining forces with air marshal Ethan Hart, Dr. Ross, an entomologist, tries desperately to save the flight from disaster. In the end, their struggle brings them closer together and offers the couple hope for the future.', 'While on a flight home from Colombia, the plane that Dr. Carrie Ross and her daughter are on is attacked by bullet ants whose sting is the most painful and deadliest on the planet. Joining forces with air marshal Ethan Hart, Dr. Ross, an entomologist, tries desperately to save the flight from disaster. In the end, their struggle brings them closer together and offers the couple hope for the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aykFOoLZTPdSHDJbuZj3cOoypcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100192'),
  ('112340756143318710', 'Destinazione Piovarolo', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Domenico Paolella, Mauro Morassi, Mario Fioretti', 'Piero De Bernardi, Stefano Strucchi, Leonardo Benvenuti', 'Totò, Irene Cefaro, Marisa Merlini, Tina Pica, Ernesto Almirante, Arnoldo Foà, Enrico Viarisio, Fanny Landini', null, 'Antonio La Quaglia becomes the railroader in Piovarolo during 1922 meanwhile the fascism is raising. Later he marries a jewish woman. He has career ambitions but can not reach them.', 'Antonio La Quaglia becomes the railroader in Piovarolo during 1922 meanwhile the fascism is raising. Later he marries a jewish woman. He has career ambitions but can not reach them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lghShX7fvj9B3P2S9vGekrQvLvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59149'),
  ('537379171706559667', 'Destined at Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'John Lyde, Brittany Wiscombe', 'Brittany Wiscombe', 'Shae Robins, Casey Elliott, Weixin Le, Noah Kershisnik, Charlotte Hemmings, Matt Koenig, Pam Eichner, Ty Pursley', 'G', 'Kim and Theo meet in the midst of Black Friday shopping madness but there''s a definite spark between them. When a power outage causes some panic at a store, the couple gets separated. With Christmas coming, there should be plenty of distractions but neither Kim nor Theo can forget the other. Both yearn to find each other but how with so little information to go on?', 'Kim and Theo meet in the midst of Black Friday shopping madness but there''s a definite spark between them. When a power outage causes some panic at a store, the couple gets separated. With Christmas coming, there should be plenty of distractions but neither Kim nor Theo can forget the other. Both yearn to find each other but how with so little information to go on?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFkFZCtrSZg30DgqCvXSqM8Wqtb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1010711'),
  ('702348019915173749', 'Destined for Blues', 2005, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Jan Kidawa-Błoński', 'Jan Kidawa-Błoński, Przemysław Angerman', 'Tomasz Kot, Jolanta Fraszyńska, Maciej Balcar, Adam Baumann, Anna Dymna, Joanna Bartel, Przemysław Bluszcz, Paweł Berger', null, 'The life of Ryszard Riedel, former leader of cult Polish rock-blues band Dzem, including the history of his family relationships, music career and addiction to alcohol and drugs.', 'The life of Ryszard Riedel, former leader of cult Polish rock-blues band Dzem, including the history of his family relationships, music career and addiction to alcohol and drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTJcTM7qfmtafPikz8DhPxo02du.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31855'),
  ('992532151683058638', 'Destino', 2003, 'Animation, Music, Family', 'Dominique Monfery', 'Donald W. Ernst', 'Jennifer Esposito, Dora Luz', 'PG', 'Short film to a song of love lost and rediscovered, a woman sees and undergoes surreal transformations. Her lover''s face melts off, she dons a dress from the shadow of a bell and becomes a dandelion, ants crawl out of a hand and become Frenchmen riding bicycles. Not to mention the turtles with faces on their backs that collide to form a ballerina, or the bizarre baseball game.', 'Short film to a song of love lost and rediscovered, a woman sees and undergoes surreal transformations. Her lover''s face melts off, she dons a dress from the shadow of a bell and becomes a dandelion, ants crawl out of a hand and become Frenchmen riding bicycles. Not to mention the turtles with faces on their backs that collide to form a ballerina, or the bizarre baseball game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IyDJdaGlU7olLC08mSwLJTmsC3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35114'),
  ('996113007478529377', 'Destiny', 1921, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Fritz Lang, Fritz Arno Wagner, Erich Nitzschmann', 'Fritz Lang, Thea von Harbou', 'Lil Dagover, Walter Janssen, Bernhard Goetzke, Hans Sternberg, Karl Rückert, Max Adalbert, Wilhelm Diegelmann, Erich Pabst', null, 'As a young couple stops and rests in a small village inn, the man is abducted by Death and is sequestered behind a huge doorless, windowless wall. The woman finds a mystic entrance and is met by Death, who tells her three separate stories set in exotic locales, all involving circumstances similar to hers.', 'As a young couple stops and rests in a small village inn, the man is abducted by Death and is sequestered behind a huge doorless, windowless wall. The woman finds a mystic entrance and is met by Death, who tells her three separate stories set in exotic locales, all involving circumstances similar to hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgRB2MhCTfOMkxRO7seX6GxOaKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29267'),
  ('603336928541596031', 'Destiny', 1997, 'Drama, History, Music', 'Youssef Chahine, Hesham Soliman, Khaled Youssef', 'Youssef Chahine, Khaled Youssef', 'Nour El-Sherif, Hani Salama, Rogena, Layla Olwy, Mahmoud Hemida, Safia ElEmary, Mohamed Mounir, Khaled El Nabawy', null, 'In the 12th century''s Andalusia lives Ibn Rushd a prominent Islamic philosopher with his wife Zeinab and daughter Salma. The principality is ruled by Khalifa ElMansour who has two sons, ElNasser, an intellectual that likes Ibn Rush and is in love with his daughter Salma. The younger son Abdallah is more into dancing and poetry, spending most of his times with the gypsy family and getting the daughter pregnant. The Khalifa is depending on the extremists to build his army granting them more power which they use to combat artists and philosophers. The extremists succeed in recruiting Abd Allah and train him to kill his father. Events go on where Marawan, the gypsy singer, is killed and Ibn Rushd''s books are burnt. Adapted from the real life of Ibn Rushd AlMasir is Chahine''s statement against extremism.', 'In the 12th century''s Andalusia lives Ibn Rushd a prominent Islamic philosopher with his wife Zeinab and daughter Salma. The principality is ruled by Khalifa ElMansour who has two sons, ElNasser, an intellectual that likes Ibn Rush and is in love with his daughter Salma. The younger son Abdallah is more into dancing and poetry, spending most of his times with the gypsy family and getting the daughter pregnant. The Khalifa is depending on the extremists to build his army granting them more power which they use to combat artists and philosophers. The extremists succeed in recruiting Abd Allah and train him to kill his father. Events go on where Marawan, the gypsy singer, is killed and Ibn Rushd''s books are burnt. Adapted from the real life of Ibn Rushd AlMasir is Chahine''s statement against extremism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjA38G2fCKTgWsz1HbOcGJalbi1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37673'),
  ('485535413882582569', 'Destiny', 2006, 'Drama', 'Zeki Demirkubuz, Zeki Demirkubuz, Iraz Uzun', 'Zeki Demirkubuz', 'Vildan Atasever, Ufuk Bayraktar, Engin Akyürek, Müge Ulusoy, Mustafa Uzunyılmaz, Ozan Bilen, Güzin Alkan, Hikmet Demir', null, 'Bekir loves Uğur, who loves Zagor, who is about to get out of jail. An already tense love triangle is thrown into turmoil on a hot summer night, when Zagor kills someone, and Uğur disappears.', 'Bekir loves Uğur, who loves Zagor, who is about to get out of jail. An already tense love triangle is thrown into turmoil on a hot summer night, when Zagor kills someone, and Uğur disappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPlu0FpmWNEQIiUrpHpzDThBaXL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44105'),
  ('1046619466677335502', 'Destiny', 2013, 'Animation', 'Fabien Weibel, Fabien Weibel', 'Fabien Weibel', null, null, 'A man''s obsession with timekeeping enters him into an endless time loop.', 'A man''s obsession with timekeeping enters him into an endless time loop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8GIjlqwYYyT5Af2v3mX1iBB18i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496051'),
  ('540621982499073486', 'Destiny', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nevra Genelioğlu, Uğur Yıldıran, Ali Bilgin', 'Özlem Yılmaz, Burcu Görgün Toptaş', 'Bergüzar Korel, Engin Akyürek, İpek Bilgin, Merve Dizdar, Osman Sonant, Serhat Parıl, Murat Okay, Anıl Altınöz', null, 'This film talks about the possibility of the course of two lives through the love between Umut and Deniz. It questions how one’s decisions can shape their fate. Sometimes small moments and decisions can entirely change the course of our lives. Umut’s decision to take his dog Oscar for an evening walk allows his path to cross Deniz’s. On that night, Umut will have to decide between a gateway which leads to love and a life which he needs to face and encounter on his own.', 'This film talks about the possibility of the course of two lives through the love between Umut and Deniz. It questions how one’s decisions can shape their fate. Sometimes small moments and decisions can entirely change the course of our lives. Umut’s decision to take his dog Oscar for an evening walk allows his path to cross Deniz’s. On that night, Umut will have to decide between a gateway which leads to love and a life which he needs to face and encounter on his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZN3SJiMQiLHGzukQcgIH1WfpEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585973'),
  ('749788574459222158', 'Destiny Turns on the Radio', 1995, 'Crime, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jack Baran, James L. Carter', 'Robert Ramsey, Matthew Stone', 'Dylan McDermott, Nancy Travis, Quentin Tarantino, Jim Belushi, James Le Gros, Janet Carroll, David Cross, Richard Edson', 'R', 'Johnny Destiny burns into Las Vegas in his hot Plymouth RoadRunner, stopping only to pick up a stranger stranded in the desert. But then, things aren''t always as they seem. Anything can happen in that town of many possibilities...especially since there''s been some weird electrical disturbances. As the stranger, fresh out of prison, tries to put his life back together--to recover his money from an old bank heist and the girl he lost in doing the job--something keeps interfering with his plans. Is it fate...or just Destiny?', 'Johnny Destiny burns into Las Vegas in his hot Plymouth RoadRunner, stopping only to pick up a stranger stranded in the desert. But then, things aren''t always as they seem. Anything can happen in that town of many possibilities...especially since there''s been some weird electrical disturbances. As the stranger, fresh out of prison, tries to put his life back together--to recover his money from an old bank heist and the girl he lost in doing the job--something keeps interfering with his plans. Is it fate...or just Destiny?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kd04IvuW1wvgGoB2HxSuFVIU9rU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62488'),
  ('1080121200135587565', 'Destiny: The Tale of Kamakura', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama, Fantasy', 'Kiyoko Shibuya, Takashi Yamazaki, Sho Funabashi', 'Takashi Yamazaki', 'Masato Sakai, Mitsuki Takahata, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Sakura Ando, Min Tanaka, Tamao Nakamura, Mikako Ichikawa, Tsuyoshi Muro', null, 'Set in an alternate universe, the ancient capital of Kamakura is a vibrant town where fantastical creatures live alongside humans. Akiko is a cheerful publishing assistant who moves into town after marrying Masakazu, a popular mystery writer. Akiko is surprised by the unusual town but enjoys the new curiosities surrounding her. However, just as she was beginning to settle in, a trifling incident sweeps her spirit to the underworld too soon. Convinced that destiny has something else in store for his wife, Masakazu journeys into the underworld to bring back Akiko’s spirit.', 'Set in an alternate universe, the ancient capital of Kamakura is a vibrant town where fantastical creatures live alongside humans. Akiko is a cheerful publishing assistant who moves into town after marrying Masakazu, a popular mystery writer. Akiko is surprised by the unusual town but enjoys the new curiosities surrounding her. However, just as she was beginning to settle in, a trifling incident sweeps her spirit to the underworld too soon. Convinced that destiny has something else in store for his wife, Masakazu journeys into the underworld to bring back Akiko’s spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7FFTr5zUvOuiZmyYOMSMcedJ87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492136'),
  ('641256623976000205', 'Destiny''s Son', 1962, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Kenji Misumi, Shozo Honda', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Mayumi Nagisa, Masayo Banri, Shigeru Amachi, Jun''ichirō Narita, Eijirō Yanagi, Matasaburô Niwa, Teru Tomota', null, 'In Edo-period Japan, Shingo is born the son of an assassin who was executed for murdering her lord’s concubine. Decades later, his adoptive family is massacred for keeping the secret. Armed with an unbeatable swordfighting technique, Shingo embarks on the path of the masterless samurai in search of vengeance and a path beyond his own ignominious origins.', 'In Edo-period Japan, Shingo is born the son of an assassin who was executed for murdering her lord’s concubine. Decades later, his adoptive family is massacred for keeping the secret. Armed with an unbeatable swordfighting technique, Shingo embarks on the path of the masterless samurai in search of vengeance and a path beyond his own ignominious origins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZqYuypYEhXDHMtrl1Zm9pdIpSj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70391'),
  ('702603992794755827', 'Destricted', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sam Taylor-Johnson, Larry Clark, Cecily Brown', 'Richard H. Prince, Sam Taylor-Johnson, Matthew Barney', 'August Knight, Angela Stone, Nancy Vee, Manuel Ferrara, Céline Tran, Destiny Deville, Sativa Rose, Jasmine Byrne', null, 'A compilation of erotic films intended to illuminate the points where art meets sexuality.', 'A compilation of erotic films intended to illuminate the points where art meets sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCf1g7GjugKNw7Iizs0O093rKqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208478'),
  ('567397399781265333', 'Destroy All Monsters', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Ishirō Honda, Taiichi Kankura, Seiji Tani', 'Ishirō Honda, Takeshi Kimura', 'Akira Kubo, Jun Tazaki, Yukiko Kobayashi, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Chōtarō Tōgin, Yoshibumi Tajima, Kenji Sahara, Heihachirō Ōkawa', 'G', 'At the turn of the century, all of the Earth''s monsters have been rounded up and kept safely on Monsterland. Chaos erupts when a race of she-aliens known as the Kilaaks unleash the monsters across the world.', 'At the turn of the century, all of the Earth''s monsters have been rounded up and kept safely on Monsterland. Chaos erupts when a race of she-aliens known as the Kilaaks unleash the monsters across the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24r1hsRisfUidwLF67J0iMuWh7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3107'),
  ('395126064404022497', 'Destroy All Neighbors', 2024, 'Horror, Comedy, Music', 'Josh Forbes, Taylor Maxwell, Ryan Spindell', 'Charles A. Pieper, Mike Benner, Jared Logan', 'Jonah Ray Rodrigues, Kiran Deol, Randee Heller, Pete Ploszek, DeMorge Brown, Kosher the Pig, Jon Daly, Thomas Lennon', null, 'William Brown, a neurotic, self-absorbed musician determined to finish his prog-rock magnum opus, faces a creative roadblock in the form of a noisy and grotesque neighbor named Vlad. Finally working up the nerve to demand that Vlad keep it down, William inadvertently decapitates him. But, while attempting to cover up one murder, William’s accidental reign of terror causes victims to pile up and become undead corpses who torment and create more bloody detours on his road to prog-rock Valhalla.', 'William Brown, a neurotic, self-absorbed musician determined to finish his prog-rock magnum opus, faces a creative roadblock in the form of a noisy and grotesque neighbor named Vlad. Finally working up the nerve to demand that Vlad keep it down, William inadvertently decapitates him. But, while attempting to cover up one murder, William’s accidental reign of terror causes victims to pile up and become undead corpses who torment and create more bloody detours on his road to prog-rock Valhalla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIpjUy6ACDk8Fc8GkynLcIAPP49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974558'),
  ('739829967208763105', 'Destroy, She Said', 1969, 'Drama, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Marguerite Duras, Jean Penzer', 'Marguerite Duras', 'Catherine Sellers, Michael Lonsdale, Henri Garcin, Nicole Hiss, Daniel Gélin', null, 'In a secluded hotel circumscribed by a dense forest Max and Alissa Thor meet Stein and Elisabeth. Max, a professor of future history and an aspiring author, is immediately attracted to the brooding wife of industrialist Bernard Alione, Elisabeth, who is recovering from a miscarriage. Stein, a German Jew and potential writer, is infatuated by Alissa, Max''s young wife and former student. During their sojourn the guests'' identities gradually meld.', 'In a secluded hotel circumscribed by a dense forest Max and Alissa Thor meet Stein and Elisabeth. Max, a professor of future history and an aspiring author, is immediately attracted to the brooding wife of industrialist Bernard Alione, Elisabeth, who is recovering from a miscarriage. Stein, a German Jew and potential writer, is infatuated by Alissa, Max''s young wife and former student. During their sojourn the guests'' identities gradually meld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fSM9I56eUc1qNEyAW83wsPAF2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65722'),
  ('820065122278500907', 'Destroyer', 1943, 'Adventure, Drama, War', 'William A. Seiter, Milton Carter, Cary Odell', 'Frank Wead, Lewis Meltzer, Borden Chase', 'Edward G. Robinson, Glenn Ford, Edgar Buchanan, Marguerite Chapman, Regis Toomey, Warren Ashe, Leo Gorcey, Edward Brophy', 'NR', 'Flagwaving story of a new American destroyer, the JOHN PAUL JONES, from the day her keel is laid, to what was very nearly her last voyage. Among the crew, is Steve Boleslavski, a shipyard welder that helped build her, who reenlists, with his old rank of Chief bosuns mate. After failing her sea trials, she is assigned to the mail run, until caught up in a disparate battle with a Japanese sub. After getting torpedoed, and on the verge of sinking, the Captain, and crew hatch a plan to try and save the ship, and destroy the sub.', 'Flagwaving story of a new American destroyer, the JOHN PAUL JONES, from the day her keel is laid, to what was very nearly her last voyage. Among the crew, is Steve Boleslavski, a shipyard welder that helped build her, who reenlists, with his old rank of Chief bosuns mate. After failing her sea trials, she is assigned to the mail run, until caught up in a disparate battle with a Japanese sub. After getting torpedoed, and on the verge of sinking, the Captain, and crew hatch a plan to try and save the ship, and destroy the sub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BCvOnVaI37dk1HcAGqMxfekqJC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98404'),
  ('259972904326208940', 'Destroyer', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Robert Kirk, Chuy Elizondo', 'Peter Garrity, Mark W. Rosenbaum, Rex Hauck', 'Lyle Alzado, Deborah Foreman, Clayton Rohner, Anthony Perkins, Tobias Anderson, Lannie Garrett, Jim Turner, Pat Mahoney', 'R', 'A prison riot breaks out at the moment of a serial murderer''s execution by electrocution, and his fate becomes indeterminate when the prison is shut down. 18 months later, a team of filmmakers converge on the prison to film a women-in-prison exploitation flick, but find that a certain somebody is disrupting their shooting schedule...', 'A prison riot breaks out at the moment of a serial murderer''s execution by electrocution, and his fate becomes indeterminate when the prison is shut down. 18 months later, a team of filmmakers converge on the prison to film a women-in-prison exploitation flick, but find that a certain somebody is disrupting their shooting schedule...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCbT12PLsRgODgIC3MKWlhNup5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85163'),
