  ('517350203787564226', 'Destruction Force', 1977, 'Crime', 'Stelvio Massi, Franco Delli Colli, Danilo Massi', 'Dardano Sacchetti, Stelvio Massi', 'Luc Merenda, Tomas Milian, Elio Zamuto, Katia Christine, Imma Piro, Nicoletta Piersanti, Alessandra Cardini, Aldo Barberito', null, 'A shoot out after a robbery ends with the death of the Chief of Police. Police detective Ghini goes in search of a suspect, Lanza, to avenge the death of his boss. Ghini''s search leads him to Belli, a Sicilian gangster and ''Trashy'', the dirty leader of a gang of killers. The action is violent as both police and criminals track down Belli who still finds some time to attempt a couple of robberies...', 'A shoot out after a robbery ends with the death of the Chief of Police. Police detective Ghini goes in search of a suspect, Lanza, to avenge the death of his boss. Ghini''s search leads him to Belli, a Sicilian gangster and ''Trashy'', the dirty leader of a gang of killers. The action is violent as both police and criminals track down Belli who still finds some time to attempt a couple of robberies...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLQxmeMTmxgn4HjraPb6kkxgd9N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52912'),
