  ('228584373477068467', 'Detective', 1969, 'Crime, Drama', 'Rudolf Thome, Niklaus Schilling, Hubertus Hagen', 'Max Zihlmann', 'Ulli Lommel, Marquard Bohm, Iris Berben, Uschi Obermaier, Walter Rilla, Elke Haltaufderheide, Peter Moland, Dieter Busch', null, 'Andy and Sebastian want to make a lot of money in a quick and easy way. Inspired by the movies, they become private investigators. Their first case happens to be about a beautiful girl called Annabella. But being a private investigator is a more demanding job then Andy and Sebastian had initially thought. Their female acquaintances Annabella, Christa, and Micky also have their share in Andy′s and Sebastian′s problems. The two wannabe detectives become more and more entangled in things that prove to be too much for them.', 'Andy and Sebastian want to make a lot of money in a quick and easy way. Inspired by the movies, they become private investigators. Their first case happens to be about a beautiful girl called Annabella. But being a private investigator is a more demanding job then Andy and Sebastian had initially thought. Their female acquaintances Annabella, Christa, and Micky also have their share in Andy′s and Sebastian′s problems. The two wannabe detectives become more and more entangled in things that prove to be too much for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6110V8sW9UdoZ7W2z5pVtxjDP4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264315'),
