  ('316930787387787153', 'Detective Belli', 1969, 'Crime, Drama', 'Romolo Guerrieri, Roberto Gerardi, Renzo Genta', 'Alberto Silvestri, Franco Verucci, Massimo D''Avak', 'Franco Nero, Florinda Bolkan, Adolfo Celi, Delia Boccardo, Zuzana Martinková, Renzo Palmer, Roberto Bisacco, Maurizio Bonuglia', 'R', 'A crooked detective begins investigating a situation on behalf of a friend and gets involved in murder, deception and double-cross.', 'A crooked detective begins investigating a situation on behalf of a friend and gets involved in murder, deception and double-cross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/io5FSvY10OtMvCcBXwpFZtWCTla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67904'),
  ('864133808017159669', 'Detective Bureau 2-3: Go to Hell, Bastards!', 1963, 'Crime, Action', 'Seijun Suzuki, Hiromi Higuchi, Shigeyoshi Mine', 'Gan Yamazaki', 'Joe Shishido, Reiko Sasamori, Tamio Kawachi, Nobuo Kaneko, Asao Sano, Kōichi Uenoyama, Kotoe Hatsui, Yūko Kusunoki', null, 'Tajima is a private detective in charge of his own company, Detective Bureau 2-3. When warring criminal gangs go overboard by robbing U.S. military munitions, Tajima steps in to stop what the cops can''t.', 'Tajima is a private detective in charge of his own company, Detective Bureau 2-3. When warring criminal gangs go overboard by robbing U.S. military munitions, Tajima steps in to stop what the cops can''t.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwQIjstNr6AN7WwkcefVwEMwOxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88535'),
