  ('33249144641766995', 'Detective Conan: Black Iron Submarine', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Yuzuru Tachikawa, Hitoshi Nishiyama, Hiromitsu Koiwa', 'Takeharu Sakurai', 'Minami Takayama, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Hayashibara, Shuichi Ikeda, Kazuhiko Inoue, Kenichi Ogata, Atsuko Yuya', null, 'While visiting Hachijo-jima, Conan sneaks aboard a security boat heading to the Pacific Buoy, an off-shore facility constructed near the coasts built to connect surveillance cameras used by police forces around the world. However, an engineer gets abducted! An eerie sound of a propeller hums underwater as a dark figure begins to creep toward Ai Haibara... When the forbidden Black Box is opened, the sealed-away past will surface above the treacherous waves!', 'While visiting Hachijo-jima, Conan sneaks aboard a security boat heading to the Pacific Buoy, an off-shore facility constructed near the coasts built to connect surveillance cameras used by police forces around the world. However, an engineer gets abducted! An eerie sound of a propeller hums underwater as a dark figure begins to creep toward Ai Haibara... When the forbidden Black Box is opened, the sealed-away past will surface above the treacherous waves!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksQ8uNgoWsVH6a0oPB6zx08pOwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047041'),
  ('1119226961448629157', 'Detective Conan: Captured in Her Eyes', 2000, 'Animation, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Adventure', 'Kenji Kodama, Masatomo Sudo, Junko Yamanaka', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Kenichi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai, Ikue Otani', 'PG-13', 'Police officers around Tokyo are being murdered by an unknown assailant. When Ran witnesses an attempt on the life of one of her friends in the police, she loses her memory. Now, Conan and Inspector Megure must find the murderer while Ran attempts to regain her lost memories.', 'Police officers around Tokyo are being murdered by an unknown assailant. When Ran witnesses an attempt on the life of one of her friends in the police, she loses her memory. Now, Conan and Inspector Megure must find the murderer while Ran attempts to regain her lost memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0ta1yBaKQRjEWLhOU8jmE9TdGa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20677'),
  ('185264440014216023', 'Detective Conan: Crossroad in the Ancient Capital', 2003, 'Animation, Mystery, Adventure', 'Masatomo Sudo, Junko Yamanaka, Kenji Kodama', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Ryo Horikawa, Yuko Miyamura, Kenichi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara', 'PG-13', 'Mouri Kogoro is called to a special case in the ancient capital of Kyoto. There, Conan meets Heiji and they team up once again to solve the case, recover the stolen Healing Buddha statue, and even discover the identity of Heiji''s first love.', 'Mouri Kogoro is called to a special case in the ancient capital of Kyoto. There, Conan meets Heiji and they team up once again to solve the case, recover the stolen Healing Buddha statue, and even discover the identity of Heiji''s first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsP5o8Z5xPgjnerByjHzOq1MUI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39202'),
  ('64049861997432727', 'Detective Conan: Dimensional Sniper', 2014, 'Animation, Action, Drama, Mystery', 'Hiroyuki Notake, Akio Kawamura, Yoshiharu Shimizu', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Noriko Hidaka, Shuichi Ikeda, Ryotaro Okiayu, Megumi Hayashibara', 'PG-13', 'A rash of sniper attacks leaves the streets of Tokyo empty and the public terrified to go outside. It’s up to Conan and his friends to find the culprit, but the case goes deeper than it seems. Military cover-ups, conspiracies and murder abound in this fast-paced, thrilling mystery!', 'A rash of sniper attacks leaves the streets of Tokyo empty and the public terrified to go outside. It’s up to Conan and his friends to find the culprit, but the case goes deeper than it seems. Military cover-ups, conspiracies and murder abound in this fast-paced, thrilling mystery!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d08RKnmdcoCwlHOezazli8hmJH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257512'),
  ('176363087582561649', 'Detective Conan: Episode One - The Great Detective Turned Small', 2017, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Keiko Urakami, Yasuyuki Urakami, Saburo Yamamoto', 'Yasuichiro Yamamoto, Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Minami Takayama, Wakana Yamazaki, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukitoshi Hori, Fumihiko Tachiki, Kenichi Ogata, Rikiya Koyama', 'PG-13', 'Two-hour remake of the original 1st episode, in celebration of the anime celebrating 20 years in broadcast. The special retells what happened on the day Shinichi was transformed into the body of a child. The special includes new scenes that weren''t in the original manga or the first anime episode.', 'Two-hour remake of the original 1st episode, in celebration of the anime celebrating 20 years in broadcast. The special retells what happened on the day Shinichi was transformed into the body of a child. The special includes new scenes that weren''t in the original manga or the first anime episode.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJLA2LwMRqqiY3ateI2ERUJPrL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573364'),
  ('799342276022952182', 'Detective Conan: Full Score of Fear', 2008, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Masatomo Sudo, Junko Yamanaka, Yasuichiro Yamamoto', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Naoko Matsui, Kenichi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai', 'PG-13', 'Serial murders involving all kinds have happened. All the victims are from a Music School led by a famous pianist. Conan and company have been invited to a opening concert of the Music Hall built by the pianist. The biggest attraction of this concert is the world famous violin called "Stradivarius" and a special appearance of a singer who has perfect pitch.', 'Serial murders involving all kinds have happened. All the victims are from a Music School led by a famous pianist. Conan and company have been invited to a opening concert of the Music Hall built by the pianist. The biggest attraction of this concert is the world famous violin called "Stradivarius" and a special appearance of a singer who has perfect pitch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxq2TfGy1Vfh9miCjKPo0nNxmW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39207'),
  ('1017034938733722883', 'Detective Conan: Jolly Roger in the Deep Azure', 2007, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Yasuichiro Yamamoto, Junko Yamanaka, Masatomo Sudo', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Naoko Matsui, Akira Kamiya, Kenichi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai', 'PG-13', 'The Isle of Koumi, a beautiful island in the Pacific Ocean. On the island, people pass an old legend down from generation to generation that there was the Seabed Palace, an ancient ruin at the bottom of the sea, where the treasure of female pirates Anne Bonny and Mary Reed was left. When Conan and his friends visit Koumi while on vacation, they meet some suspicious treasure hunters.', 'The Isle of Koumi, a beautiful island in the Pacific Ocean. On the island, people pass an old legend down from generation to generation that there was the Seabed Palace, an ancient ruin at the bottom of the sea, where the treasure of female pirates Anne Bonny and Mary Reed was left. When Conan and his friends visit Koumi while on vacation, they meet some suspicious treasure hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qiBRbIsfpw6O32TfD1FZ81MiKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39206'),
  ('750111439897734865', 'Detective Conan: Love Story at Police Headquarters ~Wedding Eve~', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Animation', 'Shunsuke Ishihara', null, 'Minami Takayama, Wataru Takagi, Atsuko Yuya, Wakana Yamazaki, Nobutoshi Canna, Chafurin, Kaneto Shiozawa, Seizo Kato', null, 'A feature-length companion piece for the film "Detective Conan: The Bride of Halloween." It consists of clips from past “Conan” TV series episodes associated with Detectives Miwako Sato and Wataru Takagi, showing the adventures they went through together and how they have grown to attracted to each other. This serves as a great companion to "The Bride of Halloween," detailing the history of two lovebirds along with their (former) colleagues at the police headquarters, to dedicated “Conan” fans to help appreciate "The Bride of Halloween" even more.', 'A feature-length companion piece for the film "Detective Conan: The Bride of Halloween." It consists of clips from past “Conan” TV series episodes associated with Detectives Miwako Sato and Wataru Takagi, showing the adventures they went through together and how they have grown to attracted to each other. This serves as a great companion to "The Bride of Halloween," detailing the history of two lovebirds along with their (former) colleagues at the police headquarters, to dedicated “Conan” fans to help appreciate "The Bride of Halloween" even more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Vq3HGbKwCLxgAQURTUE4Ub5DdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:963806'),
  ('940194612972200713', 'Detective Conan: Magician of the Silver Sky', 2004, 'Animation, Mystery, Adventure', 'Junko Yamanaka, Masatomo Sudo, Yasuichiro Yamamoto', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Naoko Matsui, Gara Takashima, Kenichi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara', 'PG-13', 'Once again, Kaitou Kid crosses swords with Conan Edogawa in this annual installment of the Detective Conan movie franchise. After receiving a letter from the thief, famous actress Juri Maki seeks the help of private detective Kogorou Mouri to protect the Star Sapphire—the "Jewel of Destiny," said to represent faith, fate, and hope.', 'Once again, Kaitou Kid crosses swords with Conan Edogawa in this annual installment of the Detective Conan movie franchise. After receiving a letter from the thief, famous actress Juri Maki seeks the help of private detective Kogorou Mouri to protect the Star Sapphire—the "Jewel of Destiny," said to represent faith, fate, and hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y23gqg2y2ckCcqjhe4WKlIHq63B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39203'),
  ('695677206489515148', 'Detective Conan: One-Eyed Flashback', 2025, 'Animation, Action, Mystery, Crime', 'Katsuya Shigehara, Masatomo Sudo, Hitoshi Nishiyama', 'Takeharu Sakurai', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Yuji Takada, Ami Koshimizu, Show Hayami, Megumi Hayashibara', null, 'As police inspector Yamato Kansuke pursues a certain man in the snowy mountains of Nagano, a shadow suddenly appears in his field of vision. While he''s distracted, a rifle bullet fired by someone grazes his left eye and causes an avalanche accompanied by a roar. Ten months later, Kansuke, having miraculously survived the avalanche, receives a report that a researcher at the Nobeyama National Astronomical Observatory has been attacked.', 'As police inspector Yamato Kansuke pursues a certain man in the snowy mountains of Nagano, a shadow suddenly appears in his field of vision. While he''s distracted, a rifle bullet fired by someone grazes his left eye and causes an avalanche accompanied by a roar. Ten months later, Kansuke, having miraculously survived the avalanche, receives a report that a researcher at the Nobeyama National Astronomical Observatory has been attacked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wl6eAHbIDSz61tGwYTOKlSRvZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1396965'),
  ('491809192019912729', 'Detective Conan: Private Eye in the Distant Sea', 2013, 'Animation, Action, Drama', 'Masatomo Sudo, Kiyoshi Muta, Yoshiharu Shimizu', 'Takeharu Sakurai', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Hayashibara, Kenichi Ogata, Yukiko Iwai, Wataru Takagi', 'PG-13', 'It’s a high-stakes mystery on the high seas! Enjoying a free prize cruise on a military ship, Conan and his friends find their relaxation interrupted by the threat of possible explosives on board! It’s a race against time to find the culprit and save the ship — and potentially the whole country!', 'It’s a high-stakes mystery on the high seas! Enjoying a free prize cruise on a military ship, Conan and his friends find their relaxation interrupted by the threat of possible explosives on board! It’s a race against time to find the culprit and save the ship — and potentially the whole country!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QtpfeGuxWbfLMgBiP3u3MVws9M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228805'),
  ('412943814365754643', 'Detective Conan: Quarter of Silence', 2011, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Yasuichiro Yamamoto, Rion Kujo, Akio Kawamura', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai, Wataru Takagi, Ikue Otani', 'PG-13', 'The explosion of a new Tokyo Subway line leads Conan and his friends in a snow-clad village. Here, after eight years, the little detective sheds light on the dynamics behind the shocking event that caused the death of a woman and the coma of a 15-year-old boy. Under the beautiful snow, Conan gets involved in something bigger than him.', 'The explosion of a new Tokyo Subway line leads Conan and his friends in a snow-clad village. Here, after eight years, the little detective sheds light on the dynamics behind the shocking event that caused the death of a woman and the coma of a 15-year-old boy. Under the beautiful snow, Conan gets involved in something bigger than him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bNsqXpPKSdcqPeBgWg9HsrwYJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77617'),
  ('87964827542508669', 'Detective Conan: Strategy Above the Depths', 2005, 'Animation, Mystery', 'Masatomo Sudo, Yasuichiro Yamamoto, Junko Yamanaka', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Kenichi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai, Ikue Otani', 'PG-13', 'Fifteen years ago in a barren stretch of the Pacific, a cruise ship collided with an iceberg and was lost at sea. More than a decade later, Hideto Yashiro—a ship engineer—died in a fatal car accident. The unlikely connection between these events only comes to light on the luxury liner St. Aphrodite during her maiden voyage. Aboard it on a much needed vacation, Kogorou Mouri, his daughter Ran, Conan Edogawa, and the Detective Boys enjoy a trip provided by Sonoko Suzuki''s family. But their fun is soon cut short when a game of hide-and-seek leads to Sonoko''s disappearance.', 'Fifteen years ago in a barren stretch of the Pacific, a cruise ship collided with an iceberg and was lost at sea. More than a decade later, Hideto Yashiro—a ship engineer—died in a fatal car accident. The unlikely connection between these events only comes to light on the luxury liner St. Aphrodite during her maiden voyage. Aboard it on a much needed vacation, Kogorou Mouri, his daughter Ran, Conan Edogawa, and the Detective Boys enjoy a trip provided by Sonoko Suzuki''s family. But their fun is soon cut short when a game of hide-and-seek leads to Sonoko''s disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enhiUd7MOuLjKa4NkZmLaN7dDWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39204'),
  ('164838018001057661', 'Detective Conan: Sunflowers of Inferno', 2015, 'Animation, Crime, Adventure, Mystery', 'Keiko Urakami, Akio Kawamura, Hiroyuki Horiuchi', 'Takeharu Sakurai', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Kenichi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai, Wataru Takagi', 'PG-13', 'Conan tries to track down Kaito Kid, who supposedly steals a replica of one of Van Gogh''s Sunflowers paintings during an auction.', 'Conan tries to track down Kaito Kid, who supposedly steals a replica of one of Van Gogh''s Sunflowers paintings during an auction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phTv5vD6nLCLrtUKWRHMBJGU7Bi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316873'),
  ('547326716381109809', 'Detective Conan: The Bride of Halloween', 2022, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Masatomo Sudo, Asuka Kashimura, Nariyuki Takahashi', 'Takahiro Okura', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Toru Furuya, Wataru Takagi, Atsuko Yuya, Nobutoshi Canna', null, 'Shibuya, Tokyo, is bustling with the Halloween season. A wedding is being held at Shibuya Hikarie, where Detective Miwako Sato of the Metropolitan Police Department is dressed in a wedding dress. While Conan and the other invited guests are watching, an assailant suddenly bursts in, and Detective Wataru Takagi, who was trying to protect Sato, is injured. Takagi survived and the situation was settled, but in Sato''s eyes, the image of the grim reaper that she had seen when Detective Matsuda, the man she had been in love with, had been killed in a series of bombings three years ago, overlapped with Takagi''s.', 'Shibuya, Tokyo, is bustling with the Halloween season. A wedding is being held at Shibuya Hikarie, where Detective Miwako Sato of the Metropolitan Police Department is dressed in a wedding dress. While Conan and the other invited guests are watching, an assailant suddenly bursts in, and Detective Wataru Takagi, who was trying to protect Sato, is injured. Takagi survived and the situation was settled, but in Sato''s eyes, the image of the grim reaper that she had seen when Detective Matsuda, the man she had been in love with, had been killed in a series of bombings three years ago, overlapped with Takagi''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfsLhI6yAHH9pdhY6EConmUCumX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:903939'),
  ('335754788632908979', 'Detective Conan: The Darkest Nightmare', 2016, 'Animation, Mystery, Action, Crime', 'Keiko Urakami, Hiroyuki Notake, Kumiko Shishido', 'Takeharu Sakurai', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai, Ikue Otani, Wataru Takagi', null, 'On a dark night, the Japanese police is raided by a spy. Different countries'' intelligence agencies - such as England''s MI6, Germany''s BDN, and America''s CIA - as well as the FBI''s secret files are going to be taken, but public safety officers lead by Tooru Amuro arrive just in time. The spy steals a car and escapes. The spy and Amuro are then locked in a dead heat on the highway, and just as it is about to cause an accident with multiple cars, the spy''s car is hit by FBI agent Shuichi Akai''s rifle bullet and falls of the roadway. The next day, Conan and his friends go to a newly-remodeled aquarium in Tokyo. Under the main attraction, a Ferris wheel, Conan finds an attractive woman alone and injured. Her left and right eyes are different colors.', 'On a dark night, the Japanese police is raided by a spy. Different countries'' intelligence agencies - such as England''s MI6, Germany''s BDN, and America''s CIA - as well as the FBI''s secret files are going to be taken, but public safety officers lead by Tooru Amuro arrive just in time. The spy steals a car and escapes. The spy and Amuro are then locked in a dead heat on the highway, and just as it is about to cause an accident with multiple cars, the spy''s car is hit by FBI agent Shuichi Akai''s rifle bullet and falls of the roadway. The next day, Conan and his friends go to a newly-remodeled aquarium in Tokyo. Under the main attraction, a Ferris wheel, Conan finds an attractive woman alone and injured. Her left and right eyes are different colors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXYeXuomi8EpXsXO4cvt5mdfSCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374856'),
  ('1019341265895349576', 'Detective Conan: The Eleventh Striker', 2012, 'Animation, Mystery, Action', 'Yasuichiro Yamamoto, Masatomo Sudo, Hiroyuki Horiuchi', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai, Wataru Takagi, Ikue Otani', 'PG-13', 'Kogoro''s detective agency receives a mysterious phone call. Someone on the other end warns about a bomb and leaves behind a code, which if Conan can decipher the riddle, he can stop the bomb. An adventure begins for Conan and the Detective Boys, taking place at a soccer match between Hideo Akagi of the Tokyo Spirits and Ryusuke Higo of Big Osaka.', 'Kogoro''s detective agency receives a mysterious phone call. Someone on the other end warns about a bomb and leaves behind a code, which if Conan can decipher the riddle, he can stop the bomb. An adventure begins for Conan and the Detective Boys, taking place at a soccer match between Hideo Akagi of the Tokyo Spirits and Ryusuke Higo of Big Osaka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wUk85WRQrAxTOgxjdPwrmVQ2Se.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122583'),
  ('958320973226986887', 'Detective Conan: The Last Wizard of the Century', 1999, 'Adventure, Animation, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Kenji Kodama, Takashi Hyodo, Yoshiharu Shimizu', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Chafurin, Kaneto Shiozawa, Wataru Takagi, Unsho Ishizuka', 'PG-13', 'Kaitou Kid dares to challenge the police once more, setting his sights on the Russian Imperial Easter Egg. With the date, time, and place, the Osaka police force scrambles to stop him. But this time, Kid may have bitten off more than he can chew—Conan Edogawa, Heiji Hattori, and numerous others are also trying to get their hands on the jeweled egg.', 'Kaitou Kid dares to challenge the police once more, setting his sights on the Russian Imperial Easter Egg. With the date, time, and place, the Osaka police force scrambles to stop him. But this time, Kid may have bitten off more than he can chew—Conan Edogawa, Heiji Hattori, and numerous others are also trying to get their hands on the jeweled egg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2v6JmGMVQR0UhUirXuuzXUcAnN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28808'),
  ('704979152115787113', 'Detective Conan: The Lost Ship in the Sky', 2010, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Action', 'Yasuichiro Yamamoto, Rion Kujo, Yoshiharu Shimizu', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai, Ikue Otani, Wataru Takagi', 'PG-13', 'A terrorist group invades a laboratory containing a deadly bacteria and destroys the lab with an explosion. They later announce via the internet they have gained possession of the bacteria and declare themselves to be the Red Siamese Cats, a terrorist group that was eradicated a decade ago.', 'A terrorist group invades a laboratory containing a deadly bacteria and destroys the lab with an explosion. They later announce via the internet they have gained possession of the bacteria and declare themselves to be the Red Siamese Cats, a terrorist group that was eradicated a decade ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kthV4ZwXO37pfCFTbX1cHOYie4r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97375'),
  ('325416844484931993', 'Detective Conan: The Million-Dollar Pentagram', 2024, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Action', 'Chika Nagaoka, Masatomo Sudo, Hitoshi Nishiyama', 'Takahiro Okura', 'Minami Takayama, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Ryo Horikawa, Yuko Miyamura, Kappei Yamaguchi, Koji Yusa, Satsuki Yukino', null, 'A message has arrived from Kid the Phantom Thief, that he will steal a Japanese sword belonging to wealthy Onoe Family in Hakodate, Hokkaido. Conan and Heiji Hattori, who happened to be in Hakodate, are on the case to capture Kid. Coincidentally the family lawyer of Onoe is found murdered in the warehouse district, apparently slaughtered by a Japanese sword. The suspect is an investor/arms dealer who is said to be after Onoe family’s hidden treasure. In the North among cherry blossoms, the exciting hunt for treasure begins!', 'A message has arrived from Kid the Phantom Thief, that he will steal a Japanese sword belonging to wealthy Onoe Family in Hakodate, Hokkaido. Conan and Heiji Hattori, who happened to be in Hakodate, are on the case to capture Kid. Coincidentally the family lawyer of Onoe is found murdered in the warehouse district, apparently slaughtered by a Japanese sword. The suspect is an investor/arms dealer who is said to be after Onoe family’s hidden treasure. In the North among cherry blossoms, the exciting hunt for treasure begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctboIRYQHYJMge6M6fgcwrhREsj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1209217'),
  ('941256383160027869', 'Detective Conan: The Mystery of the Legendary Monster Bird', 2011, 'Mystery', 'Takeshi Shirakawa', null, 'Junpei Mizobata, Shioli Kutsuna, Nene Otsuka, Masao Kusakari, Yui Aoya, Tori Matsuzaka, Sayaka Akimoto, Masatô Ibu', null, 'This story takes place 100 days before Kudo Shinichi became Edogawa Conan. Kudo Shinichi, a high school detective, arrives in Jugoya Town with Mori Ran and others. In this town a legend exists, claiming that a gigantic bull-headed shrike attacks the townspeople and kills them. The town was about to hold a festival in 3 days to put the giant bird''s spirit to rest. While being led on a tour of the bull-headed shrike Shrine by Sonoko''s parent''s friend, Mr. Wakura, a crime related to the legend occurs. Starting with Kosaka, member of the Wakura family are slowly murdered in the same way...', 'This story takes place 100 days before Kudo Shinichi became Edogawa Conan. Kudo Shinichi, a high school detective, arrives in Jugoya Town with Mori Ran and others. In this town a legend exists, claiming that a gigantic bull-headed shrike attacks the townspeople and kills them. The town was about to hold a festival in 3 days to put the giant bird''s spirit to rest. While being led on a tour of the bull-headed shrike Shrine by Sonoko''s parent''s friend, Mr. Wakura, a crime related to the legend occurs. Starting with Kosaka, member of the Wakura family are slowly murdered in the same way...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1wFljQHLEH67PrloJApGAOHMlC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380909'),
  ('692088328967289526', 'Detective Conan: The Phantom of Baker Street', 2002, 'Animation, Adventure, Mystery, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Kenji Kodama, Junko Yamanaka, Masatomo Sudo', 'Hisashi Nozawa', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Hideyuki Tanaka, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai, Ikue Otani', 'PG-13', 'Noah''s Ark, the latest innovation in VR technology, is set for a showcase to Japan''s privileged children. However, their carefree fun is cut short when a company employee is found murdered, with his dying message pointing to a clue hidden within the Ark. Along with the Detective Boys and Ran Mouri, Conan Edogawa enters Noah''s Ark to solve this mystery and ensure the perpetrator is caught.', 'Noah''s Ark, the latest innovation in VR technology, is set for a showcase to Japan''s privileged children. However, their carefree fun is cut short when a company employee is found murdered, with his dying message pointing to a clue hidden within the Ark. Along with the Detective Boys and Ran Mouri, Conan Edogawa enters Noah''s Ark to solve this mystery and ensure the perpetrator is caught.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbgADjLIYoLAc3mayVWGBWSbjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26662'),
  ('664935375119422593', 'Detective Conan: The Private Eyes'' Requiem', 2006, 'Animation, Mystery, Adventure', 'Yasuichiro Yamamoto, Junko Yamanaka, Masatomo Sudo', 'Hiroshi Kashiwabara', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Ryo Horikawa, Naoko Matsui, Yuko Miyamura, Kenichi Ogata', 'PG-13', 'Synopsis Kogoro and Conan came to Yokohama according to a request from a mysterious man. But that was a trap of this man. Ran and the Detective Boys will be taken as hostages. If they don''t solve the request of the man within 12 hours, the bombs attached to the hostages will explode. Furthermore, the man know that Conan`s true identity is Kudo Shinichi. Also Hattori Heiji, the High School Detective of the West, and Kaito Kid enter the stage. Will they be able to solve the mystery within the time limit and save Ran and the others? And who in the world is the client?', 'Synopsis Kogoro and Conan came to Yokohama according to a request from a mysterious man. But that was a trap of this man. Ran and the Detective Boys will be taken as hostages. If they don''t solve the request of the man within 12 hours, the bombs attached to the hostages will explode. Furthermore, the man know that Conan`s true identity is Kudo Shinichi. Also Hattori Heiji, the High School Detective of the West, and Kaito Kid enter the stage. Will they be able to solve the mystery within the time limit and save Ran and the others? And who in the world is the client?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nWSBZBOP6NSGuBoGQEiIg03lJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39205'),
  ('1117339567694086705', 'Detective Conan: The Raven Chaser', 2009, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Yasuichiro Yamamoto, Junko Yamanaka, Masatomo Sudo', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Megumi Hayashibara, Yukiko Iwai, Ikue Otani, Wataru Takagi', 'PG-13', 'A new member from the Black Organization that shrunk Shinichi''s body manages to find out about Shinichi''s transformation into Conan. This discovery starts to put those around him in danger as Gin and the other Black Organization members start to take action.', 'A new member from the Black Organization that shrunk Shinichi''s body manages to find out about Shinichi''s transformation into Conan. This discovery starts to put those around him in danger as Gin and the other Black Organization members start to take action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rqrypnOq4cuwzobGW9gQgarkSr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28764'),
  ('1012076950736372687', 'Detective Conan: The Scarlet Alibi', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Action, Mystery', 'Shunsuke Ishihara', 'Junichi Miyashita', 'Minami Takayama, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Shuichi Ikeda, Megumi Hayashibara, Noriko Hidaka, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Atsuko Tanaka', null, 'Compilation film combining footage from various television anime episodes that center on the Akai family.', 'Compilation film combining footage from various television anime episodes that center on the Akai family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DHVPVYuTzNBh9dcga5wgGzpPpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801293'),
  ('996870564800854881', 'Detective Conan: The Scarlet Bullet', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Tsutomu Ishigaki, Masatomo Sudo, Nariyuki Takahashi', 'Takeharu Sakurai', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Shuichi Ikeda, Ryotaro Okiayu, Atsuko Tanaka, Noriko Hidaka', null, 'At the opening ceremony of the WSG (World Sports Games) Tokyo Games, a sports festival held once every four years, it is announced that the world''s first vacuum superconducting maglev with a maximum speed of 1,000 kilometers per hour will open. While attracting attention from around the world, top executives of large companies are kidnapped from the party venue where WSG tournament sponsors gather. Conan moves toward a solution and eventually finds a connection with the WSG abduction case that occurred 15 years ago in Boston, USA.', 'At the opening ceremony of the WSG (World Sports Games) Tokyo Games, a sports festival held once every four years, it is announced that the world''s first vacuum superconducting maglev with a maximum speed of 1,000 kilometers per hour will open. While attracting attention from around the world, top executives of large companies are kidnapped from the party venue where WSG tournament sponsors gather. Conan moves toward a solution and eventually finds a connection with the WSG abduction case that occurred 15 years ago in Boston, USA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wowJzvF1KqEFSZoArkgngRy1r4L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662638'),
  ('819794868614016518', 'Detective Conan: The Story of Ai Haibara: Black Iron Mystery Train', 2023, 'Animation', 'Shunsuke Ishihara', 'Junichi Miyashita', 'Minami Takayama, Megumi Hayashibara, Kenichi Ogata, Yukitoshi Hori, Wakana Yamazaki, Rikiya Koyama, Toru Furuya, Fumihiko Tachiki', null, 'Ai Haibara (autonym Shiho Miyano a.k.a. Sherry). A woman with three identities, who boldly faces her destiny. Shiho Miyano (code name: Sherry), a scientist and a member of the Black Organization. The organization was the one that developed a mysterious poison APTX (Apotoxin) 4869, the drug that turned Shinichi Kudo into a little boy! However, when Sherry realizes that the Black Organization has murdered her sister Akemi, she betrays the Black Organization and decides to take APTX4869. The drug turns her into a little girl, and she decides to call herself Ai Haibara in order to hide from the Black Organization. Yet slowly but surely, the Black Organization begins to cast its shadow over her.', 'Ai Haibara (autonym Shiho Miyano a.k.a. Sherry). A woman with three identities, who boldly faces her destiny. Shiho Miyano (code name: Sherry), a scientist and a member of the Black Organization. The organization was the one that developed a mysterious poison APTX (Apotoxin) 4869, the drug that turned Shinichi Kudo into a little boy! However, when Sherry realizes that the Black Organization has murdered her sister Akemi, she betrays the Black Organization and decides to take APTX4869. The drug turns her into a little girl, and she decides to call herself Ai Haibara in order to hide from the Black Organization. Yet slowly but surely, the Black Organization begins to cast its shadow over her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqYvJXLdsLp3Qsmej0ekOqBrzow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058906'),
  ('540166312965594609', 'Detective Conan: The Time Bombed Skyscraper', 1997, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Adventure', 'Kenji Kodama, Masatomo Sudo, Akio Kawamura', 'Kazunari Kouchi', 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Kenichi Ogata, Yukiko Iwai, Wataru Takagi, Ikue Otani', 'PG-13', 'Once brilliant teenage detective Shinichi Kudo was given a poison that reverted him to a 4-year-old. He''s adopted the pseudonym Conan Edogawa so no one (save for an eccentric inventor) will know. Now he''s got to solve a series of bombings before his loved ones become victims. Who is this madman and why is he doing this? Only the young genius can save the day but will even he be up to the task?', 'Once brilliant teenage detective Shinichi Kudo was given a poison that reverted him to a 4-year-old. He''s adopted the pseudonym Conan Edogawa so no one (save for an eccentric inventor) will know. Now he''s got to solve a series of bombings before his loved ones become victims. Who is this madman and why is he doing this? Only the young genius can save the day but will even he be up to the task?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFb0fRZ4d5fNcFZ3th8mFen9Av2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21422'),
  ('759010828447837587', 'Detective Dee and the Mystery of the Phantom Flame', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Mystery', 'Tsui Hark, Pakie Chan, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo', 'Chen Kuofu', 'Andy Lau, Li Bingbing, Deng Chao, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Carina Lau, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Teddy Robin, Liu Jinshan', 'PG-13', 'When the future empress Wu Zetian''s two courtiers die in a mysterious fire, she gets Di Renjie, a former detective and rebel, released from prison to solve the mystery of the fire.', 'When the future empress Wu Zetian''s two courtiers die in a mysterious fire, she gets Di Renjie, a former detective and rebel, released from prison to solve the mystery of the fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWOBV05kNeLyaiA31DFkZlMpta5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48492'),
  ('353110414597147876', 'Detective Dee: Rats Invasion', 2020, 'Adventure, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Hang Zhu, Sun Jianshe', 'Hang Zhu', 'Benny Chan Ho-Man, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Zhang Dong, Shan He', null, 'A rat infestation occurred in the state, the prison collapsed, and Di Renjie was in danger. A large number of villagers were trapped in the city because of the rodent infestation. In order to save the lives of the people in the city, Di Renjie traced the source of the disease. However, as the investigation deepened, it turned out that there was a huge conspiracy behind the rat disaster.', 'A rat infestation occurred in the state, the prison collapsed, and Di Renjie was in danger. A large number of villagers were trapped in the city because of the rodent infestation. In order to save the lives of the people in the city, Di Renjie traced the source of the disease. However, as the investigation deepened, it turned out that there was a huge conspiracy behind the rat disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UT4XTP4G1xp1T8dsLoDkww81ZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728307'),
  ('616353743878739323', 'Detective Dee: The Four Heavenly Kings', 2018, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure, Mystery', 'Tsui Hark, Choi Sung-Fai, Hwang Hyo-jeong', 'Zhang Jialu', 'Mark Chao You-Ting, William Feng, Carina Lau, Lin Gengxin, Ma Sichun, Ethan Juan, Tiger Xu, Sun Jiaolong', null, 'Dee, the detective serving Chinese empress Wu Zetian, is called upon to investigate a series of strange events in Loyang, including the appearance of mysterious warriors wearing Chiyou ghost masks, foxes that speak human language and the pillar sculptures in the palace coming alive.', 'Dee, the detective serving Chinese empress Wu Zetian, is called upon to investigate a series of strange events in Loyang, including the appearance of mysterious warriors wearing Chiyou ghost masks, foxes that speak human language and the pillar sculptures in the palace coming alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZ3XTA5ZlGOj92jRBSYglW8r9QY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506763'),
  ('31962871997380331', 'Detective in the Bar 2', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Action', 'Hajime Hashimoto', 'Yasushi Sutô, Ryota Kosawa', 'Yo Oizumi, Ryuhei Matsuda, Machiko Ono, Tomorowo Taguchi, Kazuki Namioka, Atsuro Watabe, Gori, Eisuke Sasai', null, 'A friend of the detective has been is murdered. During the investigation, he comes across a source which tells him that his friend was murdered for involvement with the dark side of the political world. On top of that, a woman approaches the detective with a request.', 'A friend of the detective has been is murdered. During the investigation, he comes across a source which tells him that his friend was murdered for involvement with the dark side of the political world. On top of that, a woman approaches the detective with a request.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnPCyvWHVkyPZsAokJjoC7Cj074.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238127'),
  ('466757573522046647', 'Detective K: Secret of the Living Dead', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime, Action, Mystery', 'Kim Sok-yun, Choi Won-pyo', 'Lee Nam-kyu, Han Jeung-ae, Jo Eun-i', 'Kim Myung-min, Oh Dal-su, Kim Ji-won, Lee Min-ki, Kim Bum, Park Keun-hyong, Woo Hyeon, Yoon Sang-hoon', null, 'When a series of murders occur in Kanghwa Island, Detective K and his partner are once again called upon to solve the case. Along the way, he teams up with a beautiful woman with amnesia and together they discover Vampire bite marks on all the bodies. As they investigate further, they realize that the woman is somehow closely connected to the deaths.', 'When a series of murders occur in Kanghwa Island, Detective K and his partner are once again called upon to solve the case. Along the way, he teams up with a beautiful woman with amnesia and together they discover Vampire bite marks on all the bodies. As they investigate further, they realize that the woman is somehow closely connected to the deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFLPuNDTYxLZusaEQ0edBVlVaeh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500378'),
  ('904285582750969248', 'Detective K: Secret of the Lost Island', 2015, 'Action, Mystery, Comedy', 'Kim Sok-yun', 'Lee Nam-kyu', 'Kim Myung-min, Oh Dal-su, Lee Yeon-hee, Jung Won-joong, Hwang Chae-won, Hwang Jeong-min, Woo Hyeon, Choi Moo-seong', null, 'Joseon''s top detective Kim Min attempts to track down those responsible for circulating massive amounts of counterfeit silver bullion in Joseon. He also tries to find the missing sibling of a young girl.', 'Joseon''s top detective Kim Min attempts to track down those responsible for circulating massive amounts of counterfeit silver bullion in Joseon. He also tries to find the missing sibling of a young girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAih5TO8oiqPGZOwRoYvyjeMCRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328716'),
  ('1030370183549864801', 'Detective K: Secret of Virtuous Widow', 2011, 'Mystery, Action, History, Comedy, Crime', 'Kim Sok-yun, 장남철', 'Lee Choon-hyung, Lee Nam-kyu', 'Kim Myung-min, Oh Dal-su, Han Ji-min, Lee Jae-yong, Woo Hyeon, Ye Su-jeong, Jeong In-gi, Nam Sung-jin', null, 'In 1782, King Jeong-jo of Joseon asks detective K to investigate a series of murders related to a case of corruption within the government.', 'In 1782, King Jeong-jo of Joseon asks detective K to investigate a series of murders related to a case of corruption within the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqwriZQZMTh4yegxgsacmSjc4aV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64931'),
  ('454007111559170328', 'Detective Kitty O''Day', 1944, 'Comedy, Mystery, Romance', 'William Beaudine', 'Tim Ryan, Victor Hammond', 'Jean Parker, Peter Cookson, Tim Ryan, Veda Ann Borg, Edward Gargan, Douglas Fowley, Pat Gleason, Olaf Hytten', null, 'Convinced that she has what it takes to be a detective, inquisitive secretary Kitty O''Day gets her chance to put her sleuthing skills to the test when her investment broker boss is mysteriously murdered. But Kitty''s investigation hits a snag when Inspector Miles Clancy begins to suspect that she''s the culprit.', 'Convinced that she has what it takes to be a detective, inquisitive secretary Kitty O''Day gets her chance to put her sleuthing skills to the test when her investment broker boss is mysteriously murdered. But Kitty''s investigation hits a snag when Inspector Miles Clancy begins to suspect that she''s the culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQmsmWOSIe5J5iwEQr7EQmiba3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84773'),
  ('583720921702146565', 'Detective Knight: Independence', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Edward Drake, Laffrey Witbrod', 'Edward Drake', 'Bruce Willis, Lochlyn Munro, Jimmy Jean-Louis, Jack Kilmer, Willow Shields, Dina Meyer, Timothy V. Murphy, Lorenzo Antonucci', 'R', 'Detective James Knight ''s last-minute assignment to the Independence Day shift turns into a race to stop an unbalanced ambulance EMT from imperiling the city''s festivities. The misguided vigilante, playing cop with a stolen gun and uniform, has a bank vault full of reasons to put on his own fireworks show... one that will strike dangerously close to Knight''s home.', 'Detective James Knight ''s last-minute assignment to the Independence Day shift turns into a race to stop an unbalanced ambulance EMT from imperiling the city''s festivities. The misguided vigilante, playing cop with a stolen gun and uniform, has a bank vault full of reasons to put on his own fireworks show... one that will strike dangerously close to Knight''s home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrPKVQGjc3YZXm07OYMriIB47HM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1035806'),
  ('344616595744458657', 'Detective Knight: Redemption', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Edward Drake, Laffrey Witbrod', 'Edward Drake', 'Bruce Willis, Lochlyn Munro, Beau Mirchoff, Corey Large, Paul Johansson, John Cassini, Miranda Edwards, Hunter Daily', 'R', 'In custody in New York, Detective James Knight finds himself in the middle of a jailbreak led by The Christmas Bomber, a brutal fanatic whose Santa Claus disciples are terrorizing the city. With the promised return of his badge in exchange for taking out the terrorists, the steely-eyed Knight doles out mercy for the just...and merciless justice for all the rest.', 'In custody in New York, Detective James Knight finds himself in the middle of a jailbreak led by The Christmas Bomber, a brutal fanatic whose Santa Claus disciples are terrorizing the city. With the promised return of his badge in exchange for taking out the terrorists, the steely-eyed Knight doles out mercy for the just...and merciless justice for all the rest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acCIjyszhmit8k5eWVGNTustYRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1035803'),
  ('677477432892517799', 'Detective Knight: Rogue', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Edward Drake, Laffrey Witbrod', 'Corey Large, Edward Drake', 'Bruce Willis, Lochlyn Munro, Jimmy Jean-Louis, Beau Mirchoff, Corey Large, Michael Eklund, Johnny Messner, Cody Kearsley', 'R', 'As Los Angeles prepares for Halloween, mask-wearing armed robbers critically wound detective James Knight’s partner in a shootout following a heist. With Knight in hot pursuit, the bandits flee L.A. for New York, where the detective’s dark past collides with his present case and threatens to tear his world apart…unless redemption can claim Knight first.', 'As Los Angeles prepares for Halloween, mask-wearing armed robbers critically wound detective James Knight’s partner in a shootout following a heist. With Knight in hot pursuit, the bandits flee L.A. for New York, where the detective’s dark past collides with his present case and threatens to tear his world apart…unless redemption can claim Knight first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wj5iUJ2B5AQ1lFctJgUrHHsp9B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024546'),
  ('929808398120563925', 'Detective Story', 1951, 'Crime, Drama', 'William Wyler, Charles C. Coleman, Lee Garmes', 'Philip Yordan, Robert Wyler', 'Kirk Douglas, Eleanor Parker, William Bendix, Cathy O''Donnell, George Macready, Horace McMahon, Gladys George, Joseph Wiseman', null, 'Tells the story of one day in the lives of the various people who populate a police detective squad. An embittered cop, Det. Jim McLeod, leads a precinct of characters in their grim daily battle with the city''s lowlife. The characters who pass through the precinct over the course of the day include a young petty embezzler, a pair of burglars, and a naive shoplifter.', 'Tells the story of one day in the lives of the various people who populate a police detective squad. An embittered cop, Det. Jim McLeod, leads a precinct of characters in their grim daily battle with the city''s lowlife. The characters who pass through the precinct over the course of the day include a young petty embezzler, a pair of burglars, and a naive shoplifter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMbAiGIrfhhp0XNB4mdgfgtSDdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20853'),
  ('117085090593537766', 'Detective Story', 2007, 'Horror', 'Takashi Miike, Kazushige Tanaka', 'Tsutomu Shirado', 'Kazuya Nakayama, Claude Maki, Hiroyuki Watanabe, Tomoharu Hasegawa, Kai Ato, Harumi Inoue, Toru Kazama, Akiko Kikuchi', null, 'A detective and a businessman search for a serial killer who removes people''s organs.', 'A detective and a businessman search for a serial killer who removes people''s organs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLzIFPMdHiprXvQrG6XFDcs7uUJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28467'),
