  ('89770965254718746', 'Devara: Part 1', 2024, 'Action, Drama', 'R. Ratnavelu, Koratala Siva, Kenny Bates', 'Koratala Siva', 'N.T. Rama Rao Jr., Saif Ali Khan, Prakash Raj, Srikanth, Kalaiyarasan, Shruti Marathe, Janhvi Kapoor, Shine Tom Chacko', 'PG-13', 'Devara, a fearless man from a coastal region, embarks on a perilous journey into the treacherous world of the sea to safeguard the lives of his people. Unbeknownst to him, his brother Bhaira is plotting a conspiracy against him. As events unfold, Devara passes on his legacy to his mild-mannered and timid son, Varada.', 'Devara, a fearless man from a coastal region, embarks on a perilous journey into the treacherous world of the sea to safeguard the lives of his people. Unbeknownst to him, his brother Bhaira is plotting a conspiracy against him. As events unfold, Devara passes on his legacy to his mild-mannered and timid son, Varada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQfuaXjANoTsdx5iS0gCXlK9D2L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811941'),
