  ('1150878118771449217', 'Devil Fetus', 1983, 'Horror', 'Lau Hung-Chuen, Lau Hung-Chuen, Lo Ging-Yiu', 'Yeung Kei, Cheng Man-Wah, Lo Ging-Yiu', 'Shirley Lu Hsiu-Ling, Eddie Chen, Lu Pei-Pei, Leung Shan, Danny Lau Dan, Ou-Yang Sha-Fei, Hsu Meng-Kuang, Chin Yung-Hsiang', null, 'After a couple purchases an antique vase at a market, the woman is possessed and killed by a demonic creature. Twelve years later, the demon returns to possess the woman''s nephew and wreak more havoc.', 'After a couple purchases an antique vase at a market, the woman is possessed and killed by a demonic creature. Twelve years later, the demon returns to possess the woman''s nephew and wreak more havoc.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47CpdIk6MMyuRcCynUFdrw7Uklv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93532'),
  ('1032401769995208348', 'Devil Fish', 1984, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Lamberto Bava, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Gianfranco Clerici, Hervé Piccini, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Michael Sopkiw, Valentine Monnier, Gianni Garko, William Berger, Iris Peynado, Lawrence Morgant, Cinzia de Ponti, Paulo Branco', 'R', 'A marine biologist, a dolphin trainer, a research scientist, and a local sheriff try to hunt down a large sea monster, a shark/octopus hybrid, that is devouring swimmers and fishermen off a south Florida coast.', 'A marine biologist, a dolphin trainer, a research scientist, and a local sheriff try to hunt down a large sea monster, a shark/octopus hybrid, that is devouring swimmers and fishermen off a south Florida coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PyU4giw8m1Sl6vdugkNf4j1lbH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28820'),
  ('890256363001031361', 'Devil Girl from Mars', 1954, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'David MacDonald, Jack E. Cox', 'James Eastwood', 'Patricia Laffan, Hugh McDermott, Hazel Court, Joseph Tomelty, Adrienne Corri, Peter Reynolds, Sophie Stewart, John Laurie', 'NR', 'Eight people at a remote Scottish inn find themselves confronted by a woman from Mars, who has landed her flying saucer for repairs but intends to soon conquer the Earth and enslave its men for breeding purposes.', 'Eight people at a remote Scottish inn find themselves confronted by a woman from Mars, who has landed her flying saucer for repairs but intends to soon conquer the Earth and enslave its men for breeding purposes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgQh1yJdQ3ESgwNzTAVNIw3FzMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24212'),
  ('773244526247002602', 'Devil Hunter', 1980, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Juan Soler, Jean-Pierre Ducroux', 'Julián Esteban Rivera, Jesús Franco', 'Ursula Buchfellner, Al Cliver, Antonio Mayans, Antonio de Cabo, Bertrand Altmann, Gisela Hahn, Muriel Montossé, Werner Pochath', null, 'The lovely Laura, on a modelling job in South Africa, is kidnapped by a gang who carry her off into the jungle from where they demand a huge ransom. Two men set off in a helicopter to rescue her, little knowing what horrors Laura is enduring in the meantime in the savage clutches of a primitive and bloodthristy world. Laura''s rescuers not only have to face the cruel violence of her captors - but also the horrifying lust for blood of a primitive and cruel god.', 'The lovely Laura, on a modelling job in South Africa, is kidnapped by a gang who carry her off into the jungle from where they demand a huge ransom. Two men set off in a helicopter to rescue her, little knowing what horrors Laura is enduring in the meantime in the savage clutches of a primitive and bloodthristy world. Laura''s rescuers not only have to face the cruel violence of her captors - but also the horrifying lust for blood of a primitive and cruel god.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eccYH8f7WPqOyaIQ6vFHxRXNAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84362'),
  ('845658779655291042', 'Devil Hunters', 1989, 'Action', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku, Chui Fat, Chen Fu-Li', 'Tony Lou Chun-Ku, Chan Man-Kwai', 'Ray Lui, Moon Lee Choi-Fung, Sibelle Hu Hui-Chung, Candy Man, Alex Man Chi-Leung, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Wong Wai', null, 'A veteran mobster finds that not only are the police after him, but so are members of his own gang, led by a young gangster who wants to take over.', 'A veteran mobster finds that not only are the police after him, but so are members of his own gang, led by a young gangster who wants to take over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOkdJeArAFSHRoK6X3uMGTmGtvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41069'),
  ('1026796266594835628', 'Devil in a Blue Dress', 1995, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Carl Franklin, Tak Fujimoto', 'Carl Franklin', 'Denzel Washington, Tom Sizemore, Jennifer Beals, Don Cheadle, Maury Chaykin, Terry Kinney, Mel Winkler, Albert Hall', 'R', 'In late 1940s Los Angeles, Easy Rawlins is an unemployed black World War II veteran with few job prospects. At a bar, Easy meets DeWitt Albright, a mysterious white man looking for someone to investigate the disappearance of a missing white woman named Daphne Monet, who he suspects is hiding out in one of the city''s black jazz clubs. Strapped for money and facing house payments, Easy takes the job, but soon finds himself in over his head.', 'In late 1940s Los Angeles, Easy Rawlins is an unemployed black World War II veteran with few job prospects. At a bar, Easy meets DeWitt Albright, a mysterious white man looking for someone to investigate the disappearance of a missing white woman named Daphne Monet, who he suspects is hiding out in one of the city''s black jazz clubs. Strapped for money and facing house payments, Easy takes the job, but soon finds himself in over his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lcJhwKGavLbPva17QkTBhLfqEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8512'),
  ('230505885950956114', 'Devil In Dune', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Xia Banchang', null, 'Wang Ziyi, Tang Yinuo, Ying Da, Ma Muxuan, Zhang Zhenlei, Zhao Peilin, Cui Yahan, Liao Wang', null, 'The film tells the story of a near future in which the earth is irreversibly sandy, as human emissions and rubbish exceed its carrying capacity. As plants and animals mutate to create the Earth''s new masters, the "sand worms", which are slaughtering the planet and driving humans to the brink of extinction, the survivors are left to their own devices to find the only remaining refuge in the deep desert, the "Oasis". An exiled team of wealthy businessmen, scientists, security chiefs, mechanic families and gangsters set out on an adventure to find the Oasis in a special armoured vehicle, but the bloodthirsty insects are hot on their heels.', 'The film tells the story of a near future in which the earth is irreversibly sandy, as human emissions and rubbish exceed its carrying capacity. As plants and animals mutate to create the Earth''s new masters, the "sand worms", which are slaughtering the planet and driving humans to the brink of extinction, the survivors are left to their own devices to find the only remaining refuge in the deep desert, the "Oasis". An exiled team of wealthy businessmen, scientists, security chiefs, mechanic families and gangsters set out on an adventure to find the Oasis in a special armoured vehicle, but the bloodthirsty insects are hot on their heels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQLdzYYB71sUugtSR7e7YdjF6Vx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911972'),
  ('310774032964711798', 'Devil in the Brain', 1972, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Romano Scandariato, Fabrizio Sergenti Castellani, Sergio Sollima', 'Sergio Sollima, Suso Cecchi d''Amico', 'Stefania Sandrelli, Keir Dullea, Micheline Presle, Tino Buazzelli, Renato Cestiè, Maurice Ronet, Orchidea De Santis, Gaia Germani', null, 'Oscar is trying to re-establish an affair with Sandra, a disturbed young woman. Having found her husband Fabrizio shot dead and her young son Ricky standing beside him with a gun, Sandra suffered a complete breakdown and now lives in isolation with her protective mother. The latter saved the young boy from recrimination by placing the gun in his father''s hand, making it seem like he committed suicide. However, things are not what they seem...', 'Oscar is trying to re-establish an affair with Sandra, a disturbed young woman. Having found her husband Fabrizio shot dead and her young son Ricky standing beside him with a gun, Sandra suffered a complete breakdown and now lives in isolation with her protective mother. The latter saved the young boy from recrimination by placing the gun in his father''s hand, making it seem like he committed suicide. However, things are not what they seem...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixEWWW1o1PCb3OwuLKoCXDUqbqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105106'),
  ('1003252152963389147', 'Devil in the Dark', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Tim Brown', 'Carey Dickson', 'Dan Payne, Robin Dunne, Daniel Cudmore, Chris Ippolito, Jett Klyne, Rebecca Reichert, Peter Strand Rumpel, Owen McMenemy-Brown', null, 'When estranged brothers Adam and Clint attempt to reconnect over a week-long hunting trip in remote British Columbia, they find the tables turned by a mysterious presence lurking in the forest. Convinced that they are now besieged by a supernatural presence, the siblings begrudgingly agree on only one thing: they will have to put aside their differences and work together if they plan on making it out these dark woods alive.', 'When estranged brothers Adam and Clint attempt to reconnect over a week-long hunting trip in remote British Columbia, they find the tables turned by a mysterious presence lurking in the forest. Convinced that they are now besieged by a supernatural presence, the siblings begrudgingly agree on only one thing: they will have to put aside their differences and work together if they plan on making it out these dark woods alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4w9FcFDVQLecmYZtfTUr8Qt31h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438734'),
  ('59667771971953232', 'Devil in the Flesh', 1947, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Michel Kelber, Ghislaine Autant-Lara', 'Jean Aurenche, Pierre Bost, Claude Autant-Lara', 'Micheline Presle, Gérard Philipe, Denise Grey, Jean Debucourt, Pierre Palau, Jean Lara, Michel François, Germaine Ledoyen', null, 'In France during World War I, Marthe waits for her husband, Jacques, while he fights on the front lines. Marthe then begins a tempestuous affair with 17-year-old François, with whom she had a dalliance before marrying Jacques. Jealous François struggles with the fact that Marthe is married, while she tries to prove her devotion to her young, hotheaded lover. Things become even more complex when Marthe becomes pregnant with Jacques'' baby.', 'In France during World War I, Marthe waits for her husband, Jacques, while he fights on the front lines. Marthe then begins a tempestuous affair with 17-year-old François, with whom she had a dalliance before marrying Jacques. Jealous François struggles with the fact that Marthe is married, while she tries to prove her devotion to her young, hotheaded lover. Things become even more complex when Marthe becomes pregnant with Jacques'' baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nEV9bIEnZsTNJlJ0bmSCksz4kY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63764'),
  ('1085709789588007704', 'Devil in the Flesh', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Giuseppe Lanci, Roberta Colombo, Marco Bellocchio', 'Marco Bellocchio, Ennio De Concini', 'Maruschka Detmers, Federico Pitzalis, Anita Laurenzi, Alberto Di Stasio, Riccardo De Torrebruna, Catherine Diamant, Anna Orso, Lidia Broccolino', 'R', 'An Italian high school student becomes infatuated with a woman he sees outside his class window. Her fiancée is in jail for being involved in a radical movement, and she spends much time in court providing moral support. At first she resists the student''s advances, but eventually begins an affair with him. Their situation is condemned by her family and his father, who is the woman''s psychologist.', 'An Italian high school student becomes infatuated with a woman he sees outside his class window. Her fiancée is in jail for being involved in a radical movement, and she spends much time in court providing moral support. At first she resists the student''s advances, but eventually begins an affair with him. Their situation is condemned by her family and his father, who is the woman''s psychologist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRmtwaElIXbOr1uWzG1TGETTlqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35705'),
  ('24941041177125763', 'Devil in the Flesh', 1998, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Steve Cohen, Joseph Montgomery, Marco Black', 'Steve Cohen, Kelly Carlin-McCall, Robert McCall', 'Rose McGowan, Alex McArthur, Phil Morris, Peg Shirley, Robert Silver, J.C. Brandy, Sherrie Rose, Ryan Bittle', 'R', 'When her mother is killed in a mysterious house fire, rebellious teen Debbie Strand is sent to live with her grandmother, where she becomes even more unhinged. She develops an intense crush on her hunky creative writing teacher, Peter Rinaldi, but her numerous attempts at seduction end in failure. Soon Peter''s friends start turning up dead, and he fears that his fiancée, Marilyn, may be Debbie''s next victim.', 'When her mother is killed in a mysterious house fire, rebellious teen Debbie Strand is sent to live with her grandmother, where she becomes even more unhinged. She develops an intense crush on her hunky creative writing teacher, Peter Rinaldi, but her numerous attempts at seduction end in failure. Soon Peter''s friends start turning up dead, and he fears that his fiancée, Marilyn, may be Debbie''s next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3RL5P2bPUkWskknJ50nklOkAuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45431'),
  ('494862993647273689', 'Devil in the Lake', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Han Ju-yeol, Park Chan-yun, Tak Se-woong', 'Tak Se-woong', 'Park Ha-na, Heo Jin, Jeong Young-ju, Oh Eun-Seo, Kim Joo-eun, Jeon Yeong, Goo Bon-Woong', null, 'Bo Young moves into the mansion of the previously wealthy grandmother, Wang, as a caregiver with a dangerous intention. Mother Kim, the only blood relative of Wang who hired Bo Young, sets conditions such as ''Do not bring anyone, especially children,'' and ''Do not go near the reservoir''. Ominous and bizarre signs continue in grandmother Wang''s huge mansion located next to a reservoir called ''Gwimot'', where people are dying, and Bo Young finds out that foreigners who have visited the place have suffered a mysterious death...', 'Bo Young moves into the mansion of the previously wealthy grandmother, Wang, as a caregiver with a dangerous intention. Mother Kim, the only blood relative of Wang who hired Bo Young, sets conditions such as ''Do not bring anyone, especially children,'' and ''Do not go near the reservoir''. Ominous and bizarre signs continue in grandmother Wang''s huge mansion located next to a reservoir called ''Gwimot'', where people are dying, and Bo Young finds out that foreigners who have visited the place have suffered a mysterious death...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPZVTYQfaoj4Hg0I44k688ovVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022072'),
  ('1106411195488134548', 'Devil May Hare', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'The Tasmanian Devil is on the loose. Bugs offers to help him find his dinner.', 'The Tasmanian Devil is on the loose. Bugs offers to help him find his dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oOGu62UYJucwCk2tfruZn05JUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83750'),
  ('1016645824628483478', 'Devil Seed', 2012, 'Horror', 'Gary Elmer, Greg A. Sager, Stephanie Beaune', 'Geoff Hart, Greg A. Sager', 'Michelle Argyris, Shantelle Canzanese, Vanessa Broze, Kevin Walker, Wayne Conroy, Michael G. Wilmot, Colin Smith', null, 'Alexandra is a lively college student returning to live with her roommates Jessica and Breanne after the summer holidays. After a night of drinking, Alex agrees to a psychic reading to learn about her future with her boyfriend, Brian, but during the reading a dramatic turn of events causes SOMETHING to go drastically wrong. When Alex awakes the next day, she cant remember the events of the night before. She begins to hear creepy noises, hallucinate, black out and receive unidentifiable scratch marks all over her body. Afraid shes going crazy, she seeks help from her friends but Jessica, Breanne and Brian are incapable of comprehending the scope of the darkness descending UPON her. Instead, Alex receives help from a school professor and his father who have dealt with the supernatural before. But as Alexs condition worsens, it becomes apparent that it may already be too late to stop the entity from using Alexs body as a gateway into our world.', 'Alexandra is a lively college student returning to live with her roommates Jessica and Breanne after the summer holidays. After a night of drinking, Alex agrees to a psychic reading to learn about her future with her boyfriend, Brian, but during the reading a dramatic turn of events causes SOMETHING to go drastically wrong. When Alex awakes the next day, she cant remember the events of the night before. She begins to hear creepy noises, hallucinate, black out and receive unidentifiable scratch marks all over her body. Afraid shes going crazy, she seeks help from her friends but Jessica, Breanne and Brian are incapable of comprehending the scope of the darkness descending UPON her. Instead, Alex receives help from a school professor and his father who have dealt with the supernatural before. But as Alexs condition worsens, it becomes apparent that it may already be too late to stop the entity from using Alexs body as a gateway into our world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjrDE4agtUL3xGEVAlN0SkCjbuk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119478'),
  ('563174389314058657', 'Devil Story', 1986, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Bernard Launois, Guy Maria', 'Bernard Launois', 'Véronique Renaud, Marcel Portier, Catherine Day, Christian Paumelle, Pascal Simon, Nicole Desailly, Bernard Launois', 'NR', 'After their car breaks down in the French countryside, a young couple must fend off a Nazi mutant and his gypsy mother, a mummy, and a possessed horse.', 'After their car breaks down in the French countryside, a young couple must fend off a Nazi mutant and his gypsy mother, a mummy, and a possessed horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEwHKyYappxvC7q5c2ryR9WQmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74081'),
  ('544367701869244136', 'Devil Times Five', 1974, 'Horror', 'Sean MacGregor, Paul Hipp, Michael Shea', 'John Durren, Sandra Lee Blowitz', 'Sorrell Booke, Gene Evans, Taylor Lacher, Joan McCall, Shelley Morrison, Carolyn Stellar, John Durren, Leif Garrett', 'R', 'Five extremely disturbed, sociopathic children escape from their psychiatric transport and are taken in unwittingly by a group of adult villagers on winter vacation.', 'Five extremely disturbed, sociopathic children escape from their psychiatric transport and are taken in unwittingly by a group of adult villagers on winter vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wccgiKXUAFxdCS2pPc9B6qq8uw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72648'),
  ('1125322751976277883', 'Devil Winds', 2003, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Gilbert M. Shilton, Brian Whittred', 'Ira Schwartz, Anthony L. Greene', 'Joe Lando, Nicole Eggert, Erica Durance, Peter Graham-Gaudreau, Garwin Sanford, Gerard Plunkett, Genevieve Buechner, Lauren K. Robek', 'PG', 'A brilliant meteorologist returns to his hometown in Oklahoma to try to stop the biggest tornado ever.', 'A brilliant meteorologist returns to his hometown in Oklahoma to try to stop the biggest tornado ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqqM62oMd3UYawnzzOyurdu9zAo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100028'),
  ('307281349944625854', 'Devil, My Friend', 1988, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Erdal Kahraman', 'Ümit Ünal, Atıf Yılmaz, Halit Refiğ', 'Mazhar Alanson, Ali Poyrazoğlu, Yaprak Özdemiroğlu, Deniz Türkali, Bülent Kayabaş, Tarık Papuççuoğlu, Özkan Uğur, Ayhan Sicimoğlu', null, 'Fatih is a musician who can never seem to get where he wants to be. One day, he sells his soul to the devil in exchange for fame. But over time, he realizes that people are worse and smarter than the devil.', 'Fatih is a musician who can never seem to get where he wants to be. One day, he sells his soul to the devil in exchange for fame. But over time, he realizes that people are worse and smarter than the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpLF0Gyh07E5RW7jmrRJHfDFyZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89324'),
  ('763952830798610027', 'Devil''s Angels', 1967, 'Action', 'Daniel Haller, Richard Moore', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'John Cassavetes, Beverly Adams, Mimsy Farmer, Maurice McEndree, Leo Gordon, Russ Bender, Marc Cavell, Buck Taylor', 'R', 'A gang of outlaw bikers strike a bargain with the Sheriff of a small beach town; let them stay and the town is safe. But a local girl strays into their lair and sets off a full-scale war.', 'A gang of outlaw bikers strike a bargain with the Sheriff of a small beach town; let them stay and the town is safe. But a local girl strays into their lair and sets off a full-scale war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzQ6GjExYVZ9ZfkrtjNaEFW96CD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90086'),
  ('532817601796431059', 'Devil''s Bride', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Saara Cantell, Konsta Sohlberg', 'Saara Cantell, Leena Virtanen', 'Tuulia Eloranta, Magnus Krepper, Elin Petersdottir, Claes Malmberg, Kaija Pakarinen, Antti Reini, Lauri Tanskanen, Maria Sid', null, 'Anna is a 16-year old in a village where women are accused of witchcraft. It''s based on the witch hunts on Åland, Finland in the 1600s.', 'Anna is a 16-year old in a village where women are accused of witchcraft. It''s based on the witch hunts on Åland, Finland in the 1600s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62E4iLpGZvxEwJAHQKK4Kfp0shz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408194'),
