  ('719676926888451800', 'Devil''s Daughter', 1946, 'Drama', 'Henri Decoin, Armand Thirard', 'Henri Decoin, Alex Joffé, Marc-Gilbert Sauvajon', 'Pierre Fresnay, Fernand Ledoux, Andrée Clément, Thérèse Dorny, Pierre Juvenet, Robert Seller, Paul Frankeur, Nicolas Amato', null, 'Pursued by the police, Saget usurps the identity of a man who was returning to his town after having made his fortune in the United States. Under this new name, he deceives his compatriots with the exception of a doctor and the savage Isabelle. During an explanation Saget understands that Isabelle secretly admires him. She denounces him and Saget surrenders without a fight. Thus he ruins all his prestige with the young Amazon.', 'Pursued by the police, Saget usurps the identity of a man who was returning to his town after having made his fortune in the United States. Under this new name, he deceives his compatriots with the exception of a doctor and the savage Isabelle. During an explanation Saget understands that Isabelle secretly admires him. She denounces him and Saget surrenders without a fight. Thus he ruins all his prestige with the young Amazon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vU5uaqtgsWRF5ofzLDdPv0pj2dm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67548'),
  ('131630709824389342', 'Devil''s Den', 2006, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Jeff Burr, Viorel Sergovici', 'Mitch Gould', 'Kelly Hu, Devon Sawa, Ken Foree, Steven Schub, Karen Maxwell, Dawn Olivieri, Ken Ohara, Melissa Barker', null, 'Quinn Taylor and his friend Nick are on their way back from Mexico with a load of Spanish Fly to sell in the States. They stop at a gentlemen''s club called The Devil''s Den and decide to test out their product on the unsuspecting women there. Only, these women aren''t really human, and the two men find themselves in a very fatal position. Also tossed in are a female-assassin on the hunt for Quinn, a monster hunter!', 'Quinn Taylor and his friend Nick are on their way back from Mexico with a load of Spanish Fly to sell in the States. They stop at a gentlemen''s club called The Devil''s Den and decide to test out their product on the unsuspecting women there. Only, these women aren''t really human, and the two men find themselves in a very fatal position. Also tossed in are a female-assassin on the hunt for Quinn, a monster hunter!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3bGF7BWlA6POS7okgB5V6J1Bz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28640'),
  ('53703649236823668', 'Devil''s Diary', 2007, 'Drama, Horror, TV Movie', 'Farhad Mann, Michael Balfry', 'John Benjamin Martin', 'Alexz Johnson, Miriam McDonald, Deanna Casaluce, Magda Apanowicz, Andrea Brooks, Tyler Boissonnault, Brian Krause, Laura Carswell', 'NR', 'When a group of small-town teenagers find the “Devil''s Diary,” a book that embodies the evil of Satan by physically manifesting any evil thought that is written in it, all hell breaks loose. Unearthed after centuries of concealment, the Devil''s Diary wreaks havoc and destruction on the high school students who found it, and their entire community. Can their town be saved from complete ruin?', 'When a group of small-town teenagers find the “Devil''s Diary,” a book that embodies the evil of Satan by physically manifesting any evil thought that is written in it, all hell breaks loose. Unearthed after centuries of concealment, the Devil''s Diary wreaks havoc and destruction on the high school students who found it, and their entire community. Can their town be saved from complete ruin?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHcPoeL0UZpF54mYP9EzxyMWjX6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37434'),
  ('831783206931179748', 'Devil''s Doorway', 1950, 'Western', 'John Alton, Anthony Mann, Ridgeway Callow', 'Guy Trosper', 'Robert Taylor, Louis Calhern, Paula Raymond, Marshall Thompson, James Mitchell, Edgar Buchanan, Rhys Williams, Spring Byington', null, 'A Native American Civil War hero returns home to fight for his people.', 'A Native American Civil War hero returns home to fight for his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v10XONu2NJ6MyGMMOJKgp2GJYEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34651'),
  ('737824127959981735', 'Devil''s Due', 2014, 'Horror', 'Tyler Gillett, Matt Bettinelli-Olpin, Justin Martinez', 'Lindsay Devlin', 'Zach Gilford, Allison Miller, Sam Anderson, Roger Payano, Vanessa Ray, Bill Martin Williams, Geraldine Singer, Julia Denton', 'R', 'An unexpected pregnancy takes a terrifying turn for newlyweds Zach and Samantha McCall.', 'An unexpected pregnancy takes a terrifying turn for newlyweds Zach and Samantha McCall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56zW5kl6b10UNIXpQZTUXV2iygC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79316'),
  ('362326185461651633', 'Devil''s Express', 1976, 'Horror, Action, Crime', 'Barry Rosen, Gary Moscato, Paul Glickman', 'Pascual Vaquer, CeOtis Robinson, Bobbi Sapperstein', 'Warhawk Tanzania, Larry Fleischman, Wilfredo Roldan, Elsie Roman, Stephen DeFazio, Theodore Gottlieb, Moses Lyllia, Tsikagi Tanzania', 'R', 'Luke and his friend Rodan take a break from the city streets to train in kung fu in China. Whilst there, Rodan steals an ancient amulet which prevents an evil spirit from leaving his tomb. The evil spirit, now free, possesses somebody and follows the pair back to New York City, where it lurks in the subways, killing and mutilating its victims. Can kung fu master Luke right Rodan''s wrong and put a stop to the killings?', 'Luke and his friend Rodan take a break from the city streets to train in kung fu in China. Whilst there, Rodan steals an ancient amulet which prevents an evil spirit from leaving his tomb. The evil spirit, now free, possesses somebody and follows the pair back to New York City, where it lurks in the subways, killing and mutilating its victims. Can kung fu master Luke right Rodan''s wrong and put a stop to the killings?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qAoEEbRyzlvr4DzrWrwW8qxVJ8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87369'),
  ('764684409299452089', 'Devil''s Feud Cake', 1963, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'PG', 'Another in a series of Warner''s economy cartoons featuring clips from previous Bugs Bunny-Yosemite Sam cartoons. After Sam is killed in each pursuit, he meets with the devil, who goads him into continuing to chase the bunny.', 'Another in a series of Warner''s economy cartoons featuring clips from previous Bugs Bunny-Yosemite Sam cartoons. After Sam is killed in each pursuit, he meets with the devil, who goads him into continuing to chase the bunny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHHskfYiaqfjgCEcvEaaLdZRSsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165853'),
  ('62384135420041722', 'Devil’s Freedom', 2017, 'Horror, Documentary', 'María Secco, Everardo González', 'Diego Enrique Osorno, Everardo González', null, null, 'Mexico, 2016. In some of the world''s most dangerous cities life is not worth much. Looking into the eyes of the protagonists of violence, victims as well as executioners, helps to understand how fear inserted itself in the subconscious of our society. Through a network of concrete stories, we are facing the most obscure traits of the human psyche, the frail balance between humanity and evil.', 'Mexico, 2016. In some of the world''s most dangerous cities life is not worth much. Looking into the eyes of the protagonists of violence, victims as well as executioners, helps to understand how fear inserted itself in the subconscious of our society. Through a network of concrete stories, we are facing the most obscure traits of the human psyche, the frail balance between humanity and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k481uAGMF2WxnfR5f8Xmtqlze0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387752'),
  ('1022718396159179414', 'Devil''s Gate', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Mirosław Baszak, Clay Staub', 'Peter Aperlo, Clay Staub', 'Milo Ventimiglia, Shawn Ashmore, Javier Botet, Amanda Schull, Bridget Regan, Jonathan Frakes, Sarah Constible, Jan Skene', null, 'Set in the small town of Devil''s Gate, North Dakota, the film examines the disappearance of a local woman and her young son. Schull plays an FBI agent who helps the local sheriff search for answers. Partnering with a deputy , they track down the missing woman''s husband and find that nothing is as it seems.', 'Set in the small town of Devil''s Gate, North Dakota, the film examines the disappearance of a local woman and her young son. Schull plays an FBI agent who helps the local sheriff search for answers. Partnering with a deputy , they track down the missing woman''s husband and find that nothing is as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t30xW4QF0MlFwiyVokwjZuZDRYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355193'),
  ('414034460336436432', 'Devil''s Island', 1939, 'Drama', 'William Clemens, George Barnes, Arthur Lueker', 'Kenneth Gamet, Don Ryan', 'Boris Karloff, Nedda Harrigan, James Stephenson, Adia Kuznetzoff, Rolla Gourvitch, Will Stanton, Edward Keane, Robert Warwick', null, 'A French doctor sentenced for treason performs brain surgery on the prison commandant''s daughter.', 'A French doctor sentenced for treason performs brain surgery on the prison commandant''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDEoEggNmvDQPxUov32a7JXOvjn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30306'),
  ('405971119584203407', 'Devil''s Island', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ari Kristinsson, Fridrik Thor Fridriksson', 'Einar Kárason', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Sigurveig Jónsdóttir, Gísli Halldórsson, Halldóra Geirharðsdóttir, Sveinn Þórir Geirsson, Saga Jónsdóttir, Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Geo von Krogh', null, 'Devil''s Island is a bitter sweet tale of Iceland in the fifties. Life is rough in Reykjavik''s post-war slum of Camp Thule, where the abandoned US military barracks have been turned into makeshift homes. Struggling wives and their hard-working husbands try to make ends meet. The younger generation dreams of dollars, Rock''n''Roll and the American way of life. To celebrate or to drown their misery - they''re never short of a good reason to booze. Devil''s Island vividly depicts the everyday life of a wacky family, their neighbours and friends and shows how some of their dreams come true and others don''t.', 'Devil''s Island is a bitter sweet tale of Iceland in the fifties. Life is rough in Reykjavik''s post-war slum of Camp Thule, where the abandoned US military barracks have been turned into makeshift homes. Struggling wives and their hard-working husbands try to make ends meet. The younger generation dreams of dollars, Rock''n''Roll and the American way of life. To celebrate or to drown their misery - they''re never short of a good reason to booze. Devil''s Island vividly depicts the everyday life of a wacky family, their neighbours and friends and shows how some of their dreams come true and others don''t.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7z4ZGmhkfEGH0lphI3f9RoKEcLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42770'),
  ('122288755297306729', 'Devil''s Island', 2021, 'Horror', 'Sean King, Taylor King', null, 'Elle Alexander, Kristjan Sokoli, Danielle Jean Schaefer, Cliff Yates, Pete Berwick, Alba Yates', null, 'A young woman inherits a small island in New York and discovers it has a dangerous history.', 'A young woman inherits a small island in New York and discovers it has a dangerous history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVamYkW77fGAv2GyFiGYehqj5Ne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838594'),
