  ('984129516260874298', 'Diablo', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Ernesto Díaz Espinoza, Niccolo De La Fere', 'Mat Sansom', 'Scott Adkins, Marko Zaror, Alanna de la Rossa, Lucho Velasco, Diana Hoyos, María del Rosario, Jason Gurvitz, Jaime Correa', 'R', 'Ex-con Kris Chaney seizes the daughter of a Colombian gangster to fulfill a noble promise to the young girl''s mother. When her father enlists both the criminal underworld and a psychotic killer to exact his revenge, Kris relies on everything he''s ever learned to stay alive and keep his word.', 'Ex-con Kris Chaney seizes the daughter of a Colombian gangster to fulfill a noble promise to the young girl''s mother. When her father enlists both the criminal underworld and a psychotic killer to exact his revenge, Kris relies on everything he''s ever learned to stay alive and keep his word.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFQduVyYIinJy3eLjozgfl6Xtcn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127110'),
  ('410287305967039301', 'Diablo Rojo PTY', 2019, 'Horror', 'Sol Moreno, J. Oskura Nájera, Sebastian Touma', 'J. Oskura Nájera, Adair Dominguez', 'Carlos Carrasco, Leo Wiznitzer, Alejandra Araúz, Natalia Beluche, Renan Fernandez, Julian Urriola, Blas Valois, Simón Tejeira Healy', null, 'A "Diablo Rojo" bus driver, his helper, a priest, and two policemen fall victim to a mysterious spell and end up lost somewhere in the Chiriqui jungle, where they will have to survive the creatures that inhabit the roads, with the old bus as their only refuge.', 'A "Diablo Rojo" bus driver, his helper, a priest, and two policemen fall victim to a mysterious spell and end up lost somewhere in the Chiriqui jungle, where they will have to survive the creatures that inhabit the roads, with the old bus as their only refuge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYgq77bQd1pe8y7GxUtQvuFidYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639698'),
