  ('747059348910052224', 'Diabolic', 2025, 'Horror', 'Daniel J. Phillips, Michael Tessari', 'Daniel J. Phillips, Mike Harding', 'Elizabeth Cullen, John Harlan Kim, Mia Challis, Genevieve Mooy, Robin Goldsworthy', 'NR', 'A woman''s hope for a miracle cure turns into a nightmare when she confronts the vengeful spirit of a cursed witch, determined to claim her as a vessel for her evil power.', 'A woman''s hope for a miracle cure turns into a nightmare when she confronts the vengeful spirit of a cursed witch, determined to claim her as a vessel for her evil power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qikoc12LQH6upkLZZlJY8wEZvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1375831'),
  ('645664043898570295', 'Diabolical Inheritance', 1994, 'Horror', 'Alfredo Salazar', 'Alfredo Salazar, Guillermo Séguin', 'Lorena Herrera, Roberto Guinar, Holda Ramírez, Alan Fernando, Margarito Esparza Nevare, Raquel Loza, Fernando González, Rosa Corona', null, 'When Tony, a successful businessman, receives a call informing him that he has inherited his late aunt''s vast estate, he uproots himself and his wife, Annie, from New York to Mexico City. While adjusting to and exploring their new gothic home, Tony and Annie come upon a mysterious clown doll. Although merely unnerved by the doll’s strange appearance at first, Annie soon becomes concerned as it begins turning up out of nowhere in every corner of the house. When a series of fatal ''accidents’ occur on or near the couple’s property, with the doll always at the scene, Tony and Annie come to the terrifying realization that a sinister force has possessed it, and begin a race against time to figure out how to bring the carnage to an end!', 'When Tony, a successful businessman, receives a call informing him that he has inherited his late aunt''s vast estate, he uproots himself and his wife, Annie, from New York to Mexico City. While adjusting to and exploring their new gothic home, Tony and Annie come upon a mysterious clown doll. Although merely unnerved by the doll’s strange appearance at first, Annie soon becomes concerned as it begins turning up out of nowhere in every corner of the house. When a series of fatal ''accidents’ occur on or near the couple’s property, with the doll always at the scene, Tony and Annie come to the terrifying realization that a sinister force has possessed it, and begin a race against time to figure out how to bring the carnage to an end!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xoaBv0Z9bG0YiNKWACDUm6DV0HY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161366'),
  ('33574827951420457', 'Diabolical Narco Satanists', 1991, 'Horror, Comedy', 'José Juan Munguía', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Adolfo Martínez Solares', 'Roberto ''El Flaco'' Guzmán, Alfonso Zayas, Lina Santos, Roberto Ballesteros, Jeannette Mass, Jacaranda Alfaro, Rosario Escobar, César Bono', null, 'Roberto makes a pact with the devil to please his multiple lovers sexually, Satan accepts the deal but promises to snatch his soul when he finds true love. Meanwhile, two cops are on the lookout for those responsible of a murderous drug on the streets.', 'Roberto makes a pact with the devil to please his multiple lovers sexually, Satan accepts the deal but promises to snatch his soul when he finds true love. Meanwhile, two cops are on the lookout for those responsible of a murderous drug on the streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2FYGsJPJWLnsnzI3wHO6vQP7LM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464805'),
  ('881772859220596425', 'Diabolical: The Epstein Files', 2026, 'Documentary, Crime, Drama', 'Justin Stevens', 'Grace Tobin', 'Marjorie Taylor Greene, Thomas Massie, Ro Khanna, David Schoen, Mark Epstein', null, 'It''s the scandal that has shocked Americans and rocked the Trump administration. A legal and political saga that has shattered fundamental beliefs that all are equal in the eyes of the law. What do the Epstein Files reveal?', 'It''s the scandal that has shocked Americans and rocked the Trump administration. A legal and political saga that has shattered fundamental beliefs that all are equal in the eyes of the law. What do the Epstein Files reveal?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwFXoZsIqEZPpJgdDlJdFFzWplhk.jpg', 'plex:movie:diabolical-the-epstein-files'),
  ('17651513561595966', 'Diabolically Yours', 1967, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Julien Duvivier, Henri Decaë', 'Jean Bolvary, Julien Duvivier, Roland Girard', 'Alain Delon, Senta Berger, Sergio Fantoni, Claude Piéplu, Peter Mosbacher, Albert Augier, Renate Birgo, Georges Montant', 'G', 'A wealthy amnesiac begins to suspect that his devoted wife is not really his wife and that he is not the man people keep telling him he is.', 'A wealthy amnesiac begins to suspect that his devoted wife is not really his wife and that he is not the man people keep telling him he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9PsKtjPll2IynyfmZGtH1MiIFt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42690'),
  ('354984086190566977', 'Diabolik', 2021, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Vincenzo Mineo, Marco Manetti, Antonio Manetti', 'Michelangelo La Neve, Antonio Manetti, Marco Manetti', 'Luca Marinelli, Miriam Leone, Valerio Mastandrea, Alessandro Roja, Serena Rossi, Luca Di Giovanni, Vanessa Scalera, Roberto Citran', null, '1960s, the city of Clerville. The forthcoming visit of heiress Eva Kant, who''ll be bringing a famous pink diamond with her, catches the attention of Diabolik, the infallible and elusive thief whose real identity is unknown: while trying to steal the jewel, he finds himself bewitched by Eva''s charm, a feeling she may be reciprocating. But the police, led by relentless Inspector Ginko, is rapidly closing in on him...', '1960s, the city of Clerville. The forthcoming visit of heiress Eva Kant, who''ll be bringing a famous pink diamond with her, catches the attention of Diabolik, the infallible and elusive thief whose real identity is unknown: while trying to steal the jewel, he finds himself bewitched by Eva''s charm, a feeling she may be reciprocating. But the police, led by relentless Inspector Ginko, is rapidly closing in on him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9bOwV2V9r6LikmKHMDgmu9jcE92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593395'),
