  ('1110896428922678331', 'Diamond 13', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Gilles Béhat, Bernard Malaisy', 'Gilles Béhat, Olivier Marchal', 'Gérard Depardieu, Olivier Marchal, Asia Argento, Anne Coesens, Aïssa Maïga, Catherine Marchal, Jean-Michel Vovk, Erick Deshors', null, 'A cop goes up against his lifelong friend, who has become one of the city''s biggest drug traffickers.', 'A cop goes up against his lifelong friend, who has become one of the city''s biggest drug traffickers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDq4dbbWCKaJWZyPlJsc9hfDVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31172'),
  ('966571838316822574', 'Diamond Dogs', 2007, 'Action', 'Samuel Dolhasca, Bing Rao', 'Léopold St-Pierre', 'Dolph Lundgren, Xue Zuren, William Shriver, Raicho Vasilev, Nuoming Huari, Yu Nan, Slavi Slavov, Zhang Chunnian', 'R', 'An ex-Special Forces officer agrees to lead an obsessed fortune hunter and his men on a dangerous quest for a legendary relic, the Tangka Tapestry. But great dangers await from a gang of ruthless Russian mercenaries bent on stealing the fabled treasure and also from a deadly curse said to protect the incredibly valuable relic from tomb raiders.', 'An ex-Special Forces officer agrees to lead an obsessed fortune hunter and his men on a dangerous quest for a legendary relic, the Tangka Tapestry. But great dangers await from a gang of ruthless Russian mercenaries bent on stealing the fabled treasure and also from a deadly curse said to protect the incredibly valuable relic from tomb raiders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVYgVZx0KTEn8Tbzzn9tuW7cteD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15791'),
  ('417743279580136583', 'Diamond Dust', 2018, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Marwan Hamed, Hasan Amin', 'Ahmed Mourad', 'Asser Yassin, Menna Shalabi, Maged El Kedwany, Mohamed Mamdouh, Ahmed Kamal, Eyad Nassar, Ezzat Al Alaily, Adel Karam', null, 'Taha works as a pharmacist and lives a normal life with his disabled father. When a mysterious murder occurs, Taha''s world changes forever. He starts tracking down many secrets that leads him to unlocks a whole melancholic world of crime!', 'Taha works as a pharmacist and lives a normal life with his disabled father. When a mysterious murder occurs, Taha''s world changes forever. He starts tracking down many secrets that leads him to unlocks a whole melancholic world of crime!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAaszSEwhgERJLdg8Ppm4qSwagn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515224'),
  ('749945816674965618', 'Diamond Flash', 2012, 'Drama, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Carlos Vermut', 'Carlos Vermut', 'Eva Llorach, Ángela Villar, Rocío León, Ángela Boix, Victoria Radonic, Miquel Insúa, Klaus, Javier Botet', null, 'Violeta is willing to do anything to find her missing kid. Elena keeps a strange secret. Lola wants to settle her debts with the past. Juana needs someone who loves her unconditionally and Enriqueta just looks for someone who makes her laugh. These five women have something in common, all of them are linked to Diamond Flash, a mysterious character who will change their lives forever.', 'Violeta is willing to do anything to find her missing kid. Elena keeps a strange secret. Lola wants to settle her debts with the past. Juana needs someone who loves her unconditionally and Enriqueta just looks for someone who makes her laugh. These five women have something in common, all of them are linked to Diamond Flash, a mysterious character who will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koA0iEyjgRg0nMXmiT7nEOF8MdY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136986'),
  ('977963195608367578', 'Diamond Girl', 1998, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Timothy Bond, Buster Reynolds, Diana Keam', 'Charles Lazer, Diana Palmer', 'Jonathan Cake, Joely Collins, Kevin Otto, Royston Stoffels, Stacey Sacks, Blair Slater, Dyan Cannon, Paddy Canavan', null, 'Denny Montana never looks at Claire. She has been working for him for four years and fallen in love at a distance. When Denny''s brother Regan returns to oversee the sale of the family vineyard, Claire and Reganen makes pact. To make Denny jealous and lure him away from his girlfriend''s bad influence. But what Claire and Regan did not take into account was how difficult it can be to control their own emotions.', 'Denny Montana never looks at Claire. She has been working for him for four years and fallen in love at a distance. When Denny''s brother Regan returns to oversee the sale of the family vineyard, Claire and Reganen makes pact. To make Denny jealous and lure him away from his girlfriend''s bad influence. But what Claire and Regan did not take into account was how difficult it can be to control their own emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awumt0NW0qXwnBduEXyfq3fDKZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211331'),
  ('513975222214944275', 'Diamond Head', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Guy Green, Sam Leavitt', 'Marguerite Roberts', 'Charlton Heston, Yvette Mimieux, George Chakiris, France Nuyen, James Darren, Aline MacMahon, Elizabeth Allen, Vaughn Taylor', 'NR', 'Rich Hawaiian pineapple grower and US Senatorial candidate Richard Howland tries to control everything and everyone around him, including his headstrong sister, Slone.', 'Rich Hawaiian pineapple grower and US Senatorial candidate Richard Howland tries to control everything and everyone around him, including his headstrong sister, Slone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oCUrf9A50YyshnGx7uHX7wDik8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119052'),
  ('874706965439805573', 'Diamond Island', 2016, 'Drama', 'Davy Chou, Thomas Favel', 'Davy Chou, Claire Maugendre', 'Sobon Nuon, Cheanick Nov, Madeza Chhem, Mean Korn, Samnang Nut, Samnang Khim, Sophyna Meng, Jany Min', null, 'Bora, an 18-year-old, leaves his village to work on the construction sites of Diamond Island, a project for an ultra-modern paradise for the rich and a symbol of tomorrow’s Cambodia. He befriends his fellow workers and finds his elder brother, the charismatic Solei, who went missing five years earlier. Solei introduces him into an exciting world, that of an urban and wealthy youth, its girls, nights and illusions.', 'Bora, an 18-year-old, leaves his village to work on the construction sites of Diamond Island, a project for an ultra-modern paradise for the rich and a symbol of tomorrow’s Cambodia. He befriends his fellow workers and finds his elder brother, the charismatic Solei, who went missing five years earlier. Solei introduces him into an exciting world, that of an urban and wealthy youth, its girls, nights and illusions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omddqT2zjDZNhn5OCiHsK1Mt4lG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396253'),
