  ('388656284643173733', 'Diamonds of the Night', 1964, 'Drama, War', 'Hynek Bočan, Jan Němec, Jaroslav Kučera', 'Arnošt Lustig, Jan Němec', 'Ladislav Janský, Antonín Kumbera, Ilse Bischofová, Jan Říha, Ivan Asič, August Bischof, Josef Koggel, Oskar Müller', null, 'Two Jewish boys escape from a train transporting them from one concentration camp to another. Beyond themes of war and anti-Nazism, the film concerns itself with man''s struggle to preserve human dignity.', 'Two Jewish boys escape from a train transporting them from one concentration camp to another. Beyond themes of war and anti-Nazism, the film concerns itself with man''s struggle to preserve human dignity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djBsRTj1BlXCHDAQRAa2lkvxTMY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100589'),
