  ('873652534156954231', 'Diana', 2018, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Alejo Moreno, Irene Cruz, Víctor Quintanilla', 'Alejo Moreno', 'Ana Rujas, Jorge Roldán, Laura Ledesma, Cayetana Cabezas, Lucio Romero, Moisés Rodríguez', null, 'Madrid, Spain. The bedroom of Sofía, a luxury escort. Her new client, who has introduced himself as Hugo and appears to be an educated businessman, discovers that she has a name tattooed on her leg: Diana. Hugo cannot help asking her who Diana is.', 'Madrid, Spain. The bedroom of Sofía, a luxury escort. Her new client, who has introduced himself as Hugo and appears to be an educated businessman, discovers that she has a name tattooed on her leg: Diana. Hugo cannot help asking her who Diana is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sC15nLESFDfe2YUGkXMx3sGwy3T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:526795'),
  ('568006298324400936', 'Diana: In Her Own Words', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Tom Jennings', 'David Tillman, Tom Jennings', 'Diana, Princess of Wales, King Charles III of the United Kingdom, Camilla Shand, Frances Shand Kydd, Elizabeth II of the United Kingdom, Prince Harry, Duke of Sussex, William, Prince of Wales, Grace Kelly', null, 'Using home videos recorded by her voice coach, Diana takes us through the story of her life.', 'Using home videos recorded by her voice coach, Diana takes us through the story of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AvP1lvt8lZemhsdQ71Y0cwwaB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469980'),
  ('87953451341399771', 'Diana: The Musical', 2021, 'History, Romance, Drama', 'Declan Quinn, Kyler Griffin, Robert B. Jackson', 'David Bryan, Joe DiPietro', 'Jeanna De Waal, Roe Hartrampf, Erin Davie, Judy Kaye, Zach Adkins, Tessa Alves, Ashley Andrews, Austen Danielle Bohmer', 'PG-13', 'A princess is thrust onto the world stage. The tabloid media is captivated by her beauty and vulnerability. The globe''s most celebrated monarchy is disrupted. This is the story of the most princess woman of the modern age as she struggles to endure a spotlight brighter than any the world had ever known.', 'A princess is thrust onto the world stage. The tabloid media is captivated by her beauty and vulnerability. The globe''s most celebrated monarchy is disrupted. This is the story of the most princess woman of the modern age as she struggles to endure a spotlight brighter than any the world had ever known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpMTlCDyDJptBQg935Q9LzaB9j8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732305'),
