  ('469971198286317632', 'Diary', 1983, 'Documentary', 'David Perlov', 'David Perlov, Nathan Zach', 'David Perlov, Mira Perlov, Yael Perlov, Neomi Perlov, Klaus Kinski', null, 'A film diary in which Perlov films the minutiae of his and his family''s day-to-day life. From these small bits, he builds up a broad picture of life in Israel in the ''70s and ''80s.', 'A film diary in which Perlov films the minutiae of his and his family''s day-to-day life. From these small bits, he builds up a broad picture of life in Israel in the ''70s and ''80s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekUTgar8TzJyUquGEWVyX1m5RpG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44394'),
  ('866020465460750025', 'Diary', 2006, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Anuchit Chotrattanasiri, Jil Wong Pak-Kei', 'Pang Pak-Sing, Oxide Pang Chun', 'Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Isabella Leong Lok-Sze, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Au Hin-Wai', null, 'Winnie Leung becomes more disturbed and depressed after her boyfriend Seth Lau breaks up with her and she turns schizophrenic - imagining events which never occurred, and often living in her own world- until one day she meets a guy named Ray, bearing a close resemblance to Seth. Seeing this, her best friend Yvonne encourages her to go out with Hou so she can forget her misery and start over. As time passes, Winnie realises that the relationship with Ray is so alike her previous relationship with Seth, and when things seem to be running smoothly, the relationship begins to sours, just like with Seth. She begins to doubt his feelings and the lines between reality and fantasy start blurring again for her, leading her to question: did this all exist in the first place?', 'Winnie Leung becomes more disturbed and depressed after her boyfriend Seth Lau breaks up with her and she turns schizophrenic - imagining events which never occurred, and often living in her own world- until one day she meets a guy named Ray, bearing a close resemblance to Seth. Seeing this, her best friend Yvonne encourages her to go out with Hou so she can forget her misery and start over. As time passes, Winnie realises that the relationship with Ray is so alike her previous relationship with Seth, and when things seem to be running smoothly, the relationship begins to sours, just like with Seth. She begins to doubt his feelings and the lines between reality and fantasy start blurring again for her, leading her to question: did this all exist in the first place?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckdO48tEcCqeohkglioyYnDcgyy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50342'),
  ('873633674090714326', 'Diary for My Children', 1984, 'Drama', 'Márta Mészáros, Nyika Jancsó', 'Márta Mészáros', 'Czinkóczi Zsuzsa, Anna Polony, Földi Teri, Jan Nowicki, Sándor Oszter, Pál Zolnay, Vilmos Kun, Mari Szemes', null, 'After having lost her parents, young Juli returns from the Soviet Union to her native Budapest. Scarred by the wounds of the past, the ghost of Stalin’s oppression haunts her as she reunites with her aunt and adoptive mother Magda.', 'After having lost her parents, young Juli returns from the Soviet Union to her native Budapest. Scarred by the wounds of the past, the ghost of Stalin’s oppression haunts her as she reunites with her aunt and adoptive mother Magda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Hvy8UNr1AH7OZFuUgx33GddDTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84946'),
  ('360208222752697028', 'Diary for My Loves', 1987, 'Drama', 'Nyika Jancsó, Márta Mészáros', 'Márta Mészáros, Éva Pataki', 'Czinkóczi Zsuzsa, Anna Polony, Jan Nowicki, Ágnes Csere, Mária Ronyecz, Tamás Végvári, Pál Zolnay, Mari Szemes', null, 'A continuation of "Diary for My Children," the film picks up in 1950, when Juli, the diarist, is 18 and determined to become a movie director.', 'A continuation of "Diary for My Children," the film picks up in 1950, when Juli, the diarist, is 18 and determined to become a movie director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2PqimifLw8PPESYzP4710PlSto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131339'),
  ('727060211957969066', 'Diary ng Panget', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Andoy Ranay, Pao Orendain', 'Mel Mendoza-Del Rosario', 'Nadine Lustre, James Reid, Andre Paras, Yassi Pressman, Gabby Concepcion, Mitch Valdez, Candy Pangilinan, Aj Muhlach', null, 'A young woman takes a job as a personal maid for a rich young man. The pair do not get along, but soon due to their classmates'' games of love, their relationship grows more complicated than before.', 'A young woman takes a job as a personal maid for a rich young man. The pair do not get along, but soon due to their classmates'' games of love, their relationship grows more complicated than before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72rfGIyU81PZY4fKvnUTMWCgOGz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269660'),
  ('679279393404881970', 'Diary of a Big Man', 1988, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Chor Yuen, File Ip Kwok-Wing, Lee San-Yip', 'Philip Cheng Chung-Tai, Ng Man-Fai', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Joey Wong, Sally Yeh, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Carrie Ng Ka-Lai, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, David Wu, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling', null, 'A two-timing bigamist finds himself concocting scheme after scheme with his best friend, Chi Hung, to prevent either of his wives from discovering his bigamy. The unwanted intervention of a police officer as well as a series of unfortunate events lead to the wives discovery of the whole plot. They team up with Chi Hung''s exasperated fiancée, Ka Lai, to exact revenge upon the two men.', 'A two-timing bigamist finds himself concocting scheme after scheme with his best friend, Chi Hung, to prevent either of his wives from discovering his bigamy. The unwanted intervention of a police officer as well as a series of unfortunate events lead to the wives discovery of the whole plot. They team up with Chi Hung''s exasperated fiancée, Ka Lai, to exact revenge upon the two men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zR7be5DAVdo5xcCb7emDGMEGhRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157200'),
  ('332634359563931476', 'Diary of a Chambermaid', 1964, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Luis Buñuel, Roger Fellous, Pierre Lary', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Luis Buñuel', 'Jeanne Moreau, Georges Géret, Michel Piccoli, Françoise Lugagne, Jean Ozenne, Daniel Ivernel, Bernard Musson, Gilberte Géniat', null, 'Celestine has a new job as a chambermaid for the quirky M. Monteil, his wife and her father. When the father dies, Celestine decides to quit her job and leave, but when a young girl is raped and murdered, Celestine believes that the Monteils'' groundskeeper, Joseph, is guilty, and stays on in order to prove it. She uses her sexuality and the promise of marriage to get Joseph to confess -- but things do not go as planned.', 'Celestine has a new job as a chambermaid for the quirky M. Monteil, his wife and her father. When the father dies, Celestine decides to quit her job and leave, but when a young girl is raped and murdered, Celestine believes that the Monteils'' groundskeeper, Joseph, is guilty, and stays on in order to prove it. She uses her sexuality and the promise of marriage to get Joseph to confess -- but things do not go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epCJe5dzAn21mQ9L1fQ2FjIF13T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36245'),
  ('463483875415152714', 'Diary of a Chambermaid', 2015, 'Drama', 'Benoît Jacquot, Romain Winding', 'Hélène Zimmer, Benoît Jacquot', 'Léa Seydoux, Vincent Lindon, Clotilde Mollet, Hervé Pierre, Mélodie Valemberg, Patrick d''Assumçao, Vincent Lacoste, Joséphine Derenne', null, 'In the late 19th century, a chambermaid from Paris relocates to a remote household in Provence, engages in trysts and finds herself enraptured with a coach driver.', 'In the late 19th century, a chambermaid from Paris relocates to a remote household in Provence, engages in trysts and finds herself enraptured with a coach driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imQp5gncyqgwWygmD4lWDmBrBIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320003'),
  ('646612499738255233', 'Diary of a Country Priest', 1951, 'Drama', 'Robert Bresson, Léonce-Henri Burel, Guy Lefranc', 'Robert Bresson', 'Claude Laydu, Jean Riveyre, Adrien Borel, Rachel Bérendt, Nicole Maurey, Nicole Ladmiral, Martine Lemaire, Antoine Balpêtré', 'NR', 'An inexperienced, sickly priest shows up in the rural French community of Ambricourt, where he joins the community''s clergy. But the locals don''t take kindly to the priest, and his ascetic ways and unsociable demeanor make him an outcast. During Bible studies at the nearby girls school, he is continually mocked by his students. Then his attempt to intervene in a family feud backfires into a scandal. His failures, compounded with his declining health, begin to erode his faith.', 'An inexperienced, sickly priest shows up in the rural French community of Ambricourt, where he joins the community''s clergy. But the locals don''t take kindly to the priest, and his ascetic ways and unsociable demeanor make him an outcast. During Bible studies at the nearby girls school, he is continually mocked by his students. Then his attempt to intervene in a family feud backfires into a scandal. His failures, compounded with his declining health, begin to erode his faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mft7ZJqHxUyFaLL3ZYXX1MN2Gro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43376'),
  ('640644130922091144', 'Diary of a Fleeting Affair', 2022, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Laurent Desmet, Sophia Daverdon, Bénédicte Dujardin', 'Pierre Giraud, Emmanuel Mouret, Emmanuel Mouret', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Vincent Macaigne, Georgia Scalliet, Maxence Tual, Stéphane Mercoyrol', null, 'A single mother and a married man enter into an affair with the understanding that their relationship is purely sexual. Though they agree the relationship has no future, they find themselves increasingly drawn into each other''s company.', 'A single mother and a married man enter into an affair with the understanding that their relationship is purely sexual. Though they agree the relationship has no future, they find themselves increasingly drawn into each other''s company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5SW32l5I8COLOpqPjBMN9h92LC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:794842'),
  ('898657533761254469', 'Diary of a Hitman', 1991, 'Crime', 'Roy London, Yuri Sokol', 'Kenneth Pressman', 'Forest Whitaker, Sherilyn Fenn, Sharon Stone, Seymour Cassel, Jim Belushi, Peter White, Lois Chiles, John Bedford Lloyd', 'R', 'A veteran hitman, Dekker is ready to call it quits and leave the profession. His final job, however, proves to be trickier than expected when a sadistic man recruits the assassin to kill his wife, Jain, and their baby, but he can’t bring himself to do the job, complicating all of their lives.', 'A veteran hitman, Dekker is ready to call it quits and leave the profession. His final job, however, proves to be trickier than expected when a sadistic man recruits the assassin to kill his wife, Jain, and their baby, but he can’t bring himself to do the job, complicating all of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rF4Qz69ConQqoedsAtiv38O7UX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50185'),
  ('883175053276343303', 'Diary of a Lost Girl', 1929, 'Drama', 'Sepp Allgeier, G.W. Pabst, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Rudolf Leonhardt', 'Louise Brooks, André Roanne, Josef Rovenský, Fritz Rasp, Vera Pawlowa, Franziska Kinz, Arnold Korff, Andrews Engelmann', 'NR', 'Thymian Henning, an innocent young girl, is raped by the clerk of her father''s pharmacy. She becomes pregnant, is rejected by her family, and must fend for herself in a harsh, cruel world.', 'Thymian Henning, an innocent young girl, is raped by the clerk of her father''s pharmacy. She becomes pregnant, is rejected by her family, and must fend for herself in a harsh, cruel world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDR1Tt2pFR0M3gUFCJ1w2oiVYlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42637'),
  ('850878416926851601', 'Diary of a Mad Black Woman', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Darren Grant, David Claessen, Roger Lee', 'Tyler Perry', 'Kimberly Elise, Steve Harris, Tyler Perry, Shemar Moore, Lisa Marcos, Tamara Taylor, Cicely Tyson, Terrell Carter', 'PG-13', 'Charles, an attorney, and Helen, his devoted wife, seem to have everything – money, a beautiful mansion – the American Dream. However, as Helen prepares to celebrate their 18th wedding anniversary, her life takes an unexpected twist when she comes home to find her clothes packed up in a U-Haul van parked in the driveway. Charles is divorcing her and kicks her out. Helen moves in with her grandmother Madea, an old woman who doesn''t take any lip from anyone. Madea helps Helen through these tough times by showing her what is really important in life. Helen is forced to rediscover love, life, and religion in her pursuit for happiness.', 'Charles, an attorney, and Helen, his devoted wife, seem to have everything – money, a beautiful mansion – the American Dream. However, as Helen prepares to celebrate their 18th wedding anniversary, her life takes an unexpected twist when she comes home to find her clothes packed up in a U-Haul van parked in the driveway. Charles is divorcing her and kicks her out. Helen moves in with her grandmother Madea, an old woman who doesn''t take any lip from anyone. Madea helps Helen through these tough times by showing her what is really important in life. Helen is forced to rediscover love, life, and religion in her pursuit for happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4w36ckDhsWFPD9XaHOOJb1ru7JZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16186'),
  ('1067122047621027285', 'Diary of a Mad Housewife', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Frank Perry, Gerald Hirschfeld', 'Eleanor Perry', 'Carrie Snodgress, Richard Benjamin, Frank Langella, Lorraine Cullen, Frannie Michel, Lee Addoms, Peter Dohanos, Katherine Meskill', 'R', 'Tina Balser is a bored New York housewife-mother married to Jonathan, a pompous, social-climbing lawyer who ridicules her in front of their children, criticizing everything she does or wears. She begins an affair with George Prager, a dashing, successful, and blatantly sadistic writer.', 'Tina Balser is a bored New York housewife-mother married to Jonathan, a pompous, social-climbing lawyer who ridicules her in front of their children, criticizing everything she does or wears. She begins an affair with George Prager, a dashing, successful, and blatantly sadistic writer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loZFqYvqqzAhehLcbZq6djNo0JA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31677'),
  ('910268546617331132', 'Diary of a Madman', 1963, 'Horror', 'Reginald Le Borg, Ellis W. Carter, Al Westen', 'Robert E. Kent', 'Vincent Price, Nancy Kovack, Chris Warfield, Elaine Devry, Ian Wolfe, Stephen Roberts, Lewis Martin, Mary Adams', 'PG', 'Simon Cordier, a French magistrate and amateur sculptor comes into contact with a malevolent entity. The invisible - yet corporeal - being, called a "horla" is capable of limited psychokinesis and complete mind control.', 'Simon Cordier, a French magistrate and amateur sculptor comes into contact with a malevolent entity. The invisible - yet corporeal - being, called a "horla" is capable of limited psychokinesis and complete mind control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvsJcPEghB6YhG06FMYjtkoMCfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29060'),
  ('781213817035573449', 'Diary of a Maniac', 1993, 'Drama', 'Marco Ferreri', 'Marco Ferreri, Liliana Betti', 'Jerry Calà, Sabrina Ferilli, Valentino Macchi, Laetitia Laneri, Massimo Bucchi, Piero Nicosia, Cinzia Monreale, Lucianna De Falco', null, 'In this stylish and offbeat black comedy, Benito ( Jerry Calà) keeps a diary of his sexual fantasies and cravings. As a result of his on-again, off-again relationship with the beautiful and insatiable Luigia (Sabrina Ferilli), his thoughts along these lines have grown increasingly bizarre. For his own part, he is driven to pick up and bed women at almost every opportunity. As the fantasies recorded in his diary consume more and more of his life, and grow darker and darker, his ordinary waking life becomes flatter and duller, until he disappears altogether.', 'In this stylish and offbeat black comedy, Benito ( Jerry Calà) keeps a diary of his sexual fantasies and cravings. As a result of his on-again, off-again relationship with the beautiful and insatiable Luigia (Sabrina Ferilli), his thoughts along these lines have grown increasingly bizarre. For his own part, he is driven to pick up and bed women at almost every opportunity. As the fantasies recorded in his diary consume more and more of his life, and grow darker and darker, his ordinary waking life becomes flatter and duller, until he disappears altogether.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDe1VJ8XEMIpa2tGhJGzJaJHeq1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196979'),
  ('663777728585281969', 'Diary of a Nudist', 1961, 'Drama', 'Doris Wishman, Raymond Phelan', 'Doris Wishman', 'Davee Decker, Norman Casserly, Dolores Carlos, Allan Blacker, Joan Bamford, Maria Stinger, Harry W. Stinger, Brigitte Bernard', null, 'Arthur Sherwood is on a hunting trip when he stumbles upon a nudist camp. Horrified, the prudish newspaper editor sends female reporter Stacy to write an exposé. However, much to her surprise, Stacy loves the free-spirited lifestyle and writes positively of her experience. The dissatisfied Arthur joins the camp himself to write his own story.', 'Arthur Sherwood is on a hunting trip when he stumbles upon a nudist camp. Horrified, the prudish newspaper editor sends female reporter Stacy to write an exposé. However, much to her surprise, Stacy loves the free-spirited lifestyle and writes positively of her experience. The dissatisfied Arthur joins the camp himself to write his own story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMXPq4JsJLfDzyNcoudObnlDb8r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60991'),
  ('153930809630777626', 'Diary of a Nymphomaniac', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christian Molina, Carla Pérez de Albéniz', 'Cristiana Farina, Luca Guadagnino, Barbara Alberti', 'Belén Fabra, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Llum Barrera, Geraldine Chaplin, Ángela Molina, Pedro Gutiérrez, José Chaves, Jorge Yaman', null, 'A chronicle of the life of a middle-class French girl''s sexual adventures, her then fall into prostitution, and her ultimate redemption.', 'A chronicle of the life of a middle-class French girl''s sexual adventures, her then fall into prostitution, and her ultimate redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVYTeiFv7oQsSQF9OBRngg7ZqLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19173'),
  ('612694647569870723', 'Diary of a Pregnant Woman', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Sacha Vierny', 'Agnès Varda', 'Dorothée Blanck, Antoine Bourseiller, Jean Tasso, José Varela, Monika Weber, André Rousselet', null, 'Impressions of the rue Mouffetard, Paris 5, through the eyes of a pregnant woman.', 'Impressions of the rue Mouffetard, Paris 5, through the eyes of a pregnant woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIr8T5lssXSjEGMLrdB51kqKtn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95378'),
  ('1038697743167675330', 'Diary of a Sex Addict', 2001, 'Drama', 'Joseph Brutsman, Nathan Hope', 'Joseph Brutsman, Tony Peck', 'Rosanna Arquette, Nastassja Kinski, Michael Des Barres, Eva Jeníčková, Cole Sprouse, Dylan Sprouse, Ed Begley Jr., Alexandra Paul', 'R', 'A restaurant owner leads a double life.', 'A restaurant owner leads a double life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oOkQLPTp6EyvTfQ5OTCUqeQ90pZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61185'),
  ('630613785694417825', 'Diary of a Shinjuku Thief', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Yasuhiro Yoshioka, Seizō Sengen', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Tsutomu Tamura, Masao Adachi', 'Tadanori Yokoo, Rie Yokoyama, Fumio Watanabe, Kei Satō, Rokkō Toura, Juro Kara, Akaji Maro, Taka Okubo', null, 'In Tokyo''s Shinjuku district, the lives of a young man prone to theft, a young woman he meets at a bookstore, and a kabuki actor intersect.', 'In Tokyo''s Shinjuku district, the lives of a young man prone to theft, a young woman he meets at a bookstore, and a kabuki actor intersect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afdFSOdS1oYTi5ew7wEcl9F8yYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104744'),
  ('751229498426187674', 'Diary of a Teacher', 1973, 'Drama', 'Luciano Tovoli, Andrea Antoniani, Caterina Nobiloni', 'Vittorio De Seta', 'Bruno Cirino, Mico Cundari, Marisa Fabbri, Tullio Altamura', null, 'In a school on the extreme outskirts of Rome, a young teacher, instead of neglecting his half-empty classroom, decides to tackle the problem looking for the children who do not attend classes.', 'In a school on the extreme outskirts of Rome, a young teacher, instead of neglecting his half-empty classroom, decides to tackle the problem looking for the children who do not attend classes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4Dt9FCdyILOdNe2rcnL5h9RsKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283184'),
  ('366549539874085904', 'Diary of a Wimpy Kid', 2010, 'Comedy, Family', 'Thor Freudenthal, Jack N. Green, Pete Whyte', 'Jackie Filgo, Jeff Filgo, Gabe Sachs', 'Zachary Gordon, Robert Capron, Steve Zahn, Devon Bostick, Rachael Harris, Chloë Grace Moretz, Laine MacNeil, Andrew McNee', 'PG', 'Greg Heffley is headed for big things, but first he has to survive the scariest, most humiliating experience of any kid’s life – middle school! That won’t be easy, considering he’s surrounded by hairy-freckled morons, wedgie-loving bullies and a moldy slice of cheese with nuclear cooties!', 'Greg Heffley is headed for big things, but first he has to survive the scariest, most humiliating experience of any kid’s life – middle school! That won’t be easy, considering he’s surrounded by hairy-freckled morons, wedgie-loving bullies and a moldy slice of cheese with nuclear cooties!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLAGiPnSuODt9cn332bkFElrRig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33217'),
  ('146988121789955530', 'Diary of a Wimpy Kid', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Swinton O. Scott III', 'Jeff Kinney', 'Brady Noon, Ethan William Childress, Hunter Dillon, Erica Cerra, Chris Diamantopoulos, Gracen Newton, Christian Convery, Jessica Mikayla Adams', 'PG', 'Greg Heffley is a scrawny but ambitious kid with an active imagination and big plans to be rich and famous – he just has to survive middle school first.', 'Greg Heffley is a scrawny but ambitious kid with an active imagination and big plans to be rich and famous – he just has to survive middle school first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obg6lWuNaZkoSlwrVG4VVk4SmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774741'),
  ('431306677590620373', 'Diary of a Wimpy Kid Christmas: Cabin Fever', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Luke Cormican', 'Jeff Kinney', 'Wesley Kimmel, Erica Cerra, Christian Convery, Chris Diamantopoulos, Hunter Dillon, Spencer Howell, Gracen Newton, Gabriel Iglesias', 'PG', 'A hilarious and heartfelt holiday tale centered around everyone''s favorite disaster-prone middle school student, Greg Heffley, which finds him desperately fighting to stay off Santa''s naughty list as the family prepares for a major winter snowstorm.', 'A hilarious and heartfelt holiday tale centered around everyone''s favorite disaster-prone middle school student, Greg Heffley, which finds him desperately fighting to stay off Santa''s naughty list as the family prepares for a major winter snowstorm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CgWUleumTXrFL6AsQKjpcuwWyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1123093'),
  ('1016268884500720140', 'Diary of a Wimpy Kid: Dog Days', 2012, 'Comedy, Family', 'David Bowers, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Maya Forbes, Wallace Wolodarsky', 'Zachary Gordon, Robert Capron, Devon Bostick, Peyton List, Steve Zahn, Rachael Harris, Grayson Russell, Karan Brar', 'PG', 'It''s summertime, and Greg Heffley is looking forward to playing video games and spending time with his friends. However, Greg''s dad has other plans: He''s decided that some father-son bonding time is in order. Desperate to prevent his dad from ruining summer vacation, Greg pretends he has a job at a ritzy country club. But Greg''s plan backfires, leaving him in the middle of embarrassing mishaps and a camping trip gone wrong.', 'It''s summertime, and Greg Heffley is looking forward to playing video games and spending time with his friends. However, Greg''s dad has other plans: He''s decided that some father-son bonding time is in order. Desperate to prevent his dad from ruining summer vacation, Greg pretends he has a job at a ritzy country club. But Greg''s plan backfires, leaving him in the middle of embarrassing mishaps and a camping trip gone wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pTvjELxw0f0E6sUPGtPEl4WD0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82650'),
  ('862873301258700628', 'Diary of a Wimpy Kid: Rodrick Rules', 2011, 'Family, Comedy', 'David Bowers, Jack N. Green', 'Gabe Sachs, Jeff Judah', 'Zachary Gordon, Devon Bostick, Robert Capron, Steve Zahn, Rachael Harris, Fran Kranz, Peyton List, Connor Fielding', 'PG', 'Wimpy Greg Heffley, now in seventh grade, thinks he has it all together. He has mastered middle school and gotten rid of the Cheese Touch. However, Greg''s older brother, Rodrick, is itching to cut him down to size. He gets the perfect opportunity when their mother tries to force the boys to bond. Rodrick may be Greg''s chief tormentor, but he feels his constant pranks are just what his little brother needs to prepare him for life''s hard knocks.', 'Wimpy Greg Heffley, now in seventh grade, thinks he has it all together. He has mastered middle school and gotten rid of the Cheese Touch. However, Greg''s older brother, Rodrick, is itching to cut him down to size. He gets the perfect opportunity when their mother tries to force the boys to bond. Rodrick may be Greg''s chief tormentor, but he feels his constant pranks are just what his little brother needs to prepare him for life''s hard knocks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w77ZoDmHNf6lnk8NWsXqWYOQqnp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60307'),
  ('453147612799361951', 'Diary of a Wimpy Kid: Rodrick Rules', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Luke Cormican', 'Jeff Kinney', 'Brady Noon, Ethan William Childress, Hunter Dillon, Erica Cerra, Chris Diamantopoulos, Ed Asner, Linda Lavin, Loretta Devine', 'PG', 'As a new school year begins, Greg is subject to relentless teasing from his brother Rodrick. Will Greg manage to get along with him? Or will a secret ruin everything?', 'As a new school year begins, Greg is subject to relentless teasing from his brother Rodrick. Will Greg manage to get along with him? Or will a secret ruin everything?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iW6ixzkrvdrcxk0umiLZMtlSl9L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:897192'),
  ('230043672058623059', 'Diary of a Wimpy Kid: The Last Straw', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Matt Danner', 'Jeff Kinney', 'Aaron D. Harris, Chris Diamantopoulos, Erica Cerra, Hunter Dillon, Jude Zarzaur, Gracen Newton, Jill Basey, Bashir Salahuddin', 'PG', 'When laidback Greg finds himself at odds with his dad''s outsized expectations, pressure builds to turn his act around. After a series of hilarious near disasters, Greg''s dad presents him with an ultimatum that just might challenge his wimpy ways for good.', 'When laidback Greg finds himself at odds with his dad''s outsized expectations, pressure builds to turn his act around. After a series of hilarious near disasters, Greg''s dad presents him with an ultimatum that just might challenge his wimpy ways for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emcCjpC289NxAGuVwlItHCTrgT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1392796'),
  ('239928535619587570', 'Diary of a Wimpy Kid: The Long Haul', 2017, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Danny Brown, Jeff Ginn, Anthony B. Richmond', 'David Bowers, Jeff Kinney', 'Jason Ian Drucker, Alicia Silverstone, Tom Everett Scott, Charlie Wright, Owen Asztalos, Wyatt Walters, Joshua Hoover, Mira Silverman', 'PG', 'A Heffley family road trip to attend Meemaw''s 90th birthday party goes hilariously off course thanks to Greg''s newest scheme to get to a video gaming convention.', 'A Heffley family road trip to attend Meemaw''s 90th birthday party goes hilariously off course thanks to Greg''s newest scheme to get to a video gaming convention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivRrDm5PlOndteVZgjhQenzKU5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417830'),
  ('573558379664549749', 'Diary of an African Nun', 1977, 'Drama', 'Orin Mitchell, Julie Dash, Mshinda Price', null, 'Barbara O. Jones, Marnita Carraway, Fred Carraway, Donald Carraway Jr., Sherry Madden, Barbara Young, Makini Price, Ron Flagge', null, 'An African nun is consumed by fear and doubt about her decision to take the solemn vows of poverty, chastity and obedience. Her anguish intensifies night after night as she lies on a hard bed in her small room at the convent and listens to the rhythmic, beckoning drums of her village.', 'An African nun is consumed by fear and doubt about her decision to take the solemn vows of poverty, chastity and obedience. Her anguish intensifies night after night as she lies on a hard bed in her small room at the convent and listens to the rhythmic, beckoning drums of her village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wo9MuHU2aUj3WjtmErbv8ddr9JF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338914'),
  ('1084220138038373887', 'Diary of an Exorcist - Zero', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Renato Siqueira', 'Renato Siqueira, Luciano Milici', 'Renato Siqueira, Fábio Tomasini, Luiz Marigo, Lisa Negri, Ruben Espinoza, Cibelle Martin, Edson Rocha, Olivia Camargo', null, 'Lucas devotes his life to church work after a tragedy. When an exorcism case gets out of control, he has to figure out who is under the Devil''s influence.', 'Lucas devotes his life to church work after a tragedy. When an exorcism case gets out of control, he has to figure out who is under the Devil''s influence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QmzNum1ZltjE88cK3I4MIvNLHm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408949'),
  ('76661881346185589', 'Diary of an Unexpected Journey', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Martín Montellano, Paco Alvarez', 'Paco Alvarez, Antonella Samaniego', 'Getsemaní Vela, Xabiani Ponce de León, Kevin Holt, Martha Claudia Moreno, Carlos Corona, Moisés Arizmendi, Alfredo Huereca, Barbie Casillas', null, 'A young woman receives a diary as an inheritance from her father, in which he tells her that she must take a trip to Chiapas, a requirement for access to all his possessions.', 'A young woman receives a diary as an inheritance from her father, in which he tells her that she must take a trip to Chiapas, a requirement for access to all his possessions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aje3hkAbXisLUiDQfZPXr02AIJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096400'),
  ('103762354695429659', 'Diary of June', 2005, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Im Kyung-soo', 'Im Kyung-soo, Go Jung-woon', 'Eric Mun, Shin Eun-kyung, Yunjin Kim, Jang Ki-bum, Maeng Se-chang, Yoo Hyun-ji, Yun Ju-sang, Kim Ji-min', null, 'Two teenagers joining the same class in a high school die on the same day. The one to be top of the class is killed by a big knife on the street, the other - the second best of the class indeed - seems to be jumped from the top of the school building. Everybody believes that he first killed his classmate and than himself. But when the police finds small pill boxes into the stomachs of both kids confessing their murder two South Korean cops are torn into a new case of murder series. While they try to hunt down the serial killer, more pupils are getting killed...', 'Two teenagers joining the same class in a high school die on the same day. The one to be top of the class is killed by a big knife on the street, the other - the second best of the class indeed - seems to be jumped from the top of the school building. Everybody believes that he first killed his classmate and than himself. But when the police finds small pill boxes into the stomachs of both kids confessing their murder two South Korean cops are torn into a new case of murder series. While they try to hunt down the serial killer, more pupils are getting killed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWKcaGyeAzCVpV26r5lH0Iiiv7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38011'),
  ('44932043385703821', 'Diary of the Dead', 2007, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'George A. Romero, Adam Swica, Martin Walters', 'George A. Romero', 'Michelle Morgan, Joshua Close, Shawn Roberts, Amy Lalonde, Joe Dinicol, Scott Wentworth, Philip Riccio, Chris Violette', 'R', 'A group of young filmmakers encounter real zombies while filming a horror movie of their own.', 'A group of young filmmakers encounter real zombies while filming a horror movie of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGktSJW5dPf8QIjmcqum4KOEZPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13025'),
  ('772045076262722732', 'Diatoms', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Geneviève Hamon, Jean Painlevé', null, 'Carola Meierrose', null, 'The one-celled long and slender diatom, up close: discovered in 1703 with the invention of the microscope. We observe them magnified 10,000 times: water expelled through the skeleton, mucilage constantly emitted, allowing it to glide. Their energy comes from sunlight. They divide and disperse. The narrator, conversing with a young woman, says their remains cover one-third of the earth''s surface. They have uses in petroleum, explosives, and polish. Some live in isolation, some in colonies, like elaborate fans. They can move in clusters. Many small animals eat them. We watch them slide on each other in long strings.', 'The one-celled long and slender diatom, up close: discovered in 1703 with the invention of the microscope. We observe them magnified 10,000 times: water expelled through the skeleton, mucilage constantly emitted, allowing it to glide. Their energy comes from sunlight. They divide and disperse. The narrator, conversing with a young woman, says their remains cover one-third of the earth''s surface. They have uses in petroleum, explosives, and polish. Some live in isolation, some in colonies, like elaborate fans. They can move in clusters. Many small animals eat them. We watch them slide on each other in long strings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihYA6FH2wA0xOOHysqwe5Pc2Zx9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163236'),
  ('438059517471636807', 'Diaz - Don''t Clean Up This Blood', 2012, 'Drama, History', 'Luigi Spoletini, Umberto Francia, Matteo Peirone', 'Emanuele Scaringi, Alessandro Bandinelli', 'Claudio Santamaria, Jennifer Ulrich, Elio Germano, Davide Iacopini, Ralph Amoussou, Fabrizio Rongione, Renato Scarpa, Mattia Sbragia', null, 'On July 19–21, 2001, over 200,000 people took to the streets of Genoa to protest against the ongoing G8 summit. Anti-globalization activists clashed with the police, with 23-year-old protester Carlo Giuliani shot dead after confronting a police vehicle. In the aftermath, the police organized a night raid on the Diaz high school, where around a hundred people between unarmed protesters—mostly students—and independent reporters who documented the police brutality during the protests had took shelter. What happened next was called by Amnesty International "the most serious breach of civil liberties in a democratic Western country since World War II."', 'On July 19–21, 2001, over 200,000 people took to the streets of Genoa to protest against the ongoing G8 summit. Anti-globalization activists clashed with the police, with 23-year-old protester Carlo Giuliani shot dead after confronting a police vehicle. In the aftermath, the police organized a night raid on the Diaz high school, where around a hundred people between unarmed protesters—mostly students—and independent reporters who documented the police brutality during the protests had took shelter. What happened next was called by Amnesty International "the most serious breach of civil liberties in a democratic Western country since World War II."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcGFlMHToPdYLn3ZMUwHsA8FQr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96714'),
  ('494917606947185402', 'Dibu 2: La venganza de Nasty', 1998, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Carlos Galettini, Juan Taratuto, Abelardo Kuschnir', 'Martin Colomer', 'Mauricio Dayub, Hugo Arana, Roberto Carnaghi, Cecilia Gispert, Sol Impagliazzo, Gianni Lunadei, Horacio Marassi, Leandro Aita', null, 'The evil Nasty comes to our world with two objectives -- kidnap Buji, and carry as much candy as possible back to his world. He has the ability to ''shape-shift'', and using the appearance of Dibu, he holds up a bank so that he can get enough money to buy the candy. The police wrongly imprison Dibu, who manages to escape and confront Nasty.', 'The evil Nasty comes to our world with two objectives -- kidnap Buji, and carry as much candy as possible back to his world. He has the ability to ''shape-shift'', and using the appearance of Dibu, he holds up a bank so that he can get enough money to buy the candy. The police wrongly imprison Dibu, who manages to escape and confront Nasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hABCBmHxH5vXIc17CeeCFzG6PAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127021'),
  ('335538546785934531', 'Dibu 3', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Raúl Rodríguez Peila, Juan Carlos Lenardi, Floppi Lunt', 'Alejandro Sapognikoff, Ricardo Rodríguez', 'Germán Kraus, Stella Maris Closas, Alberto Anchart, Alejandro Awada, Marcelo Alfaro, Rodrigo Noya, Paula Siero, Edgardo Moreira', null, 'Facing an imminent attack from Mars, planet Earth sends Dibu to Mars as a peace ambassador -- the only hope for averting the attack. Amazingly, he finds a friendly population, whose only issue is that they are fed up of their planet being used as a nuclear dump site. Besides averting the Martian attack, Dibu also inadvertently manages the save hit planet from the diabolical designs of an ambitious general', 'Facing an imminent attack from Mars, planet Earth sends Dibu to Mars as a peace ambassador -- the only hope for averting the attack. Amazingly, he finds a friendly population, whose only issue is that they are fed up of their planet being used as a nuclear dump site. Besides averting the Martian attack, Dibu also inadvertently manages the save hit planet from the diabolical designs of an ambitious general', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4O2nW7Z9s7AW5NBFcddf5yF0FZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127304'),
  ('1026634857565264251', 'Dibu: La película', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Alejandro Stoessel, Carlos Olivieri, Ricardo Rodríguez', 'Daniel Kuzniecka, Ricardo Rodríguez', 'Cecilia Gispert, Laura Sordi, Germán Kraus, Stella Maris Closas, Alberto Anchart, Facundo Espinosa, Andrés Ispani, Mauricio Garcia Muela', null, 'When Caro and Marce go on vacation they find a new friend, Buji, and just like Dibu, she is a cartoon animated kid. Abu, Pepe, Víctor, Leo and Dibu are left alone at home and they have quite an adventure when they decide to sign-up Dibu in a go-cart race.', 'When Caro and Marce go on vacation they find a new friend, Buji, and just like Dibu, she is a cartoon animated kid. Abu, Pepe, Víctor, Leo and Dibu are left alone at home and they have quite an adventure when they decide to sign-up Dibu in a go-cart race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdgWJFC5buwDDupZQTkrEmmQ3SE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132298'),
  ('501417103504836827', 'Dibujando el cielo', 2018, 'Romance', 'Gerardo Barroso, Ana Laura Calderón', 'Ana Laura Calderón, Christopher Hool', 'Maite Perroni, Iván Sánchez, Christian Vazquez, Claudia Ramírez, Ximena Romo, Ana Layevska, Santiago Salcido, Ricardo Muñoz Senior', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BygqvIxknQLYkeYl2Jai8OipHe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532223'),
  ('675343129522977423', 'Dicen que soy mujeriego', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Rodríguez, Jack Draper', 'Roberto Rodríguez, Carlos González Dueñas, Pedro de Urdimalas', 'Pedro Infante, Sara García, Silvia Derbez, Rodolfo Landa, Fernando Soto, Arturo Soto Rangel, Juan Pulido, Salvador Quiroz', null, 'Pedro has had many lovers but he only loves one of them, but this romance stop going on for his flirts with other women.', 'Pedro has had many lovers but he only loves one of them, but this romance stop going on for his flirts with other women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/602S45Sp9EU0KixVtF0ddfbcO2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101300'),
  ('838320443931212230', 'Diciamoci la verità', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Giambattista Avellino', null, 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oc0CyNJ6FuUXjTlIek0Zha1vrvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282098'),
  ('951188675255432119', 'Diciannove', 2025, 'Drama', 'Giovanni Tortorici, Massimiliano Kuveiller, Francesca Coticoni', 'Giovanni Tortorici', 'Manfredi Marini, Vittoria Planeta, Dana Giuliano, Zackari Delmas, Luca Lazzareschi, Sergio Benvenuto, Maria Pia Ferlazzo, Samuel Wilberding', null, 'Leonardo, a 19-year-old student, leaves his hometown of Palermo to study economics in London. He soon grows restless and enrolls at the University of Siena to study literature before dropping out of school to study classics on his own. The following year, he travels to Turin where he meets a man who will help him on his journey of self-discovery.', 'Leonardo, a 19-year-old student, leaves his hometown of Palermo to study economics in London. He soon grows restless and enrolls at the University of Siena to study literature before dropping out of school to study classics on his own. The following year, he travels to Turin where he meets a man who will help him on his journey of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rC6hYYVUG7F8bAi9BPzhp00W5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118770'),
  ('1098557559166738928', 'Dick', 1999, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Andrew Fleming, Alexander Gruszynski, Miles Perlman', 'Andrew Fleming, Sheryl Longin', 'Kirsten Dunst, Michelle Williams, Dan Hedaya, Will Ferrell, Bruce McCulloch, Teri Garr, Dave Foley, Jim Breuer', 'PG-13', 'Two high school girls wander off during a class trip to the White House and meet President Richard Nixon. They become the official dog walkers for Nixon''s dog Checkers, and become his secret advisors during the Watergate scandal.', 'Two high school girls wander off during a class trip to the White House and meet President Richard Nixon. They become the official dog walkers for Nixon''s dog Checkers, and become his secret advisors during the Watergate scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBG4XoK5xkujl4crloPs6bStl4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16406'),
  ('943650909752703874', 'Dick Johnson Is Dead', 2020, 'Documentary', 'John Wakayama Carey, Kirsten Johnson, Kirsten Johnson', 'Kirsten Johnson, Nels Bangerter', 'Richard Johnson, Kirsten Johnson, Isla Sierck, Jed Sierck, Felix Torres, Viva Torres, Raymond Damazo, Michael Hilow', 'PG-13', 'With this inventive portrait, director Kirsten Johnson seeks a way to keep her 86-year-old father alive forever. Utilizing moviemaking magic and her family’s dark humor, she celebrates Dr. Dick Johnson’s last years by staging fantasies of death and beyond. Together, dad and daughter confront the great inevitability awaiting us all.', 'With this inventive portrait, director Kirsten Johnson seeks a way to keep her 86-year-old father alive forever. Utilizing moviemaking magic and her family’s dark humor, she celebrates Dr. Dick Johnson’s last years by staging fantasies of death and beyond. Together, dad and daughter confront the great inevitability awaiting us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnfI34kmi3fcdgP7HZjIgGOJHGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653574'),
  ('373816875216297349', 'Dick Tracy', 1937, 'Crime, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Alan James, Ray Taylor, Edgar Lyons', 'Barry Shipman, Winston Miller', 'Ralph Byrd, Kay Hughes, Smiley Burnette, Lee Van Atta, John Picorri, Carleton Young, Fred Hamilton, Francis X. Bushman', 'NR', 'Dick Tracy''s foe for this serial is the crime boss and Masked Mystery Villain The Spider/The Lame One and his Spider Ring. In the process of various crimes, including using his Flying wing and sound weapon to destroy the Bay Bridge in San Francisco and stealing an experimental "Speed Plane", the Spider captures Dick Tracy''s brother, Gordon. The Spider''s minion, Dr. Moloch, performs a brain operation on Gordon Tracy to turn him evil, making him secretly part of the Spider Ring and so turning brother against brother.', 'Dick Tracy''s foe for this serial is the crime boss and Masked Mystery Villain The Spider/The Lame One and his Spider Ring. In the process of various crimes, including using his Flying wing and sound weapon to destroy the Bay Bridge in San Francisco and stealing an experimental "Speed Plane", the Spider captures Dick Tracy''s brother, Gordon. The Spider''s minion, Dr. Moloch, performs a brain operation on Gordon Tracy to turn him evil, making him secretly part of the Spider Ring and so turning brother against brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74BXvAwd3XstKnpWuuwtN2ytYJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138336'),
  ('847794236144732914', 'Dick Tracy', 1945, 'Mystery, Action, Crime', 'William Berke, Frank Redman, Clem Beauchamp', 'Eric Taylor', 'Morgan Conway, Anne Jeffreys, Mike Mazurki, Jane Greer, Lyle Latell, Joseph Crehan, Mickey Kuhn, Trevor Bardette', null, 'Dick is faced with a series of brutal murders in which the victims, all from different social and economic backgrounds, are viciously slashed to pieces. Suspects abound but Tracy, getting a clue that there will be 15 murders in all, must find the common thread among the victims before more are killed.', 'Dick is faced with a series of brutal murders in which the victims, all from different social and economic backgrounds, are viciously slashed to pieces. Suspects abound but Tracy, getting a clue that there will be 15 murders in all, must find the common thread among the victims before more are killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fpQCSEMxFUNMIYYm2T1JlgwWgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112842'),
  ('400672836491680704', 'Dick Tracy', 1990, 'Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Warren Beatty, Vittorio Storaro, Jim Van Wyck', 'Jim Cash, Jack Epps Jr.', 'Warren Beatty, Al Pacino, Madonna, Dustin Hoffman, James Caan, Charlie Korsmo, Glenne Headly, Mandy Patinkin', 'PG', 'The comic strip detective finds his life vastly complicated when Breathless Mahoney makes advances towards him while he is trying to battle Big Boy Caprice''s united mob.', 'The comic strip detective finds his life vastly complicated when Breathless Mahoney makes advances towards him while he is trying to battle Big Boy Caprice''s united mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjeP4bpgsUvAGE8oFcICy2GaHxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8592'),
  ('890961026898534477', 'Dick Tracy Meets Gruesome', 1947, 'Action, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'John Rawlins, Frank Redman, James Lane', 'Robertson White, Eric Taylor', 'Boris Karloff, Ralph Byrd, Anne Gwynne, Edward Ashley, June Clayworth, Lyle Latell, Tony Barrett, Skelton Knaggs', null, 'A gang of criminals, which includes a piano player and an imposing former convict known as ''Gruesome'', has found out about a scientist''s secret formula for a gas that temporarily paralyzes anyone who breathes it. When Gruesome accidentally inhales some of the gas and passes out, the police think he is dead and take him to the morgue, where he later revives and escapes. This puzzling incident attracts the interest of Dick Tracy, and when the criminals later use the gas to rob a bank, Tracy realizes that he must devote his entire attention to stopping them.', 'A gang of criminals, which includes a piano player and an imposing former convict known as ''Gruesome'', has found out about a scientist''s secret formula for a gas that temporarily paralyzes anyone who breathes it. When Gruesome accidentally inhales some of the gas and passes out, the police think he is dead and take him to the morgue, where he later revives and escapes. This puzzling incident attracts the interest of Dick Tracy, and when the criminals later use the gas to rob a bank, Tracy realizes that he must devote his entire attention to stopping them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUJNIJqSPIX2hEFu82OjaqZJK1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70702'),
  ('204315565833874375', 'Dick Tracy vs. Cueball', 1946, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Gordon Douglas, George E. Diskant, John Anderson', 'Robert E. Kent, Dane Lussier', 'Morgan Conway, Anne Jeffreys, Lyle Latell, Rita Corday, Ian Keith, Dick Wessel, Douglas Walton, Esther Howard', 'NR', 'A police detective uses his girlfriend to track down a homicidal maniac.', 'A police detective uses his girlfriend to track down a homicidal maniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5czzZWxoKpFdhIHXHTya2gm6w7t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68143'),
  ('767900865675612425', 'Dick Tracy''s Dilemma', 1947, 'Drama, Crime', 'John Rawlins, Frank Redman, Grayson Rogers', 'Robert Stephen Brode', 'Ralph Byrd, Lyle Latell, Kay Christopher, Jack Lambert, Ian Keith, Bernadene Hayes, Jimmy Conlin, William B. Davidson', null, 'Dick Tracy investigates the theft of a fortune of fur coats, a possible insurance swindle and several murders, all linked to a huge thug who wears a hook in place of his right hand.', 'Dick Tracy investigates the theft of a fortune of fur coats, a possible insurance swindle and several murders, all linked to a huge thug who wears a hook in place of his right hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fuS89ds46W5Nk7ZInoPh8QqWFG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117123'),
  ('1144141369629045406', 'Dickie Roberts: Former Child Star', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Sam Weisman, Thomas E. Ackerman', 'Fred Wolf, David Spade', 'David Spade, Mary McCormack, Jon Lovitz, Craig Bierko, Alyssa Milano, Rob Reiner, Scott Terra, Jenna Boyd', 'PG-13', 'TV child star of the ''70s, Dickie Roberts is now 35 and parking cars. Craving to regain the spotlight, he auditions for a role of a normal guy, but the director quickly sees he is anything but normal. Desperate to win the part, Dickie hires a family to help him replay his childhood and assume the identity of an average, everyday loser.', 'TV child star of the ''70s, Dickie Roberts is now 35 and parking cars. Craving to regain the spotlight, he auditions for a role of a normal guy, but the director quickly sees he is anything but normal. Desperate to win the part, Dickie hires a family to help him replay his childhood and assume the identity of an average, everyday loser.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOp2EavuxouJFo8xgcPfBKPxjUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13778'),
  ('948028608241449391', 'Dicks: The Musical', 2023, 'Music, Comedy', 'Larry Charles, Fiora Cutler, Marius de Vries', 'Josh Sharp, Aaron Jackson', 'Josh Sharp, Aaron Jackson, Nathan Lane, Megan Mullally, Bowen Yang, Megan Thee Stallion, Tom Kenny, Frank Todaro', 'R', 'Two self-obsessed businessmen discover they''re long-lost identical twins and come together to plot the reunion of their eccentric divorced parents.', 'Two self-obsessed businessmen discover they''re long-lost identical twins and come together to plot the reunion of their eccentric divorced parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yVGumeBFefa1Yk4Ha5TiR6Fpac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939997'),
  ('1010407301050561234', 'Dickslap', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Baptiste Saurel', null, 'Franc Bruneau, Vanessa Guide, Cyril Gueï', null, 'Francis is the boss of a videoclub which owes its success to the movies by Ti-Kong, kung fu star and neck breaker. He has complexes about the size of his penis, Francis can not manage to admit his feelings to Sonia, his employee. But when she is offered a role in Evil Nurse, last opus of Ti-Kong, Francis does not have a choice. He is going to have to gain back his confidence to save Sonia from a terrible danger: Dickslap.', 'Francis is the boss of a videoclub which owes its success to the movies by Ti-Kong, kung fu star and neck breaker. He has complexes about the size of his penis, Francis can not manage to admit his feelings to Sonia, his employee. But when she is offered a role in Evil Nurse, last opus of Ti-Kong, Francis does not have a choice. He is going to have to gain back his confidence to save Sonia from a terrible danger: Dickslap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWI9PwyXl6DLf2FcOCmZTtsH7JW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181779'),
  ('684408034351958621', 'Dickson Experimental Sound Film', 1894, 'Music', 'William K.L. Dickson, William Heise, Fred Ott', null, 'William K.L. Dickson, Charles D''Almaine', null, 'William K.L. Dickson plays the violin while two men dance. This is the oldest surviving sound film where sound is recorded on the phonograph.', 'William K.L. Dickson plays the violin while two men dance. This is the oldest surviving sound film where sound is recorded on the phonograph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29GejylcrVahrRziYn3B1CLUs9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104396'),
  ('303531820051476342', 'Dickson Greeting', 1891, 'Documentary', 'William K.L. Dickson, William Heise, William Heise', null, 'William K.L. Dickson', null, 'William K.L. Dickson brings his hat from his one hand to the other and moves his head slightly, as a small nod toward the audience. This was the first film produced by the Edison Manufacturing Company to be shown to public audiences and the press.', 'William K.L. Dickson brings his hat from his one hand to the other and moves his head slightly, as a small nod toward the audience. This was the first film produced by the Edison Manufacturing Company to be shown to public audiences and the press.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/as6wboEEpqJXFzGNXT0poGR7BM3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33229'),
  ('945133677239368298', 'Dicky Moe', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Gene Deitch, Václav Bedřich', null, 'Allen Swift', null, 'In a 19th century fishing harbor, the captain of the Komquot is obsessed with catching the great white whale Dicky Moe. His obsession unnerves his crew so badly that they all desert the ship. Shortly afterward, the captain finds Tom searching for food in the harbor, knocks him out, and takes him aboard. Tom believes at first that he is going on a cruise, but the captain soon puts him to work scrubbing the deck.', 'In a 19th century fishing harbor, the captain of the Komquot is obsessed with catching the great white whale Dicky Moe. His obsession unnerves his crew so badly that they all desert the ship. Shortly afterward, the captain finds Tom searching for food in the harbor, knocks him out, and takes him aboard. Tom believes at first that he is going on a cruise, but the captain soon puts him to work scrubbing the deck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Hq8S6rxLnvQ2fOR2dzCzCCCNp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223023'),
  ('32431494884400215', 'Did We Meet Somewhere Before', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Andrei Tutyshkin, Nikolay Dostal, Yuri Yekelchik', 'Vladimir Polyakov', 'Arkadiy Raykin, Mariya Mironova, Vasili Merkuryev, Lyudmila Tselikovskaya, Mikhail Yanshin, Olga Aroseva, Sergei Filippov, Vladimir Gulyaev', null, 'Maximov and his wife Larisa Levkoyeva going to vacation, but in last minutes Levkoyeva were called back to theater. And Maximov goes all alone to the Crimea on the train. On the one of station he miss his train and must check the city and make a concert to reach the point of destination. But he is so popular that people just didn''t let him rest like he want...', 'Maximov and his wife Larisa Levkoyeva going to vacation, but in last minutes Levkoyeva were called back to theater. And Maximov goes all alone to the Crimea on the train. On the one of station he miss his train and must check the city and make a concert to reach the point of destination. But he is so popular that people just didn''t let him rest like he want...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RnKCM0uhSuM2g2F9qUqtzYTbjE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67786'),
  ('1016864324825344058', 'Did You Ever Take a Ride Over Kansas City Street ''In a Fliver''', 1921, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'This film is not really animated, it just consists of Walt drawing a single frame. Part of the Newman Laugh-O-Grams Series.', 'This film is not really animated, it just consists of Walt drawing a single frame. Part of the Newman Laugh-O-Grams Series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fF01xHgAwSgR4mPbiXH4PhT5HYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222389'),
  ('672827867934944240', 'Did You Hear About the Morgans?', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Marc Lawrence, Julie A. Bloom, Greg Gilman', 'Marc Lawrence', 'Hugh Grant, Sarah Jessica Parker, Sam Elliott, Mary Steenburgen, Elisabeth Moss, Michael Kelly, Wilford Brimley, Jesse Liebman', 'PG-13', 'New Yorkers Paul and Meryl Morgan seem to have it all -- except that their marriage is crumbling around them. But their romantic woes are small compared to the trouble they find themselves in after witnessing a murder. To protect them from an assassin, federal agents whisk away Paul and Meryl to a small town in Wyoming, where their marriage will crash and burn, or their passion will reignite.', 'New Yorkers Paul and Meryl Morgan seem to have it all -- except that their marriage is crumbling around them. But their romantic woes are small compared to the trouble they find themselves in after witnessing a murder. To protect them from an assassin, federal agents whisk away Paul and Meryl to a small town in Wyoming, where their marriage will crash and burn, or their passion will reignite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNRLfwUGKaSQEDvOKlIOLGn8qRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24438'),
  ('428026725579424932', 'Didi - The Goofy Cupid', 2003, 'Romance, Comedy, Family', 'Alexandre Boury, Paulo Aragão, César Moraes', 'Renato Aragão, Flávio de Souza', 'Renato Aragão, Daniel, Jackeline Petkovic, Tadeu Mello, Helen Ganzarolli, Aramis Trindade, Armando Paiva, Kleber Bambam', null, 'A clumsy angel is sent away from heaven by God Himself. He may only return after he becomes a good Cupid. But the first couple he tries to connect is a real challenge: the man is poor, and the girl comes from a rich family. And their names are Romeu and Julieta.', 'A clumsy angel is sent away from heaven by God Himself. He may only return after he becomes a good Cupid. But the first couple he tries to connect is a real challenge: the man is poor, and the girl comes from a rich family. And their names are Romeu and Julieta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5YT7IXrikXxA7pq97r7w3FethX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243664'),
  ('800882313796829237', 'Didi - The Treasure Raider', 2006, 'Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Marcus Figueiredo, Paulo Aragão, César Moraes', 'Marcus Figueiredo, Guto Franco, Flávio de Souza', 'Renato Aragão, João Paulo Bienermann, Eduardo Galvão, Grazi Massafera, Francisco Cuoco, Cecil Thiré, Miguel Thiré, Livian Aragão', null, 'Didi works as a butler at Pedro''s father''s house. While browsing an old photograph album, he and 10-year-old Pedro find an ancient map with the route to a treasure. They decide to search for it. But the treasure carries a curse cast by the three thieves who had stolen it first, during WW2.', 'Didi works as a butler at Pedro''s father''s house. While browsing an old photograph album, he and 10-year-old Pedro find an ancient map with the route to a treasure. They decide to search for it. But the treasure carries a curse cast by the three thieves who had stolen it first, during WW2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIB9ArTIaEgYUF8YUDCAjkoGCPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243463'),
  ('703221839866107887', 'Dìdi (弟弟)', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sam A. Davis, Elaine Marie Gibson, Hillary Pierce', 'Sean Wang', 'Izaac Wang, Joan Chen, Shirley Chen, Chang Li Hua, Mahaela Park, Raul Dial, Aaron Chang, Chiron Cillia Denk', 'R', 'In 2008, during the last month of summer before high school begins, an impressionable 13-year-old Taiwanese American boy learns what his family can''t teach him: how to skate, how to flirt, and how to love your mom.', 'In 2008, during the last month of summer before high school begins, an impressionable 13-year-old Taiwanese American boy learns what his family can''t teach him: how to skate, how to flirt, and how to love your mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UCTNaZgxW6BbeHMMTe6uL07MpV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1158915'),
  ('252971724521544312', 'Didi Drives Me Crazy', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Wigbert Wicker, Joseph Vilsmaier', 'Felix Huby, Dieter Hallervorden, Christoph Treutwein', 'Dieter Hallervorden, Bernard Ménez, Hans Peter Hallwachs, Gert Haucke, Günther Ungeheuer, Siegfried W. Kernen, Evelyn Gressmann, Walter Buschhoff', null, 'German vehicle fanatic Dieter ''Didi'' accepts to drive a truckload of waste barrels to a French dump site. Didi ignores the plant needs to dump toxic waste after a major incident, which made the international news. But while the French site exploiter''s agent Marcel believes it''s Did''s load, that''s in fact a deliberately obvious diversion. Now everyone chases everyone else.', 'German vehicle fanatic Dieter ''Didi'' accepts to drive a truckload of waste barrels to a French dump site. Didi ignores the plant needs to dump toxic waste after a major incident, which made the international news. But while the French site exploiter''s agent Marcel believes it''s Did''s load, that''s in fact a deliberately obvious diversion. Now everyone chases everyone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPcODmlSYoDcxSPjUZDIzKNZZEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11200'),
  ('1056568875919837464', 'DiDi Hollywood', 2010, 'Drama', 'Bigas Luna, Seth Gordon, Albert Pascual', 'Carmen Chaves Gastaldo', 'Elsa Pataky, Peter Coyote, Paul Sculfor, Giovanna Zacarías, Luis Hacha, Flora Martínez, Meritxell Laso, Àngela Soler', null, 'Bar worker Diana Diaz leaves Madrid for Miami and with new boyfriend, Robert (Luis Hacha), they then head for Hollywood, prepared to do anything for fame.', 'Bar worker Diana Diaz leaves Madrid for Miami and with new boyfriend, Robert (Luis Hacha), they then head for Hollywood, prepared to do anything for fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVonwPOkOcktqe84p8PC06mdTpE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62638'),
  ('418609437566943663', 'Didi Wanna Be a Kid', 2004, 'Comedy, Family', 'Reynaldo Boury, Alexandre Boury, César Moraes', 'Ricardo Aragão', 'Renato Aragão, Bruno Cariati, Pedro Malta, Malu Rodrigues, Didi Wagner, Cláudio Heinrich, Fernanda Lima, Rafael de Castro', null, 'Didi works at a traditional candy factory, which faces serious problems with the competition of a big company, whose products are full of artifical and dangerous flavors and colorants. He tries to warn the kids of the danger, but they don''t believe him, and he prays to his saints of devotion, St. Cosmas and St. Damian, for a solution. Some other day, he gives shelter to two poor men who, in return, give him some magical candies. After eating them, he turns into a kid and tries again to talk to the other children, who now take him seriously, since he has become one of them.', 'Didi works at a traditional candy factory, which faces serious problems with the competition of a big company, whose products are full of artifical and dangerous flavors and colorants. He tries to warn the kids of the danger, but they don''t believe him, and he prays to his saints of devotion, St. Cosmas and St. Damian, for a solution. Some other day, he gives shelter to two poor men who, in return, give him some magical candies. After eating them, he turns into a kid and tries again to talk to the other children, who now take him seriously, since he has become one of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mMEqi4T1gTptFIc1qZdxNJn3ye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255547'),
  ('1122961602208272079', 'DiDi''s Dreams', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Chiang Jui-chih, Yu Jing-pin, Kevin Tsai', 'Kevin Tsai, Liao Ming-Yi', 'Dee Hsu, Lin Chi-ling, Jin Shijia, Li Zifeng, Luke Wu, Zong Ying, Riva Chang, David Chao', null, 'An aspiring actress must overcome many obstacles as she tries to achieve her dream. Standing in the shadows of her superstar sister, she tries to prove herself while dreaming of love.', 'An aspiring actress must overcome many obstacles as she tries to achieve her dream. Standing in the shadows of her superstar sister, she tries to prove herself while dreaming of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaHEoRKyBCPlc0RMPOK71v8YyAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459674'),
  ('74840805376104359', 'Didier', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Alain Chabat, Laurent Dailland, Pierre Amzallag', 'Alain Chabat', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Alain Chabat, Isabelle Gélinas, Lionel Abelanski, Caroline Cellier, Chantal Lauby, Josiane Balasko, Dominique Farrugia', null, 'Jean-Pierre Costa is a football manager upon whom fate appears not to be smiling. First, a friend, Annabelle, dumps a pet Labrador named Didier on him whilst she goes off to make a report in Los Angeles. Next, one of his star players is injured, leaving him one player short for a crucial match. As if things could not get any worse, Costa wakes up one morning to find that that Didier has been transformed into a man...', 'Jean-Pierre Costa is a football manager upon whom fate appears not to be smiling. First, a friend, Annabelle, dumps a pet Labrador named Didier on him whilst she goes off to make a report in Los Angeles. Next, one of his star players is injured, leaving him one player short for a crucial match. As if things could not get any worse, Costa wakes up one morning to find that that Didier has been transformed into a man...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJ6HtIxYPUJh6vo0IbnmmPYLci2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37652'),
  ('990786518352093957', 'Die', 2010, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Dominic James, Nicolas Bolduc, Giulio Pietromarchi', 'Domenico Salvaggio', 'Emily Hampshire, Elias Koteas, John Pyper-Ferguson, Caterina Murino, Patricia McKenzie, Karl Pruner, Katie Boland, Miranda Handford', null, 'Six people, each of them is on the road to self-destruction. They wake up in cells in a surreal facility, without knowing how they got there or why.', 'Six people, each of them is on the road to self-destruction. They wake up in cells in a surreal facility, without knowing how they got there or why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heUAAtPWJVVV5QOMiynJztLcwC1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53861'),
  ('33320569780430166', 'Die 2050er - Everything will change', 2022, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Documentary', 'Felix Leiberg, Marten Persiel', 'Aisha Prigann, Marten Persiel', 'Noah Saavedra, Paul G. Raymond, Vibeke Hastrup, Jacqueline Chan, Jessamine-Bliss Bell, Gert Jan Louwe, Daniel Zillmann, Joëlle Chesselet', null, 'In a dystopian 2054, three young rebels go on a journey to find traces of the long lost beauty of nature, hoping to discover what happened to their planet.', 'In a dystopian 2054, three young rebels go on a journey to find traces of the long lost beauty of nature, hoping to discover what happened to their planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQmuK9BeO3sRT6Tb2KBS5BsJltH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788921'),
  ('1109305451699788722', 'Die Alone', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Lowell Dean, Mark Dobrescu', 'Lowell Dean', 'Carrie-Anne Moss, Douglas Smith, Frank Grillo, Kimberly-Sue Murray, Jonathan Cherry, Amy Matysio, Steven Roy, Harlan Blayne Kytwayhat', null, 'Lost in a world reclaimed by nature and overrun by mysterious creatures, Ethan, a young man with amnesia navigates the dangerous landscape in search of his lost love Emma. His journey takes an unexpected turn when he encounters Mae, a hardened and eccentric survivor. Together, Ethan and Mae face threats both human and otherwise before a fateful encounter with Kai unravels a secret that lies just beyond Ethan''s fractured memory.', 'Lost in a world reclaimed by nature and overrun by mysterious creatures, Ethan, a young man with amnesia navigates the dangerous landscape in search of his lost love Emma. His journey takes an unexpected turn when he encounters Mae, a hardened and eccentric survivor. Together, Ethan and Mae face threats both human and otherwise before a fateful encounter with Kai unravels a secret that lies just beyond Ethan''s fractured memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQdIj2OYELhLzECWONY932wGRxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1141182'),
  ('409215099840136715', 'Die Ältern', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sönke Wortmann, Andreas Berger', 'Robert Gold', 'Sebastian Bezzel, Kya-Celina Barucki, Anna Schudt, Philip Müller, Enzo Brumm', null, 'A writer in a midlife and marital crisis, overwhelmed by his growing children and unable to accept change, meets another woman. A bit half-hearted and unintentionally funny, he tries to do something different.', 'A writer in a midlife and marital crisis, overwhelmed by his growing children and unable to accept change, meets another woman. A bit half-hearted and unintentionally funny, he tries to do something different.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F50eNs4a2yhyINi5lloZiProIhcm.jpg', 'plex:movie:die-altern'),
  ('341145714227283096', 'Die Another Day', 2002, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Lee Tamahori, David Tattersall, James Hambidge', 'Robert Wade, Neal Purvis', 'Pierce Brosnan, Halle Berry, Toby Stephens, Rosamund Pike, Rick Yune, Judi Dench, John Cleese, Michael Madsen', 'PG-13', 'James Bond is sent to investigate the connection between a North Korean terrorist and a diamond mogul, who is funding the development of an international space weapon.', 'James Bond is sent to investigate the connection between a North Korean terrorist and a diamond mogul, who is funding the development of an international space weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZmGqOhMhaLn8AoFMvFDct4tbrL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36669'),
