  ('332094695694829999', 'Die Bad', 2000, 'Crime, Action', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Kim Sung-kwan, Cho Yong-kyu', 'Ryoo Seung-wan', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Ryoo Seung-bum, Park Seong-bin, Im Won-hee, Jung Jae-young, Kim Su-hyun, An Kil-kang, Bae Joong-sik', null, 'Die Bad is an inventive feature made up of four distinct episodes, each with their own style. With their criss-crossing characters and themes, they add up to a fairly comprehensive account of the causes and effects of male aggression, both tribal and individual.', 'Die Bad is an inventive feature made up of four distinct episodes, each with their own style. With their criss-crossing characters and themes, they add up to a fairly comprehensive account of the causes and effects of male aggression, both tribal and individual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RPnTl5ib2q5u8nbUPeQPwoP2fB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118170'),
  ('634943061091864940', 'Die Bademeister – Weiber, saufen, Leben retten', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Martin Walz, Stephan Schuh', 'Martin Ritzenhoff, Matthias Dinter', 'Michael Herbig, Hilmi Sözer, Dorkas Kiefer, Patricia Thielemann, Hanno Pöschl, Frank-Leo Schröder, Uli Krohm, Heinrich Giskes', null, 'Paul and Böller from Wanne-Eickel have a dream: they want to apply to be lifeguards on Sylt. Not because the two VoKuHiLa advocates love saving lives so much, but because they are hoping for a lot of beer and a pack of gorgeous women. Once they arrive on the tranquil island, the stylish high society quickly loses its cool thanks to the pair.', 'Paul and Böller from Wanne-Eickel have a dream: they want to apply to be lifeguards on Sylt. Not because the two VoKuHiLa advocates love saving lives so much, but because they are hoping for a lot of beer and a pack of gorgeous women. Once they arrive on the tranquil island, the stylish high society quickly loses its cool thanks to the pair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ams8bZ9b8oz0TsqafzVM52xFTrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11664'),
  ('525554652042285758', 'Die Bettwurst', 1971, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Rosa von Praunheim, Rosa von Praunheim, Peter Hartwell', 'Rosa von Praunheim', 'Luzi Kryn, Dietmar Kracht, Steven Adamczewski', null, 'It is love at first sight: elderly secretary Luzi and young, unemployed Dietmar find each other by accident in Rosa von Praunheim’s outrageous genre, social satire.', 'It is love at first sight: elderly secretary Luzi and young, unemployed Dietmar find each other by accident in Rosa von Praunheim’s outrageous genre, social satire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTfh48f2Ol46LunrFx2xL2XHaH1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1905'),
  ('743850753757695692', 'Die Bremer Stadtmusikanten', 2010, 'Family, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Philipp Timme, Dirk Regel', 'David Ungureit', 'Peter Striebeck, Harald Schmidt, Hannelore Elsner, Bastian Pastewka, Florian Martens, Gesine Cukrowski, Anna Fischer, Johannes Zirner', null, 'A man had a donkey that had carried the sacks to the mill for many years, but whose strength was now coming to an end, so that he became increasingly unfit for work.', 'A man had a donkey that had carried the sacks to the mill for many years, but whose strength was now coming to an end, so that he became increasingly unfit for work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sG1XtwprvBkwxcqGN5QRsnk9X9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1066387'),
  ('959953972535648603', 'Die Deutschmeister', 1955, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Ernst Marischka, Bruno Mondi', 'Ernst Marischka', 'Romy Schneider, Magda Schneider, Gretl Schörg, Susi Nicoletti, Adrienne Gessner, Hans Moser, Paul Hörbiger, Siegfried Breuer Jr.', null, 'Young Stanzi who is visiting Vienna helps a young corporal and musician to become famous for his marching song "Die Deutschmeister".', 'Young Stanzi who is visiting Vienna helps a young corporal and musician to become famous for his marching song "Die Deutschmeister".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3upr2JzyJui07hUu3fP9YV7cJS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6693'),
  ('660761300118071125', 'Die drei ??? – Toteninsel', 2026, 'Family, Crime, Adventure', 'Tim Dünschede, Daniel Rosness, Paul Baumann', 'Tim Dünschede, Anıl Kizilbuga', 'Julius Weckauf, Nevio Wendt, Levi Brandl, Momo Beier, Filip Schnack, Katja Lechthaler, Andreas Pietschmann, Jördis Triebel', null, 'The three investigators want to go on a road trip during their vacation, but just as they are about to set off, the phone rings and an unknown caller hands the trio of detectives their latest case: the archaeologists belonging to the secret society Sphinx are carrying out illegal excavations and selling the stolen art treasures. Their next target is the supposedly cursed island of Makatao.', 'The three investigators want to go on a road trip during their vacation, but just as they are about to set off, the phone rings and an unknown caller hands the trio of detectives their latest case: the archaeologists belonging to the secret society Sphinx are carrying out illegal excavations and selling the stolen art treasures. Their next target is the supposedly cursed island of Makatao.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQy8PqmhwRKuSmyb9eFdUe55B9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219542'),
  ('559056745836544293', 'Die fidelen Detektive', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Hermann Kugelstadt, Klaus König, Günther Rittau', 'L.A.C. Müller, Hans H. König', 'Joe Stöckel, Beppo Brem, Ernst Waldow, Lucie Englisch, Ethel Reschke, Vera Hösch, Peter Schwerdt, Wolfried Lier', null, 'Two retired Bavarian traffic police officers and a Berlin detective work together to track down jewelry thieves.', 'Two retired Bavarian traffic police officers and a Berlin detective work together to track down jewelry thieves.', null, 'tmdb:movie:5905'),
  ('105689153166459579', 'Die Geschichte der Menschheit - leicht gekürzt', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Erik Haffner, Gerhard Schirlo', 'Chris Geletneky, Erik Haffner, Claudius Pläging', 'Jeanette Hain, Christoph Maria Herbst, Jasmin Schwiers, Yung Ngo, Max Giermann, Matthias Matschke, Holger Stockhaus, Alexander Schubert', null, 'In order to leave a lasting impression in space, Dr. Georg Friedle and his team of researchers include a condensed version of world history with the 1977 Voyager mission. However, their attempt to present themselves as an intelligent and empathic race backfires unchecked: their version presents a completely insane species whose development is apparently based on pure luck rather than solid reason. A planet where Greek philosophers are celebrated as rap stars, religion is touted as a clever marketing concept, stag parties serve as a secret weapon in the First World War and the construction of the Great Wall of China is a misunderstanding of honest Berlin craftsmanship. Even the revelation of the alleged true background to the assassination attempt on Hitler is likely to make experienced historians see the end of humanity as a mere matter of time.', 'In order to leave a lasting impression in space, Dr. Georg Friedle and his team of researchers include a condensed version of world history with the 1977 Voyager mission. However, their attempt to present themselves as an intelligent and empathic race backfires unchecked: their version presents a completely insane species whose development is apparently based on pure luck rather than solid reason. A planet where Greek philosophers are celebrated as rap stars, religion is touted as a clever marketing concept, stag parties serve as a secret weapon in the First World War and the construction of the Great Wall of China is a misunderstanding of honest Berlin craftsmanship. Even the revelation of the alleged true background to the assassination attempt on Hitler is likely to make experienced historians see the end of humanity as a mere matter of time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6VGhaR0KkysQqk1QUTB6r6M78R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915646'),
  ('816390800208883489', 'Die Geschichte vom Brandner Kaspar', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Joseph Vilsmaier, Jörg Widmer', null, 'Franz Xaver Kroetz, Michael Herbig, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Alexander Held, Jörg Hube, Herbert Knaup, Detlev Buck, Elisabeth Trissenaar', null, '70-year old Brandner Kaspar lives with his granddaughter Nannerl in the mountains at the Schliersee. As he is visited by the Death and wants to take him, Brandner Kaspar tricks him and gets another 20 years of life.', '70-year old Brandner Kaspar lives with his granddaughter Nannerl in the mountains at the Schliersee. As he is visited by the Death and wants to take him, Brandner Kaspar tricks him and gets another 20 years of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApQSblNqdxp9iFT7Ui10xa3ovSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17008'),
  ('966995722180407894', 'Die grüne Lüge', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Werner Boote, Mario Hötschl, Dominik Spritzendorfer', null, 'Noam Chomsky, Kathrin Hartmann', null, 'Environmentally friendly electric cars, sustainably produced food products, fair production processes: Hurray! If everything the corporations tell us is true, we can save the world through our purchasing decisions alone! A popular and dangerous lie. In his new documentary film, Werner Boote shows us, together with environmental expert Kathrin Hartmann, how we can protect ourselves. Down with green lies!', 'Environmentally friendly electric cars, sustainably produced food products, fair production processes: Hurray! If everything the corporations tell us is true, we can save the world through our purchasing decisions alone! A popular and dangerous lie. In his new documentary film, Werner Boote shows us, together with environmental expert Kathrin Hartmann, how we can protect ourselves. Down with green lies!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oqYfd4SrOO55BtvIn0A9Ni11m6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500879'),
  ('194437374676322208', 'Die Hard', 1988, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jan de Bont, John McTiernan, Brent Boates', 'Jeb Stuart, Steven E. de Souza', 'Bruce Willis, Alan Rickman, Alexander Godunov, Bonnie Bedelia, Reginald VelJohnson, Paul Gleason, De''voreaux White, William Atherton', 'R', 'NYPD cop John McClane''s plan to reconcile with his estranged wife is thrown for a serious loop when, minutes after he arrives at her office''s Christmas Party, the entire building is overtaken by a group of terrorists. With little help from the LAPD, wisecracking McClane sets out to single-handedly rescue the hostages and bring the bad guys down.', 'NYPD cop John McClane''s plan to reconcile with his estranged wife is thrown for a serious loop when, minutes after he arrives at her office''s Christmas Party, the entire building is overtaken by a group of terrorists. With little help from the LAPD, wisecracking McClane sets out to single-handedly rescue the hostages and bring the bad guys down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Bjd8kfmDSOzpmhySpEhkUyK2oH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:562'),
  ('724276931778800659', 'Die Hard 2', 1990, 'Action, Thriller', 'Renny Harlin, Bruce Crone, Gayle Simon', 'Doug Richardson, Steven E. de Souza', 'Bruce Willis, Bonnie Bedelia, William Sadler, John Amos, Franco Nero, William Atherton, Dennis Franz, Art Evans', 'R', 'One year after his heroics in Los Angeles, John McClane is an off-duty cop who is the wrong guy in the wrong place at the wrong time. On a snowy Christmas Eve, as he waits for his wife''s plane to land at Washington Dulles International Airport, terrorists take over the air traffic control system in a plot to free a South American army general and drug smuggler being flown into the US to face drug charges. It''s now up to McClane to take on the terrorists, while coping with an inept airport police chief, an uncooperative anti-terrorist squad, and the life of his wife and everyone else trapped in planes circling overhead.', 'One year after his heroics in Los Angeles, John McClane is an off-duty cop who is the wrong guy in the wrong place at the wrong time. On a snowy Christmas Eve, as he waits for his wife''s plane to land at Washington Dulles International Airport, terrorists take over the air traffic control system in a plot to free a South American army general and drug smuggler being flown into the US to face drug charges. It''s now up to McClane to take on the terrorists, while coping with an inept airport police chief, an uncooperative anti-terrorist squad, and the life of his wife and everyone else trapped in planes circling overhead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybki0UWO3OPhaM6MSniuKC7sy1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1573'),
  ('468218742828234209', 'Die Hard Dracula', 1998, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Peter Horak', 'Peter Horak', 'Bruce Glover, Denny Sachen, Kerry Dustin, Ernest M. Garcia, Chaba Hrotko, Tom McGowan, Talia Botone, Nathalie Huot', null, 'We find Steven, a good-looking American hero devastated by the death of his girlfriend, wandering through Europe and looking for happiness. A car accident leads him to a small town sitting literally in the shadow of Dracula''s castle. The frightened villagers have been preyed upon for generations. Steven is stunned to discover Carla, the innkeeper''s daughter looks identical to his dead girlfriend. When she begs for his assistance against the vampire, he agrees to help them. Together with Dr. Van Helsing, he attacks Dracula using a variety of ingenious weapons against the supernatural. Dracula shows unusual powers that defeat them at every turn, including fireballs and lightning from his fingertips. He is constantly on a search for blood to satisfy his centuries-old bickering brides. When Dracula kidnaps Carla right out of her bed, Steven and Van Helsing desperately try to kill him before it is too late.', 'We find Steven, a good-looking American hero devastated by the death of his girlfriend, wandering through Europe and looking for happiness. A car accident leads him to a small town sitting literally in the shadow of Dracula''s castle. The frightened villagers have been preyed upon for generations. Steven is stunned to discover Carla, the innkeeper''s daughter looks identical to his dead girlfriend. When she begs for his assistance against the vampire, he agrees to help them. Together with Dr. Van Helsing, he attacks Dracula using a variety of ingenious weapons against the supernatural. Dracula shows unusual powers that defeat them at every turn, including fireballs and lightning from his fingertips. He is constantly on a search for blood to satisfy his centuries-old bickering brides. When Dracula kidnaps Carla right out of her bed, Steven and Van Helsing desperately try to kill him before it is too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Qvc0z01kA60aZ8xkMwMvSIdyz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31260'),
  ('591526427973910045', 'Die Hard: With a Vengeance', 1995, 'Action, Thriller', 'John McTiernan, Peter Menzies Jr., Peter Rogness', 'Jonathan Hensleigh', 'Bruce Willis, Jeremy Irons, Samuel L. Jackson, Larry Bryggman, Graham Greene, Anthony Peck, Nicholas Wyman, Kevin Chamberlin', 'R', 'New York detective John McClane is back and kicking bad-guy butt in the third installment of this action-packed series, which finds him teaming with civilian Zeus Carver to prevent the loss of innocent lives. McClane thought he''d seen it all, until a genius named Simon engages McClane, his new "partner" -- and his beloved city -- in a deadly game that demands their concentration.', 'New York detective John McClane is back and kicking bad-guy butt in the third installment of this action-packed series, which finds him teaming with civilian Zeus Carver to prevent the loss of innocent lives. McClane thought he''d seen it all, until a genius named Simon engages McClane, his new "partner" -- and his beloved city -- in a deadly game that demands their concentration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buqmCdFQEWwEpL3agGgg2GVjN2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1572'),
