  ('190926510873846256', 'Die Mädels vom Immenhof', 1955, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Wolfgang Schleif, Oskar Schnirch, Carl von Barany', 'Erich Ebermayer, Peer Baedecker, Wolfgang Schleif', 'Angelika Meissner, Heidi Brühl, Christiane König, Margarete Haagen, Paul Henckels, Paul Klinger, Josef Sieber, Matthias Fuchs', null, 'Granny Jantzen lives with her three granddaughters Dick, Dalli and Angela on the small pony farm Immenhof in Northern Germany. Since the breeding of ponies isn′t profitable anymore, Granny Jantzen is struggling to keep the family property. During the summer break , young Ethelbert is spending his holiday with his cousins at Immenhof. While Angela has fallen in love with the wealthy land owner Jochen von Roth, Dick and Dalli have to put up with bigheaded urbanite Ethelbert.', 'Granny Jantzen lives with her three granddaughters Dick, Dalli and Angela on the small pony farm Immenhof in Northern Germany. Since the breeding of ponies isn′t profitable anymore, Granny Jantzen is struggling to keep the family property. During the summer break , young Ethelbert is spending his holiday with his cousins at Immenhof. While Angela has fallen in love with the wealthy land owner Jochen von Roth, Dick and Dalli have to put up with bigheaded urbanite Ethelbert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXl1Sv1jMnzD4vuIX6PaxAHFPre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8419'),
  ('425031979877230364', 'Die Mamba', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Ali Samadi Ahadi', null, 'Michael Niavarani, Christoph Maria Herbst, Melika Foroutan, Tedros Teclebrhan, Proschat Madani, Max Herbrechter, Julie Engelbrecht, Monika Gruber', null, '"Die Mamba" is a top international terrorist. A deadly hand-to-hand fighter, sniper, explosives expert and master of masks and deception. Hossein Sarivi is a good husband and sound designer in a cookie factory. The two look very much alike, but their lives have had no points of contact. Until now...', '"Die Mamba" is a top international terrorist. A deadly hand-to-hand fighter, sniper, explosives expert and master of masks and deception. Hossein Sarivi is a good husband and sound designer in a cookie factory. The two look very much alike, but their lives have had no points of contact. Until now...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8aL5fMYNnNfFl9IYEaOtZwSoZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264592'),
  ('858486870163894523', 'Die Mauer – Berlin ''61', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Hartmut Schoen', 'Hartmut Schoen', 'Iris Berben, Johanna Gastdorf, Heino Ferch, Inka Friedrich, Sybille J. Schedwill, Axel Prahl, Frederick Lau, Wilfried Hochholdinger', null, 'August 1961: To earn a bit of West German money, East Berlin "plaselayer" Hans Kuhlke smuggles scrap metal to his friend Erwin Sawatzke in West Berlin. One evening, he and his wife are invited to the Sawatzkes'' house. Meanwhile, their son Paul stays with a friend in East Berlin. On this summer night, the political situation in Berlin comes to a dramatic head: the borders are closed and the construction of the Wall is initiated. The disappearance of his parents leaves 14-year-old pioneer Paul torn between family ties and loyalty to the party. At the last second, he sees through his role in the system and is taken in by his piano teacher. Together they plan their escape to the West - but it turns into a race against time.', 'August 1961: To earn a bit of West German money, East Berlin "plaselayer" Hans Kuhlke smuggles scrap metal to his friend Erwin Sawatzke in West Berlin. One evening, he and his wife are invited to the Sawatzkes'' house. Meanwhile, their son Paul stays with a friend in East Berlin. On this summer night, the political situation in Berlin comes to a dramatic head: the borders are closed and the construction of the Wall is initiated. The disappearance of his parents leaves 14-year-old pioneer Paul torn between family ties and loyalty to the party. At the last second, he sees through his role in the system and is taken in by his piano teacher. Together they plan their escape to the West - but it turns into a race against time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvRPkoenpoRWb9CBosTRNXLlRMr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266604'),
  ('38003995374485704', 'Die Musterknaben', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ralf Huettner, Hannes Hubach', 'Dominic Raacke, Ralf Huettner', 'Jürgen Tarrach, Oliver Korittke, Ellen ten Damme, Herbert Knaup, Alexander Held, Walter Gontermann, Wolfgang Maria Bauer, Annett Renneberg', null, 'Docker and Dretzke are two police officers from Cologne. But the cases here in the precinct don''t win them a flower pot at the CID. And so they find themselves at the bottom of the career ladder. When they are assigned by the Düsseldorf State Office of Criminal Investigation to work the night shift on an apartment where drugs are presumably being dealt during the day, they discover more than their Düsseldorf colleagues had planned...', 'Docker and Dretzke are two police officers from Cologne. But the cases here in the precinct don''t win them a flower pot at the CID. And so they find themselves at the bottom of the career ladder. When they are assigned by the Düsseldorf State Office of Criminal Investigation to work the night shift on an apartment where drugs are presumably being dealt during the day, they discover more than their Düsseldorf colleagues had planned...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFrFfkGZRSD0dPaMmbIUYSP05O9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11106'),
