  ('362934581037954181', 'Die Serpentintänzerin', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Max Skladanowsky', null, 'Ancion', null, 'A young woman dancer with large, flowing robes, swirls round herself quickly, making her light robe flow around her like a butterfly''s wings.', 'A young woman dancer with large, flowing robes, swirls round herself quickly, making her light robe flow around her like a butterfly''s wings.', null, 'tmdb:movie:189572'),
  ('287151429854652798', 'Die Sister, Die!', 1978, 'Horror', 'Michael Lonzo, Randall Hood', 'Tony Sawyer', 'Jack Ging, Edith Atwater, Antoinette Bower, Kent Smith, Bert Santos, Rita Conde, Jack Lester, Roger Hampton', 'PG', 'A man hires a nurse to care for his ailing but nasty and shrewish sister. What he really intends to do, however, is to convince the nurse to join him in a plot to kill her.', 'A man hires a nurse to care for his ailing but nasty and shrewish sister. What he really intends to do, however, is to convince the nurse to join him in a plot to kill her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8843Hgx3pHzTyERwiiNPjVi23SG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29423'),
  ('327433826348979585', 'Die Superbullen', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Gernot Roll, Gernot Roll', 'Franz Krause, Tom Gerhardt', 'Tom Gerhardt, Hilmi Sözer, Axel Stein, Thomas Heinze, Götz Otto, Anna Böttcher, Kordula Kohlschmitt, Franka Much', null, 'Tommie and Mario are on the prowl again. But this time not through the alcohol haze of Cologne Kalk or the Ballermann Club on Mallorca but through the German underworld. For a while, at least, because the police want to get rid of their two most stupid employees by far as soon as possible. When the billy goat "Hennes", the mascot of the 1st FC Cologne, is kidnapped, they see their chance for rehabilitation and rush to save their favorite club. Their investigation leads them across Germany, then they get it: "Hennes" must be in Munich - with the arch-rival of FC Bayern, who is targeting the morale of the troops of Cologne soccer with his outrageous kidnapping...', 'Tommie and Mario are on the prowl again. But this time not through the alcohol haze of Cologne Kalk or the Ballermann Club on Mallorca but through the German underworld. For a while, at least, because the police want to get rid of their two most stupid employees by far as soon as possible. When the billy goat "Hennes", the mascot of the 1st FC Cologne, is kidnapped, they see their chance for rehabilitation and rush to save their favorite club. Their investigation leads them across Germany, then they get it: "Hennes" must be in Munich - with the arch-rival of FC Bayern, who is targeting the morale of the troops of Cologne soccer with his outrageous kidnapping...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3MJ8CyNnVOgcvuQKdofohxOVB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52171'),
  ('1132518113903060140', 'Die Supernasen', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Dieter Pröttel, Fritz Baader, Otto Kirchhoff', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Mike Krüger', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Mike Krüger, Liane Hielscher, Gert Haucke, Susann B. Winter, Andrea L''Arronge, Harald Dietl, Ingeborg Schöner', null, 'Tommy loses his job as a make-up artist at Bayerischer Rundfunk after fogging an announcer with hairspray and then insulting her; Mike is dumped by his girlfriend because, on the one hand, he only cares about his music and, on the other hand, he is financially stranded. So they both need money and decide to become detectives. On behalf of a rich industrialist, they are to shadow his wife and take photos of her cheating. So Mike and Tommy travel to Bad Spänzer, where the lady is staying. But she is as faithful as gold, so Mike, disguised as a Prussian, makes advances to her so that Tommy can take the required photos. But Tommy soon has to slip into a costume, too: Since Tommy looks deceptively similar to an Arab sheik, he is hired by the sheik''s secret service to double him. What Tommy doesn''t know: assassins want to kill the sheikh at all costs.', 'Tommy loses his job as a make-up artist at Bayerischer Rundfunk after fogging an announcer with hairspray and then insulting her; Mike is dumped by his girlfriend because, on the one hand, he only cares about his music and, on the other hand, he is financially stranded. So they both need money and decide to become detectives. On behalf of a rich industrialist, they are to shadow his wife and take photos of her cheating. So Mike and Tommy travel to Bad Spänzer, where the lady is staying. But she is as faithful as gold, so Mike, disguised as a Prussian, makes advances to her so that Tommy can take the required photos. But Tommy soon has to slip into a costume, too: Since Tommy looks deceptively similar to an Arab sheik, he is hired by the sheik''s secret service to double him. What Tommy doesn''t know: assassins want to kill the sheikh at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swuEI62oB90tuHGkplbNtELJixd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11981'),
  ('499896193198247158', 'Die Tomorrow', 2017, 'Drama', 'Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit, Niramon Ross', 'Nawapol Thamrongrattanarit', 'Patcha Poonpiriya, Chonnikan Netjui, Chutimon Chuengcharoensukying, Morakot Liu, Sunny Suwanmethanon, Rattanrat Eertaweekul, Jarinporn Joonkiat, Violette Wautier', null, 'Die Tomorrow entails six short segments about the impermanence of life, all inspired by deaths reported in Thai daily newspapers.', 'Die Tomorrow entails six short segments about the impermanence of life, all inspired by deaths reported in Thai daily newspapers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLkLHVK1Tx3P13ikc3wzB2TWIKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488508'),
  ('136741497691457928', 'Die Vergesslichkeit der Eichhörnchen', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Holly Fink, Nadine Heinze, Marc Dietschreit', 'Marc Dietschreit, Nadine Heinze', 'Emilia Schüle, Günther Maria Halmer, Fabian Hinrichs, Anna Stieblich, Masha Tokareva, Yanina Lisovskaya, Hede Beck, Fritz Roth', null, 'Ukrainian Marija works in Germany as a 24-hour carer to support her family back home. Here she looks after Curt, who suffers from dementia, around the clock. When Curt''s controlling daughter stays away due to an accident, Curt begins to think Marija is his deceased wife. In order to have her peace of mind, Marija plays along with the game and she realizes that this makes Curt feel better. But there is also Curt''s son, who is more interested in Marija than in Curt.', 'Ukrainian Marija works in Germany as a 24-hour carer to support her family back home. Here she looks after Curt, who suffers from dementia, around the clock. When Curt''s controlling daughter stays away due to an accident, Curt begins to think Marija is his deceased wife. In order to have her peace of mind, Marija plays along with the game and she realizes that this makes Curt feel better. But there is also Curt''s son, who is more interested in Marija than in Curt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHoPwY3ydABZHFXDiptRJtYcAF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777940'),
  ('1079406271191848546', 'Die Whistleblowerin', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Elmar Fischer, Bjørn Haneld', 'Holger Joos, Elmar Fischer', 'Artjom Gilz, Katharina Nesytowa, Jennifer Ulrich, Christian Erdmann, Paul Michael Stiehler, Emilia Diekmann, Aybi Era, Clelia Sarto', null, 'Suddenly the Russian Galina reappears in her ex-boyfriend Tom''s life and asks him to contact his sister, who heads the crisis team at the Foreign Office. Galina offers herself as a whistleblower to Germany after hackers specifically attacked the computer systems of the Berlin Central Hospital. She has the code that can thwart further attacks, but in return she demands money, asylum and inclusion in a witness protection program for herself and her young daughter.', 'Suddenly the Russian Galina reappears in her ex-boyfriend Tom''s life and asks him to contact his sister, who heads the crisis team at the Foreign Office. Galina offers herself as a whistleblower to Germany after hackers specifically attacked the computer systems of the Berlin Central Hospital. She has the code that can thwart further attacks, but in return she demands money, asylum and inclusion in a witness protection program for herself and her young daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/os4t9e7ISpQoOwXGk27iwoxoe0X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1172650'),
  ('142899565081837670', 'Die Wunderübung', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Kreihsl, Wolfgang Thaler', 'Michael Kreihsl', 'Aglaia Szyszkowitz, Devid Striesow, Erwin Steinhauer', null, 'Joana and Valentin Dorek are a married couple going through a crisis. This prompts them to take a trial session with a couple’s therapist. In the therapist’s consulting room they start off with their standard programme: she won’t stop talking and he isn’t even listening. The broken communication between the couple is a real challenge for the therapist. He is almost at his wits’ end when his mobile rings and a surprising message brings chaos into their therapy session.', 'Joana and Valentin Dorek are a married couple going through a crisis. This prompts them to take a trial session with a couple’s therapist. In the therapist’s consulting room they start off with their standard programme: she won’t stop talking and he isn’t even listening. The broken communication between the couple is a real challenge for the therapist. He is almost at his wits’ end when his mobile rings and a surprising message brings chaos into their therapy session.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhw8zNTX7uiTm5UUwRqrwSrYrkj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517937'),
  ('310849893343718393', 'Die, Mommie, Die!', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Mark Rucker, Kelly Evans', 'Charles Busch', 'Charles Busch, Natasha Lyonne, Stark Sands, Frances Conroy, Philip Baker Hall, Jason Priestley, Nora Dunn, Stanley DeSantis', 'R', 'Angela Arden is a washed up, has-been singing star who is trapped in a hateful marriage to film producer Sol Sussman. In an attempt to escape her marriage so that she can be with a hunky layabout, she poisons her husband. However, Angela''s manipulative daughter, gay son and alcoholic maid are not going to make it easy for her.', 'Angela Arden is a washed up, has-been singing star who is trapped in a hateful marriage to film producer Sol Sussman. In an attempt to escape her marriage so that she can be with a hunky layabout, she poisons her husband. However, Angela''s manipulative daughter, gay son and alcoholic maid are not going to make it easy for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shWps7YrqBPujesJQrIoHnhGhZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43708'),
  ('125557289515971128', 'Die, Monster, Die!', 1965, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Daniel Haller, Philip Martell, Paul Beeson', 'Jerry Sohl', 'Boris Karloff, Nick Adams, Suzan Farmer, Freda Jackson, Terence de Marney, Patrick Magee, Sheila Raynor, Harold Goodwin', null, 'A young man visits his fiancé''s estate to discover that her wheelchair-bound scientist father has discovered a meteorite that emits mutating radiation rays that have turned the plants in his greenhouse to giants. When his own wife falls victim to this mysterious power, the old man takes it upon himself to destroy the glowing object with disastrous results.', 'A young man visits his fiancé''s estate to discover that her wheelchair-bound scientist father has discovered a meteorite that emits mutating radiation rays that have turned the plants in his greenhouse to giants. When his own wife falls victim to this mysterious power, the old man takes it upon himself to destroy the glowing object with disastrous results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zv7z3cfHGg9TwDfInxsSRAzWc6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29067'),
  ('293826096158939856', 'Die''ced: Reloaded', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jeremy Rudd', 'Jeremy Rudd', 'Eden Campbell, Jason Brooks, Nigel Vonas, Collin Fischer, John Karyus, Esha More, Mahsa Shokri', 'NR', 'Benny escapes an asylum on Halloween, masked as a scarecrow and hungry for blood. In 1980s Seattle, the hunt is on - and no one is safe.', 'Benny escapes an asylum on Halloween, masked as a scarecrow and hungry for blood. In 1980s Seattle, the hunt is on - and no one is safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haFDZfpKszHq7DXvuQd5Zz7shQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1503900'),
  ('503440491906703511', 'Diebuster: The Movie', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Atsushi Nishigori, Masahiko Otsuka, Katsuichi Nakayama', 'Yoji Enokido', 'Yukari Fukui, Maaya Sakamoto, Miyuki Sawashiro, Mitsuo Iwata, Takumi Yamazaki, Sanae Kobayashi, Yuki Matsuoka, Nozomu Sasaki', null, 'Nono is a clumsy waitress who dreams of becoming a space pilot. One day, she meets Lal''C Melk Mark, a member of the elite psychic pilot team "Topless." But when space monsters appear from out of nowhere to wreak havoc on Mars, Lal''C calls out her Buster Machine—codenamed "Dix-Neuf"—to subdue the threat. During a battle with a Space Monster, Lal''C gets the surprise of her life when she sees Nono use her super-strength to help Dix-Neuf destroy the alien. From that point, Nono hangs along with Lal''C in hopes of becoming a member of Topless.', 'Nono is a clumsy waitress who dreams of becoming a space pilot. One day, she meets Lal''C Melk Mark, a member of the elite psychic pilot team "Topless." But when space monsters appear from out of nowhere to wreak havoc on Mars, Lal''C calls out her Buster Machine—codenamed "Dix-Neuf"—to subdue the threat. During a battle with a Space Monster, Lal''C gets the surprise of her life when she sees Nono use her super-strength to help Dix-Neuf destroy the alien. From that point, Nono hangs along with Lal''C in hopes of becoming a member of Topless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vC5yypsMvYqsHYJsAEpgRfbfrWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426183'),
  ('45061407495225719', 'Diego Maradona', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Asif Kapadia', null, 'Diego Maradona, Pelé, Dalma Maradona, Daniel Arcucci, Alberto Bigon, Gonzalo Bonadeo, Corrado Ferlaino, Ciro Ferrara', null, 'Constructed from over 500 hours of never-before-seen footage, this documentary centers on the personal life and career of the controversial football player Diego Maradona who played for SSC Napoli and Argentina in the 1980s.', 'Constructed from over 500 hours of never-before-seen footage, this documentary centers on the personal life and career of the controversial football player Diego Maradona who played for SSC Napoli and Argentina in the 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eBZxi0xcXBnEYq4m4YTVf0eHWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536841'),
  ('303658135980960010', 'Diên Biên Phu', 1992, 'Drama, War', 'Pierre Schoendoerffer, Bernard Lutic, Quốc Trọng', 'Pierre Schoendoerffer', 'Donald Pleasence, Patrick Catalifo, Jean-François Balmer, Ludmila Mikaël, François Négret, Maxime Leroux, Raoul Billerey, Thế Anh', null, 'Vietnam, 1954. An American reporter finds himself in the middle of the battle of Điện Biên Phủ, between the French army and the Vietminh.', 'Vietnam, 1954. An American reporter finds himself in the middle of the battle of Điện Biên Phủ, between the French army and the Vietminh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snqmAzSevLzf8hip90clpdIvVip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74714'),
