  ('1108970146961918239', 'Diés Iraé', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rahul Sadasivan, Shehnad Jalal, Lekshmi Mohan', 'Rahul Sadasivan', 'Pranav Mohanlal, Gibin Gopinath, Swathi Das Prabhu, Manohari Joy, Arun Ajikumar, Jaya Kurup, Athulya Chandra, Sushmitha Bhat', null, 'Rohan''s affluent lifestyle spirals out of control as he becomes convinced there is a supernatural entity in his home. As he starts to uncover the mystery, he is drawn into unexpected worlds and alliances, along with the horrors that lie ahead.', 'Rohan''s affluent lifestyle spirals out of control as he becomes convinced there is a supernatural entity in his home. As he starts to uncover the mystery, he is drawn into unexpected worlds and alliances, along with the horrors that lie ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/123DlTiiezgLaJruVe7RiSi0RFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1396869'),
  ('771188525571252027', 'Dieter - Der Film', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Toby Genkel, Michael Schaack, Graham Tiernan', 'Michael Schaack', 'Dieter Bohlen, Bertram Hiese, Antonia von Romatowski, Harry Wijnvoord, Wolfgang Völz, Ruth Rockenschaub, Jan-David Rönfeldt, Robert Missler', null, 'Dieters grandma knew it from the start. This guy will be special one. She should be right. Even as a child Dieter shows an enormous power when it is necessary to enforce his will. He quickly learn that you can not only impress the girls, but also make a lot of money as a musician. He understands that the success is mainly a question of the postage costs and a healthy liver. That you may not always tell the truth, but you should always have something lying on the high edge.', 'Dieters grandma knew it from the start. This guy will be special one. She should be right. Even as a child Dieter shows an enormous power when it is necessary to enforce his will. He quickly learn that you can not only impress the girls, but also make a lot of money as a musician. He understands that the success is mainly a question of the postage costs and a healthy liver. That you may not always tell the truth, but you should always have something lying on the high edge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKuF50MPc6GKuqiCCiW37Rvr7NU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9551'),
  ('742345970932327211', 'Dietro la notte', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Davide Manca, Daniele Falleri', 'Daniele Falleri', 'Fortunato Cerlino, Roberta Giarrusso, Stefania Rocca, Elisa Visari, Daniele Nicoli, Sebastian Gimelli Morosini, Jonis Bashir, Marius Bizău', null, 'At dawn Marta will have to leave for Dubai carrying with her a large load of diamonds. She would like to share the night with Bruno, her new partner, opposed by her daughter Elena and her sister Giulia. The two lovers should be alone, but their peaceful evening suddenly turns into a nightmare.', 'At dawn Marta will have to leave for Dubai carrying with her a large load of diamonds. She would like to share the night with Bruno, her new partner, opposed by her daughter Elena and her sister Giulia. The two lovers should be alone, but their peaceful evening suddenly turns into a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1qZxNk64lJ4R9V9qRqUnoZQpRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:705714'),
  ('710870480823985167', 'Dieudonné - Le Divorce de Patrick', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Pierre-Yves Parrinet, Dieudonné, Dieudonné', 'Dieudonné', 'Dieudonné, Brigitte Tanguy', null, 'Dieudonné receives his friend Patrick. The latter is in the midst of a depression following his divorce from his wife Sandrine. Dieudonné then comes to talk about couples'' problems, romantic encounters, the effects of several years of married life, the role of a parent, children in the midst of divorce. In the course of his development, he even comes to the subject of war, religions, the attacks of September 11. In short, a whole program!', 'Dieudonné receives his friend Patrick. The latter is in the midst of a depression following his divorce from his wife Sandrine. Dieudonné then comes to talk about couples'' problems, romantic encounters, the effects of several years of married life, the role of a parent, children in the midst of divorce. In the course of his development, he even comes to the subject of war, religions, the attacks of September 11. In short, a whole program!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8T9R2naiYd7rf7boA9WswG2zvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65228'),
  ('121345594287591035', 'Dieudonné - Pardon Judas !', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Dieudonné, Pierre-Yves Parrinet, Yann Chevillard', 'Dieudonné', 'Dieudonné, Brigitte Tanguy, Jacky Sigaux, Sotha, Romain Bouteille, Didier Bénureau', null, 'After his betrayal, Judas did not go hang himself, but instead embarked on a 2000-year wandering, carrying the weight of infamy (his betrayal of Jesus), before reappearing in the midst of the Algerian desert.', 'After his betrayal, Judas did not go hang himself, but instead embarked on a 2000-year wandering, carrying the weight of infamy (his betrayal of Jesus), before reappearing in the midst of the Algerian desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6bZlCcPrJ2WR09Wf6TzVuzD3FD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76881'),
  ('99651957877940612', 'Dieumerci !', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Lucien Jean-Baptiste', null, 'Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Baptiste Lecaplain, Delphine Théodore, Olivier Sitruk, Firmine Richard, Jean-François Balmer, Michel Jonasz, Édouard Montoute', null, 'A 44 year old guy gets out of jail and wants to become an actor.', 'A 44 year old guy gets out of jail and wants to become an actor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPgxFN0hAjOLMZ3y74tTpENSW6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375895'),
  ('561952634129232736', 'Different for Girls', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Richard Spence, Sean Van Hales', 'Tony Marchant', 'Rupert Graves, Steven Mackintosh, Miriam Margolyes, Charlotte Coleman, Saskia Reeves, Nisha Nayar, Neil Dudgeon, Adrian Rawlins', null, 'Paul and Kim meet when their vehicles collide. Paul is fascinated with the attractive Kim. It turns out that the two were childhood friends in Catholic boys'' school, but back then, before the operation, Kim was named Karl.', 'Paul and Kim meet when their vehicles collide. Paul is fascinated with the attractive Kim. It turns out that the two were childhood friends in Catholic boys'' school, but back then, before the operation, Kim was named Karl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWO2iXpqQY3S4WhXRvf0B18QVR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106837'),
  ('321829473885917685', 'Different from the Others', 1919, 'Drama', 'Richard Oswald, Max Fassbender', 'Richard Oswald, Magnus Hirschfeld', 'Conrad Veidt, Anita Berber, Magnus Hirschfeld, Reinhold Schünzel, Fritz Schulz, Leo Connard, Ilse von Tasso-Lind, Ernst Pittschau', null, 'Conrad Veidt plays a famous musician who is blackmailed for being gay. Eventually he stands trial and is convicted. At the end the film pleads for the abolition of §175 (the law that punishes homosexuality).', 'Conrad Veidt plays a famous musician who is blackmailed for being gay. Eventually he stands trial and is convicted. At the end the film pleads for the abolition of §175 (the law that punishes homosexuality).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgORpP8DlLbkcH4eFACBcGztw6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44441'),
  ('784578120241625319', 'Different from Whom?', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Umberto Riccioni Carteni', 'Fabio Bonifacci', 'Luca Argentero, Claudia Gerini, Filippo Nigro, Francesco Pannofino, Giuseppe Cederna, Antonio Catania, Rinaldo Rocco, Zita Fusco', null, 'Political strategists in a northern Italian city push gay-rights campaigner Piero into the mayoral race, pairing him with uptight conservative toughie Adele. Piero and his partner, Remo, are the stable ones, while buttoned-up divorcee Adele nurses her bitterness.', 'Political strategists in a northern Italian city push gay-rights campaigner Piero into the mayoral race, pairing him with uptight conservative toughie Adele. Piero and his partner, Remo, are the stable ones, while buttoned-up divorcee Adele nurses her bitterness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVViz61H2hyasuNVtPfpPEcQtVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22786'),
  ('612299998302078208', 'Different Kinds of Rain', 2018, 'Drama', 'Isabel Prahl, Andreas Köhler', 'Karin Kaçi', 'Bjarne Mädel, Bibiana Beglau, Emma Bading, Louis Hofmann, Janina Fautz, Natalia Bobyleva, Manfred Böll, Therese Dürrenberger', null, 'The door has been closed for many weeks. A teenager has locked himself in - shutting out a helpless father, mother and sister. In Japan, youths like him have already been given a name: Hikikomori (the secluded). The phenomenon is also beginning to spread throughout the Western world. This is all the family has been able to find out. All they can do is stand in front of the locked door and ask, beg, implore, throw tantrums, despair, accuse, ignore and hope. All the while, the door increasingly becomes a mirror of their own lives.', 'The door has been closed for many weeks. A teenager has locked himself in - shutting out a helpless father, mother and sister. In Japan, youths like him have already been given a name: Hikikomori (the secluded). The phenomenon is also beginning to spread throughout the Western world. This is all the family has been able to find out. All they can do is stand in front of the locked door and ask, beg, implore, throw tantrums, despair, accuse, ignore and hope. All the while, the door increasingly becomes a mirror of their own lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evgvK5GH0o7sMTfPVncvdzdUCwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432676'),
  ('256822649974031490', 'Different Strokes', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Paul Girard, Gerald M. Williams', 'Michael Paul Girard, Migdia Chinea Varela', 'Dana Plato, Bentley Mitchum, Landon Hall, David Millbern, Gabriella Hall, Michelle Trongone, Carl Solomon', 'R', 'A Los Angeles fashion model falls in love with a female art director during a photo shoot which puts their newfound romance at odds with the model''s photographer boyfriend.', 'A Los Angeles fashion model falls in love with a female art director during a photo shoot which puts their newfound romance at odds with the model''s photographer boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0CdyzANXOCaFbzMSznfAZxRPiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135415'),
  ('42719351943226771', 'Difficult Days', 1988, 'Crime, Drama', 'Alejandro Pelayo', 'Víctor Hugo Rascón Banda', 'Alejandro Parodi, Blanca Guerra, Fernando Balzaretti, Luis Manuel Pelayo, Beatriz Aguirre, Alfredo Sevilla, Aarón Hernán, Guillermo Gil', null, 'Two shareholder brothers close several factories due to economic problems, except for their chemical plants.', 'Two shareholder brothers close several factories due to economic problems, except for their chemical plants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shnf9zN92MkiYRVVAffcxDu4yVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540744'),
  ('693208312085775606', 'Difficult Years', 1948, 'Drama', 'Luigi Zampa, Francesco De Feo, Mauro Bolognini', 'Franco Evangelisti, Enrico Fulchignoni', 'Umberto Spadaro, Ave Ninchi, Enzo Biliotti, Massimo Girotti, Delia Scala, Ernesto Almirante, Aldo Silvani, Miro Zonda', null, 'Aldo Piscitello, a minor government clerk, is forced in 1934 to join the Fascist party. When the war comes, he finds himself able only to talk ineffectually in secret against Mussolini, even as his own son Giovanni is sent into battle. By the end of the war, Aldo has found the courage to stand up for his beliefs, but by then it is too late.', 'Aldo Piscitello, a minor government clerk, is forced in 1934 to join the Fascist party. When the war comes, he finds himself able only to talk ineffectually in secret against Mussolini, even as his own son Giovanni is sent into battle. By the end of the war, Aldo has found the courage to stand up for his beliefs, but by then it is too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9XUvn1TDWsoe5haSrS5zNDhn9p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94770'),
  ('1136993911814705263', 'Dig', 2022, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'K. Asher Levin', 'Banipal Ablakhad, Benhur Ablakhad', 'Thomas Jane, Harlow Jane, Emile Hirsch, Liana Liberato, Makana David, Diego Romero, Michael Vincent Berry, Arthur Rodriguez', 'R', 'A widower and his deaf daughter are held hostage and forced to dig under their house, revealing dark secrets from the past.', 'A widower and his deaf daughter are held hostage and forced to dig under their house, revealing dark secrets from the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntD0ieBgZ1AlV0tAam3aeFDH6k7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816956'),
  ('475958804531168466', 'Dig Two Graves', 2014, 'Mystery, Thriller, Fantasy, Horror', 'Hunter Adams', 'Hunter Adams, Jeremy Phillips', 'Ted Levine, Samantha Isler, Danny Goldring, Troy Ruptash, Rachael Drummond, Bradley Grant Smith, Mark Lancaster, Mikush Lleshdedaj', null, 'A girl''s obsession with her brother''s disappearance leads her on a nightmarish journey through a small town''s Gothic landscape where she is faced with a deadly proposition. How far will she go to save the people she loves?', 'A girl''s obsession with her brother''s disappearance leads her on a nightmarish journey through a small town''s Gothic landscape where she is faced with a deadly proposition. How far will she go to save the people she loves?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Nyhc5JrWiRMuDm4iDIs1PDqzss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326420'),
  ('75643865714862842', 'Dig!', 2004, 'Documentary, Music', 'Ondi Timoner, Vasco Nunes, David Timoner', 'Ondi Timoner', 'Anton Newcombe, Courtney Taylor-Taylor, Joel Gion, Matt Hollywood, Peter Holmström, Zia McCabe, Brent DeBoer, Eric Hedford', 'R', 'A documentary on the once promising American rock bands The Brian Jonestown Massacre and The Dandy Warhols. The friendship between respective founders, Anton Newcombe and Courtney Taylor, escalated into bitter rivalry as the Dandy Warhols garnered major international success while the Brian Jonestown Massacre imploded in a haze of drugs.', 'A documentary on the once promising American rock bands The Brian Jonestown Massacre and The Dandy Warhols. The friendship between respective founders, Anton Newcombe and Courtney Taylor, escalated into bitter rivalry as the Dandy Warhols garnered major international success while the Brian Jonestown Massacre imploded in a haze of drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTE7ODSgIvYUBNhkSnW3qL2h4mi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1843'),
  ('176420519080986804', 'Digby, the Biggest Dog in the World', 1973, 'Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Joseph McGrath', 'Michael Pertwee', 'Jim Dale, Spike Milligan, Angela Douglas, John Bluthal, Norman Rossington, Milo O''Shea, Richard Beaumont, Dinsdale Landen', null, 'Digby consumes a bowl of Project X, a liquid growth formula. Soon, he becomes a sheepdog of gigantic size!', 'Digby consumes a bowl of Project X, a liquid growth formula. Soon, he becomes a sheepdog of gigantic size!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/octObGSw4okoQZvvTrq4L1FZfZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18188'),
  ('109947959600331182', 'Digger', 2021, 'Drama', 'Georgis Grigorakis, Giorgos Karvelas', 'Georgis Grigorakis', 'Vangelis Mourikis, Argyris Pandazaras, Sofia Kokkali, Theo Alexander, Vasilis Anastasiou, Vasilis Bisbikis, Michalis Iatropoulos, Pavlos Iordanopoulos', null, 'When Jonny visits his father Nikitas in his cabin in the woods after 20 years, the hermit ignores him. But to prevent the muddy ground from being pulled out from under their feet for reasons of profit, father and son must dig deep into it...', 'When Jonny visits his father Nikitas in his cabin in the woods after 20 years, the hermit ignores him. But to prevent the muddy ground from being pulled out from under their feet for reasons of profit, father and son must dig deep into it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4VjQ9zw291HUKz1euHpnhE00tE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656272'),
  ('611853352449597728', 'Digger', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Adventure', 'Alejandro González Iñárritu, Emmanuel Lubezki, Terry Needham', 'Alejandro González Iñárritu, Alexander Dinelaris, Nicolás Giacobone', 'Tom Cruise, Sandra Hüller, John Goodman, Riz Ahmed, Jesse Plemons, Sophie Wilde, Michael Stuhlbarg, Emma D''Arcy', null, 'The most powerful man in the world embarks on a frantic mission to prove he is humanity''s saviour before the disaster he’s unleashed destroys everything.', 'The most powerful man in the world embarks on a frantic mission to prove he is humanity''s saviour before the disaster he’s unleashed destroys everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAvpvFXxbaeNmhcHwVPtZyLh76X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1248832'),
  ('28524184825160197', 'Diggers', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Katherine Dieckmann, Michael McDonough', 'Ken Marino', 'Paul Rudd, Lauren Ambrose, Josh Hamilton, Ron Eldard, Ken Marino, Sarah Paulson, Maura Tierney, Beeson Carroll', 'R', 'In 1976, four working-class friends come of age in The Hamptons, on the South Shore of Long Island, New York, as clam diggers, as were their fathers and their grandfathers before them. They must cope with and learn to face the changing times in both their personal lives and their neighborhood.', 'In 1976, four working-class friends come of age in The Hamptons, on the South Shore of Long Island, New York, as clam diggers, as were their fathers and their grandfathers before them. They must cope with and learn to face the changing times in both their personal lives and their neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npNZT7xFFTMtEQjM7FrCe31fAxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17439'),
  ('861561148843836642', 'Diggerz: Black Lung Rises', 2019, 'Horror', 'David B. Craig, Kirk Loudon', 'David B. Craig, Kirk Loudon', 'Lauren Leal, Steven Roth, Damon Pampolina, Alex Niva, Johanna Winkel, Erin Presley-Froemke', null, 'An evil creature attacks a small mining town. A college student and a cranky outcast must uncover the mystery of the creature''s past to put an end to the bloodshed.', 'An evil creature attacks a small mining town. A college student and a cranky outcast must uncover the mystery of the creature''s past to put an end to the bloodshed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Qz3GbFT9Ge0ZIlMJCYw6mt0N95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549646'),
  ('623313462329918301', 'Digging for Fire', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joe Swanberg, Ben Richardson', 'Jake Johnson, Joe Swanberg', 'Jake Johnson, Rosemarie DeWitt, Jude Swanberg, Alicia Van Couvering, Timothy Simons, Jenny Slate, Jeff Baena, Mike Birbiglia', 'R', 'Tim and Lee are married with a young child. The chance to stay at a fancy home in the Hollywood Hills is complicated by Tim''s discovery of a bone and a rusty old gun in the yard. Tim is excited by the idea of a mystery, but Lee doesn''t want him to dig any further, preferring that he focus on the family taxes, which he promised to do weeks ago. This disagreement sends them on separate and unexpected adventures over the course of a weekend, as Tim and his friends seek clues to the mystery while Lee searches for answers to the bigger questions of marriage and parenthood.', 'Tim and Lee are married with a young child. The chance to stay at a fancy home in the Hollywood Hills is complicated by Tim''s discovery of a bone and a rusty old gun in the yard. Tim is excited by the idea of a mystery, but Lee doesn''t want him to dig any further, preferring that he focus on the family taxes, which he promised to do weeks ago. This disagreement sends them on separate and unexpected adventures over the course of a weekend, as Tim and his friends seek clues to the mystery while Lee searches for answers to the bigger questions of marriage and parenthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJjT0uoqWl2ETSshtNg3Wv2MkMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295490'),
  ('893222483106470140', 'Digging to China', 1997, 'Drama', 'Timothy Hutton, Jörgen Persson', 'Karen Janszen', 'Evan Rachel Wood, Kevin Bacon, Mary Stuart Masterson, Marian Seldes, Cathy Moriarty, Bing Putney, Joanne Pankow, J.C. Quinn', 'PG', 'Precocious young Harriet and her older sister Gwen live at their mother''s motel in small-town New Hampshire. Harriet dreams of a life beyond her inattentive family and the stultifying town. A mentally disabled man named Ricky comes to stay at the motel, and Harriet finds him kinder and more interesting than anyone she has ever met. After tragedy strikes, Harriet and Ricky cling to each other ever more tightly.', 'Precocious young Harriet and her older sister Gwen live at their mother''s motel in small-town New Hampshire. Harriet dreams of a life beyond her inattentive family and the stultifying town. A mentally disabled man named Ricky comes to stay at the motel, and Harriet finds him kinder and more interesting than anyone she has ever met. After tragedy strikes, Harriet and Ricky cling to each other ever more tightly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31jIfBKT9f0wWnsZW1DfAFJfZLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31641'),
  ('183880024474625959', 'Digging Up the Marrow', 2015, 'Horror', 'Adam Green', 'Adam Green', 'Ray Wise, Adam Green, Kane Hodder, Mick Garris, Rileah Vanderbilt, Josh Ethier, Tom Holland, Sarah Elbert', 'NR', 'A documentary filmmaker turns his lens on an enigmatic conspiracy theorist who claims he''s found the entrance to a vast underground city populated entirely by monsters.', 'A documentary filmmaker turns his lens on an enigmatic conspiracy theorist who claims he''s found the entrance to a vast underground city populated entirely by monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCE04zhX6TSQF1VvViyVTBVqvkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279972'),
  ('580640913693024832', 'Diggstown', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Ritchie, Thomas J. Mack, Gerry Fisher', 'Steven McKay', 'James Woods, Louis Gossett Jr., Oliver Platt, Heather Graham, Randall ''Tex'' Cobb, Thomas Wilson Brown, Bruce Dern, Marshall Bell', 'R', 'Gabriel Caine has just been released from prison when he sets up a bet with a business man who owns most of Diggstown, a boxing-mad town. The bet is that Gabe can find a boxer that will knock out 10 Diggstown men, in a boxing ring, within 24 hours. Roy ''Honey'' Palmer is that man that, at 48, many say he is too old.', 'Gabriel Caine has just been released from prison when he sets up a bet with a business man who owns most of Diggstown, a boxing-mad town. The bet is that Gabe can find a boxer that will knock out 10 Diggstown men, in a boxing ring, within 24 hours. Roy ''Honey'' Palmer is that man that, at 48, many say he is too old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJ0VsONJzyctlYX8W2rL8TQ4wD9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19143'),
  ('689929681176112566', 'Digimon Adventure', 1999, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Takaaki Yamashita, Shigeru Ando', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Toshiko Fujita, Kae Araki, Chika Sakamoto, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Yumi Touma, Hiroya Ishimaru', 'PG', 'Two children receive a strange egg that hatches into their very first Digimon, leading to the night that would change their lives forever.', 'Two children receive a strange egg that hatches into their very first Digimon, leading to the night that would change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tn65LMkjjFFRdhwV2eSFH3WRlwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97787'),
  ('455510543751191265', 'Digimon Adventure 02: Revenge of Diaboromon', 2001, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Science Fiction', 'Hiroyuki Kakudou, Kanta Kamei, Kazuto Nakazawa', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Reiko Kiuchi, Junko Noda, Rio Natsuki, Koichi Tochika, Megumi Urawa, Taisuke Yamamoto, Miwa Matsumoto, Kae Araki', 'PG', 'The DigiDestined go up against Diaboromon again. Tai and Matt head back to the Internet to deal with him with Omnimon, while the younger Chosen Children go to deal with the rampage of a swarm of Kuramon (Diaboromon''s Fresh form). With the help of Angemon and Angewomon (with T.K. and Kari), Omnimon was able to destroy Diaboromon again, but it turned out to be a trap, as his destruction allowed many more Kuramon to go to the Real World. Things go out of control when the Kuramon in the Real World merge to create a Mega level called Armageddemon, an alternate Mega in Diaboromon''s evolutionary line. It is so powerful that neither Omnimon nor Imperialdramon were able to defeat it on their own.', 'The DigiDestined go up against Diaboromon again. Tai and Matt head back to the Internet to deal with him with Omnimon, while the younger Chosen Children go to deal with the rampage of a swarm of Kuramon (Diaboromon''s Fresh form). With the help of Angemon and Angewomon (with T.K. and Kari), Omnimon was able to destroy Diaboromon again, but it turned out to be a trap, as his destruction allowed many more Kuramon to go to the Real World. Things go out of control when the Kuramon in the Real World merge to create a Mega level called Armageddemon, an alternate Mega in Diaboromon''s evolutionary line. It is so powerful that neither Omnimon nor Imperialdramon were able to defeat it on their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jo3CJrs5uQSB0mPgyGA03kYgtVS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36201'),
  ('716006012364121345', 'Digimon Adventure 02: The Beginning', 2023, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Tomohisa Taguchi, Yoshifumi Sasahara, Seiji Tachikawa', 'Akatsuki Yamatoya', 'Fukujuro Katayama, Junko Noda, Arthur Lounsbery, Naozumi Takahashi, Ayaka Asai, Koichi Tochika, Yoshitaka Yamaya, Megumi Urawa', 'PG-13', 'In 2012, after the events of Digimon Adventure: Last Evolution Kizuna, the early adulthood DigiDestined—Daisuke, Miyako, Iori, Takeru Takashi, Hikari, and Ken—must reconcile their new responsibilities with their Digimon partners. But Rui Owada, a mysterious young man, appears, claiming to be the first human to partner with a Digimon–Ukkomon. Could Rui really have been the first-ever DigiDestined?', 'In 2012, after the events of Digimon Adventure: Last Evolution Kizuna, the early adulthood DigiDestined—Daisuke, Miyako, Iori, Takeru Takashi, Hikari, and Ken—must reconcile their new responsibilities with their Digimon partners. But Rui Owada, a mysterious young man, appears, claiming to be the first human to partner with a Digimon–Ukkomon. Could Rui really have been the first-ever DigiDestined?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adRK2KTle05DTKcrkaAMAJzrLzh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872976'),
  ('639133340599493232', 'Digimon Adventure tri. Part 1: Reunion', 2015, 'Adventure, Action, Animation, Drama, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Keitaro Motonaga, Toshiyuki Komaru, Haruhito Takada', 'Yuko Kakihara', 'Natsuki Hanae, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Mao Ichimichi, Suzuko Mimori, Mutsumi Tamura, Junya Ikeda, Hitomi Yoshida, Junya Enoki', 'PG-13', 'After years of inactivity, the DigiDestined regroup with their Digimon to save their world, but have the years changed their characters too much?', 'After years of inactivity, the DigiDestined regroup with their Digimon to save their world, but have the years changed their characters too much?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUB2K3u82VAOGyLTZjhh7XIRQZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357400'),
  ('422373855051612610', 'Digimon Adventure tri. Part 2: Determination', 2016, 'Adventure, Action, Animation, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Shigeki Awai, Keitaro Motonaga', 'Yuko Kakihara', 'Natsuki Hanae, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Suzuko Mimori, Mutsumi Tamura, Hitomi Yoshida, Junya Ikeda, Junya Enoki, Mao Ichimichi', 'PG-13', 'The DigiDestined go to a nearby hot springs theme park and everyone has a good time, but Joe doesn''t show up because he wants to study for his exams. Another infected Digimon, Ogremon, attacks Odaiba. Gomamon runs away from home while Mimi faces problems with the other DigiDestined and her classmates because of her selfish ideas.', 'The DigiDestined go to a nearby hot springs theme park and everyone has a good time, but Joe doesn''t show up because he wants to study for his exams. Another infected Digimon, Ogremon, attacks Odaiba. Gomamon runs away from home while Mimi faces problems with the other DigiDestined and her classmates because of her selfish ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHWbJxybcWXgtGL5K4HKEelrXW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372752'),
  ('1044724237462347809', 'Digimon Adventure tri. Part 3: Confession', 2016, 'Adventure, Action, Animation, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Keitaro Motonaga, Koji Watanabe, Fumito Nanba', 'Yuko Kakihara, Mitsutaka Hirota, Takaaki Suzuki', 'Natsuki Hanae, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Suzuko Mimori, Mutsumi Tamura, Hitomi Yoshida, Junya Ikeda, Junya Enoki, Mao Ichimichi', 'PG-13', 'After seeing Meicoomon''s abrupt transformation and killing of Leomon, Agumon and the other Digimon are kept isolated in Koushiro''s office in order to prevent them from infection, but signs of infection begin to appear in Patamon.', 'After seeing Meicoomon''s abrupt transformation and killing of Leomon, Agumon and the other Digimon are kept isolated in Koushiro''s office in order to prevent them from infection, but signs of infection begin to appear in Patamon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mr9qCQCwYqMpiqc30uOVhVJNSWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378106'),
  ('35491802566973199', 'Digimon Adventure tri. Part 4: Loss', 2017, 'Adventure, Action, Animation, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Keitaro Motonaga', 'Yuko Kakihara', 'Natsuki Hanae, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Mao Ichimichi, Suzuko Mimori, Junya Enoki, Mutsumi Tamura, Hitomi Yoshida, Junya Ikeda', 'PG-13', 'Upon arriving at the Digital World after the "reboot", the Digidestined are hunted by a new villain. Meanwhile, Sora is troubled by her partner Digimon''s indifference towards her.', 'Upon arriving at the Digital World after the "reboot", the Digidestined are hunted by a new villain. Meanwhile, Sora is troubled by her partner Digimon''s indifference towards her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbTOYEesS4pLLMUuja5V8cAzTrx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422347'),
  ('873443642648218107', 'Digimon Adventure tri. Part 5: Coexistence', 2017, 'Adventure, Action, Animation, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Misato Takasaki, Keitaro Motonaga, Yasunori Ebina', 'Yuko Kakihara, Mitsutaka Hirota', 'Natsuki Hanae, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Suzuko Mimori, Mutsumi Tamura, Hitomi Yoshida, Junya Ikeda, Junya Enoki, Mao Ichimichi', 'PG-13', 'Meicoomon rampages after witnessing Meiko Mochizuki being injured by the man bearing Gennai''s likeness. "It would have been better if you hadn''t been born..." Meicoomon disappears into the Real World, which has since become distorted. Possessing overwhelming power, she''s the key to the world''s destruction.', 'Meicoomon rampages after witnessing Meiko Mochizuki being injured by the man bearing Gennai''s likeness. "It would have been better if you hadn''t been born..." Meicoomon disappears into the Real World, which has since become distorted. Possessing overwhelming power, she''s the key to the world''s destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrRMYAzYfRZCeFJl92b4ZCCkRUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461758'),
  ('914474826739378059', 'Digimon Adventure tri. Part 6: Future', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Keitaro Motonaga, Yasunori Ebina', null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Suzuko Mimori, Mutsumi Tamura, Junya Ikeda, Junya Enoki, Mao Ichimichi, Hitomi Yoshida', 'PG-13', 'The world has begun to collapse. The rampaging Meicoomon absorbs Tailmon, who underwent a dark evolution, and changes form into the immensely powerful Ordinemon. In accordance with Yggdrasil''s expectation, the real world is about to be engulfed by the Digital World. Meanwhile, Homeostasis considers Ordinemon to be out of control and puts into motion its final plan that will entangle the real world. Then the time comes for the DigiDestined to arrive at a final decision. What future do they choose for themselves?', 'The world has begun to collapse. The rampaging Meicoomon absorbs Tailmon, who underwent a dark evolution, and changes form into the immensely powerful Ordinemon. In accordance with Yggdrasil''s expectation, the real world is about to be engulfed by the Digital World. Meanwhile, Homeostasis considers Ordinemon to be out of control and puts into motion its final plan that will entangle the real world. Then the time comes for the DigiDestined to arrive at a final decision. What future do they choose for themselves?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNrvkKp3gb3DiotXma0g1GM0omC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481760'),
  ('667954032107683878', 'Digimon Adventure: Last Evolution Kizuna', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Shinya Kuwabara, Hikari Itoh, Takaaki Sekizaki', 'Akizuki Yamatoya', 'Natsuki Hanae, Mao Ichimichi, Suzuko Mimori, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Junya Enoki, Mutsumi Tamura, Hitomi Yoshida, Junya Ikeda', 'G', 'Tai is now a university student, living alone, working hard at school, and working every day, but with his future still undecided. Meanwhile, Matt and others continue to work on Digimon incidents and activities that help people with their partner Digimon. When an unprecedented phenomenon occurs, the DigiDestined discover that when they grow up, their relationship with their partner Digimon will come closer to an end.', 'Tai is now a university student, living alone, working hard at school, and working every day, but with his future still undecided. Meanwhile, Matt and others continue to work on Digimon incidents and activities that help people with their partner Digimon. When an unprecedented phenomenon occurs, the DigiDestined discover that when they grow up, their relationship with their partner Digimon will come closer to an end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22oG48YszCraRJigJw5F6qFs4sR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571265'),
  ('704664272652562616', 'Digimon Frontier: Revival of Ancient Digimon', 2002, 'Animation, Action', 'Takahiro Imamura', null, 'Junko Takeuchi, Hiroshi Kamiya, Sawa Ishige, Michael Shitanda, Kumiko Watanabe', 'G', 'Takuya Kanbara, Koji Minamoto, J.P. Shibayama, Zoe Orimoto, Tommy Himi, Bokomon, Neemon ride a Trailmon (Ball) through a desert when they get caught in a battle between human and beast Digimon. It is interrupted by the Lost Island, an island trapped between dimensions, crashing down between them and scooping all involved up.', 'Takuya Kanbara, Koji Minamoto, J.P. Shibayama, Zoe Orimoto, Tommy Himi, Bokomon, Neemon ride a Trailmon (Ball) through a desert when they get caught in a battle between human and beast Digimon. It is interrupted by the Lost Island, an island trapped between dimensions, crashing down between them and scooping all involved up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIeyDhUyEiWaIavy28XFBZqZubT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36198'),
  ('1076794277271670848', 'Digimon Savers: The Movie - Ultimate Power! Activate Burst Mode!!', 2006, 'Animation', 'Tatsuya Nagamine, Tadayoshi Yamamuro', 'Ryota Yamaguchi', 'Taiki Matsuno, Kazuya Nakai, Yukana, Akiko Yajima, Soichiro Hoshi, Hanawa', 'G', 'The film begins with around Agumon, Gaomon and Lalamon, whose partners have been placed in a magical slumber along with the rest of city''s population, by a mysterious thorned vine that spread throughout the city. As the Digimon make their way through the silent city, they stumble upon a pack of Goblimon, led by an Ogremon, who are attacking a young girl. They scare off the goblins, and the girl, Rhythm, reveals that she is actually a Digimon, then explains that the thorns are the work of a Digimon named Argomon. The quartet sets out to confront the villain atop his skyscraper lair.', 'The film begins with around Agumon, Gaomon and Lalamon, whose partners have been placed in a magical slumber along with the rest of city''s population, by a mysterious thorned vine that spread throughout the city. As the Digimon make their way through the silent city, they stumble upon a pack of Goblimon, led by an Ogremon, who are attacking a young girl. They scare off the goblins, and the girl, Rhythm, reveals that she is actually a Digimon, then explains that the thorns are the work of a Digimon named Argomon. The quartet sets out to confront the villain atop his skyscraper lair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IxSpD5ObRLmFOFtS2IL9jw53yg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36197'),
  ('402382301367783352', 'Digimon Tamers: Battle of Adventurers', 2001, 'Animation', 'Tetsuo Imazawa', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Fumiko Orikasa, Makoto Tsumura, Mayumi Yamaguchi, Kotono Mitsuishi, Yoko Asada, Tomo Saeki, Masako Nozawa, Tomoko Kaneda', 'G', 'Omnimon confronts Mephistomon (who was formed from Apocalymon''s data) in a dark corner of the Digital World over Mephistomon''s attempt to destroy both the Digital World and the Real World and incorporate the data in order to become truly invincible. They fight, but then Mephistomon sees a chance and slips into the Real World.', 'Omnimon confronts Mephistomon (who was formed from Apocalymon''s data) in a dark corner of the Digital World over Mephistomon''s attempt to destroy both the Digital World and the Real World and incorporate the data in order to become truly invincible. They fight, but then Mephistomon sees a chance and slips into the Real World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZwRkkmhoGiMsrrCtxIuS9I7uvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36200'),
  ('250768722881984495', 'Digimon Tamers: Runaway Locomon', 2002, 'Animation', 'Tetsuharu Nakamura', 'Hiro Masaki', 'Touko Aoyama, Yoko Asada, Susumu Chiba, Yuka Imai, Ai Iwamura, Tomoko Kaneda, Jun''ichi Kanemaru, Aoi Tada', 'PG', 'Six months after the D-Reaper was destroyed, the Tamers are planning to throw Rika a surprise party, but Rika finds out. Suddenly a train-Digimon named Locomon begins to race around the tracks, causing havoc. The Tamers respond to this, as Takato digivolves Guilmon into Growlmon to stop the train Digimon but fails as Takato, Rika and Renamon get on it in an attempt to slow it down. The others, excluding Suzie, use a freight train to catch up with Locomon', 'Six months after the D-Reaper was destroyed, the Tamers are planning to throw Rika a surprise party, but Rika finds out. Suddenly a train-Digimon named Locomon begins to race around the tracks, causing havoc. The Tamers respond to this, as Takato digivolves Guilmon into Growlmon to stop the train Digimon but fails as Takato, Rika and Renamon get on it in an attempt to slow it down. The others, excluding Suzie, use a freight train to catch up with Locomon', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axefFcfGxp3um7cDKAtZPEVwyxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36199'),
  ('194814164935545723', 'Digimon: The Movie', 2000, 'Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction, Family', 'Mamoru Hosoda, Shigeyasu Yamauchi, Hisashi Mori', 'Jeff Nimoy, Bob Buchholz', 'Lara Jill Miller, Joshua Seth, Bob Papenbrook, David Lodge, Dorothy Elias-Fahn, Michael Sorich, Peggy O''Neal, Colleen O''Shaughnessey', 'PG', 'When a powerful new Internet Digimon hatches and begins to consume data at an alarming rate, the Digidestined - kids chosen to save the digital world - must put an end to the destruction before the damage becomes irreversible and worldwide communication halts forever. As computer-based missiles are launched, and a wayward Digimon kidnaps the Digidestined, only the combined efforts of a worldwide network of kids and a new group of "Digidestined" can rescue the others and stop global disaster.', 'When a powerful new Internet Digimon hatches and begins to consume data at an alarming rate, the Digidestined - kids chosen to save the digital world - must put an end to the destruction before the damage becomes irreversible and worldwide communication halts forever. As computer-based missiles are launched, and a wayward Digimon kidnaps the Digidestined, only the combined efforts of a worldwide network of kids and a new group of "Digidestined" can rescue the others and stop global disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiH1muonzAWzlLjPhjAcAYVAjzm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20455'),
  ('868296104918231590', 'Digital Devil Story - Megami Tensei', 1987, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Mizuho Nishikubo, Naoyuki Onda, Takashi Azuhata', 'Mizuho Nishikubo', 'Yu Mizushima, Saeko Shimazu, Masako Katsuki, Hochu Otsuka, Masaharu Sato, Fumihiko Tachiki, Mari Yokoo, Megumi Hayashibara', null, 'Handsome high school student Akemi is a computer genius. One day a new girl, Yumiko, transfers to his class from another school. She quickly falls in love with Akemi but, absorbed in his computer, he pays her no attention at all. Akemi accidentally summons demons who wreak chaos on his enemies and friends.', 'Handsome high school student Akemi is a computer genius. One day a new girl, Yumiko, transfers to his class from another school. She quickly falls in love with Akemi but, absorbed in his computer, he pays her no attention at all. Akemi accidentally summons demons who wreak chaos on his enemies and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3r4gX36vxLv31XHoueRHbMMuX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73792'),
  ('129929241733049291', 'Digital Man', 1995, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Phillip J. Roth, Harris Done', 'Phillip J. Roth', 'Ken Olandt, Kristen Dalton, Adam Baldwin, Matthias Hues, Paul Gleason, Ed Lauter, Don Swayze, Chase Masterson', 'R', 'An out-of-control robot is inadvertently set loose in a small community, and a crack squad of soldiers are sent to hunt it down. Gradually, the members of the squad begin to suspect that some of them are robots.', 'An out-of-control robot is inadvertently set loose in a small community, and a crack squad of soldiers are sent to hunt it down. Gradually, the members of the squad begin to suspect that some of them are robots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yL0Z74EakJ3cFSGX8ABZpOtBpTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112328'),
