  ('570726575494381716', 'Dil Bechara', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mukesh Chhabra, Sejal Adhia, Mayank Naudiyal', 'Suprotim Sengupta, Shashank Khaitan', 'Sushant Singh Rajput, Sanjana Sanghi, Sahil Vaid, Saswata Chatterjee, Swastika Mukherjee, Sunit Tandon, Michael Muthu, Subbalakshmi', null, 'Kizie and Manny, two ordinary people brought together by a tragic twist, embark on a bittersweet and extraordinary journey into the heart of that crazy little thing called ''life''.', 'Kizie and Manny, two ordinary people brought together by a tragic twist, embark on a bittersweet and extraordinary journey into the heart of that crazy little thing called ''life''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMFjMrc8Bn0CQhtJDORfspXrWrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:645484'),
  ('477168927197432581', 'Dil Bole Hadippa!', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Anurag Singh, Sudeep Chatterjee', 'Aparajita Ghosh Das', 'Rani Mukerji, Shahid Kapoor, Anupam Kher, Dalip Tahil, Rakhi Sawant, Sherlyn Chopra, Vrajesh Hirjee, Poonam Dhillon', null, 'Veera, a fire-cracker of a girl who lives in a small village but dreams of playing cricket in the big league. Rohan is an accomplished captain of a county cricket team in England. Rohan returns to India to captain his father''s cricket team which has been losing for the last 8 years. In a Village where girls don''t play Cricket, Veera has to put on a put on a turban & beard to live her dream.', 'Veera, a fire-cracker of a girl who lives in a small village but dreams of playing cricket in the big league. Rohan is an accomplished captain of a county cricket team in England. Rohan returns to India to captain his father''s cricket team which has been losing for the last 8 years. In a Village where girls don''t play Cricket, Veera has to put on a put on a turban & beard to live her dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zt6r5WddPoBaXW6knwQWRnor61F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22609'),
  ('428797866509094613', 'Dil Chahta Hai', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Farhan Akhtar, Francesco Biffone, Reema Kagti', 'Farhan Akhtar', 'Aamir Khan, Akshaye Khanna, Saif Ali Khan, Preity Zinta, Dimple Kapadia, Sonali Kulkarni, Ayub Khan, Rajat Kapoor', null, 'Three inseparable childhood friends are just out of college. Nothing comes between them - until they each fall in love, and their wildly different approaches to relationships creates tension.', 'Three inseparable childhood friends are just out of college. Nothing comes between them - until they each fall in love, and their wildly different approaches to relationships creates tension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6Cicaf2FFmfcInfsbPTxMLk5CS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14752'),
