  ('645281416684976591', 'Dilig', 2024, 'Drama', 'Christian Paolo Lat', null, 'Dyessa Garcia, Rica Gonzales, Richard Solano, JD Aguas, Archie Adamos', null, 'About to get married to an old, wealthy businessman, Resa enlists the help of gardener Otso to seduce her fiancé’s daughter, Katelyn, and record his sexploits with her in order to get her disowned.', 'About to get married to an old, wealthy businessman, Resa enlists the help of gardener Otso to seduce her fiancé’s daughter, Katelyn, and record his sexploits with her in order to get her disowned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDn02aAZFUb7JpM7l7iuHdbWEHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1226299'),
  ('297272152748250964', 'Dilili in Paris', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Michel Ocelot', 'Elisabeth Duda, Liliane Rovère, Prunelle Charles-Ambron, Thissa d''Avila Bensalah, Enzo Ratsito, Natalie Dessay, Isabelle Guiard, Swan Mirabeau', null, 'With the help of her delivery-boy friend, Dilili, a young Kanak, investigates a spate of mysterious kidnappings of young girls that is plaguing Belle Epoque Paris. In the course of her investigation she encounters a series of extraordinary characters, each of whom provides her with clues that will help her in her quest.', 'With the help of her delivery-boy friend, Dilili, a young Kanak, investigates a spate of mysterious kidnappings of young girls that is plaguing Belle Epoque Paris. In the course of her investigation she encounters a series of extraordinary characters, each of whom provides her with clues that will help her in her quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhbSs7eruoT68NZcSkmtPYWHkU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421456'),
  ('478747451868997550', 'Diljale', 1996, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Harry Baweja', null, 'Ajay Devgn, Sonali Bendre, Amrish Puri, Parmeet Sethi, Madhoo, Shakti Kapoor, Gulshan Grover, Akash Khurana', null, 'Raja Saab, a politician, falsely accuses Shyam, a patriotic young man, of being a terrorist, prompting the latter to take an unlikely route to revenge.', 'Raja Saab, a politician, falsely accuses Shyam, a patriotic young man, of being a terrorist, prompting the latter to take an unlikely route to revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1D5yt3beDErVMl6rqccg4qsJfOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243595'),
  ('1002930506781805660', 'Dillagi', 1999, 'Family, Drama, Romance', 'Sunny Deol', null, 'Sunny Deol, Bobby Deol, Dara Singh, Urmila Matondkar, Zohra Sehgal, Sushmita Mukherjee, Preity Zinta, Kulbhushan Kharbanda', null, 'Two brothers -- Ranvir and Rajvir along with their parents move to Mumbai. They endure numerous hardships, but their will to survive prevails and they succeed. Soon, their parents pass away, leaving young Rajvir in the care of Ranvir. Now wealthy beyond any means, Ranvir runs the business and Rajvir lives recklessly. When Rajvir falls in love, Ranvir arranges his marriage, but to his dismay finds out that he has arranged his brother to marry the girl he loves.', 'Two brothers -- Ranvir and Rajvir along with their parents move to Mumbai. They endure numerous hardships, but their will to survive prevails and they succeed. Soon, their parents pass away, leaving young Rajvir in the care of Ranvir. Now wealthy beyond any means, Ranvir runs the business and Rajvir lives recklessly. When Rajvir falls in love, Ranvir arranges his marriage, but to his dismay finds out that he has arranged his brother to marry the girl he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9uVeT4605jLKHDUL4Z3kE79Can.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457714'),
  ('642099026202578332', 'Dillinger', 1945, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Max Nosseck, Jackson Rose, Frank Fox', 'William Castle', 'Lawrence Tierney, Edmund Lowe, Anne Jeffreys, Eduardo Ciannelli, Marc Lawrence, Elisha Cook Jr., Elsa Janssen, Ludwig Stössel', 'NR', 'The life of American public enemy number one who was shot by the police in 1934.', 'The life of American public enemy number one who was shot by the police in 1934.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52fF9VV0ImOBtTKpAfKVYRVuuRv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28115'),
  ('808616781350964057', 'Dillinger', 1973, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'John Milius, Jules Brenner, Donald C. Klune', 'John Milius', 'Warren Oates, Ben Johnson, Michelle Phillips, Cloris Leachman, Harry Dean Stanton, Geoffrey Lewis, John P. Ryan, Richard Dreyfuss', 'R', 'After a shoot-out kills five FBI agents in Kansas City the Bureau target John Dillinger as one of the men to hunt down. Waiting for him to break Federal law they sort out several other mobsters, while Dillinger''s bank robbing exploits make him something of a folk hero. Escaping from jail he finds Pretty Boy Floyd and Baby Face Nelson have joined the gang and pretty soon he is Public Enemy Number One. Now the G-men really are after him.', 'After a shoot-out kills five FBI agents in Kansas City the Bureau target John Dillinger as one of the men to hunt down. Waiting for him to break Federal law they sort out several other mobsters, while Dillinger''s bank robbing exploits make him something of a folk hero. Escaping from jail he finds Pretty Boy Floyd and Baby Face Nelson have joined the gang and pretty soon he is Public Enemy Number One. Now the G-men really are after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62nI7ftMyd5q9LhHPE0yltPcQKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28110'),
  ('1063382576474541026', 'Dillinger and Capone', 1995, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Jon Purdy, Sholto J. Roeg, John Nelson', 'Michael B. Druxman', 'Martin Sheen, F. Murray Abraham, Catherine Hicks, Stephen Davies, Sasha Jenson, Jeffrey Combs, Michael C. Gwynne, Anthony Crivello', 'R', 'In 1934, J. Edgar Hoover and the boys made headlines for mowing down John Dillinger in a hail of bullets outside Chicago''s Biograph theater. But in fact, according to this Jon Purdy gangster thriller, the Feds iced Dillinger''s brother. Fast-forward five years, when mobster kingpin Al Capone gives the real Dillinger an offer he can''t refuse: rob millions from a secluded vault or watch his wife and child get whacked.', 'In 1934, J. Edgar Hoover and the boys made headlines for mowing down John Dillinger in a hail of bullets outside Chicago''s Biograph theater. But in fact, according to this Jon Purdy gangster thriller, the Feds iced Dillinger''s brother. Fast-forward five years, when mobster kingpin Al Capone gives the real Dillinger an offer he can''t refuse: rob millions from a secluded vault or watch his wife and child get whacked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/of2QeqQaoOrRpi37BCKlhj1BhLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56264'),
  ('369443854335894693', 'Dillinger Is Dead', 1969, 'Drama', 'Marco Ferreri, Arturo Caravati, Mario Vulpiani', 'Sergio Bazzini, Marco Ferreri', 'Michel Piccoli, Anita Pallenberg, Gino Lavagetto, Mario Jannilli, Annie Girardot, Carole André, Adriano Aprà, Carla Petrillo', null, 'A man decides to cook for himself and finds a revolver (which may have belonged to John Dillinger) hidden in his kitchen.', 'A man decides to cook for himself and finds a revolver (which may have belonged to John Dillinger) hidden in his kitchen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JykpUFcI2j0Vo2UCYazUmIN1Rh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56693'),
  ('845682028080075145', 'Dilwale', 1994, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Harry Baweja, Veeru Devgan', 'Karan Razdan', 'Ajay Devgn, Suniel Shetty, Raveena Tandon, Gulshan Grover, Paresh Rawal, Reema Lagoo, Saeed Jaffrey, Navneet Nishan', null, 'When Arun is falsely implicated in a murder case, he loses his sanity and is sent to an asylum. However, things take a turn when Vikram, an honest policeman, comes to his aid.', 'When Arun is falsely implicated in a murder case, he loses his sanity and is sent to an asylum. However, things take a turn when Vikram, an honest policeman, comes to his aid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQJfbkVuRsP8RdUVRzYOzYByd4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159164'),
  ('171372353250513729', 'Dilwale', 2015, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Rohit Shetty, Dudley', 'Yunus Sajawal', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Kajol, Varun Dhawan, Kriti Sanon, Boman Irani, Johny Lever, Sanjay Mishra, Kabir Bedi', null, 'Raj is a Mafia member. One day he meet a girl (Meera) while chasing by his rival gang and falls in love with her. Later he finds out that this girl is the daughter of the leader of his rival gang. Yet their love story continues until he was shot by his girlfriend upon a deep misunderstanding. After that incident these two lovers lives separate until their siblings fallen in love. With this new love story their paths intertwines again.', 'Raj is a Mafia member. One day he meet a girl (Meera) while chasing by his rival gang and falls in love with her. Later he finds out that this girl is the daughter of the leader of his rival gang. Yet their love story continues until he was shot by his girlfriend upon a deep misunderstanding. After that incident these two lovers lives separate until their siblings fallen in love. With this new love story their paths intertwines again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYgPu6hhOr61knwbestTx4vSdMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370665'),
  ('397815123962729681', 'Dilwale Dulhania Le Jayenge', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Aditya Chopra, Mohammed Kasim, Manmohan Singh', 'Aditya Chopra', 'Kajol, Shah Rukh Khan, Amrish Puri, Farida Jalal, Anupam Kher, Pooja Ruparel, Parmeet Sethi, Satish Shah', 'G', 'Raj is a rich, carefree, happy-go-lucky second generation NRI. Simran is the daughter of Chaudhary Baldev Singh, who in spite of being an NRI is very strict about adherence to Indian values. Simran has left for India to be married to her childhood fiancé. Raj leaves for India with a mission at his hands, to claim his lady love under the noses of her whole family. Thus begins a saga.', 'Raj is a rich, carefree, happy-go-lucky second generation NRI. Simran is the daughter of Chaudhary Baldev Singh, who in spite of being an NRI is very strict about adherence to Indian values. Simran has left for India to be married to her childhood fiancé. Raj leaves for India with a mission at his hands, to claim his lady love under the noses of her whole family. Thus begins a saga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CAL2433ZeIihfX1Hb2139CX0pW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19404'),
  ('889544080062117332', 'Dim Sum: A Little Bit of Heart', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Wayne Wang, Chris Lee, Michael Chin', 'Terrel Seltzer', 'Laureen Chew, Kim Chew, Victor Wong, Ida F.O. Chung, Cora Miao, John Nishio, Amy Hill, Keith Choy', 'PG', 'San Francisco''s Richmond District. A widow welcomes the Chinese New Year. 62 years old, she wants to make a trip to China to pay last respects to her ancestors. A fortune teller has told her this is the year she''ll die, and a daughter, Geraldine, remains unmarried. Geraldine''s boyfriend lives in Los Angeles and she''s not sure she''s ready for marriage, nor does she want to leave her mother alone in her declining years. Mrs. Tan''s cheerful brother-in-law, Uncle Tam, tries to help out.', 'San Francisco''s Richmond District. A widow welcomes the Chinese New Year. 62 years old, she wants to make a trip to China to pay last respects to her ancestors. A fortune teller has told her this is the year she''ll die, and a daughter, Geraldine, remains unmarried. Geraldine''s boyfriend lives in Los Angeles and she''s not sure she''s ready for marriage, nor does she want to leave her mother alone in her declining years. Mrs. Tan''s cheerful brother-in-law, Uncle Tam, tries to help out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ju4TjxXBNL4FlO9pJM9034nX8p6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135418'),
  ('879144346744930029', 'Dima Gorin''s Career', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Frunze Dovlatyan, Lev Mirsky, Konstantin Arutyunov', 'Boris Medovoy', 'Aleksandr Demyanenko, Tatyana Konyukhova, Vladimir Vysotsky, Valentina Markova, Vladimir Seleznyov, Yevgeni Kudryashov, Nikolai Kazakov, Aleksey Vanin', null, 'Dmitry Gorin is awaiting the post of branch manager of a savings bank. But one day he accidentally gives an extra amount to a person who works in the taiga on the construction of the Siberia-Ural power transmission line. To return the money, Dmitry has to go to the taiga. But he is not in a hurry to return to Moscow. The fact is that he discovers a completely different life, which he likes, and meets the girl he dreamed of', 'Dmitry Gorin is awaiting the post of branch manager of a savings bank. But one day he accidentally gives an extra amount to a person who works in the taiga on the construction of the Siberia-Ural power transmission line. To return the money, Dmitry has to go to the taiga. But he is not in a hurry to return to Moscow. The fact is that he discovers a completely different life, which he likes, and meets the girl he dreamed of', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSYCLeM7xEFFgHHHdLbl4tNC4Bc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208245'),
  ('735832815330727968', 'Dime lo que quieres (de verdad)', 2023, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Bruno Ascenzo, Luis Enrique Carrión', null, 'Tony Dalton, Stephanie Cayo, Angie Cepeda, Manolo Cardona, Sebastián Garcia', 'R', 'Diego and Emilia are a conservative couple with 16 years of marriage who have lost the spark, until Tomás and Betina rescue them and introduce them to the forbidden world, changing what they know about intimacy, relationships, and sex.', 'Diego and Emilia are a conservative couple with 16 years of marriage who have lost the spark, until Tomás and Betina rescue them and introduce them to the forbidden world, changing what they know about intimacy, relationships, and sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMgx4ofxWNqgXliRyXGXImoA7vX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1157008'),
  ('1107770024975739921', 'Dime to Retire', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Robert McKimson, Milt Franklyn', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Exhausted traveler Porky Pig drives into a town looking for a hotel. He is delighted to find one with a 10 cents per-night fee. Unfortunately, its manager is Daffy Duck.', 'Exhausted traveler Porky Pig drives into a town looking for a hotel. He is delighted to find one with a 10 cents per-night fee. Unfortunately, its manager is Daffy Duck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FoUYn5YxouMoQry9Y1mwGkpaAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235167'),
  ('577672415144011978', 'Dimension 5', 1966, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Franklin Adreon, Alan Stensvold', 'Arthur C. Pierce', 'Jeffrey Hunter, France Nuyen, Harold Sakata, Donald Woods, Linda Ho, Robert Ito, David Chow, Jon Lormer', null, 'An American intelligence agent, aided by a Chinese-American female agent, uses a time-travel belt to thwart Chinese operatives who are attempting to import to Los Angeles the materials to make an atomic bomb.', 'An American intelligence agent, aided by a Chinese-American female agent, uses a time-travel belt to thwart Chinese operatives who are attempting to import to Los Angeles the materials to make an atomic bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsQsKMNioMfoA4cDRf2lkfGmP9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52516'),
  ('566026299947904425', 'Dimensions of Dialogue', 1983, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jan Švankmajer, Vladimír Malík', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'Three surreal depictions of failures of communication that occur on all levels of human society.', 'Three surreal depictions of failures of communication that occur on all levels of human society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frllemYfEue2vgcqKUY5HASb2ub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19035'),
  ('68081477697560544', 'Dimples', 1936, 'Drama, Family', 'William A. Seiter', 'Nat Perrin, Arthur Sheekman', 'Shirley Temple, Frank Morgan, Robert Kent, Helen Westley, Stepin Fetchit, Astrid Allwyn, Brook Byron, Berton Churchill', 'PG', 'Dimples Appleby lives with her pick-pocket grandfather in 19th century New York City. She entertains the crowds while he works his racket. A rich lady makes it possible for the girl to go legit.', 'Dimples Appleby lives with her pick-pocket grandfather in 19th century New York City. She entertains the crowds while he works his racket. A rich lady makes it possible for the girl to go legit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrjDWmSLcdoKIPB8DkwmOqTWeWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32484'),
  ('721161937477579169', 'Din Don: Il Ritorno', 2019, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Paolo Geremei, Alessandro Sanacore, Roberta Tocci', 'Luca Biglione, Bruno Frustaci', 'Enzo Salvi, Ivano Marescotti, Laura Torrisi, Maurizio Mattioli, Giorgia Würth, Adolfo Margiotta, Emy Bergamo, Andrea Dianetti', null, 'After the news of the death of Don Dino, who was transferred to Trentino, Donato leaves to attend the funeral. When he arrives at his destination, he discovers that he has been appointed his deputy in the parish.', 'After the news of the death of Don Dino, who was transferred to Trentino, Donato leaves to attend the funeral. When he arrives at his destination, he discovers that he has been appointed his deputy in the parish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RHBt1qzN0lwXxIokk5wnRfULVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658435'),
  ('997062861651264618', 'Din Don: Una Parrocchia In Due', 2018, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Claudio Norza, Ginevra Salamone, Paolo Geremei', 'Luca Biglione, Bruno Frustaci', 'Enzo Salvi, Maurizio Battista, Andrea Dianetti, Giorgia Würth, Emy Bergamo, Gabriele Carbotti, Maurizio Mattioli, Salvatore Misticone', null, 'Donato, a scoundrel music manager, to escape the two henchmen of a boss who, due to his inefficiency, has caused him to lose a lot of money, taking advantage of a letter from his uncle the bishop, introduces himself to the parish priest of a village church, Don Dino, dressed as a priest, and pretends to have been sent there by the bishop as assistant parish priest. Don Dino''s church is always empty. In fact, the town''s faithful frequent the new church, run by Don Gabriele, a pimp priest who knows how to deal with people. Donato''s arrival initially seems like the final blow for Don Dino''s church: Donato doesn''t know where to start a mass, he has never confessed or married anyone, the mere idea of ​​performing an extreme unction scares him. Don Dino begins to argue with Donato: he seems anything but a priest. But little by little, Don Donato''s extravagant ways, his open-mindedness as a "sinner", his mentality as a rock priest, begin to attract the faithful.', 'Donato, a scoundrel music manager, to escape the two henchmen of a boss who, due to his inefficiency, has caused him to lose a lot of money, taking advantage of a letter from his uncle the bishop, introduces himself to the parish priest of a village church, Don Dino, dressed as a priest, and pretends to have been sent there by the bishop as assistant parish priest. Don Dino''s church is always empty. In fact, the town''s faithful frequent the new church, run by Don Gabriele, a pimp priest who knows how to deal with people. Donato''s arrival initially seems like the final blow for Don Dino''s church: Donato doesn''t know where to start a mass, he has never confessed or married anyone, the mere idea of ​​performing an extreme unction scares him. Don Dino begins to argue with Donato: he seems anything but a priest. But little by little, Don Donato''s extravagant ways, his open-mindedness as a "sinner", his mentality as a rock priest, begin to attract the faithful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1Vz5W94Hc6Mbu1jADrWPY5Tg9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572026'),
  ('119472191119302028', 'Din of Celestial Birds', 2006, 'Mystery, Animation', 'E. Elias Merhige', 'E. Elias Merhige', 'Stephen Charles Barry', null, 'Din of Celestial Birds is a surreal odyssey through the evolution of consciousness.', 'Din of Celestial Birds is a surreal odyssey through the evolution of consciousness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2IrxtEkE1bAaNwT3RIkW3pZ8UC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92659'),
  ('1040205552454209547', 'Din Tao: Leader of the Parade', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Fung Kai', 'Fung Kai', 'Alan Kuo, Alien Huang, Crystal Lin, Liu Chun, Chen Bo-zheng, Esther Liu', null, 'A-Tai (Alan Ko) narrates that he is the son of Uncle Da (Chen Po-cheng) and Aunt Da (Samantha Ko), who run a troupe in Taichung. Uncle Da''s troupe does traditional performance in front of religious processions. The religion requires performers to "initiate the faces and pose as gods"—to put on a special face painting, or to put on a heavy body puppet costume, both of these represent gods'' persona. The performance demands training of martial art, acrobatics and endurance, and the performers are negatively associated with gangsters by the society. Uncle Da has been competing with Wu-cheng (Liao Jun), who studied with Uncle Da under the same master. A-Tai grew estranged with his father and the troupe, and went to Taipei to study Rock music, until a mysterious old man in blue coat bids him home.', 'A-Tai (Alan Ko) narrates that he is the son of Uncle Da (Chen Po-cheng) and Aunt Da (Samantha Ko), who run a troupe in Taichung. Uncle Da''s troupe does traditional performance in front of religious processions. The religion requires performers to "initiate the faces and pose as gods"—to put on a special face painting, or to put on a heavy body puppet costume, both of these represent gods'' persona. The performance demands training of martial art, acrobatics and endurance, and the performers are negatively associated with gangsters by the society. Uncle Da has been competing with Wu-cheng (Liao Jun), who studied with Uncle Da under the same master. A-Tai grew estranged with his father and the troupe, and went to Taipei to study Rock music, until a mysterious old man in blue coat bids him home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slaRQLQ4SULIIQIkw219wOUlPQI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118609'),
  ('509016363990448986', 'Diner', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Barry Levinson, Peter Sova', 'Barry Levinson', 'Steve Guttenberg, Daniel Stern, Mickey Rourke, Kevin Bacon, Tim Daly, Ellen Barkin, Paul Reiser, Kathryn Dowling', 'R', 'Set in 1959, Diner shows how five young men resist their adulthood and seek refuge in their beloved Diner. The mundane, childish, and titillating details of their lives are shared. But the golden moments pass, and the men shoulder their responsibilities, leaving the Diner behind.', 'Set in 1959, Diner shows how five young men resist their adulthood and seek refuge in their beloved Diner. The mundane, childish, and titillating details of their lives are shared. But the golden moments pass, and the men shoulder their responsibilities, leaving the Diner behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vKIdZ6JkFIzcQeaHg3xtdvOyRO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13776'),
  ('168476180788919139', 'Diner', 2019, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Daisuke Soma, Kota Sato, Naoki Kawamura', 'Hirohito Goto, Yoshikazu Sugiyama, Mika Ninagawa', 'Tatsuya Fujiwara, Tina Tamashiro, Masataka Kubota, Kanata Hongo, Shinji Takeda, Takumi Saitoh, Eriko Sato, Nobuaki Kaneko', null, 'A former murderer and genius chef along with a waitress come together with a group of fantastical assassins in a diner. A girl with a hollowness in her heart, who believes that she belongs nowhere, is thrust into a series of attacks where she must struggle to find her will to live.', 'A former murderer and genius chef along with a waitress come together with a group of fantastical assassins in a diner. A girl with a hollowness in her heart, who believes that she belongs nowhere, is thrust into a series of attacks where she must struggle to find her will to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6q01LCdUQApKZjfdJANBAEjfLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567590'),
  ('746295255822702113', 'Ding Dog Daddy', 1942, 'Animation', 'Friz Freleng', 'Tedd Pierce', 'Pinto Colvig, Tedd Pierce, Mel Blanc, Sara Berner', null, 'A dumb mutt falls in love with the metal statue of a greyhound.', 'A dumb mutt falls in love with the metal statue of a greyhound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/S0EBk5P5cDqy0uWiQMVAeXOkbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188383'),
  ('658461067985982980', 'Dinner at Eight', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama', 'George Cukor, Cullen Tate, William H. Daniels', 'John Meehan', 'Marie Dressler, John Barrymore, Wallace Beery, Jean Harlow, Lionel Barrymore, Lee Tracy, Edmund Lowe, Billie Burke', 'NR', 'An ambitious New York socialite plans an extravagant dinner party as her businessman husband, Oliver, contends with financial woes, causing a lot of tension between the couple. Meanwhile, their high-society friends and associates, including the gruff Dan Packard and his sultry spouse, Kitty, contend with their own entanglements, leading to revelations at the much-anticipated dinner.', 'An ambitious New York socialite plans an extravagant dinner party as her businessman husband, Oliver, contends with financial woes, causing a lot of tension between the couple. Meanwhile, their high-society friends and associates, including the gruff Dan Packard and his sultry spouse, Kitty, contend with their own entanglements, leading to revelations at the much-anticipated dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9V2dIMqC1g1S9bDgvxqUOJDfp6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39130'),
  ('1151415136386166875', 'Dinner for One', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Frank A. Banuscher, Heinz Dunkhase', 'Lauri Wylie', 'Freddie Frinton, May Warden, Heinz Piper', null, 'A very old woman wants to have dinner with her friends. As they are all dead, the butler has to play the role of every guest.', 'A very old woman wants to have dinner with her friends. As they are all dead, the butler has to play the role of every guest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WucEa0QFwAtv61wQ7X1Pyg2uAe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6166'),
  ('802050351259881198', 'Dinner for Schmucks', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Jay Roach, Jim Denault, Brian Relyea', 'Francis Veber', 'Paul Rudd, Steve Carell, Stephanie Szostak, Jemaine Clement, Zach Galifianakis, Lucy Punch, Bruce Greenwood, David Walliams', 'PG-13', 'Rising executive Tim Conrad works for a boss who hosts a monthly dinner in which the guest who brings the biggest buffoon gets a career-boost. Tim plans on not attending until he meets Barry, a man who builds dioramas using stuffed mice. Barry''s blundering but good intentions send Tim''s life into a downward spiral, threatening a major business deal and possibly scuttling Tim''s engagement to his fiancee.', 'Rising executive Tim Conrad works for a boss who hosts a monthly dinner in which the guest who brings the biggest buffoon gets a career-boost. Tim plans on not attending until he meets Barry, a man who builds dioramas using stuffed mice. Barry''s blundering but good intentions send Tim''s life into a downward spiral, threatening a major business deal and possibly scuttling Tim''s engagement to his fiancee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqCyt9ILsInMYPa2iveiINeVOJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38778'),
  ('151642859533636179', 'Dinner in America', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Anthony Kalil, Bret Miller, Adam Rehmeier', 'Adam Rehmeier', 'Kyle Gallner, Emily Skeggs, Pat Healy, Griffin Gluck, Lea Thompson, Mary Lynn Rajskub, Ryan Malgarini, Nick Chinlund', null, 'An on-the-lam punk rocker and a young woman obsessed with a local band go on an unexpected and epic journey together through the decaying suburbs of the American Midwest.', 'An on-the-lam punk rocker and a young woman obsessed with a local band go on an unexpected and epic journey together through the decaying suburbs of the American Midwest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t63UhnHaWQGcuE3pViuW3LSjBJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653664'),
  ('437629637598072466', 'Dinner Rush', 2000, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Bob Giraldi, Tim Ives', 'Brian S. Kalata, Rick Shaughnessy', 'Danny Aiello, Polly Draper, Alex Corrado, Zainab Jah, John Rothman, Michael McGlone, Edoardo Ballerini, Manny Perez', 'R', 'One unlucky evening, Louis Cropa, a part-time bookmaker, discovers that his restaurant has become a hotbed of conflicting characters. In addition to having to please a whiny food critic, Louis must fend off a hostile takeover from a pair of gangsters, to whom his sous-chef is in debt. Further, Louis has an argument with his son, the star chef, whose culinary creativity has brought success to the business.', 'One unlucky evening, Louis Cropa, a part-time bookmaker, discovers that his restaurant has become a hotbed of conflicting characters. In addition to having to please a whiny food critic, Louis must fend off a hostile takeover from a pair of gangsters, to whom his sous-chef is in debt. Further, Louis has an argument with his son, the star chef, whose culinary creativity has brought success to the business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qhSssp1RT3IU53OkomdpJsyJ0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22617'),
  ('112010366619254823', 'Dinner with a Vampire', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Lamberto Bava, Gianfranco Transunto', 'Lamberto Bava, Dardano Sacchetti', 'George Hilton, Patrizia Pellegrino, Riccardo Rossi, Isabel Russinova, Valeria Milillo, Yvonne Sciò, Igor Zalewsky, Stefano Sabelli', null, 'A camera crew unearths a thousand year old vampire from Mesopotamia. Years after his rise from the grave, the vampire becomes a famous horror film director and holds auditions for his up and coming film. Four young hopefuls are chosen and are invited to spend the night at the vampire''s house. At dinner the vampire reveals his true nature to his guests and the real reason why they are there, to kill him before dawn, as he has grown bored with his existence.', 'A camera crew unearths a thousand year old vampire from Mesopotamia. Years after his rise from the grave, the vampire becomes a famous horror film director and holds auditions for his up and coming film. Four young hopefuls are chosen and are invited to spend the night at the vampire''s house. At dinner the vampire reveals his true nature to his guests and the real reason why they are there, to kill him before dawn, as he has grown bored with his existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQuP9TOwY1IHufaMOdg8RtutlNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25854'),
  ('443648264103221328', 'Dinner with Friends', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Norman Jewison, Roger Deakins', 'Donald Margulies', 'Dennis Quaid, Andie MacDowell, Toni Collette, Greg Kinnear, Taylor Emerson, Jake Fritz, Holliston Coleman, Angus T. Jones', null, 'A husband and wife reevaluate their marriage after their closest friends, another couple decide to split up after twelve years.', 'A husband and wife reevaluate their marriage after their closest friends, another couple decide to split up after twelve years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnCMUVTw6gb0OZbxWFhbmNjV9hg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24625'),
  ('574519836156997034', 'Dino Dana: The Movie', 2020, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'George Lajtai, J.J. Johnson, Gustavo Fernandes', 'Christin Simms, J.J. Johnson', 'Michela Luci, Donald Henderson, Millie Davis, Nicola Correia Damude, Saara Chaudry, Amish Patel, Rayan Makhlouf, Trek Buccino', 'PG', 'Finds 10-year-old Dana, who sees dinosaurs in the real world, solving dino experiment #901 - where are all the kid dinosaurs? But while working on the solution, her new neighbor Mateo is dino-napped by a Tyrannosaurus Rex, and it''s up to Dana, her sister Saara, and Mateo''s brother Jadiel to finish the experiment.', 'Finds 10-year-old Dana, who sees dinosaurs in the real world, solving dino experiment #901 - where are all the kid dinosaurs? But while working on the solution, her new neighbor Mateo is dino-napped by a Tyrannosaurus Rex, and it''s up to Dana, her sister Saara, and Mateo''s brother Jadiel to finish the experiment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovrVAIXOuES7ZM90uFhrM9xoRW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670328'),
  ('342151490147466141', 'Dino King: Journey to Fire Mountain', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Han Sang-ho', 'Jang Yun mi, Han Sang-ho', 'Park Hee-soon, Ra Mi-ran, Kim Sung-kyun, Kim Eung-soo, Park Jung-geum, Yeon Ji-won, Kim Heung-rae', 'G', 'Speckles, a ferocious tarbosaurus and his young son junior, mourning the loss of their family in an epic battle, roam the lands in search of food, adventure and peace. Under the watchful eye of his dad, Junior is growing up healthy and strong, but with an overconfidence thanks to his young age. After one encounter results in Junior being kidnapped, Speckles embarks on an adventure to the ends of earth to find his son. Encountering friend and foe, ally and enemy, Speckles will stop at nothing and will take on all corners to save his offspring.', 'Speckles, a ferocious tarbosaurus and his young son junior, mourning the loss of their family in an epic battle, roam the lands in search of food, adventure and peace. Under the watchful eye of his dad, Junior is growing up healthy and strong, but with an overconfidence thanks to his young age. After one encounter results in Junior being kidnapped, Speckles embarks on an adventure to the ends of earth to find his son. Encountering friend and foe, ally and enemy, Speckles will stop at nothing and will take on all corners to save his offspring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5cFlAoO07wMxnMhHP8rZxP7JZkX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561974'),
  ('723622960595901459', 'Dino Time', 2012, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Yoon-suk Choi, John Kafka', 'Adam Beechen, James Greco, Jae Woo Park', 'Rob Schneider, Melanie Griffith, William Baldwin, Jane Lynch, Pamela Adlon, Tara Strong, Stephen Baldwin, Yuri Lowenthal', 'PG', 'Young daredevil Ernie, his sister Julia, and his best friend Max accidentally trip a time-machine into operation and find themselves transported back in time 65 million years, where they meet a T-rex named Tyra and her rambunctious son Dodger.', 'Young daredevil Ernie, his sister Julia, and his best friend Max accidentally trip a time-machine into operation and find themselves transported back in time 65 million years, where they meet a T-rex named Tyra and her rambunctious son Dodger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzOkddFfLexWtTozMMvPDUNe0AK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136793'),
  ('139175899312514090', 'Dinocroc', 2004, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kevin O''Neill, Yoram Astrakhan, Justin W. Hill', 'Dan Acre, John Huckert, Frances Doel', 'Costas Mandylor, Charles Napier, Bruce Weitz, Matt Borlenghi, Jane Longenecker, Max Perlich, Jake Thomas, Price Carson', 'R', 'After an African dinosaur ancestor of the crocodile is found, Dr. Campbell uses its DNA to create prototypes at Paula Kennedy''s Gereco lab.', 'After an African dinosaur ancestor of the crocodile is found, Dr. Campbell uses its DNA to create prototypes at Paula Kennedy''s Gereco lab.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Q3qe9yg0lEzsljgknyES8pVHIu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4289'),
  ('186729594320566672', 'Dinocroc vs. Supergator', 2010, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jim Wynorski, Samuel Brownfield, Bunny Blake', 'Mike MacLean, Jim Wynorski', 'David Carradine, Rib Hillis, Amy Holt, John Callahan, Corey Landis, James C. Burns, Delia Sheppard, Jeff Rector', 'NR', 'On a lush tropical island, working under a secret government charter, Martin Drake has not only grown sprawling acres of giant vegetables, but inadvertently spawned two mammoth reptiles as well. Now they''ve broken free of their enclosures, and Drake has only one option: kill the creatures before word gets back to Washington and they close him down. When Drake''s first team of well-armed mercenaries gets wiped out within hours of setting down in the jungle, he turns to one lone hunter, The Cajun, to go in single-handedly. But will The Cajun be cunning enough to find the creatures and destroy them before they turn the blue waters red with the blood of tourists. The only hope is to bring the monsters together and make them fight. When one emerges victorious, that will be the time to strike and kill the other. It''s a risky plan, but ultimately the only one that may work. One of David Carradine''s last movies.', 'On a lush tropical island, working under a secret government charter, Martin Drake has not only grown sprawling acres of giant vegetables, but inadvertently spawned two mammoth reptiles as well. Now they''ve broken free of their enclosures, and Drake has only one option: kill the creatures before word gets back to Washington and they close him down. When Drake''s first team of well-armed mercenaries gets wiped out within hours of setting down in the jungle, he turns to one lone hunter, The Cajun, to go in single-handedly. But will The Cajun be cunning enough to find the creatures and destroy them before they turn the blue waters red with the blood of tourists. The only hope is to bring the monsters together and make them fight. When one emerges victorious, that will be the time to strike and kill the other. It''s a risky plan, but ultimately the only one that may work. One of David Carradine''s last movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlHG4VW1Du00ySCZKy4KuLPR7nV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44809'),
  ('621329204163077318', 'Dinosaur', 2000, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Drama', 'David R. Hardberger, Ralph Zondag, Eric Leighton', 'Walon Green', 'D. B. Sweeney, Alfre Woodard, Ossie Davis, Max Casella, Hayden Panettiere, Samuel E. Wright, Julianna Margulies, Peter Siragusa', 'PG', 'An orphaned dinosaur raised by lemurs joins an arduous trek to a sancturary after a meteorite shower destroys his family home.', 'An orphaned dinosaur raised by lemurs joins an arduous trek to a sancturary after a meteorite shower destroys his family home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSje3FS7ycJSglowlngjsvDt7vO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10567'),
  ('181365091489980903', 'Dinosaur 13', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Todd Douglas Miller, Thomas Petersen', 'Todd Douglas Miller', 'Peter L. Larson, Louie Psihoyos, Stan Adelstein, Lanice Archer', 'PG', 'Two years after the discovery of "Sue," the largest and most complete Tyrannosaurus Rex skeleton found to date, government officials seize the remains and claim that "Sue" was stolen from federal land.', 'Two years after the discovery of "Sue," the largest and most complete Tyrannosaurus Rex skeleton found to date, government officials seize the remains and claim that "Sue" was stolen from federal land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g61IWIorF82G0hIlLduWVJTUB6t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249170'),
  ('23074893855952625', 'Dinosaur Adventure', 2000, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Roswitha Haas', 'Roswitha Haas', 'Armin Drogat, Georg Feils, Hanna Kandler, Simone Greiss', null, 'It couldn’t take a long time, and then the little dinosaur would hatch. Finally the eggshells crackled. "It is a boy", the dinosaur father shouted luckily. And in a little while, the small Dino played with the other dinosaur children and discovered bit by bit his neighborhood. But some day - the small dinosaur was attending some of his friends - the earth began to tremble. And shortly after, the volcano erupted. The small Dino had to wait until the volcano had eased, before he could run home. But when he arrived he was very frightened. Everything was destroyed. No trace of his family! "I must find them", he sobbed. And he started a long and adventurous search.', 'It couldn’t take a long time, and then the little dinosaur would hatch. Finally the eggshells crackled. "It is a boy", the dinosaur father shouted luckily. And in a little while, the small Dino played with the other dinosaur children and discovered bit by bit his neighborhood. But some day - the small dinosaur was attending some of his friends - the earth began to tremble. And shortly after, the volcano erupted. The small Dino had to wait until the volcano had eased, before he could run home. But when he arrived he was very frightened. Everything was destroyed. No trace of his family! "I must find them", he sobbed. And he started a long and adventurous search.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycQsLakbMFfQp3NuzNT3VDq3ucN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328220'),
  ('304458999189915798', 'Dinosaur Hotel', 2021, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Jack Peter Mundy, Rhys Frake-Waterfield, Antonia Johnstone', 'Shannon Holiday', 'Chelsea Greenwood, Aimee Marie Higham, Alexander John, Nicole Nabi, Sofia Lacey, Kate Sandison, Stephen Staley, Chrissie Wunna', null, 'Sienna is desperate to win a large cash prize in a secret underground game show. However, Dinosaur''s begin to hunt her down for the entertainment of the rich and wealthy. Can she be the last to survive the horrific night to win the prize?', 'Sienna is desperate to win a large cash prize in a secret underground game show. However, Dinosaur''s begin to hunt her down for the entertainment of the rich and wealthy. Can she be the last to survive the horrific night to win the prize?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qISzj26R3LnsChQcXQKnuyxQQhK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:839440'),
  ('113651693286329832', 'Dinosaur Island', 1994, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Fred Olen Ray, Jim Wynorski, Gary Graver', 'Christopher Wooden, Bob Sheridan', 'Ross Hagen, Richard Gabai, Antonia Dorian, Griffin Drew, Michelle Bauer, Peter Spellos, Tom Shell, Steve Barkett', null, 'Welcome to lush Dinosaur Island, where a tribe of gorgeous cavedwelling warrior women satisfy the exotic fantasies of five downed military airmen. Fearsome battles with the island''s ferocious maneating dinosaurs are the only disruption of their seductive pleasures on this island paradise. Narrowly surviving with their lives, the rugged men fall under the seductive spell of their lovely captors and soon find their every dream fulfilled.', 'Welcome to lush Dinosaur Island, where a tribe of gorgeous cavedwelling warrior women satisfy the exotic fantasies of five downed military airmen. Fearsome battles with the island''s ferocious maneating dinosaurs are the only disruption of their seductive pleasures on this island paradise. Narrowly surviving with their lives, the rugged men fall under the seductive spell of their lovely captors and soon find their every dream fulfilled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vCWyCtc1m7qWUogiE6HpEMkoAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28138'),
  ('226445862157669507', 'Dinosaur Island', 2014, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Family', 'Graeme Mitchell, Matt Drummond', 'Matt Drummond', 'Darius Williams-Watt, Kate Rasmussen, Joe Bistaveous, Juliette Frederick, Vincent Naviti, Paul Padagas, Nicole Yardley, Albert Allu', 'PG', 'The adventure begins when Lucas, a 13 year old boy, embarks on the vacation of a lifetime. When disaster strikes, Lucas finds himself stranded in a strange land littered with ghost ships and prehistoric creatures. While searching for other signs of life, Lucas hears a radio broadcast in the distance and is drawn into the jungle where he encounters a beautiful young girl who claims to have come from the 1950s. Together they set out on a quest to get home all the while uncovering secrets that will forever change the future.', 'The adventure begins when Lucas, a 13 year old boy, embarks on the vacation of a lifetime. When disaster strikes, Lucas finds himself stranded in a strange land littered with ghost ships and prehistoric creatures. While searching for other signs of life, Lucas hears a radio broadcast in the distance and is drawn into the jungle where he encounters a beautiful young girl who claims to have come from the 1950s. Together they set out on a quest to get home all the while uncovering secrets that will forever change the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOe4S3eGogWQk4H8NhVe6eNJZSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294093'),
  ('211324674422751946', 'Dinosaur World', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Ryan Bellgardt', 'Chris Hoyt', 'Xing Yu, Steven He O''Byrne, Mike Pu, Phuong Kubacki, Roman Alcantara, Evan Assante, Samuel Wang, Tracy Ju', null, 'The best players from around the world are gathered to be Russell''s lab rats on his new game, anything could happen. Everyone has their eyes on the prize, which will give them a second chance at life. Greed will take over friendship, allies will become enemies and the unexpected will come with every move you make in this made-up world infested with dinosaurs. Only one can come up triumphant.', 'The best players from around the world are gathered to be Russell''s lab rats on his new game, anything could happen. Everyone has their eyes on the prize, which will give them a second chance at life. Greed will take over friendship, allies will become enemies and the unexpected will come with every move you make in this made-up world infested with dinosaurs. Only one can come up triumphant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4secu8y6gTzkuFgjB7dY56Ky116.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757284'),
  ('795279180453768757', 'Dinosaur!', 1985, 'TV Movie, Documentary', 'Robert Guenette, Philip Hurn', 'Steven Paul Mark', 'Christopher Reeve, Robert Bakker, John Horner, Dale A. Russell, Philip Currie', 'G', 'An entertaining documentary look at dinosaurs with Emmy Award-winning special effects, feature film clips and stills, commentary by leading paleontologists of the time, and an on camera as well as voice-over narrative by Christopher Reeve. Shot on location in Los Angeles and New York at the American Museum of Natural History', 'An entertaining documentary look at dinosaurs with Emmy Award-winning special effects, feature film clips and stills, commentary by leading paleontologists of the time, and an on camera as well as voice-over narrative by Christopher Reeve. Shot on location in Los Angeles and New York at the American Museum of Natural History', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3TQEKDaFgH36WClKyvmdWdKPic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207608'),
  ('1091694703481214964', 'Dinosaur''s Hill', 1967, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Rasa Strautmane, Elena Petrova, Lydia Kovalevskaya', 'Arkadiy Snesarev', 'Lev Lyubetsky, Viktor Rozhdestvenskiy, Klara Rumyanova, I. Smirnov', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzOUTBA5oJ6iRWJGdnaAi6R2Uro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91179'),
  ('454519666532702002', 'Dinosaurs: Giants of Patagonia', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Marc Fafard, William Reeve', 'Marc Fafard', 'Donald Sutherland', 'G', 'If it weren''t for a series of cataclysmic events, a comet impact being first on the list, our planet could well still be the domain of dinosaurs. Following Pr Rodolfo Coria, a world-renowned Argentinian paleontologist, we visit sites of major discoveries he has contributed to in Patagonia and travel back in time to see these amazing beasts come to life in 3D...', 'If it weren''t for a series of cataclysmic events, a comet impact being first on the list, our planet could well still be the domain of dinosaurs. Following Pr Rodolfo Coria, a world-renowned Argentinian paleontologist, we visit sites of major discoveries he has contributed to in Patagonia and travel back in time to see these amazing beasts come to life in 3D...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXexy09XmUZKj1XAihES7MuwRW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53264'),
  ('480080892332668030', 'Dinosaurs: The Final Day with David Attenborough', 2022, 'Documentary, History', 'Matthew Thompson, Janine Frank', 'Matthew Thompson', 'David Attenborough', null, 'David Attenborough brings to life, in unprecedented detail, the last days of the dinosaurs. Palaeontologist Robert DePalma has made an incredible discovery in a prehistoric graveyard: fossilised creatures, astonishingly well preserved, that could help change our understanding of the last days of the dinosaurs. Evidence from his site records the day when an asteroid bigger than Mount Everest devastated our planet and caused the extinction of the dinosaurs. Based on brand new evidence, witness the catastrophic events of that day play out minute by minute.', 'David Attenborough brings to life, in unprecedented detail, the last days of the dinosaurs. Palaeontologist Robert DePalma has made an incredible discovery in a prehistoric graveyard: fossilised creatures, astonishingly well preserved, that could help change our understanding of the last days of the dinosaurs. Evidence from his site records the day when an asteroid bigger than Mount Everest devastated our planet and caused the extinction of the dinosaurs. Based on brand new evidence, witness the catastrophic events of that day play out minute by minute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Fo956wSGoaFD6vS6ZXQbrNpHfB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959785'),
  ('882546630543590622', 'Dinosaurus!', 1960, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Irvin S. Yeaworth Jr., Stanley Cortez', 'Dan E. Weisburd, Jean Yeaworth', 'Ward Ramsey, Paul Lukather, Kristina Hanson, Alan Roberts, Fred Engelberg, Wayne C. Treadway, Luci Blaine, Howard Dayton', null, 'After undersea explosions near a Caribbean island, prehistoric creatures are unleashed on the unsuspecting population.', 'After undersea explosions near a Caribbean island, prehistoric creatures are unleashed on the unsuspecting population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s70D6TKjyB2KkJw1HJXAebD1kSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55663'),
  ('885073166047702764', 'Dinoshark', 2010, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Kevin O''Neill', 'Frances Doel, Guy Prevost', 'Eric Balfour, Aarón Díaz, Iva Hasperger, Humberto Busto, Liv Boughn, Roger Corman, Christina Nicole, Dan Golden', null, 'A baby dinoshark evolves into a ferocious predatory adult, terrorising tourists and locals offshore from Puerto Vallarta, Mexico.', 'A baby dinoshark evolves into a ferocious predatory adult, terrorising tourists and locals offshore from Puerto Vallarta, Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMZQhzde1nrMTDj6ImwcGEPQnKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35074'),
  ('772948758175435968', 'Dinotopia 2: The Temptation', 2002, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Thomas J. Wright', null, 'Lisa Zane, Erik von Detten, Jonathan Hyde, Omid Djalili, Michael Brandon, Georgina Rylance, Shiloh Strong, Sophie Ward', 'PG', 'When a shipwreck is found on the shores of Dinotopia, Karl uses his newly discovered radio to make contact with the drifting survivors. But what will happen if that bridge between two worlds is crossed?', 'When a shipwreck is found on the shores of Dinotopia, Karl uses his newly discovered radio to make contact with the drifting survivors. But what will happen if that bridge between two worlds is crossed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bb4Ui4kg4gjt0BcL6JaGVYmJTUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145731'),
  ('994390471155536177', 'Dinotopia 3: The Election', 2002, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Thomas J. Wright', null, 'Lisa Zane, Erik von Detten, Jonathan Hyde, Omid Djalili, Michael Brandon, Georgina Rylance, Shiloh Strong, Sophie Ward', 'PG', 'Ideas of progress turn the peaceful city into a congested metropolis. Could extinction follow? Not with the blessed event that occurs - the birth of a dinosaur, symbolizing Dinotopia''s enduring civilization.', 'Ideas of progress turn the peaceful city into a congested metropolis. Could extinction follow? Not with the blessed event that occurs - the birth of a dinosaur, symbolizing Dinotopia''s enduring civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fy8YZkOE9HfeVatTC2Vbzlxp3nn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145726'),
  ('1133258875612600891', 'Dinotopia: Quest for the Ruby Sunstone', 2005, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family, Animation', 'Davis Doi', 'Sean Roche, James Gurney', 'Alyssa Milano, Jamie Kennedy, Kathy Griffin, Wayne Knight, Malcolm McDowell, Michael Clarke Duncan, George Segal, Diedrich Bader', null, 'An Orphaned Boy sets out in search of adventure, but when a shipwreck lands him on an island where Dinosaurs and Humans coexist, he finds not only adventure but a family as well.', 'An Orphaned Boy sets out in search of adventure, but when a shipwreck lands him on an island where Dinosaurs and Humans coexist, he finds not only adventure but a family as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHRTjQwsIzPMwgjcBVNRqeUS3xd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35177'),
  ('410606808340406159', 'Dio non ti odia', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Fabrizio La Monica', 'Fabrizio La Monica', 'Ferdinando Gattuccio, Emilia Passalacqua, Salvatore Nereo Salerno, Antonino Scaglione, Roberto Romano', null, 'A father is forced to take his sick daughter to a hermit healer, the only hope for the girl. A long journey awaits them in a wild land, fighting against time but something ancient and dark haunts those lands. The girl''s illness is not the only threat hanging over them. How far are you willing to go to save your children?', 'A father is forced to take his sick daughter to a hermit healer, the only hope for the girl. A long journey awaits them in a wild land, fighting against time but something ancient and dark haunts those lands. The girl''s illness is not the only threat hanging over them. How far are you willing to go to save your children?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trMIGl6PZH1Gvc9AOjzsLit33qd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728574'),
  ('383150495394417265', 'Dio: Dreamers Never Die', 2022, 'Music, Documentary', 'Don Argott, Demian Fenton', null, 'Ronnie James Dio, Wendy Dio, Tony Iommi, Geezer Butler, Bill Ward, Vinny Appice, Lita Ford, Rob Halford', null, 'This career spanning documentary on heavy metal legend Ronnie James Dio delves deep into his incredible rise from 50''s doo-wop crooner, to his early classic rock days in Ritchie Blackmore''s Rainbow, to replacing the iconic lead singer Ozzy Osborne in Black Sabbath, to finally cement his legend with DIO. Ronnie''s biography is completely unique to the tired sex, drugs and rock and roll cliches. The film is about perseverance, dreams and the power to believe in yourself.', 'This career spanning documentary on heavy metal legend Ronnie James Dio delves deep into his incredible rise from 50''s doo-wop crooner, to his early classic rock days in Ritchie Blackmore''s Rainbow, to replacing the iconic lead singer Ozzy Osborne in Black Sabbath, to finally cement his legend with DIO. Ronnie''s biography is completely unique to the tired sex, drugs and rock and roll cliches. The film is about perseverance, dreams and the power to believe in yourself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8AR4SkNm9aDSMTwbobKVEave2P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934670'),
  ('874445576078291790', 'Dionysus in ''69', 1970, 'Drama', 'Brian De Palma, Robert Fiore, Bruce Joel Rubin', 'William Arrowsmith', 'William Finley, Joan MacIntosh, Patrick McDermott, William Shephard', null, 'Filmed stageplay based on the ancient greek play The Bacchae written by Euripides. This play is performed by members of The Performance Group, an NYC experimental theater group who has made their own personal adaptation of this ancient text.', 'Filmed stageplay based on the ancient greek play The Bacchae written by Euripides. This play is performed by members of The Performance Group, an NYC experimental theater group who has made their own personal adaptation of this ancient text.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVVf5dFkkzQg3xXqlblWlMIxGd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98048'),
  ('645360363556447764', 'Dior and I', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Frédéric Tcheng, Gilles Piquard', 'Frédéric Tcheng', 'Raf Simons, Pieter Mulier, Bernard Arnault, Donatella Versace, Anna Wintour, Luca Guadagnino, Jennifer Lawrence, Harvey Weinstein', 'NR', 'Behind-the-scenes documentary revealing what goes on inside the colourful, privileged, and sometimes stressful Christian Dior fashion house.', 'Behind-the-scenes documentary revealing what goes on inside the colourful, privileged, and sometimes stressful Christian Dior fashion house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1qBPXztk6C7eZxShmYcGWuiDUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261860'),
  ('1122948546046415791', 'Dios los cría', 1977, null, 'Federico Curiel', null, 'Vicente Fernández, Lorenzo de Monteclaro, Alicia Encinas, Mónica Prado, Carlos Riquelme, María Salomé, Alberto S. Insúa, Anaís de Melo', null, 'Buddy comedy: Bro A poses as Bro B''s blind brother to help him collect an inheritance.', 'Buddy comedy: Bro A poses as Bro B''s blind brother to help him collect an inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smgfrbJIttn2Q65mYrHjOkWOAYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315165'),
  ('647146779658906706', 'Dioses y perros', 2014, 'Drama', 'David Marqués', 'David Marqués', 'Hugo Silva, Megan Montaner, Enrique Arce, Juan Codina, Víctor Palmero, Elio González, Ricard Sales, Miriam Benoit', null, 'Pasca is a sparring low hours without no aspirations in life, who''s working at a gym and lives with her disabled brother. His best friend is an alcoholic former boxer. He wears a gray life until the moment he meets a young teacher girl with a very optimistic view of life, which makes him rethink how to live life.', 'Pasca is a sparring low hours without no aspirations in life, who''s working at a gym and lives with her disabled brother. His best friend is an alcoholic former boxer. He wears a gray life until the moment he meets a young teacher girl with a very optimistic view of life, which makes him rethink how to live life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOROjGAl6OMUVjvMuD2OYyM0Yiq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257938'),
  ('151792823217443051', 'Diplomacy', 2014, 'Drama, History, War', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Michel Amathieu', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Cyril Gely', 'André Dussollier, Niels Arestrup, Burghart Klaußner, Robert Stadlober, Charlie Nelson, Jean-Marc Roulot, Stefan Wilkening, Thomas Arnold', null, 'On the night of August 24, 1944, the fate of Paris rests with General von Choltitz, who plans to destroy the city on Hitler''s orders. As the general prepares to detonate explosives throughout the capital, Swedish consul Raoul Nordling uses diplomacy in a desperate bid to convince him to defy the orders and save Paris.', 'On the night of August 24, 1944, the fate of Paris rests with General von Choltitz, who plans to destroy the city on Hitler''s orders. As the general prepares to detonate explosives throughout the capital, Swedish consul Raoul Nordling uses diplomacy in a desperate bid to convince him to defy the orders and save Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4G0i0a5NJphxCrYOZIrcYlz15O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253239'),
  ('931657225526528913', 'Diplomatic Courier', 1952, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Henry Hathaway, Lucien Ballard', 'Casey Robinson, Liam O''Brien', 'Tyrone Power, Patricia Neal, Stephen McNally, Hildegard Knef, Karl Malden, James Millican, Stefan Schnabel, Herbert Berghof', 'NR', 'During the Cold War, diplomatic courier Mike Kells must retrieve a dispatch containing top-secret intelligence. But when he arrives at the meeting point, a train station in Salzburg, his contact turns up dead, and the message is nowhere to be found. With no clear suspect in sight, Kells must sort through his uncertain relationships with two women, while sidestepping the pitfalls of subterfuge, sabotage and spies in his search for the documents.', 'During the Cold War, diplomatic courier Mike Kells must retrieve a dispatch containing top-secret intelligence. But when he arrives at the meeting point, a train station in Salzburg, his contact turns up dead, and the message is nowhere to be found. With no clear suspect in sight, Kells must sort through his uncertain relationships with two women, while sidestepping the pitfalls of subterfuge, sabotage and spies in his search for the documents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fF3q6LXQFfCD09QlJwXog2wQfNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4462'),
  ('128061037160062063', 'Diplomatic Siege', 1999, 'Action, Thriller', 'Gustavo Graef-Marino, Steven Wacks', 'Mark Amin, Robert Boris, Kevin Bernhardt', 'Daryl Hannah, Irina Movilă, Peter Weller, Tom Berenger, Brion James, Jer Adrianne Lelliott, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Lia Bugnar', 'R', 'When Steve Mitchell is clandestinely sent to the US embassy in Bucharest, Romania to disarm a nuclear bomb that has secretly remained in the building since the end of the Cold War, little does he know that other problems will soon erupt. He must join Erica Long, a diplomatic attaché who is not all that she appears, to work together on setting the correct computer code that will disable the weapon and accomplish the mission. But while watching video monitors from inside a long-forgotten surveillance room, Steve witnesses a surprising deadly takeover of the building by the Serbian Liberation Front.', 'When Steve Mitchell is clandestinely sent to the US embassy in Bucharest, Romania to disarm a nuclear bomb that has secretly remained in the building since the end of the Cold War, little does he know that other problems will soon erupt. He must join Erica Long, a diplomatic attaché who is not all that she appears, to work together on setting the correct computer code that will disable the weapon and accomplish the mission. But while watching video monitors from inside a long-forgotten surveillance room, Steve witnesses a surprising deadly takeover of the building by the Serbian Liberation Front.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAahz2oxMjdDRsXWdebzNKlBdyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27058'),
  ('487604463580689896', 'Diptych', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Guy Durban, Walerian Borowczyk, Walerian Borowczyk', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'Léon Boyer', null, 'A short film by Walerian Borowczyk in two parts. The first ''panel'' follows the morning routine of Leon Boyer who, despite being almost 100 years old, still farms the land, drives a vintage car, and plays with his two dogs. The second panel shows shots of beautiful flowers and a cat, to a recording of Tino Rossi singing ''La romance de Nadir / Je crois encore entendre'' from Bizet''s opera ''Les pêcheurs de perles''.', 'A short film by Walerian Borowczyk in two parts. The first ''panel'' follows the morning routine of Leon Boyer who, despite being almost 100 years old, still farms the land, drives a vintage car, and plays with his two dogs. The second panel shows shots of beautiful flowers and a cat, to a recording of Tino Rossi singing ''La romance de Nadir / Je crois encore entendre'' from Bizet''s opera ''Les pêcheurs de perles''.', null, 'tmdb:movie:291436'),
  ('156143575943902950', 'Dipu Number Two', 1996, 'Adventure, Family', 'Morshedul Islam, MA Mobin', 'Morshedul Islam', 'Arun Saha, Shubashish Roy, Bobita, Bulbul Ahmed, Shafquat, Forhad, Heera, Mashfiq', null, 'An adventure story for young boys, Dipu Number Two is the second film of a talented director from Bangladesh who is one of the few who concentrate on quality filmmaking in a country with a rich commercial film industry. The story is taken from a youth-oriented novel in which Dipu, a boy belonging to the educated class, is teased by the school bully but eventually forms a deep relationship with him. The rest is totally escapist in nature, including a scene in which the two youths manage to capture single-handedly an entire group of robbers.', 'An adventure story for young boys, Dipu Number Two is the second film of a talented director from Bangladesh who is one of the few who concentrate on quality filmmaking in a country with a rich commercial film industry. The story is taken from a youth-oriented novel in which Dipu, a boy belonging to the educated class, is teased by the school bully but eventually forms a deep relationship with him. The rest is totally escapist in nature, including a scene in which the two youths manage to capture single-handedly an entire group of robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Gz1HkpZhwWpyuual7eytb5CBj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93527'),
  ('1028432437835509756', 'Direct Action', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Sidney J. Furie, Curtis Petersen', 'Greg Mellott', 'Dolph Lundgren, Polly Shannon, Donald Burda, Rothaford Gray, Conrad Dunn, Walter Alza, Alex Karzis, Larry Day', null, 'Frank Gannon, a veteran cop, is being hunted by his fellow police officers after they learned he has betrayed the brotherhood and exposed to the feds wide scale corruption of the LAPD. He has one day left to prove his case and survive.', 'Frank Gannon, a veteran cop, is being hunted by his fellow police officers after they learned he has betrayed the brotherhood and exposed to the feds wide scale corruption of the LAPD. He has one day left to prove his case and survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgS2xvButiNQtT1dGf1cukdoMcR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28280'),
  ('117042627508877569', 'Direct Contact', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Danny Lerner, Ross W. Clarkson', 'Les Weldon', 'Dolph Lundgren, Gina May, Michael Paré, Bashar Rahal, James Chalke, Vladimir Vladimirov, Raicho Vasilev, Nikolay Stanoev', null, 'An imprisoned ex-US Special forces operative in Eastern Europe, is offered his freedom and money to rescue an American woman, who has been kidnapped by a ruthless warlord. But, shortly after freeing her discovers that the kidnap story was just a ruse to bring her out into the open.', 'An imprisoned ex-US Special forces operative in Eastern Europe, is offered his freedom and money to rescue an American woman, who has been kidnapped by a ruthless warlord. But, shortly after freeing her discovers that the kidnap story was just a ruse to bring her out into the open.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVEoVHjy9ULTp28XefHRYkMwZsk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20236'),
  ('741607897933411831', 'Directed by Andrei Tarkovsky', 1988, 'Documentary', 'Michał Leszczyłowski, Arne Carlsson', 'Michał Leszczyłowski', 'Brian Cox, Erland Josephson, Andrei Tarkovsky, Larisa Tarkovskaya, Sven Nykvist', null, 'This documentary offers a rare glimpse of the legendary Soviet filmmaker, Andrei Tarkosvky, at work. Tarkovsky made only seven films in his brief, but brilliant, career; Michal Leszczylowski''s respectful movie chronicles him at work on his last film, The Sacrifice. Offering insight into Tarkovsky''s working methods and transcendental aesthetics, the movie is a compelling account of the difficulties of film production. In the case of an uncompromising and visionary filmmaker like Tarkovsky, the practical problems of filmmaking are only magnified, as cast and crew struggle to realize the ambitious concepts in Tarkovsky''s mind.', 'This documentary offers a rare glimpse of the legendary Soviet filmmaker, Andrei Tarkosvky, at work. Tarkovsky made only seven films in his brief, but brilliant, career; Michal Leszczylowski''s respectful movie chronicles him at work on his last film, The Sacrifice. Offering insight into Tarkovsky''s working methods and transcendental aesthetics, the movie is a compelling account of the difficulties of film production. In the case of an uncompromising and visionary filmmaker like Tarkovsky, the practical problems of filmmaking are only magnified, as cast and crew struggle to realize the ambitious concepts in Tarkovsky''s mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcuUQqLtc9VOKZEfNb04q99ezxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54560'),
  ('775476170724912211', 'Directed by John Ford', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Peter Bogdanovich, Patrick Alexander Stewart, Eric Sherman', 'Peter Bogdanovich', 'Orson Welles, Clint Eastwood, Katharine Hepburn, Walter Hill, Maureen O''Hara, Martin Scorsese, Steven Spielberg, John Wayne', null, 'A documentary about the life and films of director John Ford.', 'A documentary about the life and films of director John Ford.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kv3tPDvWyGTQ2Nb66LTXwK18iXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94623'),
  ('573222065154285856', 'Director by Night', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Anthony Giacchino, Andrew Baker', 'Anthony Giacchino', 'Michael Giacchino, Anthony Giacchino, Josephine Giacchino, Mike Giacchino, Harry Harvey, Tom White, Mike Bryson, Jeffrey Ford', 'PG-13', 'Acclaimed composer Michael Giacchino made his directorial debut with Marvel Studios'' Special Presentation "Werewolf by Night." This behind-the-scenes special explores Giacchino''s vision, style and approach to bringing the chilling story to life, as well as offering an insider''s look at the between-the-scenes making of "Werewolf by Night."', 'Acclaimed composer Michael Giacchino made his directorial debut with Marvel Studios'' Special Presentation "Werewolf by Night." This behind-the-scenes special explores Giacchino''s vision, style and approach to bringing the chilling story to life, as well as offering an insider''s look at the between-the-scenes making of "Werewolf by Night."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmaM75vvcYPd9HdiSvF683UedZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1036996'),
  ('51200597153642285', 'Dirigible', 1931, 'Adventure, Drama, War', 'Frank Capra, Joseph Walker', 'Jo Swerling', 'Jack Holt, Ralph Graves, Fay Wray, Hobart Bosworth, Roscoe Karns, Harold Goodwin, Clarence Muse, Emmett Corrigan', null, 'Dirigible commander Jack Braden and Navy pilot ''Frisky'' Pierce fight over the glory associated with a successful expedition to the South Pole and the love of beautiful Helen, Frisky''s wife. After Braden''s dirigible expedition fails, Frisky tries an expedition by plane. Unfortunately he crashes and strands his party at the South Pole. Braden must decide between a risky rescue attempt by dirigible and remaining safely at home with Helen.', 'Dirigible commander Jack Braden and Navy pilot ''Frisky'' Pierce fight over the glory associated with a successful expedition to the South Pole and the love of beautiful Helen, Frisky''s wife. After Braden''s dirigible expedition fails, Frisky tries an expedition by plane. Unfortunately he crashes and strands his party at the South Pole. Braden must decide between a risky rescue attempt by dirigible and remaining safely at home with Helen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45e7kUOTETBB9xp5vkRg28sdmAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99922'),
  ('910380035742032964', 'Dirkie', 1969, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Jamie Uys', 'Jamie Uys', 'Wynand Uys, Jamie Uys, Lady Frolic of Belvedale, Wilhelm Esterhuizen, Sue Burman, Jan Bruijn, Pieter Hauptfleisch, Johan Du Plooy', null, 'An 8-year-old boy and his dog are left to face a vast desert wasteland alone after a plane crash, while an army of men and machines penetrate the desert searching for them. Based on true events.', 'An 8-year-old boy and his dog are left to face a vast desert wasteland alone after a plane crash, while an army of men and machines penetrate the desert searching for them. Based on true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmJXilyuRrhvYu6NCEE9KY6TneF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47962'),
  ('483745238039626509', 'Dirt', 2018, 'Drama, Action', 'Alex Ranarivelo, Reuben Steinberg', 'John Ducey', 'Kevin Dillon, DeRon Horton, Christina Moore, Ntare Guma Mbaho Mwine, Dominic DeVore, Matthew Glave, Blake Heron, Nicole Cesa', 'PG-13', 'In search of a lifeline for his struggling off road racing team, a man takes on a young car thief looking for a second chance, but as their worlds collide, they must struggle to forge a successful alliance.', 'In search of a lifeline for his struggling off road racing team, a man takes on a young car thief looking for a second chance, but as their worlds collide, they must struggle to forge a successful alliance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaZgso4P0wW9IsXTzpOtfU0UxbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480823'),
  ('907904244599673078', 'Dirt Music', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sam Chiplin, Gregor Jordan', 'Jack Thorne', 'Kelly Macdonald, Garrett Hedlund, David Wenham, Aaron Pedersen, Ava Caryofyllis, Dan Wyllie, Chris Haywood, Julia Stone', 'PG-13', 'Georgie is slowly suffocating in a loveless marriage to fishing tycoon Jim Buckridge. Handsome poacher Lu is an irresistible symbol of the excitement she craves. A passionate affair follows that reveals the dark secrets in Lu’s past and forces him to take flight into the blistering heat of the outback. Georgie follows, determined to find him and bring him back.', 'Georgie is slowly suffocating in a loveless marriage to fishing tycoon Jim Buckridge. Handsome poacher Lu is an irresistible symbol of the excitement she craves. A passionate affair follows that reveals the dark secrets in Lu’s past and forces him to take flight into the blistering heat of the outback. Georgie follows, determined to find him and bring him back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FbR35fAEr6vMiQLyxeCSgHkgvW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540414'),
  ('565353303451573043', 'Dirty', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Chris Fisher', null, 'Clifton Collins Jr., Cuba Gooding Jr., Keith David, Cole Hauser, Wood Harris, Aimee Garcia, Gates McFadden, Nicholas Gonzalez', 'R', 'Two gangbangers turned cops try and cover up a scandal within the LAPD.', 'Two gangbangers turned cops try and cover up a scandal within the LAPD.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SmbCDYvQEJTWaGcwCUOxHAph39.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10598'),
  ('321150506634948701', 'Dirty 30', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Andrew Bush, Tom Banks, Shayna Sherwood', 'Molly Prather, Mamrie Hart', 'Grace Helbig, Mamrie Hart, Hannah Hart, Matt Dellapina, Adam Lustick, Andy Ridings, Katherine Hughes, Annie Sertich', 'PG-13', 'On the eve of a Kate''s 30th birthday, she agrees to let her two lifelong friends, Evie and Charlie, throw her a party. But what''s supposed to be a simple celebration becomes a wild who''s who of past and present, and things quickly spiral out of control.', 'On the eve of a Kate''s 30th birthday, she agrees to let her two lifelong friends, Evie and Charlie, throw her a party. But what''s supposed to be a simple celebration becomes a wild who''s who of past and present, and things quickly spiral out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRDdvaJsiZimm1enx2ApkCxaee4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377492'),
  ('634304376083174780', 'Dirty Angels', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Martin Campbell, David Tattersall, Jamie Marshall', 'Alissa Sullivan Haggis, Jonas McCord', 'Eva Green, Maria Bakalova, Ruby Rose, Reza Brojerdi, Jojo T. Gibbs, Emily Bruni, Aziz Çapkurt, Rona-Lee Shimon', 'R', 'During the United States'' 2021 withdrawal from Afghanistan, a group of female soldiers posing as medical relief are sent back in to rescue a group of kidnapped teenagers caught between ISIS and the Taliban.', 'During the United States'' 2021 withdrawal from Afghanistan, a group of female soldiers posing as medical relief are sent back in to rescue a group of kidnapped teenagers caught between ISIS and the Taliban.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1y3TG8N8zwwMxqh0qzdyDs3IyCq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1043905'),
  ('481491687445794988', 'Dirty Computer', 2018, 'Music, Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Emma Westenberg, Lacey Duke, Alan Ferguson', 'Chuck Lightning, Andrew Donoho, Lacey Duke', 'Janelle Monáe, Tessa Thompson, Jayson Aaron, Michele Hart, Dyson Posey, Alex Wexo, Logan Hunt, Mel James Payne', null, 'The story of a young woman named Jane 57821, who is living in a totalitarian near-future society where citizens are referred to as ''computers.'' ''Dirty Computer'' explores humanity and what truly happens to life, liberty and the pursuit of happiness when mind and machines merge, and when the government chooses fear over freedom.', 'The story of a young woman named Jane 57821, who is living in a totalitarian near-future society where citizens are referred to as ''computers.'' ''Dirty Computer'' explores humanity and what truly happens to life, liberty and the pursuit of happiness when mind and machines merge, and when the government chooses fear over freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0DmUmSXuQmlHq83OsX0g13blaK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517582'),
  ('1077201463932096716', 'Dirty Dancing', 1987, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Jeffrey Jur, Emile Ardolino, Kevin Lee Allen', 'Eleanor Bergstein', 'Jennifer Grey, Patrick Swayze, Cynthia Rhodes, Neal Jones, Jerry Orbach, Kelly Bishop, Jane Brucker, Max Cantor', 'PG-13', 'Expecting the usual tedium that accompanies a summer in the Catskills with her family, 17-year-old Frances ''Baby'' Houseman is surprised to find herself stepping into the shoes of a professional hoofer—and unexpectedly falling in love.', 'Expecting the usual tedium that accompanies a summer in the Catskills with her family, 17-year-old Frances ''Baby'' Houseman is surprised to find herself stepping into the shoes of a professional hoofer—and unexpectedly falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Jw6jys7q9gjzVX5zm1z0gC8gY9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88'),
  ('478458493133709843', 'Dirty Dancing', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wayne Blair, Mike De La Vina, Hope Garrison', 'Eleanor Bergstein', 'Abigail Breslin, Colt Prattes, Sarah Hyland, Nicole Scherzinger, Tony Roberts, J. Quinton Johnson, Shane Harper, Trevor Einhorn', null, 'Spending the summer at a Catskills resort with her family, Frances "Baby" Houseman falls in love with the camp''s dance instructor, Johnny Castle, and nothing is ever the same for anyone in the Houseman family.', 'Spending the summer at a Catskills resort with her family, Frances "Baby" Houseman falls in love with the camp''s dance instructor, Johnny Castle, and nothing is ever the same for anyone in the Houseman family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySL7B4FgYZR5xFBWc7c7lssuCN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444902'),
  ('555886048983093364', 'Dirty Dancing: Havana Nights', 2004, 'Romance, Drama', 'Anthony B. Richmond, Guy Ferland, Zoraida Sanjurjo López', 'Boaz Yakin, Victoria Arch', 'Diego Luna, Romola Garai, Sela Ward, John Slattery, Jonathan Jackson, January Jones, Mika Boorem, René Lavan', 'PG-13', 'In pre-revolution Cuba, Katey Miller is about to defy everyone''s expectations. Instead of a parent-approved suitor, Katey is drawn to the sexy waiter, Javier, who spends his nights dancing in Havana''s nightclubs. As she secretly learns to dance with Javier, she learns the meanings of love, sensuality and independence.', 'In pre-revolution Cuba, Katey Miller is about to defy everyone''s expectations. Instead of a parent-approved suitor, Katey is drawn to the sexy waiter, Javier, who spends his nights dancing in Havana''s nightclubs. As she secretly learns to dance with Javier, she learns the meanings of love, sensuality and independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FnSCH592YIivbKtotq7YQanvmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10677'),
  ('840281856601056641', 'Dirty Deeds', 2002, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'David Caesar, Geoffrey Hall, Marc Spicer', 'David Caesar', 'Bryan Brown, Toni Collette, John Goodman, Sam Neill, Sam Worthington, Kestie Morassi, William McInnes, Andrew S. Gilbert', null, 'Set in 1960s Sydney, this is the story of an Australian gangster whose booming business, buoyed by the influx of U.S. soldiers in town for R&R during their tours in Vietnam, attracts the attention of first the Chicago mafia, and then their East Coast competitors.', 'Set in 1960s Sydney, this is the story of an Australian gangster whose booming business, buoyed by the influx of U.S. soldiers in town for R&R during their tours in Vietnam, attracts the attention of first the Chicago mafia, and then their East Coast competitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nM2AlzAoRzxlBRP5OoalpPbujQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22242'),
  ('599998446578446806', 'Dirty Deeds', 2005, 'Comedy', 'David Kendall, Mark Doering-Powell', 'Jonathan Thies, Jon Land', 'Milo Ventimiglia, Lacey Chabert, Zoe Saldaña, Arielle Kebbel, Charles Durning, Tom Amandes, Matthew Carey, Mark Derwin', 'PG-13', 'According to a high school''s lore, the "Dirty Deeds" are a daunting list of dares almost no student has ever completed. To win the student body''s respect and get noticed by his crush, senior Zach is determined to finish the list in the allotted 24-hour time period. As the school''s bullying jocks try to thwart him at every turn, Zach embarks on a wild journey, highlighted by beer swilling, grand theft auto and the snagging of an ex-homecoming queen''s bra.', 'According to a high school''s lore, the "Dirty Deeds" are a daunting list of dares almost no student has ever completed. To win the student body''s respect and get noticed by his crush, senior Zach is determined to finish the list in the allotted 24-hour time period. As the school''s bullying jocks try to thwart him at every turn, Zach embarks on a wild journey, highlighted by beer swilling, grand theft auto and the snagging of an ex-homecoming queen''s bra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fw9FRxhBftqehUVBCvsXwNQnPsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15022'),
  ('153993411005853121', 'Dirty Dingus Magee', 1970, 'Comedy, Western', 'Burt Kennedy, Harry Stradling Jr.', 'Tom Waldman, Joseph Heller, Frank Waldman', 'Frank Sinatra, George Kennedy, Anne Jackson, Lois Nettleton, Jack Elam, Michele Carey, John Dehner, Henry Jones', 'PG-13', 'Ass-breaker Dingus Magee is looking for a gold train when he comes upon old acquaintance Hoke Birdsill on stage to San Francisco, and robs him of his money. Hoke goes to the nearby town of Yerkey''s Hole, where Belle Knops is both mayor and bordello-mistress. She appoints Hoke Town Sheriff and tries to get him to stir up the Indians so the soldiers at the nearby fort (the main customers) won''t go to Little Big Horn. Dingus tries to stir up more trouble and get involved with the pale, baby-talking Indian, Anna. The film is a send-up of the oft-repeated phrase "the Code of the West" and exaggerates it and what it stands for into the ridiculousness that it is.', 'Ass-breaker Dingus Magee is looking for a gold train when he comes upon old acquaintance Hoke Birdsill on stage to San Francisco, and robs him of his money. Hoke goes to the nearby town of Yerkey''s Hole, where Belle Knops is both mayor and bordello-mistress. She appoints Hoke Town Sheriff and tries to get him to stir up the Indians so the soldiers at the nearby fort (the main customers) won''t go to Little Big Horn. Dingus tries to stir up more trouble and get involved with the pale, baby-talking Indian, Anna. The film is a send-up of the oft-repeated phrase "the Code of the West" and exaggerates it and what it stands for into the ridiculousness that it is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekGTRq3UYzUmdso2Nw1Uv9SLMLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48408'),
  ('985101513100600778', 'Dirty Fears', 2020, 'Horror', 'Carlo Fusco', null, 'Sokol Martin Pepkolaj, Ieva Lykos, Melina Arena, Francesco David Clemente, Michael Madsen, Ilaria Malvezzi, Eleonora Puglia, Eric Roberts', null, 'After an escaped mental patient takes possession and care of a mysterious mountain motel, what was once a place for rest and relaxation becomes a place of nightmares.', 'After an escaped mental patient takes possession and care of a mysterious mountain motel, what was once a place for rest and relaxation becomes a place of nightmares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emc3fH9BfEdrDnoUB7HYBKcQcmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:769098'),
  ('729731048180392999', 'Dirty Filthy Love', 2005, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Adrian Shergold, David Odd', 'Jeff Pope, Ian Puleston-Davies', 'Michael Sheen, Shirley Henderson, Adrian Bower, Claudie Blakley, Anastasia Griffith, Anton Lesser, Elliot Cowan, Rupert Young', 'R', 'A man''s life falls apart as a result of his affliction with Obsessive Compulsive Disorder and Tourette''s Syndrome in this touching and funny tale.', 'A man''s life falls apart as a result of his affliction with Obsessive Compulsive Disorder and Tourette''s Syndrome in this touching and funny tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MduGn66iGDdlgHtBqIa9bKDZbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65579'),
  ('349917481591913018', 'Dirty Gertie from Harlem U.S.A.', 1946, 'Drama', 'Spencer Williams', 'True T. Thompson', 'Francine Everett, Spencer Williams, Don Wilson, Katherine Moore, Alfred Hawkins, David Boykin, L.E. Lewis, Inez Newell', null, 'A Harlem nightclub entertainer arrives on the Caribbean island of "Rinidad" to perform as the headliner in a revue at the Paradise Hotel. She quickly attracts the attention of several men.', 'A Harlem nightclub entertainer arrives on the Caribbean island of "Rinidad" to perform as the headliner in a revue at the Paradise Hotel. She quickly attracts the attention of several men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXsMfWgsjq6aB4laWCBcR92opUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43473'),
  ('173208939891948052', 'Dirty Girl', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Abe Sylvia, Steve Gainer', 'Abe Sylvia', 'Juno Temple, Jeremy Dozier, Milla Jovovich, Mary Steenburgen, Dwight Yoakam, William H. Macy, Nicholas D''Agosto, Elsie Fisher', 'R', 'Accompanied by her closeted gay buddy, a promiscuous teenager sets out to find her long-absent father.', 'Accompanied by her closeted gay buddy, a promiscuous teenager sets out to find her long-absent father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQ6tNsVfa9DSGzmuvDdlOBZUexY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70695'),
  ('745395673465376037', 'Dirty Grandpa', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Dan Mazer, Eric Alan Edwards, Josh King', 'John Phillips', 'Robert De Niro, Zac Efron, Aubrey Plaza, Zoey Deutch, Julianne Hough, Dermot Mulroney, Adam Pally, Brandon Mychal Smith', 'R', 'Jason Kelly is one week away from marrying his boss''s uber-controlling daughter, putting him on the fast track for a partnership at the law firm. However, when the straight-laced Jason is tricked into driving his foul-mouthed grandfather, Dick, to Daytona for spring break, his pending nuptials are suddenly in jeopardy. Between riotous frat parties, bar fights, and an epic night of karaoke, Dick is on a quest to live his life to the fullest and bring Jason along for the ride.', 'Jason Kelly is one week away from marrying his boss''s uber-controlling daughter, putting him on the fast track for a partnership at the law firm. However, when the straight-laced Jason is tricked into driving his foul-mouthed grandfather, Dick, to Daytona for spring break, his pending nuptials are suddenly in jeopardy. Between riotous frat parties, bar fights, and an epic night of karaoke, Dick is on a quest to live his life to the fullest and bring Jason along for the ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0Lz1TfSlbcQthQKYGwE7blDfwN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291870'),
  ('605325317783037184', 'Dirty Hands', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Josef Kubota Wladyka', 'Alan Blanco, Josef Kubota Wladyka', 'Cristian James Abvincula, Jarlin Javier Martínez', null, 'Towing a submerged torpedo in the wake of their battered fishing boat, a desperate fisherman and a naive kid embark on a journey trafficking millions of dollars worth of cocaine. Shot entirely on location along the Pacific coast of Colombia—in areas that bear the indelible scars of the drug trade—Manos Sucias refuses to glamorize the drug trade but rather seeks to offer a rare glimpse of its devastating effects.', 'Towing a submerged torpedo in the wake of their battered fishing boat, a desperate fisherman and a naive kid embark on a journey trafficking millions of dollars worth of cocaine. Shot entirely on location along the Pacific coast of Colombia—in areas that bear the indelible scars of the drug trade—Manos Sucias refuses to glamorize the drug trade but rather seeks to offer a rare glimpse of its devastating effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whhaFZPtpRhoALHuLId01s0nr2G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261033'),
  ('1141431263981837912', 'Dirty Harry', 1971, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Bruce Surtees, Don Siegel, Robert Rubin', 'Rita M. Fink, Dean Riesner, Harry Julian Fink', 'Clint Eastwood, Harry Guardino, Reni Santoni, John Vernon, Andrew Robinson, John Larch, John Mitchum, Mae Mercer', 'R', 'When a madman dubbed ''Scorpio'' terrorizes San Francisco, hard-nosed cop, Harry Callahan – famous for his take-no-prisoners approach to law enforcement – is tasked with hunting down the psychopath.', 'When a madman dubbed ''Scorpio'' terrorizes San Francisco, hard-nosed cop, Harry Callahan – famous for his take-no-prisoners approach to law enforcement – is tasked with hunting down the psychopath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scl2JDHzYoIEs5xyYy5ITCfyY0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:984'),
  ('87470551606945019', 'Dirty Hearts', 2012, 'History, Drama, War', 'Vicente Amorim, Rodrigo Monte', null, 'Tsuyoshi Ihara, Takako Tokiwa, Eiji Okuda, Shun Sugata, Eduardo Moscovis, Kimiko Yo, Ricardo Oshiro, Ulisses Sakurai', null, 'In 1945, Japan surrendered to the United States and the Second World War was over. Right? Wrong. For eighty percent of the Japanese community in Brazil, Japan had won the war and defeat was nothing more than American propaganda. The few immigrants that accepted the truth were persecuted. Some were hunted down and assassinated - by their own countrymen - causing the start of a new, private war. Dirty Hearts is a thriller and love story told by the wife of one of the fanatics dedicated to preach Japanese victory. Little by little, she watches her husband, a hard-working immigrant, become an assassin and their love story fade away.', 'In 1945, Japan surrendered to the United States and the Second World War was over. Right? Wrong. For eighty percent of the Japanese community in Brazil, Japan had won the war and defeat was nothing more than American propaganda. The few immigrants that accepted the truth were persecuted. Some were hunted down and assassinated - by their own countrymen - causing the start of a new, private war. Dirty Hearts is a thriller and love story told by the wife of one of the fanatics dedicated to preach Japanese victory. Little by little, she watches her husband, a hard-working immigrant, become an assassin and their love story fade away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moWU02OXqMDHxrNCjPCDpRaY6Lg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126304'),
  ('888116806972409895', 'Dirty Ho', 1979, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan, Huang Pa-Ching', 'Ni Kuang', 'Wong Yu, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Lo Lieh, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Hsiao Ho, Wilson Tong Wai-Shing, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Helen Poon Bing-Seung', 'R', 'A prince enlists a thief to serve as his bodyguard to protect him from assassins.', 'A prince enlists a thief to serve as his bodyguard to protect him from assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2aj0CSXeC6tlT3eZCv6t6JqHKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54182'),
