  ('312362372987918641', 'Dirty Love', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Asher, Eric Wycoff, Michael Risoli', 'Jenny McCarthy', 'Jenny McCarthy, Eddie Kaye Thomas, Carmen Electra, Guillermo Díaz, Victor Webster, Kam Heskin, Jessica Collins, Noah Harpster', 'R', 'The klutzy yet stunning Rebecca Sommers walks in on her hunky boyfriend in bed with another woman. They break up and Rebecca starts to fall apart, but, with the help of her close girlfriends, she begins to date again. Unfortunately, the men she meets all happen to be crazy. John, her dorky guy friend, tries to express his secret love for Rebecca, but she''s too busy to notice as she tries to come to terms with her breakup.', 'The klutzy yet stunning Rebecca Sommers walks in on her hunky boyfriend in bed with another woman. They break up and Rebecca starts to fall apart, but, with the help of her close girlfriends, she begins to date again. Unfortunately, the men she meets all happen to be crazy. John, her dorky guy friend, tries to express his secret love for Rebecca, but she''s too busy to notice as she tries to come to terms with her breakup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aN5hVMCAeqlypwAEAAsORK8dExI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18189'),
  ('995828580899404745', 'Dirty Mary Crazy Larry', 1974, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'John Hough, Michael D. Margulies, Ronald L. Schwary', 'Leigh Chapman, Antonio Santean', 'Peter Fonda, Susan George, Adam Roarke, Kenneth Tobey, Eugene Daniels, Lynn Borden, Janear Hines, Elizabeth James', 'PG', 'Down-on-their-luck racers Larry and Deke steal from a supermarket manager to buy a car that will help them advance their racing chances. Their escape does not go as planned when Larry''s one-night stand, Mary, tags along for the ride.', 'Down-on-their-luck racers Larry and Deke steal from a supermarket manager to buy a car that will help them advance their racing chances. Their escape does not go as planned when Larry''s one-night stand, Mary, tags along for the ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hLvJUBEFFQHgiJIPXywRD9KZft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19017'),
  ('829813528230739359', 'Dirty Money', 2024, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Park Jung-hun, Kim Min-su, Kim Bo-hyeon', 'Kim Min-su, Hwang Eun-sung', 'Jung Woo, Kim Dae-myung, Park Byung-eun, Cho Hyun-chul, Jung Hae-kyun, Teo Yoo, Baek Soo-jang, Yoo Seung-mok', null, 'Two detectives in need; Myung-deuk looks after gang and takes bribes for his sick daughter; Dong-hyeok helps Myung-deuk to settle his gambling debts. One day they hear an information that Chinese gang is shipping a big amount of cash abroad and decide to steal it for themselves. But things go wrong and they''re now chased both by police and Chinese gang.', 'Two detectives in need; Myung-deuk looks after gang and takes bribes for his sick daughter; Dong-hyeok helps Myung-deuk to settle his gambling debts. One day they hear an information that Chinese gang is shipping a big amount of cash abroad and decide to steal it for themselves. But things go wrong and they''re now chased both by police and Chinese gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYgEyFCopQDGqcYkpPpDdMpZA44.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572195'),
  ('879246345156824756', 'Dirty Movie', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Jerry Daigle, George Gibson, George Pattison', 'Alan Donnes, Tanner Colby', 'Emily Donahoe, Christopher Meloni, Diane Neal, Stylist B., Robert Klein, Mario Cantone, Cyndi Lauper, Adam Ferrara', null, 'An outrageous cut-rate producer is about to fulfill his lifelong dream to make a movie about the most offensive, dirtiest jokes ever told. As Charlie and his filmmaking team hilariously struggle to write a script and assemble their award-winning cast, the movie-within-a-movie emerges with one dirty joke after another. Only one can take the crown for writing the dirtiest joke ever told, and Charlie will do whatever he can to be that king.', 'An outrageous cut-rate producer is about to fulfill his lifelong dream to make a movie about the most offensive, dirtiest jokes ever told. As Charlie and his filmmaking team hilariously struggle to write a script and assemble their award-winning cast, the movie-within-a-movie emerges with one dirty joke after another. Only one can take the crown for writing the dirtiest joke ever told, and Charlie will do whatever he can to be that king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ff5bC7A97Ce78TF8sAZ7Jdl7dI3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56965'),
  ('329840249385002196', 'Dirty O''Neil', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Lewis Teague, Leon Capetanos, Mark Kasdan', 'Leon Capetanos', 'Morgan Paull, Art Metrano, Pat Anderson, Jeane Manson, Katie Saylor, Raymond O''Keefe, Tommy J. Huff, Bob Potter', null, 'A police officer has very little work as there is virtually no crime in his small California town...until three hoodlums appear and rape a young woman.', 'A police officer has very little work as there is virtually no crime in his small California town...until three hoodlums appear and rape a young woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trKTdcaEt0fYzftGFxxJx1ddtUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90079'),
  ('678083074273616634', 'Dirty Pair: Affair on Nolandia', 1985, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Toshio Shirai, Masaharu Okuwaki', 'Kazunori Ito', 'Kyoko Tongu, Saeko Shimazu, Keiko Han, Toshiko Fujita, Gara Takashima, Masaru Ikeda, Banjo Ginga, Naoki Makishima', null, 'The Lovely Angels are dispatched to the planet of Ookbar in search of a missing girl. Kei and Yuri have traced young Missinie to the forest of Nolandia, but their investigations have stalled thanks to the less than helpful Chief of Security. But Kei and Yuri never let a little bureaucracy stand in their way. It''s the unicorns and UFOs, not to mention the rampaging killer robot, that are going to be the problem as the Dirty Pair tackle their toughest case yet.', 'The Lovely Angels are dispatched to the planet of Ookbar in search of a missing girl. Kei and Yuri have traced young Missinie to the forest of Nolandia, but their investigations have stalled thanks to the less than helpful Chief of Security. But Kei and Yuri never let a little bureaucracy stand in their way. It''s the unicorns and UFOs, not to mention the rampaging killer robot, that are going to be the problem as the Dirty Pair tackle their toughest case yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0V7kkv27rIQdLF8UyLm3DqqnMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68364'),
  ('1114271290862202058', 'Dirty Pair: Flight 005 Conspiracy', 1990, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Toshifumi Takizawa, Atsushi Okui', 'Haruka Takachiho, Yoshitake Suzuki', 'Kyoko Tongu, Saeko Shimazu, Gorō Naya, Kenyu Horiuchi, Koji Totani, Hiroshi Hashimoto, Ikuya Sawaki, Jurota Kosugi', 'NR', 'The 3WA''s Central Computer gave the Lovely Angels two cases at once! Kei and Yuri must investigate a space liner explosion and, simultaneously, find a missing scientist. It all seems easy enough, but this is actually the Angels'' most dangerous mission yet – and if they''re not careful, it''ll be their last.', 'The 3WA''s Central Computer gave the Lovely Angels two cases at once! Kei and Yuri must investigate a space liner explosion and, simultaneously, find a missing scientist. It all seems easy enough, but this is actually the Angels'' most dangerous mission yet – and if they''re not careful, it''ll be their last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrzZXEXPpML6aOuuDUbmgSNXAlR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68367'),
  ('489627836864278256', 'Dirty Pair: Project Eden', 1986, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Koichi Mashimo, Atsushi Okui, Youichi Ogami', 'Hiroyuki Hoshiyama', 'Kyoko Tongu, Saeko Shimazu, Katsuji Mori, Chikao Ohtsuka, Mikio Terashima, Toku Nishio, Shozo Iizuka, Naoki Makishima', null, 'Agerna is a planet rich in Vizorium, the one mineral necessary to space travel. When a series of mysterious attacks on mining operations has world leaders pointing fingers and pinning blame, 3WA naturally send in their top agents to investigate. But are the Lovely Angels up to the task of stopping a mad scientist bent on taking a long dormant alien race to its final evolutionary form? Throw in a thief after a bottle of WWII-vintage wine and it''s a safe bet that nobody''s safe. It''s more chaos, more mayhem, and even more destruction than ever before as the Dirty Pair take on their wildest case yet!', 'Agerna is a planet rich in Vizorium, the one mineral necessary to space travel. When a series of mysterious attacks on mining operations has world leaders pointing fingers and pinning blame, 3WA naturally send in their top agents to investigate. But are the Lovely Angels up to the task of stopping a mad scientist bent on taking a long dormant alien race to its final evolutionary form? Throw in a thief after a bottle of WWII-vintage wine and it''s a safe bet that nobody''s safe. It''s more chaos, more mayhem, and even more destruction than ever before as the Dirty Pair take on their wildest case yet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8l7zeovdhEfw28DlLOgbeWAaHTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68368'),
  ('928489158636778136', 'Dirty Pretty Things', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Stephen Frears, Chris Menges, Martin O''Malley', 'Steven Knight', 'Audrey Tautou, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Sergi López, Benedict Wong, Sophie Okonedo, Zlatko Burić, Damon Younger, Kenan Hudaverdi', 'R', 'An undocumented immigrant finds a human heart in one of the toilets of the west London hotel where he works with other undocumented immigrants.', 'An undocumented immigrant finds a human heart in one of the toilets of the west London hotel where he works with other undocumented immigrants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWpXOqB1STDq8ji3rQawcg1fGS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3472'),
  ('25217704241272524', 'Dirty Rotten Scoundrels', 1988, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Frank Oz, Michael Ballhaus, Bernard Williams', 'Dale Launer, Paul Henning, Stanley Shapiro', 'Steve Martin, Michael Caine, Glenne Headly, Anton Rodgers, Barbara Harris, Ian McDiarmid, Dana Ivey, Meagen Fay', 'PG', 'Con artist Lawrence Jamieson is a longtime resident of a luxurious coastal resort, where he enjoys the lavish fruits of his deceptions -- that is, until a competitor, Freddy Benson, shows up. When the new guy''s lowbrow tactics impinge on his own sophisticated work and believing him to be the infamous conman ''The Jackal'', Lawrence resolves to get rid of him. Confident of his own duplicitous talents, he challenges Freddy to a winner-takes-all competition: whoever swindles their latest mark, American heiress Janet Colgate, out of $50,000 first can stay, while the other must leave town.', 'Con artist Lawrence Jamieson is a longtime resident of a luxurious coastal resort, where he enjoys the lavish fruits of his deceptions -- that is, until a competitor, Freddy Benson, shows up. When the new guy''s lowbrow tactics impinge on his own sophisticated work and believing him to be the infamous conman ''The Jackal'', Lawrence resolves to get rid of him. Confident of his own duplicitous talents, he challenges Freddy to a winner-takes-all competition: whoever swindles their latest mark, American heiress Janet Colgate, out of $50,000 first can stay, while the other must leave town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3176xH21fSetstKpEtAD1giHbyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10141'),
