  ('755800545591838206', 'Dirty Sexy Saint', 2019, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Tosca Musk', 'Tosca Musk, Joany Kane', 'Jordan Lane Price, David A. Gregory, Luke Guldan, Matt Magnusson, Jamie Choi, Alena Chinault, Steven Hauck, Brian Cade', 'R', 'Clay Kincaid hates the nickname ''Saint'', he got for being too kind to stray animals and desperate people. Especially when it comes to women. With a rough and damaged past that has left him jaded, he doesn''t do committed relationships. This is before he meets Samantha Jamieson, an heiress turned runaway in need of help. When she starts to work as a waitress at his bar, he discovers that she is someone truly special and amazing… someone that could warm his damaged heart.', 'Clay Kincaid hates the nickname ''Saint'', he got for being too kind to stray animals and desperate people. Especially when it comes to women. With a rough and damaged past that has left him jaded, he doesn''t do committed relationships. This is before he meets Samantha Jamieson, an heiress turned runaway in need of help. When she starts to work as a waitress at his bar, he discovers that she is someone truly special and amazing… someone that could warm his damaged heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x96lVzJuFqGinfsG0EcwYwBmuom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655355'),
  ('458225840837145317', 'Dirty Teacher', 2013, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery, Drama', 'Doug Campbell, Daniel Ringey, Phil Leirness', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Josie Davis, Kelcie Stranahan, Cameron Deane Stewart, Darlene Vogel, Brennan Elliott, Lesli Kay, Marc Raducci, René Ashton', null, 'When a high school senior discovers her teacher is seducing her boyfriend, events turn deadly after the teacher tries to cover it up.', 'When a high school senior discovers her teacher is seducing her boyfriend, events turn deadly after the teacher tries to cover it up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhgfarQ9e72UFcfMJ517XiAjAm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184724'),
  ('252337241306805916', 'Dirty Tiger, Crazy Frog', 1978, 'Action, Comedy', 'Karl Maka, Chu Yat-Hung, Manny Hoh Ming', 'Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Karl Maka', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Lau Kar-Wing, Jason Pai Piao, Cheng Kang-Yeh, Lee Hoi-Sang, Dean Shek Tin, Meg Lam Kin-Ming, Billy Chan Wui-Ngai', null, 'Multi-Hand Chick asks Crazy Frog for protection after stealing someone''s wallet at the casino. Foolishly he accepts, and even more foolishly he follows her home and removes his Invincible Armor when she pretends to be willing to sleep with him. Of course she steals it, and when he tries to follow her, he''s stopped by Dirty Tiger who is on a mission to bring Crazy Frog back to his wife. However, Dirty Tiger would really like to have that armor himself...', 'Multi-Hand Chick asks Crazy Frog for protection after stealing someone''s wallet at the casino. Foolishly he accepts, and even more foolishly he follows her home and removes his Invincible Armor when she pretends to be willing to sleep with him. Of course she steals it, and when he tries to follow her, he''s stopped by Dirty Tiger who is on a mission to bring Crazy Frog back to his wife. However, Dirty Tiger would really like to have that armor himself...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihFKkiICza5LxjSpwbvLafta0wQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72222'),
  ('741938695219063883', 'Dirty War', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Daniel Percival, Graham Smith', 'Lizzie Mickery, Daniel Percival', 'Louise Delamere, Alastair Galbraith, Waleed Elgadi, Martin Savage, Koel Purie, Helen Schlesinger, Ewan Stewart, Paul Antony-Barber', null, 'After years of meticulous planning, a terrorist operation is reaching its final stages. The authorities have received no intelligence; they are in a race against time but don''t yet know it. As the operation unfolds, we see the working lives of men and women directly affected by terrorism. Among them: a firemen worried about the increasingly dangerous conditions he and his men are expected to work under; the head of the anti-terrorist branch whose responsibility it is to protect London and a female Muslim detective brought into Scotland Yard to investigate another suspected terrorist cell. But it is too late to stop the attack.', 'After years of meticulous planning, a terrorist operation is reaching its final stages. The authorities have received no intelligence; they are in a race against time but don''t yet know it. As the operation unfolds, we see the working lives of men and women directly affected by terrorism. Among them: a firemen worried about the increasingly dangerous conditions he and his men are expected to work under; the head of the anti-terrorist branch whose responsibility it is to protect London and a female Muslim detective brought into Scotland Yard to investigate another suspected terrorist cell. But it is too late to stop the attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGk7Q6E8Kx6hXhmN9A1yhNIpiP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39182'),
  ('382271478530738101', 'Dirty Wars', 2013, 'Documentary, Drama, Crime', 'Rick Rowley', 'Jeremy Scahill, David Riker', 'Jeremy Scahill, Nasser Al Aulaqi, Saleha Al Aulaqi, Muqbal Al Kazemi, Abdul Rahman Barman, Saleh Bin Fareed', 'NR', 'Investigative journalist, Jeremy Scahill is pulled into an unexpected journey as he chases down the hidden truth behind America''s expanding covert wars, and examines how the US government has responded to international terrorist threats in ways that seem to go against the established laws of the land.', 'Investigative journalist, Jeremy Scahill is pulled into an unexpected journey as he chases down the hidden truth behind America''s expanding covert wars, and examines how the US government has responded to international terrorist threats in ways that seem to go against the established laws of the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qR96ukVb0bsBUJpvFuxksZLVBqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159004'),
  ('919075126803270789', 'Dirty Weekend', 1973, 'Thriller, Crime, Comedy', 'Dino Risi, Luciano Tovoli', 'Ruggero Maccari, Dino Risi, Bernardino Zapponi', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Oliver Reed, Carole André, Lionel Stander, Bruno Cirino, Nicoletta Machiavelli, Gianni Agus, Marcello Mandò', null, 'A man and his mistress have just taken off for a weekend romp when they''re kidnapped by a trio of bank robbers. They wind up becoming media "stars" as police and reporters follow them. They all wind up at the beat-up shack of a cranky old codger, with the police surrounding them and the robbers threatening to kill everybody.', 'A man and his mistress have just taken off for a weekend romp when they''re kidnapped by a trio of bank robbers. They wind up becoming media "stars" as police and reporters follow them. They all wind up at the beat-up shack of a cranky old codger, with the police surrounding them and the robbers threatening to kill everybody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnGcNuOSjBfRFhSbvG56HcOXFYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326755'),
  ('925174828673643565', 'Dirty Weekend', 1993, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Michael Winner, Alan Jones', 'Michael Winner', 'Lia Williams, Rufus Sewell, Michael Cule, David McCallum, Sean Pertwee, Nicholas Hewetson, Christopher Adamson, Jack Galloway', null, 'Shortly after she moves into her own flat in Brighton, Bella finds she is being spied on and generally harassed by a man living across from her. Finally driven to solving the problem with a hammer, she realises she is then ready for a crusade against other such problem males', 'Shortly after she moves into her own flat in Brighton, Bella finds she is being spied on and generally harassed by a man living across from her. Finally driven to solving the problem with a hammer, she realises she is then ready for a crusade against other such problem males', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjjDAxAlmjYzb8iVxgpWTiKJ6nA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71829'),
  ('765656603700362649', 'Dirty Weekend', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Neil LaBute, Rogier Stoffers', 'Neil LaBute', 'Matthew Broderick, Alice Eve, Phil Burke, Gia Crovatin, Monique Candelaria, Charles Duran, Fredrick Lopez, Matthew Page', null, 'During a layover in Albuquerque, work colleagues Les and Natalie discover more about each other than they ever thought possible. Anxious and irritable, Les is drawn back into the city by past experiences he can’t forget (even if he doesn''t really remember the particulars of his previous drunken adventure). Natalie, refusing to leave his side, follows along as her own secrets are slowly revealed, leaving her feeling both vulnerable and unbound.', 'During a layover in Albuquerque, work colleagues Les and Natalie discover more about each other than they ever thought possible. Anxious and irritable, Les is drawn back into the city by past experiences he can’t forget (even if he doesn''t really remember the particulars of his previous drunken adventure). Natalie, refusing to leave his side, follows along as her own secrets are slowly revealed, leaving her feeling both vulnerable and unbound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFaJh6KaoYz0IsS7TqCtsmBVsaK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333344'),
  ('926684196870758772', 'Dirty Wolves', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Sergi Gallardo, Simón Casal', 'Felipe Rodríguez, Paula Cons, Carmen Abarca', 'Manuela Vellés, Isak Férriz, Marian Álvarez, Rosa Álvarez, Thomas Coumans, Ricardo de Barreiro, Sam Louwyck, Luisa Merelas', null, 'Galicia, Spain, during the Second World War The life of Manuela, a mysterious miner who was branded a witch, changes with the arrival of an Allied commando, in charge of sabotaging the production of tungsten, a vital mineral for the continuity of the war effort of Nazi Germany.', 'Galicia, Spain, during the Second World War The life of Manuela, a mysterious miner who was branded a witch, changes with the arrival of an Allied commando, in charge of sabotaging the production of tungsten, a vital mineral for the continuity of the war effort of Nazi Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyODWsBakIUk7mvyTFikRfOIHmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367499'),
