  ('711954072007962361', 'Dirty Work', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Bob Saget, Arthur Albert, Jonnie Katz', 'Norm Macdonald, Frank Sebastiano, Fred Wolf', 'Norm Macdonald, Artie Lange, Jack Warden, Traylor Howard, Christopher McDonald, Chevy Chase, Don Rickles, Polly Shannon', 'PG-13', 'Unemployed and recently dumped, Mitch and his buddy Sam start a revenge-for-hire business to raise the $50,000 that Sam''s father needs to get a heart transplant.', 'Unemployed and recently dumped, Mitch and his buddy Sam start a revenge-for-hire business to raise the $50,000 that Sam''s father needs to get a heart transplant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6OcS6TQCHal2wHooJhHWSlFzfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14577'),
  ('709252727324533956', 'Dirty Work', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Louisa Warren', 'Shannon Holiday', 'Keely Cat Wells, Claudine-Helene Aumord, Marc Ozall, Tiffany-Ellen Robinson, Ezzet-Charbel Baccache, Tara MacGowran, Darrell Griggs, Lloyd Sparsi', null, 'Arabella, a struggling fashion designer takes on a job working as a personal shopper for Marylin- a successful erotic novelist. One day, Arabella is sneakily trying on some of Marilyn''s expensive garments, when Marylin unexpectedly comes home early......but she is not alone. Arabella hides and watches as Marilyn enters with an attractive man who is not her husband. The pair make love on the bed and Arabella is turned on by what she sees. Arabella continues to hide and watches Marilyn''s many affairs take place in the bedroom, until one day she is caught by Marilyn who admits that she knew Arabella had been watching the whole time. Things get steamy between the pair, but soon they will be confronted by someone who knows about their affair and will do anything to stop it.', 'Arabella, a struggling fashion designer takes on a job working as a personal shopper for Marylin- a successful erotic novelist. One day, Arabella is sneakily trying on some of Marilyn''s expensive garments, when Marylin unexpectedly comes home early......but she is not alone. Arabella hides and watches as Marilyn enters with an attractive man who is not her husband. The pair make love on the bed and Arabella is turned on by what she sees. Arabella continues to hide and watches Marilyn''s many affairs take place in the bedroom, until one day she is caught by Marilyn who admits that she knew Arabella had been watching the whole time. Things get steamy between the pair, but soon they will be confronted by someone who knows about their affair and will do anything to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLkeHxzyTK5F2TGWruTkebtPKtd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592041'),
  ('493725930368904736', 'Dis: A Story About Love', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aune Sand', 'Aune Sand', 'Beate Halkjelsvik, Einar Lund, Beate Charlotte Lunde, Aune Sand, Siv Stubsveen, Charlotte Thiis-Evensen', null, 'Two young people stand on a street corner in a run-down part of New York, kissing. Despite the lawlessness of the district they are left unmolested. A short distance away walk Maria and Andreas. They are on their first date. In an episodic style the film tells of encounters and love among young people. The stories are set in Cairo, Paris, on the coast of Normandy and in New York.', 'Two young people stand on a street corner in a run-down part of New York, kissing. Despite the lawlessness of the district they are left unmolested. A short distance away walk Maria and Andreas. They are on their first date. In an episodic style the film tells of encounters and love among young people. The stories are set in Cairo, Paris, on the coast of Normandy and in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dysWKZKjV79Lj8yzKRdCJ9TJ1Rj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31133'),
  ('1144283112527987846', 'Disappear Completely', 2024, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Glauco Bermudez, Luis Javier Henaine', 'Luis Javier Henaine, Ricardo Aguado-Fentanes', 'Harold Torres, Tete Espinoza, Fermín Martínez, Vicky Araico, Norma Reyna, Quetzali Cortés, Eligio Meléndez, José Manuel Poncelis', null, 'An ambitious and insensitive tabloid crime photographer falls victim to a mysterious illness that makes him lose, one by one, his five senses.', 'An ambitious and insensitive tabloid crime photographer falls victim to a mysterious illness that makes him lose, one by one, his five senses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9w2Gl8zRfCdlFd9O3UWdb8caNke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671317'),
