  ('716890039633162328', 'Disciples of the Crow', 1983, 'Horror', 'John Woodward, Nancy Griffith', 'John Woodward', 'Eleese Lester, Gabriel Folse, Steven Young, Martin Boozer, Kathleen Alsobrook, Loren Bivens, John Woodward, Harry Miller', null, 'A couple passing through a small Oklahoma town discover that it has been taken over by a homicidal cult that worships a crow god--and that all the cult members are children.', 'A couple passing through a small Oklahoma town discover that it has been taken over by a homicidal cult that worships a crow god--and that all the cult members are children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auXigfZrx9z23YQfLdZlLg4ovgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62521'),
  ('153567562628441362', 'Discipline', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Christophe M. Saber, Denis Jutzeler, Léna Perdu', 'Christophe M. Saber', 'Adel Ahdy, Nour Gayed, Garance Rohr, Frank Semelet, Leo Marroni, Florence Quartenoud, Yves Raeber, Mehdi Djaadi', null, 'In a moment of anger in a grocery store in Lausanne, a father loses patience and disciplines his disobedient child. A shocked customer immediately intervenes to express her concern. Other customers join the conversation and the discussion soon turns into a debate that gradually gets out of hand.', 'In a moment of anger in a grocery store in Lausanne, a father loses patience and disciplines his disobedient child. A shocked customer immediately intervenes to express her concern. Other customers join the conversation and the discussion soon turns into a debate that gradually gets out of hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7lzr34UWUoOIfHZh4rKJw7Vl7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342399'),
  ('966840912765243679', 'Disclaimer', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michel Denisot, Gilles Porte, Michaël Viger', 'Karine Angeli', 'Franck Dubosc, Jérôme Commandeur, Marilyne Canto, Denis Podalydès, Sylvie Testud, Laurent Bateau, Frédéric Quiring, Caterina Murino', null, 'Since his sensational arrival at the head of the 20 Hours, Cédric Saint Guérande, known as "CSG" is THE favorite presenter of the French. His insolent audiences stoke the jealousy even within La Grande Chaîne which he is the undisputed star. His thirst for power is limitless, which displeases the new president of the chain. The war is declared between the two men for the great pleasure of CSG. Power games, networking, manipulations and low shots: the fight will be merciless, and the outcome necessarily spectacular. Welcome to the media circus games.', 'Since his sensational arrival at the head of the 20 Hours, Cédric Saint Guérande, known as "CSG" is THE favorite presenter of the French. His insolent audiences stoke the jealousy even within La Grande Chaîne which he is the undisputed star. His thirst for power is limitless, which displeases the new president of the chain. The war is declared between the two men for the great pleasure of CSG. Power games, networking, manipulations and low shots: the fight will be merciless, and the outcome necessarily spectacular. Welcome to the media circus games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NTbnQOKOeKqsKSfTvNMZjdQbgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550158'),
  ('15861400872031845', 'Disclosure', 1994, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Tony Pierce-Roberts, Barry Levinson, Shery Blanc', 'Paul Attanasio', 'Michael Douglas, Demi Moore, Donald Sutherland, Dylan Baker, Jacqueline Kim, Roma Maffia, Caroline Goodall, Rosemary Forsyth', 'R', 'A computer specialist is sued for sexual harassment by a former lover turned boss who initiated the act forcefully, which threatens both his career and his personal life.', 'A computer specialist is sued for sexual harassment by a former lover turned boss who initiated the act forcefully, which threatens both his career and his personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnA4QkIZZCF9wRtF8HHxWwUXVMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8984'),
  ('947717639537019314', 'Disclosure', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Sam Feder, Ava Benjamin Shorr, Lane Stroud', null, 'Laverne Cox, Bianca Leigh, Jen Richards, Alexandra Billings, Susan Stryker, Yance Ford, Lilly Wachowski, Brian Michael Smith', null, 'An investigation of how Hollywood''s fabled stories have deeply influenced how Americans feel about transgender people, and how transgender people have been taught to feel about themselves.', 'An investigation of how Hollywood''s fabled stories have deeply influenced how Americans feel about transgender people, and how transgender people have been taught to feel about themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MB2FPNxdSlykbH7ghBltoBYnTH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653610'),
  ('1025735383661213558', 'Disclosure Day', 2026, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, Deborah Jensen', 'David Koepp', 'Emily Blunt, Josh O''Connor, Colin Firth, Eve Hewson, Colman Domingo, Wyatt Russell, Henry Lloyd-Hughes, Elizabeth Marvel', null, 'If you found out we weren’t alone, if someone showed you, proved it to you, would that frighten you?', 'If you found out we weren’t alone, if someone showed you, proved it to you, would that frighten you?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RYO0KTXIJ0rS0LqnCQLxeNR3P3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1275779'),
  ('363508777998532942', 'Disco', 2008, 'Music, Comedy', 'Fabien Onteniente, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Fabien Onteniente, Philippe Guillard, Franck Dubosc', 'Franck Dubosc, Emmanuelle Béart, Gérard Depardieu, Samuel Le Bihan, Abbes Zahmani, Annie Cordy, Isabelle Nanty, François-Xavier Demaison', null, 'Didier Travolta is a 40-year-old disco music fan who has no job, lives with his mother, and has a son he hasn''t seen for a while. The mother of his son refuses to send him their son for the holidays unless he can offer him a real vacation, not just going to bars of the French port city of Le Havre. Penniless, the only way he can see his son is by winning a dance contest organized by his friend Jackson, with the prize of a vacation to Australia for two.', 'Didier Travolta is a 40-year-old disco music fan who has no job, lives with his mother, and has a son he hasn''t seen for a while. The mother of his son refuses to send him their son for the holidays unless he can offer him a real vacation, not just going to bars of the French port city of Le Havre. Penniless, the only way he can see his son is by winning a dance contest organized by his friend Jackson, with the prize of a vacation to Australia for two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6P7UjF09cp9r13sh6OA6FbiAcsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13727'),
  ('854716358980048506', 'Disco Boy', 2023, 'Drama, War', 'Giacomo Abbruzzese, Hélène Louvart, Manon Garnier', 'Giacomo Abbruzzese', 'Franz Rogowski, Morr Ndiaye, Laëtitia Ky, Leon Lučev, Matteo Olivetti, Robert Więckiewicz, Michał Balicki, Ash Goldeh', null, 'After a painful journey through Europe, Aleksei, a Belarusian, joins the Foreign Legion in France and clings to a confused hope of a European identity. Jomo, a Nigerian, fights for the survival and durability of his people in the Niger Delta and is ready to die to defend his ideas. These two young people who are sacrificed and smashed together will, against all odds, meet and their destinies will merge to continue across borders, bodies, life and death...', 'After a painful journey through Europe, Aleksei, a Belarusian, joins the Foreign Legion in France and clings to a confused hope of a European identity. Jomo, a Nigerian, fights for the survival and durability of his people in the Niger Delta and is ready to die to defend his ideas. These two young people who are sacrificed and smashed together will, against all odds, meet and their destinies will merge to continue across borders, bodies, life and death...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYsAJeLh9LmesAnPjdTaZEdr1bP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:922830'),
  ('784156752937353257', 'Disco Dancer', 1982, 'Music, Drama', 'Babbar Subhash, Nadeem Khan', 'Rahi Masoom Raza', 'Mithun Chakraborty, Kim, Rajesh Khanna, Om Puri, Gita Siddharth, Om Shivpuri, Karan Razdan, Kalpana Iyer', null, 'Street singer Anil is humiliated and—with his mother—driven out of Bombay. He soon becomes an acclaimed performer but the enemies from his past plot to destroy his hard-earned career.', 'Street singer Anil is humiliated and—with his mother—driven out of Bombay. He soon becomes an acclaimed performer but the enemies from his past plot to destroy his hard-earned career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vc1MMLflENJ8sHwbHjzedT07Hv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19887'),
  ('424819462947563045', 'Disco Godfather', 1979, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'J. Robert Wagoner', 'J. Robert Wagoner, Cliff Roquemore', 'Rudy Ray Moore, Carol Speed, Jimmy Lynch, Jerry Jones, Lady Reed, Frank Finn, Julius Carry, Hawthorne James', null, 'Retired cop and celebrity DJ Tucker Williams (aka The Disco Godfather) takes to the streets as a dangerous hallucinogenic drug called Angel Dust begins to take hold of the neighborhood.', 'Retired cop and celebrity DJ Tucker Williams (aka The Disco Godfather) takes to the streets as a dangerous hallucinogenic drug called Angel Dust begins to take hold of the neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vqv7Pqooiis8PCpRZXikE3j3UN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77403'),
  ('408607153190323605', 'Disco Inferno', 2023, 'Horror', 'Matthew Castellanos', 'Matthew Castellanos, Mike Ambs', 'Soni Bringas, Stephen Ruffin, Helene Udy, Vera Myers', 'NR', 'A young couple conjures a dark presence that hungers for their unborn baby as they prepare to burn up the dance floor at LA''s hottest disco.', 'A young couple conjures a dark presence that hungers for their unborn baby as they prepare to burn up the dance floor at LA''s hottest disco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6JcxoSz55QfH3DsnPXAZYPnFcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1191902'),
  ('751500900039921764', 'Disco Pigs', 2001, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Kirsten Sheridan, Luke Johnston, Igor Jadue-Lillo', 'Enda Walsh', 'Elaine Cassidy, Cillian Murphy, Brían F. O''Byrne, Eleanor Methven, Geraldine O''Rawe, Darren Healy, Tara Lynne O''Neill, Eoghan Harris', 'R', 'Pig and Runt born on the same day, in the same hospital, moments apart. Twins, all but by bloodline. Inseparable from birth, they are almost telepathic. They are one, needing no one else, inhabiting a delicate, insular and dangerous world where they make their own rules and have their own language. But days before their 17th birthday the balance of their world begins to shift. Pig''s sexual awakening and jealousy begins to threaten their private universe.', 'Pig and Runt born on the same day, in the same hospital, moments apart. Twins, all but by bloodline. Inseparable from birth, they are almost telepathic. They are one, needing no one else, inhabiting a delicate, insular and dangerous world where they make their own rules and have their own language. But days before their 17th birthday the balance of their world begins to shift. Pig''s sexual awakening and jealousy begins to threaten their private universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvc0ufpTy8jdazickHhtbrcx3rS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26126'),
  ('500666808795667389', 'Disco, Ibiza, Locomía', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Kike Maíllo, Marc Miró', 'Marta-Libertad Castillo, Kike Maíllo', 'Jaime Lorente, Alberto Ammann, Alejandro Speitzer, Iván Pellicer, Pol Granch, Javier Morgade, Albert Baró, Vito Sanz', null, 'In the effervescent Spain of the 80s, Xavi Font, an artistic misfit, together with his friend Lurdes Iribar and her lover Manolo Arjona, founds Locomía. Although he achieves success, he also experiences the dark reality of the industry at the hands of powerful producer José Luís Gil.', 'In the effervescent Spain of the 80s, Xavi Font, an artistic misfit, together with his friend Lurdes Iribar and her lover Manolo Arjona, founds Locomía. Although he achieves success, he also experiences the dark reality of the industry at the hands of powerful producer José Luís Gil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veNhSeNyJN1ZXXqtDYdPhoxE9DR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151262'),
  ('586428142270988291', 'Disconnect', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Henry Alex Rubin, Ken Seng, Deanna Brigidi', 'Andrew Stern', 'Jason Bateman, Hope Davis, Frank Grillo, Michael Nyqvist, Paula Patton, Andrea Riseborough, Alexander Skarsgård, Max Thieriot', 'R', 'A hard-working lawyer, attached to his cell phone, can''t find the time to communicate with his family. An estranged couple uses the internet as a means to escape from their lifeless marriage. A widowed ex-cop struggles to raise a mischievous son who cyber-bullies a classmate. An ambitious journalist sees a career-making story in a teen that performs on an adult-only site. They are strangers, neighbors and colleagues and their stories collide as ordinary people struggling to connect in today''s wired world.', 'A hard-working lawyer, attached to his cell phone, can''t find the time to communicate with his family. An estranged couple uses the internet as a means to escape from their lifeless marriage. A widowed ex-cop struggles to raise a mischievous son who cyber-bullies a classmate. An ambitious journalist sees a career-making story in a teen that performs on an adult-only site. They are strangers, neighbors and colleagues and their stories collide as ordinary people struggling to connect in today''s wired world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAStXq4ncbLBnujd3LG4KDd7Z3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127517'),
  ('506888153305636704', 'Disconnected', 1984, 'Horror', 'Gorman Bechard, Gorman Bechard, Carmine Capobianco', 'Gorman Bechard, Virginia Gilroy', 'Frances Sherman, Mark Walker, Carl Koch, Professor Morono, William A. Roberts, Carmine Capobianco, Ben Page, Donna Dervoin', null, 'Lovely young Alicia starts receiving bizarre and disturbing phone calls after breaking up with her boyfriend Mike who she suspects is cheating on her with her twin sister Barbara Ann. Alicia meets and befriends amiable, but awkward film nerd Franklin, who alas turns out to be a total psycho with a penchant for carving up nubile ladies. But is Franklin the nutter responsible for those distressing phone calls?', 'Lovely young Alicia starts receiving bizarre and disturbing phone calls after breaking up with her boyfriend Mike who she suspects is cheating on her with her twin sister Barbara Ann. Alicia meets and befriends amiable, but awkward film nerd Franklin, who alas turns out to be a total psycho with a penchant for carving up nubile ladies. But is Franklin the nutter responsible for those distressing phone calls?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gs70wk9fslVMmef9xi9z6DF6UJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84983'),
  ('640537410881637138', 'Disconnected', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Christian Marazziti', 'Christian Marazziti, Michela Andreozzi, Massimiliano Vado', 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Ricky Memphis, Carolina Crescentini, Stefano Fresi, Eugenio Franceschini, Antónia Lišková, Lorenzo Zurzolo, Benedetta Porcaroli', null, 'Well-known writer Ettore takes his family on a mountain chalet getaway for his birthday, in an effort to create a bond between his two sons, Claudio and Giulio, and his second wife, Margherita. The group is also joined by Margherita''s brother, Claudio''s girlfriend, a Ukraininan cook and her daughter. When an internet outage strikes, a series of exciting adventures ensues.', 'Well-known writer Ettore takes his family on a mountain chalet getaway for his birthday, in an effort to create a bond between his two sons, Claudio and Giulio, and his second wife, Margherita. The group is also joined by Margherita''s brother, Claudio''s girlfriend, a Ukraininan cook and her daughter. When an internet outage strikes, a series of exciting adventures ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJl49fQt6sjzmQ7AfdEaS3Pcjqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502074'),
  ('793356005426495704', 'Discontinued', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Trevor Peckham, Trevor Peckham', 'Trevor Peckham', 'Ashley Hutchinson, Langston Fishburne, Michael Bonini, Robert Picardo, Charlie Talbert, Risa Benson, Michelle Yazvac, Bill Sorice', null, 'A depressed millennial discovers that the world she knows is just a simulated version of reality that is being shut down. Suddenly, she''s the only one who wants to stick around.', 'A depressed millennial discovers that the world she knows is just a simulated version of reality that is being shut down. Suddenly, she''s the only one who wants to stick around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDWQ5vnUL2NtqWWQEbOKpewGaIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919849'),
  ('193758241007350140', 'Discopříběh', 1987, 'Music, Comedy', 'Jaroslav Soukup, Vladimír Smutný, Josef Jarolímek', 'Eduard Pergner, Jaroslav Soukup', 'Rudolf Hrušínský, Ladislav Potměšil, Mariana Slováková, Jaroslava Stránská, Roman Pikl, Andy Kraus, Radek Pospíšil, Tomáš Máka', null, 'Jirka Horáček, a teenager living with his father on a Pilsen housing estate, spends his free time at discos with friends. One night he meets the confident blonde Eva, who is already involved with an older suitor, Cáfa, and also encounters the kind Jitka. Despite Jitka’s interest, Jirka becomes infatuated with Eva and tries to win her favor, all while his reckless pursuits strain his relationship with his impatient father.', 'Jirka Horáček, a teenager living with his father on a Pilsen housing estate, spends his free time at discos with friends. One night he meets the confident blonde Eva, who is already involved with an older suitor, Cáfa, and also encounters the kind Jitka. Despite Jitka’s interest, Jirka becomes infatuated with Eva and tries to win her favor, all while his reckless pursuits strain his relationship with his impatient father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwJnWiL1Yi06j86ND5LGODVkTTc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197085'),
  ('19627406704721362', 'Discopríbeh 2', 1991, 'Comedy, Music', 'Jaroslav Soukup, Vladimír Smutný, Ivan Bareš', 'Eduard Pergner, Jaroslav Soukup', 'Ladislav Potměšil, Rudolf Hrušínský, Veronika Kánská, Eva Čížkovská, Jaroslava Stránská, Jaroslava Obermaierová, Oldřich Vlach, Pavel Nový', null, 'The fate of father and son Horáček, but this time they switched roles. Jirka has married, settled down and grown up, while his father is in trouble because he has "second lymphoma" and, feeling that he is missing the last train, he starts a relationship with a stripper, Ala, dyes his hair, but mostly he likes a pretty and kind nurse, Lucie. Although he behaves in such a way that it seems to others as if he has lost his mind, everything turns out well, of course.', 'The fate of father and son Horáček, but this time they switched roles. Jirka has married, settled down and grown up, while his father is in trouble because he has "second lymphoma" and, feeling that he is missing the last train, he starts a relationship with a stripper, Ala, dyes his hair, but mostly he likes a pretty and kind nurse, Lucie. Although he behaves in such a way that it seems to others as if he has lost his mind, everything turns out well, of course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wEjgkNWHMNn9gncTUaoGNoSWLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197091'),
  ('300105088576773640', 'Discount', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Louis-Julien Petit, David Chambille', 'Samuel Doux, Louis-Julien Petit', 'Olivier Barthélémy, Corinne Masiero, Pascal Demolon, Sarah Suco, M''Barek Belkouk, Pablo Pauly, Tanguy Onakoy, Zabou Breitman', null, 'To fight against the introduction of automatic checkouts that threaten their jobs, staff members at Hard Discounts secretly create their own "Alternative Discount" outlet by salvaging products that would otherwise have been wasted.', 'To fight against the introduction of automatic checkouts that threaten their jobs, staff members at Hard Discounts secretly create their own "Alternative Discount" outlet by salvaging products that would otherwise have been wasted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uysF4Q2c4AsNCJEwRnDveJVePNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313055'),
  ('711461869505812083', 'Discovering Dinotopia', 2002, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Tim VandeSteeg', 'Paul Carlson', 'Wentworth Miller, Len Goodman, Adam Whisner, Katie Carr, Jim Carter, Alice Krige, Tyron Leitso, Anna Maguire', 'PG', 'The citizens of Waterfall City flee for the tenuous safety of Earthfarm, abandoning their city to the dangerous Outsiders - who discover the key to Dinotopias future and threaten its survival.', 'The citizens of Waterfall City flee for the tenuous safety of Earthfarm, abandoning their city to the dangerous Outsiders - who discover the key to Dinotopias future and threaten its survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nBeQJdKgq45eQGxXohp5fG1jn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145728'),
  ('655802377717724763', 'Discovering the Real World of Harry Potter', 2001, 'Family, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Shaun Trevisick', 'Shaun Trevisick', 'Hugh Laurie, J.K. Rowling, Gavin Scott', 'G', 'Explore the myths and legends that inhabit the real world of Harry Potter. Follow award-winning documentary filmmakers as they offer insights to witches, wizards, Greek gods, ancient Celts, ghosts, magical creatures, alchemy, and ancient spells. Narrated by British actor Hugh Laurie, this fascinating documentary brings new dimensions to the historical and scientific world behind the Harry Potter series.', 'Explore the myths and legends that inhabit the real world of Harry Potter. Follow award-winning documentary filmmakers as they offer insights to witches, wizards, Greek gods, ancient Celts, ghosts, magical creatures, alchemy, and ancient spells. Narrated by British actor Hugh Laurie, this fascinating documentary brings new dimensions to the historical and scientific world behind the Harry Potter series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLpnOqKw3ZycFu8t5Gil1BqTbnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116972'),
  ('264289199115096654', 'Discovery at Dawn', 2013, 'Drama', 'Susanna Nicchiarelli, Gherardo Gossi, Enrico Mastracchi Manes', 'Susanna Nicchiarelli, Michele Pellegrini', 'Margherita Buy, Susanna Nicchiarelli, Gabriele Spinelli, Lino Guanciale, Bruno Corazzari, Lucia Mascino, Gianluigi Fogacci, Renato Carpentieri', null, 'Thirty years after the disappearance of her father, a university professor who was targeted by radicals in the ''70s, a woman discovers a way to communicate with her past self and tries to prevent the tragedy that marred the life of her family, but she learns that not everything was as she thought.', 'Thirty years after the disappearance of her father, a university professor who was targeted by radicals in the ''70s, a woman discovers a way to communicate with her past self and tries to prevent the tragedy that marred the life of her family, but she learns that not everything was as she thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMskNvFhD3T5Rzq51SxUhPIRakE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171013'),
  ('1147188746425017092', 'Disenchanted', 2022, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Simon Duggan, Hannah Quinn, Shane McEnroe', 'Brigitte Hales', 'Amy Adams, Patrick Dempsey, James Marsden, Maya Rudolph, Gabriella Baldacchino, Rachel Duff, Idina Menzel, Yvette Nicole Brown', 'PG', 'Disillusioned with life in the city, feeling out of place in suburbia, and frustrated that her happily ever after hasn’t been so easy to find, Giselle turns to the magic of Andalasia for help. Accidentally transforming the entire town into a real-life fairy tale and placing her family’s future happiness in jeopardy, she must race against time to reverse the spell and determine what happily ever after truly means to her and her family.', 'Disillusioned with life in the city, feeling out of place in suburbia, and frustrated that her happily ever after hasn’t been so easy to find, Giselle turns to the magic of Andalasia for help. Accidentally transforming the entire town into a real-life fairy tale and placing her family’s future happiness in jeopardy, she must race against time to reverse the spell and determine what happily ever after truly means to her and her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyNLq2Dc3s4IOdcYTU8ZtM2lTjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338958'),
  ('20512287344487536', 'Disengagement', 2007, 'Drama', 'Amos Gitai, Christian Berger', 'Amos Gitai, Marie-Jose Sanselme', 'Juliette Binoche, Jeanne Moreau, Barbara Hendricks, Liron Levo, Hiam Abbass, Dana Ivgy, Tomer Russo, Israel Katorza', null, 'A political drama centered around Israel''s pullout from the occupied Gaza strip, in which a French woman of Israeli origin comes to the Gaza Strip to find her long ago abandoned daughter.', 'A political drama centered around Israel''s pullout from the occupied Gaza strip, in which a French woman of Israeli origin comes to the Gaza Strip to find her long ago abandoned daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zXQY7klMf1tCY65DkBq9CbPLOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17925'),
  ('300268828961119870', 'Disgrace', 2008, 'Drama', 'Steve Jacobs, Steve Arnold', 'J.M. Coetzee', 'John Malkovich, Jessica Haines, Ériq Ebouaney, Fiona Press, Antoinette Engel, Natalie Becker, Antonio Fisher, Isabella De Villiers', 'R', 'Disgrace is the story of a South African professor of English who loses everything: his reputation, his job, his peace of mind, his good looks, his dreams of artistic success, and finally even his ability to protect his cherished daughter. After having an affair with a student, he moves to the Eastern Cape, where he gets caught up in a mess of post-apartheid politics.', 'Disgrace is the story of a South African professor of English who loses everything: his reputation, his job, his peace of mind, his good looks, his dreams of artistic success, and finally even his ability to protect his cherished daughter. After having an affair with a student, he moves to the Eastern Cape, where he gets caught up in a mess of post-apartheid politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xCM4H72gaXGXvJKcocAx8LKxaQC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12411'),
  ('247785854844192289', 'Dishkiyaoon', 2014, 'Action, Thriller', 'Sanamjit Singh Talwar', 'Sanamjit Singh Talwar', 'Harman Baweja, Ayesha Khanna, Sunny Deol, Aditya Pancholi, Prashant Narayanan, Anand Tiwari, Harsh Chhaya, Rajit Kapoor', null, 'Dishkiyaoon is a Bollywood action film produced by Shilpa Shetty and her husband Raj Kundra along with Eros International. The film features Sunny Deol, Harman Baweja and debutant Ayesha Khanna. The film is about the Mumbai underworld.2014.Four songs for the film have been composed by debutant Palash Muchhal, who''s the youngest music composer of Bollywood at age of 18.', 'Dishkiyaoon is a Bollywood action film produced by Shilpa Shetty and her husband Raj Kundra along with Eros International. The film features Sunny Deol, Harman Baweja and debutant Ayesha Khanna. The film is about the Mumbai underworld.2014.Four songs for the film have been composed by debutant Palash Muchhal, who''s the youngest music composer of Bollywood at age of 18.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsKD1GWFtzQD7dJzQ7MvLmxMpGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258879'),
  ('831380277543169236', 'Dishonored', 1931, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Josef von Sternberg, Lee Garmes', 'Daniel Nathan Rubin, Josef von Sternberg', 'Marlene Dietrich, Victor McLaglen, Gustav von Seyffertitz, Warner Oland, Lew Cody, Barry Norton, Max Barwyn, B.F. Blinn', 'NR', 'The Austrian Secret Service sends its most seductive agent to spy on the Russians.', 'The Austrian Secret Service sends its most seductive agent to spy on the Russians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3Q4WgQdJgLdt4EVMqLQqKsDcFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73420'),
  ('830483525711401309', 'Dishonored Lady', 1947, 'Crime, Drama', 'Robert Stevenson, Lucien N. Andriot, Lester D. Guthrie', 'Edmund H. North', 'Hedy Lamarr, Dennis O''Keefe, John Loder, William Lundigan, Morris Carnovsky, Natalie Schafer, Paul Cavanagh, Douglass Dumbrille', 'NR', 'Art editor Madeleine Damian carries on numerous loveless affairs. After a failed relationship with advertiser Felix Courtland, the increasingly depressed Madeleine attempts suicide. When Jack Garet, her secretary and former lover, tries to blackmail her, Madeleine resigns and seeks a reclusive life. Neighbor David Cousins befriends Madeleine, but soon Courtland and Garet discover her whereabouts and disrupt her new life.', 'Art editor Madeleine Damian carries on numerous loveless affairs. After a failed relationship with advertiser Felix Courtland, the increasingly depressed Madeleine attempts suicide. When Jack Garet, her secretary and former lover, tries to blackmail her, Madeleine resigns and seeks a reclusive life. Neighbor David Cousins befriends Madeleine, but soon Courtland and Garet discover her whereabouts and disrupt her new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KBB0gpZSscNwZx1UxexTaDgSjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33079'),
  ('284754891886074145', 'Dishoom', 2016, 'Comedy, Action', 'Rohit Dhawan, Ayananka Bose', 'Rohit Dhawan, Tushar Hiranandani', 'John Abraham, Varun Dhawan, Akshaye Khanna, Jacqueline Fernandez, Saqib Saleem, Rahul Dev, Akshay Kumar, Nargis Fakhri', null, 'When India''s top cricketer is kidnapped in the Middle East, a loose cannon and a rookie cop are tasked with finding him before the high-stakes match with Pakistan.', 'When India''s top cricketer is kidnapped in the Middle East, a loose cannon and a rookie cop are tasked with finding him before the high-stakes match with Pakistan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sY58lhquOEISrpcIzbKNV6qHgvG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393441'),
