  ('672560998727738027', 'Disneyland Handcrafted', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Leslie Iwerks', null, 'Walt Disney, Art Linkletter, Irene Dunne', null, 'Oscar and Emmy nominated filmmaker Leslie Iwerks returns with an all-new Disney documentary giving viewers an up-close look at the dedication, effort, and passion that was required to realize a dream that would go on to inspire millions around the world.', 'Oscar and Emmy nominated filmmaker Leslie Iwerks returns with an all-new Disney documentary giving viewers an up-close look at the dedication, effort, and passion that was required to realize a dream that would go on to inspire millions around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81szv19zvs5fGqXtWau6tXzfC4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1538718'),
  ('712990586154514459', 'Disobedience', 1981, 'Drama', 'Aldo Lado', 'Aldo Lado, Barbara Alberti, Amedeo Pagani', 'Stefania Sandrelli, Teresa Ann Savoy, Mario Adorf, Marie-José Nat, Karl Zinny, Jacques Perrin, Marc Porel, Nanni Loy', null, 'Luca Manzi is a fourteen year old boy when the Northern Italy Republic of Salò is governed by the Fascists. He becomes a partisan but when the war ends he is disappointed because things have not changed as he had hoped they wood, and he decides to let himself die. He is saved by Edith who tries to introduce him to sex. Based on the novel by Alberto Moravia.', 'Luca Manzi is a fourteen year old boy when the Northern Italy Republic of Salò is governed by the Fascists. He becomes a partisan but when the war ends he is disappointed because things have not changed as he had hoped they wood, and he decides to let himself die. He is saved by Edith who tries to introduce him to sex. Based on the novel by Alberto Moravia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CIfTSXGE6oTF4SiBpIqMGsyaRc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212957'),
  ('34915422736395715', 'Disobedience', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jason Rickwood, Caroline Barton, Kate Selby', 'Rebecca Lenkiewicz, Sebastián Lelio', 'Rachel Weisz, Rachel McAdams, Alessandro Nivola, Allan Corduner, Anton Lesser, Nicholas Woodeson, David Fleeshman, Steve Furst', 'R', 'New York photographer Ronit flies to London after learning about the death of her estranged father. Ronit is returning to the same Orthodox Jewish community that shunned her decades earlier for her childhood attraction to Esti, a female friend. Their fortuitous and happy reunion soon reignites their burning passion as the two women explore the boundaries of faith and sexuality.', 'New York photographer Ronit flies to London after learning about the death of her estranged father. Ronit is returning to the same Orthodox Jewish community that shunned her decades earlier for her childhood attraction to Esti, a female friend. Their fortuitous and happy reunion soon reignites their burning passion as the two women explore the boundaries of faith and sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skPT4ffWhlmmDOMNEdxOiP6Emfz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419743'),
  ('966747372944201939', 'Disorder', 1986, 'Drama, Music', 'Denis Lenoir, Olivier Assayas', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Wadeck Stanczak, Ann-Gisel Glass, Lucas Belvaux, Rémi Martin, Corinne Dacla, Simon de La Brosse, Etienne Chicot, Philippe Demarle', null, 'Three young friends steal some music equipment for their struggling post-punk band and, in a panic, kill the shop’s owner. The film examines, with characteristic restraint and acuity, the psychological fallout as the band unravels—and each of its members grapple with their own feelings of guilt, paranoia, and despair.', 'Three young friends steal some music equipment for their struggling post-punk band and, in a panic, kill the shop’s owner. The film examines, with characteristic restraint and acuity, the psychological fallout as the band unravels—and each of its members grapple with their own feelings of guilt, paranoia, and despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgNs11rAsPJOjabIF1LZqf4ca07.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64102'),
  ('69687241777523133', 'Disorder', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Huang Weikai', null, null, null, 'A "city symphony" full of dark humor that weaves together a collage of absurd sounds and events.', 'A "city symphony" full of dark humor that weaves together a collage of absurd sounds and events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zO3kmqB345G9xBi1BrrMD0jPCgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102809'),
  ('982115519444892109', 'Disorder', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Georges Lechaptois, Alice Winocour, Clément Colin', 'Alice Winocour', 'Matthias Schoenaerts, Diane Kruger, Paul Hamy, Victor Pontecorvo, Zaïd Errougui-Demonsant, Percy Kemp, Jean-Louis Coulloc''h, Mickaël Dauber', null, 'An ex-soldier with PTSD is hired to protect the wife and child of a wealthy Lebanese businessman while he''s out of town.', 'An ex-soldier with PTSD is hired to protect the wife and child of a wealthy Lebanese businessman while he''s out of town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbyzFoeLnxAs3mdSrVnRllt7U9w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329815'),
  ('17753090883526092', 'Disorder in the Court', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Jack White', 'Felix Adler', 'Moe Howard, Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Suzanne Kaaren, Bud Jamison, Harry Semels, James C. Morton, Bobby Burns', 'NR', 'The Stooges are key witnesses at a murder trial. Their friend Gail Tempest, who dances at the Black Bottom cafe where the Stooges are musicians, is accused of killing Kirk Robin.', 'The Stooges are key witnesses at a murder trial. Their friend Gail Tempest, who dances at the Black Bottom cafe where the Stooges are musicians, is accused of killing Kirk Robin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l801pSeHhCPsimBxzvKaVIWvdsi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22950'),
  ('1134894812447106056', 'Disorderlies', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Michael Schultz, Rolf Kestermann, Melissa Skoff', 'Mitchell Klebanoff, Mark Feldberg', 'Mark Morales, Darren Robinson, Damon Wimbley, Ralph Bellamy, Troy Byer, Tony Plana, Anthony Geary, Robert V. Barron', 'PG', 'As not-quite-orderlies who''re downright Disorderlies, rap-music favorites The Fat Boys rule. Playing the freewheeling caretakers of the frail Dennison, they stir up a comedic culture clash in Palm Beach society that only proves laughter is the best medicine this side of a tax refund.', 'As not-quite-orderlies who''re downright Disorderlies, rap-music favorites The Fat Boys rule. Playing the freewheeling caretakers of the frail Dennison, they stir up a comedic culture clash in Palm Beach society that only proves laughter is the best medicine this side of a tax refund.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BZn8MBlc9gjObeO9vhObazBAlc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24826'),
  ('392158251994459557', 'Disorganized Crime', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Jim Kouf, Ronald Víctor García, Dan Bradley', 'Jim Kouf', 'Hoyt Axton, Corbin Bernsen, Rubén Blades, Fred Gwynne, Lou Diamond Phillips, William Russ, Marie Butler, Gregory Wurster', 'R', 'Lou Diamond Phillips and Fred Gwynne team up with a gang of professional criminals who have everything it takes to rob a bank. The only things they do have going for them are a cop and his partner, who are dumber than they are! By the time the gang hits the bank vault, it''s a safe bet there''s going to be organized insanity and disorganized crime!', 'Lou Diamond Phillips and Fred Gwynne team up with a gang of professional criminals who have everything it takes to rob a bank. The only things they do have going for them are a cop and his partner, who are dumber than they are! By the time the gang hits the bank vault, it''s a safe bet there''s going to be organized insanity and disorganized crime!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQHt9X3Q4NhDe6LotqUDiZme2l8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30352'),
  ('450096166524341976', 'Dispute in Valladolid', 1992, 'History, Drama, TV Movie', 'Jean-Daniel Verhaeghe', 'Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Jean-Pierre Marielle, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Jean Carmet, Jean-Michel Dupuis, Claude Laugier, Didier Bourguignon, Dominique Noé, Emmanuel-Georges Delajoie', null, 'Spain conquered the seas, found a new world and different realities than the one known in Europe. But a question needed to be answered with what they found in those new territories: do the Indians have souls? The Church, bound to protect and convert the natives and the conquerors who treated them like slaves and thought they were only merchandising, expose their arguments and reasonings at what would be known as the Vallidolid controversy. Between them, there''s a cardinal hearing both parts and trying to get reasonable answers from this critical question.', 'Spain conquered the seas, found a new world and different realities than the one known in Europe. But a question needed to be answered with what they found in those new territories: do the Indians have souls? The Church, bound to protect and convert the natives and the conquerors who treated them like slaves and thought they were only merchandising, expose their arguments and reasonings at what would be known as the Vallidolid controversy. Between them, there''s a cardinal hearing both parts and trying to get reasonable answers from this critical question.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u21TdlCAt3MbnUHU5GiUO0SEgNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74133'),
  ('324991040821782959', 'Disquiet', 2010, 'Drama', 'João Botelho, João Ribeiro, Francisco Veloso', 'João Botelho', 'Cláudio da Silva, Pedro Lamares, Ricardo Aibéo, Manuel João Vieira, Suzie Peterson, António Pedro Cerdeira, Margarida Vila-Nova, Graciano Dias', null, 'Lisbon, today. In a room of a house at Douradores Street, a man invents dreams and theorizes about them. The essence of the dreams itself becomes physical, palpable, visible. The text itself materializes in its musicality. And, in front of our eyes, this music can be felt with the ears, brain and heart. It spreads itself in the street where the man lives, in the city that he loves above all and over the entire world.', 'Lisbon, today. In a room of a house at Douradores Street, a man invents dreams and theorizes about them. The essence of the dreams itself becomes physical, palpable, visible. The text itself materializes in its musicality. And, in front of our eyes, this music can be felt with the ears, brain and heart. It spreads itself in the street where the man lives, in the city that he loves above all and over the entire world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whNK0oLwa2rp9K13BNXu4ZLkmah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151433'),
  ('1031853953701004895', 'Disquiet', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Michael Winnick, Adam Sliwinski, Mel Ward', 'Michael Winnick', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Rachelle Goulding, Elyse Levesque, Lochlyn Munro, Garry Chalk, Trezzo Mahoro, Anita Brown, Bradley Stryker', 'R', 'After a near-fatal car accident, Sam wakes to discover he is trapped in an abandoned hospital by mysterious and sinister forces that have no intention of letting him leave…', 'After a near-fatal car accident, Sam wakes to discover he is trapped in an abandoned hospital by mysterious and sinister forces that have no intention of letting him leave…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVFjtO9u58PMirVHUvyAXLYObYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072074'),
  ('592152899341823794', 'Disraeli', 1929, 'Drama, History', 'Alfred E. Green, Lee Garmes', 'Julien Josephson', 'George Arliss, Doris Lloyd, David Torrence, Joan Bennett, Florence Arliss, Anthony Bushell, Michael Visaroff, Ivan F. Simpson', null, 'Prime Minister of Great Britain Benjamin Disraeli outwits the subterfuge of the Russians and chicanery at home in order to secure the purchase of the Suez Canal.', 'Prime Minister of Great Britain Benjamin Disraeli outwits the subterfuge of the Russians and chicanery at home in order to secure the purchase of the Suez Canal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVTmxQJp0sqBujbieSTrB2ui9al.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84274'),
  ('1074681713719342776', 'Disrupted', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Mario Guerrero, Roberto Fiesco', 'Roberto Fiesco, Julián Hernández', 'Coral Bonelli, Lilia Ortega, Jorge Fons, Patricio Pereda, Bruce Jazz, Jaime Said García, Jesús Clemente Mendoza, Mario Montecinos', null, 'The memory and testimony of two characters: Fernando García, known as Pinolito, who was a child actor in the seventies and Doña Lilia Ortega, his mother, an actress. Fernando came out as a transvestite, some years ago, and now calls himself Coral Bonelli. They live together in Garibaldi yearning for their past in the movies, while Coral bravely comes to terms with her gender identity. They both still perform.', 'The memory and testimony of two characters: Fernando García, known as Pinolito, who was a child actor in the seventies and Doña Lilia Ortega, his mother, an actress. Fernando came out as a transvestite, some years ago, and now calls himself Coral Bonelli. They live together in Garibaldi yearning for their past in the movies, while Coral bravely comes to terms with her gender identity. They both still perform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwEMNO1oF5cwV8yqZPrv1bVTV6X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215782'),
  ('849588670054340215', 'Disrupted', 2020, 'Action, Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Andre Welsh, Andre Welsh', 'Andre Welsh', 'Daniel Roebuck, Ron Kaell, Drew Seeley, Marie Wilson, Chioke Jelani Clanton, Amy Paffrath, Ahku, Jenny Pellicer', null, 'An Oakland widower''s thirst for justice is rekindled when a local killing is oddly similar to his wife''s unsolved murder from decades ago.', 'An Oakland widower''s thirst for justice is rekindled when a local killing is oddly similar to his wife''s unsolved murder from decades ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foDW5YJ24enxNNCkDfcuo02dDO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682545'),
  ('622442313847245894', 'Dissolved and Effused', 1985, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ladislav Smoljak, Andrej Barla, Petr Šícha', 'Ladislav Smoljak, Zdeněk Svěrák', 'Jiří Zahajský, Marek Brodský, Rudolf Hrušínský, Blažena Holišová, Josef Abrhám, Veronika Jeníková, Jaroslava Adamová, Petr Čepek', null, 'A police inspector and inexperienced trainee search for a mysteriously disappeared manufacturer of ointments for hair growth.', 'A police inspector and inexperienced trainee search for a mysteriously disappeared manufacturer of ointments for hair growth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snDjB8B5MhlBGzidQl4ClFXra1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51084'),
  ('686009057430905049', 'Dissonance', 2015, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama', 'Till Nowak', 'Till Nowak', 'Mirko Thiele, Leslie Barany, Roland Schupp, Hannah Heine, Nina Petri, Klaus Zehrfeld', null, 'A pianist plays in a huge theatre on a cylindrical piano, which is rotated by his dwarf assistant. The theatre is part of a huge, spherical city. Upon waking, he turns out to be a street musician, who has a restraining order, but wants to teach his daughter how to play the piano.', 'A pianist plays in a huge theatre on a cylindrical piano, which is rotated by his dwarf assistant. The theatre is part of a huge, spherical city. Upon waking, he turns out to be a street musician, who has a restraining order, but wants to teach his daughter how to play the piano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUHQRINutG7LVeJwMXzbTkkqt6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323317'),
  ('923385225559356194', 'Dissonance', 2018, 'Thriller', 'C.L. Zvonock, Bernard Declercq', 'Bernard Declercq', 'Moana Ferré, Pascal Greggory, Benjamin Ramon, Fabrizio Rongione, Nicolas Vaude, Renaud Rutten, Ingrid Heiderscheidt, Erico Salamone', null, 'Doctor Lepage knows his wife Françoise through and through. He protects her, watching over her. In a masterly way he chases all ''butterflies'' away that come in her neighborhood. Françoise knows that she is nice.', 'Doctor Lepage knows his wife Françoise through and through. He protects her, watching over her. In a masterly way he chases all ''butterflies'' away that come in her neighborhood. Françoise knows that she is nice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVRs0q4nrOithBbM3MXG8BavfIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558219'),
  ('973376748709384414', 'Distance', 2001, 'Drama', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda, Yutaka Yamazaki', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda', 'Arata Iura, Yūsuke Iseya, Susumu Terajima, Yui Natsukawa, Tadanobu Asano, Azusa Takehana, Kenichi Endo, Seminosuke Murasugi', null, 'On the third anniversary of a cult''s failed chemical attack on Tokyo and their subsequent mass suicide, family members of those affected gather at the cult''s former base on the shores of a lake to observe the anniversary of their loved ones'' deaths.', 'On the third anniversary of a cult''s failed chemical attack on Tokyo and their subsequent mass suicide, family members of those affected gather at the cult''s former base on the shores of a lake to observe the anniversary of their loved ones'' deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyAwtWVlHvrZkCkPEzMa0s5puXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25051'),
  ('735639639535216435', 'Distance', 2016, 'Drama', 'Shijie Tan, Xin Yukun, Sivaroj Kongsakul', 'Aditya Assarat, Xin Yukun, Shijie Tan', 'Chen Bolin, Paul Chun Pui, Tony Yang, Jiang Wenli, Chayanit Chansangavej, Yeo Yann Yann, Li Feng, Zhu Shen-Long', null, 'Three stories which each focus on one of three types of relationships: family, friendship, and love. The first story is about conflicted manager on a business trip who is intrigued by an elderly worker and investigates his life. The second story is about a young father who receives a letter that brings him to a foreign land, where old emotions come unburied. The last story is about a visiting professor from overseas who sets a student''s heart fluttering, while having to deal with his own.', 'Three stories which each focus on one of three types of relationships: family, friendship, and love. The first story is about conflicted manager on a business trip who is intrigued by an elderly worker and investigates his life. The second story is about a young father who receives a letter that brings him to a foreign land, where old emotions come unburied. The last story is about a visiting professor from overseas who sets a student''s heart fluttering, while having to deal with his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmnWxDfoPHo8rYXFwMpdNsutgXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386235'),
  ('621259278093359569', 'Distant', 2002, 'Drama', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Feridun Koç', 'Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Cemil Kavukçu', 'Muzaffer Özdemir, Mehmet Emin Toprak, Zuhal Gencer, Nazan Kesal, Feridun Koç, Fatma Ceylan, Ebru Ceylan, Bahattin Serter', null, 'A young man from rural Turkey arrives in Istanbul with dreams of working on a ship and stays with a cousin while he searches for work. Over time, the former’s struggles to find employment and the latter’s troubles and disappointments strain their relationship and living situation.', 'A young man from rural Turkey arrives in Istanbul with dreams of working on a ship and stays with a cousin while he searches for work. Over time, the former’s struggles to find employment and the latter’s troubles and disappointments strain their relationship and living situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XKGrHh1BRnMiIRMRYRsWPQDJfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31026'),
  ('1035108322879236015', 'Distant Drums', 1951, 'Western, Adventure, War', 'Raoul Walsh, Sidney Hickox', 'Niven Busch, Martin Rackin', 'Gary Cooper, Mari Aldon, Richard Webb, Ray Teal, Arthur Hunnicutt, Robert Barrat, Gregg Barton, Clancy Cooper', 'NR', 'After destroying a Seminole fort, American soldiers and their rescued companions must face the dangerous Everglades and hostile Indians in order to reach safety', 'After destroying a Seminole fort, American soldiers and their rescued companions must face the dangerous Everglades and hostile Indians in order to reach safety', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i47dolQL1igTPUQ7jvCzyiBENDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61391'),
  ('644572286709754583', 'Distant Journey', 1949, 'Drama', 'Mojmír Drvota, Alfréd Radok, Josef Střecha', 'Erik Kolár, Alfréd Radok, Mojmír Drvota', 'Blanka Waleská, Otomar Krejča, Zdeňka Baldová, Viktor Očásek, Eduard Kohout, Anna Vaňková, Jiří Plachý, Saša Rašilov', null, 'Prague, during World War II. Hana Kaufmann, a Jewish ophthalmologist, marries Dr. Antonín Bureš, a Christian man. When her family is sent to the Theresienstadt concentration camp, their romance turns into a struggle for survival.', 'Prague, during World War II. Hana Kaufmann, a Jewish ophthalmologist, marries Dr. Antonín Bureš, a Christian man. When her family is sent to the Theresienstadt concentration camp, their romance turns into a struggle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BXbz4SAnNLFRa8Ug5SbDwFpnXc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193492'),
  ('715832249781646205', 'Distant Lights', 2003, 'Drama', 'Hans-Christian Schmid, Bogumił Godfrejów', 'Hans-Christian Schmid, Michael Gutmann', 'Maria Simon, Alice Dwyer, Devid Striesow, Sebastian Urzendowsky, August Diehl, Herbert Knaup, Ivan Shvedoff, Sergey Frolov', null, 'Lichter is an episodic tale from Hans-Christian Schmid about the life on the border between Germany and Poland. The film sheds light on the everyday stories of escape and desperateness.', 'Lichter is an episodic tale from Hans-Christian Schmid about the life on the border between Germany and Poland. The film sheds light on the everyday stories of escape and desperateness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpKnM9Vc8jADfOfhM9ftOCimKv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446'),
  ('789908245847603839', 'Distant Thunder', 1973, 'Drama', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Soumitra Chatterjee, Bobita, Sandhya Roy, Chitra Banerjee, Paritosh Banerjee, Sachin Chakraborty, Govinda Chakravarti, Shrikumar Dutta', null, 'Gangacharan is the new Brahmin of a village, where he assumes various duties: teaching, organizing religious events, and trying to prevent epidemics. But in that year 1943, war is raging (as reminded by the planes occasionally heard flying over the countryside), and a major famine is under way. As food shortages reach catastrophic proportions, Gangacharan attempts to preserve his privileged situation, while his generous wife, Ananga, conversely tries to help and support the community.', 'Gangacharan is the new Brahmin of a village, where he assumes various duties: teaching, organizing religious events, and trying to prevent epidemics. But in that year 1943, war is raging (as reminded by the planes occasionally heard flying over the countryside), and a major famine is under way. As food shortages reach catastrophic proportions, Gangacharan attempts to preserve his privileged situation, while his generous wife, Ananga, conversely tries to help and support the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AT7RPArBH6k5Ac01VSk2uWQkZW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113012'),
  ('672153014122676065', 'Distant Thunder', 1981, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kichitaro Negishi, Shōhei Andō, Shun Nakahara', 'Haruhiko Arai', 'Toshiyuki Nagashima, Johnny Ohkura, Eri Ishida, Casey Takamine, Reiko Nanao, Izumi Hara, Yumiko Fujita, Keizo Kanie', null, 'A young man living on growing tomatoes in a greenhouse in a residential area. Tomato cultivation is as doomed as his personal life where he tries to keep alive his romance with the eccentric Kaede and parents selected fiancee Ayako.', 'A young man living on growing tomatoes in a greenhouse in a residential area. Tomato cultivation is as doomed as his personal life where he tries to keep alive his romance with the eccentric Kaede and parents selected fiancee Ayako.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lur3brDFphNx3DK3dYYO5gpiNeQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169977'),
  ('705486657465978678', 'Distant Thunder', 1988, 'Drama', 'Rick Rosenthal, Ralf D. Bode', 'Robert Stitzel', 'Ralph Macchio, John Lithgow, Kerrie Keane, Reb Brown, Janet Margolin, Tom Bower, Jamey Sheridan, Denis Arndt', 'R', 'A troubled Vietnam war vet deserts his wife and child shortly after he returns from the war. He returns after 10 years, where he''s been living like an animal in the forest. He finds himself unprepared for the changes that he will have to cope with, and when the vet tries to contact his son, he realizes that he has caused more damage than he had imagined.', 'A troubled Vietnam war vet deserts his wife and child shortly after he returns from the war. He returns after 10 years, where he''s been living like an animal in the forest. He finds himself unprepared for the changes that he will have to cope with, and when the vet tries to contact his son, he realizes that he has caused more damage than he had imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfWvrfnpboqeTxuKBhk23wUBOZ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220690'),
  ('1013379083197048989', 'Distant Voices, Still Lives', 1988, 'Drama, Music', 'Terence Davies, William Diver, Patrick Duval', 'Terence Davies', 'Freda Dowie, Pete Postlethwaite, Angela Walsh, Lorraine Ashbourne, Dean Williams, Sally Davies, Susan Flanagan, Nathan Walsh', 'PG-13', 'Siblings Maisie and Tony, along with their mother, gather for their sister Eileen''s wedding. It is a joyous occasion, but through flashbacks, it becomes clear that the family was not always happy. Their father was physically abusive to his wife and left the children emotionally traumatized. As a result, the children have grown into unhappy adults, looking for love they didn''t receive when they were young.', 'Siblings Maisie and Tony, along with their mother, gather for their sister Eileen''s wedding. It is a joyous occasion, but through flashbacks, it becomes clear that the family was not always happy. Their father was physically abusive to his wife and left the children emotionally traumatized. As a result, the children have grown into unhappy adults, looking for love they didn''t receive when they were young.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tixkjzGHY2tBh6j6L4azkx6OQc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41799'),
  ('694619788850347227', 'Distorted', 2018, 'Action, Mystery, Thriller', 'Trevor Cunningham, Jesse Nelson, Nikki Elek', 'Arne Olsen', 'Christina Ricci, John Cusack, Brendan Fletcher, Nicole Anthony, Maja Milkovich, Vicellous Shannon, Oliver Rice, Gigi Jackman', 'R', 'A married couple suspect that the ''smart apartments'' in their high tech residence are being used by its owner for sinister reasons.', 'A married couple suspect that the ''smart apartments'' in their high tech residence are being used by its owner for sinister reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e26QQxiD9glX34qU9Lfj98nMCTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459258'),
  ('1118452259716847043', 'Distracted', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Richard, Daniel Vogel', 'Pierre Richard', 'Pierre Richard, Marie-Christine Barrault, Bernard Blier, Maria Pacôme, Catherine Samie, Micheline Luccioni, Paul Préboist, Tsilla Chelton', null, 'A comedy about an absent-minded man who works at a advertising company and topples from one problem to another.', 'A comedy about an absent-minded man who works at a advertising company and topples from one problem to another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyCy5FHF6A7W6uguOYZogPy5HoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62675'),
  ('125622366097221194', 'District 13: Ultimatum', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Patrick Alessandrin, Jean-François Hensgens, Carine Demonguères', 'Luc Besson', 'Cyril Raffaelli, David Belle, Philippe Torreton, Daniel Duval, Élodie Yung, MC Jean Gab''1, James Deano, Laouni Mouhid', 'R', 'Damien and Leito return to District 13 on a mission to bring peace to the troubled sector that is controlled by five different gang bosses, before the city’s secret services take drastic measures to solve the problem.', 'Damien and Leito return to District 13 on a mission to bring peace to the troubled sector that is controlled by five different gang bosses, before the city’s secret services take drastic measures to solve the problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhadETc2y1ImTQ51all8tOd45aw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15357'),
  ('718707020039947785', 'District 9', 2009, 'Science Fiction', 'Trent Opaloch, Neill Blomkamp, Jeremy Hollobon', 'Neill Blomkamp, Terri Tatchell', 'Sharlto Copley, Jason Cope, Nathalie Boltt, Sylvaine Strike, Elizabeth Mkandawie, John Sumner, William Allen Young, Nick Blake', 'R', 'Thirty years ago, aliens arrive on Earth. Not to conquer or give aid, but to find refuge from their dying planet. Separated from humans in a South African area called District 9, the aliens are managed by Multi-National United, which is unconcerned with the aliens'' welfare but will do anything to master their advanced technology. When a company field agent contracts a mysterious virus that begins to alter his DNA, there is only one place he can hide: District 9.', 'Thirty years ago, aliens arrive on Earth. Not to conquer or give aid, but to find refuge from their dying planet. Separated from humans in a South African area called District 9, the aliens are managed by Multi-National United, which is unconcerned with the aliens'' welfare but will do anything to master their advanced technology. When a company field agent contracts a mysterious virus that begins to alter his DNA, there is only one place he can hide: District 9.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuGlQkqLxnodDSk6mp5c2wvxUEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17654'),
  ('621056122688781999', 'District B13', 2004, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Pierre Morel, Manuel Teran, Fotea Alex', 'Luc Besson, Bibi Naceri', 'David Belle, Cyril Raffaelli, Tony D''Amario, Dany Verissimo-Petit, Bibi Naceri, Nicolas Woirion, François Chattot, Patrick Olivier', 'R', 'Set in the ghettos of Paris in 2010, an undercover cop and ex-thug try to infiltrate a gang in order to defuse a neutron bomb.', 'Set in the ghettos of Paris in 2010, an undercover cop and ex-thug try to infiltrate a gang in order to defuse a neutron bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYIDJ15RLBsFFBSAkqjIirZCgVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10045'),
  ('662357701890601350', 'Disturbed', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Charles Winkler, Bernd Heinl', 'Charles Winkler, Emerson Bixby', 'Malcolm McDowell, Geoffrey Lewis, Priscilla Pointer, Pamela Gidley, Irwin Keyes, Clint Howard, Peter Murnik, Carrie Lynn', null, '10 years ago the perverse Dr. Russell couldn''t resist the beauty of a young patient in his mental clinic and raped her one night. When she plunged herself from the roof shortly after, he described it as consequence of her heavy depressions. Now the same urge overcomes him with his new patient Sandy. He doesn''t know that she''s the daughter of his previous victim and that she''s come for revenge.', '10 years ago the perverse Dr. Russell couldn''t resist the beauty of a young patient in his mental clinic and raped her one night. When she plunged herself from the roof shortly after, he described it as consequence of her heavy depressions. Now the same urge overcomes him with his new patient Sandy. He doesn''t know that she''s the daughter of his previous victim and that she''s come for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3z87ToyjntlHUkvR5HBJUcYEzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145951'),
  ('139898743774198903', 'Disturbia', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Rogier Stoffers, D.J. Caruso, Robert Schroer', 'Carl Ellsworth, Christopher Landon', 'Shia LaBeouf, Sarah Roemer, Carrie-Anne Moss, David Morse, Aaron Yoo, Jose Pablo Cantillo, Matt Craven, Viola Davis', 'PG-13', 'Kale has a life most teenagers would envy. He spends his days endlessly playing video games, surfing the net, eating junk food and watching cable. He has complete free reign of the house, and a beautiful young hottie named Ashley has just moved in next door. There’s only one problem—he’s not allowed to leave the house. Kale’s under court-ordered house arrest for three months, and if he takes one step beyond a 100-foot perimeter of the house, his next confinement will be in a real prison.', 'Kale has a life most teenagers would envy. He spends his days endlessly playing video games, surfing the net, eating junk food and watching cable. He has complete free reign of the house, and a beautiful young hottie named Ashley has just moved in next door. There’s only one problem—he’s not allowed to leave the house. Kale’s under court-ordered house arrest for three months, and if he takes one step beyond a 100-foot perimeter of the house, his next confinement will be in a real prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3f9KwSrieczuH9nRrwfOsoMoMNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8271'),
  ('285429266406911400', 'Disturbing Behavior', 1998, 'Mystery, Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Nutter, John S. Bartley, Katherine Keizer', 'Scott Rosenberg', 'James Marsden, Katie Holmes, Nick Stahl, Bruce Greenwood, William Sadler, Chad Donella, Katharine Isabelle, Tobias Mehler', 'R', 'Steve Clark is a newcomer in the town of Cradle Bay, and he quickly realizes that there''s something odd about his high school classmates. The clique known as the "Blue Ribbons" are the eerie embodiment of academic excellence and clean living. But, like the rest of the town, they''re a little too perfect. When Steve''s rebellious friend Gavin mysteriously joins their ranks, Steve searches for the truth with fellow misfit Rachel.', 'Steve Clark is a newcomer in the town of Cradle Bay, and he quickly realizes that there''s something odd about his high school classmates. The clique known as the "Blue Ribbons" are the eerie embodiment of academic excellence and clean living. But, like the rest of the town, they''re a little too perfect. When Steve''s rebellious friend Gavin mysteriously joins their ranks, Steve searches for the truth with fellow misfit Rachel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uAhvaueOUUQ6ORCRdsJr1WXz1w0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9424'),
  ('550405086925360091', 'Disturbing the Peace', 2020, 'Action, Crime', 'Leiohu Richmond, Jason D. Jones, Curtis Petersen', 'Chuck Hustmyre', 'Guy Pearce, Devon Sawa, Kelly Greyson, Michael Sirow, Barbie Blank, Branscombe Richmond, Dwayne Cameron, Michael Bellisario', 'R', 'A small-town marshal who hasn''t carried a gun since he left the Texas Rangers after a tragic shooting must pick up his gun again to do battle with a gang of outlaw bikers that has invaded the town to pull off a brazen and violent heist.', 'A small-town marshal who hasn''t carried a gun since he left the Texas Rangers after a tragic shooting must pick up his gun again to do battle with a gang of outlaw bikers that has invaded the town to pull off a brazen and violent heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EyDLx7ea4ysBcvf8pdV6RyR6ut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620924'),
  ('762896348579709617', 'Ditched', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Christopher Donaldson, Wes Miron', 'Christopher Donaldson', 'Marika Sila, Kris Loranger, Lee Lopez, Declan O''Reilly, Mackenzie Gray, Lara Taillon, Reamonn Joshee, J. Lindsay Robinson', null, 'An ambulance transferring dangerous convicts crashes in the middle of nowhere. It soon becomes clear that the crash was no accident, and the survivors are being stalked by a killer. Just 30 feet to the road, but will anyone reach it alive?', 'An ambulance transferring dangerous convicts crashes in the middle of nowhere. It soon becomes clear that the crash was no accident, and the survivors are being stalked by a killer. Just 30 feet to the road, but will anyone reach it alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYMTYjQCjr7gN4MddQbratlHHbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852283'),
  ('867980263355845950', 'Ditte, Child of Man', 1946, 'Drama', 'Bjarne Henning-Jensen, Verner Jensen', 'Bjarne Henning-Jensen', 'Tove Maës, Karen Poulsen, Rasmus Ottesen, Karen Lykkehus, Jette Kehlet, Edvin Tiemroth, Ebbe Rode, Kai Holm', null, 'Ditte is born out of wedlock and lives as a young girl with her old beloved grandmother. As an illegitimate child she is teased in school and more than anything in the world she wants a father. When steady - utterly reliable - herring dealer Lars Petter shows up and tells her that he is marrying Ditte''s mother, the little girl is very happy. Now Ditte must take care of three new sisters and brothers but gets nothing but complaints from her ungrateful, selfish mother. But the little girl finds consolation and support in both her sisters and brothers and Lars Petter.', 'Ditte is born out of wedlock and lives as a young girl with her old beloved grandmother. As an illegitimate child she is teased in school and more than anything in the world she wants a father. When steady - utterly reliable - herring dealer Lars Petter shows up and tells her that he is marrying Ditte''s mother, the little girl is very happy. Now Ditte must take care of three new sisters and brothers but gets nothing but complaints from her ungrateful, selfish mother. But the little girl finds consolation and support in both her sisters and brothers and Lars Petter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKmR0WOJiuFZLXy4C6HGIpdVQMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47264'),
  ('334360414260618825', 'Ditto', 2000, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Kim Jeong-kwon, Chung Kwang-suk', 'Soo Dah, Heo In-ah, Kim Jeong-kwon', 'Kim Ha-neul, Yoo Ji-tae, Ha Ji-won, Park Yong-woo, Shin Cheol-jin, Yoo Tae-gyun, Lee In-ok, Lee Yeong-gwang', null, 'In this endearing supernatural love story spanning two decades, a university student finds himself communicating with a female classmate from the same school through an antique ham radio.', 'In this endearing supernatural love story spanning two decades, a university student finds himself communicating with a female classmate from the same school through an antique ham radio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omeuvIYHe4RCak2eUQOXNZngj0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81760'),
  ('670112651261686707', 'Ditto', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Seo Eun-young, Kim Tae-hun, Jung Gi-wook', 'Shin Jai-ho', 'Yeo Jin-goo, Cho Yi-hyun, Kim Hye-yoon, Na In-woo, Bae In-hyuk, Roh Jae-won, Nam Min-woo, Lim Yu-bin', null, 'A story about the love and friendship that takes place in an era where a man and a woman communicate through radio by chance.', 'A story about the love and friendship that takes place in an era where a man and a woman communicate through radio by chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTKlh5orSD9hsE8fbn5Tb4azHSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962489'),
  ('370795253101313952', 'Diva', 1981, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Philippe Rousselot, Jean-Jacques Beineix, Carlos Conti', 'Jean Van Hamme, Jean-Jacques Beineix', 'Frédéric Andréi, Richard Bohringer, Roland Bertin, Wilhelmenia Fernandez, Thuy An Luu, Chantal Deruaz, Anny Romand, Dominique Pinon', 'R', 'Jules, a young Parisian postman, secretly records a concert performance given by the opera singer Cynthia Hawkins, whom he idolises. The following day, Jules runs into a woman who is being pursued by armed thugs. Before she is killed, the woman slips an audio cassette into his mail bag...', 'Jules, a young Parisian postman, secretly records a concert performance given by the opera singer Cynthia Hawkins, whom he idolises. The following day, Jules runs into a woman who is being pursued by armed thugs. Before she is killed, the woman slips an audio cassette into his mail bag...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5fOCdfv0lRdeI71qLFdNEKWDsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4485'),
  ('905608374011503532', 'Diva', 2020, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Jo Seul-yeah, Cho Gyu-young, Kim Sun-ryung', 'Yoo Young-seon, Jo Seul-yeah', 'Shin Min-a, Lee You-young, Lee Kyoo-hyung, Ju Seok-tae, Oh Ha-ni, Park Seong-yeon, Heo Hyung-kyu, Yoon Geumseon-ah', null, 'Skill, beauty, personality, ‘Diving Diva’ Lee-young has it all. Not being able to be with her best friend Su-jin is the only thing that gets in her way. Just so she can help Su-jin out, she changes her event to synchronizing swimming. While pouring everything to Olympics selection practice, Su-jin and Lee-young are involved in a freak accident. Su-jin disappears without a trace, while Lee-young survives but loses her memory. Lee-young’s memory slowly comes back to her but remembers strange side of Su-jin. Her iron will begins to shake on the diving board.', 'Skill, beauty, personality, ‘Diving Diva’ Lee-young has it all. Not being able to be with her best friend Su-jin is the only thing that gets in her way. Just so she can help Su-jin out, she changes her event to synchronizing swimming. While pouring everything to Olympics selection practice, Su-jin and Lee-young are involved in a freak accident. Su-jin disappears without a trace, while Lee-young survives but loses her memory. Lee-young’s memory slowly comes back to her but remembers strange side of Su-jin. Her iron will begins to shake on the diving board.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6V1FxCqLyWUQW1jENa3Kkre7YQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601664'),
  ('607930014341086221', 'Diva Futura', 2025, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Giulia Louise Steigerwalt, Vladan Radović', 'Giulia Louise Steigerwalt', 'Pietro Castellitto, Barbara Ronchi, Denise Capezza, Tesa Litvan, Lidija Kordić, Davide Iachini, Marco Iermanò, Beatrice Puccilli', null, 'In 1980s - 1990s Italy, Riccardo Schicchi’s agency Diva Futura turns free love into porn, making stars of Ilona Staller, Moana Pozzi and others known around the world. Their fame leads to Cicciolina’s election and Pozzi’s mayoral run.', 'In 1980s - 1990s Italy, Riccardo Schicchi’s agency Diva Futura turns free love into porn, making stars of Ilona Staller, Moana Pozzi and others known around the world. Their fame leads to Cicciolina’s election and Pozzi’s mayoral run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KSpbtZc9sPGaQ0x3pb9fvdDypz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1141163'),
  ('323680416885880953', 'Divaldo Franco', 2019, 'Drama', 'Clovis Mello, Jean Benoît Crépon', 'Clovis Mello, Luciane Toffoli', 'Bruno Garcia, Regiane Alves, Marcos Veras, Ghilherme Lobo, Laila Garin, Caco Monteiro, Ana Cecília Costa, Osvaldo Mil', null, 'Born in the small town of Feira de Santana, in the interior of Bahia, Divaldo has lived with mediumship since he was 4 years old. Disturbed by what he sees, rejected by other children and repressed by his father, the boy does not have an easy childhood. At 17, he is convinced that it is useless to try to deny his gift. With the support of his mother, he comes into contact with Spiritism and moves to Salvador to study the doctrine. Under the guidance of his spiritual guide, Joanna de Ângelis, the young man overcomes the homesickness and the loneliness of the big city and embraces his mission. A few years later, that strange boy from Feira de Santana becomes one of the most important mediums of all time and gives up his personal life to dedicate himself to charity.', 'Born in the small town of Feira de Santana, in the interior of Bahia, Divaldo has lived with mediumship since he was 4 years old. Disturbed by what he sees, rejected by other children and repressed by his father, the boy does not have an easy childhood. At 17, he is convinced that it is useless to try to deny his gift. With the support of his mother, he comes into contact with Spiritism and moves to Salvador to study the doctrine. Under the guidance of his spiritual guide, Joanna de Ângelis, the young man overcomes the homesickness and the loneliness of the big city and embraces his mission. A few years later, that strange boy from Feira de Santana becomes one of the most important mediums of all time and gives up his personal life to dedicate himself to charity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0qUWUddEMySjvvOUpAAlXWNrZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612304'),
  ('473867128859776981', 'DIVE', 2022, 'Drama', 'Lucía Puenzo, Nicolás Puenzo', 'Tatiana Merenuk, Mónica Herrera, Lucía Puenzo', 'Karla Souza, Hernán Mendoza, Dèja Ebergenyi, Christian Vazquez, Mabel Cadena, Fernanda Borches, Claudia Lobo, Enrique Singer', null, 'Mariel is a veteran elite diver who has one last chance at the Olympic Games. However, when a terrible truth comes to light, Mariel faces her biggest personal question: Is winning her true dream?', 'Mariel is a veteran elite diver who has one last chance at the Olympic Games. However, when a terrible truth comes to light, Mariel faces her biggest personal question: Is winning her true dream?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rl5aC6Kh46kuEwZYf0lbIMvijr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1037603'),
  ('1007473264139705251', 'Dive Bomber', 1941, 'Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Leo F. Forbstein, Bert Glennon', 'Frank Wead, Robert Buckner', 'Errol Flynn, Fred MacMurray, Ralph Bellamy, Alexis Smith, Robert Armstrong, Regis Toomey, Allen Jenkins, Craig Stevens', 'NR', 'A military surgeon teams with a ranking navy flyer to develop a high-altitude suit which will protect pilots from blacking out when they go into a steep dive.', 'A military surgeon teams with a ranking navy flyer to develop a high-altitude suit which will protect pilots from blacking out when they go into a steep dive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2my6RE1UuD7M3I0gwrToUUosyUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65587'),
  ('171099350268912603', 'DIVE!!', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Naoto Kumazawa, Akira Sako', 'Masashi Todayama, Tamio Hayashi', 'Kento Hayashi, Sosuke Ikematsu, Junpei Mizobata, Asaka Seto, Misako Renbutsu, Ken Mitsuishi, Tohru Emori, Shohei Yamazaki', null, 'A diving club is in danger of going bankrupt. To save the diving club, a female coach returns from the U.S. to coach the club and promises that a diver from the club will make the Japanese Olympic team.', 'A diving club is in danger of going bankrupt. To save the diving club, a female coach returns from the U.S. to coach the club and promises that a diver from the club will make the Japanese Olympic team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9p8hhhH7StbI4vX1mzr1Cbhkq3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147552'),
  ('53187124186259694', 'Divergence', 2005, 'Action, Thriller', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming, Mandy Ngai Man-Yin', 'Ivy Ho', 'Aaron Kwok, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Daniel Wu, Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Ning Jing, Jan Lam Hoi-Fung, Yu Rongguang', null, 'A cop, a lawyer, and an assassin cross paths after the murder of a federal witness and the kidnapping of a famous pop star.', 'A cop, a lawyer, and an assassin cross paths after the murder of a federal witness and the kidnapping of a famous pop star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pR505fBCoezKBeImYV3cdQEejRo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32164'),
  ('452161078301326336', 'Divergent', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Neil Burger, Bryan Goeres, Dieter Busch', 'Vanessa Taylor, Evan Daugherty', 'Shailene Woodley, Theo James, Zoë Kravitz, Miles Teller, Jai Courtney, Ansel Elgort, Ashley Judd, Tony Goldwyn', 'PG-13', 'In a world divided into factions based on personality types, Tris learns that she''s been classified as Divergent and won''t fit in. When she discovers a plot to destroy Divergents, Tris and the mysterious Four must find out what makes Divergents dangerous before it''s too late.', 'In a world divided into factions based on personality types, Tris learns that she''s been classified as Divergent and won''t fit in. When she discovers a plot to destroy Divergents, Tris and the mysterious Four must find out what makes Divergents dangerous before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNh4Q3iuPKDMPi2SL7GgOpiLukX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157350'),
  ('62962257033275420', 'Divers at Work on the Wreck of the "Maine"', 1898, 'Documentary', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'Divers go to work on a wrecked ship (the battleship Maine that was blown up in Havana harbour during the Spanish-American War), surrounded by curiously disproportionate fish.', 'Divers go to work on a wrecked ship (the battleship Maine that was blown up in Havana harbour during the Spanish-American War), surrounded by curiously disproportionate fish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duiuY8xi0fPCBegpWyToUQiZYSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104480'),
  ('1080546458014249903', 'Divertimento', 2023, 'Drama, History, Music', 'Marie-Castille Mention-Schaar, Pascal Ralite, Zazie Carcedo', 'Marie-Castille Mention-Schaar, Clara Bourreau', 'Oulaya Amamra, Lina El Arabi, Niels Arestrup, Zinedine Soualem, Nadia Kaci, Laurent Cirade, Martin Chapoutot, Louis-Damien Kapfer', null, 'Zahia Ziouani, 17, dreams of becoming a conductor, while her twin sister Fettouma hopes to be a professional cellist. They want to make classical music accessible to everyone and create their own orchestra.', 'Zahia Ziouani, 17, dreams of becoming a conductor, while her twin sister Fettouma hopes to be a professional cellist. They want to make classical music accessible to everyone and create their own orchestra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeLR9wpE52VNNZ2pQe26h1lxgR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958179'),
  ('573065363950190072', 'Divided Heaven', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Konrad Wolf, Kurt Barthel, Werner Bergmann', 'Konrad Wolf, Gerhard Wolf, Christa Wolf', 'Lissy Tempelhof, Werner Eberlein, Renate Blume, Eberhard Esche, Hans Hardt-Hardtloff, Hilmar Thate, Martin Flörchinger, Erika Pelikowsky', null, 'After a breakdown, Rita returns to her childhood village in 1961. As she recovers, she remembers the past two years: her love for the chemist Manfred, ten years her senior; how his enthusiasm about his new chemical process turned to bitter disappointment in the face of official rejection; how he escaped to West Berlin a few weeks before the Wall was built and hoped that she would follow him …', 'After a breakdown, Rita returns to her childhood village in 1961. As she recovers, she remembers the past two years: her love for the chemist Manfred, ten years her senior; how his enthusiasm about his new chemical process turned to bitter disappointment in the face of official rejection; how he escaped to West Berlin a few weeks before the Wall was built and hoped that she would follow him …', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQH5s8VYZpwHqH1EdidiqJMOile.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201429'),
  ('341901000255315980', 'Divided Into Zero', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Mitch Davis', 'Mitch Davis', 'Phillippe Daoust, Max Firatli, Griffith Brewer, Stephanie Kepman, Meredith Darling, Andrea Hardy, Benoît Boucher', null, 'A non-linear surrealistic horror film documenting a man''s broken descent into isolation, body mutilation, paedophilia and murder.', 'A non-linear surrealistic horror film documenting a man''s broken descent into isolation, body mutilation, paedophilia and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jx95lh2ec61PzhkIcLVQWGbeqye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289271'),
  ('1129554674619568037', 'Divided We Fall', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jan Hřebejk, Jan Malíř, Ladislav Ondráček', 'Petr Jarchovský', 'Bolek Polívka, Anna Šišková, Csongor Kassai, Jaroslav Dušek, Martin Huba, Jiří Pecha, Simona Stašová, Jiří Kodet', null, 'In 1943, a childless couple, the Čížeks, decide to hide a Jewish refugee, David Wiener, the son of Čížek''s former employer, in the secret pantry of their apartment. Čížek is aware of the danger into which he has brought his household and his neighbours, but he takes helping his fellow man in need for granted. But at the same time, as a largely unheroic hero, he is dying of fear. His personal situation is greatly complicated by the approaching end of the war, when he faces danger from both the Germans and his "honest" fellow Czechs...', 'In 1943, a childless couple, the Čížeks, decide to hide a Jewish refugee, David Wiener, the son of Čížek''s former employer, in the secret pantry of their apartment. Čížek is aware of the danger into which he has brought his household and his neighbours, but he takes helping his fellow man in need for granted. But at the same time, as a largely unheroic hero, he is dying of fear. His personal situation is greatly complicated by the approaching end of the war, when he faces danger from both the Germans and his "honest" fellow Czechs...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mKiT1zyUHHSCUm1hfZVe4RUhjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29937'),
  ('849853857607599810', 'Divin enfant', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Doran', 'Olivier Doran, Philippe Lefebvre', 'Sami Bouajila, Émilie Dequenne, Géraldine Pailhas, Linh-Dan Pham, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Pascal Demolon, Marco Prince, Natacha Lindinger', null, 'A large house surrounded by vineyards. A Christmas Eve in a very blended family turns into an absolute nightmare when the mistress of the house tells her new husband that she is pregnant. She doesn''t know that he can''t have children...', 'A large house surrounded by vineyards. A Christmas Eve in a very blended family turns into an absolute nightmare when the mistress of the house tells her new husband that she is pregnant. She doesn''t know that he can''t have children...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6D61xM5GURX6OEacdsme7Pq5dOw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253684'),
  ('223288309506784108', 'Divine', 1998, 'Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein, Guillermo Granillo', 'Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Francisco Rabal, Katy Jurado, Carolina Papaleo, Flor Eduarda Gurrola, Bruno Bichir, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Rafael Inclán, Rodrigo Ostap', null, '"La Nueva Jerusalem" is a small community of believers lead by Papá Basilio and Mamá Dorita. They''re waiting for the second coming of Christ, so they''ve abandoned the world, searching for a new spiritual life. Mamá Dorita sees in young Tomasa the signals of the chosen one. The young girl will be the new leader in "La Nueva Jerusalem".', '"La Nueva Jerusalem" is a small community of believers lead by Papá Basilio and Mamá Dorita. They''re waiting for the second coming of Christ, so they''ve abandoned the world, searching for a new spiritual life. Mamá Dorita sees in young Tomasa the signals of the chosen one. The young girl will be the new leader in "La Nueva Jerusalem".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7X8Ln2DdNJoCMAO5tL8GHlPXEuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125298'),
  ('205266697346121810', 'Divine', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Florian Hoffmeister, Jan Schomburg', 'Jan Schomburg', 'Callum Turner, Matilda De Angelis, Ronkẹ Adékoluẹjo, Mark Davison, Hugh Wyld, Lewis Hart, Kemaal Deen-Ellis, Anna Bonaiuto', null, 'While reporting on the election of the Pope in Rome, the completely atheistic journalist Gregory falls in love with Maria of all people, who is about to become a nun and is therefore actually promised to God. Gregory faces an accumulation of mysterious obstacles as he tries to get closer to Maria. He has to find out that he is dealing with a supernatural competitor. However, Gregory is determined to take up the fight against the big enemy.', 'While reporting on the election of the Pope in Rome, the completely atheistic journalist Gregory falls in love with Maria of all people, who is about to become a nun and is therefore actually promised to God. Gregory faces an accumulation of mysterious obstacles as he tries to get closer to Maria. He has to find out that he is dealing with a supernatural competitor. However, Gregory is determined to take up the fight against the big enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXx8uRWTQky0Y4uEd7G0BkaC5oS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728939'),
  ('590127913875843943', 'Divine Confusion', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Salvador Garcini', 'Antonio Abascal', 'Jesús Ochoa, Diana Bracho, Lisa Owen, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Alejandro Camacho, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Alan Estrada, Blanca Soto', null, 'The Greek Olimpian Gods engage in the human life experience to its full intensity, for which they choose Mexico City''s trendy night club: "Olimpus Dancing Club". Once living in the mortal''s world, the naughty Eros (with help of a gang of ill-behaved gods), is responsible for unleashing a forbidden passion that disrupts the lives of the members of two families of not-so-simple mortals.', 'The Greek Olimpian Gods engage in the human life experience to its full intensity, for which they choose Mexico City''s trendy night club: "Olimpus Dancing Club". Once living in the mortal''s world, the naughty Eros (with help of a gang of ill-behaved gods), is responsible for unleashing a forbidden passion that disrupts the lives of the members of two families of not-so-simple mortals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tPcM3TjH3y0fJ7K6MraqHsfKBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71665'),
  ('804071709506588533', 'Divine Divas', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Leandra Leal, David Pacheco', 'Lucas Paraizo, Carol Benjamin, Leandra Leal', 'Leandra Leal, Rogéria, Brigitte Buzios, Jane di Castro, Fujica de Holliday, Ruddy, Camille K, Miguel Falabella', null, 'Eight iconic performers of the first generation of Brazilian transvestite artists go on stage to celebrate their 50th career jubilee. The film depicts the human, personal dimension behind these icons, deconstructing gender stereotypes.', 'Eight iconic performers of the first generation of Brazilian transvestite artists go on stage to celebrate their 50th career jubilee. The film depicts the human, personal dimension behind these icons, deconstructing gender stereotypes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNzPslieL4JkE4SBsxIfrdIPvbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417504'),
  ('1028078527474502042', 'Divine Emanuelle', 1981, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Christian Anders, Ilias Mylonakos', 'Christian Anders', 'Laura Gemser, Christian Anders, Gabriele Tinti, Maximilian Wolters, Simone Brahmann, Fini, Bob Burrows, Sascha Borysenko', null, 'The young daughter of a US Senator is drawn into a hippie “free love” cult called “The Children of Light” by the blond boyfriend of the cult’s leader, a mysterious and beautiful Asian woman. The cult turns out to be not quite the “free” love community it presents itself to be.', 'The young daughter of a US Senator is drawn into a hippie “free love” cult called “The Children of Light” by the blond boyfriend of the cult’s leader, a mysterious and beautiful Asian woman. The cult turns out to be not quite the “free” love community it presents itself to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66CBh1cPP7vjkGfiCnxr5cLRVKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39919'),
  ('278026760555056087', 'Divine Horsemen: The Living Gods of Haiti', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Cherel Ito, Maya Deren, Teiji Ito', 'Cherel Ito, Teiji Ito', 'John Genke, Joan Pape', null, 'This intimate ethnographic study of Voudoun dances and rituals was shot by Maya Deren during her years in Haiti (1947-1951); she never edited the footage, so this “finished” version was made by Teiji Ito and Cherel Ito after Deren’s death.', 'This intimate ethnographic study of Voudoun dances and rituals was shot by Maya Deren during her years in Haiti (1947-1951); she never edited the footage, so this “finished” version was made by Teiji Ito and Cherel Ito after Deren’s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lswZAzO00IAAB8aZ5eZsqQvEgMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38638'),
  ('1068917551620439991', 'Divine Intervention', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Elia Suleiman, Marc-André Batigne', 'Elia Suleiman', 'Elia Suleiman, Nayef Fahoum Daher, Manal Khader, George Ibrahim, Jamel Daher, Amer Daher, Lutuf Nouasser, Riad Masarweh', null, 'Santa Claus tries to outrun a gang of knife-wielding youth. It''s one of several vignettes of Palestinian life in Israel - in a neighborhood in Nazareth and at Al-Ram checkpoint in East Jerusalem. Most of the stories are droll, some absurd, one is mythic and fanciful; few words are spoken. A man who goes through his mail methodically each morning has a heart attack. His son visits him in the hospital. The son regularly meets a woman at Al-Ram; they sit in a car, hands caressing. Once, she defies Israeli guards at the checkpoint; later, ninja-like, she takes on soldiers at a target range. A red balloon floats free overhead. Neighbors toss garbage over walls. Life goes on until it doesn''t.', 'Santa Claus tries to outrun a gang of knife-wielding youth. It''s one of several vignettes of Palestinian life in Israel - in a neighborhood in Nazareth and at Al-Ram checkpoint in East Jerusalem. Most of the stories are droll, some absurd, one is mythic and fanciful; few words are spoken. A man who goes through his mail methodically each morning has a heart attack. His son visits him in the hospital. The son regularly meets a woman at Al-Ram; they sit in a car, hands caressing. Once, she defies Israeli guards at the checkpoint; later, ninja-like, she takes on soldiers at a target range. A red balloon floats free overhead. Neighbors toss garbage over walls. Life goes on until it doesn''t.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pczspk2mTCVmG5eyErnB4BZD2HY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27744'),
  ('265525393689700247', 'Divine Intervention', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Juan Pablo Ojeda, Pedro Pablo Ibarra', 'Emilio Portes', 'Adrián Uribe, Memo Villegas, Ana Serradilla, Giovanna Romo, Jorge Perugorría', null, 'Checo and Chuma decide to use their criminal skills to do good and help people. Along the way, they learn that friendship and love are more than just clichés.', 'Checo and Chuma decide to use their criminal skills to do good and help people. Along the way, they learn that friendship and love are more than just clichés.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qpYwWq6KxuLTjmLfBVcGtjdz4g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160007'),
  ('227514781973485293', 'Divine Love', 2019, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Gabriel Mascaro, Julia Medeiros, Diego García', 'Marcelo Gomes', 'Dira Paes, Júlio Machado, Emílio de Mello, Teca Pereira, Mariana Nunes, Thalita Carauta, Tuna Dwek, Thiago Justino', null, 'In 2027 Brazil, civil servant Joana mainly deals with divorce cases. As a member of a branch of evangelical Christians known as the Divino Amor group, she uses her position to offer a kind of physical therapy to couples who want to separate. Although Joana and her husband Danilo regularly consummate their marriage, neither her constant prayers nor any other methods of assistance seem to be able to fulfill their desire for a child.', 'In 2027 Brazil, civil servant Joana mainly deals with divorce cases. As a member of a branch of evangelical Christians known as the Divino Amor group, she uses her position to offer a kind of physical therapy to couples who want to separate. Although Joana and her husband Danilo regularly consummate their marriage, neither her constant prayers nor any other methods of assistance seem to be able to fulfill their desire for a child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDVztOkuqE9GYGGaXPSMtBjcrE2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504592'),
  ('273798615050282120', 'Divine Madness', 1980, 'Documentary, Comedy, Music', 'Michael Ritchie, William A. Fraker', 'Bruce Vilanch, Jerry Blatt, Bette Midler', 'Bette Midler, Jocelyn Brown, Ula Hedwig, Diva Gray, Irving Sudrow, Tony Berg, Jon Bonine, Joey Carbone', 'R', 'Divine Madness is a 1980 concert film directed by Michael Ritchie, and featuring Bette Midler during her 1979 concert at Pasadena''s Civic Auditorium. The 94-minute film features Midler''s stand-up comedy routines as well as 16 songs, including "Big Noise From Winnetka," "Paradise," "Shiver Me Timbers," "Fire Down Below," "Stay With Me," "My Mother’s Eyes," "Chapel of Love/Boogie Woogie Bugle Boy," "Do You Want to Dance," "You Can’t Always Get What You Want/I Shall Be Released", "The E-Street Shuffle/Summer (The First Time)/"Leader of the Pack" and "The Rose".', 'Divine Madness is a 1980 concert film directed by Michael Ritchie, and featuring Bette Midler during her 1979 concert at Pasadena''s Civic Auditorium. The 94-minute film features Midler''s stand-up comedy routines as well as 16 songs, including "Big Noise From Winnetka," "Paradise," "Shiver Me Timbers," "Fire Down Below," "Stay With Me," "My Mother’s Eyes," "Chapel of Love/Boogie Woogie Bugle Boy," "Do You Want to Dance," "You Can’t Always Get What You Want/I Shall Be Released", "The E-Street Shuffle/Summer (The First Time)/"Leader of the Pack" and "The Rose".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fiHLBW50X4WJtnT3wieJ1wQYVu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27059'),
  ('1067033354528812076', 'Divine Secrets of the Ya-Ya Sisterhood', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Bailey, Callie Khouri, Avy Kaufman', 'Callie Khouri', 'Sandra Bullock, Ellen Burstyn, Fionnula Flanagan, James Garner, Cherry Jones, Ashley Judd, Shirley Knight, Angus Macfadyen', 'PG-13', 'In a sleepy Louisiana parish, a group of lifelong friends stage a rather unorthodox intervention to help a young playwright unravel the truth about her complicated mother and let go of her painful past.', 'In a sleepy Louisiana parish, a group of lifelong friends stage a rather unorthodox intervention to help a young playwright unravel the truth about her complicated mother and let go of her painful past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hI05FJ8wgPROHQgLtfJ4ZuH3l4b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9583'),
  ('866224727775218543', 'Divine Trash', 2000, 'Documentary', 'Steve Yeager', 'Kevin Heffernan, Steve Yeager', 'John Waters, Divine, Mary Vivian Pearce, Mink Stole, Herschell Gordon Lewis, Steve Buscemi, George Kuchar, Mike Kuchar', null, 'The life and times of Baltimore film maker and midnight movie pioneer, John Waters.', 'The life and times of Baltimore film maker and midnight movie pioneer, John Waters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaPcuUP9QxyKRtdGtE6IlG4JLqp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53380'),
  ('227935680366583658', 'Diving', 2017, 'Drama', 'Mélanie Laurent', 'Mélanie Laurent, Julien Lambroschini, Christophe Deslandes', 'Gilles Lellouche, María Valverde, Marie Denarnaud, Ibrahim Ahmed, Noémie Merlant, Albert Delpy, Thomas Solivérès, Christophe Vandevelde', null, 'A restless photographer leaves her family to "find herself" and takes up deep-sea diving.', 'A restless photographer leaves her family to "find herself" and takes up deep-sea diving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A44lIM211tHIzNwQZ0uGgv8WHIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462146'),
  ('537600031339914317', 'Divinity', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Horror', 'Eddie Alcazar, Danny Hiele, Johnny Starke', 'Eddie Alcazar', 'Stephen Dorff, Moisés Arias, Jason Genao, Bella Thorne, Scott Bakula, Emily Willis, Mike O''Hearn, Caylee Cowan', 'NR', 'Two brothers crash into the decaying Earth to stop a capitalist from manufacturing an immortality serum, which is synthesized utilizing heinous methods and leaving an increasingly dire infertility rate in its wake.', 'Two brothers crash into the decaying Earth to stop a capitalist from manufacturing an immortality serum, which is synthesized utilizing heinous methods and leaving an increasingly dire infertility rate in its wake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Ri4XxXNCUKwlZWXgoVNftF7GIY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058619'),
  ('514944259907342069', 'Divorce', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Radosław Drabik, Michał Chaciński, Mateusz Pastewka', 'Łukasz Światowiec, Michał Chaciński, Titas Laucius', 'Magdalena Popławska, Wojciech Mecwaldowski, Tomasz Schuchardt, Oliwia Drabik, Michalina Łabacz, Aleksandra Grabowska, Michał Pawlik, Szymon Kuśmider', null, 'Two decades after divorcing and taking separate paths in life, a former couple is working to obtain an official declaration of invalidity of their brief marriage.', 'Two decades after divorcing and taking separate paths in life, a former couple is working to obtain an official declaration of invalidity of their brief marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJfv8ceXsopdMmv9AKGBkKiBKhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1281933'),
  ('1090184942596045897', 'Divorce American Style', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Bud Yorkin, Conrad Hall, Rusty Meek', 'Norman Lear', 'Dick Van Dyke, Debbie Reynolds, Jason Robards, Jean Simmons, Van Johnson, Joe Flynn, Shelley Berman, Martin Gabel', null, 'After 17 years of marriage in American suburbia, Richard and Barbara Harmon step into the new world of divorce.', 'After 17 years of marriage in American suburbia, Richard and Barbara Harmon step into the new world of divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QLwwLUDkuBCYYGaLZZipalRW95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102057'),
  ('346991529936521736', 'Divorce Club', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Michaël Youn', 'David Gilcreast', 'Arnaud Ducret, François-Xavier Demaison, Caroline Anglade, Audrey Fleurot, Youssef Hajdi, Grégoire Bonnet, Michaël Youn, Frédérique Bel', null, 'Ben is devastated when his wife asks for a divorce. While everyone chooses her side, Ben comes across Patrick, an old friend from college, recently divorced. Patrick invites him to crash at his place. The two roommates are soon joined by other divorced, separated and single people looking for a refuge.', 'Ben is devastated when his wife asks for a divorce. While everyone chooses her side, Ben comes across Patrick, an old friend from college, recently divorced. Patrick invites him to crash at his place. The two roommates are soon joined by other divorced, separated and single people looking for a refuge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0FE1o5SUJzImwV4Q099uAq018U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665488'),
  ('1135301180031796781', 'Divorce French Style', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dorothée Sebbagh, Gilles Porte', 'Fanny Chesnel, Dorothée Sebbagh', 'Géraldine Nakache, Kim Rossi Stuart, Pascal Demolon, Sophie Cattani, Catherine Jacob, Nora Hamzawi, Caroline Le Quang, Christophe Prévost', null, 'Ariane, a young French violinist, accepts the marriage proposal of Christen, an irresistible conductor. Only problem: she''s a little bit ... married! Separated for two years with Nino, an Italian teacher with a strong character, she manages to convince him to follow her to Paris to divorce in 8 days flat. But their trip in the city of love looks much more eventful than expected...', 'Ariane, a young French violinist, accepts the marriage proposal of Christen, an irresistible conductor. Only problem: she''s a little bit ... married! Separated for two years with Nino, an Italian teacher with a strong character, she manages to convince him to follow her to Paris to divorce in 8 days flat. But their trip in the city of love looks much more eventful than expected...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hs1Qy40vtU8o8KTXx10Ql6mcZz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278646'),
  ('170392808586434855', 'Divorce French Style', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Laurent Dailland, Martin Bourboulon', 'Alexandre de La Patellière, Matthieu Delaporte', 'Laurent Lafitte, Marina Foïs, Alexandre Desrousseaux, Anna Lemarchand, Achille Potier, Judith El Zein, Michaël Abiteboul, Sara Giraudeau', null, 'Two years have passed. After missing their separation, the Leroy seem perfectly successful in their divorce. But the appearance of two new lovers in the life of Vincent and Florence will set fire to the powders. The match between the former spouses resumes.', 'Two years have passed. After missing their separation, the Leroy seem perfectly successful in their divorce. But the appearance of two new lovers in the life of Vincent and Florence will set fire to the powders. The match between the former spouses resumes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpBBAw2XkKK3VWSpaOGaCh1bgNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382593'),
  ('111529787560513924', 'Divorce Iranian Style', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Ziba Mir-Hosseini, Kim Longinotto', 'Ziba Mir-Hosseini', null, null, 'DIVORCE IRANIAN STYLE unfolds inside an Iranian divorce court, providing a subtle and intimate look at the lives of women in a country stereotypically associated with fanaticism and oppression. Astute and beautifully observed, the film reveals the ingenuity and humour with which Iranian women negotiate the restrictions of their society.', 'DIVORCE IRANIAN STYLE unfolds inside an Iranian divorce court, providing a subtle and intimate look at the lives of women in a country stereotypically associated with fanaticism and oppression. Astute and beautifully observed, the film reveals the ingenuity and humour with which Iranian women negotiate the restrictions of their society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sw3qpkFevOSRQunaGeTmozqJYKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118617'),
  ('226195227247791447', 'Divorces', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Valérie Guignabodet, Pierre Gill', 'Franck Philippon, Valérie Guignabodet', 'François-Xavier Demaison, Pascale Arbillot, Mathias Mlekuz, Brigitte Catillon, Juliette Arnaud, Zinedine Soualem, Cyril Couton, Nathalie Corré', null, 'Valentine and Alex are married, both lawyers, specializing in family matters. In the exercise of their profession, they defend the divorce of the XXIst century: amicable, in the serenity and the respect of the other, preferably in alternating custody and in the blended family, far from the cased vases and the atrocious scenes of household of the previous generation. Until the day when, because of a banal adultery, their couple shatters. And the reality of the divorce catches up with them: no more fine words, just war.', 'Valentine and Alex are married, both lawyers, specializing in family matters. In the exercise of their profession, they defend the divorce of the XXIst century: amicable, in the serenity and the respect of the other, preferably in alternating custody and in the blended family, far from the cased vases and the atrocious scenes of household of the previous generation. Until the day when, because of a banal adultery, their couple shatters. And the reality of the divorce catches up with them: no more fine words, just war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xixemp1yLsFgxVj4mu797j2z1gh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58497'),
  ('923498942692391497', 'Divorcing Jack', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Caffrey, James Welland', 'Colin Bateman', 'David Thewlis, Rachel Griffiths, Jason Isaacs, Laura Fraser, Richard Gant, Laine Megaw, Bronagh Gallagher, Kitty Aldridge', null, 'He''s Irish, he''s ageing, he drinks, is a touch cynical and when he has time writes a newspaper column. On the eve of the country''s first election as an independent state, Dan Starkey''s life is about to change after he finds the young woman he has just made love to dead and his only ally is a nun', 'He''s Irish, he''s ageing, he drinks, is a touch cynical and when he has time writes a newspaper column. On the eve of the country''s first election as an independent state, Dan Starkey''s life is about to change after he finds the young woman he has just made love to dead and his only ally is a nun', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPbxBc3DWR5vz2ucO5v8MO8NA47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43997'),
  ('487250558558516222', 'Divórcio', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Amorim, Hélcio Alemão Nagamine', 'Paulo Cursino, Angélica Lopes', 'Murilo Benício, Camila Morgado, Luciana Paes, Thelmo Fernandes, André Mattos, Ângela Dip, Carol Severian, Flávia Martins', null, '20 years after running away together, Julio and Noeli have raised a family and run a successful business together. However, their marriage seems to be failing, so Noeli files for divorce. Both will do whatever it takes to win their legal battle.', '20 years after running away together, Julio and Noeli have raised a family and run a successful business together. However, their marriage seems to be failing, so Noeli files for divorce. Both will do whatever it takes to win their legal battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOI81CTgr1ZkDR62RFOTu6mtFrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451409'),
  ('443193891740180106', 'Divorzio a Las Vegas', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Umberto Riccioni Carteni, Emanuele Zarlenga', 'Alessandro Pondi, Riccardo Irrera, Mauro Graiani', 'Giampaolo Morelli, Andrea Delogu, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Ricky Memphis, Grazia Schiavo, Luca Vecchi, Desirée Popper, Vincent Riotta', null, 'Lorenzo known as Ghandi and Elena met at 18 during a vacation through Nevada and ended up doing the classic madness: they got married in Las Vegas. A few hours later everyone was going their own way, putting the incident behind them (or at least that''s what Elena thinks). Twenty years later Elena is about to marry a very rich and brilliant man, but her best friend Sara, a lawyer, informs her that, being technically still married to Lorenzo, she must first dissolve that bond or she will be accused of bigamy. Elena and Lorenzo must therefore return to Las Vegas and obtain a divorce decree in a few days. If they really want to.', 'Lorenzo known as Ghandi and Elena met at 18 during a vacation through Nevada and ended up doing the classic madness: they got married in Las Vegas. A few hours later everyone was going their own way, putting the incident behind them (or at least that''s what Elena thinks). Twenty years later Elena is about to marry a very rich and brilliant man, but her best friend Sara, a lawyer, informs her that, being technically still married to Lorenzo, she must first dissolve that bond or she will be accused of bigamy. Elena and Lorenzo must therefore return to Las Vegas and obtain a divorce decree in a few days. If they really want to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qo7ECVZ6KybwFiM6VlbEaqYcuy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647813'),
  ('748852893080688380', 'Dixiana', 1930, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Luther Reed, J. Roy Hunt, Fred Fleck', 'Luther Reed', 'Bebe Daniels, Everett Marshall, Bert Wheeler, Robert Woolsey, Joseph Cawthorn, Jobyna Howland, Dorothy Lee, Ralf Harolde', 'NR', 'A circus performer falls in love with the son of a plantation owner in antebellum New Orleans. When the young man''s stepmother objects to the wedding, the couple break apart and go their separate ways for a time. Also in the mix are two circus comics who feud over the heart of another Southern belle.', 'A circus performer falls in love with the son of a plantation owner in antebellum New Orleans. When the young man''s stepmother objects to the wedding, the couple break apart and go their separate ways for a time. Also in the mix are two circus comics who feud over the heart of another Southern belle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6UaLSSJQ8IZL4IB1k46S5R0Pxr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22956'),
  ('1068461826807325075', 'Dixie Chicks: Shut Up and Sing', 2006, 'Music, Documentary', 'Barbara Kopple, Cecilia Peck, Christine Burrill', null, 'Natalie Maines, Emily Erwin, Martie Maguire, George W. Bush, Rick Rubin, Simon Renshaw', null, 'Shut Up and Sing is a documentary about the country band from Texas called the Dixie Chicks and how one tiny comment against President Bush dropped their number one hit off the charts and caused fans to hate them, destroy their CD’s, and protest at their concerts. A film about freedom of speech gone out of control and the three girls lives that were forever changed by a small anti-Bush comment', 'Shut Up and Sing is a documentary about the country band from Texas called the Dixie Chicks and how one tiny comment against President Bush dropped their number one hit off the charts and caused fans to hate them, destroy their CD’s, and protest at their concerts. A film about freedom of speech gone out of control and the three girls lives that were forever changed by a small anti-Bush comment', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aZ8uWvCckLTbalbiqut3Vrt33c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2152'),
  ('92202559766761803', 'Dixie Dynamite', 1976, 'Action, Thriller', 'Lee Frost, Lee Frost', 'Wes Bishop, Lee Frost', 'Warren Oates, Christopher George, Jane Anne Johnstone, Kathy McHaley, Stanley Adams, R.G. Armstrong, Phil Hoover, Wes Bishop', 'PG', 'When their moonshiner father is killed by a corrupt deputy, two young girls decide to take over his business and get revenge on the men who had him killed', 'When their moonshiner father is killed by a corrupt deputy, two young girls decide to take over his business and get revenge on the men who had him killed', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sMvIPrHPdoUG5fxmoIlTWLhzLI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90072'),
  ('541581377812939950', 'Dixieland Droopy', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Bill Thompson, Daws Butler, John Brown', null, 'John Pettibone (Droopy), a dog whose love of Dixieland music is not appreciated by those around him, has a lucky meeting with Pee-Wee Runt and his All-Flea Dixieland band at the circus.', 'John Pettibone (Droopy), a dog whose love of Dixieland music is not appreciated by those around him, has a lucky meeting with Pee-Wee Runt and his All-Flea Dixieland band at the circus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMMpQh5S3GOR7KXz38WaPhpBXWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84752'),
  ('323643819879016013', 'Dizzy Detectives', 1943, 'Comedy', 'Jules White, Benjamin H. Kline', 'Felix Adler', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Dick Botiller, Lynton Brent, Ray Corrigan, Bud Jamison, John Tyrrell', 'NR', 'The Stooges are carpenters who become policemen. A mysterious burglar disguised as a gorilla has the cops baffled and Mr. Dill, the head of the citizens league, threatening the police chief''s job. The boys go on the case and pose as night watchmen at an antiques store. They confront the crook, who turns out to be a real gorilla owned by Dill. After defeating Dill and some other bad guys in a wild fight, the gorilla drinks some nitroglycerin and blows up.', 'The Stooges are carpenters who become policemen. A mysterious burglar disguised as a gorilla has the cops baffled and Mr. Dill, the head of the citizens league, threatening the police chief''s job. The boys go on the case and pose as night watchmen at an antiques store. They confront the crook, who turns out to be a real gorilla owned by Dill. After defeating Dill and some other bad guys in a wild fight, the gorilla drinks some nitroglycerin and blows up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqKFwbNpR5zgZtCwrpdM3CVYwlx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116072'),
  ('39544677645879771', 'Dizzy Dishes', 1930, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer, Grim Natwick', null, 'William ''Billy'' Costello, William ''Billy'' Costello, Margie Hines, Billy Murray', null, 'The Fleischer''s Talkartoon short that debuted Betty Boop.', 'The Fleischer''s Talkartoon short that debuted Betty Boop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9UY6Zo5ZffCNK2LqO0p9OUl9vD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166556'),
  ('816754778646240297', 'Dizzy Doctors', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Albert Ray', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Bobby Burns, Bud Jamison, Vernon Dent, Charles Dorety, William Irving', 'NR', 'The Stooges get jobs selling "Brighto", what they think is cleaning fluid. After ruining a cop''s uniform and a new car, they discover Brighto is actually medicine. Taking their sales pitch to a hospital, they get into more trouble and must leave on the run when the head of the hospital turns out to be the owner of the car they ruined.', 'The Stooges get jobs selling "Brighto", what they think is cleaning fluid. After ruining a cop''s uniform and a new car, they discover Brighto is actually medicine. Taking their sales pitch to a hospital, they get into more trouble and must leave on the run when the head of the hospital turns out to be the owner of the car they ruined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3y7mSaFNkWr4aICL5I8NSnY9laT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115813'),
  ('354913201951445929', 'Dizzy Red Riding-Hood', 1931, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Ann Little, Billy Murray', null, 'Betty Boop goes to Grandma''s through the woods despite wolf warnings; but Bimbo follows and gives the old story a new twist.', 'Betty Boop goes to Grandma''s through the woods despite wolf warnings; but Bimbo follows and gives the old story a new twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOM3ULkeYbOxgQZ6bGJFqlvoUS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144808'),
  ('598346149181224020', 'DJ Ahmet', 2025, 'Drama, Music, Comedy', 'Georgi M. Unkovski, Naum Doksevski, Igor Aleksov', 'Georgi M. Unkovski', 'Arif Jakup, Agush Agushev, Dora Akan Zlatanova, Aksel Mehmet, Selpin Kerim, Elhame Bilal, Metin İbrahim, Adem Karaga', 'PG-13', '15-year-old Ahmet, from a remote Yuruk village in North Macedonia, finds refuge in music while navigating his father’s expectations, a conservative community, and his first experience with love — a girl already promised to someone else.', '15-year-old Ahmet, from a remote Yuruk village in North Macedonia, finds refuge in music while navigating his father’s expectations, a conservative community, and his first experience with love — a girl already promised to someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qQq52OGWBLG8RUqcrphzI6DZKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400743'),
  ('66181145440894763', 'DJ Cinderella', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Anita Barbosa, Marco Antonio de Carvalho, Paula Horta', 'Bruno Garotti, Flávia Lins e Silva, Marcelo Saback', 'Maisa Silva, Filipe Bragança, Fernanda Paes Leme, Letícia Pedro, Kiria Malheiros, Elisa Pinheiro, Marcelo Valle, Miriam Freeland', 'PG', 'Cintia is modern princess, she''s connected, decided and loves music. This "pop" princess used to live with their parents in a huge castle with a nice view to the city. Every night she looked through the window and watch the view dreaming with a prince she didn''t met yet. But one day her castle crumbles with everything around her, after her parents divorce she went to live with her aunt and stops believing in love. What she didn''t knew was that there was a charming prince in her history, that wanted to break the ice around our modern day cinderella.', 'Cintia is modern princess, she''s connected, decided and loves music. This "pop" princess used to live with their parents in a huge castle with a nice view to the city. Every night she looked through the window and watch the view dreaming with a prince she didn''t met yet. But one day her castle crumbles with everything around her, after her parents divorce she went to live with her aunt and stops believing in love. What she didn''t knew was that there was a charming prince in her history, that wanted to break the ice around our modern day cinderella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhEMGSlmtfvUYdGuE3M1dB0SmOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553608'),
  ('2537828881891639', 'DJ: Duvvada Jagannadham', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Harish Shankar, Ayananka Bose', 'Satish Vegesna, Ramesh Reddy', 'Allu Arjun, Pooja Hegde, Rao Ramesh, Murali Sharma, Tanikella Bharani, Vennela Kishore, Subbaraju, Chandramohan', null, 'A righteous young man who helps everyone gain their rightful justice, gets recruited as an undercover agent to work on a high profile case that involves a crime lord working for a corrupt minister who also happens to be the father of his romantic interest.', 'A righteous young man who helps everyone gain their rightful justice, gets recruited as an undercover agent to work on a high profile case that involves a crime lord working for a corrupt minister who also happens to be the father of his romantic interest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okq2Q1f2alXGWQMLsCi4wXoAXt4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443635'),
  ('829065770267033705', 'Django', 1966, 'Action, Western', 'Sergio Corbucci, Enzo Barboni, Ruggero Deodato', 'Franco Rossetti, José Gutiérrez Maesso, Piero Vivarelli', 'Franco Nero, José Bódalo, Loredana Nusciak, Ángel Álvarez, Gino Pernice, Simón Arriaga, Giovanni Ivan Scratuglia, Remo De Angelis', 'R', 'A coffin-dragging gunslinger and a prostitute become embroiled in a bitter feud between a merciless masked clan and a band of Mexican revolutionaries.', 'A coffin-dragging gunslinger and a prostitute become embroiled in a bitter feud between a merciless masked clan and a band of Mexican revolutionaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vs4vieNstSEfbgLFEelXXOPvr6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10772'),
  ('479939353097623271', 'Django', 2017, 'Drama, History, Music', 'Étienne Comar, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Alexis Salatko, Étienne Comar', 'Reda Kateb, Cécile de France, Bea Palya, Bimbam Merstein, Gabriel Mireté, Johnny Montreuil, Vincent Frade, Raphaël Dever', null, 'The story of Django Reinhardt, famous guitarist and composer, and his flight from German-occupied Paris in 1943.', 'The story of Django Reinhardt, famous guitarist and composer, and his flight from German-occupied Paris in 1943.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snZ8Blip3oKY5V19tWded4eoYA0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436334'),
  ('749709620146827571', 'Django & Django: Sergio Corbucci Unchained', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'Luca Rea, Andrea Arnone, Hilton Goring', 'Luca Rea, Steve Della Casa', 'Quentin Tarantino, Franco Nero, Ruggero Deodato, Adolf Hitler, Benito Mussolini, Sergio Corbucci, Clint Eastwood, Sergio Leone', null, 'A tribute to Italian filmmaker Sergio Corbucci (1926-90), presented by American filmmaker Quentin Tarantino.', 'A tribute to Italian filmmaker Sergio Corbucci (1926-90), presented by American filmmaker Quentin Tarantino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5C8S5dEfwh3SDddtqwXanRojQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854521'),
  ('617947317680026194', 'Django and Sartana Are Coming... It''s the End', 1970, 'Western', 'Demofilo Fidani, Diego Spataro, Raimondo Toscano', 'Mila Vitelli Valenza, Demofilo Fidani', 'Jack Betts, Franco Borelli, Gordon Mitchell, Simonetta Vitelli, Krista Nell, Celso Faria, Attilio Dottesio, Benito Pacifico', null, 'A gang of vicious outlaws lead by the crazed Black Burt Keller abduct Jessica Colby and decide to flee to Mexico. Shrewd bounty hunter Django and saintly roving gunslinger Sartana join forces to rescue the poor lass from the gang''s vile clutches.', 'A gang of vicious outlaws lead by the crazed Black Burt Keller abduct Jessica Colby and decide to flee to Mexico. Shrewd bounty hunter Django and saintly roving gunslinger Sartana join forces to rescue the poor lass from the gang''s vile clutches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aOTRKiwMPVB7pUxz72hS9urfNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146079'),
  ('845542825101962123', 'Django Challenges Sartana', 1970, 'Western', 'Pasquale Squitieri, Eugenio Bentivoglio', 'Pasquale Squitieri', 'Tony Kendall, George Ardisson, José Torres, Bernard Farber, Adler Gray, Salvatore Billa, Fulvio Mingozzi, Augusto Pescarini', null, 'Django comes to town to discover that his brother Steve, accused of robbing a bank, has been lynched. Django believes the real culprit is Sartana and challenges him to a duel. Just in time he discovers that the author of the crime is an important local figure and Django and Sartana join forces to punish him.', 'Django comes to town to discover that his brother Steve, accused of robbing a bank, has been lynched. Django believes the real culprit is Sartana and challenges him to a duel. Just in time he discovers that the author of the crime is an important local figure and Django and Sartana join forces to punish him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q14ITqDFLD3zPINTayrLgHZjPWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148285'),
  ('599185824652737410', 'Django Kill... If You Live, Shoot!', 1967, 'Western, Action, Horror', 'Giulio Questi, Gianni Amelio, José Luis Monter', 'Franco Arcalli, Giulio Questi, Benedetto Benedetti', 'Tomas Milian, Marilù Tolo, Piero Lulli, Milo Quesada, Francisco Sanz, Miguel Serrano, Ángel Silva, Sancho Gracia', null, 'A Mexican outlaw known as "The Stranger" is part of a band of thieves that steal a cargo of gold from a stagecoach. However, the Americans in the band betray him, and shoot all the Mexicans. The Stranger is not completely dead though, and crawls his way out of his shallow grave, continuing his pursuit of the gold, and exacting a bloody vengeance.', 'A Mexican outlaw known as "The Stranger" is part of a band of thieves that steal a cargo of gold from a stagecoach. However, the Americans in the band betray him, and shoot all the Mexicans. The Stranger is not completely dead though, and crawls his way out of his shallow grave, continuing his pursuit of the gold, and exacting a bloody vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aFamqGpI5T7sl9pVKBf7pipeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61943'),
  ('472542225166456088', 'Django Shoots First', 1966, 'Western', 'Alberto De Martino, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Alberto De Martino, Massimiliano Capriccioli, Sandro Continenza', 'Glenn Saxson, Ida Galli, Fernando Sancho, Nando Gazzolo, Guido Lollobrigida, Erika Blanc, Marcello Tusco, Antonio Piretti', null, 'Django''s father is framed by his business partner Clusker and shot by a bounty Killer. Django inherits his fathers part of the business and a score to settle with Clusker.', 'Django''s father is framed by his business partner Clusker and shot by a bounty Killer. Django inherits his fathers part of the business and a score to settle with Clusker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNq6kcJ5bU9W3NLjjDjiHyN2UTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112503'),
  ('935784058031484784', 'Django Strikes Again', 1987, 'Western, Action', 'Nello Rossati, Sandro Mancori', 'Franco Reggiani, Nello Rossati', 'Franco Nero, Christopher Connelly, Licinia Lentini, William Berger, Roberto Posse, Donald Pleasence, Alessandro Di Chio, Rodrigo Obregón', 'NR', 'Former gunfighter Django has become a monk and abandoned his violent former ways. His daughter is kidnapped by rogue Hungarian soldiers using slave labor to run a silver mine. Django casts off his habit and digs up his machine gun to practice a little liberation theology.', 'Former gunfighter Django has become a monk and abandoned his violent former ways. His daughter is kidnapped by rogue Hungarian soldiers using slave labor to run a silver mine. Django casts off his habit and digs up his machine gun to practice a little liberation theology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rkSeuO2cGcT3CQ47ZxLRHMcGZ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77079'),
  ('295098773253436266', 'Django the Bastard', 1969, 'Western, Horror', 'Sergio Garrone, Roberto Bessi', 'Sergio Garrone, Anthony Steffen', 'Anthony Steffen, Paolo Gozlino, Luciano Rossi, Teodoro Corrà, Jean Louis, Carlo Gaddi, Victoriano Gazzarra, Thomas Rudy', 'R', 'A Confederate soldier returns from the dead to take revenge on three officers who betrayed his unit in battle.', 'A Confederate soldier returns from the dead to take revenge on three officers who betrayed his unit in battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtzylsOLaSkMGZDBiFb5PGbrT9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92312'),
  ('336830822305391950', 'Django Unchained', 2012, 'Drama, Western', 'Robert Richardson, Greg Hale, Lauren Abiouness', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Jamie Foxx, Christoph Waltz, Leonardo DiCaprio, Kerry Washington, Samuel L. Jackson, Walton Goggins, Dennis Christopher, James Remar', 'R', 'With the help of a German bounty hunter, a freed slave sets out to rescue his wife from a brutal Mississippi plantation owner.', 'With the help of a German bounty hunter, a freed slave sets out to rescue his wife from a brutal Mississippi plantation owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oWY8VDWW7thTzWh3OKYRkWUlD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68718'),
  ('310545294100378741', 'Django Undisputed', 2024, 'Western', 'Alessandra Carlesi, Claudio Del Falco, Matteo De Angelis', 'Claudio Del Falco', 'Claudio Del Falco, Tomas Arana, Michael Segal, Ottaviano Dell''Acqua, Clara Guggiari, Anna Rita Del Piano, Massimiliano Buzzanca, Mauro Aversano', null, 'Determined to exact his justice, Django faces dangerous challenges and bloody clashes to restore order in a territory dominated by lawlessness and injustice.', 'Determined to exact his justice, Django faces dangerous challenges and bloody clashes to restore order in a territory dominated by lawlessness and injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/porcUhC4jqFt72TaxbjOQo2lTzL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1357886'),
  ('1030474407365745227', 'Django, Prepare a Coffin', 1968, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Enzo Barboni', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Franco Rossetti', 'Terence Hill, Horst Frank, George Eastman, Barbara Simon, Pinuccio Ardia, Guido Lollobrigida, Gianni Brezza, Giovanni Ivan Scratuglia', null, 'A mysterious gunfighter named Django is employed by a local crooked political boss as a hangman to execute innocent locals framed by the boss, who wants their land. What the boss doesn''t know is that Django isn''t hanging the men at all, just making it look like he is, and using the men he saves from the gallows to build up his own "gang" in order to take revenge on the boss, who, with Django''s former best friend, caused the death of his wife years before.', 'A mysterious gunfighter named Django is employed by a local crooked political boss as a hangman to execute innocent locals framed by the boss, who wants their land. What the boss doesn''t know is that Django isn''t hanging the men at all, just making it look like he is, and using the men he saves from the gallows to build up his own "gang" in order to take revenge on the boss, who, with Django''s former best friend, caused the death of his wife years before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJxVk479TiLTBvLXhMWWPcaNkRa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46443'),
