  ('594261079738833831', 'Django: La otra cara', 2002, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Ricardo Velásquez', 'Gastón Vizcarra', 'Giovanni Ciccia, Melania Urbina, Sergio Galliani, Tatiana Astengo, Darío Abad, Miguel Iza, Gustavo Bueno', null, 'Based on true events, this crime drama chronicles the wanderings of the thief Orlando González -alias Django- during his brief years of glory. After spending a time in the province, Django returns to Lima with his family, trying to escape the criminal circuit. But the appearance of the woman of a dead partner will unleash Django''s ambition, and his libido.', 'Based on true events, this crime drama chronicles the wanderings of the thief Orlando González -alias Django- during his brief years of glory. After spending a time in the province, Django returns to Lima with his family, trying to escape the criminal circuit. But the appearance of the woman of a dead partner will unleash Django''s ambition, and his libido.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcuHdnVtAOsbvE93bN9MhiBVF0J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336876'),
  ('314569971493863513', 'Django: Sangre de mi sangre', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Aldo Salvini', null, 'Giovanni Ciccia, Melania Urbina, Tatiana Astengo, Aldo Miyashiro, Brando Gallesi, Emilram Cossío, Sergio Galliani, Stephanie Orúe', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNBMtAKgYsqHAA5GfyKyMerG9au.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499077'),
  ('966970445557070770', 'Djinn', 2013, 'Horror', 'Tobe Hooper, Joel Ransom, Lauro David Chartrand-DelValle', 'David Tully', 'Khalid Laith, Aiysha Hart, Razane Jammal, May Calamawy, Carol Abboud, Paul Luebke, Abdullah Al Junaibi, Soumaya Akaaboune', null, 'Desperate to put the traumatic loss of their infant child behind them, newlywed couple Khalid and Salama return to their home in the United Arab Emirates. Unknown to the couple, their new luxury apartment block, Al Hamra, was built on the site of an old abandoned fishing village of the same name. Legend has it the village was abandoned after malevolent beings haunted its inhabitants. Unsettled by her new surroundings and the eerie hallways of Al Hamra, Khalid worries his wife is failing to battle her personal demons – but could it be something far more sinister?', 'Desperate to put the traumatic loss of their infant child behind them, newlywed couple Khalid and Salama return to their home in the United Arab Emirates. Unknown to the couple, their new luxury apartment block, Al Hamra, was built on the site of an old abandoned fishing village of the same name. Legend has it the village was abandoned after malevolent beings haunted its inhabitants. Unsettled by her new surroundings and the eerie hallways of Al Hamra, Khalid worries his wife is failing to battle her personal demons – but could it be something far more sinister?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woW3UhIRYb6xJjv0sbS2dKtDo8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229138'),
  ('407218156670670302', 'Djon Africa', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'João Miller Guerra, Filipa Reis, Vasco Viana', 'Pedro Pinho, João Miller Guerra', 'Isabel Cardoso, Bitori Nha Bibinha, Patrícia Soso', null, 'Miguel —alias Tibars, alias “Djon África,” born and raised in Portugal— is a kindhearted Rastafarian who loves women and lives a carefree life. Until one day a stranger tells him he''s the spitting image of his father, “a player and a crook.” His father, whom he never even knew! This intriguing discovery makes him change tack. Particularly when his grandmother, who always took care of him, finally tells him how his father was in prison; how sad Miguel was as a toddler when he couldn''t see him; how his father was banished to Cape Verde. Miguel goes there to visit him. Who is this man?', 'Miguel —alias Tibars, alias “Djon África,” born and raised in Portugal— is a kindhearted Rastafarian who loves women and lives a carefree life. Until one day a stranger tells him he''s the spitting image of his father, “a player and a crook.” His father, whom he never even knew! This intriguing discovery makes him change tack. Particularly when his grandmother, who always took care of him, finally tells him how his father was in prison; how sad Miguel was as a toddler when he couldn''t see him; how his father was banished to Cape Verde. Miguel goes there to visit him. Who is this man?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwMInfMPc4OE2FMpmAZEXUNYOnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497557'),
  ('340242915966404101', 'DMT: The Spirit Molecule', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Mitch Schultz, Matt Ehling, Bryan Ferguson', 'Rick Strassman, Mitch Schultz', 'Joe Rogan, Ralph Abraham, Joel Bakst, Steven Barker, Cynthia Geist, Susan Blumenthal, Patricio Dominguez, Neal Goldsmith', 'NR', 'THE SPIRIT MOLECULE weaves an account of Dr. Rick Strassman''s groundbreaking DMT research through a multifaceted approach to this intriguing hallucinogen found in the human brain and hundreds of plants, including the sacred Amazonian brew, ayahuasca. Utilizing interviews with a variety of experts to explain their thoughts and experiences with DMT, and ayahuasca, within their respective fields, and discussions with Strassman’s research volunteers, brings to life the awesome effects of this compound, and introduces us to far-reaching theories regarding its role in human consciousness.', 'THE SPIRIT MOLECULE weaves an account of Dr. Rick Strassman''s groundbreaking DMT research through a multifaceted approach to this intriguing hallucinogen found in the human brain and hundreds of plants, including the sacred Amazonian brew, ayahuasca. Utilizing interviews with a variety of experts to explain their thoughts and experiences with DMT, and ayahuasca, within their respective fields, and discussions with Strassman’s research volunteers, brings to life the awesome effects of this compound, and introduces us to far-reaching theories regarding its role in human consciousness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OwP5TRrnYSPPWDHzIuNFM5sH7B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53778'),
  ('771217747323099200', 'DNA', 1997, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction, Action', 'William Mesa, Gerry Lively', 'Nick Davis', 'Mark Dacascos, Jürgen Prochnow, Robin McKee, Tom Taus, Roger Aaron Brown, John H. Brennan, Mark McCracken, Joel Torre', null, 'A mad scientist''s DNA experiment on the bones of a mysterious jungle creature brings the carnivorous beast to life, and only his former assistant Ash Mattley and CIA operative Claire Sommers can stop it.', 'A mad scientist''s DNA experiment on the bones of a mysterious jungle creature brings the carnivorous beast to life, and only his former assistant Ash Mattley and CIA operative Claire Sommers can stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfjUQech7UoIbJnYo1HdGL0Cvv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76403'),
  ('763604463530311354', 'DNA', 2020, 'Drama', 'Maïwenn, Sylvestre Dedise, Hugo Le Gourrierec', 'Maïwenn', 'Fanny Ardant, Louis Garrel, Dylan Robert, Marine Vacth, Caroline Chaniolleau, Alain Françon, Florent Lacger, Henri-Noël Tabary', null, 'A woman has a close bond with her beloved Algeriann grandfather, who protected her from a toxic home life as a child; his death triggers a deep identity crisis as tensions between her extended family members escalate, revealing new depths of resentment and bitterness.', 'A woman has a close bond with her beloved Algeriann grandfather, who protected her from a toxic home life as a child; his death triggers a deep identity crisis as tensions between her extended family members escalate, revealing new depths of resentment and bitterness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBuEbgoED3rko7EfgO29a4OqFK9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664177'),
  ('733842558908464662', 'DNA - Definitely Not Suitable', 2020, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Claudio Gregori, Lillo Petrolo, Marco Pieroni', 'Claudio Gregori, Lillo Petrolo', 'Claudio Gregori, Lillo Petrolo, Anna Foglietta, Stefano De Sando, Simone Colombari, Alessio Di Domenicantonio, Federico Jahier, Marco Marzocca', null, 'What happens when two very different former elementary school classmates meet again as adults and decide to swap genetic codes to improve their lives? Between clumsy scientific experiments and DNA hacking with disastrous effects, the two will prove to be decidedly unsuited to these new lives...', 'What happens when two very different former elementary school classmates meet again as adults and decide to swap genetic codes to improve their lives? Between clumsy scientific experiments and DNA hacking with disastrous effects, the two will prove to be decidedly unsuited to these new lives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUAY8UXY3t0zUG1XuleffwNIdLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640915'),
  ('166688804890059191', 'Do Aur Do Paanch', 1980, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Rakesh Kumar', null, 'Amitabh Bachchan, Shashi Kapoor, Hema Malini, Parveen Babi, Goga Kapoor, Shreeram Lagoo, Kader Khan, Om Prakash', null, 'Two rival burglars end up at the same school with the intent of abducting a rich man''s son for a large ransom.', 'Two rival burglars end up at the same school with the intent of abducting a rich man''s son for a large ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfT13dURNNoz7QiZpPH5WOuJGPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54442'),
  ('992708851889739944', 'Do Deewane Seher Mein', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ravi Udyawar, Kaushal Shah, Abhimanyu Ray', 'Abhiruchi Chand', 'Siddhant Chaturvedi, Mrunal Thakur, Ila Arun, Joy Sengupta, Ayesha Raza Mishra', null, 'Two socially awkward millennials in Mumbai find love while struggling with self-acceptance. As they battle insecurities and societal pressure, their journey takes them from city chaos to mountain serenity.', 'Two socially awkward millennials in Mumbai find love while struggling with self-acceptance. As they battle insecurities and societal pressure, their journey takes them from city chaos to mountain serenity.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FoAy3gPhFqNX5gV9RwaDAem1KQ3x.jpg', 'plex:movie:do-deewane-seher-mein'),
  ('90401117708562506', 'Do Detectives Think?', 1927, 'Comedy', 'Fred Guiol', 'Hal Roach', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, James Finlayson, Viola Richard, Noah Young, Frank Brownlee, Chester A. Bachman, Wilson Benge', 'NR', 'An escaped convict is out to kill the judge who sentenced him. Two inept detectives are hired to guard the judge.', 'An escaped convict is out to kill the judge who sentenced him. Two inept detectives are hired to guard the judge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qoJstOsnMErobe5arDPWM1H2Dm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50868'),
