  ('1007786656202146275', 'Do Fish Do It?', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andreas Höfer, Almut Getto', 'Almut Getto', 'Sophie Rogall, Tino Mewes, Angelika Milster, Ferdinand Dux, Uwe Rohde, Hans Martin Stier, Jürgen Tonkel, Ellen ten Damme', null, '16-year old Jan is absent-mindedly strolling through the streets when he''s run over by roller-skating Nina. As fast as she has stormed into his life, however, she rushes off again. Nina is 15 years old and full of crazy ideas. She lives together with her brother, her father and his new girlfriend. Her mother isn''t in touch much. That''s why there is the unconventional Angel whose own daughter disappeared years ago and who is Nina''s best friend and substitute mother.', '16-year old Jan is absent-mindedly strolling through the streets when he''s run over by roller-skating Nina. As fast as she has stormed into his life, however, she rushes off again. Nina is 15 years old and full of crazy ideas. She lives together with her brother, her father and his new girlfriend. Her mother isn''t in touch much. That''s why there is the unconventional Angel whose own daughter disappeared years ago and who is Nina''s best friend and substitute mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91NK7qR6lOKUcga3kD14EnivFkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12147'),
  ('648736046405590796', 'Do I Sound Gay?', 2015, 'Documentary', 'David Thorpe, Matt Bockelman', 'Maeve O''Boyle, David Thorpe', 'David Sedaris, Dan Savage, Jeff Hiller, Margaret Cho, Susan Sankin, Bob Corff, Tim Gunn, Michael Airington', null, 'What makes a voice “gay”? A breakup with his boyfriend sets journalist David Thorpe on a quest to unravel a linguistic mystery.', 'What makes a voice “gay”? A breakup with his boyfriend sets journalist David Thorpe on a quest to unravel a linguistic mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJuiiHt0d5sicgDBtXwr6kdKErZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288301'),
  ('53888371018592560', 'Do It Like An Hombre', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Nicolás López, Antonio Quercia', 'Nicolás López, Guillermo Amoedo', 'Mauricio Ochmann, Alfonso Dosal, Humberto Busto, Aislinn Derbez, Ignacia Allamand, Ariel Levy, Luis Pablo Román, Elizabeth Guindi', 'R', 'Raúl, Eduardo and Santiago have led a happy and "straight" life since their childhood, until, one day, Santiago confesses to them that he is gay.', 'Raúl, Eduardo and Santiago have led a happy and "straight" life since their childhood, until, one day, Santiago confesses to them that he is gay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4q8htaBtqWT7tvVyBP9UES2fxA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460316'),
  ('1027961640806653492', 'Do it Right', 2017, 'Drama', 'Chad Chenouga, Thomas Bataille', 'Chad Chenouga, Christine Paillard', 'Khaled Alouach, Yolande Moreau, Laurent Xu, Daouda Keita, Aboudou Sacko, Jisca Kalvanda, Myriam Mansouri, Alexia Quesnel', null, 'Nassim, a 16-year-old boy, is placed with a family in the suburbs following the death of his drug addict mother. But he refuses to integrate into the social setting that surrounds him. He invents another life for himself, similar to that of his mates at the big Parisian high school he goes to. There’s no reason for that to change. His two lives, his home life and his school life, must be kept separate at all costs.', 'Nassim, a 16-year-old boy, is placed with a family in the suburbs following the death of his drug addict mother. But he refuses to integrate into the social setting that surrounds him. He invents another life for himself, similar to that of his mates at the big Parisian high school he goes to. There’s no reason for that to change. His two lives, his home life and his school life, must be kept separate at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHAHw1d2baRbqOkEOe3MZEuDpnA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443119'),
  ('785717398052189879', 'Do Knot Disturb', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Dhawan', null, 'Govinda, Sushmita Sen, Lara Dutta, Riteish Deshmukh, Sohail Khan, Ranvir Shorey, Rajpal Yadav, Manoj Pahwa', null, 'A rich businessman wants to hide his extra marital affair with a supermodel. He bribes a waiter into pretending to be the model''s boyfriend. Mistaken identities and misunderstandings follow which are sure to take the viewers on a hilarious ride.', 'A rich businessman wants to hide his extra marital affair with a supermodel. He bribes a waiter into pretending to be the model''s boyfriend. Mistaken identities and misunderstandings follow which are sure to take the viewers on a hilarious ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzj663OM9mE2vG4PlydpCwcE0LU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23275'),
  ('959710005855460945', 'Do Lafzon Ki Kahani', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Action', 'Deepak Tijori', 'Girish Dhamija', 'Kajal Aggarwal, Randeep Hooda, Anil George, Yuri Suri', null, 'Centered on ex-mixed martial arts artist Sooraj and sculptor artist Jenny. Their fate intertwines when their past are revealed in their blooming relationship.', 'Centered on ex-mixed martial arts artist Sooraj and sculptor artist Jenny. Their fate intertwines when their past are revealed in their blooming relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvWHmmWK8ZrGgnyLCBWw4rwnvS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391766'),
  ('1005330912741676044', 'Do Not Commit Adultery', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Secchi, Giulio Petroni', 'Giulio Petroni, Marco Zavattini', 'Simonetta Stefanelli, Dado Crostarosa, Barbara Bouchet, Luciano Salce, Marisa Merlini, Claudio Gora, Gigi Ballista, Franco Balducci', null, 'Pino is a young man who lives in Assisi with his father Damiano, a communist revolutionary, and his partner Nadine. One day Pino sees Maria Teresa studying Latin and starts giving her some lessons. Soon they fall in love.', 'Pino is a young man who lives in Assisi with his father Damiano, a communist revolutionary, and his partner Nadine. One day Pino sees Maria Teresa studying Latin and starts giving her some lessons. Soon they fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fShBnDTDvuvf8oshh5BG7faEzpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292613'),
  ('450871917598439355', 'Do Not Disturb', 1965, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ralph Levy, Leon Shamroy', 'Richard L. Breen, Milt Rosen', 'Doris Day, Rod Taylor, Hermione Baddeley, Sergio Fantoni, Reginald Gardiner, Maura McGiveney, Aram Katcher, Leon Askin', 'NR', 'When American couple Janet and Mike move to England for his business, she soon fears he''s having an affair with his attractive secretary and decides to get back at him by pretending she has been unfaithful.', 'When American couple Janet and Mike move to England for his business, she soon fears he''s having an affair with his attractive secretary and decides to get back at him by pretending she has been unfaithful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWsXxglsq4zSH50RKgfPGCFm5hT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45256'),
  ('811919425424492853', 'Do Not Disturb', 1999, 'Thriller', 'Dick Maas', 'Dick Maas', 'William Hurt, Jennifer Tilly, Denis Leary, Francesca Brown, Michael Chiklis, Corey Johnson, Michael A. Goorjian', null, 'Combining a family vacation with business, Walter Richmond takes his wife and their 10-year-old, mute daughter, Melissa , to the Netherlands -- where Melissa inadvertently witnesses a murder. Unable to tell anyone what she''s seen, the frightened girl vanishes in an attempt to elude the killers. Meanwhile, her parents try desperately to piece together the puzzle leading to Melissa''s disappearance.', 'Combining a family vacation with business, Walter Richmond takes his wife and their 10-year-old, mute daughter, Melissa , to the Netherlands -- where Melissa inadvertently witnesses a murder. Unable to tell anyone what she''s seen, the frightened girl vanishes in an attempt to elude the killers. Meanwhile, her parents try desperately to piece together the puzzle leading to Melissa''s disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q6awQsOv4H3ARmABir08Hmkk9iI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15719'),
  ('394973946089509455', 'Do Not Disturb', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yvan Attal, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Yvan Attal, Olivier Lécot', 'Asia Argento, Yvan Attal, Laetitia Casta, François Cluzet, Charlotte Gainsbourg, JoeyStarr, Samuel Johde', null, 'In this lively French remake of Humpday, best buds reunite and revive their friendship on a questionable dare. Can two straight guys really make a gay sex film, together?', 'In this lively French remake of Humpday, best buds reunite and revive their friendship on a questionable dare. Can two straight guys really make a gay sex film, together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53e5J4nDKZsSAkg2N0caodvcenO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127894'),
  ('431747580144437226', 'Do Not Disturb', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Patrice Leconte, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Florian Zeller', 'Christian Clavier, Carole Bouquet, Valérie Bonneton, Rossy de Palma, Stéphane De Groodt, Sébastien Castro, Arnaud Henriet, Christian Charmetant', null, 'Michel, who''s crazy about jazz, has just found a rare album that he dreams of quietly listening to in his living room. But the world seems to have conspired against him: his wife chooses this moment to divulge an ill-timed revelation, his adult son makes a surprise visit, one of his friends knocks on the door, while his mother keeps calling him on his smartphone. Not to mention that today the residents in his apartment building are holding their annual House Party. Manipulative and a liar, Michel is ready to do anything to have a moment of peace and quiet. Is it still possible, in this day and age, to just have one hour of peace?', 'Michel, who''s crazy about jazz, has just found a rare album that he dreams of quietly listening to in his living room. But the world seems to have conspired against him: his wife chooses this moment to divulge an ill-timed revelation, his adult son makes a surprise visit, one of his friends knocks on the door, while his mother keeps calling him on his smartphone. Not to mention that today the residents in his apartment building are holding their annual House Party. Manipulative and a liar, Michel is ready to do anything to have a moment of peace and quiet. Is it still possible, in this day and age, to just have one hour of peace?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5csriJUa3Evyv8r2IJANnuJlE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298614'),
  ('878160014966262278', 'Do Not Disturb', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz, Ahsen Eroğlu, Celal Kadri Kınoğlu, Özge Özberk, Bülent Şakrak, Nilperi Şahinkaya, Seda Akman, Mustafa Kirantepe', 'R', 'A middle-aged man emerges from a pandemic slump with a new job at a quiet hotel, until some eccentric guests turn his first night into a wild adventure.', 'A middle-aged man emerges from a pandemic slump with a new job at a quiet hotel, until some eccentric guests turn his first night into a wild adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdcXd3zgbtoo2EDn3ymp35gdZoH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:985883'),
  ('617843229256729872', 'Do Not Enter', 2024, 'Horror', 'Hugo Cardozo, Edgar Cardozo, Herbert Insfran', 'Hugo Cardozo', 'Lucas Caballero, Pablo Martínez, Rafael Alfaro, Lara Chamorro, Andy Romero, Mario González Martí, Santi Martínez, Lia Love', null, 'Two working class youtubers ‘in the making’ enter an abandoned mansion to get their basketball back, and get lost inside while pranking each other. They record their ‘quick adventure’ with their phones for their audience, and tweak it with a fake phantom appearance to attract more followers to their YouTube channel. When uploaded the video goes viral, so they start a challenge: if the video reaches a certain number of views, they will enter the house again, at night, alone, totally unprotected. As fans react positively, they will do as promised, not only to discover and unveil the true nature of the place and their inhabitants, but to realize they might not be among the living anymore. Which opens a question - how far would you go to be famous?', 'Two working class youtubers ‘in the making’ enter an abandoned mansion to get their basketball back, and get lost inside while pranking each other. They record their ‘quick adventure’ with their phones for their audience, and tweak it with a fake phantom appearance to attract more followers to their YouTube channel. When uploaded the video goes viral, so they start a challenge: if the video reaches a certain number of views, they will enter the house again, at night, alone, totally unprotected. As fans react positively, they will do as promised, not only to discover and unveil the true nature of the place and their inhabitants, but to realize they might not be among the living anymore. Which opens a question - how far would you go to be famous?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1l6eDcH11b9aRmmd4a9WWwhVJ5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1287717'),
  ('362324667566902602', 'Do Not Enter', 2026, 'Horror', 'Marc Klasfeld, Yon Thomas', 'Stephen Susco, Spencer Mandel, Dikega Hadnot', 'Francesca Reale, Nicholas Hamilton, Adeline Rudolph, Jake Manley, Shane Paul McGhie, Javier Botet, Laurence O''Fuarain, Brennan Keel Cook', 'R', 'A group of young explorers investigates an old abandoned hotel, only to encounter a strange supernatural being and a competing group looking for a legendary hidden treasure.', 'A group of young explorers investigates an old abandoned hotel, only to encounter a strange supernatural being and a competing group looking for a legendary hidden treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stM9N7eJmHKLmFR59JG4tLdN7Wk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999136'),
  ('5871219454937620', 'Do Not Expect Too Much from the End of the World', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marius Panduru, Radu Jude, Adriana Itu', 'Radu Jude', 'Ilinca Manolache, Ovidiu Pîrșan, Nina Hoss, Dorina Lazăr, László Miske, Uwe Boll, Șerban Pavlu, Katia Pascariu', null, 'On behalf of a multinational company, a production assistant drives around the Romanian city of Bucharest, interviewing various citizens who have been injured due to work accidents to cast one of them in a “safety at work” video.', 'On behalf of a multinational company, a production assistant drives around the Romanian city of Bucharest, interviewing various citizens who have been injured due to work accidents to cast one of them in a “safety at work” video.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2H7SMzSO0f8KHjCqavUhVfRX0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937085'),
  ('423426132211670410', 'Do Not Open', 2026, 'Thriller', 'Christopher Leto', 'Patryk Godlewski', 'Shawn Ray, Marisol Ray, Ricky Garcia', null, 'A couple''s quiet cabin retreat spirals into dread when they''re warned never to open a locked door at the end of the hall. Obsession grows, whispers stir at night, and terror seeps through the walls in this chilling slow-burn horror.', 'A couple''s quiet cabin retreat spirals into dread when they''re warned never to open a locked door at the end of the hall. Obsession grows, whispers stir at night, and terror seeps through the walls in this chilling slow-burn horror.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BZWIxNjcxYzktNjg1MS00NzMxLTllMjAtYzQ0MTRhNWRjOGI0XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:do-not-open-2026'),
  ('744289984098165869', 'Do not Panic, Major Kardos', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime', 'István Bujtor, Sándor Szönyi G.', 'István Bujtor', 'István Bujtor, András Kern, László Bánhidy, Gyula Bodrogi', null, 'There are mysterious murders in the area of ​​Lake Balaton. These places are shrouded in secrecy and constantly attract hunters: during the Second World War, the Germans had hidden a huge treasure here. Investigation of the murders entrusted to Major Kardos. He takes up the case, but in search of treasure he had many competitors. Kardos uses help from his loyal friend - a policeman-superman Etvash aka "Droplet".', 'There are mysterious murders in the area of ​​Lake Balaton. These places are shrouded in secrecy and constantly attract hunters: during the Second World War, the Germans had hidden a huge treasure here. Investigation of the murders entrusted to Major Kardos. He takes up the case, but in search of treasure he had many competitors. Kardos uses help from his loyal friend - a policeman-superman Etvash aka "Droplet".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3DH3TwNzCMwvcMijaJIQUxfjsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79241'),
  ('682217268733454144', 'Do Not Reply', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Woltosz, Walter Woltosz, Jan-Michael Losada', 'Daniel Woltosz, Walter Woltosz', 'Jackson Rathbone, Amanda Arcuri, Kerri Medders, Elise Luthman, Ashlee Füss, Ivon Millan, Courtney Henggeler, Nikki Leigh', null, 'Chelsea, a high school introvert, is abducted through a social media app and is forced to look like other girls Brad holds captive. Chelsea desperately attempts to persuade them to escape before they all become victims in his virtual reality filmed murders.', 'Chelsea, a high school introvert, is abducted through a social media app and is forced to look like other girls Brad holds captive. Chelsea desperately attempts to persuade them to escape before they all become victims in his virtual reality filmed murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryHaa5HMMOzcDXM9nExW0puZwGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543412'),
  ('890716112808047347', 'Do Not Split', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Anders Hammer, Anders Hammer', null, null, null, 'The story of the 2019 Hong Kong protests, told through a series of demonstrations by local protestors that escalate into conflict when highly armed police appear on the scene.', 'The story of the 2019 Hong Kong protests, told through a series of demonstrations by local protestors that escalate into conflict when highly armed police appear on the scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPZoRW1mtUa5csfJhKzF1pKjy0R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655154'),
  ('162957053935225035', 'Do or Die', 1991, 'Action, Thriller', 'Andy Sidaris, Mark Morris, Mike Freedman', 'Andy Sidaris', 'Pat Morita, Erik Estrada, Dona Speir, Roberta Vasquez, Bruce Penhall, Cynthia Brimhall, William Bumiller, Michael J. Shane', 'R', 'Asian crime boss Kaneshiro captures two voluptuous undercover federal agents, Donna and Nicole. But instead of liquidating them, he gives the busty duo a head start in a deadly cat-and-mouse game involving six other assassin teams. The heated action takes them from Hawaii to Las Vegas and Louisiana.', 'Asian crime boss Kaneshiro captures two voluptuous undercover federal agents, Donna and Nicole. But instead of liquidating them, he gives the busty duo a head start in a deadly cat-and-mouse game involving six other assassin teams. The heated action takes them from Hawaii to Las Vegas and Louisiana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrAgzeYhng1sQjfjJFJdrcZcFK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35739'),
  ('372413669462081659', 'Do Patti', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Shashanka Chaturvedi, Mart Ratassepp, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Anaya Mazumdar, Mayank Anurag Saxena, Kunal Komal Keswani', 'Kriti Sanon, Kajol, Shaheer Sheikh, Tanvi Azmi, Brijendra Kala, Prachee Shah, Vivek Mushran, Rohit Tiwari', null, 'A puzzling investigation leads a no-nonsense cop down a dark path involving the vicious rivalry between twin sisters and the volatile man they both love.', 'A puzzling investigation leads a no-nonsense cop down a dark path involving the vicious rivalry between twin sisters and the volatile man they both love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbXSE68cDwqUPsHJcpdu7I5kSLK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1148172'),
  ('64586776894186043', 'Do Re Mi', 1966, 'Comedy', 'P. Ramlee', 'P. Ramlee', 'P. Ramlee, A. R. Tompel, Ibrahim Din, Wan Chik Daud, Noran Nordin, Rohaya Rahman, Mahmud Jun, Minah Hashim', null, 'Do, who doesn''t take much consideration about his marriageis circled with so many debts. He lied to his mother in law to get some money. Do and his wife eventually got a divorce and Do moved out to Kuala Lumpur to start a new life. Re on the other hand has a wife who is working at a night club whereas he stays at home and takes care of the house chores. Due to re''s negligent behaviour his wife''s money was stolen and he was told to leave the house bringing him dragging himself to the big city. Mi, a bachelor who is head over heels with the girl who is staying across his house often loans him some money. While Mi was out looking for a job he helped out capturing the theif who snatched a lady''s handbag alongside with Re and Do who was in the area and helped out as well. They became close friends since then.', 'Do, who doesn''t take much consideration about his marriageis circled with so many debts. He lied to his mother in law to get some money. Do and his wife eventually got a divorce and Do moved out to Kuala Lumpur to start a new life. Re on the other hand has a wife who is working at a night club whereas he stays at home and takes care of the house chores. Due to re''s negligent behaviour his wife''s money was stolen and he was told to leave the house bringing him dragging himself to the big city. Mi, a bachelor who is head over heels with the girl who is staying across his house often loans him some money. While Mi was out looking for a job he helped out capturing the theif who snatched a lady''s handbag alongside with Re and Do who was in the area and helped out as well. They became close friends since then.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOotr9acV7niRHaAJXOVsXgWru7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91047'),
  ('875810888391687566', 'Do Re Mi Fa So La Si Do', 2008, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kang Keon-hyang, Kim Il-jun', 'Kang Keon-hyang', 'Jang Keun-suk, Cha Ye-ryun, Lim Ju-hwan, Jung Eui-chul, Park Min-ji, Lee Hyo-choon, Song Yool-Kyu, Kim Hye-ok', null, 'High school student Jung-Won (Cha Ye-Ryeon]) works at an amusement park, dressed up as Dragon cartoon character. Then one day, a guy, standing among his friends, twists her dragon mask around, causing her to fall flat on her back. Shortly afterwards, she spots the guy that caused her to fall down. Jung-won proceeds to pour a drink over his head. A few days later Jung-Won is horsing around with her brother on the top floor of their home. They notice that a new family moved in next door. Jung-Won then gets a sickening feeling when she realizes that the young guy in their family is the same guy that twisted her dragon mask around in the amusement park. His name is Eun-Kyu (Jang Keun-Suk), a popular high school student that fronts the band “Doremifasolasido.”', 'High school student Jung-Won (Cha Ye-Ryeon]) works at an amusement park, dressed up as Dragon cartoon character. Then one day, a guy, standing among his friends, twists her dragon mask around, causing her to fall flat on her back. Shortly afterwards, she spots the guy that caused her to fall down. Jung-won proceeds to pour a drink over his head. A few days later Jung-Won is horsing around with her brother on the top floor of their home. They notice that a new family moved in next door. Jung-Won then gets a sickening feeling when she realizes that the young guy in their family is the same guy that twisted her dragon mask around in the amusement park. His name is Eun-Kyu (Jang Keun-Suk), a popular high school student that fronts the band “Doremifasolasido.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bd6Cxzay5fBJbNSX7p39ZP4HbiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115963'),
  ('624681605082560391', 'Do Revenge', 2022, 'Comedy, Thriller, Romance', 'Brian Burgoyne, Cam Everson, Riley Flanagan', 'Celeste Ballard, Jennifer Kaytin Robinson', 'Camila Mendes, Maya Hawke, Austin Abrams, Rish Shah, Sarah Michelle Gellar, Talia Ryder, Alisha Boe, Ava Capri', 'NR', 'A dethroned queen bee at a posh private high school strikes a secret deal with an unassuming new student to enact revenge on one another’s enemies.', 'A dethroned queen bee at a posh private high school strikes a secret deal with an unassuming new student to enact revenge on one another’s enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akIjKJDHcVN4bzifcEarKVPNpoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762968'),
  ('783146380311125970', 'Do Unto Others', 2023, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Tetsu Maeda, Yosuke Toki, Yoko Itakura', 'Yukari Tatsui, Tetsu Maeda', 'Kenichi Matsuyama, Masami Nagasawa, Ouji Suzuka, Maki Sakai, Naho Toda, Rie Minemura, Natsu Kato, Yasuhide Aiki', null, 'A community is shocked when the bodies of an elderly man and the manager of a home-visit nursing centre are found. The passing of 42 elderly patients is connected to Shiba, a caretaker recognised for his affection and dedication.', 'A community is shocked when the bodies of an elderly man and the manager of a home-visit nursing centre are found. The passing of 42 elderly patients is connected to Shiba, a caretaker recognised for his affection and dedication.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMDw7n17XsbYl1GNowzDgiN4KtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1044171'),
  ('132317498472114020', 'Do You Believe in Angels?', 1961, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lars-Magnus Lindgren, Rune Ericson', 'Lars-Magnus Lindgren, John Einar Åberg', 'Jarl Kulle, Christina Schollin, Edvin Adolphson, Isa Quensel, Sigge Fürst, Gunnar Sjöberg, George Fant, Margit Carlqvist', null, 'Jan Froman is a young man with great plans for the future. He gets a job as an assistant janitor at a bank, but with inherited money he starts to buy and sell real estate which eventually increases in value. He falls in love with Margareta, whose father is a naval officer. Margareta is slighted by her fiance and follows Froman on a sailing trip in the archipelago. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'Jan Froman is a young man with great plans for the future. He gets a job as an assistant janitor at a bank, but with inherited money he starts to buy and sell real estate which eventually increases in value. He falls in love with Margareta, whose father is a naval officer. Margareta is slighted by her fiance and follows Froman on a sailing trip in the archipelago. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWt45aqVA0Xk2MWCS9bbxSwOcVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75911'),
  ('131050296018203454', 'Do You Believe?', 2015, 'Drama', 'Jon Gunn, Brian Shanley', 'Cary Solomon, Chuck Konzelman', 'Tracy Melchior, Mira Sorvino, Sean Astin, Alexa PenaVega, Cybill Shepherd, Brian Bosworth, Delroy Lindo, Lee Majors', 'PG-13', 'When a pastor is shaken by the visible faith of a street-corner preacher, he is reminded that true belief always requires action. His response ignites a journey that impacts everyone it touches in ways that only God could orchestrate.', 'When a pastor is shaken by the visible faith of a street-corner preacher, he is reminded that true belief always requires action. His response ignites a journey that impacts everyone it touches in ways that only God could orchestrate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89fJ4hV9fCB01EvhhLOgjMJI4A6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309425'),
  ('738250903572858476', 'Do You Do You Saint-Tropez', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Nicolas Benamou, Philippe Guilbert', 'Nicolas Benamou, Christian Clavier, Jean-François Halin', 'Christian Clavier, Benoît Poelvoorde, Thierry Lhermitte, Jérôme Commandeur, Rossy de Palma, Virginie Hocq, Vincent Desagnat, Gérard Depardieu', null, 'Every summer, the Billionaire Tranchant and his wife Eliane host the glamorous world of celebrities in their luxurious mansion in the south of France. When a criminal car sabotage related to threatening letters wreak havoc in the villa, Tranchant goes in search of the best agent for the investigation. In the middle of this hot summer, only the arrogant and incompetent agent Boullin is available... To catch the suspect and solve the mystery, he will have no choice but to impersonate a newly hired butler and will turn everyone’s vacation into a hilarious game of ‘Cluedo’!', 'Every summer, the Billionaire Tranchant and his wife Eliane host the glamorous world of celebrities in their luxurious mansion in the south of France. When a criminal car sabotage related to threatening letters wreak havoc in the villa, Tranchant goes in search of the best agent for the investigation. In the middle of this hot summer, only the arrogant and incompetent agent Boullin is available... To catch the suspect and solve the mystery, he will have no choice but to impersonate a newly hired butler and will turn everyone’s vacation into a hilarious game of ‘Cluedo’!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWpIB5MWhH3vDmNUOC1PuE0ejt1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611408'),
  ('560598408270833728', 'Do You Even Know Who I Am?', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Henry Albadán, Eduardo Ayllon, Andrés Felipe Orjuela', 'Ricardo Quevedo, Fernando Ayllón', 'Ricardo Quevedo, Freddy Beltrán, Abril Schreiber, Iván Marín, Aída Morales, Fabio Restrepo, Natalia Durán, Jéssica Sanjuan', null, 'An amateur comedian who tries to make a name for himself doing Stand Up Comedy in several bars in Bogota, with no money and still living with his parents, pretends to be someone with money to meet his better half, without knowing that she also hides some secrets.', 'An amateur comedian who tries to make a name for himself doing Stand Up Comedy in several bars in Bogota, with no money and still living with his parents, pretends to be someone with money to meet his better half, without knowing that she also hides some secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsOGUoPhkLlDl0eqsCnSiXqjNO0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379344'),
  ('526354347656147000', 'Do You Know Me', 2009, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Penelope Buitenhuis, David Pelletier, Matthew Blecha', 'Susan Lee Hoffman, Oliver Butcher', 'Rachelle Lefevre, Jeremy London, Ted Whittall, Lynda Boyd, Victoria Duffield, Adrien Dorval, Dean Wray, Nic Rhind', null, 'Ellie Carter is recently graduated and has it all. While celebrating with friend and boyfriend, she comes across a milk carton with a picture of a missing child that looks a lot like her. As a prank, they call the toll free number and she realizes that this person could be her. The more she finds out, the closer she gets to getting herself and beloved ones killed.', 'Ellie Carter is recently graduated and has it all. While celebrating with friend and boyfriend, she comes across a milk carton with a picture of a missing child that looks a lot like her. As a prank, they call the toll free number and she realizes that this person could be her. The more she finds out, the closer she gets to getting herself and beloved ones killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uY2yDcBvTl86RJ6Qg3sBsrYBMBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115724'),
  ('775950314908725482', 'Do you know the latest on the crazy ones?', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Pier Luigi Santi, Mauro Cappelloni, Mariano Laurenti', 'Gino Capone', 'Anna Maria Rizzoli, Enzo Cannavale, Bombolo, Giorgio Porcaro, Sandro Ghiani, Tuccio Musumeci, Roberto Caporali, Gegia', null, 'Jokes, rough jokes and spicy adventures set in a psychiatric clinic, naturally managed by an experienced doctor.', 'Jokes, rough jokes and spicy adventures set in a psychiatric clinic, naturally managed by an experienced doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9nUoRTFjqbLQSku5N30kARWe5W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291256'),
  ('261452177258427278', 'Do You Know the Muffin Man?', 1989, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gilbert Cates, Mark Irwin, Chitra F. Mojtabai', 'Daniel Freudenberger', 'Pam Dawber, John Shea, Stephen Dorff, Brian Bonsall, Matthew Laurance, Anthony Geary, Georgann Johnson, Bruce Fairbairn', 'NR', 'Roger Dollison, a police officer, and his wife, Kendra, are living the American dream. They have two children, Teddy and Sandy, a lovely home, and a dog named Rex. What they know and how they live as a family is irreparably changed one day when it is discovered that a classmate of Teddy''s is the apparent victim of sexual abuse and molestation at the respected neighborhood daycare center. Like all other parents, the Dollisons are tormented — "we should have known, we should have seen" — but their devastation is complete when Teddy tells his own story, one he promised his abusers he would never tell.', 'Roger Dollison, a police officer, and his wife, Kendra, are living the American dream. They have two children, Teddy and Sandy, a lovely home, and a dog named Rex. What they know and how they live as a family is irreparably changed one day when it is discovered that a classmate of Teddy''s is the apparent victim of sexual abuse and molestation at the respected neighborhood daycare center. Like all other parents, the Dollisons are tormented — "we should have known, we should have seen" — but their devastation is complete when Teddy tells his own story, one he promised his abusers he would never tell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxpfh5FSF2TdxEOKhOwdvAf2QzO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357121'),
  ('48123033768644831', 'Do You Like Big Girls?', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Takafumi Ohashi', null, 'Sena Natsuki, Rena Takei, Ken Aoyama', null, 'Tachibana Shouta is a freeter with no obvious goal or dreams in life. One day, he is dragged out by her older sister Kaoru to manage her University''s woman volleyball club, which was on the verge of abolition. Among all these big girls is also Shouta''s first love, Ayano Hasegawa. As all the girls in the volleyball team approach Shouta, Kaoru starts to realize her forbidden love for her younger brother. But, amidst all of this, Shouta aims to bring the volleyball club together and win the prefectural tournament.', 'Tachibana Shouta is a freeter with no obvious goal or dreams in life. One day, he is dragged out by her older sister Kaoru to manage her University''s woman volleyball club, which was on the verge of abolition. Among all these big girls is also Shouta''s first love, Ayano Hasegawa. As all the girls in the volleyball team approach Shouta, Kaoru starts to realize her forbidden love for her younger brother. But, amidst all of this, Shouta aims to bring the volleyball club together and win the prefectural tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRs1Z2oxQTJGP6L5HmCQTgta1oe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846195'),
  ('8524357488693770', 'Do You Like Hitchcock?', 2005, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Dario Argento, Frederic Fasano', 'Franco Ferrini, Dario Argento', 'Elio Germano, Chiara Conti, Elisabetta Rocchetti, Cristina Brondo, Iván Morales, Edoardo Stoppa, Elena Maria Bellini, Horacio José Grigaitis', null, 'A nerdy film student and lifelong voyeur begins to believe that two lovely young strangers may have conspired to commit a brutal murder.', 'A nerdy film student and lifelong voyeur begins to believe that two lovely young strangers may have conspired to commit a brutal murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xs1dkhYaB3Xz5Ei3x1yQX5zDfSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14229'),
  ('117300168339698240', 'Do You Like Me?', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Edgardo González Amer, Sebastián Gallo', 'Edgardo González Amer', 'Martina Krasinsky, Leticia Brédice, Daniel Aráoz, Marco Antonio Caponi, Daniel Loisi, Sebastián Chávez, Jonathan Toledo, Simon Benega', null, 'Nati (17) lives with her parents and her brother Seba in a marginal neighborhood. Nati and Seba do the deliveries for their mother’s canteen and spend time with a group of friends who make a living committing minor crimes. When Nati discovers that her parents have a debt they cannot pay, she tries to join the gang to get the money. During the robbery to a restaurant, Nati disobeys the gang leader and puts the plan in danger. With the collaboration of his men, the chief rapes Nati as punishment for her ‘rebellious’ attitude. Seba manages to find her, but Nati is furious and –in revenge– she decides to kill them one by one.', 'Nati (17) lives with her parents and her brother Seba in a marginal neighborhood. Nati and Seba do the deliveries for their mother’s canteen and spend time with a group of friends who make a living committing minor crimes. When Nati discovers that her parents have a debt they cannot pay, she tries to join the gang to get the money. During the robbery to a restaurant, Nati disobeys the gang leader and puts the plan in danger. With the collaboration of his men, the chief rapes Nati as punishment for her ‘rebellious’ attitude. Seba manages to find her, but Nati is furious and –in revenge– she decides to kill them one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acxGPOsAyeUVZgVokS2KUzW9CKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640813'),
  ('349310365076106399', 'Do You Remember Dolly Bell?', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Emir Kusturica, Vilko Filač', 'Emir Kusturica, Abdulah Sidran', 'Slavko Štimac, Slobodan Aligrudić, Ljiljana Blagojević, Mira Banjac, Pavle Vuisić, Nada Pani, Boro Stjepanović, Živko ''Žika'' Ristić', null, 'Growing up in 1960s Sarajevo, a young man comes of age under the shadow of his good, but ailing father, but is attracted by the world of small-time criminals. He''s hired to hide a young prostitute, whom he falls in love with.', 'Growing up in 1960s Sarajevo, a young man comes of age under the shadow of his good, but ailing father, but is attracted by the world of small-time criminals. He''s hired to hide a young prostitute, whom he falls in love with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkH1PigvNINeYQxi07RsdzSuTDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49934'),
  ('26675877641988543', 'Do You See Me?', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Capone, Francesca Gasperini, Armando De Vincentis', 'Giulia Calenda, Paola Cortellesi, Riccardo Milani', 'Paola Cortellesi, Raoul Bova, Corrado Fortuna, Lunetta Savino, Marco Bocci, Ennio Fantastichini, Cesare Bocci, Stefania Rocca', null, 'Serena Bruno is an architect who studied and got several masters in different countries of the world but she decides to go back to Italy so she can live and work there. She will soon find out that her native country is not as open minded and she will struggle to find a job that she truly loves and is passionate about. Along the way she will meet Francesco a gay man who will help and support her throughout her journey.', 'Serena Bruno is an architect who studied and got several masters in different countries of the world but she decides to go back to Italy so she can live and work there. She will soon find out that her native country is not as open minded and she will struggle to find a job that she truly loves and is passionate about. Along the way she will meet Francesco a gay man who will help and support her throughout her journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vCcy7EGI4xnVXsY51y9tIRsEWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298729'),
  ('12818508412584055', 'Do You See What I See', 2024, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Sanjay Mulani, Widhi Wicaksono, Arfian', 'Lele Laila', 'Diandra Agatha, Shenina Cinnamon, Yesaya Abraham, Sonia Alyssa, Jessica Shaina, Nyimas Ratu Rafa, Sarah Felicia, Irgi Fahrezi', null, 'After Mawar falls for her very first boyfriend, her friends'' joy turns into suspicion as they realize he may not be who he seems.', 'After Mawar falls for her very first boyfriend, her friends'' joy turns into suspicion as they realize he may not be who he seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctAlfcNNHlHR1Ct70WDrinOCIfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052886'),
  ('312768417976962850', 'Do You Trust this Computer?', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Chris Paine', 'Mark Monroe', 'Elon Musk, Raymond Kurzweil, Jonathan Nolan, James Barrat, David Ferrucci, Christine Fox, Rana El Kaliouby, Sean Gourley', null, 'Science fiction has long anticipated the rise of machine intelligence, and today a new generation of self-learning computers has begun to reshape every aspect of our lives. Will A.I. usher in an age of unprecedented potential, or prove to be our final invention?', 'Science fiction has long anticipated the rise of machine intelligence, and today a new generation of self-learning computers has begun to reshape every aspect of our lives. Will A.I. usher in an age of unprecedented potential, or prove to be our final invention?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWBS27xddEmGfraEykRAVxAWhqZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516503'),
  ('1107786433921981377', 'Do-Re-Me', 1980, null, 'Tommy Leung Ga-Shu, Ivan Lai Kai-Ming', null, 'Roy Chiao', null, 'Hong Kong movie', 'Hong Kong movie', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZQaV1NVxyCdCbBuBQaEcfhS4pL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1176119'),
  ('753309060121239509', 'DOA: Dead or Alive', 2006, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Corey Yuen, Chan Chi-Ying, Deborah Antoniou', 'J.F. Lawton, Adam Gross, Seth Gross', 'Devon Aoki, Jaime Pressly, Matthew Marsden, Holly Valance, Sarah Carter, Natassia Malthe, Kane Kosugi, Collin Chou', 'PG-13', 'Four beautiful rivals at an invitation-only martial-arts tournament join forces against a sinister threat. Princess Kasumi is an aristocratic warrior trained by martial-arts masters. Tina Armstrong is a wrestling superstar. Helena Douglas is an athlete with a tragic past. Christie Allen earns her keep as a thief and an assassin-for-hire.', 'Four beautiful rivals at an invitation-only martial-arts tournament join forces against a sinister threat. Princess Kasumi is an aristocratic warrior trained by martial-arts masters. Tina Armstrong is a wrestling superstar. Helena Douglas is an athlete with a tragic past. Christie Allen earns her keep as a thief and an assassin-for-hire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRcYqTWgbPF3TtpSDfwqRDAJjlv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9053'),
  ('1047402226106226897', 'Dobaaraa', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sakshi Mehta, Shashwat Dwivedi, Sylvester Fonseca', 'Nihit Bhave', 'Taapsee Pannu, Pavail Gulati, Aarrian Sawant, Rahul Bhat, Saswata Chatterjee, Nassar, Vidushi Mehra, Himanshi Choudhry', null, 'In the 1990s, during a wild thunderstorm night, 12-year-old Anay dies in a road accident shortly after he sees his next-door neighbor committing a crime. Twenty-five years later, in a strange turn of events, on an identical stormy night, Antara finds herself in front of a TV set through which she attempts to save Anay’s life but her good deed causes a disturbing chain of unexpected consequences.', 'In the 1990s, during a wild thunderstorm night, 12-year-old Anay dies in a road accident shortly after he sees his next-door neighbor committing a crime. Twenty-five years later, in a strange turn of events, on an identical stormy night, Antara finds herself in front of a TV set through which she attempts to save Anay’s life but her good deed causes a disturbing chain of unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0Ayozn8O69UEjDvXnT5noIgUJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796207'),
  ('997093507506814236', 'Dobbiamo parlare', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Gisella Gobbi, Vincenzo Carpineta, Sergio Rubini', 'Carla Cavalluzzi, Diego De Silva, Sergio Rubini', 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Isabella Ragonese, Maria Pia Calzone, Sergio Rubini, Antonio Albanese', null, 'Vanni and Linda live in a penthouse apartment for rent in the center of Rome. Vanni writes novels, Linda ''cooperates'' to his novels. Between a vernissage and an exhibition of Basquiat, thay hang out Alfredo and Constanza, a couple on the verge of a nervous breakdown. Alfredo is a surgeon with the habit of waking up early and has a lover, Constanza is a dermatologist with the same habits. With the intent to vent their frustrations in their friends'' living room, Alfredo and Constanza take hostage the couple and recriminate loudly about the past and the present. In an impossible attempt to contain them, Vanni and Linda eventually take the field and also thrash each other. Someone will end up getting hurt by the end of the night.', 'Vanni and Linda live in a penthouse apartment for rent in the center of Rome. Vanni writes novels, Linda ''cooperates'' to his novels. Between a vernissage and an exhibition of Basquiat, thay hang out Alfredo and Constanza, a couple on the verge of a nervous breakdown. Alfredo is a surgeon with the habit of waking up early and has a lover, Constanza is a dermatologist with the same habits. With the intent to vent their frustrations in their friends'' living room, Alfredo and Constanza take hostage the couple and recriminate loudly about the past and the present. In an impossible attempt to contain them, Vanni and Linda eventually take the field and also thrash each other. Someone will end up getting hurt by the end of the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dL1BPZM9dtfPwz2xcI7UsCk2hbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369228'),
