  ('485958482097290088', 'Doberman Cop', 1977, 'Crime, Action', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Tôru Nakajima', 'Kōji Takada', 'Sonny Chiba, Janet Hatta, Hiroki Matsukata, Eiko Matsuda, Hideo Murota, Jūkei Fujioka, Tatsuo Endō, Maki Tachibana', null, 'Joji Kano is a loose cannon cop from backwoods Okinawa, sent to Tokyo to investigate the grisly murder of an Okinawa woman. As he probes deeper into the sleazy world of flesh-peddling, talent agency corruption and mob influence, Kano uncovers the shocking truth.', 'Joji Kano is a loose cannon cop from backwoods Okinawa, sent to Tokyo to investigate the grisly murder of an Okinawa woman. As he probes deeper into the sleazy world of flesh-peddling, talent agency corruption and mob influence, Kano uncovers the shocking truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxtz3BwFZEzyUIF9PPkpB4o4pGy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91888'),
  ('162214096365352790', 'Dobermann', 1997, 'Action, Crime', 'Jan Kounen, Michel Amathieu', 'Joël Houssin', 'Vincent Cassel, Tchéky Karyo, Monica Bellucci, Antoine Basler, Affif Ben Badra, Romain Duris, Marc Duret, Pascal Demolon', null, 'The charismatic criminal Dobermann, who got his first gun when he was christened, leads a gang of brutal robbers. After a complex and brutal bank robbery, they are being hunted by the Paris police. The hunt is led by the sadistic cop Christini, who only has one goal: to catch Dobermann at any cost.', 'The charismatic criminal Dobermann, who got his first gun when he was christened, leads a gang of brutal robbers. After a complex and brutal bank robbery, they are being hunted by the Paris police. The hunt is led by the sadistic cop Christini, who only has one goal: to catch Dobermann at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rahpIHJBenGJKI1EfAHlGSfKEY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10347'),
  ('571584689677484608', 'Dobrinya and the Dragon', 2006, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ilya Maksimov, Vladimir Golounin', 'Aleksandr Boyarsky, Ilya Maksimov, Maksim Sveshnikov', 'Valeri Solovyev, Yuri Tarasov, Oleg Kulikovich, Andrei Tolubeyev, Anatoli Petrov, Sergey Makovetskiy, Yekaterina Gorokhovskaya, Elena Shulman', null, 'Dobrinya Nikitich goes on a quest to save the royal niece and finds out whether his old friend Zmey Gorinich is loyal to him. During the adventures, he is accompanied by the royal messenger who''s in love with the royal niece.', 'Dobrinya Nikitich goes on a quest to save the royal niece and finds out whether his old friend Zmey Gorinich is loyal to him. During the adventures, he is accompanied by the royal messenger who''s in love with the royal niece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMSrZEpcmlOUAL6kndUTuhSJitt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33534'),
  ('813563565204983352', 'Doc', 1971, 'Western', 'Frank Perry, Luis Gómez Valdivieso, Antonio Tarruella', 'Pete Hamill', 'Stacy Keach, Faye Dunaway, Harris Yulin, Michael Witney, Denver John Collins, Dan Greenburg, John Scanlon, Richard McKenzie', null, 'Doc Holliday travels to Tombstone, Ariz., with prostitute Katie Elder. Although the trip is difficult because Doc is ill with tuberculosis, they eventually reach their destination, where Holliday is reunited with his old friend Marshal Wyatt Earp, who has been clashing with the Clanton gang. Tensions between Earp and the Clantons rise until their infamous final showdown brings it to a head.', 'Doc Holliday travels to Tombstone, Ariz., with prostitute Katie Elder. Although the trip is difficult because Doc is ill with tuberculosis, they eventually reach their destination, where Holliday is reunited with his old friend Marshal Wyatt Earp, who has been clashing with the Clanton gang. Tensions between Earp and the Clantons rise until their infamous final showdown brings it to a head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqTktrvM9bdmCqOevMqSy8sR2DH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83147'),
  ('354640824863163077', 'Doc Hollywood', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Caton-Jones, Michael Chapman, J. Stephen Buck', 'Jeffrey Price, Daniel Pyne, Peter S. Seaman', 'Michael J. Fox, Julie Warner, Barnard Hughes, Woody Harrelson, David Ogden Stiers, Frances Sternhagen, George Hamilton, Bridget Fonda', 'PG-13', 'After leaving Washington D.C. hospital, plastic surgeon Ben Stone heads for California, where a lucrative practice in Beverly Hills awaits. After a car accident, he''s sentenced to perform as the community''s general practitioner.', 'After leaving Washington D.C. hospital, plastic surgeon Ben Stone heads for California, where a lucrative practice in Beverly Hills awaits. After a car accident, he''s sentenced to perform as the community''s general practitioner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36yGVgFWg7PvDdZ10Csg1uHpcZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11821'),
  ('606727843676508958', 'Doc Martin', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Ben Bolt, Julian Court, Scott Bates', 'Simon Mayle, Craig Ferguson, Mark Crowdy', 'Martin Clunes, Mark Heap, Tristan Sturrock, Dominic Rowan, Richard Dillane, Oliver Fox, Lynsey Baxter, Tony Maudsley', null, 'Doc Martin tells the tale of Martin Clunes'' character in the film, in the months leading up to the Saving Grace story. Martin Bamford is a heart-broken London obstetrician, in a jealous rage after he finds out that his wife has been sleeping with three of his buddies. He escapes to a small Cornish fishing village, which he grows surprisingly attached to, and is extremely reluctant to return with his cheating wife when she comes to pick him up. Although he has only been looking for a week''s R & R, Dr Bamford stumbles across a network of secrets in the village of Port Isaac, and finds himself embroiled in the most exciting scandal the village has seen for centuries.', 'Doc Martin tells the tale of Martin Clunes'' character in the film, in the months leading up to the Saving Grace story. Martin Bamford is a heart-broken London obstetrician, in a jealous rage after he finds out that his wife has been sleeping with three of his buddies. He escapes to a small Cornish fishing village, which he grows surprisingly attached to, and is extremely reluctant to return with his cheating wife when she comes to pick him up. Although he has only been looking for a week''s R & R, Dr Bamford stumbles across a network of secrets in the village of Port Isaac, and finds himself embroiled in the most exciting scandal the village has seen for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbYfsUpaa1uDho1aPxOd01riFd1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76474'),
  ('535600744758202406', 'Doc of the Dead', 2014, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Robert Muratore, Alexandre O. Philippe', 'Chad Herschberger, Alexandre O. Philippe', 'Alex Cox, Simon Pegg, Bruce Campbell, Fran Kranz, George A. Romero, Tom Savini, Greg Nicotero, Max Brooks', null, 'The definitive zombie culture documentary, brought to the screen by the makers of THE PEOPLE vs. GEORGE LUCAS.', 'The definitive zombie culture documentary, brought to the screen by the makers of THE PEOPLE vs. GEORGE LUCAS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7X0xV2zsUCFXWrrpQIowLjgCcz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250577'),
  ('398558215568846058', 'Doc Savage: The Man of Bronze', 1975, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Fantasy', 'Michael Anderson, Fred J. Koenekamp', 'Joe Morhaim, George Pal', 'Ron Ely, Paul Gleason, William Lucking, Michael Miller, Eldon Quick, Darrell Zwerling, Paul Wexler, Janice Heiden', 'G', 'In the Fabulous Thirties, Doc Savage and his five Amazing Adventurers are sucked into the mystery of Doc''s father disappearing in the wilds of South America. The maniacal Captain Seas tries to thwart them at every turn as they travel to the country of Hidalgo to investigate Doc''s father''s death and uncover a vast horde of Incan gold.', 'In the Fabulous Thirties, Doc Savage and his five Amazing Adventurers are sucked into the mystery of Doc''s father disappearing in the wilds of South America. The maniacal Captain Seas tries to thwart them at every turn as they travel to the country of Hidalgo to investigate Doc''s father''s death and uncover a vast horde of Incan gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cckGRIiw4S9cK3OrQayknwOVqTD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39554'),
  ('897879830728156057', 'Doc West', 2009, 'Western, Action', 'Giulio Base, Terence Hill', 'Marcello Olivieri, Luca Biglione', 'Terence Hill, Paul Sorvino, Boots Southerland, Clare Carey, Adam Taylor, Alessio Di Clemente, Kisha Sierra, Micah Alberti', null, 'After bandits steal his poker winnings this American legend makes his way to the next town in search of them. Seeking out his revenge during a poker game gone bad Doc West finds himself in the local town jail. When his past is exposed and a battle amongst the town breaks out in gunfire he will have to choose sides, between the outlaws or the law-abiding citizens.', 'After bandits steal his poker winnings this American legend makes his way to the next town in search of them. Seeking out his revenge during a poker game gone bad Doc West finds himself in the local town jail. When his past is exposed and a battle amongst the town breaks out in gunfire he will have to choose sides, between the outlaws or the law-abiding citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pABR4uDBhMm6HsP2fK1jkHlcybc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39807'),
  ('145081498881939536', 'Doc West II : Triggerman', 2009, 'Western, Action, Thriller', 'Terence Hill, Giulio Base', 'Marcello Olivieri, Luca Biglione', 'Terence Hill, Clare Carey, Maria P. Petruolo, Fabrizio Bucci, Evgeniya Chernyshova, Micah Alberti, Linus Huffman, Gisella Marengo', 'PG', 'A legendary poker playing outlaw, Triggerman, arrives to town for the wildest gambling tournament this side of the west. As the tournament begins he''ll get caught up in a violent showdown as bandits try to cheat their way to the finals. With his hand on the trigger this outlaw won''t let anything come between him and his winning hand.', 'A legendary poker playing outlaw, Triggerman, arrives to town for the wildest gambling tournament this side of the west. As the tournament begins he''ll get caught up in a violent showdown as bandits try to cheat their way to the finals. With his hand on the trigger this outlaw won''t let anything come between him and his winning hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFrwFXobLU9eE66g8nA4PwAIUSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55093'),
  ('358110278349267956', 'Doce hombres sin piedad', 1973, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Gustavo Pérez Puig', 'Reginald Rose', 'Jesús Puente, Pedro Osinaga, José Bódalo, Luis Prendes, Manuel Alexandre, Antonio Casal, Sancho Gracia, José María Rodero', null, 'The defense and the prosecution have rested and the jury is filing into the jury room to decide if a young man is guilty or innocent of murdering his father.', 'The defense and the prosecution have rested and the jury is filing into the jury room to decide if a young man is guilty or innocent of murdering his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLLLaCxXsjX6dF2UfQApOGNsnu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348756'),
  ('505200017294950698', 'Docking the Boat', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Tage Danielsson, Martin Bodin', 'Hans Alfredson, Tage Danielsson', 'Monica Zetterlund, Lars Ekborg, Birgitta Andersson, Gösta Ekman, Katie Rolfsen, Hans Alfredson, Hatte Furuhagen, Tage Danielsson', null, 'A group of party goers have trouble getting their boat ashore on a small island. The inhabitants of the island try to help, often with the help of an old sailor, and the results are absurd and hilarious.', 'A group of party goers have trouble getting their boat ashore on a small island. The inhabitants of the island try to help, often with the help of an old sailor, and the results are absurd and hilarious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Tdjvc07xMFrRgXzLzolh9WtP1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17091'),
  ('493968224822946706', 'Doctor', 2012, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Kim Sung-hong, Kim Kyoung-soo', 'Kim Sung-hong, Lee Ji-ho', 'Kim Chang-wan, Bae So-eun, Seo Gun-woo, Ban Min-jeong, Han Da-eun, Park Hyun-suk, Jin Ju-hyung, Choi Hyung', null, 'A plastic surgeon performs strange body experiments on his victims. A woman then goes to the plastic surgeon to seek out the perfect body. Through the surgery the women does receive the perfect body but also must now live out two separate lives.', 'A plastic surgeon performs strange body experiments on his victims. A woman then goes to the plastic surgeon to seek out the perfect body. Through the surgery the women does receive the perfect body but also must now live out two separate lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZfWDyjP6eF6UvQT2CRZ8haXzYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258936'),
  ('1053197732213815961', 'Doctor', 2021, 'Thriller, Comedy, Action', 'Nelson Dilipkumar, Vijay Kartik Kannan', 'Nelson Dilipkumar', 'Sivakarthikeyan, Vinay Rai, Priyanka Arul Mohan, Yogi Babu, Archana Chandhoke, Ilavarasu, Milind Soman, Arun Alexander', null, 'An army doctor helps his love interest''s family to find their kidnapped daughter.', 'An army doctor helps his love interest''s family to find their kidnapped daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySPT0USsuDFG9pqHjI50GYOeQmj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673692'),
  ('66511943232381964', 'Doctor and the Healer', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Franco Rossetti, Luciano Trasatti', 'Ennio De Concini, Mario Monicelli, Luigi Emmanuele', 'Vittorio De Sica, Marcello Mastroianni, Marisa Merlini, Lorella De Luca, Gabriella Pallotta, Alberto Sordi, Virgilio Riento, Carlo Taranto', null, 'Francesco, a young doctor, is appointed doctor to the imaginary village of Pianetta in the province of Avellino, but is immediately in competition with Don Antonio, a so-called "healer".', 'Francesco, a young doctor, is appointed doctor to the imaginary village of Pianetta in the province of Avellino, but is immediately in competition with Don Antonio, a so-called "healer".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4Agt14rgMkjqhQMuYHG8ujaX8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199717'),
  ('484485505060428024', 'Doctor at Large', 1957, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ernest Steward, Ralph Thomas', 'Nicholas Phipps', 'Dirk Bogarde, Muriel Pavlow, Donald Sinden, James Robertson Justice, Shirley Eaton, Derek Farr, Michael Medwin, Martin Benson', 'NR', 'Losing out to Dr. Bingham (Michael Medwin) in a competition for house surgeon when he offends a member of the board, young Dr. Simon Sparrow (Dirk Bogarde) finds himself going from post to post, filling in for other physicians. At one distant country post, he is taken aback when he works with a patient whose husband died after Simon treated the man years before. In another hospital, Simon examines a surprisingly mature teen and also tries courting devoted nurse Nan McPherson (Shirley Eaton).', 'Losing out to Dr. Bingham (Michael Medwin) in a competition for house surgeon when he offends a member of the board, young Dr. Simon Sparrow (Dirk Bogarde) finds himself going from post to post, filling in for other physicians. At one distant country post, he is taken aback when he works with a patient whose husband died after Simon treated the man years before. In another hospital, Simon examines a surprisingly mature teen and also tries courting devoted nurse Nan McPherson (Shirley Eaton).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2uvTPnh4E8v9gdqpJsw8AR0zri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68340'),
  ('34562596411490021', 'Doctor at Sea', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Ernest Steward, Ralph Thomas', 'Richard Gordon, Jack Davies, Nicholas Phipps', 'Dirk Bogarde, Brenda De Banzie, Brigitte Bardot, James Robertson Justice, Maurice Denham, Michael Medwin, Hubert Gregg, James Kenney', null, 'The second of the seven "Doctor" films, based on Richard Gordon''s novels and released between 1954 and 1970. A bachelor doctor goes to sea to escape the boredom of shore practice, but studies the nurses more than medicine, and Brigitte Bardot is around.', 'The second of the seven "Doctor" films, based on Richard Gordon''s novels and released between 1954 and 1970. A bachelor doctor goes to sea to escape the boredom of shore practice, but studies the nurses more than medicine, and Brigitte Bardot is around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pa9gmzyt6d0k0Y1PwMnhSBfTlFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68339'),
  ('130987104066748460', 'Doctor Aybolit', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Davyd Cherkaskyi, Viktor Hruzdiev, Oleksandr Mukhin', 'Yukhym Chepovetskyi, Davyd Cherkaskyi', 'Zinoviy Gerdt, Semyon Farada, Mariya Mironova, Vsevolod Abdulov, Lyudmila Ivanova, Yevhen Papernyi, Heorhii Kyshko, Viktor Andriienko', null, 'A funny comedy about doctor Aybolit and his assistants and patients - all animals.', 'A funny comedy about doctor Aybolit and his assistants and patients - all animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5SgsexwvAMed07n8hclAIxQnic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198951'),
  ('764877061245770815', 'Doctor Blood''s Coffin', 1961, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Sidney J. Furie, Philip Martell, Stephen Dade', 'Nathan Juran', 'Kieron Moore, Hazel Court, Ian Hunter, Kenneth J. Warren, Gerald Lawson, Fred Johnson, Paul Hardtmuth, Paul Stockman', null, 'After being thrown out of medical school for ethical violations, Dr. Peter Blood returns home to a small Cornish village, where he sets up a research laboratory in a secluded cave. There, he attempts to revive the dead, using kidnapped humans -- who he views as unworthy of life -- for their body parts, specifically, their hearts.', 'After being thrown out of medical school for ethical violations, Dr. Peter Blood returns home to a small Cornish village, where he sets up a research laboratory in a secluded cave. There, he attempts to revive the dead, using kidnapped humans -- who he views as unworthy of life -- for their body parts, specifically, their hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GkBT8cKPl1GhBuUnktJpjF1uV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50567'),
  ('19520966149704485', 'Doctor Bull', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Ford, George Schneiderman, Edward O''Fearna', 'Paul Green, Philip Klein', 'Will Rogers, Ralph Morgan, Andy Devine, Rochelle Hudson, Vera Allen, Marian Nixon, Howard Lally, Berton Churchill', 'NR', 'In this engaging adaptation of James Gould Cozzen''s novel The Last Adam, film icon Will Rogers portrays Dr. George Bull, a compassionate, highly regarded small-town physician who often prescribes a healthy dose of common sense! But when Bull begins dating a widow (Vera Allen), the local gossips misconstrue the story. To make matters worse, Bull''s plainspoken manner earns him an enemy in the wealthy owner of a nearby construction camp. But once it''s learned that the camp has caused illness by polluting the local water supply, the good doctor steps in to try to restore the town''s health - and his reputation!', 'In this engaging adaptation of James Gould Cozzen''s novel The Last Adam, film icon Will Rogers portrays Dr. George Bull, a compassionate, highly regarded small-town physician who often prescribes a healthy dose of common sense! But when Bull begins dating a widow (Vera Allen), the local gossips misconstrue the story. To make matters worse, Bull''s plainspoken manner earns him an enemy in the wealthy owner of a nearby construction camp. But once it''s learned that the camp has caused illness by polluting the local water supply, the good doctor steps in to try to restore the town''s health - and his reputation!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlRBJOBTWViKn7qzHRBBAdIdS1X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72608'),
  ('756530817380831474', 'Doctor Butcher M.D.', 1980, 'Horror', 'Marino Girolami, Romano Scandariato, Giacomo Dell''Orso', 'Romano Scandariato', 'Ian McCulloch, Alexandra Delli Colli, Sherry Buchanan, Peter O''Neal, Donald O''Brien, Dakar, Walter Patriarca, Linda Fumis', 'R', 'After Malukan immigrants engage in a string of corpse mutilations at various New York City hospitals, a doctor and a morgue assistant travel to the Maluku Islands to investigate.', 'After Malukan immigrants engage in a string of corpse mutilations at various New York City hospitals, a doctor and a morgue assistant travel to the Maluku Islands to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PQvNbV0s8vZKPMySRjniL8LQPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7216'),
  ('1073887737309347713', 'Doctor Death: Seeker of Souls', 1973, 'Horror', 'Eddie Saeta, Irby Smith, Jerry Ballew', 'Sal Ponti', 'John Considine, Barry Coe, Cheryl Miller, Stewart Moss, Leon Askin, Jo Morrow, Florence Marly, Sivi Aberg', 'R', 'John Considine plays the flamboyant Dr. Death, a thousand-year-old magician who has mastered he art of transferring souls from one body to another and thereby manages to perpetuate himself by jumping from one body to the next. Apparently the Doc is a kindred spirit since his blood is a highly-corrosive acid that can strip flesh from bone', 'John Considine plays the flamboyant Dr. Death, a thousand-year-old magician who has mastered he art of transferring souls from one body to another and thereby manages to perpetuate himself by jumping from one body to the next. Apparently the Doc is a kindred spirit since his blood is a highly-corrosive acid that can strip flesh from bone', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cM1k7Bcn0GuXycKjhAm0y4p3QRr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83875'),
  ('86690049563986525', 'Doctor Detroit', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Michael Pressman, King Baggot', 'Robert Boris, Bruce Jay Friedman, Carl Gottlieb', 'Dan Aykroyd, Howard Hesseman, Donna Dixon, Lydia Lei, T.K. Carter, Lynn Whitfield, Fran Drescher, Kate Murtagh', 'R', 'A shy but gentle man named Clifford Skridlow is a professor of comparative literature at the financially-strapped fictional Monroe College in Chicago. A chance encounter with four beautiful women at a restaurant changes his life forever.', 'A shy but gentle man named Clifford Skridlow is a professor of comparative literature at the financially-strapped fictional Monroe College in Chicago. A chance encounter with four beautiful women at a restaurant changes his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aluYVLiLMn5cRPBJV6YyXkItwyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23096'),
  ('286575590239959026', 'Doctor Dolittle', 1967, 'Music, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Richard Fleischer, Robert Surtees, Richard Lang', 'Leslie Bricusse', 'Rex Harrison, Samantha Eggar, Anthony Newley, Richard Attenborough, Peter Bull, Muriel Landers, William Dix, Geoffrey Holder', 'G', 'A veterinarian who can communicate with animals travels abroad to search for a giant sea snail.', 'A veterinarian who can communicate with animals travels abroad to search for a giant sea snail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rViuZo27U8wcZHGuRliv9LfmhjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16081'),
  ('835980102041670810', 'Doctor Dolittle', 1998, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Betty Thomas, Russell Boyd, Tamu Blackwell', 'Nat Mauldin, Larry Levin', 'Eddie Murphy, Ossie Davis, Oliver Platt, Peter Boyle, Richard Schiff, Kristen Wilson, Jeffrey Tambor, Kyla Pratt', 'PG-13', 'A successful physician and devoted family man, John Dolittle seems to have the world by the tail, until a long suppressed talent he possessed as a child, the ability to communicate with animals is suddenly reawakened with a vengeance! Now every creature within squawking distance wants the good doctor''s advice, unleashing an outrageous chain of events that turns his world upside down!', 'A successful physician and devoted family man, John Dolittle seems to have the world by the tail, until a long suppressed talent he possessed as a child, the ability to communicate with animals is suddenly reawakened with a vengeance! Now every creature within squawking distance wants the good doctor''s advice, unleashing an outrageous chain of events that turns his world upside down!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLrchGMIkdo1KamQJA6fwvDQEy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3050'),
  ('1139990014961912700', 'Doctor Dracula', 1978, 'Horror', 'Al Adamson, Paul Aratow', 'Paul Aratow, Cecil Brown, Gary Reathman', 'John Carradine, Don ''Red'' Barry, Larry Hankin, Geoffrey Land, Susan McIver, Regina Carrol, Paul Thomas, Clair Dia', 'R', 'An evil hypnotist puts a beautiful woman under his spell.', 'An evil hypnotist puts a beautiful woman under his spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkMXRZcQmd1LjLInwaJxeHTaJMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141127'),
  ('1046907311695036680', 'Doctor Faustus', 1967, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Richard Burton, Gábor Pogány, Nevill Coghill', null, 'Richard Burton, Elizabeth Taylor, Richard Durden, Andreas Teuber, Ian Marter, Maria Aitken, Michael Menaugh, Ram Chopra', null, 'Faustus is a scholar at the University of Wittenberg when he earns his doctorate degree. His insatiable appetite for knowledge and power leads him to employ necromancy to conjure Mephistopheles out of hell. He bargains away his soul to Lucifer in exchange for living 24 years during which Mephistopheles will be his slave. Faustus signs the pact in his own blood and Mephistopheles reveals the works of the devil to Faustus.', 'Faustus is a scholar at the University of Wittenberg when he earns his doctorate degree. His insatiable appetite for knowledge and power leads him to employ necromancy to conjure Mephistopheles out of hell. He bargains away his soul to Lucifer in exchange for living 24 years during which Mephistopheles will be his slave. Faustus signs the pact in his own blood and Mephistopheles reveals the works of the devil to Faustus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jF0JpqgrnGBhrIe0tns1ZljChg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95404'),
  ('907913010757336560', 'Doctor Francoise Gailland', 1976, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Louis Bertuccelli, Claude Renoir', 'André G. Brunelin, Jean-Louis Bertuccelli', 'Annie Girardot, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Suzanne Flon, Isabelle Huppert, François Périer, Anouk Ferjac, William Coryn, Margo Lion', null, 'Dr. Françoise Gailland has a hectic schedule, which causes her to have little time to spend with her family, which consists of her husband Gérard, her pregnant teenager daughter Élisabeth, and her sullen son Julien. However, she does manage to find the time to spend with her lover, Daniel Letessier. While her life in such disarray, she learns that she has cancer. Françoise tries to put a brave face on it, and is determined to face the life-threatening disease with courage.', 'Dr. Françoise Gailland has a hectic schedule, which causes her to have little time to spend with her family, which consists of her husband Gérard, her pregnant teenager daughter Élisabeth, and her sullen son Julien. However, she does manage to find the time to spend with her lover, Daniel Letessier. While her life in such disarray, she learns that she has cancer. Françoise tries to put a brave face on it, and is determined to face the life-threatening disease with courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58pYLDqWiDlQbDEYHAqwCX5IqbK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68971'),
  ('484905908613987946', 'Doctor G', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eeshit Narain, Gautam Kishanchandani, Anubhuti Kashyap', 'Vishal Wagh, Saurabh Bharat, Anubhuti Kashyap', 'Ayushmann Khurrana, Rakul Preet Singh, Shefali Shah, Sheeba Chaddha, Abhay Chintamani Mishr, Ayesha Kaduskar, Indraneil Sengupta, Priyam Saha', 'PG-13', 'Uday Gupta, a medical college student wanted to specialise in Orthopaedic, but is stuck in an all-female class of Gynaecology. Will he change his department, or will the department change him?', 'Uday Gupta, a medical college student wanted to specialise in Orthopaedic, but is stuck in an all-female class of Gynaecology. Will he change his department, or will the department change him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojQbYD4pHKBrnxrG0FBdqGCHhlq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778625'),
  ('310027778971573788', 'Doctor Glas', 1968, 'Drama', 'Mai Zetterling, Rune Ericson', 'David Hughes, Mai Zetterling', 'Per Oscarsson, Lone Hertz, Ulf Palme, Bente Dessau, Nils Eklund, Lars Lunøe, Bendt Rothe, Helle Hertz', null, 'Doctor Glas finds himself attracted to a young woman, married to a corrupt clergyman. She''s miserable in her marriage, so he agrees to help in anyway he can. But he is quickly torn between passion and morality.', 'Doctor Glas finds himself attracted to a young woman, married to a corrupt clergyman. She''s miserable in her marriage, so he agrees to help in anyway he can. But he is quickly torn between passion and morality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v63PDd5SWgPgq33bEPbv658pdDn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198672'),
  ('590096889682703210', 'Doctor Glas', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Erik Leijonborg', 'Isac Calmroth, Erik Leijonborg', 'Isac Calmroth, Thea Sofie Loch Næss, Christian Fandango Sundgren', null, 'A reclusive doctor who scorns shallow society meets a fashion designer in an unhappy marriage. As he attempts to rescue her from her troubled relationship, they become entangled in deception and dangerous power dynamics.', 'A reclusive doctor who scorns shallow society meets a fashion designer in an unhappy marriage. As he attempts to rescue her from her troubled relationship, they become entangled in deception and dangerous power dynamics.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fat7Y1r2Ja5AF800Ia6N3OQJx7Ks.jpg', 'plex:movie:doctor-glas-2026'),
  ('375871392621801148', 'Doctor in Clover', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Thomas, Ernest Steward', 'Jack Davies', 'Leslie Phillips, James Robertson Justice, Shirley Anne Field, John Fraser, Joan Sims, Arthur Haynes, Fenella Fielding, Jeremy Lloyd', null, 'Doctor in Clover is another ''Doctor'' movie, but this time Leslie Phillips is the main doctor in the story, looking for love and romance from the hospital nurses, much to the annoyance of the main Administrator (James Robertson Justice) who wants his doctors to be 100% focussed on the job. Numerous antics follow, with Phillips getting Justice fixed up with the new prim-and-proper Matron (Joan Sims) and his attempted failures to lure the hospital''s beauty, the physiotherapist.', 'Doctor in Clover is another ''Doctor'' movie, but this time Leslie Phillips is the main doctor in the story, looking for love and romance from the hospital nurses, much to the annoyance of the main Administrator (James Robertson Justice) who wants his doctors to be 100% focussed on the job. Numerous antics follow, with Phillips getting Justice fixed up with the new prim-and-proper Matron (Joan Sims) and his attempted failures to lure the hospital''s beauty, the physiotherapist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXU2FBxIG5NnTURvZDJLWKpkzAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68338'),
  ('518878241788461748', 'Doctor in Distress', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Thomas, Ernest Steward', 'Nicholas Phipps, Ronald Scott Thorn', 'Dirk Bogarde, Samantha Eggar, James Robertson Justice, Donald Houston, Barbara Murray, Dennis Price, Mylène Demongeot, Jill Adams', null, '"Doctor in Distress" is the fifth of the seven films in the "Doctor" series, and focuses on Sir Lancelot Spratt, Simon Sparrow''s old teacher and sometimes nemesis. When the eternal bachelor Sir Lancelot injures his back and falls in love with his physiotherapist Iris Marchant, he becomes very distressed and turns to Simon for help. Simon, who now is a senior doctor at fictional Hampden Cross Hospital and hopelessly in love with aspiring actress Delia, sends him to a nature cure clinic in a vain attempt to help him lose weight, but Sir Lancelot can''t get Iris off his mind and has her followed, first by a private investigator and eventually by himself. When he finally proposes, she rejects him and marries an old army major, which distresses Sir Lancelot even more.', '"Doctor in Distress" is the fifth of the seven films in the "Doctor" series, and focuses on Sir Lancelot Spratt, Simon Sparrow''s old teacher and sometimes nemesis. When the eternal bachelor Sir Lancelot injures his back and falls in love with his physiotherapist Iris Marchant, he becomes very distressed and turns to Simon for help. Simon, who now is a senior doctor at fictional Hampden Cross Hospital and hopelessly in love with aspiring actress Delia, sends him to a nature cure clinic in a vain attempt to help him lose weight, but Sir Lancelot can''t get Iris off his mind and has her followed, first by a private investigator and eventually by himself. When he finally proposes, she rejects him and marries an old army major, which distresses Sir Lancelot even more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tecpq44TF0iDCECOBV9EcMv0aFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68337'),
  ('132251765031534714', 'Doctor in Love', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Ernest Steward, Ralph Thomas', 'Nicholas Phipps', 'Michael Craig, Virginia Maskell, Leslie Phillips, James Robertson Justice, Nicholas Phipps, Carole Lesley, John Le Mesurier, Joan Sims', null, 'Doctors Burke and Hare leave the confines of St Swithins for the world of general practice, stopping off on the way as patients at the Foulness Anti-cold Unit. Hare then takes up a position as junior in a well-healed G.P.''s surgery while Burke continues to sow his doctorial wild oats.', 'Doctors Burke and Hare leave the confines of St Swithins for the world of general practice, stopping off on the way as patients at the Foulness Anti-cold Unit. Hare then takes up a position as junior in a well-healed G.P.''s surgery while Burke continues to sow his doctorial wild oats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Sj0ilMPmOie3Bvi82eeicaMc8U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68334'),
  ('234842309146053590', 'Doctor in the House', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Thomas', 'Richard Gordon, Nicholas Pipps', 'Dirk Bogarde, Muriel Pavlow, Kenneth More, Donald Sinden, Kay Kendall, James Robertson Justice, Donald Houston, Suzanne Cloutier', null, 'The first of the seven "Doctor" films, based on Richard Gordon''s novels and released between 1954 and 1970. Simon Sparrow is a newly arrived medical student at St Swithin''s hospital in London. Falling in with three longer-serving hopefuls he is soon immersed in the wooing, imbibing and fast sports-car driving that constitute 1950s medical training. There is, however, always the looming and formidable figure of chief surgeon Sir Lancelot Spratt to remind them of their real purpose.', 'The first of the seven "Doctor" films, based on Richard Gordon''s novels and released between 1954 and 1970. Simon Sparrow is a newly arrived medical student at St Swithin''s hospital in London. Falling in with three longer-serving hopefuls he is soon immersed in the wooing, imbibing and fast sports-car driving that constitute 1950s medical training. There is, however, always the looming and formidable figure of chief surgeon Sir Lancelot Spratt to remind them of their real purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGRDD9B0FgaWLgsjSZIHcA3ZF3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68242'),
  ('335832233455845567', 'Doctor in Trouble', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Ralph Thomas, Eric Rogers, Ernest Steward', 'Jack Davies', 'Leslie Phillips, Harry Secombe, James Robertson Justice, Angela Scoular, Irene Handl, Simon Dee, Robert Morley, Freddie Jones', null, 'Dr. Burke is in love with Ophelia but doesn''t have time to propose to her as she leaves for a cruise to the Mediterranean. Also on board the cruise ship is an old school chum of Burke''s who plays ''Dr.Dare'' in a very popular TV series and who women flock to. Burke decides to join the cruise, but is first apprehended as a stowaway, and then becomes the captain''s steward. For Burke, trying to talk to Ophelia is a hard enough task, but he meets some funny characters on board, such as a pools winner and a very stubborn captain.', 'Dr. Burke is in love with Ophelia but doesn''t have time to propose to her as she leaves for a cruise to the Mediterranean. Also on board the cruise ship is an old school chum of Burke''s who plays ''Dr.Dare'' in a very popular TV series and who women flock to. Burke decides to join the cruise, but is first apprehended as a stowaway, and then becomes the captain''s steward. For Burke, trying to talk to Ophelia is a hard enough task, but he meets some funny characters on board, such as a pools winner and a very stubborn captain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cV8x0x64fNSxe08ZX7TJpGkuppz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68336'),
  ('259972648047117831', 'Doctor Justice', 1975, 'Action', 'Christian-Jaque', 'Christian-Jaque, Jacques Robert', 'John Phillip Law, Gert Fröbe, Nathalie Delon, Roger Paschy, Henri Marteau, Gilles Béhat, Lionel Vitrant, Jean Lanier', null, 'Based on the title character, a World Health Organisation (WHO) doctor and martial arts expert who fights bad guys, created in 1970 by scriptwriter Jean Ollivier and artist Carlo Marcello for "Pif Gadget", a weekly kids'' comic book magazine in France.', 'Based on the title character, a World Health Organisation (WHO) doctor and martial arts expert who fights bad guys, created in 1970 by scriptwriter Jean Ollivier and artist Carlo Marcello for "Pif Gadget", a weekly kids'' comic book magazine in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92UeDyR1xM86qsEPZh9ZrwI4Tmg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311065'),
  ('528181932660008248', 'Doctor Lisa', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Oksana Karas, Sergey Machilsky, Polina Mashinistova', 'Oksana Karas, Natalya Kudryashova, Alexey Ilyushkin', 'Chulpan Khamatova, Konstantin Khabenskiy, Andrzej Chyra, Andrey Burkovskiy, Alexey Agranovich, Timofey Tribuntsev, Yelena Koreneva, Yuliya Aug', null, 'The film is about a day in the life of Elizaveta Petrovna Glinka, also known as Doctor Liza. Moscow, 2012. The Glinka family prepares for a celebration: thirty years together. The closest friends are invited for dinner, the sons have arrived. Of course, Liza has freed up this day for her family. There’s just a trifle: to stop by the Fund and see the weekly patients at the Paveletsky Station. But the days of Doctor Liza are always full of surprises… In a hospital in a Moscow suburb a five-year-old girl is dying. The duty doctor has to discharge Eva. Due to medical formalities the child, who suffers from cancer, is left without painkillers. In utter despair, the girl’s father turns to Liza for help. When Liza cannot find a way to help the child within the system, she decides on a desperate act…', 'The film is about a day in the life of Elizaveta Petrovna Glinka, also known as Doctor Liza. Moscow, 2012. The Glinka family prepares for a celebration: thirty years together. The closest friends are invited for dinner, the sons have arrived. Of course, Liza has freed up this day for her family. There’s just a trifle: to stop by the Fund and see the weekly patients at the Paveletsky Station. But the days of Doctor Liza are always full of surprises… In a hospital in a Moscow suburb a five-year-old girl is dying. The duty doctor has to discharge Eva. Due to medical formalities the child, who suffers from cancer, is left without painkillers. In utter despair, the girl’s father turns to Liza for help. When Liza cannot find a way to help the child within the system, she decides on a desperate act…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPkGmCUkFWyXfpLOAidpeFe9ybW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595464'),
  ('605165014289442797', 'Doctor Mack', 1995, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Chi-Ngai, Bill Wong Chung-Piu, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Lee Chi-Ngai', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Andy Hui Chi-On, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Alex To, Hilary Tsui Ho-Ying, Eileen Tung Oi-Ling, Law Kar-Ying', null, 'Since dropping out from the medical school, Lau Mack has been living a humble but contented life, running a small clinic in a shabby area, treating local inhabitants and poor prostitutes working there. One night, he escorts an injured gun robber to the government hospital, where he unexpectedly meets his old friend from college time, Dr. Jaw, now a reputed surgeon with an aspiration for senior management. To Jaw''s bitter surprise, he finds himself outshone by Lau''s medical talent and kindness to patients. Jaw is however determined to speed up his career ascent at the expense of Lau. His plots work perfectly, until an accident delivers his life to the mercy of Lau.', 'Since dropping out from the medical school, Lau Mack has been living a humble but contented life, running a small clinic in a shabby area, treating local inhabitants and poor prostitutes working there. One night, he escorts an injured gun robber to the government hospital, where he unexpectedly meets his old friend from college time, Dr. Jaw, now a reputed surgeon with an aspiration for senior management. To Jaw''s bitter surprise, he finds himself outshone by Lau''s medical talent and kindness to patients. Jaw is however determined to speed up his career ascent at the expense of Lau. His plots work perfectly, until an accident delivers his life to the mercy of Lau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xye2GvzKJ8OGJLz0pZLho2Nx7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45470'),
  ('80658733114829007', 'Doctor Mordrid', 1992, 'Fantasy, Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Albert Band, Charles Band, Adolfo Bartoli', 'C. Courtney Joyner', 'Jeffrey Combs, Yvette Nipar, Jay Acovone, Keith Coulouris, Ritch Brinkley, Brian Thompson, Pearl Shear, Murray Rubin', 'R', 'Bound by hate and a mystical amulet that holds the powers of life and death, two immortal wizards meet for the last time in an ancient struggle of good versus evil.', 'Bound by hate and a mystical amulet that holds the powers of life and death, two immortal wizards meet for the last time in an ancient struggle of good versus evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zH9TkMZHSVRokg6vyyeLdu5SJxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1877'),
  ('555801143883673497', 'Doctor of Doom', 1963, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Drama', 'René Cardona, Enrique Wallace', null, 'Lorena Velázquez, Armando Silvestre, Elizabeth Campbell, Roberto Cañedo, Sonia Infante, Jesús Salinas, Jesús "Murciélago" Velázquez, Gerardo Zepeda', null, 'A mad scientist terrorizes a city by kidnapping young women with his ape-man Gomar and then using them as subjects in sadistic brain transplant experiments. A female wrestler whose sister was one of the victims swears vengeance against the Mad Doctor.', 'A mad scientist terrorizes a city by kidnapping young women with his ape-man Gomar and then using them as subjects in sadistic brain transplant experiments. A female wrestler whose sister was one of the victims swears vengeance against the Mad Doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oppqldlFcUIbUyWpv7HoUABCExq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92696'),
  ('641333094782844029', 'Doctor of Doom', 1979, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Tim Burton, Jerry Rees', 'Tim Burton', 'Harry Sabin, Randy Cartwright, Cynthia Prince, Tim Burton, Brad Bird, Michael Giaimo, Chris Buck, Jerry Rees', null, 'A doctor goes to a dinner party where he''s made fun of and soon afterwards returns home and sends a monster to attack the people.', 'A doctor goes to a dinner party where he''s made fun of and soon afterwards returns home and sends a monster to attack the people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9mbB8fJFFtKgq6v0C1cfWeKugy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135141'),
  ('714123888588513607', 'Doctor on Call', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Guido Chiesa, Emanuele Pasquet', 'Tristan Séguéla, Jim Birmant, Guido Chiesa', 'Diego Abatantuono, Frank Matano, Francesco Russo, Cecilia Napoli, Giorgia Spinelli, Alessandro Betti, Luciano Miele, Antonio Salines', 'NR', '65 year old doctor Pierfrancesco works as a night-shift medical guard. He’s a grumpy man, full of aches and pains and is very rough with his patients. One night, he’s involved in a road collision with 30 year old delivery man Mario. While uninjured, Mario''s bicycle is destroyed, and Pierfrancesco''s sciatica flares up, making it impossible for him to drive. With both of their jobs in jeopardy, the doctor has an idea that could help them both: “remotely guided” by Pierfrancesco via wireless headset, Mario will visit his patients, and they’ll also carry out Mario’s delivery in Pierfrancesco’s car. After a range of daring (mis)adventures, they will learn to support each other, and the night will end with their lives both changed for the better.', '65 year old doctor Pierfrancesco works as a night-shift medical guard. He’s a grumpy man, full of aches and pains and is very rough with his patients. One night, he’s involved in a road collision with 30 year old delivery man Mario. While uninjured, Mario''s bicycle is destroyed, and Pierfrancesco''s sciatica flares up, making it impossible for him to drive. With both of their jobs in jeopardy, the doctor has an idea that could help them both: “remotely guided” by Pierfrancesco via wireless headset, Mario will visit his patients, and they’ll also carry out Mario’s delivery in Pierfrancesco’s car. After a range of daring (mis)adventures, they will learn to support each other, and the night will end with their lives both changed for the better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHao5iDtYN8MTydvuMSdIZ6W0JI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802324'),
  ('715072154751105530', 'Doctor on Display: The USA Tour 1986-1988', 2025, null, 'Roger Christopher Stevens', null, 'Sophie Aldred', null, 'In 1986, BBC Enterprises organized the Doctor Who USA Tour, a two-year travelling exhibition of props and memorabilia from the program, showcased in a 48-foot trailer decorated with alien landscapes from the show, police box entrances, and a mock-up of the TARDIS interior. This documentary features footage from the events as well as interviews with participants and more.', 'In 1986, BBC Enterprises organized the Doctor Who USA Tour, a two-year travelling exhibition of props and memorabilia from the program, showcased in a 48-foot trailer decorated with alien landscapes from the show, police box entrances, and a mock-up of the TARDIS interior. This documentary features footage from the events as well as interviews with participants and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gR3raRmxbhsAGvf9wxeHLyCRHLK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175404'),
  ('49511337970113899', 'Doctor Plague', 2026, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Ben Fortune, James Westlake, Truman Terracotta', 'Simon Cluett', 'Martin Kemp, Peter Woodward, Jeanine Nerissa Sothcott, David Yip, Wendy Glenn, Daisy Beaumont, Charlie Bentley, Michael McKell', null, 'Jaded detective John Verney is on the trail of an ancient cult of Plague Doctors which is cutting a bloody swathe through the London underworld. Dismissed by his superiors as gang on gang killings, the murders draw Verney into an obsessive maze of a secret society conspiracy with links to the Jack The Ripper murders of 1888, putting him and his family in grave danger.', 'Jaded detective John Verney is on the trail of an ancient cult of Plague Doctors which is cutting a bloody swathe through the London underworld. Dismissed by his superiors as gang on gang killings, the murders draw Verney into an obsessive maze of a secret society conspiracy with links to the Jack The Ripper murders of 1888, putting him and his family in grave danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wO7AbxLIYzCjIMe9OV4f3Q4e06N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1320756'),
  ('279716648550564466', 'Doctor Sleep', 2002, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Nick Willing, Peter Sova, MJ Bassett', 'Nick Willing, Madison Smartt Bell', 'Goran Višnjić, Paddy Considine, Shirley Henderson, Miranda Otto, Sophie Stuckey, Josh Richards, John Rogan, Claire Rushbrook', 'R', 'While treating a policewoman for smoking, hypnotherapist Michael Strother has a telepathic vision of a young girl floating beneath the surface of a stream. The escaped victim of a ritualistic serial killer, the girl has become mute, and Michael is called upon by Scotland Yard to unlock the secrets she holds in order to catch a man who believes he has discovered the key to immortality.', 'While treating a policewoman for smoking, hypnotherapist Michael Strother has a telepathic vision of a young girl floating beneath the surface of a stream. The escaped victim of a ritualistic serial killer, the girl has become mute, and Michael is called upon by Scotland Yard to unlock the secrets she holds in order to catch a man who believes he has discovered the key to immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBRcmhQakzeYPU6AWLP1DtAoLtC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20321'),
  ('430835660010717581', 'Doctor Sleep', 2019, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Mike Flanagan, Michael Fimognari, Katye Kalivoda', 'Mike Flanagan', 'Ewan McGregor, Rebecca Ferguson, Kyliegh Curran, Cliff Curtis, Zahn McClarnon, Emily Alyn Lind, Selena Anduze, Robert Longstreet', 'R', 'Still scarred by the trauma he endured as a child at the Overlook Hotel, Dan Torrance faces the ghosts of the past when he meets Abra, a courageous teen who desperately needs his help -- and who possesses a powerful extrasensory ability called the "shine".', 'Still scarred by the trauma he endured as a child at the Overlook Hotel, Dan Torrance faces the ghosts of the past when he meets Abra, a courageous teen who desperately needs his help -- and who possesses a powerful extrasensory ability called the "shine".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p69QzIBbN06aTYqRRiCOY1emNBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501170'),
  ('998172167771581687', 'Doctor Strange', 2007, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Jay Oliva, Dick Sebast, Patrick Archibald', 'Greg Johnson', 'Bryce Johnson, Paul Nakauchi, Kevin Michael Richardson, Michael Yama, Susan Spano, Jonathan Adams, Fred Tatasciore, Tara Strong', 'PG-13', 'Dr. Stephen Strange embarks on a wondrous journey to the heights of a Tibetan mountain, where he seeks healing at the feet of the mysterious Ancient One.', 'Dr. Stephen Strange embarks on a wondrous journey to the heights of a Tibetan mountain, where he seeks healing at the feet of the mysterious Ancient One.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ygcpWXsWmEc83j7zE8P0lvC0Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14830'),
  ('95768171384654802', 'Doctor Strange', 2016, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Ben Davis, Ray Chan, John Marzano', 'Scott Derrickson, Jon Spaihts, C. Robert Cargill', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Rachel McAdams, Benedict Wong, Mads Mikkelsen, Tilda Swinton, Michael Stuhlbarg, Benjamin Bratt', 'PG-13', 'After his career is destroyed, a brilliant but arrogant surgeon gets a new lease on life when a sorcerer takes him under her wing and trains him to defend the world against evil.', 'After his career is destroyed, a brilliant but arrogant surgeon gets a new lease on life when a sorcerer takes him under her wing and trains him to defend the world against evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xf8PbyQcR5ucXErmZNzdKR0s8ya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284052'),
  ('829852741206767558', 'Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness', 2022, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Dominic Fysh, Jamie Christopher, Aoife Warren', 'Michael Waldron', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Xochitl Gomez, Elizabeth Olsen, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Benedict Wong, Rachel McAdams, Jett Klyne, Julian Hilliard', 'PG-13', 'Doctor Strange, with the help of mystical allies both old and new, traverses the mind-bending and dangerous alternate realities of the Multiverse to confront a mysterious new adversary.', 'Doctor Strange, with the help of mystical allies both old and new, traverses the mind-bending and dangerous alternate realities of the Multiverse to confront a mysterious new adversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddJcSKbcp4rKZTmuyWaMhuwcfMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453395'),
  ('367875186490765520', 'Doctor Who', 1996, 'TV Movie, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Geoffrey Sax, Glen MacPherson', 'Matthew Jacobs', 'Paul McGann, Eric Roberts, Daphne Ashbrook, Sylvester McCoy, Yee Jee Tso, Will Sasso, Dolores Drake, John Novak', 'PG-13', 'The Seventh Doctor becomes the Eighth. And on the streets of San Francisco – alongside new ally Grace Holloway - he battles the Master.', 'The Seventh Doctor becomes the Eighth. And on the streets of San Francisco – alongside new ally Grace Holloway - he battles the Master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwae2p7JcRNtz1CvNCzpX5ad96V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15691'),
  ('185295256255941689', 'Doctor Who: A Christmas Carol', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Toby Haynes, Stephan Pehrsson', 'Steven Moffat', 'Matt Smith, Karen Gillan, Arthur Darvill, Michael Gambon, Katherine Jenkins, Laurence Belcher, Danny Horn, Leo Bill', null, 'Amy Pond and Rory Williams are trapped on a crashing space liner, and the only way the Eleventh Doctor can rescue them is to save the soul of a lonely old miser. But is Kazran Sardick, the richest man in Sardicktown, beyond redemption? And what is lurking in the fogs of Christmas Eve?', 'Amy Pond and Rory Williams are trapped on a crashing space liner, and the only way the Eleventh Doctor can rescue them is to save the soul of a lonely old miser. But is Kazran Sardick, the richest man in Sardicktown, beyond redemption? And what is lurking in the fogs of Christmas Eve?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dQv1PfE654y3uaA7jW2tIyEEUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315620'),
  ('472736624875131972', 'Doctor Who: Dimensions in Time', 1993, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Stuart McDonald', 'John Nathan-Turner, David Roden', 'Sylvester McCoy, Sophie Aldred, Kate O''Mara, Colin Baker, Peter Davison, Tom Baker, Jon Pertwee, Nicola Bryant', null, 'All of the Doctor''s incarnations are in crisis when The Rani creates a time-loop in the East-end of London in this 30th Anniversary Special.', 'All of the Doctor''s incarnations are in crisis when The Rani creates a time-loop in the East-end of London in this 30th Anniversary Special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQbOW48S3pkr8LUmEy24PCyjSTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215391'),
  ('772039675383384813', 'Doctor Who: Last Christmas', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Drama', 'Paul Wilmshurst, Neville Kidd', 'Steven Moffat', 'Peter Capaldi, Jenna Coleman, Nick Frost, Samuel Anderson, Dan Starkey, Nathan McMullen, Faye Marsay, Natalie Gumede', null, 'The Doctor and Clara face their Last Christmas. Trapped on an Arctic base, under attack from terrifying creatures, who are you going to call? Santa Claus!', 'The Doctor and Clara face their Last Christmas. Trapped on an Arctic base, under attack from terrifying creatures, who are you going to call? Santa Claus!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpvZ4LxqBLIacWBMJueXPIbdlwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317182'),
  ('618166484285535377', 'Doctor Who: Planet of the Dead', 2009, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie, Thriller, Fantasy, Mystery', 'James Strong, Rory Taylor', 'Gareth Roberts, Russell T Davies', 'David Tennant, Michelle Ryan, Lee Evans, Noma Dumezweni, Adam James, Glenn Doherty, Victoria Alcock, Daniel Kaluuya', null, 'A meeting in a London bus with jewel thief Lady Christina takes a turn for the worse for the Doctor when the bus takes a detour to a desert-like planet, where the deadly Swarm awaits.', 'A meeting in a London bus with jewel thief Lady Christina takes a turn for the worse for the Doctor when the bus takes a detour to a desert-like planet, where the deadly Swarm awaits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qKoF7XjkcbWYwekBCKt7W7rDHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282963'),
  ('580774157756036923', 'Doctor Who: Regeneration', 2026, 'Short, Science Fiction', 'Oliver Kelly', 'Oliver Kelly', null, null, 'After defeating the Rani and Omega, the Doctor prepares to make the ultimate sacrifice.', 'After defeating the Rani and Omega, the Doctor prepares to make the ultimate sacrifice.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BZGM3ZTAzOGUtMThlYS00MmZmLWJmNWUtNGU3MmMyZjA3MmE3XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:doctor-who-regeneration-2026'),
  ('337984087734859117', 'Doctor Who: The Curse of Fatal Death', 1999, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'John Henderson, Chris Howard', 'Steven Moffat', 'Rowan Atkinson, Julia Sawalha, Jonathan Pryce, Richard E. Grant, Jim Broadbent, Hugh Grant, Joanna Lumley, Roy Skelton', null, 'Before the Doctor can settle down to married life, he must face one last confrontation with his deadly enemy of certain death - the Master.', 'Before the Doctor can settle down to married life, he must face one last confrontation with his deadly enemy of certain death - the Master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jV3HsAwKmc6jW2V5eXl7Oh2SyID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255466'),
  ('846706867726984120', 'Doctor Who: The Doctor, the Widow and the Wardrobe', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Farren Blackburn, Stephan Pehrsson', 'Steven Moffat', 'Matt Smith, Karen Gillan, Arthur Darvill, Claire Skinner, Maurice Cole, Holly Earl, Alexander Armstrong, Sam Stockman', 'PG', 'It''s Christmas Eve, 1938, when Madge Arwell comes to the aid of an injured Spaceman Angel as she cycles home. He promises to repay her kindness - all she has to do is make a wish.', 'It''s Christmas Eve, 1938, when Madge Arwell comes to the aid of an injured Spaceman Angel as she cycles home. He promises to repay her kindness - all she has to do is make a wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yJ2HKPsIXYhn8cqTClvvuoZyX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315623'),
  ('91718493489299377', 'Doctor Who: The Five Doctors', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Peter Moffatt', 'Terrance Dicks', 'Peter Davison, Jon Pertwee, Patrick Troughton, Richard Hurndall, Tom Baker, William Hartnell, Janet Fielding, Mark Strickson', null, 'Many incarnations of the Doctors and their old companions are taken out of time and deposited in the Death Zone on Gallifrey. There, they must battle the Master, Daleks, Cybermen and Yeti in order to reach the Dark Tower and discover the Tomb of Rassilon.', 'Many incarnations of the Doctors and their old companions are taken out of time and deposited in the Death Zone on Gallifrey. There, they must battle the Master, Daleks, Cybermen and Yeti in order to reach the Dark Tower and discover the Tomb of Rassilon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7HvlqH579n6LRs4eSsGve8Yvii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568901'),
  ('1046505062345614780', 'Doctor Who: The Husbands of River Song', 2015, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Suzie Lavelle, Douglas Mackinnon', 'Steven Moffat', 'Peter Capaldi, Alex Kingston, Greg Davies, Matt Lucas, Phillip Rhys, Rowan Polonski, Robert Curtis, Anthony Cozens', null, 'It’s Christmas Day on a remote human colony and the Doctor is hiding from Christmas Carols and Comedy Antlers. But when a crashed spaceship calls upon the Doctor for help, he finds himself recruited into River Song’s squad and hurled into a fast and frantic chase across the galaxy. King Hydroflax is furious, and his giant Robot bodyguard is out-of-control and coming for them all! Will Nardole survive? And when will River Song work out who the Doctor is? All will be revealed on a starliner full of galactic super-villains and a destination the Doctor has been avoiding for a very long time.', 'It’s Christmas Day on a remote human colony and the Doctor is hiding from Christmas Carols and Comedy Antlers. But when a crashed spaceship calls upon the Doctor for help, he finds himself recruited into River Song’s squad and hurled into a fast and frantic chase across the galaxy. King Hydroflax is furious, and his giant Robot bodyguard is out-of-control and coming for them all! Will Nardole survive? And when will River Song work out who the Doctor is? All will be revealed on a starliner full of galactic super-villains and a destination the Doctor has been avoiding for a very long time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ettlSCoR5YhEoXx5b7JWwzstASz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371759'),
  ('460265755970658953', 'Doctor Who: The Infinite Quest', 2007, 'Science Fiction, Animation, TV Movie', 'Gary Russell', 'Alan Barnes', 'David Tennant, Freema Agyeman, Anthony Stewart Head, Toby Longworth, Liza Tarbuck, Tom Farrelly, Lizzie Hopley, Paul Clayton', null, 'In this animated adventure, The Doctor and Martha Jones trek through space and time in a race against the galaxy''s greatest despot, Balthazar, to follow a complex trail of clues to discover the location of the legendary lost spaceship, the Infinite, which, according to myth, can grant anybody their heart''s desire.', 'In this animated adventure, The Doctor and Martha Jones trek through space and time in a race against the galaxy''s greatest despot, Balthazar, to follow a complex trail of clues to discover the location of the legendary lost spaceship, the Infinite, which, according to myth, can grant anybody their heart''s desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IZtghuqyJhwTCyWZT8ESsol0CB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223356'),
  ('697992592493354304', 'Doctor Who: The Next Doctor', 2008, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie, Mystery, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Andy Goddard, Ernest Vincze', 'Russell T Davies', 'David Tennant, David Morrissey, Dervla Kirwan, Velile Tshabalala, Ruari Mears, Paul Kasey, Neil McDermott, Nicholas Briggs', null, 'The Doctor arrives in Victorian London. It''s Christmas, but snow isn''t the only thing descending on the tranquil and jubilant civilization, as familiar silver giants from an alternate reality are amassing in numbers. The Cybermen are on the move again, and the only beings who can stop them are the Doctor and... another Doctor?', 'The Doctor arrives in Victorian London. It''s Christmas, but snow isn''t the only thing descending on the tranquil and jubilant civilization, as familiar silver giants from an alternate reality are amassing in numbers. The Cybermen are on the move again, and the only beings who can stop them are the Doctor and... another Doctor?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDqIMVtDx9UuexVJVNXUxUrHfJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317190'),
  ('741715763650067748', 'Doctor Who: The Night of the Doctor', 2013, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama', 'John Hayes', 'Steven Moffat', 'Paul McGann, Emma Campbell-Jones, Clare Higgins, John Hurt', null, 'The Doctor struggles to help the only remaining crewmember of a crashing gunship. The people of the planet below offer to save his life, but at a dear cost to the life he''s lived for hundreds of years.', 'The Doctor struggles to help the only remaining crewmember of a crashing gunship. The people of the planet below offer to save his life, but at a dear cost to the life he''s lived for hundreds of years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMVneky00Xkq3bV8DlWeR2OL2mM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410714'),
  ('945055699731765822', 'Doctor Who: The Runaway Bride', 2006, 'Science Fiction', 'Euros Lyn, Rory Taylor', 'Russell T Davies', 'David Tennant, Catherine Tate, Sarah Parish, Don Gilet, Howard Attfield, Jacqueline King, Trevor Michael Georges, Glen Wilson', null, 'A young bride in the midst of her wedding finds herself mysteriously transported to the TARDIS. The Doctor must discover what her connection is with the Empress of the Racnoss''s plan to destroy the world.', 'A young bride in the midst of her wedding finds herself mysteriously transported to the TARDIS. The Doctor must discover what her connection is with the Empress of the Racnoss''s plan to destroy the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LQlTuvlDR44RMO09aZ1ejhdLET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282758'),
  ('452777176112716780', 'Doctor Who: The Snowmen', 2012, 'TV Movie, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama, Family', 'Saul Metzstein, Saul Metzstein, Andy Pryor', 'Steven Moffat', 'Matt Smith, Jenna Coleman, Richard E. Grant, Dan Starkey, Catrin Stewart, Neve McIntosh, Tom Ward, Liz White', null, 'The Doctor has retired to 1892 London. Despite the protests of his allies, he is determined to keep out of mankind''s affairs. However, a governess named Clara has stumbled upon a plot which only the Doctor can unravel, involving the death of her predecessor in ice and the sinister Dr. Simeon, who controls monsters made of sentient snow. And there is another mystery afoot: Clara is the spitting image of Oswin Oswald, whom the Doctor saw die in the Dalek asylum...', 'The Doctor has retired to 1892 London. Despite the protests of his allies, he is determined to keep out of mankind''s affairs. However, a governess named Clara has stumbled upon a plot which only the Doctor can unravel, involving the death of her predecessor in ice and the sinister Dr. Simeon, who controls monsters made of sentient snow. And there is another mystery afoot: Clara is the spitting image of Oswin Oswald, whom the Doctor saw die in the Dalek asylum...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JEGsCbGcNiF0WUyoqL0ACmAjFi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369145'),
  ('97681840892257976', 'Doctor Who: The Waters of Mars', 2009, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Graeme Harper, Ernest Vincze', 'Russell T Davies, Phil Ford', 'David Tennant, Lindsay Duncan, Peter O''Brien, Sharon Duncan-Brewster, Gemma Chan, Aleksandar Mikic, Michael Goldsmith, Cosima Shaw', null, 'In a Mars base, the inhabitants are being infected by a mysterious water creature which takes over its victims. The Doctor is thrust into the middle of this catastrophe, knowing a larger one is waiting around the corner.', 'In a Mars base, the inhabitants are being infected by a mysterious water creature which takes over its victims. The Doctor is thrust into the middle of this catastrophe, knowing a larger one is waiting around the corner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikb6cZI8RXUqcxApMJmIdimAJ1X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281979'),
  ('760623250597663820', 'Doctor Who: Time Crash', 2007, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Rory Taylor, Graeme Harper', 'Steven Moffat', 'David Tennant, Peter Davison, Freema Agyeman', null, 'After Martha Jones parts company with the Doctor, his TARDIS collides with another, and he comes face to face with one of his previous incarnations.', 'After Martha Jones parts company with the Doctor, his TARDIS collides with another, and he comes face to face with one of his previous incarnations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXX7KUd8EQuJD0CQo8ofpU50Bn6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419786'),
  ('202526570704818228', 'Doctor Who: Twice Upon a Time', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Rachel Talalay, Richard Stoddard, Ian Adrian', 'Steven Moffat', 'Peter Capaldi, David Bradley, Mark Gatiss, Pearl Mackie, Nikki Amuka-Bird, Toby Whithouse, Lily Travers, Jared Garfield', null, 'As the Twelfth Doctor nears regeneration, he stumbles on his first incarnation, also refusing to change. It takes a captain, a glass avatar and a familiar face to convince the Doctors the universe still needs them.', 'As the Twelfth Doctor nears regeneration, he stumbles on his first incarnation, also refusing to change. It takes a captain, a glass avatar and a familiar face to convince the Doctors the universe still needs them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyJzCfbTlzSkaXWqFd0SffeRH2R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495151'),
  ('664087225645930977', 'Doctor Who: Voyage of the Damned', 2007, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie, Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'James Strong, Ernest Vincze', 'Russell T Davies', 'David Tennant, Kylie Minogue, Russell Tovey, Jimmy Vee, Clive Swift, George Costigan, Geoffrey Palmer, Gray O''Brien', null, 'When disaster hits the Titanic, the Doctor uncovers a threat to the whole human race. Battling alongside aliens, saboteurs, robot Angels and a new friend called Astrid, can he stop the Christmas inferno?', 'When disaster hits the Titanic, the Doctor uncovers a threat to the whole human race. Battling alongside aliens, saboteurs, robot Angels and a new friend called Astrid, can he stop the Christmas inferno?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYezMPWGBrlNGEok6mEizkl4HUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335209'),
  ('19131576195037039', 'Doctor X', 1932, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Michael Curtiz, Ray Rennahan, Richard Towers', 'Robert Tasker, Earl Baldwin, George Rosener', 'Lionel Atwill, Fay Wray, Lee Tracy, Preston Foster, John Wray, Harry Beresford, Arthur Edmund Carewe, Leila Bennett', null, 'A wisecracking New York reporter intrudes on a research scientist''s quest to unmask The Moon Killer.', 'A wisecracking New York reporter intrudes on a research scientist''s quest to unmask The Moon Killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8hlncTkxO58t5KAvNRTXnm29Ii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3574'),
  ('961199947876960458', 'Doctor Zhivago', 1965, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'David Lean, Freddie Young, José María Ochoa', 'Robert Bolt', 'Omar Sharif, Julie Christie, Geraldine Chaplin, Rod Steiger, Alec Guinness, Tom Courtenay, Siobhán McKenna, Ralph Richardson', 'PG-13', 'The life of a Russian physician and poet who, although married to another, falls in love with a political activist''s wife and experiences hardship during World War I and then the October Revolution.', 'The life of a Russian physician and poet who, although married to another, falls in love with a political activist''s wife and experiences hardship during World War I and then the October Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0Iv2BiCFYDnzc6uU1q3AJ56igT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:907'),
  ('740332625269017660', 'Doctors'' Wives', 1971, 'Drama', 'Philip L. Parslow, George Schaefer, John M. Poer', 'Daniel Taradash', 'Dyan Cannon, Richard Crenna, Gene Hackman, Carroll O''Connor, Rachel Roberts, Janice Rule, Diana Sands, Cara Williams', 'R', 'The wives of several high-powered doctors feel neglected due to their husbands'' focus on their careers, so they embark on a regimen of sex, drugs and booze.', 'The wives of several high-powered doctors feel neglected due to their husbands'' focus on their careers, so they embark on a regimen of sex, drugs and booze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRshcixd0dLfI2lsX63ys1PaZcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200236'),
  ('691325153502603169', 'Document of the Dead', 1981, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Roy Frumkes, Reeves Lehmann', 'Roy Frumkes', 'George A. Romero, Tom Savini, Susan Tyrrell, Ken Foree, Roy Frumkes, John Amplas, David Emge, Christine Forrest', 'NR', 'A documentary about George A. Romero''s films, with a behind scenes look at Dawn of the Dead.', 'A documentary about George A. Romero''s films, with a behind scenes look at Dawn of the Dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSP1917ituww6bt9hMMVHnDRkKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87489'),
  ('679238892236820268', 'Documenteur', 1982, 'Drama', 'Agnès Varda, Bob Carr, Nurith Aviv', 'Agnès Varda', 'Sabine Mamou, Mathieu Demy, Lisa Blok-Linson, Tina Odom, Gary Feldman, Charles Southwood, Chris Leplus, Andrew Meyer', null, 'After separating from the father of her son, a young French woman tries to find lodging and a fresh start in L.A. for herself and her son.', 'After separating from the father of her son, a young French woman tries to find lodging and a fresh start in L.A. for herself and her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmfyf1qlkSigmiJf3c7Wu0528vt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157160'),
  ('553072520611459038', 'Dodes''ka-den', 1970, 'Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Takao Saitō', 'Akira Kurosawa, Shinobu Hashimoto, Hideo Oguni', 'Yoshitaka Zushi, Kin Sugai, Toshiyuki Tonomura, Shinsuke Minami, Yūko Kusunoki, Junzaburō Ban, Kiyoko Tange, Michio Hino', null, 'On a Tokyo dump’s shantytown edge, interwoven vignettes follow residents scraping by: a boy who “drives” an imaginary trolley, a homeless father and son designing a dream house, a young woman brutalized at home, drunks, schemers, and saints of small kindnesses. Kurosawa crafts a ragged mosaic of hardship, fantasy, and flickers of grace that keep people moving forward.', 'On a Tokyo dump’s shantytown edge, interwoven vignettes follow residents scraping by: a boy who “drives” an imaginary trolley, a homeless father and son designing a dream house, a young woman brutalized at home, drunks, schemers, and saints of small kindnesses. Kurosawa crafts a ragged mosaic of hardship, fantasy, and flickers of grace that keep people moving forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gP9pM94ATcZGfKQ3faKy0a3dVIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33205'),
  ('60054576047154560', 'Dodge City', 1939, 'Western', 'Michael Curtiz, Leo F. Forbstein, Sherry Shourds', 'Robert Buckner', 'Errol Flynn, Olivia de Havilland, Ann Sheridan, Bruce Cabot, Frank McHugh, Alan Hale, John Litel, Henry Travers', 'NR', 'In this epic Western, Wade Hatton, a wagon master turned sheriff, tames a cow town at the end of a railroad line.', 'In this epic Western, Wade Hatton, a wagon master turned sheriff, tames a cow town at the end of a railroad line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iySSQEAlvr87OYLA5aLzBU8q9lJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17660'),
  ('842137898031647091', 'DodgeBall: A True Underdog Story', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Jerzy Zieliński, Rawson Marshall Thurber, Darrell Woodard', 'Rawson Marshall Thurber', 'Vince Vaughn, Christine Taylor, Ben Stiller, Rip Torn, Justin Long, Stephen Root, Joel David Moore, Chris Williams', 'PG-13', 'When megalomaniacal White Goodman, the owner of a trendy, high-end fitness center, makes a move to take over the struggling local gym run by happy-go-lucky Pete La Fleur, there''s only one way for La Fleur to fight back: dodgeball. Aided by a dodgeball guru and Goodman''s attorney, La Fleur and his rag-tag team of underdogs launch a knock-down, drag-out battle in which the winner takes all.', 'When megalomaniacal White Goodman, the owner of a trendy, high-end fitness center, makes a move to take over the struggling local gym run by happy-go-lucky Pete La Fleur, there''s only one way for La Fleur to fight back: dodgeball. Aided by a dodgeball guru and Goodman''s attorney, La Fleur and his rag-tag team of underdogs launch a knock-down, drag-out battle in which the winner takes all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8KbNHkkwFXLjV1suGwm0Qjure5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9472'),
  ('422440765886575545', 'Dodging the Clock', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Ricardo Trogi, Jean-François Lord', 'Jean-Philippe Pearson, Patrice Robitaille, Ricardo Trogi', 'Patrice Robitaille, Pierre-François Legendre, Jean-Philippe Pearson, Catherine Proulx-Lemay, Julie Perreault, Geneviève Alarie, Claude Despins, Hugo Giroux', null, 'The passage of time is probably the only concrete proof we have that justice exists in this cruel world. Some people would like to stop time in its tracks, while others choose to follow its path. In this story, three men in their early thirties have reached that age when it''s time to start thinking about "getting a life", perhaps starting a family. But how do you handle the fact that your friendships are changing? That, slowly, your new family is becoming the center of your ever-shrinking world? What do you do when you realize your youth is a thing of the past?', 'The passage of time is probably the only concrete proof we have that justice exists in this cruel world. Some people would like to stop time in its tracks, while others choose to follow its path. In this story, three men in their early thirties have reached that age when it''s time to start thinking about "getting a life", perhaps starting a family. But how do you handle the fact that your friendships are changing? That, slowly, your new family is becoming the center of your ever-shrinking world? What do you do when you realize your youth is a thing of the past?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zMilKNtdEeb2OiWRWL6rcnNdle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44791'),
  ('1082109922976339609', 'Dodsworth', 1936, 'Drama, Romance', 'William Wyler, Alfred Newman, Edmond F. Bernoudy', 'Sidney Howard', 'Walter Huston, Ruth Chatterton, Paul Lukas, Mary Astor, David Niven, Gregory Gaye, Maria Ouspenskaya, Odette Myrtil', 'NR', 'A retired auto manufacturer and his wife take a long-planned European vacation only to find that they want very different things from life.', 'A retired auto manufacturer and his wife take a long-planned European vacation only to find that they want very different things from life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpd9P54mLYvzdC6rBz56is8aeDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31507'),
  ('65737110326205418', 'Dofus - Book I: Julith', 2016, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jean-Jacques Denis, Anthony Roux', 'Olivier Vanelle, Anthony Roux', 'Sauvane Delanoe, Laeticia Lefebvre, Elisabeth Ventura, Emmanuel Gradi, Jean-Claude Donda, Claire Baradat, Bernard Alane, Marc Saez', null, 'The strange little guy in the blue hood is well known to Krosmoz. His name is Joris and he''s proposing to take you on a fantastic adventure. Our hero is leading a happy life in his magic shop in the city of Bonta. But one day, when he seeks out his idol, a Gobbowl superstar, everything changes for the worst as Julith, the vengeful witch, is back in town!', 'The strange little guy in the blue hood is well known to Krosmoz. His name is Joris and he''s proposing to take you on a fantastic adventure. Our hero is leading a happy life in his magic shop in the city of Bonta. But one day, when he seeks out his idol, a Gobbowl superstar, everything changes for the worst as Julith, the vengeful witch, is back in town!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRupT7qQEMWxZQMfeNPd0w05e3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289143'),
  ('1149014345325438815', 'Dog', 2001, 'Drama', 'Sarah Samuel, Carly Shenstone, Andrea Arnold', 'Andrea Arnold', 'Joanne Hill, Freddie Cunliffe, Veronica Valentine, Jimmy Woodham, Ronnie Woodham, John Arter, Russel Radford, Steve Jewson', null, 'A teenage girl gets ready to go out to meet her boyfriend, despite her mother''s loud verbal disapproval of her clothes. She goes out to a deserted area with him and he begins to touch her up and have sex with her, however a dog reveals the true nature of her boyfriend.', 'A teenage girl gets ready to go out to meet her boyfriend, despite her mother''s loud verbal disapproval of her clothes. She goes out to a deserted area with him and he begins to touch her up and have sex with her, however a dog reveals the true nature of her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vvJwtpmqTwAkpDNHfGsphVNxYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231218'),
  ('366112187512739960', 'Dog', 2015, 'Drama', 'Esen Işık, Arzu Gamze Kılınç', 'Esen Isik', 'Oguzhan Sancar, Bekir Sevenkan, Beren Tuna, Barış Atay, Cagla Akalin, Salih Bademci, Cemal Toktas, Hakan Karsak', null, 'An ordinary day in the megacity of Istanbul: Ten-year-old Cemo sells paper tissues in the streets, Hayat is controlled by her husband and transsexual Ebru sells her body. All three have a secret love and they do everything that satisfies their longing, if only for a moment. An authentic, delicate and unsettling story about love and death and the Turkish society at the beginning of the 21st century.', 'An ordinary day in the megacity of Istanbul: Ten-year-old Cemo sells paper tissues in the streets, Hayat is controlled by her husband and transsexual Ebru sells her body. All three have a secret love and they do everything that satisfies their longing, if only for a moment. An authentic, delicate and unsettling story about love and death and the Turkish society at the beginning of the 21st century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IMrpKjeOWKgW6ZsvcSKmRGklR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362141'),
  ('1020407983853299438', 'Dog', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Samuel Benchetrit, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Samuel Benchetrit, Gábor Rassov', 'Vincent Macaigne, Vanessa Paradis, Bouli Lanners, Olivier Bisback, Tom Canivet, Éric De Staercke, Anton Kouzemin', null, 'Jacques Blanchot loses everything: his wife, his home, his job. He gradually alienates himself from the world around him. Until the day when the owner of a pet shop takes him in.', 'Jacques Blanchot loses everything: his wife, his home, his job. He gradually alienates himself from the world around him. Until the day when the owner of a pet shop takes him in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lm9uTE0O9En5xUpgkNmwCMBFUjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467414'),
