  ('410785493022310083', 'Dog 51', 2025, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Crime, Action', 'Cédric Jimenez, Fabien Vergez, Zineb Tamazit', 'Cédric Jimenez, Olivier Demangel', 'Gilles Lellouche, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Louis Garrel, Romain Duris, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Stéphane Bak, Hugo Dillon, Artus', 'NR', 'In the near future, Paris is divided into three zones that separate social classes, and no one can escape ALMA, a predictive AI that has revolutionized law enforcement. When ALMA’s creator is assassinated, Salia, a top agent, and Zem, a jaded cop, are forced to work together to solve a murder that may expose the dark secrets of the system they serve.', 'In the near future, Paris is divided into three zones that separate social classes, and no one can escape ALMA, a predictive AI that has revolutionized law enforcement. When ALMA’s creator is assassinated, Salia, a top agent, and Zem, a jaded cop, are forced to work together to solve a murder that may expose the dark secrets of the system they serve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olMvhbCRuhTbf6EMKxKGHi2on3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266798'),
  ('280932108695618781', 'Dog Barbos and Unusual Cross', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Leonid Gaidai, Konstantin Brovin, Lev Kushelevich', 'Leonid Gaidai', 'Georgiy Vitsin, Yuriy Nikulin, Yevgeni Morgunov', null, 'This is the very first silent slapstick comedy short about adventures of Worldly, Coward, and Fool. What''s more fun: fishing with worms, or dynamite? Three friends decided to have a blast! Unfortunately their dog Barbos just loves playing fetch. And this time that stick was used for blast fishing. Barbos saw people throwing a smoking stick in a water, and fetched it right back to his owners. The "unusual cross" part begins when owners try to outrun the dog with dynamite.', 'This is the very first silent slapstick comedy short about adventures of Worldly, Coward, and Fool. What''s more fun: fishing with worms, or dynamite? Three friends decided to have a blast! Unfortunately their dog Barbos just loves playing fetch. And this time that stick was used for blast fishing. Barbos saw people throwing a smoking stick in a water, and fetched it right back to his owners. The "unusual cross" part begins when owners try to outrun the dog with dynamite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzxuhvJCsphzWEh2wmhlrBNLvzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57780'),
  ('830082960281385000', 'Dog Bite Dog', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Cheang Pou-Soi, Jonathan Li Tsz-Chun, Edmond Fung Yuen-Man', 'Szeto Kam-Yuen, Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong, Melvin Li', 'Edison Chen, Sam Lee, Pei Pei Wei-Ying, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Lam Suet, Dominic Lam Ka-Wah, Ren Hao', null, 'A young Cambodian man who has been trained to fight for money in his country is hired to kill someone in Hong Kong. He performs the hit and then flees from Hong Kong police, who are wrestling with internal problems of a model cop and his son, who is also on the force and who was told by his dad not to become a police officer.', 'A young Cambodian man who has been trained to fight for money in his country is hired to kill someone in Hong Kong. He performs the hit and then flees from Hong Kong police, who are wrestling with internal problems of a model cop and his son, who is also on the force and who was told by his dad not to become a police officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itNA7ItpFZBeMfdI6MV7O9tnaKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14816'),
