  ('762141156635226336', 'Dog Lay Afternoon', 1976, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Skerl, Giuliana Gamba', 'George Eastman, Peter Skerl', 'Philippe March, Juliette Mayniel, Enrico Maria Salerno, Paul Müller, Ilona Staller, Franca Stoppi, Ennio Balbo, Leonora Fani', null, 'A young girl witnesses her mother having sex with the family dog. When her father finds out, he burns the dog alive. She is so traumatized by these incidents that she later turns into a nymphomaniac. She moves to an island and lives there with her own dog, having sex with various guests who visit her.', 'A young girl witnesses her mother having sex with the family dog. When her father finds out, he burns the dog alive. She is so traumatized by these incidents that she later turns into a nymphomaniac. She moves to an island and lives there with her own dog, having sex with various guests who visit her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOtgea9A4ivV9OzdXsjEwmxLljR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133980'),
