  ('933645232309114678', 'Dog Soldiers', 2002, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Sam McCurdy, Neil Marshall, Stephanie Rass', 'Neil Marshall', 'Sean Pertwee, Kevin McKidd, Emma Cleasby, Liam Cunningham, Thomas Lockyer, Darren Morfitt, Chris Robson, Leslie Simpson', 'R', 'A band of soldiers is dispatched to war games deep in the woods. When they stumble across a rival team slaughtered in camp, they realize they''re not alone.', 'A band of soldiers is dispatched to war games deep in the woods. When they stumble across a rival team slaughtered in camp, they realize they''re not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYHUYWglzq8Ax0EaDWqg9emjL7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11880'),
  ('164791396691106646', 'Dog Star Man', 1965, 'Fantasy', 'Stan Brakhage, Stan Brakhage', 'Stan Brakhage', 'Stan Brakhage, Jane Wodening', null, 'Experimental film following a cycle of seasons as well as the stretch of a single day as a man and his dog slowly ascend a mountain.', 'Experimental film following a cycle of seasons as well as the stretch of a single day as a man and his dog slowly ascend a mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZbENblOS67gRW3s0LJBj00m1CL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420240'),
  ('554365963766302392', 'Dog Star Man: Part I', 1963, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'Stan Brakhage, Jane Wodening', null, 'From a murky landscape, a wooded mountain emerges. We watch the sun. We see a bearded man climbing up the mountain through the snow. He carries an ax, and he''s accompanied by a dog. His labors continue. There is no soundtrack. Images rush past - water, trees, and surfaces too close up to distinguish. He struggles. A fire burns. Nature, in long shots and magnified, is formidable and silent. It''s tough going; he carries on. In a capillary, blood flows.', 'From a murky landscape, a wooded mountain emerges. We watch the sun. We see a bearded man climbing up the mountain through the snow. He carries an ax, and he''s accompanied by a dog. His labors continue. There is no soundtrack. Images rush past - water, trees, and surfaces too close up to distinguish. He struggles. A fire burns. Nature, in long shots and magnified, is formidable and silent. It''s tough going; he carries on. In a capillary, blood flows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnm7c0SBOadnZ29OGApRm4aRtbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85110'),
  ('1032250142312292856', 'Dog Star Man: Part II', 1964, 'Drama', 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'A man, accompanied by a dog, struggles through snow on a mountain side. We see film stock blister; drawn square shapes appear. Then, we see an infant''s face. The images of struggling climber, baby, blurred film stock, large snow flakes, and what may be microscopic details of matter are superimposed on each other, one dominating the frame briefly to be replaced by another. As the man falls in the snow and tries to regain his feet, the baby continues to appear, first with eyes closed. Alternately, images rush by - montages of paper cutouts and life under a microscope.', 'A man, accompanied by a dog, struggles through snow on a mountain side. We see film stock blister; drawn square shapes appear. Then, we see an infant''s face. The images of struggling climber, baby, blurred film stock, large snow flakes, and what may be microscopic details of matter are superimposed on each other, one dominating the frame briefly to be replaced by another. As the man falls in the snow and tries to regain his feet, the baby continues to appear, first with eyes closed. Alternately, images rush by - montages of paper cutouts and life under a microscope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f42jSZw0ey8TpFGKqcnHE82GxHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127148'),
  ('607959100628059124', 'Dog Star Man: Part III', 1964, 'Drama', 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'Stan Brakhage, Jane Wodening', null, 'Sexual intimacy. Three kinds of images race past, superimposed on each other sometimes: two bodies, a man and a woman''s, close up, nude - patches of skin, wisps of hair, glimpses of a face and genitalia; strips of celluloid with lines and squiggles scratched on them; and, close-up shots of what appear to be the insides of living bodies - a heart beating, muscle and sinew and tissue wet with fluids. The exterior and interior of desire.', 'Sexual intimacy. Three kinds of images race past, superimposed on each other sometimes: two bodies, a man and a woman''s, close up, nude - patches of skin, wisps of hair, glimpses of a face and genitalia; strips of celluloid with lines and squiggles scratched on them; and, close-up shots of what appear to be the insides of living bodies - a heart beating, muscle and sinew and tissue wet with fluids. The exterior and interior of desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eUMwQt7hV12kbyPxQfBpmKOQWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127320'),
  ('736089121370776413', 'Dog Star Man: Part IV', 1964, 'Drama', 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'Stan Brakhage, Jane Wodening', null, 'A man is supine on a mountain side. Images rush past of nature and a stained glass saint. An infant is born. We see a lactating nipple. Images include a mountain peak, farm buildings, a tree stump, a fire, a crawling baby, and the sun. The man falls and rolls. Then, later, he swings his ax.', 'A man is supine on a mountain side. Images rush past of nature and a stained glass saint. An infant is born. We see a lactating nipple. Images include a mountain peak, farm buildings, a tree stump, a fire, a crawling baby, and the sun. The man falls and rolls. Then, later, he swings his ax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4utOPtqb6VpFR7zNzlXziUOaq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127323'),
  ('22718812092653217', 'Dog Tags', 1987, 'Drama', 'Romano Scavolini', 'Romano Scavolini', 'Clive Wood, Baird Stafford, Robert Haufrecht, Peter Ehlich, Mike Monty, Jim Gaines, Robert Marius, David Anderson', null, 'POW''s rescued from tiger cages in Vietnam are brought into a secret mission by an Army Captain. However when the group finds a cache of gold, greed sets in and the mission goes awry.', 'POW''s rescued from tiger cages in Vietnam are brought into a secret mission by an Army Captain. However when the group finds a cache of gold, greed sets in and the mission goes awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJIl9fXqRQ9rQyV5ThG6JdBt4c1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123730'),
  ('403892036550242772', 'Dog Tags', 2008, 'Drama', 'Damion Dietz', 'Damion Dietz', 'Paul Preiss, Hoyt Richards, Candy Clark, Keythe Farley, Diane Davisson, Bart Fletcher, Barry Ratcliffe, Chris Carlisle', null, 'Raised in a single parent family by his mother Nate Merritt, develops a friendship with a gay man whilst on leave from the US marines.', 'Raised in a single parent family by his mother Nate Merritt, develops a friendship with a gay man whilst on leave from the US marines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wV1kYlJBBep9HmfHbHkodqVD6nO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19235'),
  ('1005777782393424871', 'Dog Trouble', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Lillian Randolph, Billy Bletcher', 'NR', 'Tom''s chasing Jerry when he runs right into a sleeping dog and the two of them must work together to fend him off.', 'Tom''s chasing Jerry when he runs right into a sleeping dog and the two of them must work together to fend him off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xU0HTmtqCrfrySNyHgCgQhAquV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39920'),
  ('211426629530409623', 'Dog Watch', 1945, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'As a ship''s crew is on shore leave, seadog Pluto is left to stand watch. He sees a threatening shape, but it turns out to be a cache of bones. He grabs one and settles in contentedly. A rat sneaks on, and Pluto springs into action. The rat toys with him, until it finds the officer''s mess. He bribes Pluto, until he hears an officer approaching. The rat hides, and Pluto gets thrown in the brig, while the rat sneaks off with his sandwich. But Pluto gets even.', 'As a ship''s crew is on shore leave, seadog Pluto is left to stand watch. He sees a threatening shape, but it turns out to be a cache of bones. He grabs one and settles in contentedly. A rat sneaks on, and Pluto springs into action. The rat toys with him, until it finds the officer''s mess. He bribes Pluto, until he hears an officer approaching. The rat hides, and Pluto gets thrown in the brig, while the rat sneaks off with his sandwich. But Pluto gets even.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogA6xBDaewsRrVbQjJdMbtCMUP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68493'),
  ('181876469195482142', 'Dog Watch', 1997, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert D. Yeoman, John Langley', 'Martin Zurla', 'Sam Elliott, Esai Morales, Paul Sorvino, Dan Lauria, Richard Gilliland, Jessica Steen, Mimi Craven, Richard Zavaglia', 'R', 'A San Francisco detective goes wild when he discovers his partner dead and the presumed culprit standing over him. After beating the man to death, he comes to his senses and realizes that he has to get rid of the body of the beaten man. Dumping the man in the river, he returns to his partner''s body and calls in the death. He is then given a new partner and is assigned to investigate the death of a man just pulled from the river causing all the expected problems. However, the investigation does lead to police corruption and his own partner''s involvement in drug running.', 'A San Francisco detective goes wild when he discovers his partner dead and the presumed culprit standing over him. After beating the man to death, he comes to his senses and realizes that he has to get rid of the body of the beaten man. Dumping the man in the river, he returns to his partner''s body and calls in the death. He is then given a new partner and is assigned to investigate the death of a man just pulled from the river causing all the expected problems. However, the investigation does lead to police corruption and his own partner''s involvement in drug running.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbsxAUxealK4Go5JnG2Wr5c4CDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152597'),
  ('196084192650667162', 'Dog Years', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Fabio Mollo, Martina Cocco', 'Mary Stella Brugiati, Alessandro Bosi', 'Aurora Giovinazzo, Isabella Mottinelli, Federico Cesari, Luca Vannuccini, Romana Maggiora Vergano, Paola Gioia Kaze Formisano, Marta Losito, Tingting Jia', null, 'Stella is a clumsy, cynical, imaginative and tormented teenage girl. After a life-changing car accident involving a dog, she convinces herself she must count her age in dog years: one year of her life counts for seven, and now that she’s turning sixteen, she is a centennial. For this reason, Stella thinks she has not much time left to live and pens a bucket list of all the things she would like to achieve before she dies.', 'Stella is a clumsy, cynical, imaginative and tormented teenage girl. After a life-changing car accident involving a dog, she convinces herself she must count her age in dog years: one year of her life counts for seven, and now that she’s turning sixteen, she is a centennial. For this reason, Stella thinks she has not much time left to live and pens a bucket list of all the things she would like to achieve before she dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7KFEbhEmoKY3N1AnK2MlmYBWCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806950'),
  ('273901221844053154', 'Dog''s Dialogue', 1987, 'Crime, Drama', 'Raúl Ruiz, Denis Lenoir', 'Raúl Ruiz, Nicole Muchnik', 'Eva Simonet, Robert Darmel, Silke Humel, Frank Lesne, Marie Christine Poisot, Hugo Santiago, Genevieve Such, Laurence Such', null, 'A charming tale of murder, perversity and narrative echoes told through shots of barking dogs and a La jetée-like series of stills.', 'A charming tale of murder, perversity and narrative echoes told through shots of barking dogs and a La jetée-like series of stills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hINTLyIZIR8VRrhRk2NvFKilLtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150843'),
  ('97089981069481767', 'Dogboys', 1998, 'TV Movie, Action, Drama', 'Ken Russell, Jamie Thompson', 'Rob Stork', 'Bryan Brown, Dean Cain, Tia Carrere, Ken James, Sean McCann, Richard Chevolleau, Hardee T. Lineham, Von Flores', 'PG-13', 'Marine veteran and former middleweight boxing champion Julian Taylor loses control in a bar fight and ends up serving time for aggravated assault. Soon after his arrival, Julian is introduced to Captain Brown, a menacing, overbearing guard who tags him "Dogboy" and orders him to a claustrophobic dormitory called the doghouse. There, Julian meets fellow inmate Willy Owens and learns that the prison''s vicious attack dogs are used to catch and kill escaping prisoners.', 'Marine veteran and former middleweight boxing champion Julian Taylor loses control in a bar fight and ends up serving time for aggravated assault. Soon after his arrival, Julian is introduced to Captain Brown, a menacing, overbearing guard who tags him "Dogboy" and orders him to a claustrophobic dormitory called the doghouse. There, Julian meets fellow inmate Willy Owens and learns that the prison''s vicious attack dogs are used to catch and kill escaping prisoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojNKxddfCz2nXjIyXEeYWLUaShr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142147'),
  ('484815944440893068', 'Dogfight', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nancy Savoca, Bobby Bukowski, Frank Kostenko Jr.', 'Bob Comfort', 'River Phoenix, Lili Taylor, Richard Panebianco, Anthony Clark, Mitchell Whitfield, Holly Near, E. G. Daily, Sue Morales', 'R', 'In the fall of 1963, Eddie Birdlace is an 18-year-old Marine Corps volunteer who is about to ship out with three of his buddies for a tour of duty in Vietnam. Planning a massive blowout for their last night in San Francisco, Eddie, his buddies, and a number of other Marines set up a contest they call a "dogfight”.', 'In the fall of 1963, Eddie Birdlace is an 18-year-old Marine Corps volunteer who is about to ship out with three of his buddies for a tour of duty in Vietnam. Planning a massive blowout for their last night in San Francisco, Eddie, his buddies, and a number of other Marines set up a contest they call a "dogfight”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sEJy723hW629jzzX8H5k5MTVMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14667'),
  ('851068050785071052', 'Doggone Tired', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tex Avery, Scott Bradley', null, 'Bea Benaderet, Daws Butler', 'NR', 'A rabbit tries all he can to keep a hunting dog awake before tomorrow''s big hunt.', 'A rabbit tries all he can to keep a hunting dog awake before tomorrow''s big hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3Huldl4YtgvHWrypIeBNZ74QtB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84753'),
  ('707646206796154014', 'Doghead', 2006, 'Drama', 'Santi Amodeo, Álex Catalán', 'Santi Amodeo', 'Juan José Ballesta, Adriana Ugarte, Cristina Domínguez, Manuel Alexandre, Jordi Dauder, Reyes Bergali, Cristina de Inza, Josu Eguskiza', null, 'A drama about a boy who lives in a bubble because of a rare brain disease.', 'A drama about a boy who lives in a bubble because of a rare brain disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uMk8VPBGOPGqkYZtaS5R8LDziY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115093'),
  ('1032458185528288301', 'Doghouse', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jake West, Michael Button, Daniela Faggio', 'Dan Schaffer', 'Stephen Graham, Danny Dyer, Noel Clarke, Emil Marwa, Lee Ingleby, Keith-Lee Castle, Christina Cole, Terry Stone', null, 'A group of men, heading to a remote village to help one of their friends get over his divorce, soon discover that all the women have been infected with a virus that makes them man-hating cannibals.', 'A group of men, heading to a remote village to help one of their friends get over his divorce, soon discover that all the women have been infected with a virus that makes them man-hating cannibals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XBd0TLZRcnSpbeEyoYRxxDCafJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20606'),
  ('357045888592655729', 'Dogma', 1999, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Robert D. Yeoman, Kevin Smith, James Alan Hensz', 'Kevin Smith', 'Ben Affleck, Matt Damon, Linda Fiorentino, Salma Hayek Pinault, Jason Lee, Jason Mewes, Alan Rickman, Chris Rock', 'R', 'An abortion clinic worker with a special heritage is called upon to save the existence of humanity from being negated by two renegade angels trying to exploit a loophole and reenter Heaven.', 'An abortion clinic worker with a special heritage is called upon to save the existence of humanity from being negated by two renegade angels trying to exploit a loophole and reenter Heaven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxhHl2YokTqcP44QK5tiTgjgLgk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1832'),
  ('792828062527400752', 'Dogman', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Matteo Garrone, Nicolai Brüel, Andrea Tagliaferri', 'Massimo Gaudioso, Ugo Chiti, Matteo Garrone', 'Marcello Fonte, Edoardo Pesce, Nunzia Schiano, Adamo Dionisi, Francesco Acquaroli, Alida Baldari Calabria, Gianluca Gobbi, Laura Pizzirani', null, 'Marcello, a small and gentle dog groomer, finds himself involved in a dangerous relationship of subjugation with Simone, a former violent boxer who terrorizes the entire neighborhood. In an effort to reaffirm his dignity, Marcello will submit to an unexpected act of vengeance.', 'Marcello, a small and gentle dog groomer, finds himself involved in a dangerous relationship of subjugation with Simone, a former violent boxer who terrorizes the entire neighborhood. In an effort to reaffirm his dignity, Marcello will submit to an unexpected act of vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaZq1G8sJHv9f9a5IzioQlS3REX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483184'),
  ('399616568051756091', 'Dogman''s Rabies: Underdog', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Lapo Tirelli, Roberto Urbani, Francesco Ciccone', 'Antonio Lusci, Antonio Tentori, Sergio Stivaletti', 'Riccardo De Filippis, Virgilio Olivari, Romina Mondello, Gianni Franco, Romuald Kłos, Giovanni Lombardo Radice, Ottaviano Dell''Acqua, Luis Molteni', null, 'Inspired by one of the most savage and violent crimes committed in Rome in the 1980s, "Rabbia Furiosa" is the story of Fabio, a small-time neighborhood crook, known as “Er Canaro” (the Dog Man) who suffers years of abuse and mistreatment from Claudio, a local boss of the criminal underworld. When he is driven to desperation and the brink of madness, he will carry out a terrible and bloody act of vengeance...', 'Inspired by one of the most savage and violent crimes committed in Rome in the 1980s, "Rabbia Furiosa" is the story of Fabio, a small-time neighborhood crook, known as “Er Canaro” (the Dog Man) who suffers years of abuse and mistreatment from Claudio, a local boss of the criminal underworld. When he is driven to desperation and the brink of madness, he will carry out a terrible and bloody act of vengeance...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zduAS00UrlGmx4O51edtMHQxUdX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528769'),
  ('1091665268631769014', 'Dogora', 1964, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Horror', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Ken Sano', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Robert Dunham, Yōsuke Natsuki, Yōko Fujiyama, Hiroshi Koizumi, Susumu Fujita, Jun Tazaki, Nobuo Nakamura, Seizaburō Kawazu', null, 'A floating amorphous life-form descends from the atmosphere to consume carbon in the form of diamonds.', 'A floating amorphous life-form descends from the atmosphere to consume carbon in the form of diamonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLCbrX4tE9evZSRtkmZNYUlJDcS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62560'),
  ('963034968695728244', 'Dogra Magra', 1988, 'Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Toshio Matsumoto, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Toshio Matsumoto, Atsushi Yamatoya', 'Yoji Matsuda, Shijaku Katsura, Hideo Murota, Eri Misawa, Leo Morimoto, Jun Haichi, Kaori Kobayashi, Harukazu Kitami', null, 'A young man kills his bride on the day of his marriage and goes insane. He wakes up in an asylum with no memory, left in the hands of two mysterious doctors who relate his condition with his biological identity.', 'A young man kills his bride on the day of his marriage and goes insane. He wakes up in an asylum with no memory, left in the hands of two mysterious doctors who relate his condition with his biological identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ss6zWMdXWE7OsxXCqzirUBTTlQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91229'),
  ('995410567015492889', 'Dogs', 1976, 'Horror', 'Burt Brinckerhoff, Flora M. Gordon, Robert Steadman', 'O''Brian Tomalin', 'David McCallum, Sandra McCabe, George Wyner, Eric Server, Linda Gray, Dean Santoro, Holly Harris, Sterling Swanson', 'R', 'On the quiet campus of the remotely-located SouthWestern University, something strange is happening. All of the dogs in the area, once loyal, gentle pets, are now banding together in wild packs and hunting down their former masters. Could the strange transformation have anything to do with the secret government experiments being conducted in the school''s physics laboratory? More importantly, can the dogs be stopped before it''s too late?', 'On the quiet campus of the remotely-located SouthWestern University, something strange is happening. All of the dogs in the area, once loyal, gentle pets, are now banding together in wild packs and hunting down their former masters. Could the strange transformation have anything to do with the secret government experiments being conducted in the school''s physics laboratory? More importantly, can the dogs be stopped before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9QYxAoSeVaUdvFw9HEqmzPUbdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104528'),
  ('581940371418926314', 'Dogs Die Alone', 2023, 'Drama', 'Paolo Pisanu', null, 'Orlando Angius, Francesca Cavazzuti, Alessandro Gazale, Andrea Carbon', null, 'Rudi lives on petty crimes in his small world. He is sixty and he has spent most of his life on his own. He is feared and respected, he knows everything about this small world of his, but he doesn’t know that anything you leave behind can sometimes catch up, grab you and crush you. When he finds himself having to take care of his daughter Susanna, he is forced to come to terms with himself.', 'Rudi lives on petty crimes in his small world. He is sixty and he has spent most of his life on his own. He is feared and respected, he knows everything about this small world of his, but he doesn’t know that anything you leave behind can sometimes catch up, grab you and crush you. When he finds himself having to take care of his daughter Susanna, he is forced to come to terms with himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCt7ildIuRIVEAevEolRPL5BwOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1105364'),
  ('808104050876248007', 'Dogs Don''t Wear Pants', 2019, 'Drama', 'J-P Valkeapää, Teemu Liakka, Pietari Peltola', 'Juhana Lumme, J-P Valkeapää', 'Pekka Strang, Krista Kosonen, Ilona Huhta, Jani Volanen, Oona Airola, Iiris Anttila, Ester Geislerová, Samuel Shipway', null, 'A grieving heart surgeon struggling with the loss of his wife drifts through an emotionally detached life while raising his teenage daughter. His chance encounter with a dominatrix awakens feelings he thought were gone, drawing him into a dark and unconventional world where pain and desire intertwine.', 'A grieving heart surgeon struggling with the loss of his wife drifts through an emotionally detached life while raising his teenage daughter. His chance encounter with a dominatrix awakens feelings he thought were gone, drawing him into a dark and unconventional world where pain and desire intertwine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lTQrvsJOD16Hffiv0xv71txRod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524780'),
  ('957876654011139127', 'Dogs in Space', 1986, 'Drama, Music', 'Richard Lowenstein, Andrew de Groot', 'Richard Lowenstein', 'Michael Hutchence, Saskia Post, Nique Needles, Deanna Bond, Tony Helou, Chris Haywood, Peter Walsh, Laura Swanson', 'R', 'The place is Melbourne, Australia 1978. The punk phenomenon is sweeping the country and Dogs In Space, a punk group, are part of it. In a squat, in a dodgy suburb, live a ragtag collection of outcasts and don''t-wanna-bes who survive on a diet of old TV space films, drugs and good music. And the satellite SKYLAB could crash through their roof at any moment...', 'The place is Melbourne, Australia 1978. The punk phenomenon is sweeping the country and Dogs In Space, a punk group, are part of it. In a squat, in a dodgy suburb, live a ragtag collection of outcasts and don''t-wanna-bes who survive on a diet of old TV space films, drugs and good music. And the satellite SKYLAB could crash through their roof at any moment...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/170HfrEGMYMrHxceh27XCAe6J5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30994'),
  ('266752932506873589', 'Dogs of Hell', 1982, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Worth Keeter, Irl Dixon', 'Tom McIntyre', 'Earl Owensby, Bill Gribble, Kathy Hasty, Robert Bloodworth, Bob Duggan', 'R', 'A pack of Rottweilers, bred and trained by the U.S. military to kill humans, escape to ravage the peaceful mountain resort town of Lake Lure. It is up to the local sheriff to protect his small community.', 'A pack of Rottweilers, bred and trained by the U.S. military to kill humans, escape to ravage the peaceful mountain resort town of Lake Lure. It is up to the local sheriff to protect his small community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Yy6kd5rQkIcPOggAuZyJEjHrEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89710'),
  ('196085283893902419', 'Dogs of War!', 1923, 'Comedy, Family', 'Robert F. McGowan', 'Hal Roach', 'Harold Lloyd, Roy Brooks, Joe Cobb, Jackie Condon, Mickey Daniels, Sunshine Sammy Morrison, Allen ''Farina'' Hoskins, Clara Guiol', 'NR', 'The gang wages war using old vegetables as munitions. Later, they ruin a movie in progress when they double-expose the film.', 'The gang wages war using old vegetables as munitions. Later, they ruin a movie in progress when they double-expose the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tf6YSsTUI8hDespy2TNcMhNnVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175692'),
  ('445436066462053094', 'Dogtanian and the Three Muskehounds', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Toni García, Manuel Sirgo, Javier Ibañez', 'Claudio Biern Boyd', 'Miguel Ángel Pérez, Eduardo Jover, Gloria Cámara, Antonio Ramírez de Antón, Ana Esther Alborg, Ana María Marí, Luis Bajo, Carlos Kaniowsky', null, 'France, 17th century, under the reign of Louis XIII. Dogtanian is an impetuous and innocent peasant from Gascony, as well as a skilled swordsman, who travels to Paris with the purpose of making his dream come true: to join the Corps of Muskehounds of the Royal Guard.', 'France, 17th century, under the reign of Louis XIII. Dogtanian is an impetuous and innocent peasant from Gascony, as well as a skilled swordsman, who travels to Paris with the purpose of making his dream come true: to join the Corps of Muskehounds of the Royal Guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzc6gzLENIujnRIx7rUjN1FIhn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768726'),
  ('1087807231560077679', 'Dogtooth', 2009, 'Drama', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Christos Nikou, Thimios Bakatakis', 'Arturo Ripstein, José Emilio Pacheco', 'Christos Stergioglou, Michele Valley, Hristos Passalis, Angeliki Papoulia, Mary Tsoni, Anna Kalaitzidou, Steve Krikris, Sissi Petropoulou', 'NR', 'Three teenagers are confined to an isolated country estate that could very well be on another planet. The trio spend their days listening to endless homemade tapes that teach them a whole new vocabulary. Any word that comes from beyond their family abode is instantly assigned a new meaning. Hence ''the sea'' refers to a large armchair and ''zombies'' are little yellow flowers. Having invented a brother whom they claim to have ostracized for his disobedience, the uber-controlling parents terrorize their offspring into submission.', 'Three teenagers are confined to an isolated country estate that could very well be on another planet. The trio spend their days listening to endless homemade tapes that teach them a whole new vocabulary. Any word that comes from beyond their family abode is instantly assigned a new meaning. Hence ''the sea'' refers to a large armchair and ''zombies'' are little yellow flowers. Having invented a brother whom they claim to have ostracized for his disobedience, the uber-controlling parents terrorize their offspring into submission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBrhzHcOxXclTItkPzsJUCTSFyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38810'),
  ('596517203873511724', 'Dogtown and Z-Boys', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Peter Pilafian, Sebastian Jungwirth, Stacy Peralta', 'Stacy Peralta, Craig Stecyk', 'Jay Adams, Tony Alva, Stacy Peralta, Steve Caballero, Tony Hawk, Jeff Ament, Henry Rollins, Jeff Ho', 'PG-13', 'This award-winning, thrilling story is about a group of discarded kids who revolutionized skateboarding and shaped the attitude and culture of modern day extreme sports. Featuring old skool skating footage, exclusive interviews and a blistering rock soundtrack, DOGTOWN AND Z-BOYS captures the rise of the Zephyr skateboarding team from Venice''s Dogtown, a tough "locals only" beach with a legacy of outlaw surfing.', 'This award-winning, thrilling story is about a group of discarded kids who revolutionized skateboarding and shaped the attitude and culture of modern day extreme sports. Featuring old skool skating footage, exclusive interviews and a blistering rock soundtrack, DOGTOWN AND Z-BOYS captures the rise of the Zephyr skateboarding team from Venice''s Dogtown, a tough "locals only" beach with a legacy of outlaw surfing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eb02dpopuAhuThf7nXAAwKtAF88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1282'),
  ('979291213357115029', 'Dogville Confessions', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Sami Saif', null, 'Lars von Trier, Nicole Kidman, Paul Bettany, Blair Brown, Stellan Skarsgård, Harriet Andersson, Patricia Clarkson, Jeremy Davies', null, 'A documentary on the creation of Lars von Trier''s fascinating drama Dogville starring amongst others Nicole Kidman, Paul Bettany, Stellan Skarsgård, Ben Gazzara, Lauren Bacall and James Caan. Showcasing behind-the-scenes footage and providing a much deeper look inside the world of filmmaking including some moments of insight that are hard to believe.', 'A documentary on the creation of Lars von Trier''s fascinating drama Dogville starring amongst others Nicole Kidman, Paul Bettany, Stellan Skarsgård, Ben Gazzara, Lauren Bacall and James Caan. Showcasing behind-the-scenes footage and providing a much deeper look inside the world of filmmaking including some moments of insight that are hard to believe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Z9ZaWcndc0PzkNxUFL4Tw9Zvdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140278'),
  ('223703270488107300', 'Dogwashers', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Carlos Moreno, Juan Carlos Gil', 'Antonio García Ángel, Pilar Quintana', 'Christian Tappán, Anderson Ballesteros, Jhon Álex Toro, José Marino Angulo, Juan Martin Arancedo, Geovanni Marin Cardona, Jaime Andrés Castaño, Jhonnie Castillo', 'NR', 'When a narco past his prime refuses to pay a debt to an upstart, only a secret stash of money can save his men. But guess what the gardener just found?', 'When a narco past his prime refuses to pay a debt to an upstart, only a secret stash of money can save his men. But guess what the gardener just found?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uEilmHRJ2YElyZ9kSjrTUjEnTkt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:725649'),
  ('1064182573631454150', 'Dogwood Tree', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Nobuhiro Doi', 'Noriko Yoshida', 'Yui Aragaki, Toma Ikuta, Osamu Mukai, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Misako Renbutsu, Arata Iura, Yuichi Kimura, Yutaka Matsushige', null, 'A young girl tries to maintain a long-distance relationship with an aspiring fisherman.', 'A young girl tries to maintain a long-distance relationship with an aspiring fisherman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SdAQqiUNqmty61SIhcss6j3YnR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60604'),
  ('183465669748984393', 'Doi Boy', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Nontawat Numbenchapol, Rimvydas Leipus', 'Nontawat Numbenchapol', 'Awat Ratanapintha, Arak Amornsupasiri, Bhumibhat Thavornsiri, Panisara Rikulsurakan, Ornjira Lamwilai, Noomsang, Nattapong Mooring Phamon, Atthanee Tokeree', null, 'Sorn, an ethnic Shan sex worker, tries to build a future in Chiang Mai, Thailand, as a refugee far from home, but he is drawn into a complex relationship with one client, an investigator probing a political activist.', 'Sorn, an ethnic Shan sex worker, tries to build a future in Chiang Mai, Thailand, as a refugee far from home, but he is drawn into a complex relationship with one client, an investigator probing a political activist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFjNdswa8V8OyhwmhX31JB6ENkG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1082449'),
  ('767315220403073778', 'Doidas e Santas', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paulo Thiago, Marc Aymonin, Renata Biagiola', 'Pedro Antônio, Cláudia Gomes', 'Maria Paula, Georgiana Góes, Nicette Bruno, Marcelo Faria, Flávia Alessandra, Thiago Fragoso, Jonas Bloch, Luana Maia', null, 'Beatriz is a famous psychoanalyst who teaches others to be happy, but isn''t able to be happy herself. Things take a turn when her mother''s death takes her traveling with her sister to Buenos Aires to comply with the unusual directives she left in her will.', 'Beatriz is a famous psychoanalyst who teaches others to be happy, but isn''t able to be happy herself. Things take a turn when her mother''s death takes her traveling with her sister to Buenos Aires to comply with the unusual directives she left in her will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8QgAKmyOgIjydoky2w3ZmxUpMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336183'),
  ('931921810463154061', 'Doin'' Time', 1985, 'Comedy', 'George Mendeluk, Ronald Víctor García', 'Dee Caruso, Franelle Silver, Ron Zwang', 'Jeff Altman, Dey Young, Richard Mulligan, John Vernon, Jimmie Walker, Judy Landers, Colleen Camp, Muhammad Ali', 'R', 'Duke Jarrett is sent to jail at the John Dillinger prison. However, the prison looks more like a zoo, more or less ruled by the prisoners themselves.', 'Duke Jarrett is sent to jail at the John Dillinger prison. However, the prison looks more like a zoo, more or less ruled by the prisoners themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qT0BRPPB2qa5VMs0X9Mti4kREPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71911'),
  ('59008849478920112', 'Doin'' Time on Planet Earth', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Frank Bueno, Eric McLeod, Charles Matthau', 'Darren Star', 'Nicholas Strouse, Andrea Thompson, Martha Scott, Adam West, Hugh Gillin, Matt Adler, Timothy Patrick Murphy, Candice Azzara', 'PG', 'Ryan Richmond is an eccentric teenager living with his mother, father, sister and brother in the Holiday Inn they own in Sunnyvale, Arizona, the prune capital of the world. Is it any wonder that he wants to go to Saudi Arabaia for college and leave Sunnyvale far, far behind? He spends his days at school with his sex-obsessed best friend Dan Forrester and lusts after Lisa Winston, the sexy lounge singer who his parents have hired to perform at the Holiday Inn. Stuck without a date for his brother''s wedding to a senator''s daughter, Ryan goes to a computer dating service, which asks him such questions as "Can you breathe foreign substances?" Soon, Ryan is told that he may be an alien stuck on Earth along with thousands of others. Soon, Charles and Edna Pinsky show up and tell him that he may an alien prince meant to lead his brethren home. And that''s when things get out of control...', 'Ryan Richmond is an eccentric teenager living with his mother, father, sister and brother in the Holiday Inn they own in Sunnyvale, Arizona, the prune capital of the world. Is it any wonder that he wants to go to Saudi Arabaia for college and leave Sunnyvale far, far behind? He spends his days at school with his sex-obsessed best friend Dan Forrester and lusts after Lisa Winston, the sexy lounge singer who his parents have hired to perform at the Holiday Inn. Stuck without a date for his brother''s wedding to a senator''s daughter, Ryan goes to a computer dating service, which asks him such questions as "Can you breathe foreign substances?" Soon, Ryan is told that he may be an alien stuck on Earth along with thousands of others. Soon, Charles and Edna Pinsky show up and tell him that he may an alien prince meant to lead his brethren home. And that''s when things get out of control...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utbzkl04N9Sm7QRjSlAjykE3Hxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251377'),
  ('598871222353876248', 'Doing Hard Time', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Preston A. Whitmore II, Patrice Lucien Cochet', 'Preston A. Whitmore II', 'Boris Kodjoe, Michael Kenneth Williams, Sticky Fingaz, Giancarlo Esposito, Steven Bauer, Emilio Rivera, Reagan Gomez-Preston, Jazsmin Lewis', 'R', 'A father''s eight year old son is murdered in a gangland shooting. The father gets himself thrown into prison to avenge his son''s death.', 'A father''s eight year old son is murdered in a gangland shooting. The father gets himself thrown into prison to avenge his son''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfTCHXJnBVrNaHWRawS42MJ0ZFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32812'),
  ('684441806805688531', 'Doing Time', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yōichi Sai, Takeshi Hamada', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Yōichi Sai, Wishing Chong', 'Tsutomu Yamazaki, Teruyuki Kagawa, Tomorowo Taguchi, Yutaka Matsushige, Toshifumi Muramatsu, Ito Yozaburo, Kenichi Endo, Matomu Onda', null, 'A man serving a sentence in a minimum-security prison. Life in the jail is rigid and organized, eventually leading all of the cell-mates to abandon their individuality.', 'A man serving a sentence in a minimum-security prison. Life in the jail is rigid and organized, eventually leading all of the cell-mates to abandon their individuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3q1p4KCmgRcioM06CosxsxGe2Hy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109558'),
  ('173737707842767278', 'Doing Time on Maple Drive', 1992, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Ken Olin, Bing Sokolsky', 'James Duff', 'James B. Sikking, Bibi Besch, William McNamara, Jayne Brook, David Byron, Lori Loughlin, Jim Carrey, Philip Linton', null, 'Yale scholar Matt Carter introduces his wealthy fiancée, Allison, to his family, and initially everything goes smoothly. However, it isn''t long before Allison learns that Matt has lied to her about his relatives to mask their failures and dysfunctions. His brother, Tim, flunked out of school and developed a drinking problem, and Matt struggles to keep his own troubling secret from his less than tolerant parents.', 'Yale scholar Matt Carter introduces his wealthy fiancée, Allison, to his family, and initially everything goes smoothly. However, it isn''t long before Allison learns that Matt has lied to her about his relatives to mask their failures and dysfunctions. His brother, Tim, flunked out of school and developed a drinking problem, and Matt struggles to keep his own troubling secret from his less than tolerant parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3SuMq6qrDqVr3ltF94z9UjB8iPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22795'),
  ('328423350995325462', 'Dojoji Temple', 1976, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror', 'Kihachiro Kawamoto, Minoru Tamura', 'Kihachiro Kawamoto', null, null, 'A man who is on a pilgrimage spends the night with a woman. After they share a moment of passion, he runs away and she chases him.', 'A man who is on a pilgrimage spends the night with a woman. After they share a moment of passion, he runs away and she chases him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmY5OtY5Dq6dPXYIcCaEYxzAF8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153119'),
  ('23144912791709012', 'Dokidoki! Pretty Cure the Movie: Memories for the Future', 2013, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Naoyuki Ito, Ken Ueno, Kenji Takahashi', 'Ryota Yamaguchi', 'Hitomi Nabatame, Minako Kotobuki, Mai Fuchigami, Kanako Miyamoto, Rie Kugimiya, Ayaka Ohashi, Kazuko Sugiyama, Kumiko Nishihara', null, 'One day, Mana Aida receives a wedding dress from her mother and grandmother that they had worn in the past. While thinking about who she would wear this beside someday, a mysterious man named Marsh appears, and Mana is thrown back into the past. She was happy to see her grandmother she loved and her old dog Maro, but she then realizes that Alice and Rikka aren''t there because memories have been altered. In order to save precious memories, the future, dreams and hope, Mana transforms into Cure Heart.', 'One day, Mana Aida receives a wedding dress from her mother and grandmother that they had worn in the past. While thinking about who she would wear this beside someday, a mysterious man named Marsh appears, and Mana is thrown back into the past. She was happy to see her grandmother she loved and her old dog Maro, but she then realizes that Alice and Rikka aren''t there because memories have been altered. In order to save precious memories, the future, dreams and hope, Mana transforms into Cure Heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhqgkFeqteDyL5Om322KihkvZVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270482'),
  ('527877209784381386', 'Doktor Civanım', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Ahmet Sezerel, Oğuz Abadan', 'Safa Önal, Memduh Ün', 'Kemal Sunal, Bahar Öztan, Ayşen Gruda, Ali Şen, İhsan Yüce, Reha Yurdakul, Sırrı Elitaş, Ahmet Açan', null, 'Kemal writes a letter to his mother telling her that he is a doctor. His mother is so happy that she spreads the news throughout the village. When the girls in the village learn that Kemal is returning to the village, they do everything they can to win him over. However, Kemal falls in love with Sümbül, the daughter of Ruşen Ağa. The discovery that Kemal is not a doctor will put this love in jeopardy.', 'Kemal writes a letter to his mother telling her that he is a doctor. His mother is so happy that she spreads the news throughout the village. When the girls in the village learn that Kemal is returning to the village, they do everything they can to win him over. However, Kemal falls in love with Sümbül, the daughter of Ruşen Ağa. The discovery that Kemal is not a doctor will put this love in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZUMnXDpGACSPiIExbeeOjd4C9g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361064'),
  ('76407539147243845', 'Dokunmayın Şabanıma', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Osman F. Seden, Cahit Engin', 'Osman F. Seden', 'Kemal Sunal, Ahu Tuğba, Ercan Yazgan, Halit Akçatepe, Ali Şen, Reha Yurdakul, Osman F. Seden, Ünal Gürel', null, 'Şaban is a minibus driver who is unsuccessful with women, while Ökkeş is a complete womanizer. Ökkeş and Şaban, two old army buddies, cross paths one day in prison. Ökkeş, who is being forced by his father to marry, asks Şaban to take his place, and they switch roles. However, when both of them fall in love with the daughter of the house they go to, things get complicated. The girl they are in love with has switched places with the housekeeper...', 'Şaban is a minibus driver who is unsuccessful with women, while Ökkeş is a complete womanizer. Ökkeş and Şaban, two old army buddies, cross paths one day in prison. Ökkeş, who is being forced by his father to marry, asks Şaban to take his place, and they switch roles. However, when both of them fall in love with the daughter of the house they go to, things get complicated. The girl they are in love with has switched places with the housekeeper...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBME2NcIqRCSvDI99sW7mOQ6ZX3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190459'),
  ('25912678836891539', 'Dolan''s Cadillac', 2009, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jeff Beesley, Gerald Packer, Woody Sidarous', 'Richard Dooling', 'Christian Slater, Emmanuelle Vaugier, Wes Bentley, Greg Bryk, Aidan Devine, Al Sapienza, Karen LeBlanc, Cory Generoux', 'R', 'Robinson, a once peaceful, law-abiding school teacher, has turned into an obsessed vengeance machine, intent on killing the man who murdered his wife - ruthless Las Vegas mob boss James Dolan. But to do so, Robinson must infiltrate the dangerous underworld, and devise a diabolical plan that will bury Dolan once and for all.', 'Robinson, a once peaceful, law-abiding school teacher, has turned into an obsessed vengeance machine, intent on killing the man who murdered his wife - ruthless Las Vegas mob boss James Dolan. But to do so, Robinson must infiltrate the dangerous underworld, and devise a diabolical plan that will bury Dolan once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5R9MivzBtRpZCq3amYmNjEmfChT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19823'),
  ('55565613846579501', 'DolceRoma', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Fabio Resinaro, Paolo Bellan, Rodolfo De Maistre', 'Fabio Resinaro, Fausto Brizzi', 'Lorenzo Richelmy, Luca Barbareschi, Claudia Gerini, Francesco Montanari, Valentina Bellè, Iaia Forte, Libero De Rienzo, Luca Vecchi', null, 'Andrea Serrano is a young aspiring writer who, to make ends meet, is forced to wash corpses in a mortuary, while struggling to finish his first novel, a story about the Camorra. Having become discouraged by his struggling career, he is waiting for the chance of a lifetime. And finally, it arrives - a major film producer decides to adapt his novel and make it into a movie.', 'Andrea Serrano is a young aspiring writer who, to make ends meet, is forced to wash corpses in a mortuary, while struggling to finish his first novel, a story about the Camorra. Having become discouraged by his struggling career, he is waiting for the chance of a lifetime. And finally, it arrives - a major film producer decides to adapt his novel and make it into a movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/J4dSUA9OLVFbnKzvOFh8UlkF7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571482'),
  ('77427489111832354', 'Dolcissime', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ferran Paredes, Francesco Ghiaccio', 'Marco D''Amore, Gabriele Scotti, Renata Ciaravino', 'Margherita De Francisco, Giulia Barbuto, Costa Da Cruz, Alice Manfredi, Giulia Fiorellino, Licia Navarrini, Valeria Solarino, Vinicio Marchioni', null, 'Mariagrazia, Chiara and Letizia are inseparable friends forced to come to terms every day with the hated extra kilos, looks of disapproval from their schoolmates and giggles in the school hallways. Mariagrazia suffers for the confrontation with her mother (Valeria Solarino), a former sports champion. Chiara has a chat with a peer, but she is too afraid to send him her photo. Letizia has a talent for music but too much shame to show it. After the umpteenth teasing, an unexpected opportunity for redemption comes from the popular and beautiful Alice, captain of the synchronized swimming school team, forced by a blackmail to train them in secret. The three girls embark on an impossible challenge, driven into the water by their desire for revenge.', 'Mariagrazia, Chiara and Letizia are inseparable friends forced to come to terms every day with the hated extra kilos, looks of disapproval from their schoolmates and giggles in the school hallways. Mariagrazia suffers for the confrontation with her mother (Valeria Solarino), a former sports champion. Chiara has a chat with a peer, but she is too afraid to send him her photo. Letizia has a talent for music but too much shame to show it. After the umpteenth teasing, an unexpected opportunity for redemption comes from the popular and beautiful Alice, captain of the synchronized swimming school team, forced by a blackmail to train them in secret. The three girls embark on an impossible challenge, driven into the water by their desire for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HQitZg6VxCnaPj6b3nldypwqaR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606227'),
  ('326819080636130460', 'Dolemite', 1975, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Nicholas Josef von Sternberg, D''Urville Martin, John Ashley Hamilton', 'Jerry Jones', 'Rudy Ray Moore, D''Urville Martin, Lady Reed, Jerry Jones, Cardella Di Milo, Hy Pyke, Wesley Gale, John Kerry', 'R', 'Dolemite is a pimp who was set up by Willie Greene and the cops, who have planted drugs, stolen furs, and guns in his trunk and got him sentenced to 20 years in jail. One day, Queen B and a warden planned to get him out of Jail and get Willie Green and Mitchell busted for what they did to him.', 'Dolemite is a pimp who was set up by Willie Greene and the cops, who have planted drugs, stolen furs, and guns in his trunk and got him sentenced to 20 years in jail. One day, Queen B and a warden planned to get him out of Jail and get Willie Green and Mitchell busted for what they did to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sc81lG0MdHq1UCY5b2B10c9wSKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19174'),
  ('112952458527720987', 'Dolemite Is My Name', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Craig Brewer, Eric Steelberg, Beat Frutiger', 'Larry Karaszewski, Scott Alexander', 'Eddie Murphy, Wesley Snipes, Da''Vine Joy Randolph, Keegan-Michael Key, Mike Epps, Craig Robinson, Tituss Burgess, Kodi Smit-McPhee', 'R', 'The story of Rudy Ray Moore, who created the iconic big screen pimp character Dolemite in the 1970s.', 'The story of Rudy Ray Moore, who created the iconic big screen pimp character Dolemite in the 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoAqJg7ZSmftnBGOkupU1ySZQU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528888'),
  ('954966499977550208', 'Dolittle', 2020, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Peter James, Matt Haggerty, Andrew Proctor', 'Stephen Gaghan, Dan Gregor, Doug Mand', 'Robert Downey Jr., Harry Collett, Michael Sheen, Jim Broadbent, Antonio Banderas, Rami Malek, Jessie Buckley, Emma Thompson', 'PG', 'After losing his wife seven years earlier, the eccentric Dr. John Dolittle, famed doctor and veterinarian of Queen Victoria’s England, hermits himself away behind the high walls of Dolittle Manor with only his menagerie of exotic animals for company. But when the young queen falls gravely ill, a reluctant Dolittle is forced to set sail on an epic adventure to a mythical island in search of a cure, regaining his wit and courage as he crosses old adversaries and discovers wondrous creatures.', 'After losing his wife seven years earlier, the eccentric Dr. John Dolittle, famed doctor and veterinarian of Queen Victoria’s England, hermits himself away behind the high walls of Dolittle Manor with only his menagerie of exotic animals for company. But when the young queen falls gravely ill, a reluctant Dolittle is forced to set sail on an epic adventure to a mythical island in search of a cure, regaining his wit and courage as he crosses old adversaries and discovers wondrous creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Nt3v1uzUgfSuVARD1AnI9g9Zl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448119'),
  ('662744328404530300', 'Doll Face', 1945, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Joseph LaShelle, Lewis Seiler', 'Leonard Praskins', 'Vivian Blaine, Dennis O''Keefe, Perry Como, Carmen Miranda, Martha Stewart, Stephen Dunne, Reed Hadley, Stanley Prager', null, 'Burlesque queen Doll Face Carroll is dismissed from an audition for a legitimate Broadway show because she lacks culture. Her boss/manager Mike decides that she can get both culture and plenty of publicity by writing her autobiography. He hires a ghost writer to do all the work, but doesn''t count on the possibility that Doll Face and her collaborator might have more than a book on their minds.', 'Burlesque queen Doll Face Carroll is dismissed from an audition for a legitimate Broadway show because she lacks culture. Her boss/manager Mike decides that she can get both culture and plenty of publicity by writing her autobiography. He hires a ghost writer to do all the work, but doesn''t count on the possibility that Doll Face and her collaborator might have more than a book on their minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYubN0aC1zSjV3X8JRghJOIQAE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117394'),
  ('533731087727916544', 'Doll Graveyard', 2005, 'Horror', 'Charles Band, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Domonic Muir', 'Jared Kusnitz, Gabrielle Lynn, Kristyn Green, Anna Alicia Brock, Brian Lloyd, Scott Seymour, Ken Lyle, Hannah Marks', null, 'It''s 1905 when 12 year old Sophia plays all by herself in her big, creepy house with only four handmade dolls as friends. When her abusive father has finally had enough, he forces her to bury them in the backyard. But, after she "slips" and breaks her neck, dad buries her right along with the dolls. 100 years later, the Fillbrook family moves into the very same house.', 'It''s 1905 when 12 year old Sophia plays all by herself in her big, creepy house with only four handmade dolls as friends. When her abusive father has finally had enough, he forces her to bury them in the backyard. But, after she "slips" and breaks her neck, dad buries her right along with the dolls. 100 years later, the Fillbrook family moves into the very same house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rlUoLsHJVQQU6sHZuY9FeZV8IE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12759'),
  ('863629082376813222', 'Dollar for the Dead', 1998, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Gene Quintano', 'Gene Quintano', 'Emilio Estevez, William Forsythe, Jordi Mollà, Joaquim de Almeida, Jonathan Banks, Howie Long, Ed Lauter, Simón Andreu', null, 'In this tribute to the old time spaghetti westerns with a liberal dose of modern Hong Kong film-making thrown in, Emilio Estevez assumes Clint Eastwood''s "man with no name" role. Estevez plays a super-quick gunman on the run from a rancher (Long) and his men out to kill him for killing his son. The gunman gets mixed up with a former Confederate soldier (William Forsythe) who has knowledge of hidden gold. The only trouble is he is also pursued by Union soldiers. When they free a man (Ed Lauter) with part of the map to the gold, they then are also pursued by Spanish soldiers. It all leads to a small Mexican town terrorized by soldiers and led a by a good priest (Joaquim De Almeida) who also has knowledge of the gold.', 'In this tribute to the old time spaghetti westerns with a liberal dose of modern Hong Kong film-making thrown in, Emilio Estevez assumes Clint Eastwood''s "man with no name" role. Estevez plays a super-quick gunman on the run from a rancher (Long) and his men out to kill him for killing his son. The gunman gets mixed up with a former Confederate soldier (William Forsythe) who has knowledge of hidden gold. The only trouble is he is also pursued by Union soldiers. When they free a man (Ed Lauter) with part of the map to the gold, they then are also pursued by Spanish soldiers. It all leads to a small Mexican town terrorized by soldiers and led a by a good priest (Joaquim De Almeida) who also has knowledge of the gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSMRMb2AkukTRsSHfOPnh2DyXO3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68745'),
  ('445248457593990552', 'Dollface', 2014, 'Horror', 'Tommy Faircloth', 'Tommy Faircloth', 'Kirsten Ray, Debbie Rochon, John Kap, Jason Vail, Elizabeth Mears, Leah Wiseman, Patrick G. Keenan, Suzie Haines', 'NR', 'A group of college students researching Dorchester Stewart, better known as the infamous killer Crinoline Head, return to the scene of the horrific murders that happened in 1996.', 'A group of college students researching Dorchester Stewart, better known as the infamous killer Crinoline Head, return to the scene of the horrific murders that happened in 1996.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfcV9GlgdEljvA8QKOFJONQ4ApR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343750'),
  ('629155511322909424', 'Dollhouse', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Shinobu Yaguchi, Tetsuya Okabe, Fūta Takagi', 'Shinobu Yaguchi', 'Masami Nagasawa, Koji Seto, Tetsushi Tanaka, Aoi Ikemura, Naomi Nishida, Hiroki Konno, Totoka Honda, Tōru Shinagawa', null, 'After losing their child, a mother finds solace in a life-sized ancient doll she finds on the market. When a new daughter enters the family''s life, strange things begin to happen and no matter how hard the family tries to get rid of it, the doll always finds its way back.', 'After losing their child, a mother finds solace in a life-sized ancient doll she finds on the market. When a new daughter enters the family''s life, strange things begin to happen and no matter how hard the family tries to get rid of it, the doll always finds its way back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUs4OPpvu4Is7wIGaXkseNJHhEA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1404791'),
  ('610094373322048701', 'Dollman', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'George Mooradian, Albert Pyun', 'Chris Roghair', 'Tim Thomerson, Jackie Earle Haley, Kamala Lopez, Humberto Ortiz, Nicholas Guest, Judd Omen, Michael Halsey, Frank Doubleday', 'R', 'Brick Bardo is a traveller from outer space who is forced to land on Earth. Though regular sized on his home planet, he is doll-sized here on Earth, as are the enemy forces who have landed as well. While Brick enlists the help of an impoverished girl and her son, the bad guys enlist the help of a local gang. When word leaks out as to his location, and all hell breaks loose, Brick is besieged by an onslaught of curious kids, angry gang members, and his own doll-sized enemies, and he must protect the family who has helped him and get off the planet alive.', 'Brick Bardo is a traveller from outer space who is forced to land on Earth. Though regular sized on his home planet, he is doll-sized here on Earth, as are the enemy forces who have landed as well. While Brick enlists the help of an impoverished girl and her son, the bad guys enlist the help of a local gang. When word leaks out as to his location, and all hell breaks loose, Brick is besieged by an onslaught of curious kids, angry gang members, and his own doll-sized enemies, and he must protect the family who has helped him and get off the planet alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bL6kIrquE6dAVAuRZFwLQd03nT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68773'),
  ('264412942364110642', 'Dollman vs. Demonic Toys', 1993, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Charles Band, Adolfo Bartoli, Douglas Aarniokoski', 'Craig Hamann', 'Tim Thomerson, Tracy Scoggins, Melissa Behr, Phil Fondacaro, R.C. Bates, Willie C. Carpenter, Peter Chen, Frank Welker', 'R', 'The Demonic Toys are back, so policewoman Judith Grey seeks the help of 12 inch tall Dollman and his 12 inch tall girlfriend, Nurse Ginger. The Toys hole up in an evil deserted toy factory and it''s up to Dollman to keep the Toys from summoning the powers of darkness to the Earth.', 'The Demonic Toys are back, so policewoman Judith Grey seeks the help of 12 inch tall Dollman and his 12 inch tall girlfriend, Nurse Ginger. The Toys hole up in an evil deserted toy factory and it''s up to Dollman to keep the Toys from summoning the powers of darkness to the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzd0S30LWCdK5y2pMrObCfGXocN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84152'),
  ('160943863873905924', 'Dolls', 1986, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Stuart Gordon, Judy Monti, Marco Valerio Pugini', 'Ed Naha', 'Ian Patrick Williams, Carolyn Purdy-Gordon, Carrie Lorraine, Guy Rolfe, Hilary Mason, Bunty Bailey, Cassie Stuart, Stephen Lee', 'R', 'A precocious girl, her nasty parents, two punk-rock losers and a weak-kneed salesman inadvertently become the guests of two ghoulish senior citizens in their dark, haunted mansion.', 'A precocious girl, her nasty parents, two punk-rock losers and a weak-kneed salesman inadvertently become the guests of two ghoulish senior citizens in their dark, haunted mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEE9Ly5r9o2XR35wKiIlkLfvnx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24341'),
  ('730900157501331157', 'Dolls', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Miho Kanno, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Tatsuya Mihashi, Chieko Matsubara, Kyoko Fukada, Tsutomu Takeshige, Kayoko Kishimoto, Nao Omori', null, 'Dolls takes puppeteering as its overriding motif, which relates thematically to the action provided by the live characters. Chief among those tales is the story of Matsumoto and Sawako, a young couple whose relationship is about to be broken apart by the former''s parents, who have insisted their son take part in an arranged marriage to his boss'' daughter.', 'Dolls takes puppeteering as its overriding motif, which relates thematically to the action provided by the live characters. Chief among those tales is the story of Matsumoto and Sawako, a young couple whose relationship is about to be broken apart by the former''s parents, who have insisted their son take part in an arranged marriage to his boss'' daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQ9XBpH88jvO3hpHt9Zm5IHe5NP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870'),
  ('1149847658559665975', 'Dolls and Angels', 2008, 'Drama', 'Nora Hamdi, Jean-Louis Vialard', 'Nora Hamdi', 'Leïla Bekhti, Karina Testa, Samy Naceri, Samuel Le Bihan, Fejria Deliba, Léa Seydoux, Gianni Giardinelli, Aurelia Crebessegues', null, 'The father of a family of North African immigrants living on a Paris housing estate finds it hard to impose his will on his two teenage daughters. Lya, 17, and Chirine, 18, respond to their father’s bouts of violence by rebelling in the same way as most French adolescents. When Chirine is offered work as a model, she jumps at the chance, but soon realizes she may be about to fall into the prostitution racket...', 'The father of a family of North African immigrants living on a Paris housing estate finds it hard to impose his will on his two teenage daughters. Lya, 17, and Chirine, 18, respond to their father’s bouts of violence by rebelling in the same way as most French adolescents. When Chirine is offered work as a model, she jumps at the chance, but soon realizes she may be about to fall into the prostitution racket...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yE43fMVGKu33GGLQUwRvOZU4XNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58596'),
  ('651049547991467872', 'Dolly', 2026, 'Horror', 'Rod Blackhurst, Justin Derry', 'Rod Blackhurst, Brandon Weavil', 'Max Lindsey, Fabianne Therese, Seann William Scott, Ethan Suplee, Russ Tiller, Michalina Scorzelli, Kate Cobb', 'R', 'Young Macy is abducted by a deranged, monstrous figure who wants to raise her as its child.', 'Young Macy is abducted by a deranged, monstrous figure who wants to raise her as its child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTPUg3XtdcKRAS5Vwsi1GYPFhNZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1309083'),
  ('313234510444190359', 'Dolly Dearest', 1991, 'Horror', 'Maria Lease, Eric D. Andersen, Larry Litton', 'Maria Lease', 'Denise Crosby, Sam Bottoms, Rip Torn, Chris Demetral, Candace Hutson, Lupe Ontiveros, Enrique Renaldo, Alma Martinez', 'R', 'An American family moves to Mexico to fabricate dolls, but their toy factory happens to be next to a Sanzian grave and the toys come into possession of an old, malicious spirit.', 'An American family moves to Mexico to fabricate dolls, but their toy factory happens to be next to a Sanzian grave and the toys come into possession of an old, malicious spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fp5o7DIp31R3T7SNzPGVKgyyTpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28859'),
  ('370078186329776951', 'Dolly Ki Doli', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Abhishek Dogra', 'Abhishek Dogra, Umashankar Singh', 'Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Pulkit Samrat, Rajkummar Rao, Varun Sharma, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Archana Puran Singh, Mubeen Saudagar, Saif Ali Khan', null, 'Dolly, an attractive woman, fakes marriages and runs away stealing all the precious belongings of the groom and his family. Dolly''s modus operandi is to get her fake brother to identify prospective grooms &amp; then entice these men to fall in love with her. Attracted by her charms, these prospective grooms are ready to do anything for dolly including going against their parents'' wishes to marry her.', 'Dolly, an attractive woman, fakes marriages and runs away stealing all the precious belongings of the groom and his family. Dolly''s modus operandi is to get her fake brother to identify prospective grooms &amp; then entice these men to fall in love with her. Attracted by her charms, these prospective grooms are ready to do anything for dolly including going against their parents'' wishes to marry her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xn2K7FAa8JI8sXITW5M92b6u1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320024'),
  ('35866893899775353', 'Dolly Kitty and Those Twinkling Stars', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alankrita Shrivastava', 'Alankrita Shrivastava', 'Konkona Sen Sharma, Bhumi Pednekar, Aamir Bashir, Vikrant Massey, Amol Parashar, Kubbra Sait, Karan Kundra, Kalyani Jha', null, 'A disillusioned Delhi wife (Dolly), and her new-in-town cousin (Kitty), navigate damning secrets, dreams and their thorny dynamic on their respective roads to freedom.', 'A disillusioned Delhi wife (Dolly), and her new-in-town cousin (Kitty), navigate damning secrets, dreams and their thorny dynamic on their respective roads to freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGXdE7Qe2Sgth64GVgnhnMF79NJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639414'),
  ('428871158911855248', 'Dolly Parton''s Christmas on the Square', 2020, 'Comedy, Music, Family, TV Movie', 'Debbie Allen, Oliver Bokelberg, Todd Hilyard', 'Maria S. Schlatter', 'Dolly Parton, Christine Baranski, Treat Williams, Jenifer Lewis, Josh Segarra, Jeanine Mason, Mary Lane Haskell, Matthew Johnson', 'PG', 'A rich and nasty woman returns to her hometown to evict everyone but discovers the true meaning of Christmas thanks to the local townsfolk – and an actual angel. Features 14 original songs with music and lyrics by Dolly Parton!', 'A rich and nasty woman returns to her hometown to evict everyone but discovers the true meaning of Christmas thanks to the local townsfolk – and an actual angel. Features 14 original songs with music and lyrics by Dolly Parton!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fmnCR1UpojTl5FRBu7OzZTibA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747349'),
  ('896712065032818726', 'Dollybirds', 1997, 'Comedy, Music', 'Péter Tímár, Péter Szatmári', 'Péter Tímár, Gyula Márton', 'János Gálvölgyi, Ildikó Tóth, Vanda Kovács, Anita Tóth, Natália Nagy, Sándor Almási, Balázs Lázár, Kristóf Németh', null, 'The movie is set in the actual "Ki Mit Tud?" talent contest in 1962. In reality the contest in dance music category was won by an army brass band. "Omega" which later became one of the most successful Hungarian rock bands came out in the second place.', 'The movie is set in the actual "Ki Mit Tud?" talent contest in 1962. In reality the contest in dance music category was won by an army brass band. "Omega" which later became one of the most successful Hungarian rock bands came out in the second place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBUrMl3Sp9Gd6dTkvhYIeOKQxtY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41012'),
  ('879163806753791066', 'Dolores Claiborne', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Taylor Hackford, Gabriel Beristain, Kristie Sills', 'Tony Gilroy', 'Kathy Bates, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Judy Parfitt, Christopher Plummer, David Strathairn, Eric Bogosian, John C. Reilly, Ellen Muth', 'R', 'Dolores Claiborne was accused of killing her abusive husband twenty years ago, but the court''s findings were inconclusive and she was allowed to walk free. Now she has been accused of killing her employer, Vera Donovan, and this time there is a witness who can place her at the scene of the crime. Things look bad for Dolores when her daughter Selena, a successful Manhattan magazine writer, returns to cover the story.', 'Dolores Claiborne was accused of killing her abusive husband twenty years ago, but the court''s findings were inconclusive and she was allowed to walk free. Now she has been accused of killing her employer, Vera Donovan, and this time there is a witness who can place her at the scene of the crime. Things look bad for Dolores when her daughter Selena, a successful Manhattan magazine writer, returns to cover the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQuwx3UAyXbE9tzdM3jLqtbogc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11929'),
  ('393888360739830195', 'Dolphin Boy', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Mohammad Kheirandish', 'Yana Kuzmina, Mohamed Hamedani, Mohammad Kheirandish', 'Polina Avdeenko, Yuliya Rudina, Alexander Fenin, Boris Khasanov, Alexander Vasilyev, Yuliya Zorkina, Vasilisa Ushakova', null, 'When a plane crashes at sea, dolphins rescue a little boy and raise him as family. He lives a carefree life beneath the waves until an evil monster seizes power over the underwater world. Banished to dry land, the boy is taken in by a kind-hearted captain. With his new companion''s help, the boy embarks on a journey to solve the mystery of his true identity.', 'When a plane crashes at sea, dolphins rescue a little boy and raise him as family. He lives a carefree life beneath the waves until an evil monster seizes power over the underwater world. Banished to dry land, the boy is taken in by a kind-hearted captain. With his new companion''s help, the boy embarks on a journey to solve the mystery of his true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gISoDEiaUH9BNEunmLC7FgUVaia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947938'),
  ('126611369215967192', 'Dolphin Reef', 2018, 'Documentary, Family', 'Keith Scholey, Alastair Fothergill', 'David H. Fowler', 'Natalie Portman', 'G', 'Echo is a youngster who can''t quite decide if it''s time to grow up and take on new responsibilities-or give in to her silly side and just have fun. Dolphin society is tricky, and the coral reef that Echo and his family call home depends on all of its inhabitants to keep it healthy. But Echo has a tough time resisting the many adventures the ocean has to offer.', 'Echo is a youngster who can''t quite decide if it''s time to grow up and take on new responsibilities-or give in to her silly side and just have fun. Dolphin society is tricky, and the coral reef that Echo and his family call home depends on all of its inhabitants to keep it healthy. But Echo has a tough time resisting the many adventures the ocean has to offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjXDxftBdM4mdhcO3eTqJCUt3Y8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454291'),
  ('686289483836219188', 'Dolphin Tale', 2011, 'Drama, Family', 'Charles Martin Smith, Karl Walter Lindenlaub', 'Karen Janszen, Noam Dromi', 'Nathan Gamble, Cozi Zuehlsdorff, Harry Connick Jr., Austin Stowell, Morgan Freeman, Ashley Judd, Kris Kristofferson, Ray McKinnon', 'PG', 'A sea of animal rescuers — and a lonely boy in need of a friend – nurse an injured dolphin back to health after it loses its tail in a trap.', 'A sea of animal rescuers — and a lonely boy in need of a friend – nurse an injured dolphin back to health after it loses its tail in a trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/af2SRFllNW26WFG84AfTv3xLT5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62837'),
  ('248093320171865384', 'Dolphin Tale 2', 2014, 'Family, Drama', 'Daryn Okada, Charles Martin Smith', 'Charles Martin Smith', 'Nathan Gamble, Cozi Zuehlsdorff, Harry Connick Jr., Ashley Judd, Kris Kristofferson, Morgan Freeman, Bethany Hamilton, Austin Stowell', 'PG', 'The team of people who saved Winter''s life reassemble in the wake of her surrogate mother''s passing in order to find her a companion so she can remain at the Clearwater Marine Hospital.', 'The team of people who saved Winter''s life reassemble in the wake of her surrogate mother''s passing in order to find her a companion so she can remain at the Clearwater Marine Hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ujGA9YqxQ3uwtMelCEsaBKasuR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227735'),
  ('782865560194270931', 'Dom', 2003, 'Drama', 'Moacyr Góes, Cris D''amato, Hsu Chien', 'Moacyr Góes', 'Marcos Palmeira, Maria Fernanda Cândido, Bruno Garcia, Luciana Braga, Leon Góes, Ana Abott, Isabela Coimbra, Thiago Farias', null, 'Free adaptation of Machado de Assis'' "Dom Casmurro". Bento marries an actress, and soon afterwards she gets pregnant. Then, he begins to suspect the child isn''t his, but his best friend''s.', 'Free adaptation of Machado de Assis'' "Dom Casmurro". Bento marries an actress, and soon afterwards she gets pregnant. Then, he begins to suspect the child isn''t his, but his best friend''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4cAKS9JhKqtOYx79WwD7IRorbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70813'),
  ('572621270764661124', 'Dom Hemingway', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Richard Shepard, Giles Nuttgens', 'Richard Shepard', 'Jude Law, Demián Bichir, Richard E. Grant, Matthew C. Martino, Emilia Clarke, Kerry Condon, Mădălina Ghenea, Deborah Rosan', 'R', 'After spending 12 years in prison for keeping his mouth shut, notorious safe-cracker Dom Hemingway is back on the streets of London looking to collect what he''s owed.', 'After spending 12 years in prison for keeping his mouth shut, notorious safe-cracker Dom Hemingway is back on the streets of London looking to collect what he''s owed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvrUPdZUDlSn1S4KCW5IdIMGS5D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192134'),
  ('552518249416909486', 'Dom Juan & Sganarelle', 2015, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Julien Roux, Vincent Macaigne', 'Vincent Macaigne', 'Loïc Corbery, Suliane Brahim, Julie Sicard, Serge Bagdassarian, Claire de la Rüe du Can, Alain Lenglet, Clément Hervieu-Léger, Gérard Giroudon', null, 'Woman hero Dom Juan lives a life full of excesses and love affairs. When he seduces the nun Elvire, but shows no interest in her a short time later, he gets to deal with her vengeful brothers. Dom Juan and his assistant Sganarelle have to flee and set out on a journey full of strange encounters.', 'Woman hero Dom Juan lives a life full of excesses and love affairs. When he seduces the nun Elvire, but shows no interest in her a short time later, he gets to deal with her vengeful brothers. Dom Juan and his assistant Sganarelle have to flee and set out on a journey full of strange encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bT5FhFKsjmpTFABhYCsWPWfZs4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354424'),
  ('439616376741794768', 'Domain', 2009, 'Drama', 'Patric Chiha, Pascal Poucet', 'Patric Chiha', 'Béatrice Dalle, Isaïe Sultan, Alain Libolt, Raphaël Bouvet, Sylvia Rohrer, Gisèle Vienne, Udo Samel, Tatiana Vialle', null, 'Nadia is in her late 30s and begins a serious relationship with a teen named Pierre.', 'Nadia is in her late 30s and begins a serious relationship with a teen named Pierre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agaPOz1GYxJEEiKsFrFPCUzDZ2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61893'),
  ('326306804058687430', 'Domain', 2017, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Nathaniel Atcheson, Benjamin Kantor', 'Nathaniel Atcheson', 'Britt Lower, Ryan Merriman, William Gregory Lee, Kevin Sizemore, Nick Gomez, Sonja Sohn, Cedric Sanders, Beth Grant', 'NR', 'After a deadly virus wipes out most of humanity, the survivors are forced to wait alone in self-sustaining bunkers while the viral threat runs its course. Able to communicate through a networked video interface, the survivors wait for years and slowly become a motley family of sorts. But their fragile social ecosystem is shattered when, one by one, they start mysteriously disappearing from their bunkers.', 'After a deadly virus wipes out most of humanity, the survivors are forced to wait alone in self-sustaining bunkers while the viral threat runs its course. Able to communicate through a networked video interface, the survivors wait for years and slowly become a motley family of sorts. But their fragile social ecosystem is shattered when, one by one, they start mysteriously disappearing from their bunkers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UDuKKHPu0Kw77qduE2kbHj8zyA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406104'),
  ('955191215904635344', 'Domains', 2019, 'Drama', 'Natsuka Kusano, Yasutaka Watanabe', 'Tomoyuki Takahashi', 'Asami Shibuya, Tomo Kasajima, Tomomitsu Adachi, Ryu Kenta', null, 'Aki and Naoko are childhood friends who are drifting apart as adults. Immersed in her family life, Naoko now has a husband and daughter; Aki, on the other hand, remains single and is on leave from work due to a personal crisis. The plot might sound familiar but it has never been told like this. The director Kusano Natsuka stages the interactions through an actors’ table-read and, as the lines are repeated, the scenes gradually develop into on-location conversations. Moreover, she repositions the dramatic peak of the story to the beginning: Aki has murdered Naoko’s daughter.', 'Aki and Naoko are childhood friends who are drifting apart as adults. Immersed in her family life, Naoko now has a husband and daughter; Aki, on the other hand, remains single and is on leave from work due to a personal crisis. The plot might sound familiar but it has never been told like this. The director Kusano Natsuka stages the interactions through an actors’ table-read and, as the lines are repeated, the scenes gradually develop into on-location conversations. Moreover, she repositions the dramatic peak of the story to the beginning: Aki has murdered Naoko’s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hb9ZPkiuB1efzlalpWBVo003aU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575806'),
  ('1052766261597823659', 'Domani interrogo', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Reality', 'Umberto Riccioni Carteni, Vladan Radović', 'Herbert Simone Paragnani, Gaja Cenciarelli', 'Anna Ferzetti, Fabio Bizzarro, Sara Silvestro, Anita Serafini, Lorenzo Bagala', null, 'A story set in a school on the outskirts of Rome.', 'A story set in a school on the outskirts of Rome.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FhiqjGnMxJ5Or1SYmJjsQAssM3Ut.jpg', 'plex:movie:domani-interrogo'),
  ('364239074903350397', 'Dombivli Return', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mahendra Teredesai', null, 'Sandeep Kulkarni, Rajeshwari Sachdev, Amol Parashar, Hrishikesh Joshi', null, 'Anant Velankar is an honest government officer working in Mantralaya who has never taken bribe.He has a respectful life with is family wife Ujwala and daughter Antra.He commutes daily for work from Dombivali to CST a route more then a hour and admires his boss Dadasaheb but suddenly comes across a photograph of him killing someone which is the only proof the murder.Now the ball is in Anant''s court how to deal with the situation weather to revel the truth in front of everyone or blackmail Dadasaheb.', 'Anant Velankar is an honest government officer working in Mantralaya who has never taken bribe.He has a respectful life with is family wife Ujwala and daughter Antra.He commutes daily for work from Dombivali to CST a route more then a hour and admires his boss Dadasaheb but suddenly comes across a photograph of him killing someone which is the only proof the murder.Now the ball is in Anant''s court how to deal with the situation weather to revel the truth in front of everyone or blackmail Dadasaheb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iowMD8PiqWSdfJNpDof9PBhnfIq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783442'),
