  ('201774156915082756', 'Domestic Disturbance', 2001, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Michael Seresin, Harold Becker, Allan Graf', 'Lewis Colick', 'John Travolta, Matt O''Leary, Vince Vaughn, Teri Polo, Ruben Santiago-Hudson, Steve Buscemi, Susan Floyd, Angelica Page', 'PG-13', 'Frank Morrison is a divorced father with a 12-year-old son, Danny. His ex-wife Susan and son Danny now live with Rick Barnes, Susan''s new husband. Danny, who has a reputation for telling lies, accuses his stepfather of committing a murder. Initially, no one believes his accusations, but then Frank becomes convinced and is the only one who believes him. Now, the father Danny trusts must protect him from the stepfather he fears.', 'Frank Morrison is a divorced father with a 12-year-old son, Danny. His ex-wife Susan and son Danny now live with Rick Barnes, Susan''s new husband. Danny, who has a reputation for telling lies, accuses his stepfather of committing a murder. Initially, no one believes his accusations, but then Frank becomes convinced and is the only one who believes him. Now, the father Danny trusts must protect him from the stepfather he fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quRhjnXAuIn04VmgM84nmKzt79J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11456'),
  ('288436031594699871', 'Domestic Life', 2013, 'Drama', 'Isabelle Czajka, Renaud Chassaing', 'Isabelle Czajka', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Julie Ferrier, Natacha Régnier, Héléna Noguerra, Laurent Poitrenaux, Claire Chust, Michaël Abiteboul, Sava Lolov', null, 'Juliette was simply not sure about coming to live in this residential suburb of the greater Paris metropolitan area. All the women here are in their forties, have children to raise, houses to keep and husbands who return home late at night.Today she has an appointment in Paris that is important for her career, but she also has to run errands and pick up the kids from school. During the course of her day, monopolized by petty, everyday tasks, Juliette can feel the noose of domestic obligations and household chores slowly tightening around her neck.', 'Juliette was simply not sure about coming to live in this residential suburb of the greater Paris metropolitan area. All the women here are in their forties, have children to raise, houses to keep and husbands who return home late at night.Today she has an appointment in Paris that is important for her career, but she also has to run errands and pick up the kids from school. During the course of her day, monopolized by petty, everyday tasks, Juliette can feel the noose of domestic obligations and household chores slowly tightening around her neck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brIijVMn6HRVef0XzMlcDUjTCvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191482'),
  ('992127912298523420', 'Domingo', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fellipe Barbosa, Clara Linhart, Louise Botkay', 'Lucas Paraizo', 'Ítala Nandi, Camila Morgado, Augusto Madeira, Martha Nowill, Michael Wahrmann, Ismael Caneppele, Silvana Silvia, Clemente Viscaíno', null, 'January 1st, 2003. When Brazil celebrates President Lula′s historic investiture, two middle-class, provincial families gather in an old, poorly maintained house. As they prepare a big party, secrets, hidden desires and frustrations are revealed.', 'January 1st, 2003. When Brazil celebrates President Lula′s historic investiture, two middle-class, provincial families gather in an old, poorly maintained house. As they prepare a big party, secrets, hidden desires and frustrations are revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIzySOMQhxfIfnc0t21Gih90uAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539441'),
  ('1046946533343998806', 'Dominick and Eugene', 1988, 'Drama', 'Robert M. Young, Curtis Clark', 'Alvin Sargent, Corey Blechman', 'Tom Hulce, Ray Liotta, Jamie Lee Curtis, Todd Graff, Bill Cobbs, David Strathairn, Mimi Cecchini, Robert Levine', 'PG-13', 'Dominick and Eugene are twins, but Dominick is a little bit slow due do an accident in his youth. They live together, with Dominick working as garbage man to put Eugene through medical school. Their relationship becomes strained when Eugene must decide between his devotion to his brother, or his need to go away to complete his training. Things are also not helped by Dominick''s co-worker, or Eugene''s budding romance.', 'Dominick and Eugene are twins, but Dominick is a little bit slow due do an accident in his youth. They live together, with Dominick working as garbage man to put Eugene through medical school. Their relationship becomes strained when Eugene must decide between his devotion to his brother, or his need to go away to complete his training. Things are also not helped by Dominick''s co-worker, or Eugene''s budding romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSxAr4qqJmLOZz3hhgGa54LShx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49314'),
  ('1118316974223691617', 'Dominion', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Chris Delforce, Lissy Jayne, Lissy Jayne', 'Chris Delforce', 'Rooney Mara, Joaquin Phoenix, Sia, Sadie Sink, Kat Von D, Chris Delforce', null, 'Exposing the dark underbelly of modern animal agriculture through drones, hidden & handheld cameras, the feature-length film explores the morality and validity of our dominion over the animal kingdom.', 'Exposing the dark underbelly of modern animal agriculture through drones, hidden & handheld cameras, the feature-length film explores the morality and validity of our dominion over the animal kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzqwEuYSPQ7Kj6ovg016KclS0Sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472796'),
