  ('1139597222676776313', 'Domino', 2019, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Brian De Palma, José Luis Alcaine, Josep M. Civit', 'Petter Skavlan', 'Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Carice van Houten, Guy Pearce, Ériq Ebouaney, Mohammed Azaay, Younes Bachir, Thomas W. Gabrielsson, Paprika Steen', 'R', 'Seeking justice for his partner’s murder by an ISIS member, a Copenhagen police officer finds himself caught in a cat and mouse game with a duplicitous CIA agent who is using the killer as a pawn to trap other ISIS members.', 'Seeking justice for his partner’s murder by an ISIS member, a Copenhagen police officer finds himself caught in a cat and mouse game with a duplicitous CIA agent who is using the killer as a pawn to trap other ISIS members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ExrDZRhhmZkveXMjUzywc6266q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455957'),
