  ('454780264847541151', 'Don', 1978, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Chandra Barot', 'Javed Akhtar, Salim Khan', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Zeenat Aman, Pran Sikand, Iftekhar, Om Shivpuri, Satyendra Kapoor, Kamal Kapoor, Helen', null, 'A ruthless gangster named Don is killed during a scuffle with the police. Since only DSP D''Silva knows of this incident, he recruits Vijay, who is a spitting image of Don, to replace the original Don and infiltrate his gang. D''Silva plans to nab the entire gang, but when he dies during a raid, the secret that Vijay is not Don is also buried with him.', 'A ruthless gangster named Don is killed during a scuffle with the police. Since only DSP D''Silva knows of this incident, he recruits Vijay, who is a spitting image of Don, to replace the original Don and infiltrate his gang. D''Silva plans to nab the entire gang, but when he dies during a raid, the secret that Vijay is not Don is also buried with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLxX1pmZitRXGdxtmbLuPBq53Y9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33104'),
  ('867908443199187624', 'Don', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Farhan Akhtar, Nandini Shrikent, Rohit Dhawan', 'Salim Khan, Javed Akhtar', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Arjun Rampal, Boman Irani, Om Puri, Isha Koppikar, Pavan Malhotra, Rajesh Khattar', 'PG-13', 'DCP DeSilva sees a way to bring to justice the feared head of a criminal empire by recruiting a man named Vijay, who looks exactly like the crime boss. The ruse works too well, and soon Vijay finds his life in danger when DeSilva, the only one who knows his true identity, dies.', 'DCP DeSilva sees a way to bring to justice the feared head of a criminal empire by recruiting a man named Vijay, who looks exactly like the crime boss. The ruse works too well, and soon Vijay finds his life in danger when DeSilva, the only one who knows his true identity, dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HyRXNJ4U3H5yP9XjeTGWtlUlJN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17501'),
