  ('809374547214735097', 'Don Chisciotte e Sancio Panza', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Alessandro Metz, Mario Capriotti', 'Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Fulvia Franco, Umberto D''Orsi, Mirella Pamphili, Franco Giacobini, Giovanni Ivan Scratuglia, Liana Trouché', null, 'Comic version of the famous man of la Mancha by Miguel de Cervantes in which Don Quixote having read an adventure book too many sets out on his own adventures with his servant Sancho Panza.', 'Comic version of the famous man of la Mancha by Miguel de Cervantes in which Don Quixote having read an adventure book too many sets out on his own adventures with his servant Sancho Panza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sf6pEkFr7U5LIhPq3czU7BE5y1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121313'),
  ('523217742197029142', 'Don de Dios', 2005, 'Drama', 'Fermín Gómez Lara', 'Fermín Gómez Lara', 'Mauricio Islas, Luis Felipe Tovar, Tomás Goros, Jenny Lore, Angélica López, Irene Arcila, Anna Cepinska, Gloria Guzmán', null, 'Tepito is a neighborhood of Mexico City, where the dreams of many destitute people become real. But Tepito is also run by organized crime and corrupt politicians, impunity reigns and justice is non- existent. Here will take place the story of two foolishly proud young men, who were once best childhood friends, and now are blinded by greed and turn against each other. Their intentions are to destroy their families and eventually their own lives.', 'Tepito is a neighborhood of Mexico City, where the dreams of many destitute people become real. But Tepito is also run by organized crime and corrupt politicians, impunity reigns and justice is non- existent. Here will take place the story of two foolishly proud young men, who were once best childhood friends, and now are blinded by greed and turn against each other. Their intentions are to destroy their families and eventually their own lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40sAr5tsvmRNcCnj7wI04BArmJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90295'),
  ('268101591671963150', 'Don Donald', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Ben Sharpsteen, Louis Debney', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald is courting Daisy (called Donna, here in her first appearance) Duck in Mexico. He arrives on a burro, which doesn''t get along at all well with her; she convinces him to buy a car. They head through the desert, but the car breaks down, and throws Donald out, then takes off on its own with Daisy trapped inside the rumble seat. The car hits a rock, throwing Daisy into a mud puddle, to Donald''s excessive amusement. Daisy pulls a unicycle from her purse, and rides off.', 'Donald is courting Daisy (called Donna, here in her first appearance) Duck in Mexico. He arrives on a burro, which doesn''t get along at all well with her; she convinces him to buy a car. They head through the desert, but the car breaks down, and throws Donald out, then takes off on its own with Daisy trapped inside the rumble seat. The car hits a rock, throwing Daisy into a mud puddle, to Donald''s excessive amusement. Daisy pulls a unicycle from her purse, and rides off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipZj0bN6yqtIIWCIhhYNTpb1JFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62405'),
  ('499761415690732129', 'Don erre que erre', 1970, 'Comedy', 'José Luis Sáenz de Heredia, Federico G. Larraya, Luis Ligero', 'José Luis Sáenz de Heredia, Rafael J. Salvia', 'Paco Martínez Soria, Mari Carmen Prendes, José Sacristán, Alfonso del Real, Josele Román, Tomás Blanco, Guillermo Marín, Valeriano Andrés', null, 'Don Rodrigo goes to the bank and when he is going to take his money there is a robbery. Then the bank refuses to give him his money back (257 pesetas, a small amount of money) with the argument that the money was robbed to him, not to the bank. He will fight against the bank till the last consequences.', 'Don Rodrigo goes to the bank and when he is going to take his money there is a robbery. Then the bank refuses to give him his money back (257 pesetas, a small amount of money) with the argument that the money was robbed to him, not to the bank. He will fight against the bank till the last consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Z0XQtbbuWIOY5FHrnmo0iyrolh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85897'),
  ('906690775093753832', 'Don Franco and Don Ciccio in a Year of Protest', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Marino Girolami, Guido Girolami, Corrado Prisco', 'Amedeo Sollazzo, Marino Girolami', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Edwige Fenech, Ennio Girolami, Umberto D''Orsi, Lino Banfi, Luca Sportelli, Enzo Andronico', null, 'Italy''s best loved comedy duo play rival priests in the neighboring towns of Roccapizzone and San Antonio. Did Franco crash his bike through Ciccio''s new stained glass window on purpose or was he just in town for their mutual confession? Their main beef with each other concerns their opposing football teams and this feud takes up a great deal of the picture.', 'Italy''s best loved comedy duo play rival priests in the neighboring towns of Roccapizzone and San Antonio. Did Franco crash his bike through Ciccio''s new stained glass window on purpose or was he just in town for their mutual confession? Their main beef with each other concerns their opposing football teams and this feud takes up a great deal of the picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTXQRgeq1B1IDPwVY82u2LMktCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121314'),
  ('396859483714009464', 'Don Giovanni', 1979, 'Drama, Music', 'Joseph Losey, Gerry Fisher, Carlo Carlotto', 'Frantz Salieri, Patricia Losey, Joseph Losey', 'Ruggero Raimondi, John Macurdy, Edda Moser, Kiri Te Kanawa, Kenneth Riegel, José van Dam, Teresa Berganza, Malcolm King', null, 'Screen adapatation of Mozart''s greatest opera. Don Giovanni, the infamous womanizer, makes one conquest after another until the ghost of Donna Anna''s father, the Commendatore, (whom Giovanni killed) makes his appearance. He offers Giovanni one last chance to repent for his multitudinious improprieties. He will not change his ways So, he is sucked down into hell by evil spirits. High drama, hysterical comedy, magnificent music!', 'Screen adapatation of Mozart''s greatest opera. Don Giovanni, the infamous womanizer, makes one conquest after another until the ghost of Donna Anna''s father, the Commendatore, (whom Giovanni killed) makes his appearance. He offers Giovanni one last chance to repent for his multitudinious improprieties. He will not change his ways So, he is sucked down into hell by evil spirits. High drama, hysterical comedy, magnificent music!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4avKNH3REZtyZiCHBwq8TvRKNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61638'),
  ('84687021950897401', 'Don Jon', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Thomas Kloss, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Scarlett Johansson, Julianne Moore, Tony Danza, Glenne Headly, Brie Larson, Lindsey Broad, Rob Brown', 'R', 'A New Jersey guy dedicated to his family, friends, and church, develops unrealistic expectations from watching porn and works to find happiness and intimacy with his potential true love.', 'A New Jersey guy dedicated to his family, friends, and church, develops unrealistic expectations from watching porn and works to find happiness and intimacy with his potential true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uh8bwvgGXeUKzdL4oSul9zxyTcd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138697'),
  ('532157815294584259', 'Don Juan', 1926, 'Adventure, Romance', 'Alan Crosland, Byron Haskin, Gordon Hollingshead', 'Bess Meredyth', 'John Barrymore, Jane Winton, John Roche, Warner Oland, Estelle Taylor, Montagu Love, Josef Swickard, Willard Louis', 'NR', 'If there was one thing that Don Juan de Marana learned from his father Don Jose, it was that women gave you three things - life, disillusionment and death. In his father''s case it was his wife, Donna Isobel, and Donna Elvira who supplied the latter. Don Juan settled in Rome after attending the University of Pisa. Rome was run by the tyrannical Borgia family consisting of Caesar, Lucrezia and the Count Donati. Juan has his way with and was pursued by many women, but it is the one that he could not have that haunts him. It will be for her that he suffers the wrath of Borgia for ignoring Lucrezia and then killing Count Donati in a duel. For Adriana, they will both be condemned to death in the prison on the river Tigre.', 'If there was one thing that Don Juan de Marana learned from his father Don Jose, it was that women gave you three things - life, disillusionment and death. In his father''s case it was his wife, Donna Isobel, and Donna Elvira who supplied the latter. Don Juan settled in Rome after attending the University of Pisa. Rome was run by the tyrannical Borgia family consisting of Caesar, Lucrezia and the Count Donati. Juan has his way with and was pursued by many women, but it is the one that he could not have that haunts him. It will be for her that he suffers the wrath of Borgia for ignoring Lucrezia and then killing Count Donati in a duel. For Adriana, they will both be condemned to death in the prison on the river Tigre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgG2uNEvdmgVs9k8RlTA9JqxsQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89059'),
  ('628431969425957767', 'Don Juan', 1969, 'Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Svatopluk Malý', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'František Filipovský, Vítězslav Kuschmitz, M. Krajník, J. Posedník, M. Volková', null, 'The age-old story of Don Juan, played by giant puppets.', 'The age-old story of Don Juan, played by giant puppets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10FPKjxCaKzhBCAclsii9hSaC2R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19019'),
  ('1149510085706976006', 'Don Juan', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jacques Weber, José Luis Alcaine', 'Molière, Jacques Weber', 'Jacques Weber, Michel Boujenah, Emmanuelle Béart, Penélope Cruz, Ariadna Gil, Denis Lavant, Michael Lonsdale, Jacques Frantz', null, 'Spain in the mid-seventeenth century. A series of bloody wars has ravaged the nation. Don Juan the nobleman and his valet, Sganarelle, roam the countryside on horseback, on the run and lost.', 'Spain in the mid-seventeenth century. A series of bloody wars has ravaged the nation. Don Juan the nobleman and his valet, Sganarelle, roam the countryside on horseback, on the run and lost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NCivdigjwb1TTsm1KkYWSWrNQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237796'),
  ('203977601189582142', 'Don Juan', 2022, 'Comedy, Music', 'Julie Gouet, Sébastien Buchmann, Mariore Manneville', 'Axelle Ropert, Serge Bozon', 'Tahar Rahim, Virginie Efira, Alain Chamfort, Damien Chapelle, Jehnny Beth, Louise Ribière, Colline Libon, Elsa Esnoult', null, 'Jilted on his wedding day, Laurent, a stage actor playing the role of the famous seducer Don Juan, cannot help but see his ex-fiancée in every women he meets. In an attempt to mend his broken heart and ego, he tries to seduce them all but none are receptive to his elaborate (and musical) advances. Meanwhile, at the theater, the leading lady quits and the production brings in Laurent’s ex-fiancée as the replacement.', 'Jilted on his wedding day, Laurent, a stage actor playing the role of the famous seducer Don Juan, cannot help but see his ex-fiancée in every women he meets. In an attempt to mend his broken heart and ego, he tries to seduce them all but none are receptive to his elaborate (and musical) advances. Meanwhile, at the theater, the leading lady quits and the production brings in Laurent’s ex-fiancée as the replacement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lhmSCuUz24zwpbow9MTuV9S2iZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657198'),
  ('928625677845924395', 'Don Juan 67', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Velo, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'Carlos Velo, Fernando Galiana', 'Mauricio Garcés, Isela Vega, Irma Lozano, David Reynoso, Maura Monti, Alicia Bonet, Chalo Gonzalez, Martha Navarro', null, 'Mauricio, millionaire, and irreclaimable Don Juan, lives only for and to seduce women of every class and condition. With the help of his butler manages to capture the hearts of many to abandon and then having a panic marriage.', 'Mauricio, millionaire, and irreclaimable Don Juan, lives only for and to seduce women of every class and condition. With the help of his butler manages to capture the hearts of many to abandon and then having a panic marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzxQKqZTWkfn5gkFoan9OB33YGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260040'),
  ('1021358745681082863', 'Don Juan DeMarco', 1994, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Jeremy Leven, Ralf D. Bode', 'Jeremy Leven', 'Johnny Depp, Marlon Brando, Faye Dunaway, Géraldine Pailhas, Bob Dishy, Rachel Ticotin, Talisa Soto, Stephen Singer', 'PG-13', 'John Arnold DeMarco is a man who believes he is Don Juan, the greatest lover in the world. Clad in a cape and mask, DeMarco undergoes psychiatric treatment with Dr. Jack Mickler to cure him of his apparent delusion. But the psychiatric sessions have an unexpected effect on the psychiatric staff and, most profoundly, Dr Mickler, who rekindles the romance in his complacent marriage.', 'John Arnold DeMarco is a man who believes he is Don Juan, the greatest lover in the world. Clad in a cape and mask, DeMarco undergoes psychiatric treatment with Dr. Jack Mickler to cure him of his apparent delusion. But the psychiatric sessions have an unexpected effect on the psychiatric staff and, most profoundly, Dr Mickler, who rekindles the romance in his complacent marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fe0TuYz9jCKUba2Omj48K8bWJ8z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1909'),
  ('536476042484512292', 'Don Juan in Sicily', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Lattuada, Roberto Gerardi, Oddo Bracci', 'Sabatino Ciuffini, Attilio Riccio, Giorgio Salvioni', 'Lando Buzzanca, Katia Moguy, Katia Christine, Stefania Careddu, Ewa Aulin, Marcella Michelangeli, Roberto De Simone, Ugo Attanasio', null, 'Giovanni Percolla lives in Catania surrounded by the attentive cares of his three sisters. He permanently acts like a Don Giovanni to hide his real poor "knowledge" of women. With his friend he moves also to Rome but women still continues to remain part of his fantasies. But Giovanni succeeded to build anyway a fame of "tombeur de femmes". One day he meets the real love of Maria Antonietta and decides to marry. Will things change?', 'Giovanni Percolla lives in Catania surrounded by the attentive cares of his three sisters. He permanently acts like a Don Giovanni to hide his real poor "knowledge" of women. With his friend he moves also to Rome but women still continues to remain part of his fantasies. But Giovanni succeeded to build anyway a fame of "tombeur de femmes". One day he meets the real love of Maria Antonietta and decides to marry. Will things change?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHhMqUxwroHj0eRNOZpM8Ei8uA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284273'),
  ('311435025414590722', 'Don Juan or If Don Juan Were a Woman', 1973, 'Drama', 'Roger Vadim, Henri Decaë, Andréas Winding', 'Jean-Pierre Petrolacci', 'Brigitte Bardot, Robert Hossein, Mathieu Carrière, Michèle Sand, Jane Birkin, Robert Walker Jr., Maurice Ronet, Dominique Zardi', 'R', 'Jeanne lives in Paris and believes she is the reincarnation of Don Juan. She visits a priest and tells him she has killed a man. He comes to her elegant flat - her father has died leaving her rich - and she tells the priest stories about men she has seduced. The seduction is easy, she tells him, it''s destruction that takes planning. We watch her with an upright elected official, a wealthy boor, and a folk singer. She describes herself as a spider. Her friend Léporella tries to be Jeanne''s conscience. What does Jeanne want?', 'Jeanne lives in Paris and believes she is the reincarnation of Don Juan. She visits a priest and tells him she has killed a man. He comes to her elegant flat - her father has died leaving her rich - and she tells the priest stories about men she has seduced. The seduction is easy, she tells him, it''s destruction that takes planning. We watch her with an upright elected official, a wealthy boor, and a folk singer. She describes herself as a spider. Her friend Léporella tries to be Jeanne''s conscience. What does Jeanne want?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7O8oQQBxUAkKUZvs6fVslQ8QQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82969'),
  ('628330245036125302', 'Don Juan, My Dear Ghost', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Mercero, Carlos Suárez', 'Joaquín Oristrell, Antonio Mercero', 'Juan Luis Galiardo, María Barranco, José «Saza» Sazatornil, Verónica Forqué, Luis Escobar, Rossy de Palma', null, 'Seville, November 1, 1990. Tenorio goes out of his grave, as every year. Similarly, Juan Marquina, a great actor, makes the general rehearsal of a musical version of the play. Since that moment, two worlds come together in a circle of adventures, facing both Don Juans, helped by four beautiful women with decisive influence on their destinies.', 'Seville, November 1, 1990. Tenorio goes out of his grave, as every year. Similarly, Juan Marquina, a great actor, makes the general rehearsal of a musical version of the play. Since that moment, two worlds come together in a circle of adventures, facing both Don Juans, helped by four beautiful women with decisive influence on their destinies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6w0dJXZ3UTcKX2iWSUN9C9J3stF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95994'),
  ('297718738930784182', 'Don King: Only in America', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Herzfeld, Bill Butler', null, 'Ving Rhames, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Jeremy Piven, Darius McCrary, Keith David, Gabriel Casseus, Loretta Devine, Brent Jennings', null, 'A cinematic portrait of the famous fight promoter and boxing manager.', 'A cinematic portrait of the famous fight promoter and boxing manager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJmNeaGivcXKd8Gzzbi3YRIqHtF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31907'),
  ('601990385651109239', 'Don McKay', 2009, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jake Goldberger, Phil Parmet', 'Jake Goldberger', 'Thomas Haden Church, Elisabeth Shue, Melissa Leo, M. Emmet Walsh, Keith David, James Rebhorn, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Stephen Benson', 'R', 'Everything appears off-kilter when a man returns to his hometown after 25 years to visit his former lover.', 'Everything appears off-kilter when a man returns to his hometown after 25 years to visit his former lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkziSZ6vmwFnhybgBAM96Q6xKMr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35689'),
  ('1137128484315739978', 'Don Milani - Il priore di Barbiana', 1997, 'History, Drama', 'Andrea Frazzi', 'Stefano Rulli, Sandro Petraglia', 'Sergio Castellitto, Roberto Citran, Ilaria Occhini, Gianna Giachetti, Mauro Marino, Mario Valgoi, Evelina Gori, Adelaide Foti', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QtU67jdnaYu5MEMeUZp9X8HWWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254494'),
  ('126725806648066511', 'Don Olsen kommer til byen', 1964, 'Family, Comedy', 'Anker Sørensen, Henning Bendtsen', 'Bent Christensen, Knud Poulsen, Tage Vandsted', 'Dirch Passer, Buster Larsen, Bodil Udsen, Birgitte Price, Marguerite Viby, Bendt Rothe, Otto Brandenburg, Daimi', null, 'Bank director L.W. Jacobsen resides in a small provincial town. He is not particularly interested in his wife, Elsebeth, but rather in teacher and city council member Miss Mortensen. Thorsen, the town''s manufacturer, is a member of the same city council group as Jacobsen. Then Don Olsen comes to town. Olsen is not interested in the upper class, but rather in people. By chance, Thorsen and Olsen meet and soon become drinking buddies. Thorsen drags the milkman''s horse home to his apartment in the middle of the night. The scandal is a reality. Thorsen wants to flee, but with Olsen''s help, he instead woos the townspeople and Miss Mortensen under the motto "Make good times better."', 'Bank director L.W. Jacobsen resides in a small provincial town. He is not particularly interested in his wife, Elsebeth, but rather in teacher and city council member Miss Mortensen. Thorsen, the town''s manufacturer, is a member of the same city council group as Jacobsen. Then Don Olsen comes to town. Olsen is not interested in the upper class, but rather in people. By chance, Thorsen and Olsen meet and soon become drinking buddies. Thorsen drags the milkman''s horse home to his apartment in the middle of the night. The scandal is a reality. Thorsen wants to flee, but with Olsen''s help, he instead woos the townspeople and Miss Mortensen under the motto "Make good times better."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhbAuVmr8BLCgauPjvvPB4VreiF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47265'),
  ('695903898177749980', 'Don Q Son of Zorro', 1925, 'Western, Adventure, Romance', 'Donald Crisp, Henry Sharp, Frank Richardson', 'Jack Cunningham, Lotta Woods', 'Douglas Fairbanks, Mary Astor, Jack McDonald, Donald Crisp, Stella De Lanti, Warner Oland, Jean Hersholt, Albert MacQuarrie', null, 'Don Cesar De Vega crosses swords with a vicious member of the Queen''s Guard, and steals the affection of a young heiress. When the officer frames the young upstart for murder, Don Cesar fakes his own death and retreats to the crumbling ruins of the family castle he plots his vengeance.', 'Don Cesar De Vega crosses swords with a vicious member of the Queen''s Guard, and steals the affection of a young heiress. When the officer frames the young upstart for murder, Don Cesar fakes his own death and retreats to the crumbling ruins of the family castle he plots his vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opEdSrnK0cuYX3XsN5KF8WNnFYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111759'),
  ('156116771766356409', 'Don Quijote cabalga de nuevo', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Roberto Gavaldón, Francisco Sempere, Zacarías Urbiola', 'Carlos Blanco', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Cantinflas, María Fernanda D''Ocón, Paca Gabaldón, Ricardo Merino, José Orjas, Emilio Laguna, Laly Soldevila', null, 'A new vision of the Knight of the sad figure, which lives obsessed by the chivalry and its codes of honor. Accompanied by his unusual squire Sancho Panza, Don Quixote recalls some of the adventures they''ve shared.', 'A new vision of the Knight of the sad figure, which lives obsessed by the chivalry and its codes of honor. Accompanied by his unusual squire Sancho Panza, Don Quixote recalls some of the adventures they''ve shared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yR2ouxrAFwsRG1FrqZOgdZ1smcS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145481'),
  ('953230616914643134', 'Don Quixote', 1933, 'Adventure, Drama', 'G.W. Pabst, Nicolas Farkas, Paul Portier', 'Paul Morand, G.W. Pabst', 'Feodor Chaliapin Sr., Dorville, René Donnio, Renée Valliers, Mady Berry, Mireille Balin, Arlette Marchal, Jean de Limur', 'NR', 'Inflamed by his readings of chivalric novels, Don Quixote, a knight with a sad face, accompanied by Sancho Panza, a peasant steeped in common sense, decides to set off across the world in search of improbable adventures.', 'Inflamed by his readings of chivalric novels, Don Quixote, a knight with a sad face, accompanied by Sancho Panza, a peasant steeped in common sense, decides to set off across the world in search of improbable adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UyeBI3Iof9h4MSpOYrbT15KaLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190375'),
  ('665297476151120347', 'Don Quixote', 1947, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Rafael Gil, Alfredo Fraile', 'Rafael Gil', 'Rafael Rivelles, Juan Calvo, Fernando Rey, Manolo Morán, Sara Montiel, Juan Espantaleón, Guillermo Marín, Nani Fernández', null, 'The old hidalgo Don Alonso Quijano, maddened by the excessive reading of books on chivalry and determined to become a famous and heroic knight-errant, leaves his village and sets out on the road in search of adventure, accompanied by his faithful friend Sancho Panza.', 'The old hidalgo Don Alonso Quijano, maddened by the excessive reading of books on chivalry and determined to become a famous and heroic knight-errant, leaves his village and sets out on the road in search of adventure, accompanied by his faithful friend Sancho Panza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lrwOGPr6EvvwiLyj9gl5wtrQR0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94341'),
  ('1140761643595003731', 'Don Quixote', 1957, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Grigori Kozintsev, Andrey Moskvin, Apollinariy Dudko', 'Yevgeni Shvarts', 'Nikolai Cherkasov, Yuriy Tolubeev, Serafima Birman, Svetlana Grigoreva, Vladimir Maksimov, Viktor Kolpakov, Lyudmila Kasyanova, Tamilla Aghamirova', null, 'Senor Quexana has read so many books on chivalry that he believes that he is the knight Don Quixote de la Mancha. So Don Quixote sets off on his horse, accompanied by his squire Sancho Panza on a mule, to perform valiant deeds. They mistakenly save the Lady Altisidora who is so amused that she invites them to visit the Duke to provide some merriment at court. Among other deeds, Don Quixote frees some prisoners, who then turn upon him, and Don Quixote attacks a windmill that he imagines is a monstrous wizard.', 'Senor Quexana has read so many books on chivalry that he believes that he is the knight Don Quixote de la Mancha. So Don Quixote sets off on his horse, accompanied by his squire Sancho Panza on a mule, to perform valiant deeds. They mistakenly save the Lady Altisidora who is so amused that she invites them to visit the Duke to provide some merriment at court. Among other deeds, Don Quixote frees some prisoners, who then turn upon him, and Don Quixote attacks a windmill that he imagines is a monstrous wizard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q0LoAVxhlJNHrrs0CCxJsp2WhcE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84782'),
  ('198517791657506833', 'Don Quixote', 1962, 'Animation', 'Vlado Kristl', 'Miguel de Cervantes, Vlado Kristl', null, null, '"Don Kihot" is a satirical, Klee-esque meditation about Don Quijote in the contemporary militaristic and regimentistic world.', '"Don Kihot" is a satirical, Klee-esque meditation about Don Quijote in the contemporary militaristic and regimentistic world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWKzHeAruTKtnpyg9UXXYrUaJ2H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117982'),
  ('683552277406934343', 'Don Quixote', 1992, 'Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'Orson Welles, Gary Graver, José García Galisteo', 'Orson Welles', 'Francisco Reiguera, Akim Tamiroff, Orson Welles, Pepe Mediavilla, Juan Carlos Ordóñez, Constantino Romero, Paola Mori, Juan Serrano', null, 'A posthumous 1992 reconstruction of Orson Welles’s long-unfinished Don Quixote project, edited by Jesús Franco from footage shot between 1957 and 1972, following Don Quixote and Sancho Panza as they wander modern Spain in pursuit of chivalric ideals. (Note: This version represents a later editorial assembly, not a film completed by Welles.)', 'A posthumous 1992 reconstruction of Orson Welles’s long-unfinished Don Quixote project, edited by Jesús Franco from footage shot between 1957 and 1972, following Don Quixote and Sancho Panza as they wander modern Spain in pursuit of chivalric ideals. (Note: This version represents a later editorial assembly, not a film completed by Welles.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ot8NgOyV53lTJ2Qp5wumCJdDq5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31987'),
  ('330063841035796902', 'Don Quixote', 2000, 'Adventure, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Peter Yates, David Connell, Alan Tomkins', 'John Mortimer', 'John Lithgow, Bob Hoskins, Isabella Rossellini, Vanessa Williams, Lambert Wilson, Amelia Warner, Tony Haygarth, Peter Eyre', 'NR', 'Adapted from the work of Miguel de Cervantes, this is the story of a hidalgo, fanatic for chivalry novels, who loses his sanity and believing to be a knight named Don Quixote de La Mancha, decides to go on imaginary adventures along with his friend, the simple farmer Sancho Panza, who becomes his squire. On their journeys, they rescue dames in distress in honorable acts and fight giants among other perils, with Don longing to be with the love of his life, lady Dulcinea, and Sancho waiting to be rewarded with an island where he''s about to become a governor.', 'Adapted from the work of Miguel de Cervantes, this is the story of a hidalgo, fanatic for chivalry novels, who loses his sanity and believing to be a knight named Don Quixote de La Mancha, decides to go on imaginary adventures along with his friend, the simple farmer Sancho Panza, who becomes his squire. On their journeys, they rescue dames in distress in honorable acts and fight giants among other perils, with Don longing to be with the love of his life, lady Dulcinea, and Sancho waiting to be rewarded with an island where he''s about to become a governor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAAYFnAR7bIX3iaVBWg0OfmcQz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207937'),
  ('986064105001203919', 'Don Quixote, Knight Errant', 2002, 'Comedy, Adventure, Drama', 'Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón', 'Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón', 'Juan Luis Galiardo, Carlos Iglesias, José Luis Torrijo, Fernando Guillén Cuervo, Santiago Ramos, Carmen Machi, Max Hausmann', null, 'After an old soldier named Miguel de Cervantes (1547-1616) wrote the adventures of Don Quixote and Sancho Panza, the knight and his squire have become very popular. When he learns that the Turkish comes along the Mediterranean coast with a powerful army, Don Quixote will undertake, again opposed by his niece and his housekeeper, a new adventure that begins in La Mancha and ends on the coast.', 'After an old soldier named Miguel de Cervantes (1547-1616) wrote the adventures of Don Quixote and Sancho Panza, the knight and his squire have become very popular. When he learns that the Turkish comes along the Mediterranean coast with a powerful army, Don Quixote will undertake, again opposed by his niece and his housekeeper, a new adventure that begins in La Mancha and ends on the coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gO913BidX1tOyo5JkDsx5x9Sgpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115725'),
  ('562046764599063296', 'Don Verdean', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Jared Hess, Mattias Troelstrup', 'Jared Hess, Jerusha Hess', 'Sam Rockwell, Jemaine Clement, Amy Ryan, Danny McBride, Will Forte, Leslie Bibb, Steve Park, Sky Elobar', 'PG-13', 'Biblical archaeologist Don Verdean is hired by a local church pastor to find faith-promoting relics in the Holy Land. But after a fruitless expedition he is forced to get creative in this comedy of faith and fraud.', 'Biblical archaeologist Don Verdean is hired by a local church pastor to find faith-promoting relics in the Holy Land. But after a fruitless expedition he is forced to get creative in this comedy of faith and fraud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDRa5s8n0jEHW2SSE8Xn4HRI3Ue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309298'),
  ('1066200915558954999', 'Don''s Fountain of Youth', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'While traveling with his nephews, Donald is disgusted that they are only interested in comics. He stops at the "fountain of youth" and tricks the kids into thinking he is a baby again. However, he gets tangled up with an aggressive mother alligator and her babies, and makes a hurried exit with the nephews.', 'While traveling with his nephews, Donald is disgusted that they are only interested in comics. He stops at the "fountain of youth" and tricks the kids into thinking he is a baby again. However, he gets tangled up with an aggressive mother alligator and her babies, and makes a hurried exit with the nephews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJa2PxKZuKWvYvO97jt5YCIKPx3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55503'),
  ('555088189352345078', 'Don''s Party', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Bruce Beresford', 'David Williamson', 'John Hargreaves, Graham Kennedy, Ray Barrett, Clare Binney, Graeme Blundell, Pat Bishop, Jeanie Drynan, Harold Hopkins', null, 'On the night of the 1969 federal election, Don Henderson invites a group of friends to celebrate a predicted Labor Party victory, much to the dismay of his wife, Kath. The Hendersons and their nine guests drink, joke, make love, and fight, all while coming to terms with their individual struggles in life.', 'On the night of the 1969 federal election, Don Henderson invites a group of friends to celebrate a predicted Labor Party victory, much to the dismay of his wife, Kath. The Hendersons and their nine guests drink, joke, make love, and fight, all while coming to terms with their individual struggles in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ze1TSaRBNJkgvNjvDJpUiWmRt9T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38919'),
  ('690349377782545494', 'Don''s Plum', 2002, 'Drama', 'R.D. Robb, Steve Adcock, Brian Bellamy', 'Dale Wheatley', 'Scott Bloom, Kevin Connolly, Tobey Maguire, Leonardo DiCaprio, Jenny Lewis, Meadow Sisto, Marissa Ribisi, Amber Benson', null, 'A group of Los Angeles teenagers meets daily at their local diner hangout to discuss their latest misadventures and miserable lives.', 'A group of Los Angeles teenagers meets daily at their local diner hangout to discuss their latest misadventures and miserable lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXWiYyWaNUfZaud5maDWDFJ5AG7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37857'),
  ('757568905139223625', 'Don''t', 1975, 'Documentary', 'Robin Lehman', null, null, null, 'The lyric passage of a Monarch butterfly, beginning with its birth, through its delicate metamorphosis from caterpillar to butterfly and on its journey from country to city. From the first frame, the audience experiences the tension of this perilous flight as numerous adversaries, threaten the butterfly''s freedom. A lively sound track, with music composed by Frederic Chopin, allows us to live for a few moments in this fleeting world.', 'The lyric passage of a Monarch butterfly, beginning with its birth, through its delicate metamorphosis from caterpillar to butterfly and on its journey from country to city. From the first frame, the audience experiences the tension of this perilous flight as numerous adversaries, threaten the butterfly''s freedom. A lively sound track, with music composed by Frederic Chopin, allows us to live for a few moments in this fleeting world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thjpbugl17zapfxFY1bXKJ4EbFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243396'),
