  ('353259852946529251', 'Don''t Be a Menace to South Central While Drinking Your Juice in the Hood', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Paris Barclay, Russ Brandt', 'Shawn Wayans, Marlon Wayans, Phil Beauman', 'Shawn Wayans, Marlon Wayans, Tracey Cherelle Jones, Chris Spencer, Vivica A. Fox, Lahmard J. Tate, Rappin'' Granny, Suli McCullough', 'R', 'When Ashtray moves to South Central L.A. to live with his father (who appears to be the same age he is) and grandmother (who likes to talk tough and smoke reefer), he falls in with his gang-banging cousin Loc Dog, who along with the requisite pistols and Uzi carries a thermo-nuclear warhead for self-defense. Will Ashtray be able to keep living the straight life?', 'When Ashtray moves to South Central L.A. to live with his father (who appears to be the same age he is) and grandmother (who likes to talk tough and smoke reefer), he falls in with his gang-banging cousin Loc Dog, who along with the requisite pistols and Uzi carries a thermo-nuclear warhead for self-defense. Will Ashtray be able to keep living the straight life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HZQBF7JDd2e9p4rPSbSHuWHaCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10607'),
