  ('907519852083810469', 'Don''t Breathe', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Helga Rossi, Fede Álvarez, Pedro Luque', 'Fede Álvarez, Rodo Sayagues', 'Stephen Lang, Jane Levy, Dylan Minnette, Daniel Zovatto, Emma Bercovici, Franciska Törőcsik, Christian Zagia, Katia Bokor', 'R', 'A group of teens break into a blind man''s home thinking they''ll get away with the perfect crime. They''re wrong.', 'A group of teens break into a blind man''s home thinking they''ll get away with the perfect crime. They''re wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSxHyPZ2nipSfvdft4IhQKjk5eZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300669'),
