  ('169735261122798759', 'Don''t Click', 2012, 'Horror, Crime, Mystery', 'Kim Gi-tae, Kim Tae-kyung', 'Kim Tae-Hyoung, Hong Geon-Gook, Choi Kwan-young', 'Park Bo-young, Joo Won, Kang Byul, Kim Min-hyuk, Lee Marg-Eum, Kang Hae-In, Kwon Nam-hee, Jeong Dong-gyoo', null, 'A horror movie about the mysterious happenings that happen to a pair of sisters after watching an unidentified video. Directed by Kim Tae-kyeong, Park Bo-yeong plays Se-hee who tries to save her sister Jeong-mi, her boyfriend Joo Won and Kang Byeol plays the sister.', 'A horror movie about the mysterious happenings that happen to a pair of sisters after watching an unidentified video. Directed by Kim Tae-kyeong, Park Bo-yeong plays Se-hee who tries to save her sister Jeong-mi, her boyfriend Joo Won and Kang Byeol plays the sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQIaKeYLt8vZzCxxFysFIxyxrRn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132957'),
  ('270061380050200517', 'Don''t Come Back Alive', 2022, 'Thriller, Fantasy, Horror', 'Néstor Sánchez Sotelo, Mariano Suárez, Sergio Suárez', 'Hernán Moyano', 'María Abadi, Melisa Garat, Marco de la O, Ruby Vizcarra, Rafaella Pampiglione, Fiorela Duranda, Daniel Reyes, Roberto Romano', null, 'A dogged detective and hard charging prosecutor track the criminal ring behind a gruesome series of murders. What they find shocks them to their core - a sinister satanic female cult leader orchestrating gruesome murder rituals to bring about the rise of the anti-Christ. They must figure out why this happened, when the next ritual will happen and how to stop her!', 'A dogged detective and hard charging prosecutor track the criminal ring behind a gruesome series of murders. What they find shocks them to their core - a sinister satanic female cult leader orchestrating gruesome murder rituals to bring about the rise of the anti-Christ. They must figure out why this happened, when the next ritual will happen and how to stop her!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arb5afU36jYYmDvOWMW3i8Z4Tmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812488'),
  ('78593776694212935', 'Don''t Come Knocking', 2005, 'Drama, Western', 'Wim Wenders, Franz Lustig, Michael Wenders', 'Sam Shepard, Wim Wenders', 'Sam Shepard, Jessica Lange, Tim Roth, Gabriel Mann, Sarah Polley, Fairuza Balk, Eva Marie Saint, James Roday Rodriguez', 'R', 'Howard Spence has seen better days. Once a big Western movie star, he now drowns his disgust for his selfish and failed life with alcohol, drugs and young women. If he were to die now, nobody would shed a tear over him, that''s the sad truth. Until one day Howard learns that he might have a child somewhere out there...', 'Howard Spence has seen better days. Once a big Western movie star, he now drowns his disgust for his selfish and failed life with alcohol, drugs and young women. If he were to die now, nobody would shed a tear over him, that''s the sad truth. Until one day Howard learns that he might have a child somewhere out there...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sF9LWvw71gaGR46QtJIFGtLXhWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3527'),
  ('32404087897263891', 'Don''t Cry for Salim the Lame', 1989, 'Crime, Drama', 'Saeed Akhtar Mirza, Manoj Lalwani, Gautam Sen', 'Saeed Akhtar Mirza', 'Pavan Malhotra, Makrand Deshpande, Ashutosh Gowariker, Rajendra Gupta, Neelima Azim, Vikram Gokhale, Surekha Sikri, Nishigandha Wad', null, 'Salim Pasha, a man with a physical disability, is involved in crimes like extortion and robbery with two of his friends Peera and Abdul. Salim is a carefree man.', 'Salim Pasha, a man with a physical disability, is involved in crimes like extortion and robbery with two of his friends Peera and Abdul. Salim is a carefree man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yZhOdiME6hobTizFaz4yFrv0Oi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128677'),
  ('865418640516818298', 'Don''t Cry Mommy', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Maxim Pezhemsky, Irina Vasilyeva, Andrei Zhegalov', 'Maxim Pezhemsky, Konstantin Murzenko', 'Gosha Kutsenko, Nikolay Chindyaykin, Sergey Koltakov, Evgeniy Sidikhin, Sergey Veksler, Valeriy Priyomykhov, Ivan Okhlobystin, Andrei Panin', null, 'Wedding in a provincial seaside town. In the midst of the fun criminal authority Tourist begins to molest the bride, which infuriates the groom — merchant seaman. The bandits and the police decide to plant a sailor, but he runs away and on his quest sent the police, killers, relatives and different people.', 'Wedding in a provincial seaside town. In the midst of the fun criminal authority Tourist begins to molest the bride, which infuriates the groom — merchant seaman. The bandits and the police decide to plant a sailor, but he runs away and on his quest sent the police, killers, relatives and different people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnTPHTf6KY4snosEAFjyrfd7ECT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48004'),
  ('741934922023396684', 'Don''t Cry with Your Mouth Full', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Colin Mounier, Pascal Thomas, Suzanne Schiffman', 'Roland Duval, Pascal Thomas, Suzanne Schiffman', 'Annie Colé, Frédéric Duru, Bernard Ménez, Jean Carmet, Christina Chamaret, Daniel Ceccaldi, Hélène Dieudonné, Alain Perceau', null, 'Annie, a 16 years old girl, loves Frédéric who is away doing his national service. During her holidays in the country, she meets Alexandre. He''s older, owns a car and she experiences the "first time" with him. Back during a leave, Frédéric finds his sweetheart in the arms of this clumsy oaf and eventually hits it off with him.', 'Annie, a 16 years old girl, loves Frédéric who is away doing his national service. During her holidays in the country, she meets Alexandre. He''s older, owns a car and she experiences the "first time" with him. Back during a leave, Frédéric finds his sweetheart in the arms of this clumsy oaf and eventually hits it off with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7INnxZiAvtxJQhZV6XfOFMJZ7rJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314149'),
  ('1095853826184789204', 'Don''t Cry, Mommy', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kim Jae-hoon, Kim Yong-Han, Park Gun-woo', 'Lee Sang-hyeon', 'Yu Seon, Nam Bo-ra, Dong Ho, Kwon Hyun-sang, Lee Sang-Min, Yu Oh-seong, Choi Dae-chul, Hong Seok-bin', null, 'Yoo-lim, who divorced her husband and was preparing for a new start, learns that her daughter, Eun-ah, got raped by boys at school. However, they will not be punished because they are minors. Eun-ah kills herself, and Yoo-lim seeks revenge.', 'Yoo-lim, who divorced her husband and was preparing for a new start, learns that her daughter, Eun-ah, got raped by boys at school. However, they will not be punished because they are minors. Eun-ah kills herself, and Yoo-lim seeks revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSljAl0eusPr2hKAhwuq1bUU3gW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146371'),
  ('469043573564440380', 'Don''t Cry, Peter', 1964, 'Comedy, War', 'France Štiglic, Ivan Marinček', 'Vladimir Koch, Ivan Ribič, France Štiglic', 'Lojze Rozman, Bert Sotlar, Majda Potokar, Zlatko Šugman, Bogdan Lubej, Polde Bibič, Maks Bajc, Danilo Bezlaj', null, 'Two partisan coalminers need to take three orphan children away from dangerous area to the liberated land.', 'Two partisan coalminers need to take three orphan children away from dangerous area to the liberated land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22WxH5LBe5TaRwEG9Nsjpp3fL4J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24414'),
  ('515178343974940752', 'Don’t Cry, Pretty Girls!', 1970, 'Drama, Music', 'Dezső Koza, Judit Szõczy, Mara Luttor', 'Péter Zimre', 'Jaroslava Schallerová, Kati Sír, Márk Zala, Lajos Balázsovits, Péter Blaskó, Balázs Kosztolányi, Balázs Tardy, József Kovács', null, 'Savanyú and his friend work at a plant. After the monotonous shifts they engage in the pleasures of the afternoon and the night, i.e. parties and concerts. Savanyú dates Juli, they are already engaged. The young men live as sub-tenants, the young women in workers'' hostels. None of these places are suited for spending time together. They are in need of an apartment. Out of the ruinous apartment which they lay siege on, however, they are sent away by the otherwise friendly policeman. At a concert held in the Park of Youth, Juli gets to know Géza. They flirt, then go to the country with a pop-group. Savanyú and his friends follow them. A minor fight cools the atmosphere.', 'Savanyú and his friend work at a plant. After the monotonous shifts they engage in the pleasures of the afternoon and the night, i.e. parties and concerts. Savanyú dates Juli, they are already engaged. The young men live as sub-tenants, the young women in workers'' hostels. None of these places are suited for spending time together. They are in need of an apartment. Out of the ruinous apartment which they lay siege on, however, they are sent away by the otherwise friendly policeman. At a concert held in the Park of Youth, Juli gets to know Géza. They flirt, then go to the country with a pop-group. Savanyú and his friends follow them. A minor fight cools the atmosphere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cA4leVjUDmgZMT9gXfjnrtz7Cfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291173'),
  ('962055668052554998', 'Don''t Deliver Us from Evil', 1971, 'Horror, Drama', 'Joël Séria, Marcel Combes', 'Joël Séria', 'Jeanne Goupil, Catherine Wagener, Bernard Dhéran, Gérard Darrieu, Marc Dudicourt, Michel Robin, Véronique Silver, Jean-Pierre Helbert', null, 'Anne and Lore, neighbors and best friends, barely into their teens, board at a convent school where they have taken a vow to sin and to serve Satan. Anne keeps a secret diary, they read a salacious novel, they get a classmate in trouble, they spy on the nuns, they set aside their communion wafers; they make a pact of devotion.', 'Anne and Lore, neighbors and best friends, barely into their teens, board at a convent school where they have taken a vow to sin and to serve Satan. Anne keeps a secret diary, they read a salacious novel, they get a classmate in trouble, they spy on the nuns, they set aside their communion wafers; they make a pact of devotion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPm3D4yYqPHkVTezY7BdQN7Cu5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61683'),
  ('335198137958720639', 'Don''t Die Too Hard!', 2001, 'Comedy, Action', 'Charles Nemes', 'Ramzy Bedia, Éric Judor, Kader Aoun', 'Éric Judor, Ramzy Bedia, Marina Foïs, Serge Riaboukine, Michel Puterflam, Omar Sy, Jean-Claude Dauphin, JoeyStarr', null, 'Eric and Ramzy are working as window washers at the Montparnasse skyscraper in Paris. Thinking that he has a date set up with beautiful executive Marie-Joelle (who in reality hates his guts), Ramzy stays at work late while Eric hangs around with him. As a result, the pair witness a gang of terrorists seize the tower and take its late-night occupants (including Marie- Joelle) hostage. Knowing that only they can save the day, Eric and Ramzy swing into action.', 'Eric and Ramzy are working as window washers at the Montparnasse skyscraper in Paris. Thinking that he has a date set up with beautiful executive Marie-Joelle (who in reality hates his guts), Ramzy stays at work late while Eric hangs around with him. As a result, the pair witness a gang of terrorists seize the tower and take its late-night occupants (including Marie- Joelle) hostage. Knowing that only they can save the day, Eric and Ramzy swing into action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QmPJAQWEqiBIwGTNivK8NYLhes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15449'),
  ('368012863750953115', 'Don''t Die Without Telling Me Where You''re Going', 1995, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Eliseo Subiela, Fabián Bielinsky, Hugo Colace', 'Eliseo Subiela', 'Darío Grandinetti, Mariana Arias, Oscar Martínez, Mónica Galán, Tincho Zabala, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Sandra Ballesteros, Sandra Sandrini', null, 'A lonely film projectionist through a series of odd events, discovers that he is the reincarnation of one of the inventors of cinema, and that a woman he sees in his dreams is his eternal companion on a trip through centuries.', 'A lonely film projectionist through a series of odd events, discovers that he is the reincarnation of one of the inventors of cinema, and that a woman he sees in his dreams is his eternal companion on a trip through centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrECi6T4U0IfE6nFzjjKvw3qklS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63004'),
  ('549133634540581040', 'Don''t Die: The Man Who Wants to Live Forever', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Chris Smith, Chris Smith', null, 'Bryan Johnson, Oliver Zolman, Mac Davis, Joao Pedro de Magalhaes, Vadim Gladyshev', 'PG-13', 'In this documentary, wealthy entrepreneur Bryan Johnson puts his body and fortune on the line to defy aging and extend his life beyond all known limits.', 'In this documentary, wealthy entrepreneur Bryan Johnson puts his body and fortune on the line to defy aging and extend his life beyond all known limits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2M0CF7UsbpQ45xGuVRhExAhUWBj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1401905'),
  ('217046213433049074', 'Don''t Drink the Water', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Harvey Genkins, Howard Morris', 'R.S. Allen, Woody Allen, Harvey Bullock', 'Jackie Gleason, Estelle Parsons, Ted Bessell, Howard St. John, Joan Delaney, Michael Constantine, Danny Meehan, Richard Libertini', null, 'The Hollander family''s European vacation is interrupted when their plane is forced to land in Vulgaria. The Hollanders leave the plane to take pictures which results in accusations of spying. Chased by Vulgarian soldiers, they take refuge in the American Embassy under the protection of the absent ambassador''s hapless son.', 'The Hollander family''s European vacation is interrupted when their plane is forced to land in Vulgaria. The Hollanders leave the plane to take pictures which results in accusations of spying. Chased by Vulgarian soldiers, they take refuge in the American Embassy under the protection of the absent ambassador''s hapless son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjbt1XEhSEcQDYUOL1Fgu8BIubR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212622'),
