  ('670471777308293601', 'Don''t Forget You''re Going to Die', 1996, 'Drama', 'Xavier Beauvois, Caroline Champetier', 'Marie Sauzeau, Xavier Beauvois, Anne-Marie Sauzeau', 'Xavier Beauvois, Chiara Mastroianni, Roschdy Zem, Bulle Ogier, Jean-Louis Richard, Emmanuel Salinger, Jean Douchet, Pascal Bonitzer', null, 'Benoit has his life all planned out before him. Unfortunately, he had totally forgotten to include his military service. Inevitably called into duty, he tries everything he can to avoid it, eventually launching into a hedonistic lifestyle—out of control with drugs, alcohol, and nightclubs.', 'Benoit has his life all planned out before him. Unfortunately, he had totally forgotten to include his military service. Inevitably called into duty, he tries everything he can to avoid it, eventually launching into a hedonistic lifestyle—out of control with drugs, alcohol, and nightclubs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoS7TUKnZDNXP4atxFoMtcXvmrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72368'),
