  ('877066255909542191', 'Don''t Go in the House', 1979, 'Horror', 'Joseph Ellison, Oliver Wood', 'Joseph Ellison, Ellen Hammill, Joe Masefield', 'Dan Grimaldi, Robert Carnegie, Ruth Dardick, Charles Bonet, Bill Ricci, Johanna Brushay, Ralph D. Bowman, Mary Ann Chinn', 'R', 'As a child, Donald was tormented by his mother who used fire as a punishment. Now a deranged adult, Donald stalks women at clubs, then takes them home where he kills them with a flamethrower.', 'As a child, Donald was tormented by his mother who used fire as a punishment. Now a deranged adult, Donald stalks women at clubs, then takes them home where he kills them with a flamethrower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fj7sn4eT4p7X30LNLFlWJkQUyhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39867'),
  ('813871469853712169', 'Don''t Go in the Woods', 1981, 'Horror', 'James Bryan, Hank Zinman', 'Garth Eliassen', 'Jack McClelland, Mary Gail Artz, James P. Hayden, Angie Brown, Ken Carter, David Barth, Larry Roupe, Amy Martell', 'R', 'Four backpackers decide to take a hike in the mountains of Utah. But within the woods lurks a killer. But who...or what...is it? The lazy local sheriff blames bears. But the escalating body count seems to point to a human killer. Ignoring the warning signs, our campers remain lost in the woods...alone...awaiting their fate.', 'Four backpackers decide to take a hike in the mountains of Utah. But within the woods lurks a killer. But who...or what...is it? The lazy local sheriff blames bears. But the escalating body count seems to point to a human killer. Ignoring the warning signs, our campers remain lost in the woods...alone...awaiting their fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9klmBM1TypVd0DrJ4D7kh5vl3lD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44936'),
  ('125663421779072640', 'Don''t Go Near the Park', 1981, 'Horror', 'Lawrence D. Foldes, John Weldon, Earl Statler', 'Lawrence D. Foldes, Linwood Chase', 'Aldo Ray, Meeno Peluce, Tammy Taylor, Barbara Bain, Robert Gribbin, Linnea Quigley, Chris Riley, Lara Morann', 'R', 'In the prehistory of man, 12,000 years ago, two members of a superhuman tribe abuse the treasured secret of eternal youth. They use the methods of ritual cannibalism on the children of their own tribe and when discovered by the ''Queen'' of the tribe, they are cursed to an eternity of old age with no chance to ever die. Now, in present day Los Angeles, their only hope to recapture eternal youth is the ritualistic sacrifice of a 16-year-old female virgin. Their existence is discovered by an investigative reporter and a young runaway child and this leads to an unexplained and terrifying confrontation', 'In the prehistory of man, 12,000 years ago, two members of a superhuman tribe abuse the treasured secret of eternal youth. They use the methods of ritual cannibalism on the children of their own tribe and when discovered by the ''Queen'' of the tribe, they are cursed to an eternity of old age with no chance to ever die. Now, in present day Los Angeles, their only hope to recapture eternal youth is the ritualistic sacrifice of a 16-year-old female virgin. Their existence is discovered by an investigative reporter and a young runaway child and this leads to an unexplained and terrifying confrontation', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywqbYR9qJLqnNfo5K5eSVUEI1KG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27566'),
