  ('126807574355077789', 'Don''t Panic', 1989, 'Horror', 'Rubén Galindo Jr., Jorge Bustos, Miguel Araña', 'Rubén Galindo Jr.', 'Jon Michael Bischof, Gabriela Hassel, Helena Rojo, Jorge Luke, Juan Ignacio Aranda, Eduardo Noriega, Roberto Palazuelos, Edna Bolkan', null, 'On his 17th birthday, a boy named Michael has a surprise party thrown by his friends, where a session with a Ouija board accidentally unleashes a demon named Virgil, who possesses one of them to go on a killing spree. Michael, now plagued by violent nightmares and premonitions, sets out to try and stop the killings.', 'On his 17th birthday, a boy named Michael has a surprise party thrown by his friends, where a session with a Ouija board accidentally unleashes a demon named Virgil, who possesses one of them to go on a killing spree. Michael, now plagued by violent nightmares and premonitions, sets out to try and stop the killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMC8GpjVKBusffUE8hrSOTdIRcp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84387'),
