  ('771629652431198324', 'Dona Flor and Her Two Husbands', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Bruno Barreto, Jorge Durán, Murilo Salles', 'Eduardo Coutinho, Bruno Barreto, Leopoldo Serran', 'Sonia Braga, José Wilker, Mauro Mendonça, Nelson Xavier, Rui Rezende, Nelson Dantas, Mário Gusmão, Wilson Mello', null, 'After the death of her handsome but good-for-nothing husband Vadinho, Flor, a widow, marries Dr. Teodoro, a respectable gentleman. Hilarity ensues when Vadinho''s spirit returns into her life.', 'After the death of her handsome but good-for-nothing husband Vadinho, Flor, a widow, marries Dr. Teodoro, a respectable gentleman. Hilarity ensues when Vadinho''s spirit returns into her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTkw5nnrYT0KpAAEm0wNdgQ7Bu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42234'),
  ('525987766445173180', 'Dona Flor e Seus Dois Maridos', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Luciano Xavier, Pedro Vasconcelos, Fernanda Badaue', 'Pedro Vasconcelos', 'Juliana Paes, Marcelo Faria, Leandro Hassum, Cassiano Carneiro, Nívea Maria, Ana Paula Bouzas, Fábio Lago, Maria Gal', null, 'In a small city of Brazil, Flor (a very good looking woman) marries Vadinho, a very handsome and erotic man. Once married she finds he is a good-for-nothing. She works teaching cooking to her neighbours but he takes all her money to gamble. One day he dies. Flor misses the goods of the marriage so she marries again with a very correct gentleman – the owner of the drugstore (Teodoro). Now she’s very happy with her man, but misses the erotic moments with her previous husband. Then the ghost of Vadhino comes to earth to chase her.', 'In a small city of Brazil, Flor (a very good looking woman) marries Vadinho, a very handsome and erotic man. Once married she finds he is a good-for-nothing. She works teaching cooking to her neighbours but he takes all her money to gamble. One day he dies. Flor misses the goods of the marriage so she marries again with a very correct gentleman – the owner of the drugstore (Teodoro). Now she’s very happy with her man, but misses the erotic moments with her previous husband. Then the ghost of Vadhino comes to earth to chase her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5ORYHcyxuvL7BRInMA8Ly1bV7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476724'),
  ('326829432252649678', 'Doña Herlinda and Her Son', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo, Jorge López Páez', 'Guadalupe del Toro, Marco Antonio Treviño, Arturo Meza, Leticia Lupercio, Lucha Villa, Guillermina Alba', null, 'A manipulative mama deftly manages the life of her homosexual son so that he can have his cake and eat it too. A woman of means, she does this by allowing her son, a doctor, to tryst in her home with his lover. Putting her son''s happiness above all else, she then arranges a marriage of convenience to a woman.', 'A manipulative mama deftly manages the life of her homosexual son so that he can have his cake and eat it too. A woman of means, she does this by allowing her son, a doctor, to tryst in her home with his lover. Putting her son''s happiness above all else, she then arranges a marriage of convenience to a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNVu1XtpPt5qVSi3nZjDQcaYXg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40924'),
  ('592453347408376197', 'Dona Lurdes: O Filme', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cristiano Marques, Breno Cunha, Lamartine Ferreira', 'Cláudio Torres Gonzaga, Manuela Dias', 'Regina Casé, Evandro Mesquita, Arlete Salles, Chay Suede, Thiago Martins, Jéssica Ellen, Nanda Costa, Juliano Cazarré', null, 'Dona Lurdes is a mother and housewife who is suffering from empty nest syndrome when her last child leaves home. To escape her loneliness, she goes in search of new ways to fill her days and her life. Due to her thirst for new things, Dona Lurdes will live new experiences, build friendships and new love.', 'Dona Lurdes is a mother and housewife who is suffering from empty nest syndrome when her last child leaves home. To escape her loneliness, she goes in search of new ways to fill her days and her life. Due to her thirst for new things, Dona Lurdes will live new experiences, build friendships and new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKS02ZDoNbEPY1mMtnj1iwJJIxE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175785'),
  ('7836927885561859', 'Doña Perfecta', 1951, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Alejandro Galindo, Jesús Marín, José Ortiz Ramos', 'Íñigo de Martino, Alejandro Galindo, Gunther Gerszo', 'Dolores del Río, Esther Fernández, Carlos Navarro, Julio Villarreal, José Elías Moreno, Natalia Ortiz, Ignacio Retes, Rafael Icardo', null, 'Liberal farmer Pepe has arrived in Santa Fe to visit his aunt, Dona Perfecta. While he''s there, Pepe is eager to teach the traditional-minded townspeople a new way of living. Unfortunately for Pepe the people of Santa Fe aren''t eager to embrace change, and when the citizens begin to voice resentment Pepe is forced to seek refuge with his sympathetic aunt. Dona Perfecta is just as traditional as any of the other townspeople though, and only suffers Pepe due to the fact that he is family. When Pepe and his cousin Rosario fall deeply in love, the situation quickly comes to a head.', 'Liberal farmer Pepe has arrived in Santa Fe to visit his aunt, Dona Perfecta. While he''s there, Pepe is eager to teach the traditional-minded townspeople a new way of living. Unfortunately for Pepe the people of Santa Fe aren''t eager to embrace change, and when the citizens begin to voice resentment Pepe is forced to seek refuge with his sympathetic aunt. Dona Perfecta is just as traditional as any of the other townspeople though, and only suffers Pepe due to the fact that he is family. When Pepe and his cousin Rosario fall deeply in love, the situation quickly comes to a head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrIialJbP6xhNIgA9EXKTgdAKu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120289'),
  ('661665183885064879', 'Donald and Pluto', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Ben Sharpsteen', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Plumber Donald is using a large magnet in his work. When he drops it, it causes trouble for Pluto, especially after Pluto swallows it. Things begin clinging to him, especially his metal dog dish.', 'Plumber Donald is using a large magnet in his work. When he drops it, it causes trouble for Pluto, especially after Pluto swallows it. Things begin clinging to him, especially his metal dog dish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHZN0eg2bW8bnOvaZdYxPtiYzek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74958'),
  ('259621869158512032', 'Donald and the Wheel', 1961, 'Animation', 'Hamilton Luske', null, 'Clarence Nash, Bill Cole, Bill Lee, Thurl Ravenscroft, Max Smith', 'NR', 'A father tells his son the invention of the wheel was most important; to prove it, the two hipsters visit the inventor caveman Donald Duck. There follows a survey of the progress of transportation, a digression into the basics of gear ratios, a series of live-action dancers to various styles of music inside a giant jukebox, an illustration of the use of wheels in power generation and space satellites, etc. Ultimately, Donald decides he doesn''t want the responsibility, but certainly someone else would take on the task.', 'A father tells his son the invention of the wheel was most important; to prove it, the two hipsters visit the inventor caveman Donald Duck. There follows a survey of the progress of transportation, a digression into the basics of gear ratios, a series of live-action dancers to various styles of music inside a giant jukebox, an illustration of the use of wheels in power generation and space satellites, etc. Ultimately, Donald decides he doesn''t want the responsibility, but certainly someone else would take on the task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebH3ndeKAXOLjQmo2FssVKHhMp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54477'),
  ('486819026849283892', 'Donald Applecore', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Dessie Flynn, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'Donald the apple farmer notices his apples have been nibbled on and catches Chip n'' Dale in the act. In the ensuing battle, Donald uses a helicopter to spray them (but they have tiny gas masks). And then he brings in the really heavy artillery.', 'Donald the apple farmer notices his apples have been nibbled on and catches Chip n'' Dale in the act. In the ensuing battle, Donald uses a helicopter to spray them (but they have tiny gas masks). And then he brings in the really heavy artillery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MjRwL7pFJWUUlpx3ZCdq75layR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54479'),
  ('1014344376875587936', 'Donald Duck and the Gorilla', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald', 'NR', 'Ajax the killer gorilla has escaped from the zoo. Donald''s nephews dress up as a gorilla, but soon Donald encounters the real gorilla, and they chase each other until the radio broadcasts instructions for subduing Ajax.', 'Ajax the killer gorilla has escaped from the zoo. Donald''s nephews dress up as a gorilla, but soon Donald encounters the real gorilla, and they chase each other until the radio broadcasts instructions for subduing Ajax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffpYDYXvOy93MLkdIoOXDwRu1W5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54482'),
  ('334592944042292758', 'Donald Gets Drafted', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher, John McLeish', 'NR', 'Donald Fauntleroy Duck gets his draft notice and goes in, past all the amazingly enticing recruiting posters, to sign up. First he has to pass the physical. Despite his flat feet, he makes it. Donald wants to fly, but first he has to make it through Sergeant Pete''s boot camp. He has a terrible time with close-order drills, and standing at attention without moving when he''s over an ant-hill proves a real challenge. Eventually, Donald ends up on endless KP.', 'Donald Fauntleroy Duck gets his draft notice and goes in, past all the amazingly enticing recruiting posters, to sign up. First he has to pass the physical. Despite his flat feet, he makes it. Donald wants to fly, but first he has to make it through Sergeant Pete''s boot camp. He has a terrible time with close-order drills, and standing at attention without moving when he''s over an ant-hill proves a real challenge. Eventually, Donald ends up on endless KP.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRLBsKsNXIjdiaUJK4GYZaqmXoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54485'),
  ('1111130294331325504', 'Donald Glover: Weirdo', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Shannon Hartman', 'Donald Glover', 'Donald Glover', null, 'Fearlessly funny stand-up comic and sitcom star Donald Glover puts on a live show in New York, confessing his love for Cocoa Puffs and Toys "R" Us.', 'Fearlessly funny stand-up comic and sitcom star Donald Glover puts on a live show in New York, confessing his love for Cocoa Puffs and Toys "R" Us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWNAh2aJ4pgXXrC926gtOoeWam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84154'),
  ('470237230726426074', 'Donald in Mathmagic Land', 1959, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Les Clark, Hamilton Luske, Wolfgang Reitherman', 'Heinz Haber', 'Clarence Nash, Paul Frees', 'NR', 'Disney used animation here to explain through this wonderful adventure of Donald how mathematics can be useful in our real life. Through this journey Donald shows us how mathematics are not just numbers and charts, but magical living things.', 'Disney used animation here to explain through this wonderful adventure of Donald how mathematics can be useful in our real life. Through this journey Donald shows us how mathematics are not just numbers and charts, but magical living things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKyvrSVysFobPPmMHqyStvrJRqc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19715'),
  ('1072802852503548426', 'Donald Trump''s The Art of the Deal: The Movie', 2016, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Kevin Atkinson, Jeremy Konner', 'Joe Randazzo', 'Johnny Depp, Ron Howard, Alfred Molina, Robert Morse, Patton Oswalt, Jack McBrayer, Michaela Watkins, Henry Winkler', 'NR', 'Donald Trump has it all. Money, power, respect, and an Eastern European bride. But all his success didn''t come for nothing. First, he inherited millions of dollars from his rich father, then he grabbed New York City by the balls. Now you can learn the art of negotiation, real estate, and high-quality brass.', 'Donald Trump has it all. Money, power, respect, and an Eastern European bride. But all his success didn''t come for nothing. First, he inherited millions of dollars from his rich father, then he grabbed New York City by the balls. Now you can learn the art of negotiation, real estate, and high-quality brass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vy28pjIwIGwjDLSa47CI6wdvEYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382079'),
  ('668754921921290686', 'Donald''s Better Self', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Thelma Boardman, Don Brodie', 'NR', 'Schoolboy Donald is torn between his angel and devil sides, though in Donald''s case, the devil side isn''t hard to resist. But the smoking he''s encouraged to do turns him green and gives him regrets, and when the good side shows up and kicks evil''s butt, Donald cheers.', 'Schoolboy Donald is torn between his angel and devil sides, though in Donald''s case, the devil side isn''t hard to resist. But the smoking he''s encouraged to do turns him green and gives him regrets, and when the good side shows up and kicks evil''s butt, Donald cheers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5y79VxwzRYU1lcw4YwNizXYAiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69111'),
  ('900030626552605807', 'Donald''s Camera', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dick Lundy', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Inspired by a store display, Donald decides to "hunt" some wildlife with his camera. First, he encounters a too-friendly chipmunk, then a large group of shy animals, then some animals in a dark cave. But his biggest challenge is a woodpecker, who finds a number of ways to torment him, even though Donald does manage to trick him briefly using some toothpaste that pretends to be a worm.', 'Inspired by a store display, Donald decides to "hunt" some wildlife with his camera. First, he encounters a too-friendly chipmunk, then a large group of shy animals, then some animals in a dark cave. But his biggest challenge is a woodpecker, who finds a number of ways to torment him, even though Donald does manage to trick him briefly using some toothpaste that pretends to be a worm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OCKPWkBQYw8msJULUwU2ieCQDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54489'),
  ('905303793806412402', 'Donald''s Cousin Gus', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Donald Duck''s gluttonous cousin, Gus Goose, comes for a visit and practically eats him out of house and home. When the direct approach to getting rid of his voracious houseguest fails, Donald resorts to desperate measures to dislodge him.', 'Donald Duck''s gluttonous cousin, Gus Goose, comes for a visit and practically eats him out of house and home. When the direct approach to getting rid of his voracious houseguest fails, Donald resorts to desperate measures to dislodge him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDh9L6t4x0Di4LAA0Pxt4VU1uPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55095'),
  ('492786376255137388', 'Donald''s Crime', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Gloria Blondell', 'NR', 'On the night he promised to take Daisy out, Donald Duck discovers he''s broke. Desperate for spending money, he gets it in the last place he knows: his three nephews'' piggy bank. After their night out, Daisy thanks the ''rich'' big spender, which only makes Donald remember how penniless and remorseful he is. What ensues is Donald''s guilt (and imagination) taking him on a nerve-wracking ride in the role of a wanted man.', 'On the night he promised to take Daisy out, Donald Duck discovers he''s broke. Desperate for spending money, he gets it in the last place he knows: his three nephews'' piggy bank. After their night out, Daisy thanks the ''rich'' big spender, which only makes Donald remember how penniless and remorseful he is. What ensues is Donald''s guilt (and imagination) taking him on a nerve-wracking ride in the role of a wanted man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPXYKNCTVXN8zN14eUqR7iRxduf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55354'),
  ('58344989617663145', 'Donald''s Decision', 1942, 'Animation', 'Ford Beebe', null, 'Clarence Nash, Thelma Boardman', null, 'Donald Duck buys Canadian war bonds in World War II.', 'Donald Duck buys Canadian war bonds in World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6wBM3zwRpkIlN4muDjfXu3xISy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64658'),
  ('728542826832652531', 'Donald''s Diary', 1954, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Clarence Nash, Leslie Denison, Vivi Janiss', 'NR', 'Donald is writing in his diary and narrating (in a rather sophisticated voice) about his romance with Daisy. She was able to snare him into a relationship in which they got to know each other better and Donald got to meet Daisy''s family. Finally, Donald decides to marry Daisy but when waiting for her to arrive so he can pop the question, he falls asleep and has a nightmarish vision of what married life would be like (among other things that he''ll be forced to do all the housework and be served a burnt T bone for dinner). Needless to say, the marriage is called off when he awakens.', 'Donald is writing in his diary and narrating (in a rather sophisticated voice) about his romance with Daisy. She was able to snare him into a relationship in which they got to know each other better and Donald got to meet Daisy''s family. Finally, Donald decides to marry Daisy but when waiting for her to arrive so he can pop the question, he falls asleep and has a nightmarish vision of what married life would be like (among other things that he''ll be forced to do all the housework and be served a burnt T bone for dinner). Needless to say, the marriage is called off when he awakens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRUeH40ya9HZ0sNV3m0QfGq3YzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55357'),
  ('376629770567673739', 'Donald''s Dilemma', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Gloria Blondell, George Magrill, Richard Conte, Ken Darby', 'NR', 'Donald and Daisy are walking when he is hit by a flowerpot. He''s convinced he''s a famous singer, and he croons divinely, but does not recognize Daisy. He in fact does become famous. Daisy is devastated by her inability to get over him and sees a psychiatrist. He tells her she has to choose between the world having Donald, or her getting him back. She picks herself, and drops another flowerpot, which restores him.', 'Donald and Daisy are walking when he is hit by a flowerpot. He''s convinced he''s a famous singer, and he croons divinely, but does not recognize Daisy. He in fact does become famous. Daisy is devastated by her inability to get over him and sees a psychiatrist. He tells her she has to choose between the world having Donald, or her getting him back. She picks herself, and drops another flowerpot, which restores him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwRYHy36TKvtk1ab9gXGGnUk4Wn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55359'),
  ('234704246425625979', 'Donald''s Dog Laundry', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King, Bob Newman', null, 'Clarence Nash, Lee Millar', 'NR', 'With a rubber bone as a lure, Donald Duck tries to entice Pluto to try his mechanical dog washer. When the bone gives Pluto trouble, Donald tries a toy cat as a lure only to unexpectedly fall into the washer himself, get scrubbed and then hung out on the line to dry.', 'With a rubber bone as a lure, Donald Duck tries to entice Pluto to try his mechanical dog washer. When the bone gives Pluto trouble, Donald tries a toy cat as a lure only to unexpectedly fall into the washer himself, get scrubbed and then hung out on the line to dry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqCeYJtxyGzJ3fDut3RZ1ZXL6vh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55362'),
  ('822766609257791485', 'Donald''s Double Trouble', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Gloria Blondell, Leslie Denison', 'NR', 'Daisy tells Donald he has to improve his English and manners before she''ll see him again. Fortunately, an exact double with an English accent, clear speech, and impeccable manners happens by. Donald talks him into posing as Donald, but grows increasingly jealous as Daisy hugs and kisses the stranger.', 'Daisy tells Donald he has to improve his English and manners before she''ll see him again. Fortunately, an exact double with an English accent, clear speech, and impeccable manners happens by. Donald talks him into posing as Donald, but grows increasingly jealous as Daisy hugs and kisses the stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itF6bWTmx32dNGqOXTwujS4CF8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55365'),
  ('742528634967837083', 'Donald''s Dream Voice', 1948, 'Animation', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Ruth Clifford, Leslie Denison', 'NR', 'Donald is trying to sell brushes door-to-door, but since nobody can understand him, nobody will buy anything. He happens across a street vendor selling voice pills. They work great, but he''s only got a limited number so of course, the last pill ends up in various inconvenient places.', 'Donald is trying to sell brushes door-to-door, but since nobody can understand him, nobody will buy anything. He happens across a street vendor selling voice pills. They work great, but he''s only got a limited number so of course, the last pill ends up in various inconvenient places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yAD9TXykIHBIGyPJd6XBoNmAU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55367'),
  ('46843101570858998', 'Donald''s Garden', 1942, 'Animation', 'Dick Lundy', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald has to work hard to save his garden and price-winning melons from a hungry badger.', 'Donald has to work hard to save his garden and price-winning melons from a hungry badger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YHgXREirxHuivk4MEYm5LTco5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55371'),
  ('170909961868236772', 'Donald''s Gold Mine', 1942, 'Animation', 'Dick Lundy', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald is digging in his gold mine, mostly generic looking dark rocks, and being clumsy, to the great amusement of his burro, when he accidentally fills his cart with a load of pure gold. The burro takes off and dumps the cart, Donald and all, into a scary looking crusher. Donald barely makes it through the machinery.', 'Donald is digging in his gold mine, mostly generic looking dark rocks, and being clumsy, to the great amusement of his burro, when he accidentally fills his cart with a load of pure gold. The burro takes off and dumps the cart, Donald and all, into a scary looking crusher. Donald barely makes it through the machinery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azvS48D9PtbTDdO74VdXFrYZCVo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55395'),
  ('171027852906733333', 'Donald''s Golf Game', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald Duck tries to exhibit his golfing ability to his nephews only to have them tease him with sneezes, noises and "trick" clubs. Finally, they put a grasshopper in a ball and it "jumps" all over.', 'Donald Duck tries to exhibit his golfing ability to his nephews only to have them tease him with sneezes, noises and "trick" clubs. Finally, they put a grasshopper in a ball and it "jumps" all over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oablzcHZEL0T1GBlB5Sv3f2FNCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55397'),
  ('373905688033218738', 'Donald''s Happy Birthday', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'It''s March 13, Donald''s birthday. The boys are going to buy him a box of cigars, but they''re broke. They do a quick bout of yardwork and hit Donald up for the price of the cigars (without telling him why), but he makes them put it in a piggy bank. The problem: how to get the money without Donald catching them. Donald catches them buying the cigars but thinks they are buying them for themselves and forces them to smoke until they are sick the whole box.', 'It''s March 13, Donald''s birthday. The boys are going to buy him a box of cigars, but they''re broke. They do a quick bout of yardwork and hit Donald up for the price of the cigars (without telling him why), but he makes them put it in a piggy bank. The problem: how to get the money without Donald catching them. Donald catches them buying the cigars but thinks they are buying them for themselves and forces them to smoke until they are sick the whole box.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fT67HEWHBRF18r5QtFI1TwqeyB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55399'),
  ('1024320978289007380', 'Donald''s Lucky Day', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald Duck, delivery boy, is hired to deliver a mysterious package on Friday the Thirteenth. He is hindered by a bothersome black cat -- and by the fact that the package contains a live bomb.', 'Donald Duck, delivery boy, is hired to deliver a mysterious package on Friday the Thirteenth. He is hindered by a bothersome black cat -- and by the fact that the package contains a live bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A57RV6NrcHNOWJpqZ6LNdsdstr9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55404'),
  ('984511185338946100', 'Donald''s Nephews', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald''s sister Dumbella sends her three sons Huey, Dewey, and Louie to visit their uncle Donald. They prove to be quite a handful for Donald, even with help from his book on child rearing.', 'Donald''s sister Dumbella sends her three sons Huey, Dewey, and Louie to visit their uncle Donald. They prove to be quite a handful for Donald, even with help from his book on child rearing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msXchLphRH9nKffpkFvBsq3e85h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69103'),
  ('310542562322335524', 'Donald''s Off Day', 1944, 'Animation', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald''s got the day off, and all he can think of is golf until it rains as soon as he sets foot outside. He takes it out on his nephews. When he''s sitting around moping, they take revenge by playing off his hypochondria.', 'Donald''s got the day off, and all he can think of is golf until it rains as soon as he sets foot outside. He takes it out on his nephews. When he''s sitting around moping, they take revenge by playing off his hypochondria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daWOFME0j8zUuqTmt4cnJZ2E7ZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55407'),
  ('710640336665353526', 'Donald''s Ostrich', 1937, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Billy Bletcher, Elvia Allman, Clarrie Collins', 'NR', 'Donald is the baggagemaster at a remote railway station. Part of the latest cargo shipment is Hortense the Ostrich, who is a bit too friendly with Donald, and who eats everything in sight, whether it''s food or not (mostly not): a concertina, an alarm clock, some balloons, all of which start reacting when Hortense gets the hiccups.', 'Donald is the baggagemaster at a remote railway station. Part of the latest cargo shipment is Hortense the Ostrich, who is a bit too friendly with Donald, and who eats everything in sight, whether it''s food or not (mostly not): a concertina, an alarm clock, some balloons, all of which start reacting when Hortense gets the hiccups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eV4XUwro8W46g0OGO8FbYKVEjmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57645'),
  ('1095886870550733287', 'Donald''s Penguin', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Louis Manley', 'NR', 'Admiral Byrd ships Donald a penguin from the South Pole. Donald is amused by it, until he thinks it has eaten his goldfish. It hasn''t - yet - so Donald gets a fish from the fridge to make amends. When he comes back, though, he''s got a reason to be upset with the penguin.', 'Admiral Byrd ships Donald a penguin from the South Pole. Donald is amused by it, until he thinks it has eaten his goldfish. It hasn''t - yet - so Donald gets a fish from the fridge to make amends. When he comes back, though, he''s got a reason to be upset with the penguin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmZsqdcFKxHV9rc0jnyDgPlulta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55409'),
  ('865978270366949', 'Donald''s Snow Fight', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'It''s snowed, and Donald Duck is going sledding. Meanwhile, his nephews have built a snowman at the bottom of the hill. Donald aims his sled at their snowman and demolishes it, so the boys get even by including a boulder in the bottom of their next snowman. This means war, so they retreat to opposing snow forts for battle.', 'It''s snowed, and Donald Duck is going sledding. Meanwhile, his nephews have built a snowman at the bottom of the hill. Donald aims his sled at their snowman and demolishes it, so the boys get even by including a boulder in the bottom of their next snowman. This means war, so they retreat to opposing snow forts for battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1E7g9QiFjvXCQociAxxb4vBELS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55461'),
  ('454179081036349207', 'Donald''s Tire Trouble', 1943, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Dick Lundy', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald, driving in the country, is frustrated in his attempts to fix a flat tire. The jack breaks, the radiator explodes, then the remaining three tires go flat. Donald gives up in disgust and drives on with the flats.', 'Donald, driving in the country, is frustrated in his attempts to fix a flat tire. The jack breaks, the radiator explodes, then the remaining three tires go flat. Donald gives up in disgust and drives on with the flats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCFSsTF1GYim88bnt8Grha8Z6sU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55462'),
  ('909263838971644172', 'Donald''s Vacation', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald takes a kayak trip. When he gets to his campsite, he unloads the kayak, fights with his folding chair, and goes to sleep. Meanwhile, the chipmunks of the forest (precursors of Chip ''n Dale), attracted by his squawking, make off with the huge pile of food he carelessly unloaded. They get the attention of a bear, who Donald is soon battling.', 'Donald takes a kayak trip. When he gets to his campsite, he unloads the kayak, fights with his folding chair, and goes to sleep. Meanwhile, the chipmunks of the forest (precursors of Chip ''n Dale), attracted by his squawking, make off with the huge pile of food he carelessly unloaded. They get the attention of a bear, who Donald is soon battling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHbUDPhQj0HII834Rt9QE0VxkTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55464'),
  ('150139247394297082', 'Donatella', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Tonino Delli Colli, Mario Monicelli, Enzo Avitabile', 'Ruggero Maccari, Sandro Continenza, Piero Tellini', 'Elsa Martinelli, Gabriele Ferzetti, Walter Chiari, Aldo Fabrizi, Abbe Lane, Xavier Cugat, Liliana Bonfatti, Virgilio Riento', null, 'Donatella is a simple and honest roman girl, daughter of a bookbinder and girlfriend of Guido, a gas station owner. One day she finds a woman''s handbag containing valuables and documents, and decides to return it to her owner, a wealthy American lady, who offers Donatella a job as a secretary as a reward: she has to manage the lady''s villa during her absences. There, Donatella casually meets Maurizio, a rich, elegant and well-educated young man, and ends up falling in love.', 'Donatella is a simple and honest roman girl, daughter of a bookbinder and girlfriend of Guido, a gas station owner. One day she finds a woman''s handbag containing valuables and documents, and decides to return it to her owner, a wealthy American lady, who offers Donatella a job as a secretary as a reward: she has to manage the lady''s villa during her absences. There, Donatella casually meets Maurizio, a rich, elegant and well-educated young man, and ends up falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCnaIyh5KeuE6YbVcaBlnwtQ3uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220565'),
  ('629325249322454677', 'Donato and Daughter', 1993, 'Crime, Action, Drama, TV Movie', 'Rod Holcomb, Thomas Del Ruth, L. Dean Jones Jr.', null, 'Charles Bronson, Dana Delany, Xander Berkeley, Jenette Goldstein, Louis Giambalvo, Marc Alaimo, Tom Verica, Robert Gossett', null, 'Though emotionally estranged, a father and daughter team of Los Angeles police detectives must work together to stop a serial killer. Along the way, the two find themselves forced to deal with a number of painful secrets from their past.', 'Though emotionally estranged, a father and daughter team of Los Angeles police detectives must work together to stop a serial killer. Along the way, the two find themselves forced to deal with a number of painful secrets from their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxPEtvfrKcpensMI8pcNIkapHYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110093'),
  ('366834778465695136', 'Donbass', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Anne-Laure Bonnel', 'Anne-Laure Bonnel', 'Anne-Laure Bonnel', null, 'Anne-Laure Bonnel, a young director and mother of a French family, decides to accompany Alexander, a father of Ukrainian family, to the Donbass region of eastern Ukraine in a pro-Russian zone. At the heart of the war, she captures the terrible images of a deadly conflict and an unprecedented humanitarian disaster.', 'Anne-Laure Bonnel, a young director and mother of a French family, decides to accompany Alexander, a father of Ukrainian family, to the Donbass region of eastern Ukraine in a pro-Russian zone. At the heart of the war, she captures the terrible images of a deadly conflict and an unprecedented humanitarian disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSAw4wtVw4258CGbWdbDNewWywK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:562889'),
  ('795392012931168675', 'Donbass', 2018, 'Drama, War', 'Sergei Loznitsa, Oleg Mutu, Marek Cydorowicz', 'Sergei Loznitsa', 'Tamara Yatsenko, Iryna Zayarmiuk, Hryhoriy Masliuk, Olesia Zhurakivska, Liudmyla Smorodina, Boris Kamorzin, Mikhail Voloshin, Yevhen Chepurniak', null, 'In the historic Donbass region of eastern Ukraine, despite the cruel war that has been raging since 2014 between the self-proclaimed People''s Republics of Donetsk and Luhansk and the Ukrainian government, people try to survive in the rotten heart of chaos, where violence disguises itself as peace, propaganda becomes univocal truth and hatred reigns in the name of love.', 'In the historic Donbass region of eastern Ukraine, despite the cruel war that has been raging since 2014 between the self-proclaimed People''s Republics of Donetsk and Luhansk and the Ukrainian government, people try to survive in the rotten heart of chaos, where violence disguises itself as peace, propaganda becomes univocal truth and hatred reigns in the name of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egjOYURjYL1VzwOCgm9cUjWX6FF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519187'),
  ('22561668424002494', 'Donde hay patrón...', 1978, 'Comedy, Music', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Luis Villar', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Manolo Escobar, Sara Lezana, Álvaro de Luna, Manolo Gómez Bur, Mayra Gómez Kemp, Gracita Morales, Manuel Alexandre, Luis Barbero', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRP3IG4vqymxGNj8IhjhioRCRDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445039'),
  ('647025695082392913', 'Done the Impossible', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Brian Wiser, Jason Heppler, Tony Hadlock', null, 'Adam Baldwin, Joss Whedon, Orson Scott Card, Ron Glass, Nathan Fillion, Alan Tudyk, Jewel Staite, Morena Baccarin', null, 'A documentary covering Firefly''s birth, death and rebirth from the perspective of both the fans and the cast and crew of both productions.', 'A documentary covering Firefly''s birth, death and rebirth from the perspective of both the fans and the cast and crew of both productions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aIA8NWUdF7SptQc1ELYJS3nVfz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33370'),
  ('14703115769482016', 'Dong', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai, Jia Zhangke', 'Jia Zhangke', 'Liu Xiaodong, Han Sanming', null, 'Jia Zhangke travels with painter Liu Xiaodong from China to Thailand as they as they meet everyday workers in the throes of social turmoil. Liu Xiaodong is well-known for his monumental canvases, particularly those inspired by China''s Three Gorges Dam project. Jia Zhangke visits Liu on the banks of Fengjie, a city about to be swallowed up by the Yangtze River. The area is in the process of being "de-constructed" by armies of shirtless male workers who form the subject of Liu''s paintings. Liu and Jia next travel to Bangkok, where Liu paints Thai sex workers languishing in brothels. The two sets of paintings are united in their subjects'' shared sense of malaise in the face of the dehumanizing labor afforded them.', 'Jia Zhangke travels with painter Liu Xiaodong from China to Thailand as they as they meet everyday workers in the throes of social turmoil. Liu Xiaodong is well-known for his monumental canvases, particularly those inspired by China''s Three Gorges Dam project. Jia Zhangke visits Liu on the banks of Fengjie, a city about to be swallowed up by the Yangtze River. The area is in the process of being "de-constructed" by armies of shirtless male workers who form the subject of Liu''s paintings. Liu and Jia next travel to Bangkok, where Liu paints Thai sex workers languishing in brothels. The two sets of paintings are united in their subjects'' shared sense of malaise in the face of the dehumanizing labor afforded them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7p0XKbezDORD93sd2Isn0KrOlXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101822'),
  ('54831206732097592', 'Döngel Kârhanesi', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Hakan Algül', 'Necef Uğurlu', 'Metin Akpınar, Ahmet Uğurlu, Şenay Gürler, Şebnem Dönmez, Goncagül Sunar, Fadik Sevin Atasoy, Erkan Taşdöğen, Nezih Tuncay', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjkIaP6HJr4PocyR68SPquF4sn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63321'),
  ('110407292125699548', 'Dongji Rescue', 2025, 'Drama, History, War', 'Gao Weizhe, Guan Hu, Fei Zhenxiang', 'Dong Runnian, Zhang Ji, Chen Shu', 'Zhu Yilong, Leo Wu, Ni Ni, Yang Haoyu, Chen Minghao, Ni Dahong, William Franklyn-Miller, Li Jiuxiao', null, 'Inspired by the real life rescue of over 300 British soldiers in 1942, Dongji Rescue is a rousing, action-packed story of heroism on the high seas. When the Japanese warship Lisbon Maru is torpedoed off the coast of Dongji Island, the lives of over 300 British POWs on board are at risk of being claimed by the sea. Their only hope is a small group of defiant Chinese fisherman who will do anything to rescue and protect them from their captors.', 'Inspired by the real life rescue of over 300 British soldiers in 1942, Dongji Rescue is a rousing, action-packed story of heroism on the high seas. When the Japanese warship Lisbon Maru is torpedoed off the coast of Dongji Island, the lives of over 300 British POWs on board are at risk of being claimed by the sea. Their only hope is a small group of defiant Chinese fisherman who will do anything to rescue and protect them from their captors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eb3YebyscUmXmrrC2ZDDVR0w0P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1305653'),
  ('365674674065080204', 'Dongju: The Portrait of a Poet', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Lee Joon-ik, Choi Yong-jin, Lee Jun-il', 'Shin Yeon-shick', 'Kang Ha-neul, Park Jeong-min, Kim In-woo, Choi Hong-il, Kim Jung-pal, Moon Choi, Shin Yoon-ju, Kim Ooh-jin', null, 'Based on a true story, renowned Korean poet, Yun Dong-ju, is detained and abused by the Japanese for participating in the Korean Independence Movement.', 'Based on a true story, renowned Korean poet, Yun Dong-ju, is detained and abused by the Japanese for participating in the Korean Independence Movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rK9VFrmRgGLN7CWTlBqLrlG8FUS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382336'),
  ('1052854085112690824', 'Donkey Punch', 2008, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Olly Blackburn, Nanu Segal', 'Olly Blackburn, David Bloom', 'Nichola Burley, Sian Breckin, Jaime Winstone, Robert Boulter, Tom Burke, Julian Morris, Jay Taylor', 'R', 'Three hot girls, four guys, and one mega-swanky yacht collide for a serious night of drugs and sexual deviancy. One debaucherous act goes too far though, turning this teen joy ride into a weekend of bloody bedlam.', 'Three hot girls, four guys, and one mega-swanky yacht collide for a serious night of drugs and sexual deviancy. One debaucherous act goes too far though, turning this teen joy ride into a weekend of bloody bedlam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wd5GVtBRA6gG7CRV6E2VKr7AcT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13429'),
  ('499720039809593805', 'Donkey Skin', 1970, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Jacques Demy, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Jacques Demy', 'Catherine Deneuve, Jacques Perrin, Jean Marais, Delphine Seyrig, Fernand Ledoux, Micheline Presle, Sacha Pitoëff, Henri Crémieux', null, 'A fairy godmother helps a princess disguise herself so she won''t have to marry her father.', 'A fairy godmother helps a princess disguise herself so she won''t have to marry her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSODEFNpTBCOJNHhsbwrwvH0Uvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5590'),
  ('83377689146869889', 'Donkey X', 2007, 'Family, Adventure, Animation', 'Jose Pozo', 'Angel E. Pariente', 'David Fernández, Andreu Buenafuente, José Luis Gil, Sancho Gracia, Luis Posada', null, 'The donkey, Rucio, tells the true story of Don Quixote and defends the idea that he wasn''t insane, but a very intelligent, passionate and enthusiastic fellow.', 'The donkey, Rucio, tells the true story of Don Quixote and defends the idea that he wasn''t insane, but a very intelligent, passionate and enthusiastic fellow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysicR8T5LLgVgzE5zG7paKJ2UHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14704'),
  ('1071134599981838200', 'Donkey''s Christmas Shrektacular', 2010, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Raman Hui Shing-Ngai, Walt Dohrn', 'Ryan Crego, Walt Dohrn', 'Mike Myers, Eddie Murphy, Cameron Diaz, Antonio Banderas, Walt Dohrn, Jon Hamm, Jane Lynch, Craig Robinson', null, 'Deck the halls with Donkey’s laughter in this all-new holiday collection. Donkey presents his very own carolling stage show featuring his Far Far Away pals in this merry, musical treat with all the trimmings! Join in the fun as they bring their own Shrektacular spirit to festive holiday songs, a fun Donkey Decoration scramble, and a hilarious virtual Yule Log that’s so funny… it’s on fire.', 'Deck the halls with Donkey’s laughter in this all-new holiday collection. Donkey presents his very own carolling stage show featuring his Far Far Away pals in this merry, musical treat with all the trimmings! Join in the fun as they bring their own Shrektacular spirit to festive holiday songs, a fun Donkey Decoration scramble, and a hilarious virtual Yule Log that’s so funny… it’s on fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VndinS8opLxtWtVLhBUFyqdbdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51256'),
  ('735104631958476489', 'Donne con le gonne', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Nuti, Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Ferzan Özpetek', 'Giovanni Veronesi, Francesco Nuti, Ugo Chiti', 'Francesco Nuti, Carole Bouquet, Gastone Moschin, Cinzia Leone, Didi Perego, Antonio Petrocelli, Patrizia Corti, Daniele Dublino', null, 'Renzo falls in love with feminist Margherita, too emancipated for him: they start a troubled relationship until he kidnaps her, forcing her to be an housewife devoted to her husband.', 'Renzo falls in love with feminist Margherita, too emancipated for him: they start a troubled relationship until he kidnaps her, forcing her to be an housewife devoted to her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KRICd0MBRcnD0ik6e4Mml8TP7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124726'),
