  ('224782348548778094', 'Doraemon the Movie: Nobita''s Sky Utopia', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Saeko Ozawa, Yasue Sosogi, Takumi Doyama', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Subaru Kimura, Tomokazu Seki, Marina Inoue, Inori Minase, Ren Nagase', null, 'Doraemon, Nobita and his friends go to find Utopia, a perfect land in the sky where everyone lives with happiness, using an airship having a time warp function.', 'Doraemon, Nobita and his friends go to find Utopia, a perfect land in the sky where everyone lives with happiness, using an airship having a time warp function.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uux6M8z3hxLDkq8LXSzq8528mrq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030587'),
  ('675858525756186374', 'Doraemon: New Nobita''s Great Demon - Peko and the Exploration Party of Five', 2014, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Shinnosuke Yakuwa, Masaru Ohshiro, Takashi Suehiro', 'Higashi Shimizu', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Subaru Kimura, Tomokazu Seki, Yu Kobayashi, Kenji Tada, Miku Natsume', 'PG', 'Nobita is followed by a stray dog on his way home and decides to help it find its original owner with the help of Doraemon. They find out that the dog is actually a prince in its homeland in Africa.', 'Nobita is followed by a stray dog on his way home and decides to help it find its original owner with the help of Doraemon. They find out that the dog is actually a prince in its homeland in Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xKGMXQFGca4nKcO308aZ6nWz0Gc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285812'),
  ('73601802850766689', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Animal Planet', 1990, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Sadayoshi Tominaga, Tsutomu Shibayama', null, 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe', null, 'Nobita and his friends get transported to an animal planet after a mysterious pink fog appears inside his house. They work together with the natives to find the origin of the fog.', 'Nobita and his friends get transported to an animal planet after a mysterious pink fog appears inside his house. They work together with the natives to find the origin of the fog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mB1nulptGzyJJFKOfkDXenCUHP5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161707'),
  ('769732163118103810', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Birth of Japan', 1989, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama', null, 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki', null, 'Nobita, thinking of running away from home, travels back in time with Doraemon and his pals to prehistoric Japan. However, a time paradox causes prehistoric boy Kukul to land in the modern day, so it''s up to Doraemon and the rest to help the boy get back to the past while also defeating the mysterious shaman king, Giga-Zombie.', 'Nobita, thinking of running away from home, travels back in time with Doraemon and his pals to prehistoric Japan. However, a time paradox causes prehistoric boy Kukul to land in the modern day, so it''s up to Doraemon and the rest to help the boy get back to the past while also defeating the mysterious shaman king, Giga-Zombie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWYf9VL7yO0NMPzzUKsCGCD4GU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142527'),
  ('192878443010393908', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Birth of Japan', 2016, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Shinnosuke Yakuwa, Takashi Suehiro', 'Shinnosuke Yakuwa', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Tomokazu Seki, Subaru Kimura, Kotono Mitsuishi, Yasunori Matsumoto, Miyako Takeuchi', null, 'Doraemon and his friends travel to ancient Japan where they meet Kukuru. When Kukuru tells them that his tribe has been enslaved by Gigazombie, Doraemon decides to help him.', 'Doraemon and his friends travel to ancient Japan where they meet Kukuru. When Kukuru tells them that his tribe has been enslaved by Gigazombie, Doraemon decides to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yF6pCSsRKkN5RzeU01OzXOzTyVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384345'),
  ('837480091495642447', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Castle of the Undersea Devil', 1983, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama', null, 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe', null, 'Nobita and his friends under the waters of the Pacific Ocean. Gian and Suneo take Doraemon''s underwater vehicle and travel through the Atlantic Ocean, trying to find a treasure ship.', 'Nobita and his friends under the waters of the Pacific Ocean. Gian and Suneo take Doraemon''s underwater vehicle and travel through the Atlantic Ocean, trying to find a treasure ship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ioI9ftVCfdhgwM0jAjfSG2pNN4S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147576'),
  ('333427832315872933', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Galaxy Super-express', 1996, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Sadayoshi Tominaga, Minetaro Hirai', 'Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Ryoichi Tanaka, Junichi Sugawara', null, 'Doraemon went missing for 3 days. But it turns out later that he went to the 22nd century to buy a mystery galactic express train ticket whose destination is a secret until the passengers arrive there and see for themselves.', 'Doraemon went missing for 3 days. But it turns out later that he went to the 22nd century to buy a mystery galactic express train ticket whose destination is a secret until the passengers arrive there and see for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moqO24uCB0k6q4qPyAwb7O0xeWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106164'),
  ('741415979718819004', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Green Giant Legend', 2008, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Ayumu Watanabe, Katsuyoshi Kishi, Shizue Kaneko', 'Hiroshi Onogi', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Tomokazu Seki, Subaru Kimura, Takuya Yoshikoshi, Maki Horikita, Chiaki', null, 'A sapling Nobita discovers is turned into a plant-boy with help from Doraemon, and becomes Earth''s only hope at passing judgment from the dryadic aliens of the Green Planet.', 'A sapling Nobita discovers is turned into a plant-boy with help from Doraemon, and becomes Earth''s only hope at passing judgment from the dryadic aliens of the Green Planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jY2c8s4s8YyGxuxX8ymmzGUdnwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136686'),
  ('139535191727707919', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Haunts of Evil', 1982, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Hideo Nishimaki', null, 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Sumiko Shirakawa, Kazuyo Aoki, Mari Shimizu', null, 'Nobita and Doraemon venture to the Heavy Smokers Forest in the Congo, where they find a stray dog and a giant statue. After discovering that they are wanted for trespassing on isolated kingdom land, Nobita and the rest must utilize the power of the mysterious statue to prove their worth.', 'Nobita and Doraemon venture to the Heavy Smokers Forest in the Congo, where they find a stray dog and a giant statue. After discovering that they are wanted for trespassing on isolated kingdom land, Nobita and the rest must utilize the power of the mysterious statue to prove their worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4V4Iu9UQRdfrQliBJWlB0cOtEhO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184004'),
  ('531442986112062951', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Island of Miracles – Animal Adventure', 2012, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Kōzō Kusuba, Katsuyoshi Kishi, Masahiro Kurio', 'Higashi Shimizu', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Subaru Kimura, Tomokazu Seki, Nana Mizuki, Masako Nozawa, Atsuko Tanaka', null, 'Nobita and Doraemon use time tree Mochi and catch a big bird, which has been extinct for 500 years ago. To protect the animal, Nobita and Doraemon go to Beremon Island, overseen by a golden beetle named Herakles.', 'Nobita and Doraemon use time tree Mochi and catch a big bird, which has been extinct for 500 years ago. To protect the animal, Nobita and Doraemon go to Beremon Island, overseen by a golden beetle named Herakles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUJGtID4UyO6nLE0Ztqq48y4Hdw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160642'),
  ('731318249318224775', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Kingdom of Clouds', 1992, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Sadayoshi Tominaga, Ayumu Watanabe', 'Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Masayuki Kato, Ryoichi Tanaka', null, 'Nobita, after wondering if Heaven truly exists, asks for Doraemon to take him there. When his robot pal suggests that they make their own Heaven, Nobita enlists Shizuka, Gian, and Suneo to help, but a war breaks out between two islands in the clouds that could have terrible environmental consequences if Nobita and Doraemon don''t bring peace in time!', 'Nobita, after wondering if Heaven truly exists, asks for Doraemon to take him there. When his robot pal suggests that they make their own Heaven, Nobita enlists Shizuka, Gian, and Suneo to help, but a war breaks out between two islands in the clouds that could have terrible environmental consequences if Nobita and Doraemon don''t bring peace in time!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rLQFXpnE4m87NS31CKwjRspGrd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134162'),
  ('979228895736898209', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Knights on Dinosaurs', 1987, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama', null, 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe', null, 'Nobita tries to prove to Doraemon and his friends that dinosaurs are still alive, and, after finding an underground cave, discovers a hollow earth civilization of knights and saurian steeds that Suneo must be rescued from.', 'Nobita tries to prove to Doraemon and his friends that dinosaurs are still alive, and, after finding an underground cave, discovers a hollow earth civilization of knights and saurian steeds that Suneo must be rescued from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AMuQBdwHAGYDRgU8Ao3x4mR7cu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72565'),
  ('681212929478558519', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Legend of the Sun King', 2000, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Sadayoshi Tominaga, Toshiyuki Umeda', 'Nobuaki Kishima', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Megumi Ogata, Mayumi Izuka, Kazuko Sugiyama', null, 'Doraemon and its friends open a hole in the time and they''re travel to the Country of Mayana, a lost Mayan civilization in the jungle.', 'Doraemon and its friends open a hole in the time and they''re travel to the Country of Mayana, a lost Mayan civilization in the jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBPaU4bnqrnKrKe0gi6nC9qvlLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31352'),
  ('1097772997575033574', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the New Steel Troops: Winged Angels', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Yukiyo Teramoto, Hiroshi Fukuda, Masahiro Kurio', null, 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Tomokazu Seki, Subaru Kimura, Miyuki Sawashiro, Chiaki, Masaharu Fukuyama', 'PG', 'Nobita and Doraemon find a giant robot in pieces which they later assemble. It turns out to be a destructive weapon and the gang must save Earth from an imminent invasion.', 'Nobita and Doraemon find a giant robot in pieces which they later assemble. It turns out to be a destructive weapon and the gang must save Earth from an imminent invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57ighjFjXpRwg7VeQ1GN6nf4OZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137227'),
  ('81778513786279274', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Robot Kingdom', 2002, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Toshiyuki Umeda, Sadayoshi Tominaga, Tsutomu Shibayama', 'Kishida Nobuaki', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe, Houko Kuwashima, Chiharu Niiyama, Konishiki', null, 'Nobita, Doraemon, and the rest travel to the far future, on an inhabited planet where humans and robots coexist. The Empress of the Robot Kingdom is plotting to strip the robot inhabitants of their emotions, so it''s up to Nobita and his friends to stop the plan, while also helping a robot boy named Poko from getting caught in the middle.', 'Nobita, Doraemon, and the rest travel to the far future, on an inhabited planet where humans and robots coexist. The Empress of the Robot Kingdom is plotting to strip the robot inhabitants of their emotions, so it''s up to Nobita and his friends to stop the plan, while also helping a robot boy named Poko from getting caught in the middle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsr4Hcdh2xWtUDQumjiML5cirNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162095'),
  ('263492808512250093', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Space Heroes', 2015, 'Comedy, Animation, Family, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Yoshihiro Osugi, Takashi Suehiro', 'Higashi Shimizu', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Subaru Kimura, Tomokazu Seki, Mamiko Noto, Marina Inoue, Yûji Tanaka', 'PG', 'Nobita and friends decide to make a movie inspired by the space adventures of their heroes, but their fiction turns into a reality.', 'Nobita and friends decide to make a movie inspired by the space adventures of their heroes, but their fiction turns into a reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYVJgcuCU9swa7GEujygsRdkSQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350650'),
  ('914168721340961059', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Spiral City', 1997, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Family, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Soichiro Zen, Toshiyuki Umeda', null, 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Nozomu Sasaki, Sumiko Shirakawa', null, 'When Doraemon and Nobita win a tiny planet through a lottery, they make use of a screw to bring several toys to life and create a toy town.', 'When Doraemon and Nobita win a tiny planet through a lottery, they make use of a screw to bring several toys to life and create a toy town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEmOqdiYe1sVL4y5fmy7aF22t2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163394'),
  ('216254539426118470', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Steel Troops', 1986, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama', null, 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Masayuki Kato, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Ryoichi Tanaka', null, 'Doraemon and Nobita decide to build a perfect toy robot. However, their creation turns out to be a little more uncanny than an object of appreciation and wonder.', 'Doraemon and Nobita decide to build a perfect toy robot. However, their creation turns out to be a little more uncanny than an object of appreciation and wonder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rh8di1cyuYHZz37W5iZR00Eg47I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88625'),
  ('185467191699210893', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Tin Labyrinth', 1993, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Science Fiction, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Tooru Osakabe, Hideko Takahashi, Tsutomu Shibayama', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Nobuaki Kishima, Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Yôsuke Naka, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Nobuyo Oyama', null, 'Nobita and his friends find a portal to a mysterious resort filled with metal buildings. They soon discover that the person who opened the portal for them has an ulterior motive.', 'Nobita and his friends find a portal to a mysterious resort filled with metal buildings. They soon discover that the person who opened the portal for them has an ulterior motive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0v7xiBYCl1oaujtpkbF6YtglUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161822'),
  ('656054277087718596', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Windmasters', 2003, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Ayumu Watanabe, Toshiyuki Umeda', 'Nobuaki Kishima', 'Michiko Nomura, Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe', null, 'After a typhoon hits Nobita''s town, he and Doraemon discover a wind sprite who, with some help from Doraemon''s 22nd-century tech, takes them and their friends to a fantastic world of wind and storm people. But the wind sprite, named Fuuko by Nobita, had brought them to her world for a reason, as her peoples'' gods are battling, and Suneo might be a key player in their feud.', 'After a typhoon hits Nobita''s town, he and Doraemon discover a wind sprite who, with some help from Doraemon''s 22nd-century tech, takes them and their friends to a fantastic world of wind and storm people. But the wind sprite, named Fuuko by Nobita, had brought them to her world for a reason, as her peoples'' gods are battling, and Suneo might be a key player in their feud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdBLKFviJckRXOCgPqkTQK16Rq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98613'),
  ('414994117196599902', 'Doraemon: Nobita and the Winged Braves', 2001, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Toshiyuki Umeda, Sadayoshi Tominaga', 'Nobuaki Kishima', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Rina Chinen, Daisuke Gori', null, 'Doraemon and his friends have to rescue the people of Birdopia from the wrongdoing of vengeful former bird troopers before they unleash a wicked ancient dragon.', 'Doraemon and his friends have to rescue the people of Birdopia from the wrongdoing of vengeful former bird troopers before they unleash a wicked ancient dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrxoFlx8b8rPQz3BbQq0Wj8d1ya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162092'),
  ('806309664484558897', 'Doraemon: Nobita Drifts in the Universe', 1999, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Toshiyuki Umeda, Soichiro Zen', 'Nobuaki Kishima', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe', null, 'Nobita and his friends embark on a rescue mission to save Gian and Suneo, whom, after playing one of Doraemon''s futuristic video games, are held captive by an evil alien force.', 'Nobita and his friends embark on a rescue mission to save Gian and Suneo, whom, after playing one of Doraemon''s futuristic video games, are held captive by an evil alien force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyIYQ8nTNccBz9lGeDDGu4foLCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162072'),
  ('142046239577534788', 'Doraemon: Nobita in the Wan-Nyan Spacetime Odyssey', 2004, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Masahiro Kumagai, Tsutomu Shibayama, Tetsuro Karai', 'Nobuaki Kishima', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe, Megumi Hayashibara, Osamu Saka, Hitomi Shimatani', null, 'Nobita, believing he and Doraemon had done a good deed by saving stray cats and dogs and sending them back in time by 300 million years, discover that the usage of Doraemon''s Ray of Evolution had created a cat-and-dog-person society equal to Nobita''s time. When an asteroid attack is set to hit the city, Nobita and his friends must save Doraemon and ease tensions between the two sides.', 'Nobita, believing he and Doraemon had done a good deed by saving stray cats and dogs and sending them back in time by 300 million years, discover that the usage of Doraemon''s Ray of Evolution had created a cat-and-dog-person society equal to Nobita''s time. When an asteroid attack is set to hit the city, Nobita and his friends must save Doraemon and ease tensions between the two sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBYEK5Kv8uVZGoTbBcovIcWjKNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192904'),
  ('497110535190637758', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Chronicle of the Moon Exploration', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Family', 'Hiroki Imamura, Shinnosuke Yakuwa, Takashi Suehiro', 'Mizuki Tsujimura', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Tomokazu Seki, Subaru Kimura, Junko Minagawa, Alice Hirose, Sōichi Nakaoka', 'PG', 'When Nobita''s class makes fun of him for believing in the moon rabbit, he embarks on an adventure with Doraemon to create a civilisation of rabbits on the moon.', 'When Nobita''s class makes fun of him for believing in the moon rabbit, he embarks on an adventure with Doraemon to create a civilisation of rabbits on the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAZ43208e643rB3pcx8jsLqc6B9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575222'),
  ('1114710800319682921', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Diary on the Creation of the World', 1995, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Minetaro Hirai', 'Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki', null, 'To help him with his summer vacation project, Doraemon gives Nobita a kit which allows him to create a new world. The duo and their friends then go on a journey to witness the evolution of life.', 'To help him with his summer vacation project, Doraemon gives Nobita a kit which allows him to create a new world. The duo and their friends then go on a journey to witness the evolution of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qemtaCXwo9sP6bYO8Hqc0o96JIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162069'),
  ('43807434715989395', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Dinosaur', 1980, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Hiroshi Fukutomi, Katsuji Misawa, Akira Ookuma', 'Seiji Matsuoka, Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Masayuki Kato, Keiko Yokozawa', null, 'When Suneo does not show Nobita the fossil of a dinosaur claw, he takes up a challenge to find a dinosaur. He digs up a hillside and finds an egg, which later hatches and becomes a dinosaur.', 'When Suneo does not show Nobita the fossil of a dinosaur claw, he takes up a challenge to find a dinosaur. He digs up a hillside and finds an egg, which later hatches and becomes a dinosaur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBWtnb9kmROgziBXOh4P3IMXHKz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64789'),
  ('1111865045885058386', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Dinosaur', 2006, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Ayumu Watanabe, Masahiro Kumagai, Kenichi Konishi', 'Kōzō Kusuba, Ayumu Watanabe', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Tomokazu Seki, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Subaru Kimura, Yumi Kakazu, Eiichiro Funakoshi, Kenji Utsumi', null, 'After bringing a fossilized egg back to life with the Time Cloth, Nobita finds himself the owner of a baby dinosaur. Everything is fine until it grows up. Nobita and friends use Doraemon''s time machine to return it back to its own time.', 'After bringing a fossilized egg back to life with the Time Cloth, Nobita finds himself the owner of a baby dinosaur. Everything is fine until it grows up. Nobita and friends use Doraemon''s time machine to return it back to its own time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0D94CrNm8bTCgHdpURTmR46s1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70841'),
  ('730820561105983082', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Dorabian Nights', 1991, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama', 'Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Masako Matsubara, Yoshino Ootori', null, 'Shizuka ends up in the fantasy world of the ''Arabian Nights'' story. However, Doraemon, Nobita, Suneo, and Jyaian must find her from the imaginary Middle East and bring her back to the real life.', 'Shizuka ends up in the fantasy world of the ''Arabian Nights'' story. However, Doraemon, Nobita, Suneo, and Jyaian must find her from the imaginary Middle East and bring her back to the real life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMrO4LcdoSI1PLd9oKLuY5W8cDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188403'),
  ('1067963805837585006', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Great Adventure in the Antarctic Kachi Kochi', 2017, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Atsushi Takahashi, Hiroshi Shimizu, Koichi Maruyama', 'Atsushi Takahashi', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Tomokazu Seki, Subaru Kimura, Chiaki, Kotono Mitsuishi, Daisuke Namikawa', null, 'Doraemon and Nobita discover a mysterious golden ring far beneath the ice in Antarctica, leading them to uncover an ancient, ruined city.', 'Doraemon and Nobita discover a mysterious golden ring far beneath the ice in Antarctica, leading them to uncover an ancient, ruined city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcydn0Lr3DAixZFOaUmjoqoIFU6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462677'),
  ('1052645198673929368', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Great Adventure in the South Seas', 1998, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama', 'Fujiko F. Fujio, Nobuaki Kishima', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Kazuya Tatekabe, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Tohru Emori, Paul Lucas', null, 'Nobita coaxes his friends to join him for a treasure hunt but an eerie event transports them to the past. However, their hunt for treasure is not easy as they come face-to-face with pirates.', 'Nobita coaxes his friends to join him for a treasure hunt but an eerie event transports them to the past. However, their hunt for treasure is not easy as they come face-to-face with pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gGIYi40x3G6UPm1IMGqdseK0Ro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105444'),
  ('621528193677168453', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Great Adventure in the World of Magic', 1984, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama, Akihiko Iguchi', 'Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Tadashi Nakamura, Mami Koyama', null, 'Nobita, currently obsessed with fantasy fiction, wishes upon Doraemon''s Moshimo-Box for the world to have real magic and sorcery. This doesn''t go as he''d hoped, of course, and Nobita must navigate the strangely-bureaucratic magical world he''d made while also learning to conjure on his own in preparation for an attack by the underground-dwelling Demon World.', 'Nobita, currently obsessed with fantasy fiction, wishes upon Doraemon''s Moshimo-Box for the world to have real magic and sorcery. This doesn''t go as he''d hoped, of course, and Nobita must navigate the strangely-bureaucratic magical world he''d made while also learning to conjure on his own in preparation for an attack by the underground-dwelling Demon World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7P921n7w0SKrl8b18bVq1LsEoY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161699'),
  ('890370259166107383', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Great Battle of the Mermaid King', 2010, 'Adventure, Family, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Kōzō Kusuba, Naoyuki Asano, Katsuyoshi Kishi', 'Yuichi Shinpo', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Chiaki, Megumi Oohara, Tomokazu Seki, Yumi Kakazu, Subaru Kimura, Shihoko Hagino, Mayumi Izuka', null, 'Nobita, Doraemon, and the rest must come to the aid of mermaid princess Sophia, whose undersea kingdom is suffering under the weight of a war. Their only hope lies in a mythical sword from the planet Aqua...', 'Nobita, Doraemon, and the rest must come to the aid of mermaid princess Sophia, whose undersea kingdom is suffering under the weight of a war. Their only hope lies in a mythical sword from the planet Aqua...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvi0MjGJvWPAAqQaxCwwMsLqBG8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86184'),
  ('32275429256500708', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Little Star Wars', 1985, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama', null, 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Michiko Nomura, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Dai Kanai, Keiko Han', null, 'As Nobita, Gian, Shizuka, and Suneo are making their own space movie, a fleeing bug-sized alien president makes his way to Earth, and needs the help of the kids and Doraemon to stop an oppressive dictatorship threatening his democracy.', 'As Nobita, Gian, Shizuka, and Suneo are making their own space movie, a fleeing bug-sized alien president makes his way to Earth, and needs the help of the kids and Doraemon to stop an oppressive dictatorship threatening his democracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4IPqrfXEEtMC8hzV5PaCElkdNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161704'),
  ('200823594195105679', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s New Dinosaur', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Takashi Kojima, Takashi Suehiro, Kazuaki Imai', 'Genki Kawamura', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Tomokazu Seki, Subaru Kimura, Kotono Mitsuishi, Takuya Kimura, Aya Endo', null, 'Nobita accidentally finds a fossil dinosaur egg mixed with rocks in the dinosaur fossil exhibition site that he had visited before. He returns it to its original state with the ''time blanket''.', 'Nobita accidentally finds a fossil dinosaur egg mixed with rocks in the dinosaur fossil exhibition site that he had visited before. He returns it to its original state with the ''time blanket''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxCZmXRJa8hSv1Tpih8TBSR4o6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682153'),
  ('1152784396147390298', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s New Great Adventure Into the Underworld - The Seven Magic Users', 2007, 'Family, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Shizue Kaneko, Yukiyo Teramoto, Masahiro Kumagai', 'Yuichi Shinpo', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Subaru Kimura, Tomokazu Seki, Chiaki, Shihoko Hagino, Yasunori Matsumoto', null, 'Nobita wishes the world into a magic-reliant one with Doraemon''s Moshimo-Box, and, along with his friends, must stop an asteroid from hitting the planet with help from a sorcerer-in-training.', 'Nobita wishes the world into a magic-reliant one with Doraemon''s Moshimo-Box, and, along with his friends, must stop an asteroid from hitting the planet with help from a sorcerer-in-training.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PlFFcAq9PcFEGgA0Znvut3kmVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52795'),
  ('539476940950520621', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Secret Gadget Museum', 2013, 'Adventure, Family, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Yukiyo Teramoto, Hiroshi Fukuda, Hiroshi Fukuda', 'Higashi Shimizu', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Subaru Kimura, Tomokazu Seki, Chiaki, Kotono Mitsuishi, Sachi Matsumoto', 'PG', 'Doraemon and his friends travel to the 22nd century to look for his golden bell, which was stolen by a notorious thief called Kaito DX.', 'Doraemon and his friends travel to the 22nd century to look for his golden bell, which was stolen by a notorious thief called Kaito DX.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOPhayPb0YzO8GfC4sNmntV9FWE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218726'),
  ('805855302760937245', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Three Visionary Swordsmen', 1994, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Minetaro Hirai, Sadayoshi Tominaga, Tsutomu Shibayama', 'Fujiko F. Fujio', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Masako Matsubara, Ryoichi Tanaka', null, 'Nobita is exhausted from having constant nightmares and pleads Doraemon to arrange a dream machine that will enable him to dream of anything he wishes for. As Nobita dreams of him and his friends in the roles of gallant musketeers, the dream world starts to break down due to a dark force, and Nobita will have to put his fantasy to the test and become a hero, both in the real world and imagined.', 'Nobita is exhausted from having constant nightmares and pleads Doraemon to arrange a dream machine that will enable him to dream of anything he wishes for. As Nobita dreams of him and his friends in the roles of gallant musketeers, the dream world starts to break down due to a dark force, and Nobita will have to put his fantasy to the test and become a hero, both in the real world and imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCQtdezF7Ap5wm8ICiB3Pzx6wM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161715'),
  ('76092142330269356', 'Doraemon: Nobita''s Treasure Island', 2018, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Comedy, Family', 'Yoshimichi Kameda, Takashi Suehiro, Yousuke Hatta', 'Genki Kawamura', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Subaru Kimura, Tomokazu Seki, Yo Oizumi, Kotono Mitsuishi, Yasunori Matsumoto', 'PG', 'Upon hearing about the story of Treasure Island, Nobita dreams of discovering and exploring his own treasure island, despite the fact all of the Earth has been mapped already.', 'Upon hearing about the story of Treasure Island, Nobita dreams of discovering and exploring his own treasure island, despite the fact all of the Earth has been mapped already.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1YkpYAxzD1lxNbjoZBpvYWkucO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495925'),
  ('1038171428116036570', 'Doraemon: The New Record of Nobita''s Spaceblazer', 2009, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Shigeo Koshi, Katsuyoshi Kishi, Naoyuki Asano', 'Yuichi Shinpo', 'Wasabi Mizuta, Megumi Oohara, Yumi Kakazu, Tomokazu Seki, Karina, Subaru Kimura, Ayaka Wilson', null, 'Nobita finds a passage to a spaceship in another dimension. With their new friends, he and Doraemon fight the cruel leader of an exploited planet.', 'Nobita finds a passage to a spaceship in another dimension. With their new friends, he and Doraemon fight the cruel leader of an exploited planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6F5mriTD7HrVSJf7o0BrAedw5LX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95935'),
  ('64837046696081907', 'Doraemon: The Record of Nobita, Spaceblazer', 1981, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Sadayoshi Tominaga, Hideo Nishimaki', null, 'Nobuyo Oyama, Kazuya Tatekabe, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Michiko Nomura, Noriko Ohara, Masako Sugaya, Emiko Tsukada', null, 'Lopple and Chammy, two runaway aliens, recruit Doraemon and Nobita to help save their planet from destruction.', 'Lopple and Chammy, two runaway aliens, recruit Doraemon and Nobita to help save their planet from destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3JzxjbBojrcs9LxFmSnOgCEzkT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162103'),
  ('1150005176404547168', 'Doraemon: The Record of Nobita''s Parallel Journey to the West', 1988, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Tsutomu Shibayama', null, 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe, Masayuki Kato, Sachiko Chijimatsu, Sumiko Shirakawa', null, 'As Nobita, Shizuka, Gian, and Suneo are auditioning for a role in their school''s play based on "Journey to the West", the coveted role of Son Goku is hotly contested. After suggesting that the real Great Sage Equal to Heaven should play himself, knowing that the story is only a legend, Nobita and Doraemon go back in time to find their own fake Monkey King, but arrive in present day with the story''s demons having taken over the world. The only way for things to go back to normal is for Nobita and pals to reenact the tale...for real!', 'As Nobita, Shizuka, Gian, and Suneo are auditioning for a role in their school''s play based on "Journey to the West", the coveted role of Son Goku is hotly contested. After suggesting that the real Great Sage Equal to Heaven should play himself, knowing that the story is only a legend, Nobita and Doraemon go back in time to find their own fake Monkey King, but arrive in present day with the story''s demons having taken over the world. The only way for things to go back to normal is for Nobita and pals to reenact the tale...for real!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEL1XbKs3UezQfApuy5CchuQn6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136241'),
  ('759237398239030594', 'Doraemon: What am I for Momotaro', 1981, 'Animation, Family', 'Takeyuki Kanda', 'Noboru Shiroyama', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Noriko Ohara, Michiko Nomura, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazuya Tatekabe', null, 'A short movie of Doraemon was released on August 1, 1981 in Japan. It is a retelling of the famous Japanese fable Momotaro.', 'A short movie of Doraemon was released on August 1, 1981 in Japan. It is a retelling of the famous Japanese fable Momotaro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnjWAqU5nZoxR6zG2uJtRNw5bjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326146'),
  ('142038943380404669', 'Dorami & Doraemons: Robot School''s Seven Mysteries', 1996, 'Animation', 'Yoshihiko Takakura, Yoshitomo Yonetani', 'Kenji Terada', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Keiko Yokozawa, Keiichi Nanba, Toshiharu Sakurai, Megumi Hayashibara, Teiyu Ichiryusai, Kyousei Tsukui, Masaharu Sato', null, 'It is time for Doraemon''s younger sister - Dorami-chan to graduate from the Robot School. But a mysterious wind sucks Doraemon and the principal away. Dorami escapes, and finds Doraemon''s Good Friend Telepathy Card. This is a device Doraemon uses to communicate with his friends—collectively known as The Doraemons.', 'It is time for Doraemon''s younger sister - Dorami-chan to graduate from the Robot School. But a mysterious wind sucks Doraemon and the principal away. Dorami escapes, and finds Doraemon''s Good Friend Telepathy Card. This is a device Doraemon uses to communicate with his friends—collectively known as The Doraemons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KdnqaPGxXc6PpoSrg6aWdrD02b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326904'),
  ('758658604767485630', 'Dorami-chan: Mini-Dora SOS!!', 1989, 'Animation', 'Yoshihiko Takakura, Makoto Moriwaki', 'Ryo Motohira', null, null, 'This episode is set in the future 2011 where the main characters from Doraemon are all grown up and have kids. Minidora (mini doraemon) accidentally gets delivered to the Nobita''s future house. The sons of Jyaiyan, Suneo and Nobita plays with Minidora with the special goods he brings out of his pocket. But trouble happens when they ran away from Dorami, who came to retrieve Minidora.', 'This episode is set in the future 2011 where the main characters from Doraemon are all grown up and have kids. Minidora (mini doraemon) accidentally gets delivered to the Nobita''s future house. The sons of Jyaiyan, Suneo and Nobita plays with Minidora with the special goods he brings out of his pocket. But trouble happens when they ran away from Dorami, who came to retrieve Minidora.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQhZGrKdEuvVKVnHZGyNKKQbYX5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326391'),
  ('495736292689457048', 'Dorfpunks', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lars Jessen', 'Norbert Eberlein', 'Cecil von Renner, Pit Bukowski, Daniel Michel, Laszlo Horwitz, Samuel Auer, Wilfried Dziallas, Axel Prahl, Ole Fischer', null, 'It is the summer of 1984 in Schmalenstedt, in the middle of Holstein Switzerland, directly on the Baltic Sea. The 17-year-old Malte Ahrens, who calls himself Roddy Dangerblood, lives with his elderly parents in a farmhouse, is trained as a potter and has discovered for himself the punk that has made its way into Schmalenstedt with some delay.', 'It is the summer of 1984 in Schmalenstedt, in the middle of Holstein Switzerland, directly on the Baltic Sea. The 17-year-old Malte Ahrens, who calls himself Roddy Dangerblood, lives with his elderly parents in a farmhouse, is trained as a potter and has discovered for himself the punk that has made its way into Schmalenstedt with some delay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsdCdmFHmFPc4bEKOq8uqpmIBsf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36472'),
  ('214346367258450970', 'Dorian Blues', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tennyson Bardwell', 'Tennyson Bardwell', 'Michael McMillian, Lea Coco, Mo Quigley, Steve Fletcher, Austin Basis, Ryan Kelly Berkowitz, Chris Dallman, Leslie Elliard', null, 'Dorian realizes he is gay in his final year of high school. He meets another gay youth locally, but remains confused. He starts therapy, then resorts to confession in the Church, and finally comes out to his brother. Dorian then decides to come out to his father; he gets kicked out of the house.', 'Dorian realizes he is gay in his final year of high school. He meets another gay youth locally, but remains confused. He starts therapy, then resorts to confession in the Church, and finally comes out to his brother. Dorian then decides to come out to his father; he gets kicked out of the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZfhoKWz6BpVQ1Puzpot7aG03v7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32444'),
  ('591772215827156104', 'Dorian Gray', 1970, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Massimo Dallamano, Otello Spila, Raul Montesanti', 'Renato Romano', 'Helmut Berger, Richard Todd, Herbert Lom, Marie Liljedahl, Margaret Lee, Maria Rohm, Beryl Cunningham, Isa Miranda', null, 'London, England. Dorian Gray is a young man who somehow keeps his beauty eternally, while a mysterious portrait of himself gradually reveals his moral decay.', 'London, England. Dorian Gray is a young man who somehow keeps his beauty eternally, while a mysterious portrait of himself gradually reveals his moral decay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bh4CFuIT9UbFLxggnCnZPMLEqAB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47459'),
  ('377078575345368543', 'Dorian Gray', 2009, 'Fantasy, Drama, Thriller', 'Oliver Parker, Roger Pratt, Christopher Newman', 'Toby Finlay', 'Ben Barnes, Colin Firth, Rebecca Hall, Emilia Fox, Ben Chaplin, Fiona Shaw, Caroline Goodall, Maryam D''Abo', 'R', 'Seduced into the decadent world of Lord Henry Wotton, handsome young aristocrat Dorian Gray becomes obsessed with maintaining his youthful appearance, and commissions a special portrait that will weather the winds of time while he remains forever young. When Gray''s obsession spirals out of control, his desperate attempts to safeguard his secret turn his once-privileged life into a living hell.', 'Seduced into the decadent world of Lord Henry Wotton, handsome young aristocrat Dorian Gray becomes obsessed with maintaining his youthful appearance, and commissions a special portrait that will weather the winds of time while he remains forever young. When Gray''s obsession spirals out of control, his desperate attempts to safeguard his secret turn his once-privileged life into a living hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRKt8nYdy7EO4uqeKVVpZRmqrxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23488'),
  ('1051875140004764001', 'Dorian Gray in the Mirror of the Yellow Press', 1984, 'Drama', 'Ulrike Ottinger, Eva Ebner, Ulrike Ottinger', 'Ulrike Ottinger', 'Veruschka von Lehndorff, Delphine Seyrig, Tabea Blumenschein, Toyo Tanaka, Irm Hermann, Magdalena Montezuma, Barbara Valentin, Luc Alexander', null, 'The final installment in Ulrike Ottinger’s Berlin Trilogy (following TICKET OF NO RETURN and FREAK ORLANDO) casts Delphine Seyrig as the nefarious Fritz Lang supervillain Dr. Mabuse, here the head of a powerful media empire that seeks to create headlines by manufacturing (and then publicly destroying) its own celebrity: the wealthy, handsome playboy Dorian Gray.', 'The final installment in Ulrike Ottinger’s Berlin Trilogy (following TICKET OF NO RETURN and FREAK ORLANDO) casts Delphine Seyrig as the nefarious Fritz Lang supervillain Dr. Mabuse, here the head of a powerful media empire that seeks to create headlines by manufacturing (and then publicly destroying) its own celebrity: the wealthy, handsome playboy Dorian Gray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AkievMQ1MXciT8tkT1RsBhcwaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224756'),
  ('859133869076431420', 'Dorm', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Songyos Sugmakanan, Weerachai Yaikwawong, Niramon Ross', 'Songyos Sugmakanan, Chonlada Tiaosuwan, Vanridee Pongsittisak', 'Chintara Sukapatana, Charlie Trairat, Sirachuch Chienthaworn, Suttipong Tudpitakkul, Nipawan Taveepornsawan, Monton Annupabmard, Natapohn Tameeruks, Jirat Sukchaloen', null, 'When 12-year-old Ton transfers to an all-boys boarding school, he''s taunted by his peers and terrified by their tales about the ghosts that inhabit the school. Ton is utterly miserable until he befriends a mysterious fellow pupil.', 'When 12-year-old Ton transfers to an all-boys boarding school, he''s taunted by his peers and terrified by their tales about the ghosts that inhabit the school. Ton is utterly miserable until he befriends a mysterious fellow pupil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d20Sxlt4JqZFiQFZnay7rih3OCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21766'),
  ('850578749979352447', 'Dorm Daze 2', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Scott Hillenbrand, David Hillenbrand, Philip D. Schwartz', 'Patrick Casey, Josh Miller', 'Gable Carr, Patrick Cavanaugh, James DeBello, Marieh Delfino, Tony Denman, Larry Drake, Danielle Fishel, Vida Guerra', 'NR', 'The gang from Dorm Daze is back, but this time they''re on a cruise ship on a tropical voyage through the high seas. The cruise makes an educational stop at the island of San Paradiso, where the students are supposed to explore an important archaeological site. Things go from normal to crazy as their visit coincides with every other college''s spring break. The moment the boat docks, classes are over! For these Billingsley students, their Semester at Sea will be an adventure no one will ever forget.', 'The gang from Dorm Daze is back, but this time they''re on a cruise ship on a tropical voyage through the high seas. The cruise makes an educational stop at the island of San Paradiso, where the students are supposed to explore an important archaeological site. Things go from normal to crazy as their visit coincides with every other college''s spring break. The moment the boat docks, classes are over! For these Billingsley students, their Semester at Sea will be an adventure no one will ever forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6H4osjA6mFDBPMRKHkuoDrF4sXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10104'),
  ('1067214645652329795', 'Dormant Beauty', 2012, 'Drama', 'Daniele Ciprì, Marco Bellocchio', 'Marco Bellocchio, Stefano Rulli, Veronica Raimo', 'Isabelle Huppert, Alba Rohrwacher, Toni Servillo, Maya Sansa, Michele Riondino, Pier Giorgio Bellocchio, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Brenno Placido', null, 'A mosaic of several intertwined stories questioning the meaning of life, love and hope, set during the last six days in the life of Eluana Englaro, a young woman who spent 17 years in a vegetative state.', 'A mosaic of several intertwined stories questioning the meaning of life, love and hope, set during the last six days in the life of Eluana Englaro, a young woman who spent 17 years in a vegetative state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/basum4NDZlibx0Vbd3AKqIOFXYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110447'),
  ('1087165834480649576', 'Dormitory', 2024, 'Drama', 'Nehir Tuna, Florent Herry', 'Nehir Tuna', 'Doğa Karakaş, Can Bartu Arslan, Ozan Çelik, Tansu Biçer, Didem Ellialtı, Orhan Güner, Işıltı Su Alyanak, Ozan Bilen', null, 'Forced to leave the comfort of his middle class lifestyle at his father''s behest, fourteen-year-old Ahmet is sent to an all-boys religious dormitory where he must navigate familial expectations, his religious obligations, and the childhood to which he so desperately clings.', 'Forced to leave the comfort of his middle class lifestyle at his father''s behest, fourteen-year-old Ahmet is sent to an all-boys religious dormitory where he must navigate familial expectations, his religious obligations, and the childhood to which he so desperately clings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBeJX2GOOczfDMaDT4jRRT0f0yR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156208'),
  ('376890071437587679', 'Dornröschen', 2009, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Arend Agthe, Stefan Motzek, Oliver Schnekenbühl', 'Arend Agthe', 'Anna Hausburg, Moritz Schulze, Dirk Bach, Christine Urspruch, Franz-Joseph Dieken, Bettina Kupfer, Erich Schleyer, Gustav Peter Wöhler', null, 'German TV adaptation of Grimm‘s fairy tale “Sleeping Beauty“.', 'German TV adaptation of Grimm‘s fairy tale “Sleeping Beauty“.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gAIThnU4uvw5vqgLPSDzaBHopU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111556'),
  ('1098822690723821250', 'Dororo', 2007, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Akihiko Shiota, Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Yuji Shimomura', 'Akihiko Shiota, Masaru Nakamura', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Ko Shibasaki, Kiichi Nakai, Yoshio Harada, Eita Nagayama, Mieko Harada, Katsuo Nakamura, Anna Tsuchiya', null, 'Hyakkimaru, a warrior on a quest to reclaim 48 of his body parts which were each taken by a demon, is joined by Dororo, a thief on a quest to avenge the death of her parents.', 'Hyakkimaru, a warrior on a quest to reclaim 48 of his body parts which were each taken by a demon, is joined by Dororo, a thief on a quest to avenge the death of her parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEM9WY9ufaIeX8xHdHyJ8H2udNz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16221'),
  ('967851330220343983', 'Dorothea', 2025, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Chad Ferrin, Jeff Billings, Wolf Dangler', 'Chad Ferrin', 'Susan Priver, Lew Temple, Ginger Lynn, Brinke Stevens, Ezra Buzzington, Cassandra Gava, William Salyers, Cyril O''Reilly', null, 'A twisted true crime nightmare where serial killer granny Dorothea Puente lures the vulnerable, kills without remorse, and buries secrets in her garden. Evil wears a smile. You’ll never trust kindness again.', 'A twisted true crime nightmare where serial killer granny Dorothea Puente lures the vulnerable, kills without remorse, and buries secrets in her garden. Evil wears a smile. You’ll never trust kindness again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oKJN4xy0MKM59FzA3Z7cpbC83E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1559827'),
  ('1107967587271654752', 'Dorothea''s Revenge', 1974, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Fleischmann, Jean-Jacques Flori, Klaus Müller-Laue', 'Peter Fleischmann, Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer, Alexander von Paczensky, Gerhard Gommel, Henry Beuck, Anemone Gehann, Birgit Heise, Mathias Herisch, Barbara Ossenkopp', null, 'Dorothea, a 16-year-old bourgeois girl from Hamburg, plays with her friends of both sexes, imitating the production of adult movies. In the end, pretending to make sex-scenes is not satisfying enough, and with a street professional, Dorothea is initiated in hard sex.', 'Dorothea, a 16-year-old bourgeois girl from Hamburg, plays with her friends of both sexes, imitating the production of adult movies. In the end, pretending to make sex-scenes is not satisfying enough, and with a street professional, Dorothea is initiated in hard sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMsQscAlMAECFcUOMRmKCcxqRBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67241'),
  ('344908934540698452', 'Dorothy Mills', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Agnès Merlet, Andrew Hegarty, Jonathan Shaw', 'Juliette Sales, Agnès Merlet', 'Carice van Houten, Jenn Murray, David Wilmot, Ger Ryan, David Ganly, Gary Lewis, Rynagh O''Grady, Charlene McKenna', 'R', 'When a gloomy, God-fearing island community is rocked by the assault of an infant, a psychiatrist is called in to examine Dorothy Mills, the teenager accused of the crime. Despite the villagers'' hostility to her inquiry, she soon comes to suspect that Dorothy suffers from multiple personality disorder...', 'When a gloomy, God-fearing island community is rocked by the assault of an infant, a psychiatrist is called in to examine Dorothy Mills, the teenager accused of the crime. Despite the villagers'' hostility to her inquiry, she soon comes to suspect that Dorothy suffers from multiple personality disorder...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nluoNHRQzJoyvMin0P4hOFC1d5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15741'),
  ('549035910653090107', 'Dos a la carta', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Robert Bellsolà', null, 'Adrià Collado, Andoni Agirregomezkorta, Carolina Bang, Melani Olivares', null, 'Oscar, a smart stockbroker from the big city, and Dan, a goofy slacker from hicksville, get some big news: they''re brothers. Now they''re stuck sharing their deceased father''s estate, a failing country-style restaurant in the middle of nowhere.', 'Oscar, a smart stockbroker from the big city, and Dan, a goofy slacker from hicksville, get some big news: they''re brothers. Now they''re stuck sharing their deceased father''s estate, a failing country-style restaurant in the middle of nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvIe1TRBOrv94AXDcP1EXbw7K8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282990'),
  ('223430587996395007', 'Dos Estaciones', 2022, 'Drama', 'Juan Pablo González, Gerardo Guerra V.', 'Ilana Coleman, Juan Pablo González, Ana Isabel Fernández', 'Teresa Sánchez, Rafaela Fuentes, Tatín Vera, Manuel Garcia-Rulfo', null, 'Fifty-year-old Maria Garcia is the owner of the Dos Estaciones, a once-majestic tequila factory struggling to stay afloat, and the final hold-over from generations of Mexican-owned tequila plants in the highlands of Jalisco; the rest have folded to foreign corporations. Once one of the wealthiest people in town, Maria knows her current financial situation is untenable. When a persistent plague and an unexpected flood cause irreversible damage, she is forced to do everything she can to save her community''s main source of economy and pride.', 'Fifty-year-old Maria Garcia is the owner of the Dos Estaciones, a once-majestic tequila factory struggling to stay afloat, and the final hold-over from generations of Mexican-owned tequila plants in the highlands of Jalisco; the rest have folded to foreign corporations. Once one of the wealthiest people in town, Maria knows her current financial situation is untenable. When a persistent plague and an unexpected flood cause irreversible damage, she is forced to do everything she can to save her community''s main source of economy and pride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBYchePTtLlKpqDdGsplrKCHr5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865584'),
