  ('645063460857448903', 'Dos pintores pintorescos', 1967, 'Crime, Comedy', 'René Cardona Jr., Rosalío Solano', 'Roberto Gómez Bolaños', 'Gaspar Henaine, Marco Antonio Campos, Regina Torné, Gilda Mirós, Miguel Córcega, Emilia Stuart, Eduardo Alcaraz, Nathanael León', null, 'Two house-painters go to art school. Also bad guys try to kill them.', 'Two house-painters go to art school. Also bad guys try to kill them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhy9DqUzl3dVZe8Phz8FocpyQeq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326676'),
  ('343891543392352673', 'Dos tipos de cuidado', 1953, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Ignacio Torres, James L. Fields', 'Carlos Orellana, Ismael Rodríguez', 'Jorge Negrete, Pedro Infante, Carmelita González, Yolanda Varela, Carlos Orellana, José Elías Moreno, Queta Lavat, Arturo Soto Rangel', null, 'Jorge Bueno and Pedro Malo are best friends who consider giving up their womanizing ways when they each fall in love. As fate would have it, Pedro Malo unexpectedly marries Jorge Bueno''s girlfriend, and the conflict between the former buddies begins.', 'Jorge Bueno and Pedro Malo are best friends who consider giving up their womanizing ways when they each fall in love. As fate would have it, Pedro Malo unexpectedly marries Jorge Bueno''s girlfriend, and the conflict between the former buddies begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KP4lpfka3RoHEMQ8Hp43M9fxJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120301'),
  ('946199786402001343', 'Dossier 51', 1978, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michel Deville, Claude Lecomte, Kalinka Weiler', 'Michel Deville, Gilles Perrault', 'François Marthouret, Roger Planchon, Patrick Chesnais, Jean Martin, Daniel Mesguich, Anna Prucnal, László Szabó, Didier Sauvegrain', null, 'A French diplomat is surveilled by a secret service to find a weakness for political control, his private life becoming ''File No. 51''.', 'A French diplomat is surveilled by a secret service to find a weakness for political control, his private life becoming ''File No. 51''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Gzv3s2heDvwESo8oYQSm0w3V3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49583'),
  ('144735663135538943', 'Dossier K.', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jan Verheyen, Frank van den Eeden', 'Carl Joos, Erik Van Looy', 'Koen De Bouw, Werner De Smedt, Hilde De Baerdemaeker, Blerim Destani, Greg Timmermans, Jappe Claes, Marieke Dilles, R. Kan Albay', null, 'Vincke and Verstuyft are detectives of the Antwerp police department. This time they have to deal with the Albanian mob and some problems in their own police division.', 'Vincke and Verstuyft are detectives of the Antwerp police department. This time they have to deal with the Albanian mob and some problems in their own police division.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYpr0Hxrw3Rn6gAeyqLD3fhJi1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44751'),
  ('314164183475523056', 'Dostana', 1980, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Raj Khosla', 'Javed Akhtar, Salim Khan', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Shatrughan Sinha, Zeenat Aman, Prem Chopra, Amrish Puri, Helen, Pran Sikand, Gajanan Jagirdar', null, 'Two close friends decide to enter law enforcement – one a police officer, the other a lawyer – but their friendship begins to unravel when they both fall in love with the same woman.', 'Two close friends decide to enter law enforcement – one a police officer, the other a lawyer – but their friendship begins to unravel when they both fall in love with the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYUgAxGTeZ3DvIKno5OpHJt0e4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143844'),
  ('37276888892777032', 'Dostana', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Tarun Mansukhani, Sameer Sippy', 'Tarun Mansukhani', 'Abhishek Bachchan, John Abraham, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Kirron Kher, Boman Irani, Bobby Deol, Shrey Bawa, Sushmita Mukherjee', 'PG-13', 'Two straight guys pretend to be a gay couple to secure a posh Miami apartment, but fall for their gorgeous roommate. Hilarity ensues as they strive to convince everyone of the ruse while secretly trying to win her heart.', 'Two straight guys pretend to be a gay couple to secure a posh Miami apartment, but fall for their gorgeous roommate. Hilarity ensues as they strive to convince everyone of the ruse while secretly trying to win her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obwjlgNI2NFZupMuJBbKgH3IhQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14071'),
  ('281202367727080208', 'Dosti: Friends Forever', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Suneel Darshan', 'Robin Bhatt', 'Akshay Kumar, Bobby Deol, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Lara Dutta, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Shakti Kapoor, Kiran Kumar, Mahesh Thakur', null, 'Karan (Bobby Deol) was wealthy and a mansion was his habitat. Raj (Akshay Kumar) had empty pockets and the sky was his roof. Karan''s jet ensured that he could fly if he wanted. Raj could only depend on his two feet. Karan had a family and yet craved love. Raj had love to share, but craved a family. Karan was the eternal Casanova. Raj was the proverbial one-woman man. Karan had it all, and yet felt empty. Raj had nothing, but his heart was full. They were two people as different as can be. Yet they found a common ground. One that led to the glorious road of Friendship! But can they sustain their friendship when new conflicts arise?', 'Karan (Bobby Deol) was wealthy and a mansion was his habitat. Raj (Akshay Kumar) had empty pockets and the sky was his roof. Karan''s jet ensured that he could fly if he wanted. Raj could only depend on his two feet. Karan had a family and yet craved love. Raj had love to share, but craved a family. Karan was the eternal Casanova. Raj was the proverbial one-woman man. Karan had it all, and yet felt empty. Raj had nothing, but his heart was full. They were two people as different as can be. Yet they found a common ground. One that led to the glorious road of Friendship! But can they sustain their friendship when new conflicts arise?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnJQne1uplPbXDDL9YCvRK7OI5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225635'),
  ('727892777800435774', 'Dot', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Derviş Zaim', 'Derviş Zaim', 'Mehmet Ali Nuroğlu, Serhat Kılıç, Settar Tanrıöğen, Şener Kökkaya, Mustafa Uzunyılmaz, Nadi Güler, Numan Acar, Bayazıt Gülercan', null, 'Story of a man who is suffering because of a crime and trying to escape of his suffering.', 'Story of a man who is suffering because of a crime and trying to escape of his suffering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hndS0UCJOF3sJOaC0wWmg4HPTMH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63488'),
  ('1127545481852255539', 'Dot the I', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Affonso Beato, Matthew Parkhill', 'Matthew Parkhill', 'Gael García Bernal, Natalia Verbeke, James D''Arcy, Tom Hardy, Charlie Cox, Yves Aubert, Myfanwy Waring, Michael Webber', 'R', 'A fiery Spanish woman is about to marry a kind British man when she meets a Brazilian actor who ignites in her a flame of lust she can''t ignore.', 'A fiery Spanish woman is about to marry a kind British man when she meets a Brazilian actor who ignites in her a flame of lust she can''t ignore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Gq1e0OC7r6L4V5dJaLgANk09xl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18538'),
  ('290083710688349753', 'Dots', 1940, 'Animation', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'An experimental film in which both sound and visuals were created entirely by Norman McLaren drawing directly upon the film with ordinary pen and ink. The main title is in eight languages. Rereleased with multilingual titles in 1949.', 'An experimental film in which both sound and visuals were created entirely by Norman McLaren drawing directly upon the film with ordinary pen and ink. The main title is in eight languages. Rereleased with multilingual titles in 1949.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isMonuYGbpcIxti2Mh1RzM9QuNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104398'),
  ('465758797332949060', 'Dottie Gets Spanked', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Todd Haynes, Maryse Alberti', 'Todd Haynes', 'J. Evan Bonifant, Barbara Garrick, Julie Halston, Robert Pall, Harriet Sansom Harris, Irving Metzman, Ashley Chapman, Rhea Silver-Smith', null, 'A six-year-old boy in pre-hippie 1960s United States endures ridicule from his schoolmates and worry from his father over his fixation with a TV star named Dottie.', 'A six-year-old boy in pre-hippie 1960s United States endures ridicule from his schoolmates and worry from his father over his fixation with a TV star named Dottie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bzYMppHUTj6UlMxPz7W1TMSDUP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148033'),
  ('576675786434151275', 'Dou kyu sei – Classmates', 2016, 'Romance, Animation', 'Akemi Hayashi, Shoko Nakamura, Akemi Hayashi', 'Asumiko Nakamura', 'Kenji Nojima, Hiroshi Kamiya, Hideo Ishikawa, Yurino', 'PG-13', 'Rihito Sajo, an honor student with a perfect score on the entrance exam and Hikaru Kusakabe, in a band and popular among girls, would have never crossed paths. Until one day they started talking at the practice for their school’s upcoming chorus festival. After school, the two meet regularly, as Hikaru helps Rihito to improve his singing skills. While they listen to each other’s voice and harmonize, their hearts start to beat together.', 'Rihito Sajo, an honor student with a perfect score on the entrance exam and Hikaru Kusakabe, in a band and popular among girls, would have never crossed paths. Until one day they started talking at the practice for their school’s upcoming chorus festival. After school, the two meet regularly, as Hikaru helps Rihito to improve his singing skills. While they listen to each other’s voice and harmonize, their hearts start to beat together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIfRCA5wEvj9tApca4UDUagQEiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372754'),
  ('870800352706212864', 'Double Agent', 2003, 'Thriller, Action', 'Kim Hyeon-jeong', 'Shim Hye-weon', 'Han Suk-kyu, Ko So-young, Cheon Ho-jin, Song Jae-ho, Jiří Datel Novotný, Lee Hwan-jun, Ryu Seung-su, Lee Byung-wook', null, 'A North Korean diplomat defects to the South during the Cold War, but the South Koreans have their suspicions as to whether he is an actual defector or a double agent.', 'A North Korean diplomat defects to the South during the Cold War, but the South Koreans have their suspicions as to whether he is an actual defector or a double agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejR2tyFpl2QOCgX8wpcVX4nnTB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122528'),
  ('593009678903046658', 'Double Agent 73', 1974, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Doris Wishman, Nuri Habib', 'Doris Wishman', 'Chesty Morgan, Frank Silvano, Saul Meth, Jill Harris, Louis Burdi, Peter Savage, Buck Starr, Joseph Chiaro', 'R', 'Underworld drug king Toplar is flooding the market with low-grade heroin. Agent 99 gets a bit too close to the truth, but manages to gasp out a clue as to Toplar''s identity. Jane (Agent 73) is called in, and gets a camera implanted in her breast in order to photograph the bad guys she dispatches so headquarters will be able to identify Toplar when she finds him.', 'Underworld drug king Toplar is flooding the market with low-grade heroin. Agent 99 gets a bit too close to the truth, but manages to gasp out a clue as to Toplar''s identity. Jane (Agent 73) is called in, and gets a camera implanted in her breast in order to photograph the bad guys she dispatches so headquarters will be able to identify Toplar when she finds him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNPvzesRWZ3iMCSveUr76zadB0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37043'),
  ('76790478895565944', 'Double Blind', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ian Hunt-Duffy, Narayan Van Maele, Mitzi Smishkewych-Kosovske', 'Darach McGarrigle', 'Millie Brady, Pollyanna McIntosh, Akshay Kumar, Diarmuid Noyes, Brenock O''Connor, Abby Fitz, Shonagh Marie, Frank Blake', null, 'After an experimental drug trial goes awry, the test subjects face a terrifying side effect: if you fall asleep you die. Trapped in an isolated facility, panic ensues as they try to escape and somehow stay awake.', 'After an experimental drug trial goes awry, the test subjects face a terrifying side effect: if you fall asleep you die. Trapped in an isolated facility, panic ensues as they try to escape and somehow stay awake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JG4otyEyfTSECOq8VkFRdAA01M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140648'),
  ('298876328360965529', 'Double Confession', 1950, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Ken Annakin, Pat Kelly, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'William Templeton', 'Derek Farr, Joan Hopkins, Peter Lorre, William Hartnell, Naunton Wayne, Ronald Howard, Kathleen Harrison, Leslie Dwyer', 'NR', 'The hero discovers his estranged wife dead and tries to frame her lover for the murder. He becomes involved with the criminals who make various unsuccessful attempts on his life while the police clear up the mystery.', 'The hero discovers his estranged wife dead and tries to frame her lover for the murder. He becomes involved with the criminals who make various unsuccessful attempts on his life while the police clear up the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p78tF1evuzNBDk14Rqgb5qFMliE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36339'),
  ('224378281558500871', 'Double Cross', 1994, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Keusch, Tobias A. Schliessler', 'Henry C. Parke', 'Patrick Bergin, Kelly Preston, Jennifer Tilly, Matt Craven, Kevin Tighe, Sharlene Martin, Philip Maurice Hayes, L. Harvey Gold', 'R', 'A chance encounter with a blonde in a sports car causes Jack to give chase in his souped up mustang and culminates in a car crash and a sexual encounter. The blonde asks that he sign that the accident was really her husband''s fault, who was not even present, for insurance issues. Jack agrees and finds himself the alibi for murder and with his own past criminal record, he fears jail for lying under oath.', 'A chance encounter with a blonde in a sports car causes Jack to give chase in his souped up mustang and culminates in a car crash and a sexual encounter. The blonde asks that he sign that the accident was really her husband''s fault, who was not even present, for insurance issues. Jack agrees and finds himself the alibi for murder and with his own past criminal record, he fears jail for lying under oath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49U1NpepMj4rra9xifeTffTmGyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79121'),
  ('906489610265581876', 'Double Dad', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'José Roberto Eliezer, Cris D''amato', 'Renato Fagundes, Thalita Rebouças, Thalita Rebouças', 'Maisa Silva, Eduardo Moscovis, Marcelo Médici, Fafá de Belém, Thaynara OG, Rayana Diniz, Caio Vegatti, Pedro Ottoni', 'NR', 'While her mom is away, a teen sneaks out of the hippie commune where she lives and embarks on a life-changing adventure to discover who her father is.', 'While her mom is away, a teen sneaks out of the hippie commune where she lives and embarks on a life-changing adventure to discover who her father is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oO0eRoCtA8pDV67VRpGeXBhtxH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773998'),
  ('773492284073960860', 'Double Daddy', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Lee Friedlander, Daniel Ringey, Cricket Peters', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Mollee Gray, Brittany Curran, Cameron Palatas, Maeve Quinlan, René Ashton, Boyd Kestner, Lucy Sheftall, Robert Curtis Brown', null, 'A teen''s life turns upside down when her boyfriend impregnates both her and a new student at school.', 'A teen''s life turns upside down when her boyfriend impregnates both her and a new student at school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRCy7Db1mbtGhZGSxlyW3oTJJTb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345054'),
  ('592440474990188002', 'Double Dare', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Amanda Micheli, Amanda Micheli', null, 'Jeannie Epper, Zoë Bell, Lucy Lawless, Lynda Carter, Steven Spielberg, Quentin Tarantino, Eurlyne Epper, Ken Howard', 'NR', 'With being thrown off buildings an occupational hazard, professional stuntwomen Jeannie Epper and Zoë Bell (the alter egos of Wonder Woman and Xena, respectively) would seem well-equipped for any challenges Hollywood might dish out. But finding roles -- and respect -- in a male-dominated field can prove more harrowing than dodging punches.', 'With being thrown off buildings an occupational hazard, professional stuntwomen Jeannie Epper and Zoë Bell (the alter egos of Wonder Woman and Xena, respectively) would seem well-equipped for any challenges Hollywood might dish out. But finding roles -- and respect -- in a male-dominated field can prove more harrowing than dodging punches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1o0DIK6vCuNwrgmvOlwrZG0OZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19416'),
  ('748677208392803816', 'Double Date', 2017, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Benjamin Barfoot, Laura Bellingham', 'Danny Morgan', 'Danny Morgan, Michael Socha, Kelly Wenham, Georgia Groome, Dougie Poynter, Brooke Norbury, Dexter Fletcher, James Swanton', null, 'Meet innocent Jim, terrified of girls, and on a reluctant quest to prove his manhood the night before he turns 30. He and his cocky friend Alex think they’ve hit the jackpot when they meet the beautiful siblings Kitty and Lulu, who seem up for anything on a wild party-fuelled night. But little do they know that the femmes fatales want to make Jim lose much more than just his virginity… Getting laid has never been so bloody difficult.', 'Meet innocent Jim, terrified of girls, and on a reluctant quest to prove his manhood the night before he turns 30. He and his cocky friend Alex think they’ve hit the jackpot when they meet the beautiful siblings Kitty and Lulu, who seem up for anything on a wild party-fuelled night. But little do they know that the femmes fatales want to make Jim lose much more than just his virginity… Getting laid has never been so bloody difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1u51B2HsJRHb38dG5eajgc9uGUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434080'),
  ('27630130644289267', 'Double Dhamaal', 2011, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Indra Kumar, Aseem Bajaj, Shahid Hasan', 'Tushar Hiranandani', 'Riteish Deshmukh, Arshad Warsi, Javed Jaffrey, Aashish Chaudhary, Sanjay Dutt, Mallika Sherawat, Kangana Ranaut, Satish Kaushik', null, 'Four slackers decide to avenge their humiliation at the hands of a con-man.', 'Four slackers decide to avenge their humiliation at the hands of a con-man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysGYrjeAdIXZULLVdGzwliqGHyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68029'),
  ('1021694337200824288', 'Double Door', 1934, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Charles Vidor, Harry Fischbeck', 'Elizabeth A. McFadden', 'Evelyn Venable, Mary Morris, Anne Revere, Kent Taylor, Guy Standing, Colin Tapley, Virginia Howell, Halliwell Hobbes', 'NR', 'In 1910 Manhattan, Victoria Van Brett, a bitter spinster heiress lives an isolated life with her sister Caroline. Her domineering urges go into overdrive when their half-brother Rip brings a new bride home to the family’s gloomy Fifth Avenue mansion, built by their late industrialist father. The title refers to a secret soundproofed chamber that the villainess uses to entrap her enemies.', 'In 1910 Manhattan, Victoria Van Brett, a bitter spinster heiress lives an isolated life with her sister Caroline. Her domineering urges go into overdrive when their half-brother Rip brings a new bride home to the family’s gloomy Fifth Avenue mansion, built by their late industrialist father. The title refers to a secret soundproofed chamber that the villainess uses to entrap her enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47pnQENUOsh1dE8FPru9c1IfRoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222700'),
  ('512091120677602539', 'Double Double Trouble', 2026, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Gabriel Correa', 'Sarah Jones', 'Tami Roman, Colin Lawrence, Hamza Fouad, Akeem Hoyte-Charles, Devon Alexander', 'Not Rated', 'Reeling from a devastating miscarriage and the collapse of her marriage, Drea struggles to rebuild her life when her identical twin sister Ali finds love with Ryan, a man who represents everything Drea believes she''s lost.', 'Reeling from a devastating miscarriage and the collapse of her marriage, Drea struggles to rebuild her life when her identical twin sister Ali finds love with Ryan, a man who represents everything Drea believes she''s lost.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F638eREiG0GaTRbv1D0SYai3lEcx.jpg', 'plex:movie:double-double-trouble'),
  ('172827269320669541', 'Double Down', 2005, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Neil Breen', 'Neil Breen', 'Neil Breen, Mike Brady, Robert DiFrancesco, Bonnie Carmalt, George Kerr, Maynard Mahler, Rose Mahler, Bernadette Baca', 'NR', 'An edgy action thriller set in Las Vegas during a terrorist attack. A genius computer loner takes control of the city and the attack as he fights with his fits of overwhelming depression and obsessions with love and death.', 'An edgy action thriller set in Las Vegas during a terrorist attack. A genius computer loner takes control of the city and the attack as he fights with his fits of overwhelming depression and obsessions with love and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJ6byvS4Al8BMQ93Wc46LDbVZN2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260928'),
  ('138140346977568335', 'Double Dragon', 1994, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Gary B. Kibbe, James Yukich, Robert M. Williams Jr.', 'Michael Davis, Peter Gould', 'Mark Dacascos, Scott Wolf, Robert Patrick, Kristina Wagner, Julia Nickson, Alyssa Milano, Vanna White, Nils Allen Stewart', 'PG-13', 'Two brothers have half of a powerful ancient Chinese talisman. An evil gang leader has the other half, and determines to get the brothers'' half and have a complete medallion so he can gain absolute power.', 'Two brothers have half of a powerful ancient Chinese talisman. An evil gang leader has the other half, and determines to get the brothers'' half and have a complete medallion so he can gain absolute power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZTYSD8ZesYMKqLRbmVfZUW1FiE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2436'),
  ('1105045025129769899', 'Double Dribble', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'A basketball game of Goofs (P.U. vs. U.U.) in which the players play furiously, often breaking the rules of the game. All of the players are named after Disney artists.', 'A basketball game of Goofs (P.U. vs. U.U.) in which the players play furiously, often breaking the rules of the game. All of the players are named after Disney artists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGO5ZsLS4RQApdjG2qAcUDn8cOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66850'),
  ('664903766400875230', 'Double Dynamite', 1951, 'Comedy, Adventure, Music, Romance', 'Irving Cummings, Robert De Grasse, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Melville Shavelson', 'Jane Russell, Groucho Marx, Frank Sinatra, Don McGuire, Howard Freeman, Nestor Paiva, Frank Orth, Harry Hayden', 'NR', 'An innocent bank teller, suspected of embezzlement, is aided by an eccentric, wisecracking waiter.', 'An innocent bank teller, suspected of embezzlement, is aided by an eccentric, wisecracking waiter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eC78JPGLhE64F6q9hG1VR6zbFTa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84397'),
  ('818060324306772709', 'Double Exposure', 1982, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'William Byron Hillman', 'William Byron Hillman', 'Michael Callan, Joanna Pettet, James Stacy, Pamela Hensley, Cleavon Little, Seymour Cassel, Robert Tessier, David Young', null, 'A photographer for a men''s magazine is haunted by disturbing dreams, in which he slaughters his models. When he learns that these models are dying in real life as they did in his dreams, he begins to go insane.', 'A photographer for a men''s magazine is haunted by disturbing dreams, in which he slaughters his models. When he learns that these models are dying in real life as they did in his dreams, he begins to go insane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98hp4WtJPmfRCO7h7TySBstjnVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54868'),
  ('649897374950418743', 'Double Face', 1969, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Gábor Pogány, Riccardo Freda', 'Paul Hengge, Riccardo Freda', 'Klaus Kinski, Christiane Krüger, Günther Stoll, Annabella Incontrera, Margaret Lee, Sydney Chaplin, Barbara Nelli, Ignazio Dolce', null, 'After a businessman''s unfaithful wife is seemingly killed in a car accident, he is led by several unscrupulous characters to believe that she is actually alive.', 'After a businessman''s unfaithful wife is seemingly killed in a car accident, he is led by several unscrupulous characters to believe that she is actually alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5F6lgRBQTvqDZWuJHd52NTNXYE2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133941'),
  ('1032793412455530411', 'Double Feature', 1984, 'Drama', 'José Luis Garci, Manuel Rojas, Roberto Bodegas', 'Horacio Valcárcel, José Luis Garci', 'Adolfo Marsillach, Jesús Puente, María Casanova, José Bódalo, Encarna Paso, Emma Suárez, Rafael Hernández, Juan Calot', null, 'Director José Luis Garci has turned his camera inward on filmmakers and screenwriters to portray them as so self-absorbed in the creative process that there is no other world, no other human relationship that can compete. As José (Adolfo Marsillach) and Federico (Jesus Puente) work together on a new screenplay, their interactions with their family (José''s teen daughters, Federico''s wife) disappear under the all-consuming task of creation. The daughters give up and go off on their own, and the wife joins a convent while Federico barely notices. And when the producer is interrupted by profound grief at the sudden death of his older son, he almost automatically returns to thinking about the film project when the funeral has ended. Garci honors many great directors at the beginning of this film, and the film continues to play out as an elaboration on this homage -- an illustration both of the dedication and the cost of filmmaking, no judgments given.', 'Director José Luis Garci has turned his camera inward on filmmakers and screenwriters to portray them as so self-absorbed in the creative process that there is no other world, no other human relationship that can compete. As José (Adolfo Marsillach) and Federico (Jesus Puente) work together on a new screenplay, their interactions with their family (José''s teen daughters, Federico''s wife) disappear under the all-consuming task of creation. The daughters give up and go off on their own, and the wife joins a convent while Federico barely notices. And when the producer is interrupted by profound grief at the sudden death of his older son, he almost automatically returns to thinking about the film project when the funeral has ended. Garci honors many great directors at the beginning of this film, and the film continues to play out as an elaboration on this homage -- an illustration both of the dedication and the cost of filmmaking, no judgments given.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewN1nhOAcAEKUwugdgGlTf4gJ8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202787'),
  ('980572373602327788', 'Double Gentlemen', 1986, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-François Stévenin, Pascal Marti, Darius Khondji', 'Bruno Nuytten, Jackie Berroyer, Jean-François Stévenin', 'Jean-François Stévenin, Yves Afonso, Carole Bouquet, Jean-Pierre Kohut-Svelko, Serge Valézy, Pierre Edelman, Brigitte Roüan, Jacqueline Dane', null, 'In a routine look at what it means to finally leave adolescence behind — even in one’s mature years — this series of mood swings and sequences focuses on two grown men. Francois (Jean Francois Stevenin, the director) and Leo (Yves Alonso) are old friends, and at one point they decide to go out and search for one of their childhood buddies, the brunt of several of their practical jokes. In true form, the men opt for playing yet another practical joke on their friend, but their plans backfire when his wife Helene (Carole Bouquet) comes into the picture instead. Her presence forces them to reconsider their shenanigans in a new light.', 'In a routine look at what it means to finally leave adolescence behind — even in one’s mature years — this series of mood swings and sequences focuses on two grown men. Francois (Jean Francois Stevenin, the director) and Leo (Yves Alonso) are old friends, and at one point they decide to go out and search for one of their childhood buddies, the brunt of several of their practical jokes. In true form, the men opt for playing yet another practical joke on their friend, but their plans backfire when his wife Helene (Carole Bouquet) comes into the picture instead. Her presence forces them to reconsider their shenanigans in a new light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLxSLZmMJA8mrsOBrwOoXCkyT48.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63982'),
  ('633977277711084975', 'Double Happiness', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Peter Wunstorf, Mina Shum', 'Mina Shum', 'Sandra Oh, Stephen Chang, Alannah Ong, Frances You, Donald Fong, Callum Keith Rennie, Claudette Carracedo, Gene Kiniski', null, 'Jade Li is a feisty, 20-something Chinese Canadian, trying to achieve that happy medium between giving in to her parent''s wishes and fulfilling her own needs and desires - double happiness. Naturally, something''s got to give and when love beckons in the shape of Mark, a white university student, the facade of the perfect Chinese daughter begins to slip.', 'Jade Li is a feisty, 20-something Chinese Canadian, trying to achieve that happy medium between giving in to her parent''s wishes and fulfilling her own needs and desires - double happiness. Naturally, something''s got to give and when love beckons in the shape of Mark, a white university student, the facade of the perfect Chinese daughter begins to slip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sbnCdiFoZLe4G27ERS7wtj1lCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60855'),
  ('135785032610131840', 'Double Harness', 1933, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Cromwell, J. Roy Hunt, Doran Cox', 'Jane Murfin', 'Ann Harding, William Powell, Lucile Browne, Henry Stephenson, Lilian Bond, George Meeker, Reginald Owen, Kay Hammond', null, 'After tricking him into marriage, a woman tries to win the love of her philandering husband.', 'After tricking him into marriage, a woman tries to win the love of her philandering husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDVebENmmToW4duHrWKO7id3uMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175027'),
  ('1018541838216297796', 'Double Identity', 2009, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Dennis Dimster, Lorenzo Senatore, Simeon Asenov', 'Zvia Dimbort, Dennis Dimster', 'Val Kilmer, Izabella Miko, Hristo Shopov, Raicho Vasilev, Didem Erol, Shelly Varod, Valentine Pelka, Zahari Baharov', null, 'In Chechnya, an American doctor takes a detour in life when he helps a mysterious woman escape from her would-be assailant.', 'In Chechnya, an American doctor takes a detour in life when he helps a mysterious woman escape from her would-be assailant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9jumrbylMill1LOllH5UBwu0BS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31453'),
  ('1124527432444051003', 'Double Impact', 1991, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Vic Armstrong, John Cheung Ng-Long, Sheldon Lettich', 'Sheldon Lettich, Jean-Claude Van Damme', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Geoffrey Lewis, Alonna Shaw, Bolo Yeung, Cory Everson, Philip Chan Yan-Kin, Alan Scarfe, Andy Armstrong', 'R', 'Jean Claude Van Damme plays a dual role as Alex and Chad, twins separated at the death of their parents. Chad is raised by a family retainer in Paris, Alex becomes a petty crook in Hong Kong. Seeing a picture of Alex, Chad rejoins him and convinces him that his rival in Hong Kong is also the man who killed their parents. Alex is suspicious of Chad, especially when it comes to his girlfriend.', 'Jean Claude Van Damme plays a dual role as Alex and Chad, twins separated at the death of their parents. Chad is raised by a family retainer in Paris, Alex becomes a petty crook in Hong Kong. Seeing a picture of Alex, Chad rejoins him and convinces him that his rival in Hong Kong is also the man who killed their parents. Alex is suspicious of Chad, especially when it comes to his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmzwvSqoMC37Tgqwj4mA2dHNSmw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9594'),
  ('884532525240140105', 'Double Indemnity', 1973, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jack Smight, David S. Hall, Haskell B. Boggs', 'Raymond Chandler, Billy Wilder', 'Richard Crenna, Lee J. Cobb, Samantha Eggar, Robert Webber, Arch Johnson, Kathleen Cody, John Fiedler, John Elerick', 'PG', 'A scheming wife lures an insurance investigator into helping murder her husband and then declare it an accident. The investigator''s boss, not knowing his man is involved in it, suspects murder and sets out to prove it.', 'A scheming wife lures an insurance investigator into helping murder her husband and then declare it an accident. The investigator''s boss, not knowing his man is involved in it, suspects murder and sets out to prove it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsXRfLELPxBo3T4osRSc4YijHlt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84834'),
  ('792078045743663068', 'Double Jeopardy', 1955, 'Crime', 'R.G. Springsteen, John L. Russell, Bartlett A. Carré', 'Don Martin', 'Rod Cameron, Gale Robbins, Allison Hayes, Jack Kelly, John Litel, Robert Armstrong, John Gallaudet, Robert Nelson', 'NR', 'Marc Hill is the attorney for Emmet Devrey, a real estate developer with a past, who is being blackmailed by his former partner Sam Baggett. When Sam''s unfaithful wife Marge cooks up a scheme with her used car salesman lover Jeff Calder to bilk both Devrey and her alcoholic husband, Sam is killed and Devrey is accused of the crime. Mark is called to prove his employers innocence.', 'Marc Hill is the attorney for Emmet Devrey, a real estate developer with a past, who is being blackmailed by his former partner Sam Baggett. When Sam''s unfaithful wife Marge cooks up a scheme with her used car salesman lover Jeff Calder to bilk both Devrey and her alcoholic husband, Sam is killed and Devrey is accused of the crime. Mark is called to prove his employers innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7IGjMykkRlOcdS5kub4vt1CK7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29624'),
  ('237728777433390214', 'Double Jeopardy', 1992, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Lawrence Schiller, Joseph Paul Moore, Robert Carmichael', null, 'Rachel Ward, Bruce Boxleitner, Sela Ward, Denice Duff, Tom Everett, Aaron Eckhart, Sally Kirkland, Jay Patterson', null, 'When his lover is accused of murder, a Salt Lake City family man is her eyewitness and his wife is her attorney.', 'When his lover is accused of murder, a Salt Lake City family man is her eyewitness and his wife is her attorney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9PaPWQgh5Pf5eIJjoxSq8oaHusV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75836'),
  ('219633294431815107', 'Double Jeopardy', 1996, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Ron Orieux, Deborah Dalton', 'Deborah Dalton', 'Joe Penny, Brittany Murphy, Teri Garr, Shawn Hatosy, Rutanya Alda, Ken James, Frederic Forrest, Marc Donato', null, 'A naive 16 year old waitress falls for a corrupt, married police officer. When she falls pregnant, her lover plots her murder.', 'A naive 16 year old waitress falls for a corrupt, married police officer. When she falls pregnant, her lover plots her murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zn7sKnWQH8OOC3Y3Kza12p223z2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412160'),
  ('1139512711437957663', 'Double Jeopardy', 1999, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Peter James, Bruce Beresford, Andrew Neskoromny', 'David Weisberg, Douglas S. Cook', 'Ashley Judd, Tommy Lee Jones, Bruce Greenwood, Annabeth Gish, Benjamin Weir, Jay Brazeau, Roma Maffia, Davenia McFadden', 'R', 'Libby Parsons, wrongly convicted of her husband Nick''s murder, thinks he is still alive. She survives the long years in prison with two burning desires sustaining her -- finding her son and solving the mystery that destroyed her once-happy life. Standing between her and her quest, however, is her parole officer, Travis Lehman. Libby poses a challenge to the cynical officer, one that forces him to face up to his own failings while pitting him against his superior and law enforcement colleagues, as she plunges into a desperate fight for justice, survival, and revenge.', 'Libby Parsons, wrongly convicted of her husband Nick''s murder, thinks he is still alive. She survives the long years in prison with two burning desires sustaining her -- finding her son and solving the mystery that destroyed her once-happy life. Standing between her and her quest, however, is her parole officer, Travis Lehman. Libby poses a challenge to the cynical officer, one that forces him to face up to his own failings while pitting him against his superior and law enforcement colleagues, as she plunges into a desperate fight for justice, survival, and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPd9QvEeMQpgHO6iLB1LqALTZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10398'),
  ('431021007981705144', 'Double Life', 2016, 'Mystery', 'Yoshiyuki Kishi, Kôzô Natsumi', 'Yoshiyuki Kishi', 'Mugi Kadowaki, Hiroki Hasegawa, Masaki Suda, Lily Franky, Aoba Kawai, Yukiko Shinohara, Shohei Uno, Yukino Kishii', null, 'Tama is a graduate student. She lives with her boyfriend Takuya. She becomes influenced by lectures about French writer Sophie Calle and begins to follow her neighbor Ishizaka. Tama soon discovers that her neighbor Ishizaka is having an affair. She becomes excited about discovering his secret. Her relationship with her boyfriend Takuya and her professor Shinohara changes.', 'Tama is a graduate student. She lives with her boyfriend Takuya. She becomes influenced by lectures about French writer Sophie Calle and begins to follow her neighbor Ishizaka. Tama soon discovers that her neighbor Ishizaka is having an affair. She becomes excited about discovering his secret. Her relationship with her boyfriend Takuya and her professor Shinohara changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xTUSLHgvbdKzCJ4HhAgQX8mfVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382261'),
  ('958215250650641041', 'Double Life', 2023, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Martin Wood, Pieter Stathis, Michael Alcantara', 'Michael Hurst', 'Javicia Leslie, Pascale Hutton, Vincent Gale, Niall Matter, Aaron Douglas, John Cassini, William MacDonald, Carmen Moore', 'PG-13', 'A widow finds out from her late husband''s mistress that his death was not an accident. Both women work together to unmask the truth behind the man they both loved.', 'A widow finds out from her late husband''s mistress that his death was not an accident. Both women work together to unmask the truth behind the man they both loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fn0EHiPtbVJ0aH74rRVnWfq6p6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1036347'),
  ('485606766406347933', 'Double Lover', 2017, 'Romance, Thriller, Drama', 'François Ozon, Manuel Dacosse', 'Philippe Piazzo', 'Marine Vacth, Jérémie Renier, Jacqueline Bisset, Myriam Boyer, Dominique Reymond, Fanny Sage, Jean-Édouard Bodziak, Antoine de La Morinerie', 'NR', 'Chloé, a fragile young woman, falls in love with her psychoanalyst, Paul. A few months later she moves in with him, but soon discovers that her lover is concealing a part of his identity.', 'Chloé, a fragile young woman, falls in love with her psychoanalyst, Paul. A few months later she moves in with him, but soon discovers that her lover is concealing a part of his identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1KEFLE8cthmuXs0ESxfwbcziN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451955'),
  ('589833720692281144', 'Double Mints', 2017, 'Romance', 'Eiji Uchida', 'Asumiko Nakamura', 'Yasushi Fuchikami, Shunsuke Tanaka, Shunpei Kawagoshi, Kenta Suga, Ami Tomite, Kazuya Takahashi, Shigemitsu Ogi, Wataru Ichinose', 'NR', 'Mitsuo Ichikawa reconnects with his former schoolmate and mentor, only to discover he''s a thug and a murderer. Instead of distancing themselves, they forge a new alliance.', 'Mitsuo Ichikawa reconnects with his former schoolmate and mentor, only to discover he''s a thug and a murderer. Instead of distancing themselves, they forge a new alliance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euKnqGsxzPDx6gEgIWryi5YGNJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434015'),
