  ('442964599449821246', 'Double Patty', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Shin Hyun-kyu, Kang Ji-hyeon, Paek Seung-hwan', 'Paek Seung-hwan', 'IRENE, Shin Seung-ho, Jeong Young-ju, Jo Dal-hwan, Song Yong-sik, Song Ji-in, Yoo Byeong-hun, Paek Seung-hwan', null, 'Kang Woo-ram is busy preparing to get a job. Lee Hyun-ji is a would-be anchor, but she works at a homemade hamburger restaurant. One night, Woo-ram visits the hamburger restaurant and orders a double patty hamburger, which has a "buy one, get one free" sale. This is how their relationship begins.', 'Kang Woo-ram is busy preparing to get a job. Lee Hyun-ji is a would-be anchor, but she works at a homemade hamburger restaurant. One night, Woo-ram visits the hamburger restaurant and orders a double patty hamburger, which has a "buy one, get one free" sale. This is how their relationship begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRV7eLTiQefmJ6eYYtpypFP4lAS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727551'),
