  ('605032253703503125', 'Double Tap', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Lo Chi-Leung, Thomas Chow Wai-Kwan, Henry Ng Hin-Wing', 'Yeung Chin-Hung, Clarence Lee, Lo Chi-Leung', 'Leslie Cheung, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Ruby Wong Cheuk-Ling, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Monica Chan Fat-Yung, Joseph Cheung Man-Kwong, Henry Fong Ping, Alexander Chan Mong-Wah', null, 'Rick Pang, an IPSC champion who is also a gun expert who tinkers with his pistols to perfect his technique known as ''double tap'' which is the terminology where a shooter can place two exact shots in the same spot to maximize marksmanship.', 'Rick Pang, an IPSC champion who is also a gun expert who tinkers with his pistols to perfect his technique known as ''double tap'' which is the terminology where a shooter can place two exact shots in the same spot to maximize marksmanship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVyN43Q3qZaj9HwkyktKWveFmrH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127849'),
