  ('1113846145923707169', 'Double Team', 1997, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Tsui Hark, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Charlie Picerni', 'Don Jakoby, Paul Mones', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Dennis Rodman, Mickey Rourke, Paul Freeman, Natacha Lindinger, Valéria Cavalli, Jay Benedict, Bruno Bilotta', 'R', 'A CIA agent is interned for failing to kill an international terrorist. Escaping from his island exile, he teams up with a flamboyant arms dealer and sets out to find the terrorist and rescue the agent''s family. Together they''re a two-man arsenal... with enough voltage to rock the free world.', 'A CIA agent is interned for failing to kill an international terrorist. Escaping from his island exile, he teams up with a flamboyant arms dealer and sets out to find the terrorist and rescue the agent''s family. Together they''re a two-man arsenal... with enough voltage to rock the free world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUzF2S15iX4Hn6ikbFX1YP3SDEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9405'),
  ('459645844893100366', 'Double Teamed!', 2002, 'TV Movie, Drama, Family', 'Duwayne Dunham, Matias Alvarez, Miriam Footer', 'John Wierick', 'Poppi Monroe, Annie McElwain, Teal Redmann, Nick Searcy, Tanya Shanti Goott, Joey Miyashima, Mackenzie Phillips, Chris Olivero', 'G', 'Heather and Heidi play volleyball for their school team, when their family decides that they need to go to a bigger school so that they will have a better chance for scholarships. But at the new school, the twins are discovered by the basketball coach. Inspired by the true story of Heather and Heidi Burge.', 'Heather and Heidi play volleyball for their school team, when their family decides that they need to go to a bigger school so that they will have a better chance for scholarships. But at the new school, the twins are discovered by the basketball coach. Inspired by the true story of Heather and Heidi Burge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9oSHI9ivzgkvY5r5uj08iCualJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108204'),
  ('773917217354379562', 'Double Threat', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Joel Layogan, Shane Stanley, Karen Ross', 'CJ Walley', 'Danielle Chuchran, Matthew Lawrence, Kevin Joy, Mo Gallini, Dawn Olivieri, Andrea Logan White, Aimey Beer, Dmitriy Karas', 'PG-13', 'With ruthless mobsters on her tail, a young woman with a split personality becomes entangled with a man on a pilgrimage across the country to scatter his brother''s ashes.', 'With ruthless mobsters on her tail, a young woman with a split personality becomes entangled with a man on a pilgrimage across the country to scatter his brother''s ashes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Z9KqbOA8WbInbmB0TsO62L7QIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:981848'),
