  ('871281598483089104', 'Double Trouble', 1992, 'Action, Comedy', 'John Paragon, Alex Mendes, Jack S. Krevoy', 'Kurt Wimmer, Charles Osburn', 'Peter Paul, David Paul, Roddy McDowall, David Carradine, Steve Kanaly, Troy Donahue, A.J. Johnson, Bill Mumy', 'R', 'Two beefed-up twins operating on opposing sides of the law, team up to stop a nefarious crook in this actioner. Peter Jade is a notoriously arrogant burglar who ends up with the key to an enormous underground cache of diamonds. David Jade is a cop who joins forces with Peter after greedy Philip Chamberlain, wanting the diamonds for himself, kills David''s partner', 'Two beefed-up twins operating on opposing sides of the law, team up to stop a nefarious crook in this actioner. Peter Jade is a notoriously arrogant burglar who ends up with the key to an enormous underground cache of diamonds. David Jade is a cop who joins forces with Peter after greedy Philip Chamberlain, wanting the diamonds for himself, kills David''s partner', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9Q0zxjCPBS84y2akpowbnNcnOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88107'),
  ('41088512831686632', 'Double Vision', 2002, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Chen Kuofu, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Tony Leung Siu-Hung', 'Chen Kuofu, Su Chaobin', 'Tony Leung Ka-fai, René Liu, David Morse, Leon Dai, Yang Kuei-mei, Lung Sihung, Brett Climo, Wei-Han Huang', null, 'An FBI Agent pairs with a troubled Taiwan cop to hunt for a serial killer who''s embedding a mysterious fungus in the brains of victims.', 'An FBI Agent pairs with a troubled Taiwan cop to hunt for a serial killer who''s embedding a mysterious fungus in the brains of victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djoTRFqiVTwfsbbmYrJCeNvwlTa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57100'),
