  ('934544309135212518', 'Double Wedding', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Thorpe, Joseph C. Wright, Edwin B. Willis', 'Jo Swerling', 'William Powell, Myrna Loy, Florence Rice, John Beal, Jessie Ralph, Edgar Kennedy, Sidney Toler, Mary Gordon', 'NR', 'A bohemian free spirit helps meek Waldo win back his fiancée and falls in love with her over-controlling sister in the process.', 'A bohemian free spirit helps meek Waldo win back his fiancée and falls in love with her over-controlling sister in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76A4FIQuX4gbKVUDtVHkKvcTunY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20642'),
  ('940849631778593324', 'Double Whammy', 2001, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Tom DiCillo, Stephen Wertimer, Lisa M. Rowe', 'Tom DiCillo', 'Denis Leary, Elizabeth Hurley, Luis Guzmán, Victor Argo, Chris Noth, Donald Faison, Keith Nobbs, Steve Buscemi', 'R', 'Ray Pluto has many problems. He is satirized in the tabloids as the "loser cop." His partner is starting to seem suspiciously attracted to him. A pair of screenwriters across the hall keep bugging him for help. The superintendent of his building is stabbed by hoodlums hired by his own rebellious daughter. To top it off, a sexually aggressive chiropractor may just be Ray''s undoing.', 'Ray Pluto has many problems. He is satirized in the tabloids as the "loser cop." His partner is starting to seem suspiciously attracted to him. A pair of screenwriters across the hall keep bugging him for help. The superintendent of his building is stabbed by hoodlums hired by his own rebellious daughter. To top it off, a sexually aggressive chiropractor may just be Ray''s undoing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvyjEU4VEhAtnOxjC9NaTtiPXlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14390'),
  ('3653958572526776', 'Double Whoopee', 1929, 'Comedy', 'Lewis R. Foster', 'H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Jean Harlow, Ed Brandenburg, William Gillespie, Charlie Hall, Ham Kinsey, Sam Lufkin', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie wreak havoc at an upper class hotel in their jobs as footman (Hardy) and doorman (Laurel). They partially undress blonde bombshell Jean Harlow (in a brief appearance) and repeatedly escort a stuffy nobleman into an empty elevator shaft.', 'Stan and Ollie wreak havoc at an upper class hotel in their jobs as footman (Hardy) and doorman (Laurel). They partially undress blonde bombshell Jean Harlow (in a brief appearance) and repeatedly escort a stuffy nobleman into an empty elevator shaft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc4DLcLwAOyof2CRvBJk9q1N6li.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48815'),
  ('1128814896251533103', 'Double World', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Wang Feng, Stephen Tung Wai, Teddy Chan', 'Liu Fendou, Wen Ning', 'Henry Lau, Peter Ho, Lin Chenhan, Jiang Luxia, Lo Chung-Him, Hu Ming, Tiger Xu, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam', 'PG-13', 'Keen to bring honor to his clan, young villager Dong Yilong embarks on a perilous journey to compete in a tournament that selects warriors for battle.', 'Keen to bring honor to his clan, young villager Dong Yilong embarks on a perilous journey to compete in a tournament that selects warriors for battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lv3RonWge4GlC9ymNzC0oWpFCfv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611395'),
  ('897136166499259899', 'Double XL', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Satramm Ramani, Milind Jog', 'Sasha Singh, Mudassar Aziz', 'Sonakshi Sinha, Huma Qureshi, Zaheer Iqbal, Mahat Raghavendra, Jimmy Shergill, Sachin Shroff, Shubha Khote, Kanwaljit Singh', null, 'Rajshri wants to be a sports presenter on TV but is promptly told that she is ''too healthy'' for it. Saira, a fashion designer also has hit rock bottom in her life after she is cheated on by her boyfriend. A chance encounter between the two leads them to London to discover themselves and challenge the norms of who''s a ''normal woman''.', 'Rajshri wants to be a sports presenter on TV but is promptly told that she is ''too healthy'' for it. Saira, a fashion designer also has hit rock bottom in her life after she is cheated on by her boyfriend. A chance encounter between the two leads them to London to discover themselves and challenge the norms of who''s a ''normal woman''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5pOwxgBj5M67FpiFLwOxSbJiVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915776'),
  ('32910021059041900', 'Double Xposure', 2012, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Li Yu, Florian Zinke', 'Fang Li, Li Yu', 'Fan Bingbing, William Feng, Huo Siyan, Joan Chen, Yao Anlian, Kong Wei, Liang Jing, Fang Li', null, 'When Song Qi stumbles upon her boyfriend''s affair with her best friend, her life quickly starts falling apart and she is subsequently drawn into a quicksand of revenge and murder. Though all is not as it seems and Song Qi will have to embark on a twisted journey into her past and the very depths of her own mind', 'When Song Qi stumbles upon her boyfriend''s affair with her best friend, her life quickly starts falling apart and she is subsequently drawn into a quicksand of revenge and murder. Though all is not as it seems and Song Qi will have to embark on a twisted journey into her past and the very depths of her own mind', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtR18ywuJo3KksSEdL19xc1x0Ng.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141932'),
  ('512761181048037416', 'Double zéro', 2004, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Gérard Pirès, Denis Rouden', 'Alexandre Coquelle, Matthieu Le Naour', 'Éric Judor, Ramzy Bedia, Édouard Baer, Georgianna Robertson, François Chattot, Didier Flamand, Rossy de Palma, Nino Kirtadzé', null, 'Ben and Bill are the two worst, completely useless agents - real losers. But who else would you send on a super-difficult top-secret mission? The French have just sold a new high-power M51 rocket to the Russians for crazy money. Unfortunately for them, the rocket was hijacked before they could get it of their hands. However, not just any fool is up to neutralizing this threat, but only the craziest and most stupid of them can cope with such a task.', 'Ben and Bill are the two worst, completely useless agents - real losers. But who else would you send on a super-difficult top-secret mission? The French have just sold a new high-power M51 rocket to the Russians for crazy money. Unfortunately for them, the rocket was hijacked before they could get it of their hands. However, not just any fool is up to neutralizing this threat, but only the craziest and most stupid of them can cope with such a task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCPKGHTiuxg3y7JsWfN0ScoWAQ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33624'),
  ('600811977587966924', 'Double, Double, Toil and Trouble', 1993, 'Family, TV Movie, Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Stuart Margolin, Richard Leiterman', 'Jurgen Wolff', 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Cloris Leachman, Phil Fondacaro, Eric McCormack, Kelli Fox, Wayne Robson, Meshach Taylor', null, 'On Halloween night, two precocious little girls try to save their parents from their nasty old capitalist aunt''s greedy clutches. Magic abounds and they meet mysterious new friends along the way.', 'On Halloween night, two precocious little girls try to save their parents from their nasty old capitalist aunt''s greedy clutches. Magic abounds and they meet mysterious new friends along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nMrq5z9b8pADKGop7aAFk0DUtP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57789'),
  ('881736434968527630', 'Doubles Cause Troubles', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Wong Jing, Yip Wa-Sing', 'Wong Jing', 'Carol Cheng, Maggie Cheung, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee, Wilson Lam Chun-Yin, Tom Poon, Kwan Ming-Yuk, Hon Yee-Sang', null, 'Nurse Liang Shanbo and Actress Zhu Yingtai are mismatched cousins who just inherited a rental home from their late relative. When they moved in, they discover that a room has been rented out to a man named Ben, who turns out to be a criminal gangster. One night, when Ben returns home, bloodied and injured, he collapses into Yingtai''s arms and whispers a code in her ear before he dies. Not knowing what the code leads to, Yingtai and Shanbo are later visited by a man claiming to be Ben''s brother who wants to solve the case. In the meantime, gangsters believed to be involved with Ben''s murder want to retrieve the code from the girls, whom they think were told by Ben what it actually unlocks.', 'Nurse Liang Shanbo and Actress Zhu Yingtai are mismatched cousins who just inherited a rental home from their late relative. When they moved in, they discover that a room has been rented out to a man named Ben, who turns out to be a criminal gangster. One night, when Ben returns home, bloodied and injured, he collapses into Yingtai''s arms and whispers a code in her ear before he dies. Not knowing what the code leads to, Yingtai and Shanbo are later visited by a man claiming to be Ben''s brother who wants to solve the case. In the meantime, gangsters believed to be involved with Ben''s murder want to retrieve the code from the girls, whom they think were told by Ben what it actually unlocks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m34wHqqce6ysY0PoZRoX99pKD5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402216'),
  ('524978254887167245', 'Doubt', 2008, 'Drama', 'John Patrick Shanley, Roger Deakins', 'John Patrick Shanley', 'Meryl Streep, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Amy Adams, Viola Davis, Alice Drummond, Audrie Neenan, Susan Blommaert, Carrie Preston', 'PG-13', 'In 1964 Bronx, two Catholic school nuns question the new priest''s ambiguous relationship with a troubled African-American student.', 'In 1964 Bronx, two Catholic school nuns question the new priest''s ambiguous relationship with a troubled African-American student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lypT2ghNuUPYVJf66oe4fKvUqI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14359'),
  ('15986984505721630', 'Douce', 1943, 'Drama', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Fred Hérold, Philippe Agostini', 'Jean Aurenche, Pierre Bost', 'Odette Joyeux, Roger Pigaut, Madeleine Robinson, Jean Debucourt, Marguerite Moreno, Richard Francœur, Gabrielle Fontan, Louis Florencie', null, 'In Paris in 1887, Irène works as a governess to Douce, the grand-daughter of the dowager Countess de Bonafé. Douce believes she is in love with Fabien, the handsome manager of the estate. However she cannot hope to marry him because of their class difference. Douce''s widowed father, the Count de Bonafé, has a wooden leg, and is infatuated with Irène. Douce discovers that Fabien is planning to flee to Quebec with Irène, and also finds out that the Count has asked Irène to marry him. So Douce tells Fabien this and convinces him to run away with her, causing consternation in the family.', 'In Paris in 1887, Irène works as a governess to Douce, the grand-daughter of the dowager Countess de Bonafé. Douce believes she is in love with Fabien, the handsome manager of the estate. However she cannot hope to marry him because of their class difference. Douce''s widowed father, the Count de Bonafé, has a wooden leg, and is infatuated with Irène. Douce discovers that Fabien is planning to flee to Quebec with Irène, and also finds out that the Count has asked Irène to marry him. So Douce tells Fabien this and convinces him to run away with her, causing consternation in the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZrtLQZ1STNm3jW2QDZ5jaM0yNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63771'),
  ('395572381823527325', 'Doug Stanhope: No Refunds', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Milton Lage', 'Doug Stanhope', 'Doug Stanhope', null, 'Not all stand-up comedy is spot-cleaned and pre-packaged for the masses. Like the legends who were born out of smokey, booze-soaked nightclubs of decades past, Doug Stanhope spews his own brand of moral outrage in an unmatched style that borders on self-destruction. Nothing is sacred, no subject off-limits and most importantly nothing is contrived. From critically acclaimed appearances at the Ed', 'Not all stand-up comedy is spot-cleaned and pre-packaged for the masses. Like the legends who were born out of smokey, booze-soaked nightclubs of decades past, Doug Stanhope spews his own brand of moral outrage in an unmatched style that borders on self-destruction. Nothing is sacred, no subject off-limits and most importantly nothing is contrived. From critically acclaimed appearances at the Ed', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/leh2zShssPQ3M8wlIt1SPaFIFkW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18362'),
  ('473099354193147495', 'Doug''s 1st Movie', 1999, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Maurice Joyce', 'Ken Scarborough', 'Thomas McHugh, Fred Newman, Chris Phillips, Constance Shulman, Frank Welker, Doug Preis, Guy Hadley, Alice Playten', 'G', 'Doug and his pal Skeeter set''s out to find the monster of Lucky Duck Lake. Though things get really out of hand when some one blurts out that the monster is real.', 'Doug and his pal Skeeter set''s out to find the monster of Lucky Duck Lake. Though things get really out of hand when some one blurts out that the monster is real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZduJdSSWCkmvnBpNyRaIszubVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16508'),
  ('383183819845046309', 'Dougal and the Blue Cat', 1970, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Serge Danot, Serge Danot, J. Auclin', 'Jean-François Josselin, Serge Danot', 'Christian Riehl, Nadine Legrand, Paul Bisciglia, Pascale Priou, Christine Lefèvre, Denise Bourel, Jean-Luc Tardieu, Pierre Ferval', null, 'A blue cat named Buxton is found in the Magic Garden. With help from the Blue voice (played by Fenella Fielding), Buxton enters the ruins of the old treacle factory where he is crowned king after correctly identifying the colours of seven doors (coloured different shades of blue). Buxton throws all the characters of The Magic Roundabout except Dougal into prison and steals Zebedee''s magic moustache.', 'A blue cat named Buxton is found in the Magic Garden. With help from the Blue voice (played by Fenella Fielding), Buxton enters the ruins of the old treacle factory where he is crowned king after correctly identifying the colours of seven doors (coloured different shades of blue). Buxton throws all the characters of The Magic Roundabout except Dougal into prison and steals Zebedee''s magic moustache.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYb5KBDw8EhS48Momi9qZMQqMux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23055'),
  ('434319118285681535', 'Dough', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'John Goldschmidt, Peter Hannan', 'Jez Freedman', 'Jonathan Pryce, Jerome Holder, Pauline Collins, Phil Davis, Ian Hart, Malachi Kirby, Andrew Ellis, Daniel Caltagirone', null, 'An old Jewish baker struggles to keep his business afloat until his young Muslim apprentice accidentally drops cannabis in the dough and sends sales sky high.', 'An old Jewish baker struggles to keep his business afloat until his young Muslim apprentice accidentally drops cannabis in the dough and sends sales sky high.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ke8MS7oa97ScXMFHbsvWmAI5Ln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299780'),
  ('390339098156042989', 'Dough for the Do-Do', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Carl W. Stalling', 'Tedd Pierce, Warren Foster', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky Pig has an adventure in Wackyland while searching for the last Do-Do bird.', 'Porky Pig has an adventure in Wackyland while searching for the last Do-Do bird.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOzxKnmE5o2E0EpC7rIwMw0JNsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64716'),
  ('248027563402934084', 'Dough Ray Me-ow', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Arthur Davis', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Louie the Parrot finds a written will stating that his master bequeathes the family fortune not to him, but to his fellow household pet, a lunkheaded cat named Heathcliff, with the proviso that Louie is next in line to inherit the wealth if Heathcliff dies. So, Louie plots the untimely demise of Heathcliff.', 'Louie the Parrot finds a written will stating that his master bequeathes the family fortune not to him, but to his fellow household pet, a lunkheaded cat named Heathcliff, with the proviso that Louie is next in line to inherit the wealth if Heathcliff dies. So, Louie plots the untimely demise of Heathcliff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQ5sbVa0Tad89UegIpRiLO28YJM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147209'),
  ('423884549534456539', 'Dounia and the Princess of Aleppo', 2023, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'André Kadi, Marya Zarif', 'Marya Zarif', 'Rahaf Ataya, Elza Mardirossian, Manuel Tadros, Raïa Haïdar, Marya Zarif, Mohsen El Gharbi, Naïm Jeanbart, Mustapha Aramis', null, 'Forced to leave Syria because of the war, Dounia and her grandparents go in search of a new safe haven. As she traverses the world in search of asylum, Dounia draws strength from the wisdom of the ancient world, brought to light by her grandmother''s magic nigella seeds.', 'Forced to leave Syria because of the war, Dounia and her grandparents go in search of a new safe haven. As she traverses the world in search of asylum, Dounia draws strength from the wisdom of the ancient world, brought to light by her grandmother''s magic nigella seeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghbylpaqHeZcVaxxenx67jTva06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:970867'),
  ('716941500004866993', 'Doutes', 2021, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'François Hanss, Cyril Hibert, Véronique Labrid', 'Elodie Wallace, Anne-Claire Jaulin', 'Muriel Robin, Elodie Wallace, Olivier Claverie', null, 'Agnès, editor-in-chief and presenter of a successful investigative magazine, is at the peak of her career. Agnès'' personal assistant Manon urges her to deal with "sexual violence" in the next broadcast ... - A poignant chamber play (2021, directed by François Hanss) between theater and fiction.', 'Agnès, editor-in-chief and presenter of a successful investigative magazine, is at the peak of her career. Agnès'' personal assistant Manon urges her to deal with "sexual violence" in the next broadcast ... - A poignant chamber play (2021, directed by François Hanss) between theater and fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adOokXHGpU51iwkqQcCS2ehznak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890120'),
  ('283118286599514437', 'Douze hommes en colère', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Stephan Meldegg', 'Attica Guedj, Stephan Meldegg', 'Alain Doutey, François Gamard, Michel Leeb, Pierre Santini, André Thorent, Jean-Luc Porraz, Louis-Marie Audubert, Elric Thomas', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9lS5HlpVhNN3FIID6Z17r9lTIj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499137'),
  ('1144794545506745306', 'Dovbush', 2023, 'History, Drama', 'Oles Sanin, Serhiy Mykhalchuk', 'Paul Wolansky', 'Serhiy Strelnykov, Darya Plakhtiy, Rostyslav Derzhypilskyi, Oleksii Hnatkovskyi, Oleh Shulha, Dmytro Vivchariuk, Petro Zhyrun, Ivan Zhyrun', null, 'In the early eighteenth century, foreign rule means dark times for the Hutsuls of the Carpathians. The two Dovbush brothers become opryshkos - mountain outlaws. But the two brothers become enemies - one cares only about money, the other - Oleksa - fights for his people. The Carpathians are convulsed with a wave of uprisings. The aristocracy uses its military might to try to kill Dovbush and destroy his legend. But Dovbush outwits them. The desperate lords devise a devious plan and attack the invincible outlaw''s Achilles heel - his love for his childhood sweetheart, Marichka. Who will be the assassin to attack the Opryshko whose immense strength and bravery inspired folk tales? Will the lords'' treacherous plan destroy the hero before he can lead his people to freedom?', 'In the early eighteenth century, foreign rule means dark times for the Hutsuls of the Carpathians. The two Dovbush brothers become opryshkos - mountain outlaws. But the two brothers become enemies - one cares only about money, the other - Oleksa - fights for his people. The Carpathians are convulsed with a wave of uprisings. The aristocracy uses its military might to try to kill Dovbush and destroy his legend. But Dovbush outwits them. The desperate lords devise a devious plan and attack the invincible outlaw''s Achilles heel - his love for his childhood sweetheart, Marichka. Who will be the assassin to attack the Opryshko whose immense strength and bravery inspired folk tales? Will the lords'' treacherous plan destroy the hero before he can lead his people to freedom?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85HSmdR9xW0PJdnPsn8KaUfZPGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:815029'),
  ('40950682821407202', 'Dove osano le cicogne', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Fausto Brizzi', 'Fausto Brizzi, Herbert Simone Paragnani, Gianluca Belardi', 'Angelo Pintus, Marta Zoboli, Beatrice Arnera, Andrea Perroni, Tullio Solenghi, Maria Amelia Monti, Imma Piro, Antonio Catania', null, 'A couple is desperately looking to conceive a child and moves to Spain to get the help of a renowned doctor. Their plans change after they meet an apparently perfect girl that volunteers to carry on the pregnancy in their place.', 'A couple is desperately looking to conceive a child and moves to Spain to get the help of a renowned doctor. Their plans change after they meet an apparently perfect girl that volunteers to carry on the pregnancy in their place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2u0F5uo9FtyxCU5MoBSgd7vISP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1256223'),
  ('1058791432065414621', 'Dovlatov', 2018, 'Drama', 'Vladimir Golov, Evgeniya Kirpichnikova, Anna Sagalovich', 'Yuliya Tupikina, Aleksei German Jr.', 'Milan Marić, Danila Kozlovsky, Helena Sujecka, Eva Gerr, Arthur Beschastny, Anton Shagin, Svetlana Khodchenkova, Elena Lyadova', null, 'Dovlatov charts six days in the life of a brilliant, ironic writer who saw far beyond the rigid limits of 70s Soviet Russia. Sergei Dovlatov fought to preserve his own talent and decency with poet and writer Joseph Brodsky, while watching his artist friends got crushed by the iron-willed state machinery.', 'Dovlatov charts six days in the life of a brilliant, ironic writer who saw far beyond the rigid limits of 70s Soviet Russia. Sergei Dovlatov fought to preserve his own talent and decency with poet and writer Joseph Brodsky, while watching his artist friends got crushed by the iron-willed state machinery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYLev9O4YoK5vwByYcWwAdG15Xa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493655'),
  ('966988623584369186', 'Down', 2001, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Dick Maas, Marc Felperlaan', 'Dick Maas', 'James Marshall, Naomi Watts, Eric Thal, Michael Ironside, Edward Herrmann, Dan Hedaya, Ron Perlman, Kathryn Meisle', 'R', 'After the elevators at a New York City skyscraper begin inexplicably malfunctioning, putting its passengers at risk, mechanic Mark Newman and reporter Jennifer Evans begin separate investigations. Newman gets resistance from superiors at his company, which manufactured the elevator, while additional elevator incidents cause several gruesome deaths. The police get involved and suspect that terrorists are responsible, but a far stranger explanation looms.', 'After the elevators at a New York City skyscraper begin inexplicably malfunctioning, putting its passengers at risk, mechanic Mark Newman and reporter Jennifer Evans begin separate investigations. Newman gets resistance from superiors at his company, which manufactured the elevator, while additional elevator incidents cause several gruesome deaths. The police get involved and suspect that terrorists are responsible, but a far stranger explanation looms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWPmTnu1zXZO3IFGIvNLQtjOkr7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19058'),
  ('1150425408900112690', 'Down', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Daniel Stamm', 'Kent Kubena', 'Natalie Martinez, Matt Lauria, Christina Leone, Arnie Pantoja', 'NR', 'A pair of coworkers gets trapped in an elevator over a long weekend, but what at first promises to be a romantic connection turns nefarious as each party begins to reveal who they truly are.', 'A pair of coworkers gets trapped in an elevator over a long weekend, but what at first promises to be a romantic connection turns nefarious as each party begins to reveal who they truly are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWD5FXfXTRcYzXZLq0bg8hxmQrs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571055'),
  ('299751706427825469', 'Down a Dark Hall', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Fantasy, Drama', 'Susana García Díez, Rodrigo Cortés, Jarin Blaschke', 'Michael Goldbach, Chris Sparling', 'AnnaSophia Robb, Uma Thurman, Isabelle Fuhrman, Victoria Moroles, Noah Silver, Taylor Russell, Rosie Day, Rebecca Front', 'PG-13', 'Kit, a troubled girl, is sent to the exclusive Blackwood boarding school, where she discovers that only four other female students have been admitted to learn the four pillars of knowledge under the ominous wing of the mysterious headmistress Madame Duret.', 'Kit, a troubled girl, is sent to the exclusive Blackwood boarding school, where she discovers that only four other female students have been admitted to learn the four pillars of knowledge under the ominous wing of the mysterious headmistress Madame Duret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3zuws3fT9zC7s8LILqEY9smjN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421792'),
  ('552399394524418441', 'Down and Out in America', 1986, 'Documentary, History', 'Tom Hurwitz, Lee Grant, Joseph Feury', null, 'Lee Grant', null, 'The recession of the 1980s split the country into the haves and have-nots, from family farmers to factory workers and homeless people forced to live in decrepit welfare hotels. On the verge of losing everything, courageous Americans discover the power of community organizing to fight injustice.', 'The recession of the 1980s split the country into the haves and have-nots, from family farmers to factory workers and homeless people forced to live in decrepit welfare hotels. On the verge of losing everything, courageous Americans discover the power of community organizing to fight injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iWdjpovH391tfyve80xOsoh5cS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114522'),
  ('362821655098230613', 'Down and Out in Beverly Hills', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Paul Mazursky, Donald McAlpine, Peter Bogart', 'Paul Mazursky, Leon Capetanos', 'Nick Nolte, Bette Midler, Richard Dreyfuss, Little Richard, Tracy Nelson, Elizabeth Peña, Evan Richards, Donald F. Muhich', 'R', 'Beverly Hills couple Barbara and Dave Whiteman find their lives altered by the arrival of a vagrant who tries to drown himself in their swimming pool.', 'Beverly Hills couple Barbara and Dave Whiteman find their lives altered by the arrival of a vagrant who tries to drown himself in their swimming pool.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bfbUsKcJD4HHFmlTcpHBI2wR2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9941'),
  ('19766909259107301', 'Down and Out with Donald Duck', 1987, 'Animation, TV Movie, Family', 'Scott Garen', 'Stan Freberg, Katharine Sloan, Joie Albrecht', 'Stan Freberg, Tony Anselmo, Albert Ash, Les Perkins, Will Ryan, Harry Shearer', null, 'This "duckumentary," done in the style of "60 Minutes," traces the life of Donald Duck. As Donald''s fame grows, so does his ego. While hosting a variety show one night, Donald snaps and fires a gun at the audience for misbehaving. This leads to a series of problems that eventually cause Donald to seek psychiatric help from Ludwig Von Drake, who uses an insult machine as part of Donald''s therapy. Then, after a long night of bizarre dreams, Donald learns the error of his ways and vows to reform.', 'This "duckumentary," done in the style of "60 Minutes," traces the life of Donald Duck. As Donald''s fame grows, so does his ego. While hosting a variety show one night, Donald snaps and fires a gun at the audience for misbehaving. This leads to a series of problems that eventually cause Donald to seek psychiatric help from Ludwig Von Drake, who uses an insult machine as part of Donald''s therapy. Then, after a long night of bizarre dreams, Donald learns the error of his ways and vows to reform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vSpqCv3Y9LYVJH6P2onQmOtg5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377471'),
  ('845402252849730090', 'Down and Outing', 1961, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Gene Deitch', null, 'Allen Swift', null, 'Tom accompanies his owner, Clint Clobber, who has severe anger management issues, on a fishing trip.', 'Tom accompanies his owner, Clint Clobber, who has severe anger management issues, on a fishing trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oirDckwrtslotnRrDVVydwasQfp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222973'),
  ('1108149987846695062', 'Down Argentine Way', 1940, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Irving Cummings, Leon Shamroy, Ray Rennahan', 'Karl Tunberg, Darrell Ware', 'Don Ameche, Betty Grable, Carmen Miranda, Charlotte Greenwood, J. Carrol Naish, Henry Stephenson, Kay Aldridge, Leonid Kinskey', 'NR', 'The story—in which an American heiress on holiday in South America falls in love with an Argentine horse breeder against the wishes of their families—takes a backseat to the spectacular location shooting and parade of extravagant musical numbers, which include the larger-than-life Carmen Miranda singing the hit “South American Way” and a showstopping dance routine by the always amazing Nicholas Brothers.', 'The story—in which an American heiress on holiday in South America falls in love with an Argentine horse breeder against the wishes of their families—takes a backseat to the spectacular location shooting and parade of extravagant musical numbers, which include the larger-than-life Carmen Miranda singing the hit “South American Way” and a showstopping dance routine by the always amazing Nicholas Brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gg3DgplgKq8ZBFnMwMfgGuhSZCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43810'),
  ('787907084290335854', 'Down Beat Bear', 1956, 'Comedy, Animation, Music', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'Paul Frees, Daws Butler', 'NR', 'A dancing bear escapes from the zoo and finds his way to Tom and Jerry''s house. He dances with Tom, making it impossible for Tom to call the authorities; Jerry takes every opportunity to play music and keep Tom and the bear dancing', 'A dancing bear escapes from the zoo and finds his way to Tom and Jerry''s house. He dances with Tom, making it impossible for Tom to call the authorities; Jerry takes every opportunity to play music and keep Tom and the bear dancing', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVVkTTLq2LdMGYGtDFO7wO9kq6g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55506'),
  ('877835512047907255', 'Down by Law', 1986, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Robby Müller, Jim Jarmusch, Guido Chiesa', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Tom Waits, John Lurie, Roberto Benigni, Nicoletta Braschi, Ellen Barkin, Billie Neal, Rockets Redglare, Vernel Bagneris', 'R', 'A disc jockey, a pimp and an Italian tourist escape from jail in New Orleans.', 'A disc jockey, a pimp and an Italian tourist escape from jail in New Orleans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IyxoUQ7BB5kcSd7gASe2dTyWu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1554'),
  ('1015482408973387984', 'Down by Love', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Muriel Cravatte, Pierre Godeau', 'Pierre Godeau', 'Guillaume Gallienne, Adèle Exarchopoulos, Stéphanie Cléau, Aliénor Poisson, Cyrielle Martinez, Selma Mansouri, Sabila Moussadek, Marie Rivière', null, 'A man, a woman. A prison director, his inmate. An impossible love, a true story.', 'A man, a woman. A prison director, his inmate. An impossible love, a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYZKngNLoj1nEmQS9lyKW4trsHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381255'),
  ('706510215469217818', 'Down House', 2001, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Roman Kachanov, Mikhail Mukasey, Vladimir Kaplan', 'Roman Kachanov, Ivan Okhlobystin', 'Fyodor Bondarchuk, Ivan Okhlobystin, Anna Buklovskaya, Aleksandr Bashirov, Mikhail Vladimirov, Jerzy Stuhr, Valentina Sharykina, Galina Kashkovskaya', null, 'Programmer Prince Myshkin returns to his historical homeland from Switzerland, where he was undergoing treatment in a psychiatric clinic. On the bus, the prince meets businessman Parfen Rogozhin, who is suffering from lovesickness for Nastasya Filippovna.', 'Programmer Prince Myshkin returns to his historical homeland from Switzerland, where he was undergoing treatment in a psychiatric clinic. On the bus, the prince meets businessman Parfen Rogozhin, who is suffering from lovesickness for Nastasya Filippovna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkEzedgAziNqOiBv6TbDeyAhrLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63958'),
  ('1023115710075527794', 'Down in the Delta', 1998, 'Drama', 'Maya Angelou, William Wages', 'Myron Goble', 'Alfre Woodard, Al Freeman Jr., Esther Rolle, Mary Alice, Loretta Devine, Wesley Snipes, Mpho Koaho, Anne-Marie Johnson', null, 'A single mother plagued by alcohol and drug addictions is sent with her children from Chicago to her ancestral home in the Mississippi Delta, to live with her uncle and aunt for the summer.', 'A single mother plagued by alcohol and drug addictions is sent with her children from Chicago to her ancestral home in the Mississippi Delta, to live with her uncle and aunt for the summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ygShFSdj1hug8xj2q28OMktAU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125582'),
  ('1120085641705724429', 'Down in the Valley', 2005, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller, Western', 'David Jacobson, Enrique Chediak', 'David Jacobson', 'Edward Norton, Evan Rachel Wood, David Morse, Rory Culkin, Bruce Dern, John Diehl, Geoffrey Lewis, Elizabeth Peña', 'R', 'On a trip to the beach, a teenage girl named Tobe meets a charismatic stranger named Harlan, who dresses like a cowboy and claims to be a former ranch hand. The pair feel an instant attraction and begin a relationship, but her father, a lawman, is suspicious of her lover.', 'On a trip to the beach, a teenage girl named Tobe meets a charismatic stranger named Harlan, who dresses like a cowboy and claims to be a former ranch hand. The pair feel an instant attraction and begin a relationship, but her father, a lawman, is suspicious of her lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgyp48naq0W7j4NbOttFi91DlYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7870'),
  ('45292071751426223', 'Down Low', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Rightor Doyle, Nate Hurtsellers, Bruce Edward Hall', 'Lukas Gage, Phoebe Fisher', 'Zachary Quinto, Lukas Gage, Sebastian Arroyo, Judith Light, Simon Rex, Audra McDonald, Christopher Reed Brown, Dominique Allen Lawson', 'R', 'A repressed gay man develops an unlikely friendship with a young masseur who teaches him to embrace life.', 'A repressed gay man develops an unlikely friendship with a young masseur who teaches him to embrace life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heHmq8R7M5B8KZTksteu9PXlx4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072799'),
  ('190204447487527469', 'Down Periscope', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Victor Hammer, David S. Ward, Christina Fong', 'Hugh Wilson, Andrew Kurtzman, Eliot Wald', 'Kelsey Grammer, Lauren Holly, Rob Schneider, Harry Dean Stanton, Bruce Dern, William H. Macy, Rip Torn, Ken Hudson Campbell', 'PG-13', 'Maverick Navy Lieutenant Commander Tom Dodge will never be a textbook officer, but he''s a brilliant seaman who''s always wanted to command a nuclear submarine — he''s been given one last chance to clean up his record. Unfortunately, Admiral Graham, his nemesis, would rather sink the fleet than give Dodge his own boat. So, Graham stacks the deck against him and assigns Dodge to the Stingray, a diesel-powered WW2 submarine that can barely keep afloat. To make matters worse, Dodge''s crew is a collection of maladjusted, mistake-prone misfits. Then, he''s tagged the "enemy" in a crucial war game, and ordered to take on the U.S. Navy''s best.', 'Maverick Navy Lieutenant Commander Tom Dodge will never be a textbook officer, but he''s a brilliant seaman who''s always wanted to command a nuclear submarine — he''s been given one last chance to clean up his record. Unfortunately, Admiral Graham, his nemesis, would rather sink the fleet than give Dodge his own boat. So, Graham stacks the deck against him and assigns Dodge to the Stingray, a diesel-powered WW2 submarine that can barely keep afloat. To make matters worse, Dodge''s crew is a collection of maladjusted, mistake-prone misfits. Then, he''s tagged the "enemy" in a crucial war game, and ordered to take on the U.S. Navy''s best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brleKcHsirTw7lFqcgUMOfgL2nl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9101'),
  ('603003789103270384', 'Down Terrace', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ben Wheatley, Laurie Rose', 'Robin Hill, Ben Wheatley', 'Robin Hill, Robert Hill, Julia Deakin, David Schaal, Kerry Peacock, Tony Way, Mark Kempner, Michael Smiley', null, 'After serving jail time for a mysterious crime, Bill and Karl get out of jail and become preoccupied with figuring out who turned them in to the police. On top of that, the "family business" is on the rocks, and the motley crew of criminals who operate out of Down Terrace aren''t feeling terribly trusting of one another. It might look like an ordinary house, but at Down Terrace, the walls are closing in..', 'After serving jail time for a mysterious crime, Bill and Karl get out of jail and become preoccupied with figuring out who turned them in to the police. On top of that, the "family business" is on the rocks, and the motley crew of criminals who operate out of Down Terrace aren''t feeling terribly trusting of one another. It might look like an ordinary house, but at Down Terrace, the walls are closing in..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WMwkZ4Qmsi3X6WvfjvBsC1er6F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42151'),
  ('218600496281866727', 'Down the Ancient Stairs', 1975, 'Drama', 'Mauro Bolognini, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Tullio Pinelli', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Barbara Bouchet, Françoise Fabian, Silvano Tranquilli, Marthe Keller, Lucia Bosè, Pierre Blaise, Adriana Asti', null, 'A mental hospital somewhere in Tuscany during the thirties. Far away from fascism, this closed world is rules over by Dr. Bonaccorsi, a passionate benevolent psychiatrist whose dream is to isolate the germ of madness. He is also a very active ladies''man and makes three women benefit from his sexual itch: Francesca the hospital manager''s wife, Bianca, his devoted nurse and Carla, a nymphomaniac doctor''s wife. His well-ordered universe starts being challenged with the coming of Anna, a trainee psychiatrist, who disapproves of his theory on the origin of madness. Worse, she resists his advances. As Bonaccorsi is more insecure than he looks, what will become of him?', 'A mental hospital somewhere in Tuscany during the thirties. Far away from fascism, this closed world is rules over by Dr. Bonaccorsi, a passionate benevolent psychiatrist whose dream is to isolate the germ of madness. He is also a very active ladies''man and makes three women benefit from his sexual itch: Francesca the hospital manager''s wife, Bianca, his devoted nurse and Carla, a nymphomaniac doctor''s wife. His well-ordered universe starts being challenged with the coming of Anna, a trainee psychiatrist, who disapproves of his theory on the origin of madness. Worse, she resists his advances. As Bonaccorsi is more insecure than he looks, what will become of him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tG8t0JtyGGVxafEKryoTH4s5GVF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105529'),
  ('828107421712908710', 'Down the Deep, Dark Web', 2016, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Duki Dror, Tzachi Schiff', 'Yuval Orr', 'Yuval Orr', null, 'A Gonzo-style exploration that goes beyond everything you thought you knew about the dangers, and promise, of the Darknet. Hackers, Cypherpunks and crypto-anarchists guide us ever deeper down this rabbit hole, uncovering the hidden light at the bottom of the deep, dark web.', 'A Gonzo-style exploration that goes beyond everything you thought you knew about the dangers, and promise, of the Darknet. Hackers, Cypherpunks and crypto-anarchists guide us ever deeper down this rabbit hole, uncovering the hidden light at the bottom of the deep, dark web.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcYNlZMLLNKA2DsM90MPaRal5sz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404117'),
  ('709733453968884423', 'Down the Rabbit Hole', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Manolo Caro, María Secco', 'Juan Pablo Villalobos', 'Manuel Garcia-Rulfo, Teresa Ruiz, Miguel Valverde, Alfredo Gatica, Pierre Louis, Mercedes Hernández, Gerardo Trejoluna, Lizeth Selene', 'R', 'Raised in opulence and culture, a boy''s life contrasts with the darkness that seeps in from his father''s criminal activities in this dark comedy.', 'Raised in opulence and culture, a boy''s life contrasts with the darkness that seeps in from his father''s criminal activities in this dark comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5HdtvogDClJjNdtdIxGgOfaZjK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1155605'),
  ('635631652308407091', 'Down There', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Chantal Akerman', null, 'Akerman spends a month in Tel Aviv, in an apartment by the sea, contemplating childhood, family, and her Jewish identity.', 'Akerman spends a month in Tel Aviv, in an apartment by the sea, contemplating childhood, family, and her Jewish identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54jjiaG9x430AF1KHmv0fKfpF92.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235055'),
  ('1099887682582953458', 'Down Three Dark Streets', 1954, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Joseph F. Biroc, Arnold Laven', 'Gordon Gordon, Mildred Gordon', 'Broderick Crawford, Ruth Roman, Martha Hyer, Marisa Pavan, Max Showalter, Kenneth Tobey, Gene Reynolds, William Johnstone', null, 'An FBI Agent takes on the three unrelated cases of a dead agent to track down his killer.', 'An FBI Agent takes on the three unrelated cases of a dead agent to track down his killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2JMsqltTw25UbEcdFk8QGCYrP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37413'),
  ('541583022125306800', 'Down to Earth', 1947, 'Music, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Alexander Hall, Rudolph Maté', 'Edwin Blum, Don Hartman', 'Rita Hayworth, Larry Parks, Marc Platt, Roland Culver, James Gleason, Edward Everett Horton, Adele Jergens, George Macready', null, 'Upset at a new Broadway musical mocking The Nine Muses, Greek goddess Terpsichore comes down to earth to land a part in the show and change it.', 'Upset at a new Broadway musical mocking The Nine Muses, Greek goddess Terpsichore comes down to earth to land a part in the show and change it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVJVe73kGdnD9iexcRR1nHlYcII.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67060'),
  ('1002001617849859941', 'Down to Earth', 2001, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Weitz, Chris Weitz, Mark Anthony Little', 'Elaine May, Warren Beatty', 'Chris Rock, Regina King, Chazz Palminteri, Eugene Levy, Frankie Faison, Mark Addy, Greg Germann, Jennifer Coolidge', 'PG-13', 'Struggling comic Lance Barton knows what it''s like to die on stage. But when his life takes an unexpected turn - straight to heaven - Lance is sure there''s been a mistake. Miraculously, he''s right! An angel tells Lance he was taken prematurely but assures him he can be returned to Earth - in the aged body of a ruthless white billionaire. In this improbable reincarnation, Lance begins a hilarious quest to realize his showbiz dream...and, along the way, discovers the person he never imagined he could be.', 'Struggling comic Lance Barton knows what it''s like to die on stage. But when his life takes an unexpected turn - straight to heaven - Lance is sure there''s been a mistake. Miraculously, he''s right! An angel tells Lance he was taken prematurely but assures him he can be returned to Earth - in the aged body of a ruthless white billionaire. In this improbable reincarnation, Lance begins a hilarious quest to realize his showbiz dream...and, along the way, discovers the person he never imagined he could be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2XM4YCfBOOWEL4a0abQji7QxwI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16300'),
  ('398607271985639603', 'Down to the Bone', 2002, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'René Castillo', 'René Castillo', 'Bruno Bichir, Daniel Cubillo, Eugenia León, Claudia Prado, Celso R. García', null, 'A man is wrongfully buried alive, and starts to descend to the Underworld.', 'A man is wrongfully buried alive, and starts to descend to the Underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSvdD7bvvsEH95rzdtYs0dB1Hx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121967'),
  ('946790595598302482', 'Down to the Bone', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Debra Granik, Neil Daly, Vince P. Maggio', 'Richard Lieske, Debra Granik', 'Vera Farmiga, Hugh Dillon, Clint Jordan, Caridad ''La Bruja'' De La Luz, Jasper Daniels, Taylor Foxhall, Giles Penderghast, Terry McKenna', 'R', 'A woman stuck in a stale marriage struggles to raise her children and manage her secret drug habit. But when winter comes to her small town, her balancing act begins to come crashing down.', 'A woman stuck in a stale marriage struggles to raise her children and manage her secret drug habit. But when winter comes to her small town, her balancing act begins to come crashing down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5A0RdsKe8qnX9ntPXL4dsPGvMl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40876'),
  ('101923369904265364', 'Down to the Cellar', 1983, 'Animation, Horror, Mystery', 'Jan Švankmajer, Juraj Galvánek, Zlatica Vejchodská', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Oľga Vronská, Alexander Letko, Monika Belo-Cabanová', null, 'A little girl goes down to the basement cellar to fetch some potatoes, and finds all her hidden fears about the cellar depicted in animated form.', 'A little girl goes down to the basement cellar to fetch some potatoes, and finds all her hidden fears about the cellar depicted in animated form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36KG77qMJDsW26wKjC2LvzIDSjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126597'),
  ('312951409138706258', 'Down to the Sea in Ships', 1949, 'Drama, Adventure, Action', 'Henry Hathaway, Joseph MacDonald', 'Sy Bartlett, John Lee Mahin', 'Richard Widmark, Lionel Barrymore, Dean Stockwell, Cecil Kellaway, Gene Lockhart, Berry Kroeger, John McIntire, Harry Morgan', 'NR', 'During a whaling expedition in the late 1800''s, the aging Captain Bering Joy (Lionel Barrymore) and his new first mate, Dan Lunceford (Richard Widmark) engage in a battle of wills concerning the education of the captain''s struggling grandson.', 'During a whaling expedition in the late 1800''s, the aging Captain Bering Joy (Lionel Barrymore) and his new first mate, Dan Lunceford (Richard Widmark) engage in a battle of wills concerning the education of the captain''s struggling grandson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWowLRmayDVqhB10Xgky7imfTiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164073'),
  ('992894434347927073', 'Down to You', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kris Isacsson, Robert D. Yeoman', 'Kris Isacsson', 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Julia Stiles, Selma Blair, Shawn Hatosy, Zak Orth, Ashton Kutcher, Rosario Dawson, Henry Winkler', 'PG-13', 'College coeds in New York City, Al, the son of a celebrity chef, and Imogen, a talented artist, become smitten the second they lay eyes on one another at a bar. However, the road to happiness is not a smooth one. Outside forces, including a predatory porn star who wants to lure Al into her bed, threaten to pull apart the young lovers before their romance has a chance to really flourish.', 'College coeds in New York City, Al, the son of a celebrity chef, and Imogen, a talented artist, become smitten the second they lay eyes on one another at a bar. However, the road to happiness is not a smooth one. Outside forces, including a predatory porn star who wants to lure Al into her bed, threaten to pull apart the young lovers before their romance has a chance to really flourish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqEEtX4S8j2XqZ9JAD97fz2DPkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10472'),
  ('920507802891907532', 'Down Twisted', 1987, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Albert Pyun, Walt Lloyd, Tony Perez', 'Tom O’Neill', 'Carey Lowell, Charles Rocket, Trudy Dochterman, Thom Mathews, Norbert Weisser, Linda Kerridge, Nicholas Guest, Galyn Görg', null, 'A naive, good-hearted Los Angeles waitress does not think twice about helping her troubled roommate. Unfortunately, her help lands her in Central America fleeing for her life with a grungy mercenary.', 'A naive, good-hearted Los Angeles waitress does not think twice about helping her troubled roommate. Unfortunately, her help lands her in Central America fleeing for her life with a grungy mercenary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Dwpo0WuOceN1faGSbzC3EMIsxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88253'),
  ('166289398642988955', 'Down with Love', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peyton Reed, Jeff Cronenweth, David Sandefur', 'Dennis Drake, Eve Ahlert', 'Renée Zellweger, Ewan McGregor, Sarah Paulson, David Hyde Pierce, Rachel Dratch, Jack Plotnick, Tony Randall, John Aylward', 'PG-13', 'In 1962 New York City, love blossoms between a playboy journalist and a feminist advice author.', 'In 1962 New York City, love blossoms between a playboy journalist and a feminist advice author.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74lG2SGDJdyiS8hB4kkFcRIviSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10720'),
  ('19391079617484083', 'Down with the King', 2021, 'Drama, Music', 'Diego Ongaro, Daniel Vecchione', 'Diego Ongaro, Xabi Molia', 'Freddie Gibbs, Bob Tarasuk, Jamie Neumann, David Krumholtz, Sharon Washington, Carl Volz, Michael ''Bucky'' Pasquarella, Hernan Orozco', 'R', 'Sent to the Berkshires to focus on his next album, disillusioned rap star Money Merc abruptly announces his retirement on Twitter. After Merc''s announcement, his manager rushes to the countryside to lure him back into the music industry.', 'Sent to the Berkshires to focus on his next album, disillusioned rap star Money Merc abruptly announces his retirement on Twitter. After Merc''s announcement, his manager rushes to the countryside to lure him back into the music industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYtRs89ddKFQinH9e6CSFvXfRnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838889'),
  ('225558390346938120', 'Downeast', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Joe Raffa, Heather Chaffee, Anthony Hanna', 'Joe Raffa', 'Greg Finley, Dylan Silver, Judson Mills, Joss Glennie-Smith, Gareth Williams, Kirk Fox, Joe Holt, Dennis Cockrum', 'NR', 'Dives into the often ignored seedy underbelly of Maine and it follows Emma Maddox as she returns to her hometown years following the mysterious death of her brother, Mikey. As she reconnects with his best friend Tommy, the two rekindle their flame and Emma begins to uncover the web of lies the town has been keeping.', 'Dives into the often ignored seedy underbelly of Maine and it follows Emma Maddox as she returns to her hometown years following the mysterious death of her brother, Mikey. As she reconnects with his best friend Tommy, the two rekindle their flame and Emma begins to uncover the web of lies the town has been keeping.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2JZkkFnIZjXfEztl5CBr6Hjr6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802194'),
  ('628032517957574019', 'Downfall', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Im Kwon-taek, Lee Min-bu', 'Kim Dae-seung, Im Kwon-taek', 'Shin Eun-kyung, Jeong-hyeon Han, Choi Dong-joon, Kyeong-sun Jeon, Ahn Byeong-kyeong, Park Gil-su, Oh Dong-Yeong, Kim Ji-Eun', null, 'A young woman is tricked into prostitution, thinking she is going to sell beverages at a village store. She soon learns about the dark world of Korea''s red-light districts, where their pimps and society exploit her.', 'A young woman is tricked into prostitution, thinking she is going to sell beverages at a village store. She soon learns about the dark world of Korea''s red-light districts, where their pimps and society exploit her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVPfq45HDPbKpV8QvRYCw69MyDz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226875'),
